window.NPC_LATER = {"2026-11-16|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也灰蒙蒙的。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě huīméngméng de.","m":"It's grey and hazy here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也灰蒙蒙的","en":"It was grey and hazy where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也灰蒙蒙的。北京这两天刮了一场大风，天一下子就蓝了——不过也冷多了，我把厚外套翻出来了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě huīméngméng de. Běijīng zhè liǎng tiān guā le yì cháng dà fēng, tiān yíxiàzi jiù lán le —— búguò yě lěng duō le, wǒ bǎ hòu wàitào fān chūlái le.","m":"You said last time it was grey and hazy where you are too. Beijing had a big wind these last couple of days and the sky turned blue just like that — but it's a lot colder, too. I've dug out my thick coat.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边现在冷不冷？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān xiànzài lěng bu lěng?","m":"Is it cold where you are now?"},"replies":[{"t":"挺冷的，我也穿上厚外套了。","p":"Tǐng lěng de, wǒ yě chuān shang hòu wàitào le.","m":"Pretty cold — I've got my thick coat on too.","r":{"t":"那我们俩都裹得像个球了，哈哈。","p":"Nà wǒmen liǎ dōu guǒ de xiàng gè qiú le, hāha.","m":"Then we're both bundled up like balls, haha."}},{"t":"不冷，还挺暖和的。","p":"Bù lěng, hái tǐng nuǎnhuo de.","m":"No, it's actually quite warm.","r":{"t":"真羡慕！北京现在早上只有一两度。","p":"Zhēn xiànmù! Běijīng xiànzài zǎoshang zhǐ yǒu yī liǎng dù.","m":"Lucky you! Beijing mornings are only one or two degrees now."}}],"next":{"t":"北京今天还是灰灰的，希望你那边亮一点。","p":"Běijīng jīntiān háishi huīhuī de, xīwàng nǐ nàbiān liàng yìdiǎn.","m":"Beijing's still grey today — hope it's brighter where you are."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边出太阳了！","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān chū tàiyáng le!","m":"The sun's out where I am!"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边出太阳了","en":"The sun was out where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边出太阳了，我好羡慕。告诉你，北京也出太阳了！一刮风，天就蓝了，我骑车出门，一路都晒得到太阳。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān chū tàiyáng le, wǒ hǎo xiànmù. Gàosu nǐ, Běijīng yě chū tàiyáng le! Yì guā fēng, tiān jiù lán le, wǒ qí chē chūmén, yí lù dōu shài de dào tàiyáng.","m":"You said the sun was out where you are — I was so jealous. Well, the sun's out in Beijing too! The wind came, the sky went blue, and I had sunshine all the way on my bike.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边出太阳的时候，你最喜欢去哪儿？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān chū tàiyáng de shíhou, nǐ zuì xǐhuan qù nǎr?","m":"When the sun's out where you are, where do you like to go most?"},"replies":[{"t":"去公园走走。","p":"Qù gōngyuán zǒuzou.","m":"For a walk in the park.","r":{"t":"我也是！北京的银杏叶快掉完了，得赶紧去看。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Běijīng de yínxìng yè kuài diào wán le, děi gǎnjǐn qù kàn.","m":"Me too! Beijing's ginkgo leaves are nearly all down — I'd better hurry."}},{"t":"哪儿都不去，在家晒太阳。","p":"Nǎr dōu bú qù, zài jiā shài tàiyáng.","m":"Nowhere — I sit in the sun at home.","r":{"t":"这个我也喜欢，泡杯茶，坐在窗边。","p":"Zhège wǒ yě xǐhuan, pào bēi chá, zuò zài chuāng biān.","m":"I love that too — a cup of tea, sitting by the window."}}],"next":{"t":"北京还没出太阳，我先借你那边的太阳想一想。","p":"Běijīng hái méi chū tàiyáng, wǒ xiān jiè nǐ nàbiān de tàiyáng xiǎng yi xiǎng.","m":"Still no sun in Beijing — I'm borrowing yours in my head for now."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"遛狗的人每天都那么早吗？","p":"Liù gǒu de rén měi tiān dōu nàme zǎo ma?","m":"Are the dog walkers out that early every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过遛狗的人是不是每天都那么早（六点多，有一只小白狗）","en":"You asked if the dog walkers are out that early every day (just after six — there's a little white dog)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问遛狗的人是不是每天都那么早。那只小白狗，我终于知道它叫什么了：叫「馒头」！我下楼扔垃圾，正好碰到它主人，她告诉我的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn liù gǒu de rén shì bu shì měi tiān dōu nàme zǎo. Nà zhī xiǎo bái gǒu, wǒ zhōngyú zhīdào tā jiào shénme le: jiào “Mántou”! Wǒ xià lóu rēng lājī, zhènghǎo pèng dào tā zhǔrén, tā gàosu wǒ de.","m":"Last time you asked if the dog walkers are out that early every day. That little white dog — I finally know its name: Mantou, “steamed bun”! I bumped into its owner when I took the rubbish down, and she told me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你养过宠物吗？","p":"Nǐ yǎngguo chǒngwù ma?","m":"Have you ever had a pet?"},"replies":[{"t":"养过，小时候家里有只猫。","p":"Yǎngguo, xiǎoshíhou jiā lǐ yǒu zhī māo.","m":"Yes — we had a cat when I was little.","r":{"t":"猫也好！我一直想养一只，可是天天上课，没时间陪它。","p":"Māo yě hǎo! Wǒ yìzhí xiǎng yǎng yì zhī, kěshì tiāntiān shàngkè, méi shíjiān péi tā.","m":"Cats are lovely! I've always wanted one, but I teach every day and wouldn't have time for it."}},{"t":"没养过，不过很想养。","p":"Méi yǎngguo, búguò hěn xiǎng yǎng.","m":"Never, but I'd really like one.","r":{"t":"我也是！先下楼跟馒头玩玩，过过瘾。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Xiān xià lóu gēn Mántou wánwan, guòguo yǐn.","m":"Same here! For now I just go down and play with Mantou."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又看到那只小白狗了，跟你说一声。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu kàn dào nà zhī xiǎo bái gǒu le, gēn nǐ shuō yì shēng.","m":"I saw that little white dog again today — just thought I'd tell you."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你几点起床？","p":"Nǐ jǐ diǎn qǐchuáng?","m":"What time do you get up?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她几点起床（七点左右）","en":"You asked what time she gets up (around seven)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我几点起床，我说七点左右。这两天越来越冷，闹钟响了，我还想在被窝里多待五分钟。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ jǐ diǎn qǐchuáng, wǒ shuō qī diǎn zuǒyòu. Zhè liǎng tiān yuè lái yuè lěng, nàozhōng xiǎng le, wǒ hái xiǎng zài bèiwō lǐ duō dāi wǔ fēnzhōng.","m":"Last time you asked what time I get up, and I said around seven. It's been getting colder these days — when the alarm goes, I want five more minutes under the covers.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天起床难不难？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān qǐchuáng nán bu nán?","m":"Is it hard for you to get up in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"难，我得定好几个闹钟。","p":"Nán, wǒ děi dìng hǎo jǐ gè nàozhōng.","m":"Hard — I have to set several alarms.","r":{"t":"我也是！我定了三个：七点、七点五分、七点十分。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ dìng le sān gè: qī diǎn, qī diǎn wǔ fēn, qī diǎn shí fēn.","m":"Me too! I've set three: seven, five past, ten past."}},{"t":"还好，我醒了就起。","p":"Hái hǎo, wǒ xǐng le jiù qǐ.","m":"Not bad — I get up as soon as I wake.","r":{"t":"真厉害！教教我。","p":"Zhēn lìhai! Jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"Impressive! Teach me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天七点，闹钟一响我就起来了，难得！","p":"Jīntiān qī diǎn, nàozhōng yì xiǎng wǒ jiù qǐlái le, nándé!","m":"Seven today — up the moment the alarm went. A rare win!"}},"m3.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我也差不多七点。","p":"Wǒ yě chàbuduō qī diǎn.","m":"About seven for me too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也差不多七点起床","en":"You get up around seven too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也差不多七点起床。这两天天冷了，七点窗外还是灰的，我躺在被窝里想：你是不是也刚起？","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě chàbuduō qī diǎn qǐchuáng. Zhè liǎng tiān tiān lěng le, qī diǎn chuāng wài hái shì huī de, wǒ tǎng zài bèiwō lǐ xiǎng: nǐ shì bu shì yě gāng qǐ?","m":"You said you get up around seven too. It's turned cold these days — at seven it's still grey outside, and lying under the covers I wonder: are you just getting up too?","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你起床以后第一件事做什么？","p":"Nǐ qǐchuáng yǐhòu dì yī jiàn shì zuò shénme?","m":"What's the first thing you do after you get up?"},"replies":[{"t":"先喝一杯水。","p":"Xiān hē yì bēi shuǐ.","m":"Drink a glass of water.","r":{"t":"好习惯！我第一件事是看手机，得改改。","p":"Hǎo xíguàn! Wǒ dì yī jiàn shì shì kàn shǒujī, děi gǎigai.","m":"Good habit! Mine is checking my phone — I need to change that."}},{"t":"先看手机，哈哈。","p":"Xiān kàn shǒujī, hāha.","m":"Check my phone, haha.","r":{"t":"我也是！一看就是十分钟。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Yí kàn jiù shì shí fēnzhōng.","m":"Me too! And there go ten minutes."}}],"next":{"t":"今天七点，跟你差不多的时候起的。","p":"Jīntiān qī diǎn, gēn nǐ chàbuduō de shíhou qǐ de.","m":"Up at seven today — about the same time as you."}},"m3.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我起得比较晚，九点左右。","p":"Wǒ qǐ de bǐjiào wǎn, jiǔ diǎn zuǒyòu.","m":"I get up late, around nine."},"mem":{"zh":"你一般九点左右起床","en":"You usually get up around nine"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你九点左右起床，我好羡慕！这两天我也想睡到九点，可是八点半就有课。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiǔ diǎn zuǒyòu qǐchuáng, wǒ hǎo xiànmù! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě xiǎng shuì dào jiǔ diǎn, kěshì bā diǎn bàn jiù yǒu kè.","m":"You said you get up around nine — I'm so jealous! These days I'd love to sleep till nine too, but I've got class at half past eight.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你是晚上睡得晚，还是就喜欢多睡一会儿？","p":"Nǐ shì wǎnshang shuì de wǎn, háishi jiù xǐhuan duō shuì yíhuìr?","m":"Do you go to bed late, or do you just like a bit more sleep?"},"replies":[{"t":"晚上睡得晚，一般十二点以后。","p":"Wǎnshang shuì de wǎn, yìbān shí'èr diǎn yǐhòu.","m":"I go to bed late — usually after midnight.","r":{"t":"那九点起也正常！我十一点就困了。","p":"Nà jiǔ diǎn qǐ yě zhèngcháng! Wǒ shíyī diǎn jiù kùn le.","m":"Then nine makes sense! I'm sleepy by eleven."}},{"t":"就是喜欢多睡一会儿。","p":"Jiùshì xǐhuan duō shuì yíhuìr.","m":"I just like a bit more sleep.","r":{"t":"能多睡就多睡，这是福气。","p":"Néng duō shuì jiù duō shuì, zhè shì fúqi.","m":"Sleep when you can — that's a blessing."}}],"next":{"t":"我今天七点就起了，替你多睡了一会儿，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān qī diǎn jiù qǐ le, tì nǐ duō shuì le yíhuìr, hāha.","m":"Up at seven today — enjoy those extra hours for me, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-16|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也在下雨。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě zài xià yǔ.","m":"It's raining here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也在下雨","en":"It was raining where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也在下雨。台北到现在还在下！我在机车座垫下面放了一套雨衣，现在又多放了一双袜子。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě zài xià yǔ. Táiběi dào xiànzài hái zài xià! Wǒ zài jīchē zuòdiàn xiàmiàn fàng le yí tào yǔyī, xiànzài yòu duō fàng le yì shuāng wàzi.","m":"You said it was raining where you are too. It's still raining in Taipei! I keep a raincoat under my scooter seat — and now a spare pair of socks as well.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"下雨天你怎么出门？","p":"Xià yǔ tiān nǐ zěnme chūmén?","m":"How do you get around on rainy days?"},"replies":[{"t":"撑伞走路。","p":"Chēng sǎn zǒulù.","m":"I walk with an umbrella.","r":{"t":"走路也好！不过台北的雨常常斜着打过来，伞没什么用耶。","p":"Zǒulù yě hǎo! Búguò Táiběi de yǔ chángcháng xié zhe dǎ guòlái, sǎn méi shénme yòng ye.","m":"Walking's nice! But Taipei rain often comes in sideways — umbrellas don't help much."}},{"t":"能不出门就不出门。","p":"Néng bù chūmén jiù bù chūmén.","m":"I stay in if I can.","r":{"t":"好聪明！我也想，可是要上课喔。","p":"Hǎo cōngming! Wǒ yě xiǎng, kěshì yào shàngkè o.","m":"Smart! I'd love to, but I've got class."}}],"next":{"t":"台北还在下雨喔，希望你那边已经停了。","p":"Táiběi hái zài xià yǔ o, xīwàng nǐ nàbiān yǐjīng tíng le.","m":"Still raining in Taipei — hope yours has stopped."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边今天是晴天。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān jīntiān shì qíngtiān.","m":"It's sunny here today."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边是晴天","en":"It was sunny where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是晴天，我超羡慕。台北还在下雨，我都快忘记太阳长什么样子了。我就想一下你那边的晴天，心情好一点。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì qíngtiān, wǒ chāo xiànmù. Táiběi hái zài xià yǔ, wǒ dōu kuài wàngjì tàiyáng zhǎng shénme yàngzi le. Wǒ jiù xiǎng yíxià nǐ nàbiān de qíngtiān, xīnqíng hǎo yìdiǎn.","m":"You said it was sunny where you are — so jealous. Taipei's still raining; I've almost forgotten what the sun looks like. So I just picture your sunny day, and I feel a bit better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边晴天的时候，你最喜欢做什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān qíngtiān de shíhou, nǐ zuì xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"On sunny days where you are, what do you like doing most?"},"replies":[{"t":"出去走走，晒晒太阳。","p":"Chūqù zǒuzou, shàishai tàiyáng.","m":"Going out for a walk in the sun.","r":{"t":"好好喔！帮我多晒一点。","p":"Hǎo hǎo o! Bāng wǒ duō shài yìdiǎn.","m":"Sounds lovely! Soak up some extra for me."}},{"t":"跟平常一样，没什么特别的。","p":"Gēn píngcháng yíyàng, méi shénme tèbié de.","m":"Same as usual — nothing special.","r":{"t":"哈哈也是，晴天也要过日子。","p":"Hāha yě shì, qíngtiān yě yào guò rìzi.","m":"Haha, true — life goes on, sunny or not."}}],"next":{"t":"台北今天还是灰的，我在想你那边的太阳。","p":"Táiběi jīntiān háishi huī de, wǒ zài xiǎng nǐ nàbiān de tàiyáng.","m":"Taipei's still grey today — thinking of your sunshine."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你后来迟到了吗？","p":"Nǐ hòulái chídào le ma?","m":"Were you late in the end?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她后来有没有迟到（差一点，跑着进教室）","en":"You asked if she was late in the end (nearly — she ran into class)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我有没有迟到。跟你说，我现在定了两个闹钟，第二个叫「不准再睡」。这两天都准时到了！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yǒu méiyǒu chídào. Gēn nǐ shuō, wǒ xiànzài dìng le liǎng gè nàozhōng, dì èr gè jiào “bù zhǔn zài shuì”. Zhè liǎng tiān dōu zhǔnshí dào le!","m":"Last time you asked if I was late. Well — I've set two alarms now, and the second one is called “NO more sleeping”. I've been on time both days!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你是那种常常差一点迟到的人吗？","p":"Nǐ shì nà zhǒng chángcháng chà yìdiǎn chídào de rén ma?","m":"Are you the kind of person who's often nearly late?"},"replies":[{"t":"是，我常常是跑着到的。","p":"Shì, wǒ chángcháng shì pǎo zhe dào de.","m":"Yes — I often arrive running.","r":{"t":"那我们是同一种人，哈哈。","p":"Nà wǒmen shì tóng yì zhǒng rén, hāha.","m":"Then we're the same kind of person, haha."}},{"t":"不是，我一般会早到。","p":"Bú shì, wǒ yìbān huì zǎo dào.","m":"No, I'm usually early.","r":{"t":"好厉害！教我一下。","p":"Hǎo lìhai! Jiāo wǒ yíxià.","m":"Impressive! Teach me how."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我没迟到喔！第二个闹钟有用。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ méi chídào o! Dì èr gè nàozhōng yǒu yòng.","m":"I wasn't late today! The second alarm works."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"台北常常下雨吗？","p":"Táiběi chángcháng xià yǔ ma?","m":"Does it rain a lot in Taipei?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过台北是不是常常下雨（冬天常常下，雨不大，一直下）","en":"You asked if it rains a lot in Taipei (in winter — light, but it never stops)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问台北是不是常常下雨。这两天还是在下！我妈说，冬天吹东北季风，所以台湾北部的雨特别多。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Táiběi shì bu shì chángcháng xià yǔ. Zhè liǎng tiān háishi zài xià! Wǒ mā shuō, dōngtiān chuī dōngběi jìfēng, suǒyǐ Táiwān běibù de yǔ tèbié duō.","m":"Last time you asked if it rains a lot in Taipei. It's still raining! My mum says the northeast monsoon blows in winter, so northern Taiwan gets loads of rain.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边一年里哪个季节雨最多？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yì nián lǐ nǎ gè jìjié yǔ zuì duō?","m":"Where you are, which season gets the most rain?"},"replies":[{"t":"夏天，常常下大雨。","p":"Xiàtiān, chángcháng xià dà yǔ.","m":"Summer — lots of heavy rain.","r":{"t":"跟台湾夏天一样！下午的雷阵雨，下一下就停。","p":"Gēn Táiwān xiàtiān yíyàng! Xiàwǔ de léizhènyǔ, xià yíxià jiù tíng.","m":"Just like summer in Taiwan! Afternoon thunderstorms that stop as fast as they start."}},{"t":"我那边很少下雨。","p":"Wǒ nàbiān hěn shǎo xià yǔ.","m":"It hardly ever rains where I am.","r":{"t":"真的？那我有点想去你那边住。","p":"Zhēnde? Nà wǒ yǒudiǎn xiǎng qù nǐ nàbiān zhù.","m":"Really? Then I kind of want to move there."}}],"next":{"t":"你问台北的雨——今天还是在下，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ wèn Táiběi de yǔ —— jīntiān háishi zài xià, hāha.","m":"You asked about Taipei's rain — still going today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-16|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same here — grey and drizzly.","p":"","m":"我这边也是，天灰灰的，下着毛毛雨。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是阴天下小雨","en":"It was grey and drizzly where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was grey and drizzly where you are too. Update from London: still grey. My brolly turned inside out on the way to the station, so now I just put my hood up.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是阴天下小雨。伦敦最新消息：还是灰的。去车站的路上我的伞被吹翻了，所以现在我干脆戴帽子。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do on grey days like this?","p":"","m":"这种灰蒙蒙的日子，你一般做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Stay in with a hot drink.","p":"","m":"待在家里，喝点热的。","r":{"t":"Solid plan. Tea, blanket, done.","p":"","m":"好主意。一杯茶，一条毯子，搞定。"}},{"t":"Go out anyway — it's only rain.","p":"","m":"照样出门，不就是下雨嘛。","r":{"t":"That's the spirit. Rain never stopped anyone here.","p":"","m":"就该这样。在这儿下雨从来拦不住谁。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still grey here. Hope your day's a bit brighter.","p":"","m":"这边还是灰的。希望你今天亮堂一点。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's sunny where I am.","p":"","m":"我这边出太阳了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边出太阳了","en":"It was sunny where you are"},"later":{"t":"You told me it was sunny where you are — I'm still a bit jealous. We finally got one sunny hour on Tuesday. Half the office went outside just to stand in it.","p":"","m":"你跟我说你那边出太阳了——我到现在还有点羡慕。周二我们终于有了一个小时的太阳。办公室一半的人跑出去，就为了站在太阳底下。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is it usually sunny where you live?","p":"","m":"你住的地方一般都是晴天吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, most of the year.","p":"","m":"是的，一年里大部分时候都是。","r":{"t":"Right, I'm moving in with you. Joking. Mostly.","p":"","m":"好，我搬去你那儿住。开玩笑的。大概吧。"}},{"t":"No, we just got lucky that day.","p":"","m":"不是，那天只是运气好。","r":{"t":"Ha, so it was a rare one for you too.","p":"","m":"哈，原来对你来说也难得。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still no sun in London. Hope yours is still out.","p":"","m":"伦敦还是没太阳。希望你那边的太阳还在。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What day is bin day?","p":"","m":"哪天收垃圾？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他哪天收垃圾（周一，所以周日晚上大家都把垃圾桶推出来）","en":"You asked which day is bin day (Monday — so everyone puts their bins out on Sunday night)"},"later":{"t":"You asked about bin day. Small update: our council takes recycling one week and normal rubbish the next. We put the wrong bin out. Twice.","p":"","m":"你上次问哪天收垃圾。最新情况：我们这个区一周收可回收的，下一周收普通垃圾。我们把垃圾桶推错了。两次。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where you live, do you sort your rubbish?","p":"","m":"你住的地方，垃圾要分类吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, into a few different bins.","p":"","m":"要，分好几个桶。","r":{"t":"Then you'd beat us at it. We're still learning.","p":"","m":"那你肯定比我们强。我们还在学。"}},{"t":"Not really, it all goes in one bag.","p":"","m":"不怎么分，全都装一个袋子。","r":{"t":"Honestly, that sounds easier.","p":"","m":"说实话，听起来简单多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bins collected. Crisis over.","p":"","m":"垃圾收走了。危机解除。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you remember yours?","p":"","m":"你记得把你的推出去了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他记没记得推垃圾桶（差一点忘了，半夜穿着袜子跑出去）","en":"You asked if he remembered his bin (just about — he ran out in his socks at midnight)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I remembered my bin — the one I chased in my socks. My flatmate has now put a rota on the fridge. My name's on it every single week. Apparently that's fair.","p":"","m":"你上次问我记没记得推垃圾桶——就是我穿着袜子追出去的那次。现在我室友在冰箱上贴了一张值日表。每一周都有我的名字。据说这样才公平。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a chore you always forget?","p":"","m":"有没有什么家务你老是忘？"},"replies":[{"t":"Watering my plants.","p":"","m":"给植物浇水。","r":{"t":"Same in our flat. The basil didn't make it.","p":"","m":"我们家也是。那盆罗勒没撑住。"}},{"t":"Not really, I'm pretty organised.","p":"","m":"没有，我挺有条理的。","r":{"t":"Then our fridge rota needs you, haha.","p":"","m":"那我们冰箱上的值日表需要你，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Shoes on this time, for the record.","p":"","m":"说明一下，这次我穿鞋了。"}},"m3.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Yes — ours is on Thursday.","p":"","m":"有，我们这边是星期四。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边周四收垃圾","en":"Your bin day is Thursday"},"later":{"t":"You said your bin day's on Thursday. Mine's Monday — and this week I finally got it right. Shoes on, before midnight. My flatmate actually clapped.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边周四收垃圾。我这边是周一——这周我终于做对了。穿着鞋，半夜之前。我室友居然鼓掌了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who takes the bins out where you live?","p":"","m":"你家谁负责倒垃圾？"},"replies":[{"t":"Me, always.","p":"","m":"我，每次都是我。","r":{"t":"Then you're the hero of your home. Respect.","p":"","m":"那你是你家的英雄。佩服。"}},{"t":"We take turns.","p":"","m":"我们轮流。","r":{"t":"Very fair. We've just started a rota too.","p":"","m":"很公平。我们也刚排了值日表。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thursday's coming — don't forget your bin!","p":"","m":"周四快到了——别忘了倒垃圾！"}},"m3.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"No, we have big shared bins.","p":"","m":"没有，我们这边是大的公共垃圾桶。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边是大的公共垃圾桶","en":"You have big shared bins where you live"},"later":{"t":"You said you have big shared bins. I'm jealous! This week I learned our bin is far too small for four flatmates. Two days after collection, it's already full.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边是大的公共垃圾桶。我好羡慕！这周我才发现，我们的垃圾桶对四个室友来说太小了。收完两天，就又满了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you sort your rubbish into different bins?","p":"","m":"你会把垃圾分到不同的桶里吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, recycling goes separately.","p":"","m":"会，可回收的分开放。","r":{"t":"Good. We're still learning which bin is which.","p":"","m":"挺好。我们还在学哪个桶装什么。"}},{"t":"No, it all goes in together.","p":"","m":"不分，全都放一起。","r":{"t":"Honestly, that sounds much easier.","p":"","m":"说实话，听起来简单多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Big shared bins — still jealous.","p":"","m":"公共大垃圾桶——我还是羡慕。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-16|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's raining here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也在下雨。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也在下雨","en":"It was raining where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's raining there too. Here it rains every afternoon now. On Tuesday I waited under the flyover for forty minutes, with ten other drivers.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也在下雨。我们这儿现在每天下午都下。周二我在高架桥下面等了四十分钟，旁边还有十个司机。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When it rains, do you go out or stay home?","p":"","m":"下雨的时候，你出门还是待在家？"},"replies":[{"t":"I stay home if I can.","p":"","m":"能不出门就不出门。","r":{"t":"Good choice. Me, I can't — rain means more orders!","p":"","m":"明智。我可不行——一下雨，单子就多！"}},{"t":"I go out anyway, with an umbrella.","p":"","m":"照样出门，打把伞。","r":{"t":"Strong! Here umbrella is not enough, you need raincoat.","p":"","m":"厉害！在我们这儿光打伞不够，得穿雨衣。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still raining here, bro. Hope you stay dry.","p":"","m":"我们这儿还在下雨，兄弟。希望你别淋着。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dry here, but cold.","p":"","m":"我这边没下雨，就是冷。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边没下雨，但是冷","en":"It was dry but cold where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's cold there. I tried to imagine it. Here it's thirty-two degrees and wet. My daughter asked me what 'cold' feels like. I opened the fridge for her.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边冷。我试着想象了一下。我们这儿三十二度，还湿漉漉的。我女儿问我「冷」是什么感觉，我给她打开了冰箱。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How cold is it there right now?","p":"","m":"你那边现在有多冷？"},"replies":[{"t":"Around ten degrees.","p":"","m":"十度左右。","r":{"t":"Ten! For me that's a fridge, bro.","p":"","m":"十度！对我来说那就是冰箱了，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Close to zero.","p":"","m":"快到零度了。","r":{"t":"Zero?! I can't imagine. Stay warm!","p":"","m":"零度？！我想象不出来。注意保暖！"}}],"next":{"t":"Stay warm today! Here still hot, haha.","p":"","m":"今天注意保暖！我们这儿还是很热，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you ride a scooter too?","p":"","m":"你也骑摩托吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他是不是也骑摩托车（每天都骑，送孩子上学）","en":"You asked if he rides a scooter too (every day — he takes his kids to school on it)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I ride a scooter. Every day, yes. This week both my kids want to sit in front. So now they take turns — one gets Monday, Wednesday, Friday, the other gets the rest.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是也骑摩托车。对，每天都骑。这个星期两个孩子都想坐前面。所以现在他们轮着来——一个周一、周三、周五，另一个是剩下的几天。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you usually get to work or school?","p":"","m":"你一般怎么去上班或者上学？"},"replies":[{"t":"By bus or train.","p":"","m":"坐公交或者火车。","r":{"t":"Good. No rain on your head!","p":"","m":"挺好。雨淋不到头上！"}},{"t":"I walk.","p":"","m":"走路。","r":{"t":"Walking is healthy! Here too hot for walking, haha.","p":"","m":"走路健康！我们这儿太热，走不了，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took the kids to school again today.","p":"","m":"今天又送孩子上学了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do people ride in the rain?","p":"","m":"下雨天大家也骑吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过下雨天大家还骑不骑车（骑，穿上雨衣就走）","en":"You asked if people still ride in the rain (yes — raincoat on and off they go)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if people ride in the rain. Yes — but only with good raincoat. My old one tore this week, so I bought new one. Blue, very big. My wife says I look like a tent.","p":"","m":"你上次问下雨天大家还骑不骑车。骑——不过得有件好雨衣。我那件旧的这周破了，就买了件新的。蓝色的，特别大。我老婆说我像一顶帐篷。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's one thing you always take when it rains?","p":"","m":"下雨天你一定会带的一样东西是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"An umbrella, always.","p":"","m":"伞，每次都带。","r":{"t":"Umbrella is good for walking. On a motorbike, it flies away, haha.","p":"","m":"走路打伞挺好。骑摩托车的话，伞会飞走，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Shoes that don't get wet.","p":"","m":"不怕湿的鞋。","r":{"t":"Smart! My shoes are wet every day this month.","p":"","m":"聪明！这个月我的鞋天天是湿的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Raincoat on again today.","p":"","m":"今天又穿上雨衣了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-16|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same here — it's still dark at seven.","p":"","m":"我这边也是，七点还黑着。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是七点天还黑着","en":"It's still dark at seven where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's still dark at seven where you are too. Here the sun comes up around quarter to eight now. My kids eat breakfast in the dark and say good morning to the moon.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边七点天也还黑着。我们这儿现在七点三刻左右才出太阳。我的孩子们摸黑吃早饭，跟月亮说早上好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is it harder to get up when it's dark?","p":"","m":"天黑的时候，起床是不是更难？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, much harder.","p":"","m":"是，难多了。","r":{"t":"Ja, for me too. A big cup of coffee helps.","p":"","m":"是啊，我也是。来一大杯咖啡就好点。"}},{"t":"Not really, I'm used to it.","p":"","m":"还好，习惯了。","r":{"t":"Same — after forty winters, my body just knows.","p":"","m":"我也是——过了四十个冬天，身体自己就知道了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still dark here this morning. All lamps on again.","p":"","m":"今天早上这儿还是黑的。灯又全开了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's already light at seven here.","p":"","m":"我这边七点天已经亮了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边七点天已经亮了","en":"It's already light at seven where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's already light at seven where you are. I thought of that on my way to school, cycling in the dark. So — did you enjoy the light for me?","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边七点天已经亮了。我摸黑骑车去学校的时候，想起了这句话。那么——你替我好好享受阳光了吗？","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did you enjoy the light for me?","p":"","m":"你替我享受阳光了吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I went for a walk.","p":"","m":"享受了，我出去走了走。","r":{"t":"Perfect. That's exactly what I meant.","p":"","m":"太好了。我说的就是这个。"}},{"t":"Not really, I was too busy.","p":"","m":"没有，太忙了。","r":{"t":"To be fair, mornings are busy everywhere.","p":"","m":"说句公道话，哪儿的早上都忙。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your bright mornings from my dark kitchen.","p":"","m":"在我黑黑的厨房里，想着你那边亮堂堂的早上。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many lamps do you have?","p":"","m":"你家有几盏灯？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她有几盏灯（十一盏，在瑞典很正常）","en":"You asked how many lamps she has (eleven — normal in Sweden)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many lamps I have. Eleven, I said. Well — now it's twelve. We bought a paper star lamp for the kitchen window. Most Swedish windows get one around Advent.","p":"","m":"你上次问我有几盏灯。我说十一盏。现在变成十二盏了。我们买了一盏纸做的星星灯挂在厨房窗户上。将临期前后，瑞典大多数人家的窗口都会挂一盏。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do people decorate their windows where you live?","p":"","m":"你住的地方，大家会装饰窗户吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, especially for holidays.","p":"","m":"会，尤其是过节的时候。","r":{"t":"Then you know the feeling. A lit window is like a hello.","p":"","m":"那你懂这种感觉。一扇亮着的窗户，就像在跟人打招呼。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不怎么装饰。","r":{"t":"Then imagine a whole street of glowing stars. It's lovely.","p":"","m":"那你想象一下，一整条街都是亮着的星星。很美。"}}],"next":{"t":"All eleven lamps on again today.","p":"","m":"今天十一盏灯又全开了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you mind the dark mornings?","p":"","m":"你介意早上那么黑吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她介不介意早上天黑（不介意，灯都开着很温馨）","en":"You asked if she minds the dark mornings (not really — with the lamps on it's cosy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I mind the dark mornings. Not really, I said. To be fair, this week was harder — rain every day, grey all day. So we lit candles at breakfast. It helps more than you'd think.","p":"","m":"你上次问我介不介意早上天黑。我说还好。说句公道话，这个星期难熬一点——天天下雨，一整天都是灰的。所以我们早饭的时候点了蜡烛。比你想的管用。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What helps you on gloomy days?","p":"","m":"阴沉沉的日子，什么能让你好过一点？"},"replies":[{"t":"Music.","p":"","m":"音乐。","r":{"t":"Ja! I play old Swedish pop in the kitchen. My kids hate it.","p":"","m":"对！我在厨房放瑞典的老流行歌。我的孩子们受不了。"}},{"t":"Going outside, even for a short walk.","p":"","m":"出去走走，哪怕一小会儿。","r":{"t":"That's what we say here: there's no bad weather, only bad clothes.","p":"","m":"我们这儿就有句话：没有坏天气，只有穿错的衣服。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cosy morning here. Hope your day is cosy too.","p":"","m":"我这边的早上很温馨。希望你今天也是。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-16|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-11-16","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"The sun's up here too.","p":"","m":"我这边太阳也出来了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也出太阳了","en":"The sun was up where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said the sun's up there too. Here the sky is getting a bit hazy now — the harmattan is starting. Dry air, dusty sky, cracked lips. Chale, I'm already buying lip balm.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也出太阳了。我们这儿天开始有点灰蒙蒙的——哈马丹风要来了。空气干，天上都是灰，嘴唇干裂。兄弟，我已经在买润唇膏了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the weather like where you are this week?","p":"","m":"你那边这个星期天气怎么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cool and cloudy.","p":"","m":"凉快，多云。","r":{"t":"Cool sounds nice. Send some here!","p":"","m":"凉快听着就舒服。给我们送点过来！"}},{"t":"Hot and sunny.","p":"","m":"又热又晒。","r":{"t":"Then we're twins this week.","p":"","m":"那我们这周一模一样。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hello from sunny Accra.","p":"","m":"阿克拉的阳光问你好。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's still dark here.","p":"","m":"我这边天还黑着。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边早上天还黑着","en":"It was still dark where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's still dark there in the morning. I keep thinking about that. Here, close to the equator, the day is about twelve hours all year. Six to six, more or less.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边早上天还黑着。我一直在想这件事。我们这儿离赤道近，一年到头白天都是十二个小时左右。差不多早六点到晚六点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When does it get light where you are now?","p":"","m":"你那边现在几点天亮？"},"replies":[{"t":"Around seven.","p":"","m":"七点左右。","r":{"t":"Seven! I'd sleep through half the morning.","p":"","m":"七点！那我能睡掉半个早上。"}},{"t":"After eight.","p":"","m":"八点以后。","r":{"t":"After eight?! Chale, that's late.","p":"","m":"八点以后？！兄弟，那也太晚了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your dark mornings. Hope today's a good one.","p":"","m":"想起你那边黑漆漆的早上。希望你今天过得好。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's on the radio?","p":"","m":"收音机里在放什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过收音机里放什么（早上新闻，然后是 highlife 音乐）","en":"You asked what's on the radio (morning news, then highlife)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what's on the radio. This week our neighbour played one old highlife song three mornings in a row. I've started sampling it for a beat. Don't tell him, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次问收音机里放什么。这个星期，邻居连着三个早上都放同一首老 highlife 歌。我已经开始拿它采样做节奏了。别告诉他，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What music do you wake up to?","p":"","m":"你早上起来听什么音乐？"},"replies":[{"t":"Nothing — I like quiet mornings.","p":"","m":"什么都不听，我喜欢安静的早上。","r":{"t":"Respect. My street doesn't do quiet.","p":"","m":"佩服。我们这条街可没有安静这回事。"}},{"t":"Whatever my phone picks.","p":"","m":"手机放什么我听什么。","r":{"t":"Same! My phone knows me better than I do.","p":"","m":"我也是！手机比我还了解我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Highlife on the radio again today, chale.","p":"","m":"今天收音机里又是 highlife，兄弟。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it loud?","p":"","m":"声音大吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过收音机吵不吵（吵得能把他叫醒，不用闹钟）","en":"You asked if the radio is loud (loud enough that he doesn't need an alarm)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the radio's loud. This week it got louder — he bought a new speaker. My alarm clock is officially retired, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次问收音机吵不吵。这个星期更吵了——他买了个新音箱。我的闹钟正式退休了，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you wake up — alarm, or on your own?","p":"","m":"你怎么醒——靠闹钟，还是自己醒？"},"replies":[{"t":"Alarm. Many alarms.","p":"","m":"闹钟。好多个闹钟。","r":{"t":"Many alarms! I know that life.","p":"","m":"好多个！这种日子我懂。"}},{"t":"On my own, usually.","p":"","m":"一般自己醒。","r":{"t":"Lucky. My body only wakes up for the radio.","p":"","m":"真好。我的身体只听收音机的。"}}],"next":{"t":"The radio woke me up again, haha.","p":"","m":"收音机又把我叫醒了，哈哈。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-17|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-17","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也不要香菜。","p":"Wǒ yě bú yào xiāngcài.","m":"I don't want cilantro either."},"mem":{"zh":"你也不要香菜","en":"You don't like cilantro either"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也不要香菜，我们是一伙儿的！这两天跟朋友去吃涮羊肉，调料里也有香菜，我一根一根挑出来，朋友笑我挑了十分钟。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě bú yào xiāngcài, wǒmen shì yì huǒr de! Zhè liǎng tiān gēn péngyou qù chī shuàn yángròu, tiáoliào lǐ yě yǒu xiāngcài, wǒ yì gēn yì gēn tiāo chūlái, péngyou xiào wǒ tiāo le shí fēnzhōng.","m":"You said you don't want cilantro either — we're on the same team! I went for hotpot lamb with friends these last couple of days, and the dipping sauce had cilantro too. I picked it out bit by bit, and my friends laughed that it took me ten minutes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你还有什么不吃的东西吗？","p":"Nǐ hái yǒu shénme bù chī de dōngxi ma?","m":"Is there anything else you don't eat?"},"replies":[{"t":"我不太能吃辣。","p":"Wǒ bú tài néng chī là.","m":"I can't really do spicy food.","r":{"t":"那出去吃饭，记得说「不要辣」。","p":"Nà chūqù chī fàn, jìde shuō “bú yào là”.","m":"Then when you eat out, remember to say “不要辣” — no chilli."}},{"t":"没有，我什么都吃。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ shénme dōu chī.","m":"No, I eat everything.","r":{"t":"真好！跟你吃饭最省心了。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Gēn nǐ chī fàn zuì shěngxīn le.","m":"Great! You'd be the easiest person to eat out with."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的煎饼又说了「不要香菜」，想到你了。","p":"Jīntiān de jiānbing yòu shuō le “bú yào xiāngcài”, xiǎng dào nǐ le.","m":"Said “no cilantro” for my jianbing again today and thought of you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没吃过煎饼。","p":"Wǒ hái méi chīguo jiānbing.","m":"I've never had jianbing."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没吃过煎饼","en":"You've never had a jianbing"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没吃过煎饼。这两天我特意看了看大姐怎么摊：先舀一勺面糊摊开，打个鸡蛋，撒葱花，放一块薄脆，刷上酱，一卷就好了，不到两分钟。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi chīguo jiānbing. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ tèyì kàn le kàn dàjiě zěnme tān: xiān yǎo yì sháo miànhù tān kāi, dǎ gè jīdàn, sǎ cōnghuā, fàng yí kuài báocuì, shuā shang jiàng, yì juǎn jiù hǎo le, bú dào liǎng fēnzhōng.","m":"You said you've never had a jianbing. So these last couple of days I watched closely how the lady makes it: a ladle of batter spread out, an egg cracked on, spring onions, a crispy cracker, a brush of sauce, roll it up — done in under two minutes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边早上有没有这种路边的早点摊？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zǎoshang yǒu méiyǒu zhè zhǒng lùbiān de zǎodiǎn tān?","m":"Where you are, are there roadside breakfast stalls like this in the morning?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，卖包子、豆浆什么的。","p":"Yǒu, mài bāozi, dòujiāng shénme de.","m":"Yes — steamed buns, soy milk, that sort of thing.","r":{"t":"那挺好，早上吃点儿热乎的最舒服。","p":"Nà tǐng hǎo, zǎoshang chī diǎnr rèhu de zuì shūfu.","m":"Nice — something hot in the morning is the best."}},{"t":"没有，大家一般在家吃。","p":"Méiyǒu, dàjiā yìbān zài jiā chī.","m":"No, people usually eat at home.","r":{"t":"在家吃也好，想吃什么做什么。","p":"Zài jiā chī yě hǎo, xiǎng chī shénme zuò shénme.","m":"Eating at home is good too — you make whatever you fancy."}}],"next":{"t":"你说还没吃过煎饼，我今天路过煎饼摊，又想起你了。","p":"Nǐ shuō hái méi chīguo jiānbing, wǒ jīntiān lùguò jiānbing tān, yòu xiǎng qǐ nǐ le.","m":"You said you've never had a jianbing — I passed the stall today and thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"一个煎饼多少钱？","p":"Yí gè jiānbing duōshao qián?","m":"How much is a jianbing?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过一个煎饼多少钱（加一个蛋十块左右）","en":"You asked how much a jianbing costs (about ten yuan with an extra egg)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问一个煎饼多少钱，我说十块左右。这两天我发现，同一条街，胡同口那家九块，地铁口那家要十二。我说贵的那三块是「地段费」，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn yí gè jiānbing duōshao qián, wǒ shuō shí kuài zuǒyòu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, tóng yì tiáo jiē, hútòng kǒu nà jiā jiǔ kuài, dìtiě kǒu nà jiā yào shí'èr. Wǒ shuō guì de nà sān kuài shì “dìduàn fèi”, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how much a jianbing is — about ten, I said. Then I noticed: on the same street, the one at the hutong entrance is nine, and the one by the subway exit is twelve. I call the extra three “location fee”, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边一顿早饭大概多少钱？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yí dùn zǎofàn dàgài duōshao qián?","m":"Roughly how much is a breakfast where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"差不多一杯咖啡的钱。","p":"Chàbuduō yì bēi kāfēi de qián.","m":"About the price of a coffee.","r":{"t":"那还行！在北京，一杯咖啡能买两个煎饼。","p":"Nà hái xíng! Zài Běijīng, yì bēi kāfēi néng mǎi liǎng gè jiānbing.","m":"Not bad! In Beijing a coffee costs about two jianbing."}},{"t":"我一般在家吃，不太花钱。","p":"Wǒ yìbān zài jiā chī, bú tài huā qián.","m":"I usually eat at home, so it hardly costs anything.","r":{"t":"在家吃最省了。","p":"Zài jiā chī zuì shěng le.","m":"Eating at home saves the most."}}],"next":{"t":"你问煎饼多少钱，我今天又买了一个，还是十块。","p":"Nǐ wèn jiānbing duōshao qián, wǒ jīntiān yòu mǎi le yí gè, háishi shí kuài.","m":"You asked about jianbing prices — bought another today, still ten yuan."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天早上都吃煎饼吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān zǎoshang dōu chī jiānbing ma?","m":"Do you have jianbing every morning?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天早上都吃煎饼（一个星期三次，别的时候喝粥）","en":"You asked if she has jianbing every morning (three times a week; congee the other days)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天都吃煎饼。这两天天冷了，我改成在家煮小米粥，放几颗红枣，喝完从里到外都暖和。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān dōu chī jiānbing. Zhè liǎng tiān tiān lěng le, wǒ gǎi chéng zài jiā zhǔ xiǎomǐ zhōu, fàng jǐ kē hóngzǎo, hē wán cóng lǐ dào wài dōu nuǎnhuo.","m":"Last time you asked if I have jianbing every day. Now it's turned cold, I've switched to millet congee at home with a few red dates — it warms you right through.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天早上喜欢吃热的还是凉的？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zǎoshang xǐhuan chī rè de háishi liáng de?","m":"On winter mornings, do you like something hot or cold?"},"replies":[{"t":"热的，一定要热的。","p":"Rè de, yídìng yào rè de.","m":"Hot — it has to be hot.","r":{"t":"对！冬天早上吃一口热的，人才醒过来。","p":"Duì! Dōngtiān zǎoshang chī yì kǒu rè de, rén cái xǐng guòlái.","m":"Right! On a winter morning you only wake up after something hot."}},{"t":"无所谓，有什么吃什么。","p":"Wúsuǒwèi, yǒu shénme chī shénme.","m":"Doesn't matter — I eat whatever's there.","r":{"t":"这样最好养活，哈哈。","p":"Zhèyàng zuì hǎo yǎnghuo, hāha.","m":"Then you're easy to feed, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我没吃煎饼，喝的是粥。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ méi chī jiānbing, hē de shì zhōu.","m":"No jianbing for me today — congee instead."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-17|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-17","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我早饭也喝奶茶！","p":"Wǒ zǎofàn yě hē nǎichá!","m":"I have milk tea for breakfast too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你早饭也喝奶茶","en":"You have milk tea for breakfast too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你早饭也喝奶茶！这两天在店里打工，我发现天一冷，来买热奶茶的人超多，很多人一进来就说：「大杯，微糖，热的。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zǎofàn yě hē nǎichá! Zhè liǎng tiān zài diàn lǐ dǎgōng, wǒ fāxiàn tiān yì lěng, lái mǎi rè nǎichá de rén chāo duō, hěn duō rén yí jìnlái jiù shuō: “Dà bēi, wēi táng, rè de.”","m":"You said you have milk tea for breakfast too! On my shifts at the shop these days, I've noticed that once it turns cold, loads of people come in for hot milk tea. Lots of them walk in and say: “Large, a little sugar, hot.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你的奶茶一般要几分糖？","p":"Nǐ de nǎichá yìbān yào jǐ fēn táng?","m":"How sweet do you usually have your milk tea?"},"replies":[{"t":"半糖就好。","p":"Bàn táng jiù hǎo.","m":"Half sugar is fine.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！半糖最刚好。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Bàn táng zuì gānghǎo.","m":"Same as me! Half sugar is just right."}},{"t":"我不加糖。","p":"Wǒ bù jiā táng.","m":"No sugar for me.","r":{"t":"无糖喔？好健康！我还做不到。","p":"Wú táng o? Hǎo jiànkāng! Wǒ hái zuò bu dào.","m":"No sugar? So healthy! I can't do that yet."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又是蛋饼配奶茶，想到你也在喝。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu shì dànbǐng pèi nǎichá, xiǎng dào nǐ yě zài hē.","m":"Danbing and milk tea again this morning — thought of you having yours."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我早上什么都不吃。","p":"Wǒ zǎoshang shénme dōu bù chī.","m":"I don't eat anything in the morning."},"mem":{"zh":"你早上什么都不吃","en":"You don't eat anything in the morning"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你早上什么都不吃。这两天我也试了一次不吃早餐——上到第二节课，肚子就叫了，旁边的同学都听到了，好丢脸喔。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zǎoshang shénme dōu bù chī. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě shì le yí cì bù chī zǎocān —— shàng dào dì èr jié kè, dùzi jiù jiào le, pángbiān de tóngxué dōu tīng dào le, hǎo diūliǎn o.","m":"You said you don't eat anything in the morning. So I tried skipping breakfast once — by second period my stomach was growling and the people next to me heard it. So embarrassing.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你早上不吃，一般几点才吃第一顿？","p":"Nǐ zǎoshang bù chī, yìbān jǐ diǎn cái chī dì yī dùn?","m":"If you skip breakfast, when do you usually have your first meal?"},"replies":[{"t":"中午才吃。","p":"Zhōngwǔ cái chī.","m":"Not till lunch.","r":{"t":"好厉害，我撑不到中午。","p":"Hǎo lìhai, wǒ chēng bu dào zhōngwǔ.","m":"Impressive — I can't hold out till noon."}},{"t":"十点左右会吃一点东西。","p":"Shí diǎn zuǒyòu huì chī yìdiǎn dōngxi.","m":"I have a little something around ten.","r":{"t":"那也不错，我十点也会偷吃饼干。","p":"Nà yě búcuò, wǒ shí diǎn yě huì tōu chī bǐnggān.","m":"That's not bad — I sneak biscuits at ten too."}}],"next":{"t":"你说早上什么都不吃，我今天还是吃了蛋饼，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shuō zǎoshang shénme dōu bù chī, wǒ jīntiān háishi chī le dànbǐng, hāha.","m":"You said you skip breakfast — I still had my danbing today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"蛋饼是什么？","p":"Dànbǐng shì shénme?","m":"What's a danbing?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过蛋饼是什么（薄饼加蛋卷起来，淋酱油膏）","en":"You asked what a danbing is (a thin crêpe with egg, rolled up, with thick soy sauce)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问蛋饼是什么。这两天我又吃了，这次点了起司蛋饼，里面多一片起司。台湾的早餐店，蛋饼可以加好多东西：玉米、鲔鱼、培根。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn dànbǐng shì shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu chī le, zhè cì diǎn le qǐsī dànbǐng, lǐmiàn duō yí piàn qǐsī. Táiwān de zǎocān diàn, dànbǐng kěyǐ jiā hǎo duō dōngxi: yùmǐ, wěiyú, péigēn.","m":"Last time you asked what a danbing is. I had one again — a cheese one this time, with an extra slice of cheese inside. At Taiwanese breakfast shops you can add all sorts: sweetcorn, tuna, bacon.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边早上大家都吃什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zǎoshang dàjiā dōu chī shénme?","m":"What do people eat for breakfast where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"面包，配咖啡。","p":"Miànbāo, pèi kāfēi.","m":"Bread, with coffee.","r":{"t":"那跟台湾也有点像！早餐店也卖吐司和咖啡。","p":"Nà gēn Táiwān yě yǒudiǎn xiàng! Zǎocān diàn yě mài tǔsī hé kāfēi.","m":"That's a bit like Taiwan! Breakfast shops sell toast and coffee too."}},{"t":"吃热的，像粥或者面。","p":"Chī rè de, xiàng zhōu huòzhě miàn.","m":"Something hot, like congee or noodles.","r":{"t":"热的好！冬天早上，我也想喝一碗热豆浆。","p":"Rè de hǎo! Dōngtiān zǎoshang, wǒ yě xiǎng hē yì wǎn rè dòujiāng.","m":"Hot is good! On winter mornings I want a bowl of hot soy milk too."}}],"next":{"t":"你问我蛋饼是什么，我今天又吃了一个，想到你。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ dànbǐng shì shénme, wǒ jīntiān yòu chī le yí gè, xiǎng dào nǐ.","m":"You asked what a danbing is — I had another today and thought of you."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天都去同一家早餐店吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān dōu qù tóng yì jiā zǎocān diàn ma?","m":"Do you go to the same breakfast shop every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天都去同一家早餐店（老板娘一看到她就说「老样子？」）","en":"You asked if she goes to the same breakfast shop every day (the owner greets her with “the usual?”)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天都去同一家早餐店。这两天老板娘还多送我一颗荷包蛋，说我最近太瘦了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān dōu qù tóng yì jiā zǎocān diàn. Zhè liǎng tiān lǎobǎnniáng hái duō sòng wǒ yì kē hébāodàn, shuō wǒ zuìjìn tài shòu le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if I go to the same breakfast shop every day. These days the owner even threw in a free fried egg — she says I've got too thin lately, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有常去的店，老板都认识你？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu cháng qù de diàn, lǎobǎn dōu rènshi nǐ?","m":"Is there a place you go to so often that the owner knows you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，楼下的咖啡店。","p":"Yǒu, lóuxià de kāfēi diàn.","m":"Yes — the café downstairs.","r":{"t":"那你也有你的「老样子」了！","p":"Nà nǐ yě yǒu nǐ de “lǎoyàngzi” le!","m":"Then you've got your own “usual” too!"}},{"t":"没有，我常常换着吃。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ chángcháng huàn zhe chī.","m":"No, I like to switch around.","r":{"t":"换着吃也好，每天都有新的。","p":"Huàn zhe chī yě hǎo, měi tiān dōu yǒu xīn de.","m":"That's good too — something new every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天老板娘又说「老样子？」，我笑了。","p":"Jīntiān lǎobǎnniáng yòu shuō “lǎoyàngzi?”, wǒ xiào le.","m":"The owner said “the usual?” again today and I laughed."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-17|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-17","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same — I ate standing up too.","p":"","m":"我也是，也是站着吃的。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也站着吃的早饭","en":"You ate breakfast standing up too"},"later":{"t":"You said you ate breakfast standing up too. Small win this week: on Wednesday I actually sat down for my toast. Two whole minutes. I felt like a king.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是站着吃的早饭。这周有个小胜利：周三我居然坐下来吃了吐司。整整两分钟。我感觉自己像个国王。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's breakfast like for you on a normal weekday?","p":"","m":"平常的工作日，你早饭一般怎么吃？"},"replies":[{"t":"Coffee, and that's it.","p":"","m":"一杯咖啡，就这样。","r":{"t":"The classic. No judgement here.","p":"","m":"经典。我不评判。"}},{"t":"A proper bowl of something hot.","p":"","m":"好好吃一碗热的。","r":{"t":"That's very grown-up. I'm taking notes.","p":"","m":"很有大人样。我记下了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Standing breakfast again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是站着吃的早饭。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I had a proper breakfast this morning.","p":"","m":"我今天早上好好吃了一顿早饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那天好好吃了一顿早饭","en":"You had a proper breakfast that day"},"later":{"t":"You said you'd had a proper breakfast. So I tried: on Wednesday I made porridge. It took eight minutes. I nearly missed my train, but I wasn't hungry till lunch.","p":"","m":"你上次说你好好吃了一顿早饭。所以我也试了：周三我煮了燕麦粥。花了八分钟。差点没赶上车，不过一直到午饭都没饿。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What counts as a proper breakfast where you are?","p":"","m":"在你那边，什么样的早饭才算「好好吃了一顿」？"},"replies":[{"t":"Rice, soup and a few small dishes.","p":"","m":"米饭、汤，再加几个小菜。","r":{"t":"That's a real meal! My toast feels a bit sad now.","p":"","m":"那是正经一顿饭！我的吐司显得有点可怜了。"}},{"t":"Eggs and bread.","p":"","m":"鸡蛋加面包。","r":{"t":"Simple and good. Can't argue with eggs.","p":"","m":"简单又好。鸡蛋没的说。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about your proper breakfast.","p":"","m":"我还在想你那顿正经早饭。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How do you take your tea?","p":"","m":"你的茶怎么喝？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他茶怎么喝（加奶，不加糖，要浓）","en":"You asked how he takes his tea (milk, no sugar, strong)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how I take my tea. Strong, milk, no sugar. One of my flatmates puts the milk in first. We argued about it for twenty minutes. Very British.","p":"","m":"你上次问我茶怎么喝。要浓，加奶，不加糖。我有个室友是先倒奶再倒茶的。我们为这个争了二十分钟。非常英国。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you take yours — tea or coffee?","p":"","m":"你呢——喝茶还是喝咖啡？怎么喝？"},"replies":[{"t":"Coffee, black.","p":"","m":"咖啡，什么都不加。","r":{"t":"Strong choice. Respect.","p":"","m":"硬核。佩服。"}},{"t":"Tea, no milk.","p":"","m":"茶，不加奶。","r":{"t":"Fair enough. Plenty of people here drink it like that too.","p":"","m":"也行。这儿也有很多人这么喝。"}}],"next":{"t":"Strong tea, milk, no sugar — already had two today.","p":"","m":"浓茶，加奶，不加糖——今天已经喝了两杯。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why were you standing up?","p":"","m":"你为什么站着吃？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他为什么站着吃（又要迟到了，跟平常一样）","en":"You asked why he was standing up (running late, as usual)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why I was standing up. Running late, as usual. So this week I set my alarm ten minutes earlier. Result: I still ate standing up — just more slowly.","p":"","m":"你上次问我为什么站着吃。又要迟到了，跟平常一样。所以这周我把闹钟提前了十分钟。结果：还是站着吃——只是吃得慢了一点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you a morning person?","p":"","m":"你是早起型的人吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Not at all.","p":"","m":"完全不是。","r":{"t":"Welcome to the club. We meet at ten.","p":"","m":"欢迎加入。我们十点集合。"}},{"t":"Yes, I like mornings.","p":"","m":"是，我喜欢早上。","r":{"t":"Respect. Tell me your secret.","p":"","m":"佩服。告诉我你的秘诀。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ran late again today. Classic.","p":"","m":"今天又差点迟到。老样子。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-17|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-17","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I had rice for breakfast too.","p":"","m":"我早饭也吃的米饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你早饭也吃米饭","en":"You had rice for breakfast too"},"later":{"t":"You said you had rice for breakfast too! Rice for breakfast, rice for lunch, rice for dinner. Here we say: if you didn't eat rice, you didn't eat yet. It's true, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你早饭也吃米饭！早饭米饭，午饭米饭，晚饭也是米饭。我们这儿有句话：没吃米饭，就不算吃过饭。真的，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you eat rice every day?","p":"","m":"你每天都吃米饭吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Almost every day.","p":"","m":"差不多每天都吃。","r":{"t":"Same! Rice is my fuel.","p":"","m":"我也是！米饭就是我的油。"}},{"t":"Not every day — maybe twice a week.","p":"","m":"不是每天，一周两次吧。","r":{"t":"Twice is OK. My wife says I eat too much rice anyway.","p":"","m":"两次也行。反正我老婆说我米饭吃太多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Rice again today, bro. Thought of you.","p":"","m":"今天又是米饭，兄弟。想到你了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never tried nasi uduk.","p":"","m":"我没吃过椰浆饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你还没吃过 nasi uduk","en":"You've never tried nasi uduk"},"later":{"t":"You said you never tried nasi uduk. This week I asked the warung lady why it smells so good. She said: coconut milk and lemongrass, cooked with the rice. Now you know the secret too.","p":"","m":"你上次说你还没吃过 nasi uduk（椰浆饭）。这周我问小摊的阿姨，为什么这么香。她说：椰奶和香茅，跟米一起煮。现在你也知道秘诀了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What breakfast from your place should I try?","p":"","m":"你那边有什么早饭我应该尝尝？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something with eggs and bread.","p":"","m":"鸡蛋配面包之类的。","r":{"t":"Easy! I can make that at home.","p":"","m":"简单！我在家就能做。"}},{"t":"A hot bowl of noodle soup.","p":"","m":"一碗热汤面。","r":{"t":"Noodle soup in the morning? Good idea when it rains here.","p":"","m":"早上吃汤面？我们这儿下雨的时候正合适。"}}],"next":{"t":"Had nasi uduk again today. One day you will try it, I'm sure.","p":"","m":"今天又吃了 nasi uduk。总有一天你会尝到的。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What comes with it?","p":"","m":"配什么吃？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 nasi uduk 配什么（鸡蛋、炸红葱头、一点 sambal 辣酱）","en":"You asked what comes with nasi uduk (egg, fried shallots and a bit of sambal)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what comes with nasi uduk. This week I added tempe orek — sweet fried tempeh. My daughter steals it from my plate every time.","p":"","m":"你上次问 nasi uduk 配什么。这周我多加了一份 tempe orek——甜甜的炒天贝。我女儿每次都从我盘子里偷。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like spicy food, like sambal?","p":"","m":"你喜欢吃辣吗，像 sambal 那种？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, the spicier the better.","p":"","m":"喜欢，越辣越好。","r":{"t":"Strong! You can eat sambal with me anytime.","p":"","m":"厉害！随时可以跟我一起吃 sambal。"}},{"t":"A little bit is fine.","p":"","m":"一点点就行。","r":{"t":"Same as my wife. Little bit, then a lot of water, haha.","p":"","m":"跟我老婆一样。吃一点点，然后喝一大堆水，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Extra sambal today.","p":"","m":"今天多加了 sambal。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much is it?","p":"","m":"多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 nasi uduk 多少钱（一万五千印尼盾左右）","en":"You asked how much it is (about fifteen thousand rupiah)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much. Fifteen thousand, I said. This week I paid only twelve — no egg, because I was in a hurry. Big mistake. I was hungry by ten.","p":"","m":"你上次问多少钱。我说一万五。这周我只花了一万二——因为赶时间没要鸡蛋。大错特错。十点就饿了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How much is a cheap breakfast where you are?","p":"","m":"你那边一顿便宜的早饭多少钱？"},"replies":[{"t":"About the price of a coffee.","p":"","m":"差不多一杯咖啡的钱。","r":{"t":"Then breakfast here is cheaper than coffee there, haha.","p":"","m":"那我们这儿的早饭比你那边的咖啡还便宜，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Not sure — I usually eat at home.","p":"","m":"不太清楚，我一般在家吃。","r":{"t":"Home breakfast is the cheapest! My wife agrees.","p":"","m":"在家吃最便宜！我老婆也这么说。"}}],"next":{"t":"Same breakfast, same price today.","p":"","m":"今天还是同样的早饭、同样的价钱。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-17|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-11-17","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I always get the same thing too.","p":"","m":"我也每次都点一样的。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也总是点一样的","en":"You always get the same thing too"},"later":{"t":"You said you always get the same thing too. This week I tried to order something different. The koko lady just looked at me and handed me my usual. Chale, she was right.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也总是点一样的。这周我想换点别的。卖 koko 的阿姨看了我一眼，直接把老样子递给我了。兄弟，她是对的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a 'usual' order somewhere?","p":"","m":"你有没有在哪儿总点的「老样子」？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, the same coffee every morning.","p":"","m":"有，每天早上同一杯咖啡。","r":{"t":"Then you get it. One less thing to think about.","p":"","m":"那你懂。少想一件事。"}},{"t":"Not really — I like trying new things.","p":"","m":"没有，我喜欢试新的。","r":{"t":"Respect. I need a bit of that.","p":"","m":"佩服。我得学学。"}}],"next":{"t":"Same order again today, chale.","p":"","m":"今天又是老样子，兄弟。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never had koko.","p":"","m":"我没喝过 koko。"},"mem":{"zh":"你还没喝过 koko","en":"You've never had koko"},"later":{"t":"You said you've never had koko. So here's more: it's millet porridge with ginger and pepper, and you eat it with koose — little fried bean cakes. With the harmattan starting, hot spicy koko is perfect.","p":"","m":"你上次说你还没喝过 koko。那我多说一点：它是小米粥，加姜和辣椒，配 koose 一起吃——一种豆子炸的小饼。哈马丹风开始刮了，喝一碗又热又辣的 koko 正好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a hot breakfast you love?","p":"","m":"你最爱的热乎乎的早饭是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Porridge — oats or rice.","p":"","m":"粥——燕麦的或者米的。","r":{"t":"Porridge gang! We're the same.","p":"","m":"喝粥一派！我们一样。"}},{"t":"I usually skip breakfast.","p":"","m":"我一般不吃早饭。","r":{"t":"Chale, my mum would never allow that.","p":"","m":"兄弟，我妈绝对不允许。"}}],"next":{"t":"Had koko again today. Thought of you!","p":"","m":"今天又喝了 koko。想起你了！"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much is it?","p":"","m":"多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 koko 多少钱（几塞地，便宜又顶饱）","en":"You asked how much koko is (a few cedis — cheap and filling)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much. A few cedis, I said. This week I got two koose extra for free, because I helped her carry her pot to the stop. Best deal in Accra.","p":"","m":"你上次问多少钱。我说几塞地。这周她多送了我两个 koose，因为我帮她把锅抬到了车站。阿克拉最划算的买卖。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you usually get breakfast?","p":"","m":"你一般在哪儿吃早饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"I make it at home.","p":"","m":"在家自己做。","r":{"t":"Home cooking, nice. I can only make tea.","p":"","m":"在家做，真好。我只会泡茶。"}},{"t":"From a little shop or stall near me.","p":"","m":"家附近的小店或者小摊。","r":{"t":"Then you know — street breakfast is the best.","p":"","m":"那你懂——路边的早饭最好吃。"}}],"next":{"t":"Koko and koose, still cheap today.","p":"","m":"koko 加 koose，今天还是那么便宜。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it served hot?","p":"","m":"是热的吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 koko 是不是热的（是，刚从锅里舀出来）","en":"You asked if koko is served hot (yes — straight from the pot)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if koko is served hot. Very hot! This week I burned my tongue because I was rushing to the studio. Lesson: koko waits for nobody — but you must wait for koko.","p":"","m":"你上次问 koko 是不是热的。特别烫！这周我急着去录音室，把舌头烫了。教训：koko 不等人——可是人得等 koko。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you eat breakfast fast or slowly?","p":"","m":"你吃早饭快还是慢？"},"replies":[{"t":"Fast, I'm always in a hurry.","p":"","m":"快，我总是很赶。","r":{"t":"Same! We need to slow down, chale.","p":"","m":"我也是！我们得慢下来，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Slowly, I like to take my time.","p":"","m":"慢，我喜欢慢慢吃。","r":{"t":"That's the way. I'm trying to learn.","p":"","m":"就该这样。我在学。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot koko again today. Careful with your breakfast too, haha.","p":"","m":"今天的 koko 又很烫。你吃早饭也小心点，哈哈。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也骑车上学。","p":"Wǒ yě qí chē shàngxué.","m":"I ride to school too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也骑车上学","en":"You ride to school too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也骑车上学。这两天雨小了一点，红灯的时候，前面停了一整排机车，每个人的雨衣颜色都不一样，好像彩虹。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě qí chē shàngxué. Zhè liǎng tiān yǔ xiǎo le yìdiǎn, hóngdēng de shíhou, qiánmiàn tíng le yì zhěng pái jīchē, měi gè rén de yǔyī yánsè dōu bù yíyàng, hǎoxiàng cǎihóng.","m":"You said you ride to school too. The rain's eased off a bit these days. At a red light there was a whole row of scooters in front of me, every raincoat a different colour — like a rainbow.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你骑车的时候，最怕什么天气？","p":"Nǐ qí chē de shíhou, zuì pà shénme tiānqì?","m":"When you're riding, what weather do you dread most?"},"replies":[{"t":"下大雨。","p":"Xià dà yǔ.","m":"Heavy rain.","r":{"t":"同意！大雨打在脸上好痛。","p":"Tóngyì! Dà yǔ dǎ zài liǎn shang hǎo tòng.","m":"Agreed! Heavy rain stings your face."}},{"t":"刮大风。","p":"Guā dà fēng.","m":"Strong wind.","r":{"t":"大风也好可怕！骑在桥上的时候，车子都会晃。","p":"Dà fēng yě hǎo kěpà! Qí zài qiáo shang de shíhou, chēzi dōu huì huàng.","m":"Wind is scary too! On bridges the whole bike wobbles."}}],"next":{"t":"今天骑车，路上的水少一点了。","p":"Jīntiān qí chē, lù shang de shuǐ shǎo yìdiǎn le.","m":"Rode in today — fewer puddles on the road."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我坐地铁去学校。","p":"Wǒ zuò dìtiě qù xuéxiào.","m":"I take the metro to school."},"mem":{"zh":"你坐地铁去学校","en":"You take the subway to school"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你坐地铁去学校。我被你说动了，这两天下雨也改坐捷运——结果车厢里每个人的伞都在滴水，地上一摊一摊的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zuò dìtiě qù xuéxiào. Wǒ bèi nǐ shuōdòng le, zhè liǎng tiān xià yǔ yě gǎi zuò jiéyùn —— jiéguǒ chēxiāng lǐ měi gè rén de sǎn dōu zài dī shuǐ, dì shang yì tān yì tān de.","m":"You said you take the subway to school. You talked me into it — these rainy days I've switched to the MRT too. Except everyone's umbrella drips in the carriage, so there are puddles all over the floor.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你坐地铁的时候一般做什么？","p":"Nǐ zuò dìtiě de shíhou yìbān zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do on the subway?"},"replies":[{"t":"听音乐。","p":"Tīng yīnyuè.","m":"Listen to music.","r":{"t":"我也是！戴上耳机，就是我自己的世界。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Dài shang ěrjī, jiù shì wǒ zìjǐ de shìjiè.","m":"Me too! Headphones on, and it's my own world."}},{"t":"看手机，或者背单词。","p":"Kàn shǒujī, huòzhě bèi dāncí.","m":"Look at my phone, or go over vocab.","r":{"t":"你好认真！我都在看猫的影片。","p":"Nǐ hǎo rènzhēn! Wǒ dōu zài kàn māo de yǐngpiàn.","m":"You're so diligent! I just watch cat videos."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下雨，我想到你坐地铁，不会湿，真好。","p":"Jīntiān xià yǔ, wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ zuò dìtiě, bú huì shī, zhēn hǎo.","m":"Rainy today — thought of you on the subway, nice and dry."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你穿雨衣了吗？","p":"Nǐ chuān yǔyī le ma?","m":"Did you wear a raincoat?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她有没有穿雨衣（穿了，鞋子还是全湿了）","en":"You asked if she wore a raincoat (she did — her shoes still got soaked)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我有没有穿雨衣。跟你说，这两天我买了一双雨鞋套，套在鞋子外面，下课回家袜子终于是干的了！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yǒu méiyǒu chuān yǔyī. Gēn nǐ shuō, zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mǎi le yì shuāng yǔ xiétào, tào zài xiézi wàimiàn, xiàkè huí jiā wàzi zhōngyú shì gān de le!","m":"Last time you asked if I wore a raincoat. Well — I bought a pair of rain shoe covers that go over my shoes, and when I got home from class my socks were finally dry!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你下雨天会穿雨鞋吗？","p":"Nǐ xià yǔ tiān huì chuān yǔxié ma?","m":"Do you wear rain boots on rainy days?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我有一双雨靴。","p":"Huì, wǒ yǒu yì shuāng yǔxuē.","m":"Yes, I have a pair of wellies.","r":{"t":"雨靴好可爱！我也想买一双。","p":"Yǔxuē hǎo kě'ài! Wǒ yě xiǎng mǎi yì shuāng.","m":"Wellies are so cute! I want a pair too."}},{"t":"不会，湿了就湿了。","p":"Bú huì, shī le jiù shī le.","m":"No — if they get wet, they get wet.","r":{"t":"哈哈，你好勇敢。","p":"Hāha, nǐ hǎo yǒnggǎn.","m":"Haha, you're brave."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又穿了雨衣，鞋子还是湿的，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu chuān le yǔyī, xiézi háishi shī de, hāha.","m":"Raincoat on again today, shoes still wet, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"台湾的人都骑机车吗？","p":"Táiwān de rén dōu qí jīchē ma?","m":"Does everyone ride a scooter in Taiwan?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过台湾的人是不是都骑机车（很多人骑，早上路口全是机车）","en":"You asked if everyone in Taiwan rides a scooter (lots do — junctions are full of them in the morning)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问台湾的人是不是都骑机车。这两天我认真数了一下：一个红灯，我前面停了三十几台！对了，台湾说机车用「台」，一台机车，不太说「一辆」喔。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Táiwān de rén shì bu shì dōu qí jīchē. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ rènzhēn shǔ le yíxià: yí gè hóngdēng, wǒ qiánmiàn tíng le sānshí jǐ tái! Duì le, Táiwān shuō jīchē yòng “tái”, yì tái jīchē, bú tài shuō “yí liàng” o.","m":"Last time you asked if everyone in Taiwan rides a scooter. So I actually counted: at one red light there were thirty-odd in front of me! Oh, and in Taiwan we count scooters with 台 — 一台机车 — we don't really say 一辆.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边的人上班上课，一般怎么去？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān de rén shàngbān shàngkè, yìbān zěnme qù?","m":"Where you are, how do people usually get to work or class?"},"replies":[{"t":"开车的人最多。","p":"Kāi chē de rén zuì duō.","m":"Most people drive.","r":{"t":"那你那边的路口都是汽车，跟台北很不一样。","p":"Nà nǐ nàbiān de lùkǒu dōu shì qìchē, gēn Táiběi hěn bù yíyàng.","m":"So your junctions are all cars — really different from Taipei."}},{"t":"坐地铁、坐公交的多。","p":"Zuò dìtiě, zuò gōngjiāo de duō.","m":"Mostly subway and buses.","r":{"t":"那跟台北的捷运很像！","p":"Nà gēn Táiběi de jiéyùn hěn xiàng!","m":"That's like the MRT in Taipei!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天红灯的时候我想到你问的：真的好多机车！","p":"Jīntiān hóngdēng de shíhou wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ wèn de: zhēnde hǎo duō jīchē!","m":"At a red light today I thought of your question: so many scooters!"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常骑共享单车。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng qí gòngxiǎng dānchē.","m":"I often ride shared bikes too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常骑共享单车","en":"You often ride shared bikes too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常骑共享单车。这两天北京刮大风，我顶着风骑，感觉一直在原地蹬。最后下来推着走了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng qí gòngxiǎng dānchē. Zhè liǎng tiān Běijīng guā dà fēng, wǒ dǐng zhe fēng qí, gǎnjué yìzhí zài yuándì dēng. Zuìhòu xiàlái tuī zhe zǒu le, hāha.","m":"You said you often ride shared bikes too. It's been really windy in Beijing — riding into it felt like pedalling on the spot. In the end I got off and pushed, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你骑车是为了赶路，还是骑着玩？","p":"Nǐ qí chē shì wèile gǎnlù, háishi qí zhe wán?","m":"Do you ride to get somewhere, or just for fun?"},"replies":[{"t":"赶路，每天都骑。","p":"Gǎnlù, měi tiān dōu qí.","m":"To get places — every day.","r":{"t":"那你也是风里来雨里去的人了。","p":"Nà nǐ yě shì fēng lǐ lái yǔ lǐ qù de rén le.","m":"Then you're out in all weathers too."}},{"t":"骑着玩，周末出去转转。","p":"Qí zhe wán, zhōumò chūqù zhuànzhuan.","m":"For fun — a ride around at weekends.","r":{"t":"那好！不赶时间的时候，骑车最舒服。","p":"Nà hǎo! Bù gǎn shíjiān de shíhou, qí chē zuì shūfu.","m":"Nice! Riding's best when you're not in a hurry."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又骑共享单车了，想到你也在骑。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qí gòngxiǎng dānchē le, xiǎng dào nǐ yě zài qí.","m":"Rode a shared bike again today — thought of you riding too."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没骑过共享单车。","p":"Wǒ hái méi qíguo gòngxiǎng dānchē.","m":"I've never ridden a shared bike."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没骑过共享单车","en":"You've never ridden a shared bike"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没骑过共享单车。教你个小窍门：扫码之前，先捏捏车闸，看看车胎。这两天我连扫了两辆，一辆没气，一辆座子是歪的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi qíguo gòngxiǎng dānchē. Jiāo nǐ gè xiǎo qiàomén: sǎo mǎ zhīqián, xiān niēnie chēzhá, kànkan chētāi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ lián sǎo le liǎng liàng, yí liàng méi qì, yí liàng zuòzi shì wāi de.","m":"You said you've never ridden a shared bike. Here's a tip: before you scan, squeeze the brakes and check the tyres. These last couple of days I scanned two in a row — one had a flat, and the other's seat was crooked.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你平时出门一般怎么走？","p":"Nǐ píngshí chūmén yìbān zěnme zǒu?","m":"How do you usually get around?"},"replies":[{"t":"坐地铁或者公交。","p":"Zuò dìtiě huòzhě gōngjiāo.","m":"Subway or bus.","r":{"t":"那也方便，冬天还不冷。","p":"Nà yě fāngbiàn, dōngtiān hái bù lěng.","m":"That's handy too — and you don't freeze in winter."}},{"t":"一般走路。","p":"Yìbān zǒulù.","m":"Usually on foot.","r":{"t":"走路好，想停就停，想看就看。","p":"Zǒulù hǎo, xiǎng tíng jiù tíng, xiǎng kàn jiù kàn.","m":"Walking's great — stop and look whenever you like."}}],"next":{"t":"今天骑车的时候想到你：第一次骑，记得先看车闸。","p":"Jīntiān qí chē de shíhou xiǎng dào nǐ: dì yī cì qí, jìde xiān kàn chēzhá.","m":"Thought of you on my bike today: first ride, check the brakes first."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"骑车冷不冷？","p":"Qí chē lěng bu lěng?","m":"Is it cold on the bike?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她骑车冷不冷（冷，戴了手套脸还是冻红了）","en":"You asked if it was cold on the bike (yes — gloves on, face still red)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我骑车冷不冷。冷！这两天我又加了口罩和一顶毛线帽，全副武装。学生说我像要去滑雪的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qí chē lěng bu lěng. Lěng! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu jiā le kǒuzhào hé yì dǐng máoxiàn mào, quánfù wǔzhuāng. Xuésheng shuō wǒ xiàng yào qù huáxuě de.","m":"Last time you asked if it's cold on the bike. Cold! These days I've added a face mask and a woolly hat — fully kitted out. My students say I look like I'm off skiing.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边现在出门要穿多少？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān xiànzài chūmén yào chuān duōshao?","m":"How much do you need to wear to go out where you are now?"},"replies":[{"t":"一件厚外套就够了。","p":"Yí jiàn hòu wàitào jiù gòu le.","m":"A thick coat is enough.","r":{"t":"那还好，北京已经要穿羽绒服了。","p":"Nà hái hǎo, Běijīng yǐjīng yào chuān yǔróngfú le.","m":"Not bad — in Beijing it's already down-jacket weather."}},{"t":"一件T恤就行。","p":"Yí jiàn T xù jiù xíng.","m":"Just a T-shirt.","r":{"t":"真羡慕！我都快忘了穿T恤是什么感觉了。","p":"Zhēn xiànmù! Wǒ dōu kuài wàng le chuān T xù shì shénme gǎnjué le.","m":"So jealous! I've almost forgotten what wearing a T-shirt feels like."}}],"next":{"t":"今天也冷，我又戴上手套了。你也多注意身体。","p":"Jīntiān yě lěng, wǒ yòu dài shang shǒutào le. Nǐ yě duō zhùyì shēntǐ.","m":"Cold again today — gloves back on. Look after yourself too."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你停下来买煎饼了吗？","p":"Nǐ tíng xiàlái mǎi jiānbing le ma?","m":"Did you stop for a jianbing?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她有没有停下来买煎饼（当然买了）","en":"You asked if she stopped for a jianbing (of course she did)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我有没有停下来买煎饼。当然买了！这两天卖煎饼的大姐都认识我了，我车还没停稳，她就喊：「老样子？加蛋，不要香菜！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yǒu méiyǒu tíng xiàlái mǎi jiānbing. Dāngrán mǎi le! Zhè liǎng tiān mài jiānbing de dàjiě dōu rènshi wǒ le, wǒ chē hái méi tíng wěn, tā jiù hǎn: “Lǎoyàngzi? Jiā dàn, bú yào xiāngcài!”","m":"Last time you asked if I stopped for a jianbing. Of course! The jianbing lady knows me now — before I've even stopped the bike, she calls out: “The usual? Extra egg, no cilantro!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出门的路上，会顺便买点儿什么吗？","p":"Nǐ chūmén de lù shang, huì shùnbiàn mǎi diǎnr shénme ma?","m":"Do you pick anything up on your way out?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，买一杯咖啡。","p":"Huì, mǎi yì bēi kāfēi.","m":"Yes, a coffee.","r":{"t":"咖啡也好，冬天还能暖手。","p":"Kāfēi yě hǎo, dōngtiān hái néng nuǎn shǒu.","m":"Coffee's good — it warms your hands in winter too."}},{"t":"不买，我在家吃完再出门。","p":"Bù mǎi, wǒ zài jiā chī wán zài chūmén.","m":"No — I eat at home before I go.","r":{"t":"那你比我有计划多了。","p":"Nà nǐ bǐ wǒ yǒu jìhuà duō le.","m":"Then you're much more organised than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又停下来买煎饼了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu tíng xiàlái mǎi jiānbing le, hāha.","m":"Stopped for a jianbing again today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My train was packed too.","p":"","m":"我坐的车也挤得要命。"},"mem":{"zh":"你坐的车也很挤","en":"Your train was packed too"},"later":{"t":"You said your train was packed too. A tip I've picked up: walk right to the end of the platform — the end carriages are often a bit emptier. On Thursday I got a seat!","p":"","m":"你上次说你坐的车也很挤。我学到一个小窍门：走到站台最头上——车头车尾的车厢常常空一点。周四我居然有座位了！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How long is your trip to work or school?","p":"","m":"你去上班或者上学路上要多久？"},"replies":[{"t":"About half an hour.","p":"","m":"半个小时左右。","r":{"t":"Same as me. Just enough for one podcast.","p":"","m":"跟我一样。刚好听一集播客。"}},{"t":"Over an hour.","p":"","m":"一个多小时。","r":{"t":"Over an hour! You deserve a medal. And a seat.","p":"","m":"一个多小时！你该拿块奖牌。再加一个座位。"}}],"next":{"t":"Packed train again today. Hope yours was kinder.","p":"","m":"今天车又很挤。希望你的车好一点。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I walk to work, so no crowds for me.","p":"","m":"我走路上班，不用挤。"},"mem":{"zh":"你走路上班，不用挤","en":"You walk to work, so no crowds"},"later":{"t":"You said you walk to work. So on Thursday I got off two stops early and walked the rest. Twenty minutes, light rain, and honestly — the best part of my day.","p":"","m":"你上次说你走路上班。所以周四我提前两站下车，剩下的路走过去。二十分钟，下着小雨，说实话——那是我一天里最好的时候。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you see on your way?","p":"","m":"你路上能看到些什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Mostly shops and traffic.","p":"","m":"大多是商店和车。","r":{"t":"Still beats someone's elbow in your face.","p":"","m":"总比别人的胳膊肘顶在脸上强。"}},{"t":"A park, actually.","p":"","m":"其实，有个公园。","r":{"t":"A park! That's a proper commute.","p":"","m":"公园！这才叫上班的路。"}}],"next":{"t":"Enjoy the walk today — I'm jealous.","p":"","m":"今天好好享受走路吧——我羡慕了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long is your ride?","p":"","m":"你路上要多久？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他路上要多久（门到门二十五分钟）","en":"You asked how long his ride is (twenty-five minutes, door to door)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long my ride is. Twenty-five minutes. I've started using them for work — I listen back to interviews for a piece I'm writing about flat-sharing.","p":"","m":"你上次问我路上要多久。二十五分钟。我现在用这段时间干活——我在写一篇讲合租的稿子，路上就听采访录音。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do on your way to work or school?","p":"","m":"你上班或者上学的路上一般做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Listen to music.","p":"","m":"听音乐。","r":{"t":"Good choice. My recordings are less fun.","p":"","m":"选得好。我的录音可没那么好玩。"}},{"t":"Nothing — I just look out of the window.","p":"","m":"什么都不做，就看看窗外。","r":{"t":"Underrated. On the Tube it's just tunnel, though.","p":"","m":"被低估了的乐趣。不过地铁窗外只有隧道。"}}],"next":{"t":"Twenty-five minutes again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是二十五分钟。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it always that packed?","p":"","m":"一直都那么挤吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是不是每天都那么挤（每天早上八点到九点）","en":"You asked if it's always that packed (every morning, eight to nine)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's always that packed. Every morning, I said. So on Thursday I left at half seven. Half-empty carriage — I read a whole newspaper. Totally worth it.","p":"","m":"你上次问是不是每天都那么挤。我说每天早上都这样。所以周四我七点半就出门了。车厢空了一半——我看完了一整份报纸。太值了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Would you get up earlier to avoid the crowds?","p":"","m":"为了不挤，你愿意早点起吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I'd rather be early.","p":"","m":"愿意，我宁可早一点。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love half seven on the Central line.","p":"","m":"那你肯定会爱上七点半的中央线。"}},{"t":"No way, sleep comes first.","p":"","m":"不行，睡觉第一。","r":{"t":"Fair. Sleep is sacred.","p":"","m":"有道理。睡觉是神圣的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Yep, packed again today.","p":"","m":"没错，今天又挤满了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I ride a motorbike too.","p":"","m":"我也骑摩托。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也骑摩托车","en":"You ride a motorbike too"},"later":{"t":"You said you ride a motorbike too! Then you understand: on Thursday I was stuck one hour near Sudirman, not moving. Motorbikes everywhere, like a river.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也骑摩托车！那你就懂：周四我在 Sudirman 大道附近堵了一个小时，一动不动。到处都是摩托车，像一条河。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the worst traffic jam you've been in?","p":"","m":"你碰到过最严重的堵车是什么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Two hours, on a holiday.","p":"","m":"过节的时候，堵了两个小时。","r":{"t":"Two hours! Respect. Bring snacks next time.","p":"","m":"两个小时！佩服。下次带点零食。"}},{"t":"It's not bad where I live.","p":"","m":"我住的地方不怎么堵。","r":{"t":"Lucky you, bro. Here the traffic never sleeps.","p":"","m":"你真幸运，兄弟。我们这儿的路从来不睡觉。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ride safe today, bro!","p":"","m":"今天骑车注意安全，兄弟！"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't drive at all.","p":"","m":"我完全不开车。"},"mem":{"zh":"你完全不开车","en":"You don't drive at all"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't drive at all. Sometimes I think that's smart. This week a passenger told me she sold her car — she takes the MRT now, it's faster. Good for her. Not so good for me, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次说你完全不开车。有时候我觉得这样挺聪明。这周有个乘客跟我说，她把车卖了——现在坐地铁，更快。对她是好事。对我就不太好了，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you usually get around?","p":"","m":"你平时一般怎么出门？"},"replies":[{"t":"Public transport, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多坐公共交通。","r":{"t":"Good choice. The train has no traffic jam.","p":"","m":"选得好。火车不堵。"}},{"t":"I walk or cycle.","p":"","m":"走路或者骑自行车。","r":{"t":"Healthy! In Jakarta walking is hard — too hot.","p":"","m":"健康！在雅加达走路很难——太热了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Traffic was crazy again today. Good thing you don't drive, haha.","p":"","m":"今天又堵疯了。还好你不开车，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Where did you go?","p":"","m":"你去哪儿了？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他去了哪儿（接孩子，再去买点东西）","en":"You asked where he went (picking up his kids, then some shopping)"},"later":{"t":"You asked where I went. Picking up my kids. This week my eight-year-old asked me to wait one street away from the school. Too embarrassing, a dad on a motorbike in a giant raincoat. Eight years old, already embarrassed!","p":"","m":"你上次问我去了哪儿。接孩子。这周我八岁的那个让我在离学校一条街的地方等。说是太丢人了，老爸骑着摩托车，穿一件大雨衣。才八岁，就开始嫌我丢人了！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When you were little, how did you get to school?","p":"","m":"你小时候怎么去上学？"},"replies":[{"t":"My parents drove me.","p":"","m":"爸妈开车送我。","r":{"t":"Lucky! I walked thirty minutes, every day.","p":"","m":"真幸运！我每天走三十分钟。"}},{"t":"I walked with my friends.","p":"","m":"跟朋友一起走路去。","r":{"t":"Same as me! That was the best part.","p":"","m":"跟我一样！那是最开心的时候。"}}],"next":{"t":"Picked up the kids again today.","p":"","m":"今天又去接孩子了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it always that busy?","p":"","m":"一直都这么多车吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是不是一直那么堵（一直，连半夜都堵）","en":"You asked if it's always that busy (always — even at midnight)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's always that busy. Always. But Sunday morning is different: Car Free Day on Sudirman. No cars, no motorbikes — only people walking and running. I take my kids there.","p":"","m":"你上次问是不是一直那么堵。一直堵。不过周日早上不一样：Sudirman 大道有「无车日」。没有汽车，没有摩托车——只有走路和跑步的人。我带孩子去。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a car-free day where you live?","p":"","m":"你住的地方有无车日吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, sometimes at weekends.","p":"","m":"有，周末有时候有。","r":{"t":"Then you know the feeling. So quiet, so nice.","p":"","m":"那你懂这种感觉。那么安静，那么好。"}},{"t":"Not that I know of.","p":"","m":"好像没有。","r":{"t":"Try one someday. It's like a different city.","p":"","m":"哪天去试试。像换了一座城市。"}}],"next":{"t":"Busy roads again today.","p":"","m":"今天路上又很堵。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I get coffee on the way too.","p":"","m":"我路上也会买咖啡。"},"mem":{"zh":"你上班路上也买咖啡","en":"You get coffee on the way too"},"later":{"t":"You said you get coffee on the way too. This week it got really cold, and the coffee guy started giving me a cup sleeve without asking. Small thing, but it made my morning.","p":"","m":"你上次说你路上也买咖啡。这周天特别冷，卖咖啡的大哥不用我说，就给我套了个杯套。小事，可是让我一早上都很开心。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your morning drink?","p":"","m":"你早上喝什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Coffee, always.","p":"","m":"咖啡，每天都是。","r":{"t":"Same team! No coffee, no brain.","p":"","m":"同一队！没咖啡，脑子就不转。"}},{"t":"Tea, actually.","p":"","m":"其实是茶。","r":{"t":"Nice. Maybe I should try — my mom says I drink too much coffee.","p":"","m":"不错。也许我该试试——我妈说我咖啡喝太多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Got my cart coffee again today. Thought of you getting yours.","p":"","m":"今天又在咖啡车买了咖啡。想到你也在买。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I make coffee at home.","p":"","m":"我在家自己煮咖啡。"},"mem":{"zh":"你在家自己煮咖啡","en":"You make coffee at home"},"later":{"t":"You said you make coffee at home. I tried it this week! Bought a cheap kettle. Day one, too strong. Day two, too weak. Day three — honestly, I went back to the cart.","p":"","m":"你上次说你在家自己煮咖啡。这周我也试了！买了个便宜的烧水壶。第一天，太浓。第二天，太淡。第三天——说实话，我又回去找那辆咖啡车了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you make your coffee?","p":"","m":"你怎么煮咖啡？"},"replies":[{"t":"Just instant coffee.","p":"","m":"就是速溶的。","r":{"t":"Instant is fast. Maybe that's my level.","p":"","m":"速溶的快。也许那才是我的水平。"}},{"t":"With a little machine.","p":"","m":"用一台小机器。","r":{"t":"Fancy! Teach me someday.","p":"","m":"高级！哪天教教我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Mine was from the cart again today, as usual.","p":"","m":"我今天的咖啡还是咖啡车的，跟平常一样。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does he know your order?","p":"","m":"他知道你要什么吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过卖咖啡的知不知道他点什么（知道：小杯，加奶，不加糖）","en":"You asked if the coffee guy knows his order (yes — small, milk, no sugar)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if he knows my order. Yes — and this week he knew something else: I was tired. He said, 'Long night? Extra shot, on me.' New Yorkers notice everything.","p":"","m":"你上次问他知不知道我点什么。知道——而且这周他还看出来别的：我很累。他说：「熬夜了？多加一份浓缩，我请。」纽约人什么都看得见。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there someone who knows your order somewhere?","p":"","m":"有没有哪个地方的人知道你要点什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, at my local café.","p":"","m":"有，家附近的咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Nice! It makes a big city feel small.","p":"","m":"真好！大城市一下子就变小了。"}},{"t":"No, I always go to different places.","p":"","m":"没有，我老是去不一样的地方。","r":{"t":"That's fun too. Every day a new coffee.","p":"","m":"那也好玩。每天都是新的咖啡。"}}],"next":{"t":"He knew my order again today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天他又知道我要什么了，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much is it?","p":"","m":"多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过咖啡多少钱（两块钱左右，比咖啡馆便宜多了）","en":"You asked how much it is (about two dollars — way cheaper than a café)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much. Two dollars, I said. This week I did the maths: a month of cart coffee is about forty dollars. A café latte every day would be over a hundred. So the cart wins, honestly.","p":"","m":"你上次问多少钱。我说两块。这周我算了一下：一个月咖啡车的咖啡大概四十块。要是每天在咖啡馆喝拿铁，得一百多。所以说实话，咖啡车赢了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you keep track of what you spend on small things?","p":"","m":"你会记小东西上花了多少钱吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I check every month.","p":"","m":"会，每个月都看。","r":{"t":"Wow, organised. I only check when I'm scared.","p":"","m":"哇，真有条理。我只有害怕的时候才看。"}},{"t":"No, I'd rather not know.","p":"","m":"不记，我宁可不知道。","r":{"t":"Haha, honestly, same.","p":"","m":"哈哈，说实话，我也是。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still two dollars today.","p":"","m":"今天还是两块钱。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-18|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-18","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It gets dark early here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也黑得早。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边天也黑得早","en":"It gets dark early where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it gets dark early there too. Here it's around four now, and a few minutes earlier every week. My oldest put reflectors on everything — bike, helmet, backpack. Like a little Christmas tree.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也黑得早。我们这儿现在四点左右就黑了，每个星期还要再早几分钟。我家老大在所有东西上都贴了反光片——自行车、头盔、书包。像一棵小圣诞树。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do on dark evenings?","p":"","m":"天黑得早的晚上，你一般做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Stay home and cook.","p":"","m":"待在家里做饭。","r":{"t":"Ja, same. It's soup weather.","p":"","m":"对，我也是。正是喝汤的天气。"}},{"t":"Go out with friends anyway.","p":"","m":"照样跟朋友出去。","r":{"t":"Good! The dark is no reason to hide.","p":"","m":"好！天黑不是躲起来的理由。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dark early again today. Lights on, and ride safe.","p":"","m":"今天天又黑得很早。开着灯，注意安全。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's still light at four here.","p":"","m":"我这边四点天还亮着。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边四点天还亮着","en":"It's still light at four where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's still light at four there. I thought of you on Thursday, cycling home at half past three under a pink sky. The sunset is short here, but sometimes very pretty.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边四点天还亮着。周四三点半我骑车回家，天是粉红色的，我想起了你。我们这儿的日落很短，可有时候很美。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When does it get dark where you are now?","p":"","m":"你那边现在几点天黑？"},"replies":[{"t":"Around five.","p":"","m":"五点左右。","r":{"t":"Five sounds like summer to me right now.","p":"","m":"我现在听到五点，就觉得像夏天。"}},{"t":"After six.","p":"","m":"六点以后。","r":{"t":"After six! Enjoy it for me.","p":"","m":"六点以后！替我好好享受。"}}],"next":{"t":"Enjoy your daylight for me today.","p":"","m":"今天替我好好享受你那边的阳光。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How far do you cycle?","p":"","m":"你骑多远？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她骑多远（单程十五分钟左右）","en":"You asked how far she cycles (about fifteen minutes each way)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how far I cycle. Fifteen minutes. On Thursday it was twenty — a strong wind from the sea, straight in my face. Malmö is flat, so the wind is our only hill.","p":"","m":"你上次问我骑多远。十五分钟。周四骑了二十分钟——海上吹来大风，正对着脸。马尔默是平的，所以风就是我们唯一的上坡。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How long does it take you to get to work or school?","p":"","m":"你去上班或者上学要多久？"},"replies":[{"t":"About twenty minutes.","p":"","m":"二十分钟左右。","r":{"t":"Lagom — just right.","p":"","m":"lagom——刚刚好。"}},{"t":"Almost an hour.","p":"","m":"快一个小时。","r":{"t":"That's long! I hope you can read or listen on the way.","p":"","m":"挺久的！希望你路上能看看书、听点东西。"}}],"next":{"t":"Fifteen minutes on the bike again today.","p":"","m":"今天又骑了十五分钟车。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you cycle in winter too?","p":"","m":"冬天也骑车吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她冬天也骑车吗（骑，这儿人人都骑，下雪也骑）","en":"You asked if she cycles in winter too (yes — everyone does, even in snow)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I cycle in winter. Yes — and this week I put winter tyres on my bike, the ones with little metal studs. They sound funny on the road, like tiny tap shoes.","p":"","m":"你上次问我冬天也骑车吗。骑——这周我给自行车换了冬天的轮胎，上面有小小的金属钉。在路上声音很好笑，像一双双小踢踏舞鞋。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Would you cycle in the snow?","p":"","m":"下雪的时候你会骑车吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Maybe, if the roads were clear.","p":"","m":"路上没雪的话，也许会。","r":{"t":"That's fair. Clear roads make all the difference.","p":"","m":"有道理。路干不干净，差别很大。"}},{"t":"No way, too scary.","p":"","m":"不会，太吓人了。","r":{"t":"Honestly, the first time was scary for me too.","p":"","m":"说实话，我第一次也很害怕。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cycled in the cold again today.","p":"","m":"今天又在冷风里骑车了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-19|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-11-19","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也爱吃兰州拉面！","p":"Wǒ yě ài chī Lánzhōu lāmiàn!","m":"I love Lanzhou noodles too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱吃兰州拉面","en":"You love Lanzhou noodles too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也爱吃兰州拉面！这两天我又去了，学了一个新词：拉面可以选粗细，「毛细」最细，「大宽」最宽。我点了个「二细」，刚刚好。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě ài chī Lánzhōu lāmiàn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu qù le, xué le yí gè xīn cí: lāmiàn kěyǐ xuǎn cūxì, “máoxì” zuì xì, “dàkuān” zuì kuān. Wǒ diǎn le gè “èrxì”, gānggāng hǎo.","m":"You said you love Lanzhou noodles too! I went again these last couple of days and learned a new word: you can choose how thick the noodles are — 毛细 is the thinnest, 大宽 the widest. I ordered 二细, “second thin”. Just right.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃面喜欢细的还是宽的？","p":"Nǐ chī miàn xǐhuan xì de háishi kuān de?","m":"Do you like your noodles thin or wide?"},"replies":[{"t":"细的，跟汤一起吃最香。","p":"Xì de, gēn tāng yìqǐ chī zuì xiāng.","m":"Thin — they're best with the soup.","r":{"t":"对对对！下次你点「毛细」试试。","p":"Duì duì duì! Xià cì nǐ diǎn “máoxì” shìshi.","m":"Yes yes yes! Try 毛细 next time."}},{"t":"宽的，有嚼劲。","p":"Kuān de, yǒu jiáojìn.","m":"Wide — nice and chewy.","r":{"t":"大宽！下次我也试试。","p":"Dàkuān! Xià cì wǒ yě shìshi.","m":"大宽! I'll try it next time."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去吃拉面了，想到你也爱吃。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù chī lāmiàn le, xiǎng dào nǐ yě ài chī.","m":"Had Lanzhou noodles again today — thought of you."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我一般点牛肉面，不要辣。","p":"Wǒ yìbān diǎn niúròu miàn, bú yào là.","m":"I usually get beef noodles, not spicy."},"mem":{"zh":"你一般点牛肉面，不要辣","en":"You usually order beef noodles, not spicy"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你点牛肉面不要辣。这两天我学你，也点了一碗不加辣的，第一次喝出了汤本来的味道，好鲜！不过喝到一半，我还是加了一勺辣子。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ diǎn niúròumiàn bú yào là. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xué nǐ, yě diǎn le yì wǎn bù jiā là de, dì yī cì hē chū le tāng běnlái de wèidao, hǎo xiān! Búguò hē dào yíbàn, wǒ háishi jiā le yì sháo làzi.","m":"You said you order beef noodles without chilli. So I copied you and got one with no chilli — for the first time I could taste what the broth really tastes like. So savoury! Halfway through, though, I still added a spoonful of chilli.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"面汤你会喝完吗？","p":"Miàntāng nǐ huì hē wán ma?","m":"Do you finish the soup?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，汤是最好喝的。","p":"Huì, tāng shì zuì hǎohē de.","m":"Yes — the soup's the best part.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"不会，喝一半就饱了。","p":"Bú huì, hē yíbàn jiù bǎo le.","m":"No — I'm full halfway.","r":{"t":"那剩下的汤，我帮你喝，哈哈。","p":"Nà shèng xià de tāng, wǒ bāng nǐ hē, hāha.","m":"Then I'll finish the rest for you, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的牛肉面，我差点学你不要辣。","p":"Jīntiān de niúròumiàn, wǒ chà diǎn xué nǐ bú yào là.","m":"Nearly ordered my beef noodles without chilli today, like you."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我喜欢吃干拌的。","p":"Wǒ xǐhuan chī gānbàn de.","m":"I like the dry ones."},"mem":{"zh":"你喜欢吃干拌的","en":"You like the dry-mixed noodles"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你喜欢吃干拌的。这两天我真去点了！拌开以后有醋、有辣子、有葱花，好吃。吃完我才发现：一口汤都没喝，有点想汤。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ xǐhuan chī gānbàn de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhēn qù diǎn le! Bàn kāi yǐhòu yǒu cù, yǒu làzi, yǒu cōnghuā, hǎochī. Chī wán wǒ cái fāxiàn: yì kǒu tāng dōu méi hē, yǒudiǎn xiǎng tāng.","m":"You said you like the dry-mixed ones. So I actually ordered it! Mix it up and there's vinegar, chilli, spring onions — delicious. Only when I'd finished did I notice: not a single sip of soup. I kind of missed it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"吃干拌的，你会多加醋吗？","p":"Chī gānbàn de, nǐ huì duō jiā cù ma?","m":"With dry-mixed noodles, do you add extra vinegar?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，多加一点才好吃。","p":"Huì, duō jiā yìdiǎn cái hǎochī.","m":"Yes — it's better with extra.","r":{"t":"我这回也加多了，酸得眯眼睛，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ zhè huí yě jiā duō le, suān de mī yǎnjing, hāha.","m":"I added too much this time — so sour I was squinting, haha."}},{"t":"不加，我不太喜欢酸的。","p":"Bù jiā, wǒ bú tài xǐhuan suān de.","m":"No, I'm not big on sour.","r":{"t":"那你跟老板说一声「不要醋」就行。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn lǎobǎn shuō yì shēng “bú yào cù” jiù xíng.","m":"Then just tell the owner “不要醋” — no vinegar."}}],"next":{"t":"今天看见有人点干拌的，想到你了。","p":"Jīntiān kànjiàn yǒu rén diǎn gānbàn de, xiǎng dào nǐ le.","m":"Saw someone order the dry-mixed noodles today and thought of you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没吃过兰州拉面。","p":"Wǒ hái méi chīguo Lánzhōu lāmiàn.","m":"I've never had Lanzhou noodles."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没吃过兰州拉面","en":"You've never had Lanzhou noodles"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没吃过兰州拉面。这两天我站在窗口看师傅拉面：一团面，对折一拉，再对折再拉，七八下就变成一大把细面了。我看呆了，差点忘了点单。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi chīguo Lánzhōu lāmiàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhàn zài chuāngkǒu kàn shīfu lā miàn: yì tuán miàn, duì zhé yì lā, zài duì zhé zài lā, qī bā xià jiù biàn chéng yí dà bǎ xì miàn le. Wǒ kàn dāi le, chà diǎn wàng le diǎn dān.","m":"You said you've never had Lanzhou noodles. These last couple of days I stood at the window watching the chef: one lump of dough, fold and pull, fold and pull again — seven or eight times and it's a big bundle of thin noodles. I was so mesmerised I nearly forgot to order.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有那种可以看着师傅现场做的小吃？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu nà zhǒng kěyǐ kàn zhe shīfu xiànchǎng zuò de xiǎochī?","m":"Where you are, is there a snack you can watch being made right in front of you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，现做的饼。","p":"Yǒu, xiàn zuò de bǐng.","m":"Yes — flatbreads made on the spot.","r":{"t":"现做的最香！我也想去看看。","p":"Xiàn zuò de zuì xiāng! Wǒ yě xiǎng qù kànkan.","m":"Freshly made is the best! I'd love to watch."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not that I can think of.","r":{"t":"那下次你看到拉面馆，一定要坐在能看到师傅的地方。","p":"Nà xià cì nǐ kàn dào lāmiàn guǎn, yídìng yào zuò zài néng kàn dào shīfu de dìfang.","m":"Then next time you see a noodle place, sit where you can watch the chef."}}],"next":{"t":"你说还没吃过兰州拉面。今天我又路过那家店，想起你了。","p":"Nǐ shuō hái méi chīguo Lánzhōu lāmiàn. Jīntiān wǒ yòu lùguò nà jiā diàn, xiǎng qǐ nǐ le.","m":"You said you've never had Lanzhou noodles. I passed the place again today and thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"一个星期三次，不腻吗？","p":"Yí gè xīngqī sān cì, bú nì ma?","m":"Three times a week — don't you get sick of it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他一个星期吃三次腻不腻（不腻，想试干拌的）","en":"You asked if three times a week got boring (no — he wanted to try the dry-mixed ones)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一个星期三次腻不腻。不腻！这两天我真的点了干拌的，老板笑我：「三次牛肉面，终于换了。」我说：「对对对，换换口味。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yí gè xīngqī sān cì nì bu nì. Bú nì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhēnde diǎn le gānbàn de, lǎobǎn xiào wǒ: “Sān cì niúròumiàn, zhōngyú huàn le.” Wǒ shuō: “Duì duì duì, huànhuan kǒuwèi.”","m":"Last time you asked if three times a week got boring. Not at all! These days I really did order the dry-mixed ones, and the owner laughed: “Three beef noodle soups, and finally a change.” I said: “Yes yes yes, a change of taste.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一种怎么吃都吃不腻的东西？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yì zhǒng zěnme chī dōu chī bu nì de dōngxi?","m":"Is there something you never get tired of eating?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我天天吃米饭也不腻。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ tiāntiān chī mǐfàn yě bú nì.","m":"Yes — I could eat rice every day.","r":{"t":"米饭最厉害，什么菜都能配。","p":"Mǐfàn zuì lìhai, shénme cài dōu néng pèi.","m":"Rice wins — it goes with anything."}},{"t":"没有，我吃两次就腻了。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ chī liǎng cì jiù nì le.","m":"No — twice and I'm bored.","r":{"t":"那你一定很会找新馆子。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn huì zhǎo xīn guǎnzi.","m":"Then you must be great at finding new places."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我没吃拉面，休息一天，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ méi chī lāmiàn, xiūxi yì tiān, hāha.","m":"No noodles for me today — a day off, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你点菜的时候说中文吗？","p":"Nǐ diǎn cài de shíhou shuō Zhōngwén ma?","m":"Do you order in Chinese?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他点菜时说不说中文（说，老板还教他「多加辣子」）","en":"You asked if he orders in Chinese (yes — the owner taught him 多加辣子)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我点菜说不说中文。说！这两天老板听我说话，问我：「你的中文怎么有四川味儿？」我说我是在成都学的。他说：「怪不得这么能吃辣。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ diǎn cài shuō bu shuō Zhōngwén. Shuō! Zhè liǎng tiān lǎobǎn tīng wǒ shuōhuà, wèn wǒ: “Nǐ de Zhōngwén zěnme yǒu Sìchuān wèir?” Wǒ shuō wǒ shì zài Chéngdū xué de. Tā shuō: “Guàibude zhème néng chī là.”","m":"Last time you asked if I order in Chinese. I do! These days the owner listened to me and asked: “Why does your Chinese sound Sichuanese?” I said I learned it in Chengdu. He said: “No wonder you can handle so much chilli.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你点菜的时候，有没有说错过什么？","p":"Nǐ diǎn cài de shíhou, yǒu méiyǒu shuō cuòguo shénme?","m":"Have you ever said something wrong while ordering?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，把菜名说错了，服务员笑了。","p":"Yǒu, bǎ càimíng shuō cuò le, fúwùyuán xiào le.","m":"Yes — I got a dish name wrong and the waiter laughed.","r":{"t":"我也是！我在成都把「水饺」说成了「睡觉」。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ zài Chéngdū bǎ “shuǐjiǎo” shuō chéng le “shuìjiào”.","m":"Me too! In Chengdu I asked for “sleep” instead of “dumplings”."}},{"t":"还没有，我一般用手指。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, wǒ yìbān yòng shǒu zhǐ.","m":"Not yet — I usually just point.","r":{"t":"用手指也行，菜到了就好！","p":"Yòng shǒu zhǐ yě xíng, cài dào le jiù hǎo!","m":"Pointing works — as long as the food arrives!"}}],"next":{"t":"你问我点菜说不说中文——今天我又说了，老板笑了。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ diǎn cài shuō bu shuō Zhōngwén —— jīntiān wǒ yòu shuō le, lǎobǎn xiào le.","m":"You asked if I order in Chinese — I did again today, and the owner laughed."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说，前几天我第一次自己用中文开家长会。有个家长问我特殊高中的事，我答不上来。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō, qián jǐ tiān wǒ dì yī cì zìjǐ yòng Zhōngwén kāi jiāzhǎng huì. Yǒu gè jiāzhǎng wèn wǒ tèshū gāozhōng de shì, wǒ dá bu shànglái.","m":"A few days ago I ran a parents' evening in Chinese on my own for the first time. One parent asked me about the specialized high schools, and I couldn't answer."},{"t":"回家我查清楚了：要考一个专门的试，叫 SHSAT。我把「考试」「报名」「几月份」都写进小抄了。","p":"Huí jiā wǒ chá qīngchu le: yào kǎo yí gè zhuānmén de shì, jiào SHSAT. Wǒ bǎ “kǎoshì” “bàomíng” “jǐ yuèfèn” dōu xiě jìn xiǎochāo le.","m":"At home I looked it all up: there's a special exam called the SHSAT. I've put 考试 (exam), 报名 (sign up) and 几月份 (which month) on my crib sheet."},{"t":"周五去法拉盛吃面，我把整个家长会给老板娘讲了一遍，一句英语都没用。","p":"Zhōuwǔ qù Fǎlāshèng chī miàn, wǒ bǎ zhěng gè jiāzhǎng huì gěi lǎobǎnniáng jiǎng le yí biàn, yí jù Yīngyǔ dōu méi yòng.","m":"On Friday at the noodle shop in Flushing, I told the owner the whole parents'-evening story — without a single word of English."}],"replies":[{"t":"你好厉害，一句英语都没用！","p":"Nǐ hǎo lìhai, yí jù Yīngyǔ dōu méi yòng!","m":"Impressive — not one word of English!","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个感觉！不过我的四川口音，老板娘还是听得直笑。","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège gǎnjué! Búguò wǒ de Sìchuān kǒuyīn, lǎobǎnniáng háishi tīng de zhí xiào.","m":"Yes yes yes, that's the feeling! Though my Sichuan accent still makes her laugh."}},{"t":"下次家长会你肯定没问题。","p":"Xià cì jiāzhǎng huì nǐ kěndìng méi wèntí.","m":"You'll be fine at the next one.","r":{"t":"希望吧！家长总能问出小抄上没有的问题。","p":"Xīwàng ba! Jiāzhǎng zǒng néng wèn chū xiǎochāo shang méiyǒu de wèntí.","m":"I hope so! Parents always ask what's not on the crib sheet."}}],"from":"2026-11-22"}},"2026-11-19|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-19","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们学校的食堂也很好吃。","p":"Wǒmen xuéxiào de shítáng yě hěn hǎochī.","m":"Our school cafeteria is good too."},"mem":{"zh":"你们那儿的食堂也很好吃","en":"Your canteen is good too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你们的食堂也很好吃。我们食堂这两天加了一样新的：猪肉白菜馅儿的饺子，排队排到了门口。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐmen de shítáng yě hěn hǎochī. Wǒmen shítáng zhè liǎng tiān jiā le yí yàng xīn de: zhūròu báicài xiànr de jiǎozi, páiduì pái dào le ménkǒu.","m":"You said your canteen is good too. Ours added something new these last couple of days: pork and cabbage dumplings. The queue went all the way to the door.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃饭的地方，最受欢迎的是什么？","p":"Nǐ chī fàn de dìfang, zuì shòu huānyíng de shì shénme?","m":"Where you eat, what's the most popular dish?"},"replies":[{"t":"炸鸡，每次都要排队。","p":"Zhájī, měi cì dōu yào páiduì.","m":"Fried chicken — there's always a queue.","r":{"t":"炸鸡到哪儿都受欢迎！","p":"Zhájī dào nǎr dōu shòu huānyíng!","m":"Fried chicken's a hit everywhere!"}},{"t":"不太清楚，我一般吃同一样。","p":"Bú tài qīngchu, wǒ yìbān chī tóng yí yàng.","m":"Not sure — I always have the same thing.","r":{"t":"那你肯定有一个最爱的。","p":"Nà nǐ kěndìng yǒu yí gè zuì ài de.","m":"Then you must have a favourite."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我们食堂是土豆炖牛肉，想到你们的食堂了。","p":"Jīntiān wǒmen shítáng shì tǔdòu dùn niúròu, xiǎng dào nǐmen de shítáng le.","m":"Beef and potato stew in our canteen today — thought of yours."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我一般自己带饭。","p":"Wǒ yìbān zìjǐ dài fàn.","m":"I usually bring my own lunch."},"mem":{"zh":"你一般自己带饭","en":"You usually bring your own lunch"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你一般自己带饭。我被你说动了，这两天也带了：头天晚上炒个西红柿鸡蛋，第二天中午热一热。同事都问我是不是要减肥，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yìbān zìjǐ dài fàn. Wǒ bèi nǐ shuōdòng le, zhè liǎng tiān yě dài le: tóu tiān wǎnshang chǎo gè xīhóngshì jīdàn, dì èr tiān zhōngwǔ rè yi rè. Tóngshì dōu wèn wǒ shì bu shì yào jiǎnféi, hāha.","m":"You said you usually bring your own lunch. You talked me into it, so these days I've brought mine too: tomato and egg stir-fry made the night before, heated up at lunch. My colleagues all asked if I'm on a diet, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你带饭一般带什么？","p":"Nǐ dài fàn yìbān dài shénme?","m":"What do you usually bring?"},"replies":[{"t":"头天晚上剩的菜。","p":"Tóu tiān wǎnshang shèng de cài.","m":"Leftovers from the night before.","r":{"t":"对，一次做两顿，最省事。","p":"Duì, yí cì zuò liǎng dùn, zuì shěngshì.","m":"Right — cook once, eat twice. Easiest."}},{"t":"简单的，三明治或者沙拉。","p":"Jiǎndān de, sānmíngzhì huòzhě shālā.","m":"Something simple — a sandwich or salad.","r":{"t":"这个也好，不用热。","p":"Zhège yě hǎo, bú yòng rè.","m":"That's good too — no heating up."}}],"next":{"t":"今天看同事带饭，又想起你了。","p":"Jīntiān kàn tóngshì dài fàn, yòu xiǎng qǐ nǐ le.","m":"Saw a colleague with a packed lunch today and thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你今天抢到了吗？","p":"Nǐ jīntiān qiǎngdào le ma?","m":"Did you get some today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她抢到红烧肉没有（抢到了，最后一份）","en":"You asked if she got the braised pork (yes — the last portion)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我抢到红烧肉没有。抢到了，最后一份！这两天我学聪明了，一下课就往食堂跑，比学生跑得还快。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qiǎng dào hóngshāoròu méiyǒu. Qiǎng dào le, zuìhòu yí fèn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xué cōngming le, yí xiàkè jiù wǎng shítáng pǎo, bǐ xuésheng pǎo de hái kuài.","m":"Last time you asked if I got the braised pork. I did — the last portion! These days I've wised up: the moment class ends, I run to the canteen, faster than the students.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃饭快还是慢？","p":"Nǐ chī fàn kuài háishi màn?","m":"Do you eat fast or slowly?"},"replies":[{"t":"快，十分钟就吃完了。","p":"Kuài, shí fēnzhōng jiù chī wán le.","m":"Fast — done in ten minutes.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！当老师的都吃得快。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Dāng lǎoshī de dōu chī de kuài.","m":"Same as me! Teachers all eat fast."}},{"t":"慢，我喜欢慢慢吃。","p":"Màn, wǒ xǐhuan mànmàn chī.","m":"Slowly — I like to take my time.","r":{"t":"慢慢吃好，细嚼慢咽嘛。","p":"Mànmàn chī hǎo, xì jiáo màn yàn ma.","m":"Taking your time is good — chew slowly, as they say."}}],"next":{"t":"今天红烧肉我没抢到，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān hóngshāoròu wǒ méi qiǎng dào, hāha.","m":"Missed the braised pork today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你跟谁一起吃？","p":"Nǐ gēn shéi yìqǐ chī?","m":"Who did you eat with?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她跟谁一起吃午饭（跟两个同事，边吃边聊学生）","en":"You asked who she has lunch with (two colleagues — they talk about students)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我跟谁一起吃饭。还是那两个同事。这两天我们聊的都是一个德国学生——他这个周末要去相亲，我们三个老师在帮他出主意。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ gēn shéi yìqǐ chī fàn. Hái shì nà liǎng gè tóngshì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen liáo de dōu shì yí gè Déguó xuésheng —— tā zhège zhōumò yào qù xiāngqīn, wǒmen sān gè lǎoshī zài bāng tā chū zhǔyi.","m":"Last time you asked who I eat with. The same two colleagues. These days all we talk about is one German student — he's going on a set-up date this weekend, and the three of us teachers are giving him advice.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃饭的时候，喜欢边吃边聊吗？","p":"Nǐ chī fàn de shíhou, xǐhuan biān chī biān liáo ma?","m":"Do you like chatting while you eat?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢，边吃边聊最开心。","p":"Xǐhuan, biān chī biān liáo zuì kāixīn.","m":"Yes — eating and chatting is the best.","r":{"t":"对，饭桌上的话最多。","p":"Duì, fànzhuō shang de huà zuì duō.","m":"Right — people talk most at the table."}},{"t":"不太喜欢，我想安安静静地吃。","p":"Bú tài xǐhuan, wǒ xiǎng ān'ānjìngjìng de chī.","m":"Not really — I like to eat in peace.","r":{"t":"也好，吃饭就好好吃饭。","p":"Yě hǎo, chī fàn jiù hǎohǎo chī fàn.","m":"Fair enough — when you eat, just eat."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我们三个又一起吃饭了，聊的还是学生。","p":"Jīntiān wǒmen sān gè yòu yìqǐ chī fàn le, liáo de háishi xuésheng.","m":"The three of us had lunch again today — still talking about students."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-19|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-19","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢吃便当。","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan chī biàndāng.","m":"I like bento too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢吃便当","en":"You like bento boxes too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢吃便当！这两天我在学校旁边发现一家新的便当店，选三样菜才七十五块，比之前那家还便宜。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan chī biàndāng! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xuéxiào pángbiān fāxiàn yì jiā xīn de biàndāng diàn, xuǎn sān yàng cài cái qīshíwǔ kuài, bǐ zhīqián nà jiā hái piányi.","m":"You said you like bento boxes too! These days I found a new bento shop next to campus — three dishes of your choice for just 75 dollars, even cheaper than the other place.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你午饭一般吃什么？","p":"Nǐ wǔfàn yìbān chī shénme?","m":"What do you usually have for lunch?"},"replies":[{"t":"米饭配两三个菜。","p":"Mǐfàn pèi liǎng sān gè cài.","m":"Rice with two or three dishes.","r":{"t":"那跟便当一样嘛！","p":"Nà gēn biàndāng yíyàng ma!","m":"That's basically a bento!"}},{"t":"随便吃一点，三明治什么的。","p":"Suíbiàn chī yìdiǎn, sānmíngzhì shénme de.","m":"Just something quick, like a sandwich.","r":{"t":"三明治也不错，吃完比较不会想睡觉。","p":"Sānmíngzhì yě búcuò, chī wán bǐjiào bú huì xiǎng shuìjiào.","m":"Sandwiches are good — you don't get as sleepy after."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又吃了便当，想到你也喜欢。","p":"Jīntiān yòu chī le biàndāng, xiǎng dào nǐ yě xǐhuan.","m":"Had a bento again today — thought of you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我午饭一个人吃。","p":"Wǒ wǔfàn yí gè rén chī.","m":"I eat lunch on my own."},"mem":{"zh":"你午饭一个人吃","en":"You eat lunch on your own"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你午饭一个人吃。这两天同学都去考试了，我也一个人吃，真的边吃边看剧，结果看到忘记吃，饭都冷了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ wǔfàn yí gè rén chī. Zhè liǎng tiān tóngxué dōu qù kǎoshì le, wǒ yě yí gè rén chī, zhēnde biān chī biān kàn jù, jiéguǒ kàn dào wàngjì chī, fàn dōu lěng le.","m":"You said you eat lunch on your own. These days my classmates were all off at exams, so I ate alone too — and really did watch a show while eating. I got so into it I forgot to eat, and my food went cold.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个人吃饭的时候，会看什么吗？","p":"Nǐ yí gè rén chī fàn de shíhou, huì kàn shénme ma?","m":"When you eat alone, do you watch anything?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，看一集剧。","p":"Huì, kàn yì jí jù.","m":"Yes, an episode of something.","r":{"t":"一集剧刚好一顿饭！","p":"Yì jí jù gānghǎo yí dùn fàn!","m":"One episode, one meal — perfect!"}},{"t":"不看，就安安静静地吃。","p":"Bú kàn, jiù ān'ānjìngjìng de chī.","m":"No, I just eat quietly.","r":{"t":"这样也好，吃得比较慢，不会忘记吃。","p":"Zhèyàng yě hǎo, chī de bǐjiào màn, bú huì wàngjì chī.","m":"That's good too — you eat slower, and you don't forget to eat."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我也一个人吃午饭，想到你了。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yě yí gè rén chī wǔfàn, xiǎng dào nǐ le.","m":"Lunch on my own today too — thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"便当里有什么？","p":"Biàndāng li yǒu shénme?","m":"What was in the bento?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她便当里有什么（排骨、卤蛋、三样青菜）","en":"You asked what was in her bento (pork chop, braised egg, three veg)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我便当里有什么。这两天我换点了鸡腿便当，鸡腿超大，盖住了半个便当盒！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ biàndāng lǐ yǒu shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ huàn diǎn le jītuǐ biàndāng, jītuǐ chāo dà, gài zhù le bàn gè biàndāng hé!","m":"Last time you asked what was in my bento. These days I switched to the chicken leg one — the leg is huge, it covers half the box!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃过台湾的便当吗？","p":"Nǐ chīguo Táiwān de biàndāng ma?","m":"Have you ever had a Taiwanese bento?"},"replies":[{"t":"没吃过，看起来很好吃。","p":"Méi chīguo, kàn qǐlái hěn hǎochī.","m":"No, but it looks delicious.","r":{"t":"来台湾一定要吃一次，火车站就有卖台铁便当。","p":"Lái Táiwān yídìng yào chī yí cì, huǒchē zhàn jiù yǒu mài Tái-tiě biàndāng.","m":"You have to try one in Taiwan — train stations sell the railway bento."}},{"t":"吃过，我喜欢排骨的。","p":"Chīguo, wǒ xǐhuan páigǔ de.","m":"Yes — I like the pork chop one.","r":{"t":"排骨便当最经典了！","p":"Páigǔ biàndāng zuì jīngdiǎn le!","m":"Pork chop bento is the classic!"}}],"next":{"t":"你问我便当里有什么——今天还是排骨，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ biàndāng lǐ yǒu shénme —— jīntiān háishi páigǔ, hāha.","m":"You asked what's in my bento — pork chop again today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你下午睡了吗？","p":"Nǐ xiàwǔ shuì le ma?","m":"Did you nap in the afternoon?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她下午睡了没有（在教室趴着睡了十分钟）","en":"You asked if she napped in the afternoon (ten minutes, head down on her desk)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我下午有没有睡。这两天我学乖了：午饭只吃半碗饭，下午果然没那么想睡了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiàwǔ yǒu méiyǒu shuì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xué guāi le: wǔfàn zhǐ chī bàn wǎn fàn, xiàwǔ guǒrán méi nàme xiǎng shuì le.","m":"Last time you asked if I napped in the afternoon. These days I've learned my lesson: only half a bowl of rice at lunch — and sure enough, I'm not as sleepy in the afternoon.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃完午饭会想睡觉吗？","p":"Nǐ chī wán wǔfàn huì xiǎng shuìjiào ma?","m":"Do you get sleepy after lunch?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每天都想。","p":"Huì, měi tiān dōu xiǎng.","m":"Yes, every day.","r":{"t":"那我们一样！好想要一个午睡时间。","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng! Hǎo xiǎng yào yí gè wǔshuì shíjiān.","m":"Same! I wish we had nap time."}},{"t":"不会，喝杯咖啡就好。","p":"Bú huì, hē bēi kāfēi jiù hǎo.","m":"No — a coffee sorts me out.","r":{"t":"咖啡对我没用，我喝完照样想睡。","p":"Kāfēi duì wǒ méi yòng, wǒ hē wán zhàoyàng xiǎng shuì.","m":"Coffee doesn't work on me — I'm still sleepy after."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下午我又想睡了……","p":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ wǒ yòu xiǎng shuì le ……","m":"Sleepy again this afternoon…"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-19|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-19","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I take a full hour for lunch too.","p":"","m":"我午饭也有整整一个小时。"},"mem":{"zh":"你午饭也是整整一个小时","en":"You take a full hour for lunch too"},"later":{"t":"You said you take a full hour for lunch too. Good for us! On Friday a new colleague asked why I never eat at my desk. I said: the desk is for work, the table is for lunch.","p":"","m":"你上次说你午饭也是整整一个小时。我们都做得好！周五一个新同事问我，为什么从来不在办公桌上吃。我说：桌子是干活的，饭桌是吃饭的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you usually eat lunch?","p":"","m":"你一般在哪儿吃午饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"At a table with other people.","p":"","m":"跟别人一起在饭桌上吃。","r":{"t":"Ja, that's the best way.","p":"","m":"对，这样最好。"}},{"t":"At my desk, if I'm honest.","p":"","m":"说实话，在办公桌上。","r":{"t":"To be fair, sometimes I do too. Don't tell anyone.","p":"","m":"说句公道话，我有时候也会。别告诉别人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took my full lunch hour again today.","p":"","m":"今天我又好好吃了一个小时午饭。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I usually eat lunch at home.","p":"","m":"我一般在家吃午饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你一般在家吃午饭","en":"You usually eat lunch at home"},"later":{"t":"You said you eat lunch at home. I'm a bit jealous. This week the school canteen had fish soup, and thirty eight-year-olds said 'eww' at the same time.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一般在家吃午饭。我有点羡慕。这周学校食堂做了鱼汤，三十个八岁的孩子同时说「咦——」。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you usually make for lunch at home?","p":"","m":"你在家午饭一般做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Leftovers from dinner.","p":"","m":"前一天晚饭剩的。","r":{"t":"Smart. Cook once, eat twice.","p":"","m":"聪明。做一次，吃两顿。"}},{"t":"Something quick, like noodles.","p":"","m":"快的，比如面条。","r":{"t":"Quick is good. Lunch shouldn't be stress.","p":"","m":"快就好。午饭不该有压力。"}}],"next":{"t":"Canteen lunch for me today. Thought of yours at home.","p":"","m":"今天我吃的是食堂。想到你在家吃。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you have?","p":"","m":"你吃了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她午饭吃了什么（食堂的肉丸配土豆）","en":"You asked what she had (meatballs and potatoes from the canteen)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I had. Meatballs, I said. On Friday it was pea soup and pancakes — a very old Swedish tradition. It's usually a Thursday thing, but our canteen does it on Fridays. The kids only come for the pancakes.","p":"","m":"你上次问我吃了什么。我说肉丸。周五是豌豆汤配煎饼——瑞典一个很老的传统。一般是周四吃，可我们食堂放在周五。孩子们都是冲着煎饼来的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a food your country eats on a certain day?","p":"","m":"你们那儿有没有哪天专门吃的东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, we have special food for festivals.","p":"","m":"有，过节有专门的吃的。","r":{"t":"I love that. Food is a calendar.","p":"","m":"我喜欢这个。吃的就是日历。"}},{"t":"Not really, every day is different.","p":"","m":"没有，每天都不一样。","r":{"t":"That's nice too. More surprises.","p":"","m":"那也好。惊喜更多。"}}],"next":{"t":"Big lunch today. Hope you ate well too.","p":"","m":"今天午饭吃得很饱。希望你也吃得好。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you eat with colleagues?","p":"","m":"你跟同事一起吃吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是跟同事一起吃（是，大家坐一张长桌）","en":"You asked if she eats with colleagues (yes — they all sit at one long table)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I eat with colleagues. Yes, at one long table. This week we started something new: every Friday, someone brings a cake from home. A colleague from Syria brought basbousa. Gone in five minutes.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是跟同事一起吃。是的，一张长桌。这周我们开始了一件新事：每个星期五，有人从家里带一个蛋糕。一个叙利亚来的同事带了 basbousa（粗麦粉糖浆蛋糕）。五分钟就没了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"At lunch, do you eat with other people or alone?","p":"","m":"午饭你是跟人一起吃，还是一个人？"},"replies":[{"t":"Usually with friends or colleagues.","p":"","m":"一般跟朋友或者同事。","r":{"t":"Ja, food tastes better with people.","p":"","m":"对，跟人一起吃更香。"}},{"t":"Alone, and I like it.","p":"","m":"一个人，我喜欢这样。","r":{"t":"That's fair. Sometimes quiet is the best company.","p":"","m":"有道理。有时候安静就是最好的陪伴。"}}],"next":{"t":"Long table, lots of chat again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是长桌，聊了好多。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-19|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-19","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I eat the same lunch every day too.","p":"","m":"我也天天吃一样的午饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也是每天吃一样的午饭","en":"You eat the same lunch every day too"},"later":{"t":"You said you eat the same lunch every day too. Shock news: on Friday I picked a different sandwich. Egg and cress. I regret nothing. Well — a little.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是每天吃一样的午饭。爆炸新闻：周五我换了个三明治。鸡蛋水芹的。我一点也不后悔。好吧——有一点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your go-to lunch?","p":"","m":"你最常吃的午饭是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Rice with some vegetables.","p":"","m":"米饭配点蔬菜。","r":{"t":"That's a lot healthier than mine, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，比我的健康多了。"}},{"t":"Whatever's quick.","p":"","m":"什么快吃什么。","r":{"t":"'Whatever's quick' is basically my life motto.","p":"","m":"「什么快吃什么」基本就是我的人生格言。"}}],"next":{"t":"Same sandwich today. Obviously.","p":"","m":"今天还是那个三明治。当然了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I usually bring lunch from home.","p":"","m":"我一般从家里带饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你一般从家里带午饭","en":"You usually bring lunch from home"},"later":{"t":"You said you bring lunch from home. So I tried! On Thursday I brought leftover pasta. The office microwave queue was ten people long. Next time, a sandwich.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一般从家里带午饭。所以我也试了！周四我带了剩的意面。办公室微波炉前排了十个人。下次还是带三明治吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you usually bring?","p":"","m":"你一般带什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Leftovers from dinner.","p":"","m":"前一天晚饭剩的。","r":{"t":"Big brain. I'll start doing that.","p":"","m":"聪明。我也开始这么干。"}},{"t":"Just a sandwich and some fruit.","p":"","m":"就一个三明治加点水果。","r":{"t":"Simple. Classic. I approve.","p":"","m":"简单。经典。我赞成。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought a meal deal again today. Very disorganised.","p":"","m":"今天又买了午餐套餐。很没条理。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What sandwich did you get?","p":"","m":"你买了什么三明治？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买了什么三明治（鸡肉培根，永远是鸡肉培根）","en":"You asked what sandwich he got (chicken and bacon — always chicken and bacon)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what sandwich I got. Chicken and bacon, always. On Friday they'd sold out. I just stood there staring at the shelf for a full minute. My colleague had to choose for me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买了什么三明治。鸡肉培根，永远是。周五卖完了。我就站在那儿盯着货架看了整整一分钟。最后同事替我挑的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you quick at choosing food, or slow?","p":"","m":"你挑吃的快还是慢？"},"replies":[{"t":"Quick — I know what I like.","p":"","m":"快，我知道自己喜欢什么。","r":{"t":"Same. Until they sell out, apparently.","p":"","m":"我也是。看来得等到卖完那天。"}},{"t":"Slow, I can never decide.","p":"","m":"慢，我老是拿不定主意。","r":{"t":"Then avoid the meal deal shelf. Far too many choices.","p":"","m":"那你千万别去套餐货架。选择太多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Chicken and bacon again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是鸡肉培根。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much is a meal deal?","p":"","m":"午餐套餐多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过一份 meal deal 多少钱（四英镑左右）","en":"You asked how much a meal deal is (about four pounds)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much a meal deal is. About four pounds. I write about money, so I did the maths: five a week is twenty pounds. That's about a thousand a year. On sandwiches.","p":"","m":"你上次问一份 meal deal（午餐套餐）多少钱。四英镑左右。我是写钱的记者，所以算了一下：一周五份就是二十镑。一年差不多一千镑。全花在三明治上。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a cheap lunch where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边便宜的午饭是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A bowl of noodles.","p":"","m":"一碗面。","r":{"t":"Noodles — I'd swap my sandwich for that any day.","p":"","m":"面——我随时愿意拿三明治换。"}},{"t":"Something from a convenience store.","p":"","m":"便利店买点什么。","r":{"t":"Same idea as our meal deal, then.","p":"","m":"那跟我们的 meal deal 差不多。"}}],"next":{"t":"Another four pounds today.","p":"","m":"今天又花了四镑。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-20|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-20","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也超爱逛夜市！","p":"Wǒ yě chāo ài guàng yèshì!","m":"I love night markets too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也超爱逛夜市","en":"You love night markets too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也超爱逛夜市！周末我跟我妈又去了一次，这次吃了姜母鸭。冬天就要吃这个，我妈说这叫「从里面暖起来」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě chāo ài guàng yèshì! Zhōumò wǒ gēn wǒ mā yòu qù le yí cì, zhè cì chī le jiāngmǔyā. Dōngtiān jiù yào chī zhège, wǒ mā shuō zhè jiào “cóng lǐmiàn nuǎn qǐlái”.","m":"You said last time you love night markets too! This weekend I went again with my mum — this time we had ginger duck. That's the thing to eat in winter. My mum calls it “warming up from the inside”.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天最想吃什么热的？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān zuì xiǎng chī shénme rè de?","m":"Where you are, what hot food do you crave most in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"热汤面，一碗下去就暖了。","p":"Rè tāngmiàn, yì wǎn xiàqù jiù nuǎn le.","m":"Hot noodle soup — one bowl and you're warm.","r":{"t":"汤面我也爱！台北冷的时候，我最想吃牛肉面。","p":"Tāngmiàn wǒ yě ài! Táiběi lěng de shíhou, wǒ zuì xiǎng chī niúròumiàn.","m":"I love noodle soup too! When Taipei gets cold, beef noodle soup is what I want most."}},{"t":"火锅！跟朋友一起吃最好。","p":"Huǒguō! Gēn péngyou yìqǐ chī zuì hǎo.","m":"Hotpot! Best with friends.","r":{"t":"对！我们宿舍楼下的火锅店，一变冷就坐满了。","p":"Duì! Wǒmen sùshè lóuxià de huǒguō diàn, yí biàn lěng jiù zuò mǎn le.","m":"Right! The hotpot place downstairs from our dorm fills up the moment it turns cold."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过夜市，想到你也爱逛。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò yèshì, xiǎng dào nǐ yě ài guàng.","m":"Walked past a night market today — thought of you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没逛过夜市！","p":"Wǒ hái méi guàngguo yèshì!","m":"I've never been to a night market!"},"mem":{"zh":"你还没逛过夜市","en":"You've never been to a night market"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没逛过夜市——周末我又去了，这次去饶河街，排了二十分钟队买胡椒饼。刚从炉子里拿出来，烫得我两只手换来换去。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi guàngguo yèshì —— zhōumò wǒ yòu qù le, zhè cì qù Ráohé Jiē, pái le èrshí fēnzhōng duì mǎi hújiāobǐng. Gāng cóng lúzi lǐ ná chūlái, tàng de wǒ liǎng zhī shǒu huàn lái huàn qù.","m":"You said you'd never been to a night market — I went again this weekend, to Raohe Street this time, and queued twenty minutes for a pepper bun. Straight out of the oven, so hot I kept passing it from hand to hand.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有像夜市这样，晚上出来吃东西的地方？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu xiàng yèshì zhèyàng, wǎnshang chūlái chī dōngxi de dìfang?","m":"Where you are, is there anywhere like a night market, where people go out to eat at night?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，晚上路边有很多小吃摊。","p":"Yǒu, wǎnshang lùbiān yǒu hěn duō xiǎochī tān.","m":"Yes — there are lots of food stalls by the road at night.","r":{"t":"那你那边也有夜市嘛！下次拍给我看。","p":"Nà nǐ nàbiān yě yǒu yèshì ma! Xià cì pāi gěi wǒ kàn.","m":"So you've got night markets too! Send me a photo next time."}},{"t":"没有，晚上九点店就都关了。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǎnshang jiǔ diǎn diàn jiù dōu guān le.","m":"No — everything's shut by nine.","r":{"t":"九点？台北的夜市九点才刚热闹起来耶！","p":"Jiǔ diǎn? Táiběi de yèshì jiǔ diǎn cái gāng rènao qǐlái ye!","m":"Nine? In Taipei that's when the night markets are just getting busy!"}}],"next":{"t":"你说还没逛过夜市，我一直在想，第一次逛应该先吃什么。","p":"Nǐ shuō hái méi guàngguo yèshì, wǒ yìzhí zài xiǎng, dì yī cì guàng yīnggāi xiān chī shénme.","m":"You said you've never been to a night market — I keep thinking about what you should eat first."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最爱吃什么？","p":"Nǐ zuì ài chī shénme?","m":"What's your favourite thing to eat there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在夜市最爱吃什么（她说胡椒饼）","en":"You asked what she loves most at the night market (pepper buns)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最爱吃什么，我说胡椒饼。周末我又去买了，这次学乖了：先咬一小口，让热气跑出来，就不会烫嘴了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuì ài chī shénme, wǒ shuō hújiāobǐng. Zhōumò wǒ yòu qù mǎi le, zhè cì xué guāi le: xiān yǎo yì xiǎo kǒu, ràng rèqì pǎo chūlái, jiù bú huì tàng zuǐ le.","m":"Last time you asked what I love most, and I said pepper buns. I got one again this weekend — and learned my lesson: take a small bite first, let the steam out, and you won't burn your mouth.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"换我问你：你最爱吃的小吃是什么？","p":"Huàn wǒ wèn nǐ: nǐ zuì ài chī de xiǎochī shì shénme?","m":"My turn to ask: what's your favourite snack?"},"replies":[{"t":"我最爱吃饺子。","p":"Wǒ zuì ài chī jiǎozi.","m":"Dumplings are my favourite.","r":{"t":"饺子我也超爱！我一次可以吃二十个。","p":"Jiǎozi wǒ yě chāo ài! Wǒ yí cì kěyǐ chī èrshí gè.","m":"I love dumplings too! I can eat twenty in one go."}},{"t":"我那边的小吃，你可能没听过。","p":"Wǒ nàbiān de xiǎochī, nǐ kěnéng méi tīngguo.","m":"The snacks where I am — you've probably never heard of them.","r":{"t":"那更要跟我说！下次拍一张给我看。","p":"Nà gèng yào gēn wǒ shuō! Xià cì pāi yì zhāng gěi wǒ kàn.","m":"Then you have to tell me! Send me a photo next time."}}],"next":{"t":"你问我最爱吃什么，我今天又想吃胡椒饼了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ zuì ài chī shénme, wǒ jīntiān yòu xiǎng chī hújiāobǐng le, hāha.","m":"You asked my favourite — I'm craving a pepper bun again today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"撑到走不动了吗？哈哈","p":"Chēng dào zǒu bú dòng le ma? Hāha","m":"So full you couldn't walk? Haha"},"mem":{"zh":"你笑她吃到走不动（最后还买了珍奶）","en":"You teased her about being too full to walk (she still bought a bubble tea)"},"later":{"t":"你上次笑我吃到走不动，哈哈。周末去夜市，我跟自己说：只买三样。结果……最后又买了一杯珍奶。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì xiào wǒ chī dào zǒu bu dòng, hāha. Zhōumò qù yèshì, wǒ gēn zìjǐ shuō: zhǐ mǎi sān yàng. Jiéguǒ…… zuìhòu yòu mǎi le yì bēi zhēnnǎi.","m":"Last time you laughed at me for being too full to walk, haha. This weekend at the night market I told myself: only three things. And then… I bought another bubble tea at the end.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你呢？你是吃到撑的那种，还是吃七分饱就停的那种？","p":"Nǐ ne? Nǐ shì chī dào chēng de nà zhǒng, háishi chī qī fēn bǎo jiù tíng de nà zhǒng?","m":"What about you? Do you eat till you're stuffed, or stop when you're about 70% full?"},"replies":[{"t":"我也是，看到好吃的就停不下来。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, kàn dào hǎochī de jiù tíng bu xiàlái.","m":"Same as you — when I see good food I can't stop.","r":{"t":"那我们一起逛夜市就危险了，哈哈。","p":"Nà wǒmen yìqǐ guàng yèshì jiù wēixiǎn le, hāha.","m":"Then going to a night market together would be dangerous, haha."}},{"t":"我吃七分饱就好。","p":"Wǒ chī qī fēn bǎo jiù hǎo.","m":"I stop at about 70% full.","r":{"t":"好厉害喔，我真的做不到！","p":"Hǎo lìhai o, wǒ zhēnde zuò bu dào!","m":"Impressive — I really can't do that!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天我肚子终于不撑了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ dùzi zhōngyú bù chēng le, hāha.","m":"My stomach's finally not stuffed today, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"菜单翻好了！这两天在店里一边摇饮料，一边背英文名。烧仙草最后写的是 grass jelly，店长说外国客人一看就懂。","p":"Càidān fān hǎo le! Zhè liǎng tiān zài diàn lǐ yìbiān yáo yǐnliào, yìbiān bèi Yīngwén míng. Shāoxiāncǎo zuìhòu xiě de shì grass jelly, diànzhǎng shuō wàiguó kèrén yí kàn jiù dǒng.","m":"The menu’s done! These last few days I’ve been shaking drinks at the shop and memorising the English names at the same time. We went with “grass jelly” for 烧仙草 in the end — my manager says foreign customers get it at a glance."},{"t":"桂圆红枣茶我写了 longan & red date tea，旁边还加一句：像小一点的荔枝。","p":"Guìyuán hóngzǎo chá wǒ xiě le longan & red date tea, pángbiān hái jiā yí jù: xiàng xiǎo yìdiǎn de lìzhī.","m":"For the longan and red date tea I wrote “longan & red date tea”, with a note: like a smaller lychee."},{"t":"24 号就上线了，好紧张喔！","p":"Èrshísì hào jiù shàngxiàn le, hǎo jǐnzhāng o!","m":"It goes live on the 24th — I’m so nervous!"}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜！菜单翻好了。","p":"Gōngxǐ! Càidān fān hǎo le.","m":"Congrats on finishing the menu!","r":{"t":"谢谢！24 号上线，到时候跟你说卖得怎么样。","p":"Xièxie! Èrshísì hào shàngxiàn, dào shíhou gēn nǐ shuō mài de zěnmeyàng.","m":"Thanks! It goes live on the 24th — I'll tell you how it sells."}},{"t":"grass jelly 我看得懂！","p":"Grass jelly wǒ kàn de dǒng!","m":"I'd understand “grass jelly”!","r":{"t":"太好了！那我就放心了。","p":"Tài hǎo le! Nà wǒ jiù fàngxīn le.","m":"Great! That's a relief."}}],"from":"2026-11-22","to":"2026-11-23"}},"2026-11-20|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-11-20","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我下班也常去踢球！","p":"Wǒ xiàbān yě cháng qù tī qiú!","m":"I often play football after work too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你下班也常去踢球","en":"You often play football after work too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你下班也常踢球！周末我带女儿去公园，给她买了一个小足球。她两岁，踢一下就跑，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ xiàbān yě cháng tī qiú! Zhōumò wǒ dài nǚ'ér qù gōngyuán, gěi tā mǎi le yí gè xiǎo zúqiú. Tā liǎng suì, tī yí xià jiù pǎo, hāha.","m":"You said last time you often play football after work too! This weekend I took my daughter to the park and bought her a little football. She's two — she kicks it once and runs off, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你们一般在哪儿踢球？","p":"Nǐmen yìbān zài nǎr tī qiú?","m":"Where do you usually play?"},"replies":[{"t":"在公园，有草地。","p":"Zài gōngyuán, yǒu cǎodì.","m":"In a park, on grass.","r":{"t":"草地！太羡慕了。我们工地旁边全是土，下雨就踢不了。","p":"Cǎodì! Tài xiànmù le. Wǒmen gōngdì pángbiān quán shì tǔ, xià yǔ jiù tī bu liǎo.","m":"Grass! So jealous. By our site it's all dirt — when it rains we can't play."}},{"t":"在学校的球场。","p":"Zài xuéxiào de qiúchǎng.","m":"On a school pitch.","r":{"t":"那真好！我们没有球门，就放两块砖。","p":"Nà zhēn hǎo! Wǒmen méiyǒu qiúmén, jiù fàng liǎng kuài zhuān.","m":"Nice! We don't have goals — we just put down two bricks."}}],"next":{"t":"今天工地上又有人带了球，想到你也踢。","p":"Jīntiān gōngdì shang yòu yǒu rén dài le qiú, xiǎng dào nǐ yě tī.","m":"Someone brought a ball to site again today — thought of you."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我踢前锋。","p":"Wǒ tī qiánfēng.","m":"I play up front."},"mem":{"zh":"你踢前锋","en":"You play up front"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你踢前锋！周末我带女儿去公园，她当前锋，我守门。她踢进了一个球——我故意没接住，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ tī qiánfēng! Zhōumò wǒ dài nǚ'ér qù gōngyuán, tā dāng qiánfēng, wǒ shǒu mén. Tā tī jìn le yí gè qiú — wǒ gùyì méi jiē zhù, hāha.","m":"You said you play up front! This weekend I took my daughter to the park — she was the striker, I was in goal. She scored one… I let it in on purpose, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你踢前锋，一场能进几个球？","p":"Nǐ tī qiánfēng, yì chǎng néng jìn jǐ gè qiú?","m":"As a striker, how many goals do you get in a game?"},"replies":[{"t":"运气好的话，一个。","p":"Yùnqi hǎo de huà, yí gè.","m":"One, if I'm lucky.","r":{"t":"一个就很好了！下次你来，我一个也不让你进。","p":"Yí gè jiù hěn hǎo le! Xià cì nǐ lái, wǒ yí gè yě bú ràng nǐ jìn.","m":"One is great! Next time you come, I won't let a single one in."}},{"t":"最近一个都没进，哈哈。","p":"Zuìjìn yí gè dōu méi jìn, hāha.","m":"Haven't scored a single one lately, haha.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题！下次一定进。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí! Xià cì yídìng jìn.","m":"No problem, no problem! You'll score next time."}}],"next":{"t":"今天守门的时候想到你：前锋来了！哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān shǒu mén de shíhou xiǎng dào nǐ: qiánfēng lái le! Hāha.","m":"In goal today I thought of you: here comes the striker! Haha."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我哪儿都踢，缺谁补谁。","p":"Wǒ nǎr dōu tī, quē shéi bǔ shéi.","m":"I play anywhere — wherever we're short."},"mem":{"zh":"你哪个位置都踢，缺谁补谁","en":"You play anywhere — wherever the team is short"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你哪儿都踢，缺谁补谁。周末我带女儿去公园踢球，我一个人又守门又当前锋，跟你一样，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nǎr dōu tī, quē shéi bǔ shéi. Zhōumò wǒ dài nǚ'ér qù gōngyuán tī qiú, wǒ yí gè rén yòu shǒu mén yòu dāng qiánfēng, gēn nǐ yíyàng, hāha.","m":"You said you play anywhere — wherever the team's short. This weekend I took my daughter to play in the park, and I was keeper and striker at once. Just like you, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你们一般几个人一起踢？","p":"Nǐmen yìbān jǐ gè rén yìqǐ tī?","m":"How many of you usually play?"},"replies":[{"t":"差不多十个人，五对五。","p":"Chàbuduō shí gè rén, wǔ duì wǔ.","m":"About ten — five-a-side.","r":{"t":"跟我们差不多！人不多，每个人都能踢到球。","p":"Gēn wǒmen chàbuduō! Rén bù duō, měi gè rén dōu néng tī dào qiú.","m":"About the same as us! Not too many, so everyone gets the ball."}},{"t":"不一定，谁有空谁来。","p":"Bù yídìng, shéi yǒu kòng shéi lái.","m":"It varies — whoever's free comes.","r":{"t":"我们也是。人太多的时候，我就去守门。","p":"Wǒmen yě shì. Rén tài duō de shíhou, wǒ jiù qù shǒu mén.","m":"Us too. When there are too many people, I go in goal."}}],"next":{"t":"今天少一个人，我又想到你：缺谁补谁。","p":"Jīntiān shǎo yí gè rén, wǒ yòu xiǎng dào nǐ: quē shéi bǔ shéi.","m":"We were one short today — thought of you: wherever you're needed."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我回到家只想躺着。","p":"Wǒ huí dào jiā zhǐ xiǎng tǎng zhe.","m":"When I get home I just want to lie down."},"mem":{"zh":"你下了班回到家只想躺着","en":"You just want to lie down when you get home"},"later":{"t":"你上次说回到家只想躺着。周末我也试了：一整天在家躺着，什么都不做。结果……我女儿不同意，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō huí dào jiā zhǐ xiǎng tǎng zhe. Zhōumò wǒ yě shì le: yì zhěng tiān zài jiā tǎng zhe, shénme dōu bú zuò. Jiéguǒ…… wǒ nǚ'ér bù tóngyì, hāha.","m":"You said last time you just want to lie down when you get home. I tried it this weekend: a whole day lying around at home, doing nothing. But… my daughter didn't agree, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你躺着的时候一般做什么？看手机还是睡觉？","p":"Nǐ tǎng zhe de shíhou yìbān zuò shénme? Kàn shǒujī háishi shuìjiào?","m":"What do you usually do when you're lying down — scroll your phone or sleep?"},"replies":[{"t":"看手机，一看就是两个小时。","p":"Kàn shǒujī, yí kàn jiù shì liǎng gè xiǎoshí.","m":"My phone — and suddenly two hours are gone.","r":{"t":"我也会！不过我看的是我的备忘录，里面都是同事说的、我没听懂的话。","p":"Wǒ yě huì! Búguò wǒ kàn de shì wǒ de bèiwànglù, lǐmiàn dōu shì tóngshì shuō de, wǒ méi tīng dǒng de huà.","m":"Me too! Though what I read is my notes app — full of things my colleagues said that I didn't understand."}},{"t":"什么都不做，就躺着。","p":"Shénme dōu bú zuò, jiù tǎng zhe.","m":"Nothing — I just lie there.","r":{"t":"这个最舒服。我太太下了夜班，也是这样。","p":"Zhège zuì shūfu. Wǒ tàitai xià le yèbān, yě shì zhèyàng.","m":"That's the best. My wife does the same after a night shift."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下班我也躺了一会儿，学你的，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān xiàbān wǒ yě tǎng le yíhuìr, xué nǐ de, hāha.","m":"Lay down for a bit after work today — copied you, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"谁赢了？","p":"Shéi yíng le?","m":"Who won?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过谁赢了（他那队输了，三比二）","en":"You asked who won (his team lost 3–2)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问谁赢了，我说我们输了，三比二。我不服！周末我对着院子的墙练射门了一个小时。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn shéi yíng le, wǒ shuō wǒmen shū le, sān bǐ èr. Wǒ bù fú! Zhōumò wǒ duì zhe yuànzi de qiáng liàn shèmén le yí gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Last time you asked who won — I said we lost, 3–2. I'm not having it! This weekend I practised shooting against the yard wall for an hour.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你呢？你喜欢踢球，还是喜欢看球？","p":"Nǐ ne? Nǐ xǐhuan tī qiú, háishi xǐhuan kàn qiú?","m":"What about you — do you like playing football or watching it?"},"replies":[{"t":"我喜欢看，不太会踢。","p":"Wǒ xǐhuan kàn, bú tài huì tī.","m":"I like watching — I'm not much of a player.","r":{"t":"那下周我们比赛，我拍视频给你看！","p":"Nà xià zhōu wǒmen bǐsài, wǒ pāi shìpín gěi nǐ kàn!","m":"Then next week when we play, I'll film it for you!"}},{"t":"我偶尔踢，踢得不好。","p":"Wǒ ǒu'ěr tī, tī de bù hǎo.","m":"I play now and then — not very well.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！踢得不好没关系，开心就好。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Tī de bù hǎo méi guānxi, kāixīn jiù hǎo.","m":"Same as me! It doesn't matter if you're not good — it's about having fun."}}],"next":{"t":"你问谁赢了——我还在想那个三比二，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ wèn shéi yíng le —— wǒ hái zài xiǎng nà gè sān bǐ èr, hāha.","m":"You asked who won — I'm still thinking about that 3–2, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"踢球的时候你们说中文吗？","p":"Tī qiú de shíhou nǐmen shuō Zhōngwén ma?","m":"Do you speak Chinese while you play?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们踢球时说不说中文（他的「传球」「射门」「好球」都是在球场上学的）","en":"You asked whether they speak Chinese while playing (he learned “pass”, “shoot” and “nice one” on the pitch)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们踢球说不说中文。跟你说，那天我又学了一个新词：「乌龙球」。为什么学会了？因为……我踢了一个。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen tī qiú shuō bu shuō Zhōngwén. Gēn nǐ shuō, nà tiān wǒ yòu xué le yí gè xīn cí: “wūlóngqiú”. Wèishénme xuéhuì le? Yīnwèi…… wǒ tī le yí gè.","m":"Last time you asked if we speak Chinese when we play. Well — that day I learned another new word: 乌龙球, an own goal. How did I learn it? Because… I scored one.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你呢？有没有哪个中文词，不是在书上学的，是在生活里学会的？","p":"Nǐ ne? Yǒu méiyǒu nǎ gè Zhōngwén cí, bú shì zài shū shang xué de, shì zài shēnghuó lǐ xuéhuì de?","m":"What about you? Is there a Chinese word you didn't learn from a book, but picked up in real life?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，「加油」是看比赛学会的。","p":"Yǒu, “jiāyóu” shì kàn bǐsài xuéhuì de.","m":"Yes — I picked up 加油 watching a match.","r":{"t":"加油！这个我们在球场上也天天喊。","p":"Jiāyóu! Zhège wǒmen zài qiúchǎng shang yě tiāntiān hǎn.","m":"加油! We shout that on the pitch every day too."}},{"t":"有，「辣」是点菜的时候学会的。","p":"Yǒu, “là” shì diǎn cài de shíhou xuéhuì de.","m":"Yes — I learned 辣 ordering food.","r":{"t":"辣！这个字我最熟。我吃辣比四川同事还厉害。","p":"Là! Zhège zì wǒ zuì shú. Wǒ chī là bǐ Sìchuān tóngshì hái lìhai.","m":"辣! That's the one I know best. I can handle spice better than my Sichuan colleagues."}}],"next":{"t":"踢球的时候说中文，是我最开心的中文课。","p":"Tī qiú de shíhou shuō Zhōngwén, shì wǒ zuì kāixīn de Zhōngwén kè.","m":"Speaking Chinese on the pitch is my happiest Chinese lesson."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：我的数字练到「百万」了！这周开会，经理说「三百二十万」，我一下就翻出来了。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: wǒ de shùzì liàn dào “bǎiwàn” le! Zhè zhōu kāihuì, jīnglǐ shuō “sānbǎi èrshí wàn”, wǒ yí xià jiù fān chūlái le.","m":"Guess what: my numbers are up to millions now! At a meeting this week the manager said “三百二十万” and I translated it straight away — 3.2 million."},{"t":"经理什么也没说，就对我竖了一个大拇指，哈哈。","p":"Jīnglǐ shénme yě méi shuō, jiù duì wǒ shù le yí gè dàmǔzhǐ, hāha.","m":"The manager didn't say a word — just gave me a thumbs-up, haha."},{"t":"我女儿现在也会喊「一万」了，就是还数不到二。","p":"Wǒ nǚ'ér xiànzài yě huì hǎn “yí wàn” le, jiùshì hái shǔ bu dào èr.","m":"My daughter can shout 一万 now too — she just can't count to two yet."}],"replies":[{"t":"好厉害！一下就翻出来了。","p":"Hǎo lìhai! Yí xià jiù fān chūlái le.","m":"Impressive — straight away!","r":{"t":"谢谢！以前我要想十秒钟。","p":"Xièxie! Yǐqián wǒ yào xiǎng shí miǎo zhōng.","m":"Thanks! I used to need ten seconds."}},{"t":"你女儿也在学中文啊！","p":"Nǐ nǚ'ér yě zài xué Zhōngwén a!","m":"Your daughter's learning Chinese too!","r":{"t":"对，她说「万」比我说得还准。","p":"Duì, tā shuō “wàn” bǐ wǒ shuō de hái zhǔn.","m":"Yes — she says 万 better than I do."}}],"from":"2026-11-22"}},"2026-11-20|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-20","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same here — I always cook way too much!","p":"","m":"我也是，每次都做太多！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也总是做太多","en":"You always cook way too much too"},"later":{"t":"You said you always cook too much too. Update: on Saturday we were still eating that curry. My flatmate put it on toast. Honestly? Not bad.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也总是做太多。最新情况：周六我们还在吃那锅咖喱。我室友把它抹在吐司上吃。说实话？还不错。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do with leftovers?","p":"","m":"剩菜你一般怎么处理？"},"replies":[{"t":"Take them for lunch the next day.","p":"","m":"第二天带去当午饭。","r":{"t":"Same plan here. Lunch sorted.","p":"","m":"我们也是这么打算的。午饭解决了。"}},{"t":"Freeze them for later.","p":"","m":"冻起来以后吃。","r":{"t":"Smart. Our freezer is full of mystery boxes.","p":"","m":"聪明。我们的冰箱冷冻层全是看不出是啥的盒子。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still eating that curry today.","p":"","m":"今天还在吃那锅咖喱。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I live alone, so it's usually just a frozen pizza.","p":"","m":"我一个人住，一般热个冷冻披萨就算了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你一个人住，一般就吃个冷冻披萨","en":"You live alone, so it's usually a frozen pizza"},"later":{"t":"You said it's usually just a frozen pizza for you. Funny — after three days of curry, I had a frozen pizza on Saturday. On the sofa, in silence. It was lovely.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一般就吃个冷冻披萨。好笑的是——吃了三天咖喱以后，周六我也吃了个冷冻披萨。坐在沙发上，安安静静的。太舒服了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like cooking, or is it just a job?","p":"","m":"你喜欢做饭，还是只当一件不得不做的事？"},"replies":[{"t":"I quite like it, when I have time.","p":"","m":"有时间的话，挺喜欢的。","r":{"t":"Same. Sundays are my cooking day.","p":"","m":"我也是。周日是我做饭的日子。"}},{"t":"It's just a job.","p":"","m":"就是件不得不做的事。","r":{"t":"Honest answer. Pizza respects that.","p":"","m":"老实话。披萨尊重你。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking about your frozen pizza. Sounds peaceful.","p":"","m":"我在想你那个冷冻披萨。听起来很清静。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What kind of curry?","p":"","m":"什么咖喱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是什么咖喱（鹰嘴豆的，室友妈妈的方子）","en":"You asked what kind of curry (chickpea — his flatmate's mum's recipe)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what kind of curry. Chickpea — my flatmate's mum's recipe. I asked her for the secret. One word: patience. You fry the onions for twenty minutes, not five.","p":"","m":"你上次问是什么咖喱。鹰嘴豆的——我室友妈妈的方子。我问她秘诀是什么。就一个词：耐心。洋葱要炒二十分钟，不是五分钟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a family recipe?","p":"","m":"你家有没有传下来的菜谱？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my mum's soup.","p":"","m":"有，我妈做的汤。","r":{"t":"Mums and soup. Unbeatable.","p":"","m":"妈妈和汤。无敌。"}},{"t":"Not really, I just cook simple things.","p":"","m":"没有，我就做些简单的。","r":{"t":"Simple is good. Most good food is.","p":"","m":"简单就好。好吃的东西大多都简单。"}}],"next":{"t":"Leftover chickpea curry for lunch today.","p":"","m":"今天午饭是剩的鹰嘴豆咖喱。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Are you eating leftovers all week now?","p":"","m":"那你们这周都要吃剩的了？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他是不是整个星期都吃剩的（差不多，午饭管到周四）","en":"You asked if he's eating leftovers all week (pretty much — lunch sorted till Thursday)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I'm eating leftovers all week. Yes. There are still two boxes in the fridge. I'm starting to dream in chickpeas.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是整个星期都吃剩的。是的。冰箱里还有两盒。我做梦都开始梦到鹰嘴豆了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How many days in a row could you eat the same food?","p":"","m":"同一样东西，你能连着吃几天？"},"replies":[{"t":"Two days, then I'm done.","p":"","m":"两天，然后就受不了了。","r":{"t":"Wise. I'm on day three and fading.","p":"","m":"明智。我已经第三天了，快撑不住了。"}},{"t":"A whole week, no problem.","p":"","m":"一整个星期，没问题。","r":{"t":"You'd be the hero of our flat.","p":"","m":"你会是我们这屋的英雄。"}}],"next":{"t":"Day two of curry. Going strong.","p":"","m":"咖喱第二天。还撑得住。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-20|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-20","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same — I'm more of a listener too.","p":"","m":"我也是，我也更爱听别人说。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也是比较爱听的那种人","en":"You're more of a listener too"},"later":{"t":"You said you're more of a listener too. So this week I tried one small thing: at lunch I asked one question — just 'How was your weekend?' Then I listened for ten minutes. Honestly, it worked.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是比较爱听的那种人。所以这周我试了一件小事：午饭的时候，我只问了一个问题——「周末过得怎么样？」然后听了十分钟。说实话，挺管用的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"In a group, do you talk more or listen more?","p":"","m":"在一群人里，你是说得多还是听得多？"},"replies":[{"t":"Listen more.","p":"","m":"听得多。","r":{"t":"Listener team! We notice everything.","p":"","m":"爱听的一队！我们什么都看在眼里。"}},{"t":"Depends who's there.","p":"","m":"看是谁在。","r":{"t":"Same. With close friends I talk a lot.","p":"","m":"我也是。跟好朋友在一起我话很多。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hey, fellow listener.","p":"","m":"嘿，同样爱听的朋友。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Talking in a big group like that still makes me nervous.","p":"","m":"那种一大群人聊天，我还是会紧张。"},"mem":{"zh":"在一大群人里说话你还是会紧张","en":"Talking in a big group still makes you nervous"},"later":{"t":"You said big groups still make you nervous. Me too. This week I tried a trick: before I go, I prepare one story. Just one. On Friday I told my coffee cart story, and people laughed!","p":"","m":"你上次说在一大群人里说话你还是会紧张。我也是。这周我试了个办法：去之前，先准备一个故事。就一个。周五我讲了我和咖啡车的故事，大家都笑了！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What helps you in a big group?","p":"","m":"在一大群人里，什么能帮到你？"},"replies":[{"t":"Talking to one person first.","p":"","m":"先跟一个人说。","r":{"t":"Good trick. One friend first, then the group.","p":"","m":"好办法。先一个朋友，再一群人。"}},{"t":"Nothing yet — I'm still working on it.","p":"","m":"还没找到，还在努力。","r":{"t":"Same. We're working on it together, then.","p":"","m":"我也是。那我们一起努力。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hope today was easy on you, big group or not.","p":"","m":"希望你今天过得轻松，不管人多人少。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What was so funny?","p":"","m":"什么事那么好笑？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过什么事那么好笑（老板跟伦敦来的新同事解释棒球，一团乱）","en":"You asked what was so funny (his boss explaining baseball to the new guy from London — total chaos)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what was funny — the baseball story. Update: then the London guy explained cricket to my boss. Ten minutes. Nobody understood anything. Best lunch ever.","p":"","m":"你上次问什么事那么好笑——就是棒球那件事。后续：然后伦敦来的同事给我老板解释板球。十分钟。谁都没听懂。最好笑的一顿午饭。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a sport you've never understood?","p":"","m":"有没有哪种运动你一直看不懂？"},"replies":[{"t":"Baseball, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，棒球。","r":{"t":"Ha! Good, it's not just me.","p":"","m":"哈！太好了，不只是我。"}},{"t":"American football.","p":"","m":"美式橄榄球。","r":{"t":"Same. It stops every ten seconds!","p":"","m":"我也是。每十秒就停一次！"}}],"next":{"t":"Still laughing about the baseball thing.","p":"","m":"我还在为棒球那件事笑。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Was it all in English?","p":"","m":"全程都说英语吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是不是全程说英语（是，而且他们说得好快，他大概听懂一半）","en":"You asked if it was all in English (yes — they talk so fast, he caught about half)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it was all in English. Yes. This week I found a trick: when I miss a word, I say 'Wait, what?' and smile. Everyone just says it again, slower. Nobody minds.","p":"","m":"你上次问是不是全程说英语。是的。这周我发现了个办法：没听清的时候，我就说「等等，什么？」然后笑一下。大家就会再说一遍，说慢一点。没人介意。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When you don't understand something, what do you do?","p":"","m":"听不懂的时候，你会怎么办？"},"replies":[{"t":"Ask them to say it again.","p":"","m":"请他们再说一遍。","r":{"t":"Same. It's okay to ask, honestly.","p":"","m":"我也是。说实话，问一下没关系。"}},{"t":"Just nod and smile.","p":"","m":"点点头，笑一笑。","r":{"t":"Ha, I did that for my whole first month.","p":"","m":"哈，我刚来的第一个月全是这样。"}}],"next":{"t":"I think I caught a bit more English today.","p":"","m":"我觉得今天多听懂了一点英语。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"A few weeks ago I pitched a logo to a client — in English, my first time.","p":"","m":"几个星期前，我给客户提案了一个标志——用英语，第一次。"},{"t":"This week they emailed: our orange logo is going on all their delivery trucks. Real trucks, on real New York streets.","p":"","m":"这周他们发邮件来了：我们那个橙色标志要印在他们所有的送货卡车上。真的卡车，开在纽约真的街上。"},{"t":"Jess said, 'You crushed it.' This time I didn't have to look it up.","p":"","m":"Jess 说：「你干得太漂亮了。」这次我不用查就听懂了。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Congratulations!","p":"","m":"恭喜！","r":{"t":"Thanks! I'll tell you when I spot the first one.","p":"","m":"谢谢！看到第一辆我就告诉你。"}},{"t":"Orange trucks — I'll look out for them.","p":"","m":"橙色的卡车——我会留意的。","r":{"t":"Haha, if you're ever in New York and see one, it's mine!","p":"","m":"哈哈，要是你哪天来纽约看到一辆，那就是我的！"}}],"from":"2026-11-22"}},"2026-11-20|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-11-20","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I lose track of time when I'm busy too.","p":"","m":"我一忙起来也会忘了时间。"},"mem":{"zh":"你忙起来也会忘了时间","en":"You lose track of time when you're busy too"},"later":{"t":"You said you lose track of time too. Chale, it happened again. My mum called me for dinner three times. By the time I came, the jollof was cold.","p":"","m":"你上次说你忙起来也会忘了时间。兄弟，又来了。我妈叫了我三次吃晚饭。等我过去，jollof 饭（加纳的番茄焖饭）都凉了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What makes you lose track of time?","p":"","m":"什么会让你忘了时间？"},"replies":[{"t":"A good book.","p":"","m":"一本好书。","r":{"t":"Books do that! One more page, one more page…","p":"","m":"书就是这样！再看一页，再看一页……"}},{"t":"My phone, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，手机。","r":{"t":"Ha! The phone wins every time.","p":"","m":"哈！每次都是手机赢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Lost track of time again today.","p":"","m":"今天又忘了时间。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I stop at six, no matter what.","p":"","m":"不管怎样，我六点就停。"},"mem":{"zh":"你到六点就停，不管做到哪儿","en":"You stop at six, no matter what"},"later":{"t":"You said you stop at six, no matter what. So I tried. Saturday: I stopped at six. Then I opened my laptop again at seven. Baby steps, chale.","p":"","m":"你上次说你到六点就停，不管做到哪儿。所以我也试了。周六：六点停了。然后七点又打开了电脑。一步一步来，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you make yourself stop?","p":"","m":"你怎么让自己停下来？"},"replies":[{"t":"I set an alarm.","p":"","m":"定个闹钟。","r":{"t":"An alarm, OK. Mine just makes me finish the song first.","p":"","m":"闹钟，好。我的闹钟只会让我先把这首歌做完。"}},{"t":"I leave the room.","p":"","m":"离开那个房间。","r":{"t":"Smart. If I can see the laptop, I'm finished.","p":"","m":"聪明。只要我看得见电脑，就完了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thought of you at six today. I kept working, haha.","p":"","m":"今天六点想到你了。我还是接着干了，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What kind of beat?","p":"","m":"什么样的节奏？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是什么样的节奏（Afrobeats，加一点 highlife 吉他）","en":"You asked what kind of beat (Afrobeats, with a bit of highlife guitar)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what kind of beat. Afrobeats with highlife guitar. Good news: it's finished, and a dancer used it in a video. Since then, three more dancers have used it. I'm still in shock.","p":"","m":"你上次问是什么样的节奏。Afrobeats 加 highlife 吉他。好消息：做完了，一个舞者拿它拍了视频。后来又有三个舞者用了。我到现在还不敢相信。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you dance, or are you more of a listener?","p":"","m":"你会跳舞，还是更爱听？"},"replies":[{"t":"I dance when nobody's watching.","p":"","m":"没人看的时候会跳。","r":{"t":"That's the best kind of dancing.","p":"","m":"那是最好的跳法。"}},{"t":"Listener, definitely.","p":"","m":"肯定是听。","r":{"t":"Listeners matter too. Someone has to nod along.","p":"","m":"听的人也重要。总得有人跟着点头。"}}],"next":{"t":"Back on that beat today.","p":"","m":"今天又在弄那段节奏。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What time did you finish?","p":"","m":"你几点做完的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他几点做完的（凌晨两点左右）","en":"You asked what time he finished (around two in the morning)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what time I finished. Two in the morning. My mum saw me at breakfast and said: 'You look like the harmattan.' Dry and dusty. Thanks, Mum.","p":"","m":"你上次问我几点做完的。凌晨两点。我妈吃早饭的时候看见我，说：「你看起来像哈马丹风。」又干又灰。谢谢你，妈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you a night owl or an early bird?","p":"","m":"你是夜猫子，还是早起的鸟？"},"replies":[{"t":"Night owl.","p":"","m":"夜猫子。","r":{"t":"Night owls unite, chale.","p":"","m":"夜猫子们团结起来，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Early bird.","p":"","m":"早起的鸟。","r":{"t":"Respect. Mornings are hard for me.","p":"","m":"佩服。早上对我来说太难了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Slept till ten today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天睡到了十点，哈哈。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Chale, guess what. A radio station here played my song on Friday night.","p":"","m":"兄弟，你猜怎么着。周五晚上，这儿的一个电台放了我的歌。"},{"t":"My mum heard it in the kitchen. She didn't know it was mine until the DJ said my name.","p":"","m":"我妈在厨房听到了。DJ 说出我的名字，她才知道是我的。"},{"t":"Then she called my auntie in Kumasi to tell her. Twice.","p":"","m":"然后她给库马西的姨妈打电话报喜。打了两次。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Congratulations! Your mum must be proud.","p":"","m":"恭喜！你妈妈一定很骄傲。","r":{"t":"She is. She still says I should sleep more, though.","p":"","m":"是的。不过她还是说我该多睡点。"}},{"t":"What's the song called?","p":"","m":"这首歌叫什么？","r":{"t":"'Harmattan' — after the dry wind that's blowing in right now.","p":"","m":"《Harmattan》——就是现在正刮过来的那股干风。"}}],"from":"2026-11-22"}},"2026-11-21|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-11-21","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也去过金字塔！","p":"Wǒ yě qùguo jīnzìtǎ!","m":"I've been to the pyramids too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也去过金字塔","en":"You've been to the pyramids too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也去过金字塔！周末我带表妹去了，她果然拍了一百多张，一半是骆驼。准确地说，五十三张是骆驼。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě qùguo jīnzìtǎ! Zhōumò wǒ dài biǎomèi qù le, tā guǒrán pāi le yìbǎi duō zhāng, yíbàn shì luòtuo. Zhǔnquè de shuō, wǔshísān zhāng shì luòtuo.","m":"You said you've been to the pyramids too! I took my cousin at the weekend, and sure enough she took over a hundred photos — half of them camels. To be precise, fifty-three were camels.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你旅游的时候拍照多吗？","p":"Nǐ lǚyóu de shíhou pāizhào duō ma?","m":"Do you take lots of photos when you travel?"},"replies":[{"t":"很多，一个地方能拍几十张。","p":"Hěn duō, yí gè dìfang néng pāi jǐshí zhāng.","m":"Loads — dozens in one place.","r":{"t":"那你跟我表妹一定合得来。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ biǎomèi yídìng hé de lái.","m":"Then you and my cousin would get on."}},{"t":"不多，我更喜欢用眼睛看。","p":"Bù duō, wǒ gèng xǐhuan yòng yǎnjing kàn.","m":"Not many — I'd rather just look.","r":{"t":"我也觉得，用眼睛看，记得更久。","p":"Wǒ yě juéde, yòng yǎnjing kàn, jìde gèng jiǔ.","m":"I agree — you remember it longer that way."}}],"next":{"t":"你说你也去过金字塔，我一直在想你那次是什么样子。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ yě qùguo jīnzìtǎ, wǒ yìzhí zài xiǎng nǐ nà cì shì shénme yàngzi.","m":"You said you've been to the pyramids too — I keep wondering what your visit was like."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没去过埃及。","p":"Wǒ hái méi qùguo Āijí.","m":"I've never been to Egypt."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没去过埃及","en":"You've never been to Egypt"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没去过埃及。给你一个小建议：去金字塔，最好早上一开门就到，人少，也不晒。周末我们一早就到了，几乎没有人。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi qùguo Āijí. Gěi nǐ yí gè xiǎo jiànyì: qù jīnzìtǎ, zuì hǎo zǎoshang yì kāi mén jiù dào, rén shǎo, yě bú shài. Zhōumò wǒmen yì zǎo jiù dào le, jīhū méiyǒu rén.","m":"You said you've never been to Egypt. A small tip: for the pyramids, get there right when it opens — fewer people, and the sun's not so strong. At the weekend we got there first thing, and it was almost empty.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最想去哪个地方旅行？","p":"Nǐ zuì xiǎng qù nǎ gè dìfang lǚxíng?","m":"Where would you most like to travel?"},"replies":[{"t":"我一直想去日本。","p":"Wǒ yìzhí xiǎng qù Rìběn.","m":"I've always wanted to go to Japan.","r":{"t":"日本好！我带过的游客里，好几个都说那里很干净。","p":"Rìběn hǎo! Wǒ dàiguo de yóukè lǐ, hǎo jǐ gè dōu shuō nàlǐ hěn gānjìng.","m":"Japan's great! Quite a few of my tourists said how clean it is."}},{"t":"还没想好，哪里都想去。","p":"Hái méi xiǎng hǎo, nǎlǐ dōu xiǎng qù.","m":"Haven't decided — I want to go everywhere.","r":{"t":"那就先从一个开始。我推荐……埃及！","p":"Nà jiù xiān cóng yí gè kāishǐ. Wǒ tuījiàn …… Āijí!","m":"Then start with one. I recommend… Egypt!"}}],"next":{"t":"你说还没去过埃及——没关系，我先讲给你听。","p":"Nǐ shuō hái méi qùguo Āijí —— méi guānxi, wǒ xiān jiǎng gěi nǐ tīng.","m":"You said you've never been to Egypt — never mind, I'll tell you about it first."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你表妹多大了？","p":"Nǐ biǎomèi duō dà le?","m":"How old is your cousin?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她表妹多大（十二岁，第一次去金字塔）","en":"You asked how old her cousin is (twelve — her first time at the pyramids)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我表妹多大。十二岁。周末她站在金字塔下面问我：「这么大的石头，古人是怎么搬上去的？」我讲了半个小时，她最后说：「我还是觉得是外星人。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ biǎomèi duō dà. Shí'èr suì. Zhōumò tā zhàn zài jīnzìtǎ xiàmiàn wèn wǒ: “Zhème dà de shítou, gǔrén shì zěnme bān shàngqù de?” Wǒ jiǎng le bàn gè xiǎoshí, tā zuìhòu shuō: “Wǒ háishi juéde shì wàixīngrén.”","m":"Last time you asked how old my cousin is. Twelve. At the weekend she stood under the pyramid and asked me: “How did people back then get stones this big up there?” I explained for half an hour, and in the end she said: “I still think it was aliens.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候有没有特别想知道答案的问题？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou yǒu méiyǒu tèbié xiǎng zhīdào dá'àn de wèntí?","m":"As a kid, was there a question you really wanted answered?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我想知道天为什么是蓝的。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ xiǎng zhīdào tiān wèishénme shì lán de.","m":"Yes — why the sky is blue.","r":{"t":"我也问过我爸，他说：「因为天就是蓝的。」","p":"Wǒ yě wènguo wǒ bà, tā shuō: “Yīnwèi tiān jiù shì lán de.”","m":"I asked my dad that too. He said: “Because the sky is blue.”"}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"I can't remember.","r":{"t":"没关系，小孩的问题，大人常常都忘了。","p":"Méi guānxi, xiǎohái de wèntí, dàrén chángcháng dōu wàng le.","m":"That's fine — grown-ups often forget the questions they had as kids."}}],"next":{"t":"我表妹的一百张照片，我还在手机里慢慢看，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ biǎomèi de yìbǎi zhāng zhàopiàn, wǒ hái zài shǒujī lǐ mànmàn kàn, hāha.","m":"I'm still slowly going through my cousin's hundred photos on my phone, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去过几次了？","p":"Nǐ qùguo jǐ cì le?","m":"How many times have you been?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去过几次金字塔（数不清了，每次还是觉得很大）","en":"You asked how many times she's been to the pyramids (too many to count — still huge every time)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去过几次金字塔。数不清了。可是周末跟表妹去，她每看到一样东西都「哇」一声，我好像也是第一次来。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qùguo jǐ cì jīnzìtǎ. Shǔ bu qīng le. Kěshì zhōumò gēn biǎomèi qù, tā měi kàn dào yí yàng dōngxi dōu “wa” yì shēng, wǒ hǎoxiàng yě shì dì yī cì lái.","m":"Last time you asked how many times I've been to the pyramids. Too many to count. But going with my cousin at the weekend — she said “wow” at everything, and it felt like my first time too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你住的地方，有没有你天天见、外地人却觉得很了不起的东西？","p":"Nǐ zhù de dìfang, yǒu méiyǒu nǐ tiāntiān jiàn, wàidì rén què juéde hěn liǎobuqǐ de dōngxi?","m":"Where you live, is there something you see every day that visitors find amazing?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一座很老的桥。","p":"Yǒu, yí zuò hěn lǎo de qiáo.","m":"Yes — a very old bridge.","r":{"t":"那下次带朋友去看看，你会重新发现它。","p":"Nà xià cì dài péngyou qù kànkan, nǐ huì chóngxīn fāxiàn tā.","m":"Then take a friend next time — you'll see it with new eyes."}},{"t":"没有，我那边很普通。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ nàbiān hěn pǔtōng.","m":"No, my place is pretty ordinary.","r":{"t":"普通的地方，在别人眼里也可能很特别。","p":"Pǔtōng de dìfang, zài biérén yǎn lǐ yě kěnéng hěn tèbié.","m":"An ordinary place can look special to someone else."}}],"next":{"t":"去了数不清多少次，这次还是很开心。","p":"Qù le shǔ bu qīng duōshao cì, zhè cì háishi hěn kāixīn.","m":"Been more times than I can count, and this time was still lovely."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说个好消息：我去台湾读研的推荐信有着落了！大学的中文老师答应帮我写。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō gè hǎo xiāoxi: wǒ qù Táiwān dú yán de tuījiànxìn yǒu zhuóluò le! Dàxué de Zhōngwén lǎoshī dāying bāng wǒ xiě.","m":"Good news: I've got a reference letter sorted for my master's application to Taiwan! My Chinese professor from university agreed to write it."},{"t":"她让我先写一段自己做过的事。我写了带旅游团——准确地说，三十七个团。","p":"Tā ràng wǒ xiān xiě yí duàn zìjǐ zuòguo de shì. Wǒ xiě le dài lǚyóutuán —— zhǔnquè de shuō, sānshíqī gè tuán.","m":"She asked me to write a paragraph about what I've done first. I wrote about guiding tour groups — thirty-seven groups, to be precise."},{"t":"她看完说：「写得太正式了，像在写论文。」又是这个问题，哈哈。","p":"Tā kàn wán shuō: “Xiě de tài zhèngshì le, xiàng zài xiě lùnwén.” Yòu shì zhège wèntí, hāha.","m":"After reading it she said: “Too formal — it reads like a thesis.” That old problem again, haha."}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜！推荐信有着落了。","p":"Gōngxǐ! Tuījiànxìn yǒu zhuóluò le.","m":"Congrats on the reference letter!","r":{"t":"谢谢！还差一封，我还在找。","p":"Xièxie! Hái chà yì fēng, wǒ hái zài zhǎo.","m":"Thanks! I still need one more — I'm looking."}},{"t":"三十七个团，好厉害！","p":"Sānshíqī gè tuán, hǎo lìhai!","m":"Thirty-seven groups — amazing!","r":{"t":"每个团都教了我一个新词，这个我最骄傲。","p":"Měi gè tuán dōu jiāo le wǒ yí gè xīn cí, zhège wǒ zuì jiāo'ào.","m":"Every group taught me a new word — that's what I'm proudest of."}}],"from":"2026-11-24"}},"2026-11-21|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-11-21","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在公交车上背生词。","p":"Wǒ yě zài gōngjiāochē shang bèi shēngcí.","m":"I study words on the bus too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也在公交车上背生词","en":"You go over new words on the bus too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在公交车上背生词！星期六去奶奶家，我在车上背了二十个。可是……下车的时候，我只记得五个，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài gōngjiāochē shang bèi shēngcí! Xīngqīliù qù nǎinai jiā, wǒ zài chē shang bèi le èrshí gè. Kěshì …… xià chē de shíhou, wǒ zhǐ jìde wǔ gè, hāha.","m":"You said you go over new words on the bus too! On Saturday, going to my grandma's, I learned twenty on the bus. But… when I got off, I only remembered five, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一次背几个生词？","p":"Nǐ yí cì bèi jǐ gè shēngcí?","m":"How many new words do you learn at a time?"},"replies":[{"t":"十个左右。","p":"Shí gè zuǒyòu.","m":"About ten.","r":{"t":"十个好！下次我也试试十个。","p":"Shí gè hǎo! Xià cì wǒ yě shìshi shí gè.","m":"Ten is good! I'll try ten next time."}},{"t":"我不背，听多了就记住了。","p":"Wǒ bú bèi, tīng duō le jiù jìzhù le.","m":"I don't memorise — I pick them up from listening.","r":{"t":"这个我也想试试！我先从听中文歌开始。","p":"Zhège wǒ yě xiǎng shìshi! Wǒ xiān cóng tīng Zhōngwén gē kāishǐ.","m":"I want to try that! I'll start with Chinese songs."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我背了……三个生词，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ bèi le …… sān gè shēngcí, hāha.","m":"Today I learned… three new words, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我在车上一看手机就晕。","p":"Wǒ zài chē shang yí kàn shǒujī jiù yūn.","m":"I get carsick as soon as I look at my phone on the bus."},"mem":{"zh":"你在车上一看手机就晕","en":"You get carsick if you look at your phone on the bus"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在车上一看手机就晕。星期六我也晕了！路上太堵，车停停走走。我就闭上眼睛，听了一个小时中文歌。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài chē shang yí kàn shǒujī jiù yūn. Xīngqīliù wǒ yě yūn le! Lù shang tài dǔ, chē tíngtíng zǒuzǒu. Wǒ jiù bì shang yǎnjing, tīng le yí gè xiǎoshí Zhōngwén gē.","m":"You said you get carsick if you look at your phone on the bus. On Saturday I did too! So much traffic — stop, go, stop, go. So I closed my eyes and listened to Chinese songs for an hour.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你听中文歌吗？","p":"Nǐ tīng Zhōngwén gē ma?","m":"Do you listen to Chinese songs?"},"replies":[{"t":"听，有几首我很喜欢。","p":"Tīng, yǒu jǐ shǒu wǒ hěn xǐhuan.","m":"Yes — there are a few I really like.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 下次告诉我是哪几首。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Xià cì gàosu wǒ shì nǎ jǐ shǒu.","m":"¡Qué chévere! — so cool! Tell me which ones next time."}},{"t":"不太听，歌词听不懂。","p":"Bú tài tīng, gēcí tīng bu dǒng.","m":"Not really — I can't understand the lyrics.","r":{"t":"我也听不懂！可是我喜欢它的声音。","p":"Wǒ yě tīng bu dǒng! Kěshì wǒ xǐhuan tā de shēngyīn.","m":"I can't either! But I like how it sounds."}}],"next":{"t":"今天坐车我也只听不看，想到你了。","p":"Jīntiān zuò chē wǒ yě zhǐ tīng bú kàn, xiǎng dào nǐ le.","m":"Just listened, didn't look, on the bus today — thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"去奶奶家要多久？","p":"Qù nǎinai jiā yào duō jiǔ?","m":"How long does it take to get to your grandma's?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去奶奶家要多久（一个多小时，路上很堵）","en":"You asked how long it takes to get to her dad's mum's (over an hour — lots of traffic)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去奶奶家要多久。星期六更久，两个小时！下大雨，路上都是车。可是到了以后，奶奶做了 ajiaco，一切都好了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù nǎinai jiā yào duō jiǔ. Xīngqīliù gèng jiǔ, liǎng gè xiǎoshí! Xià dà yǔ, lù shang dōu shì chē. Kěshì dào le yǐhòu, nǎinai zuò le ajiaco, yíqiè dōu hǎo le.","m":"Last time you asked how long it takes to get to my grandma's. Saturday was even longer — two hours! Pouring rain, cars everywhere. But when I got there, Grandma had made ajiaco, Bogotá's chicken and potato soup, and everything was fine.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你周末会去看家里人吗？","p":"Nǐ zhōumò huì qù kàn jiā lǐ rén ma?","m":"Do you visit family at weekends?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，常常去。","p":"Huì, chángcháng qù.","m":"Yes, often.","r":{"t":"那你也知道，路上很累，可是很值得。","p":"Nà nǐ yě zhīdào, lù shang hěn lèi, kěshì hěn zhíde.","m":"Then you know — the trip's tiring, but worth it."}},{"t":"不常去，他们住得很远。","p":"Bù cháng qù, tāmen zhù de hěn yuǎn.","m":"Not often — they live far away.","r":{"t":"那你见到他们的时候，一定很开心。","p":"Nà nǐ jiàn dào tāmen de shíhou, yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"Then it must be extra happy when you do see them."}}],"next":{"t":"去奶奶家的路好远，可是很开心。","p":"Qù nǎinai jiā de lù hǎo yuǎn, kěshì hěn kāixīn.","m":"The trip to Grandma's is so long, but I'm happy."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你奶奶知道你在学中文吗？","p":"Nǐ nǎinai zhīdào nǐ zài xué Zhōngwén ma?","m":"Does your grandma know you're learning Chinese?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她奶奶知不知道她在学中文（知道，每次都让她说几句）","en":"You asked if her dad's mum knows she's learning Chinese (yes — she always asks to hear some)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我奶奶知不知道我在学中文。星期六我教她说「好吃」。她喝 ajiaco 的时候说了三次「好吃」，声调比我还好！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ nǎinai zhī bu zhīdào wǒ zài xué Zhōngwén. Xīngqīliù wǒ jiāo tā shuō “hǎochī”. Tā hē ajiaco de shíhou shuō le sān cì “hǎochī”, shēngdiào bǐ wǒ hái hǎo!","m":"Last time you asked if my grandma knows I'm learning Chinese. On Saturday I taught her to say 好吃, “delicious”. She said it three times while eating her ajiaco — her tones were better than mine!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里有人跟你学过一句外语吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu rén gēn nǐ xuéguo yí jù wàiyǔ ma?","m":"Has anyone in your family ever learned a phrase of a foreign language from you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我教过我妈一句。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ jiāoguo wǒ mā yí jù.","m":"Yes, I taught my mum one.","r":{"t":"太好了！她一定说得很开心。","p":"Tài hǎo le! Tā yídìng shuō de hěn kāixīn.","m":"Great! I bet she loves saying it."}},{"t":"还没有，他们不太感兴趣。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, tāmen bú tài gǎn xìngqù.","m":"Not yet — they're not very interested.","r":{"t":"没关系，慢慢来。我外婆以前也不感兴趣。","p":"Méi guānxi, mànmàn lái. Wǒ wàipó yǐqián yě bù gǎn xìngqù.","m":"That's okay, give it time. Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us) wasn't interested at first either."}}],"next":{"t":"我奶奶现在一直说一句中文，下次告诉你是哪一句！","p":"Wǒ nǎinai xiànzài yìzhí shuō yí jù Zhōngwén, xià cì gàosu nǐ shì nǎ yí jù!","m":"My grandma keeps saying one Chinese word now — I'll tell you which next time!"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"星期六跟成都的语伴视频，她问我：毕业以后想做什么？","p":"Xīngqīliù gēn Chéngdū de yǔbàn shìpín, tā wèn wǒ: bìyè yǐhòu xiǎng zuò shénme?","m":"On Saturday I video-called my language partner in Chengdu, and she asked me: what do you want to do after you graduate?"},{"t":"我说：「我还没想好。」这句我说得很好，因为我练了很多次，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ shuō: “Wǒ hái méi xiǎng hǎo.” Zhè jù wǒ shuō de hěn hǎo, yīnwèi wǒ liàn le hěn duō cì, hāha.","m":"I said: “I haven't decided yet.” I said that one really well, because I've practised it lots, haha."},{"t":"我爸妈想让我学医，我自己……等一下等一下，我还在想。这时候 Mochi 走到镜头前面，语伴笑着说：「你看，Mochi 想当医生！」","p":"Wǒ bà mā xiǎng ràng wǒ xué yī, wǒ zìjǐ …… děng yíxià děng yíxià, wǒ hái zài xiǎng. Zhè shíhou Mochi zǒu dào jìngtóu qiánmiàn, yǔbàn xiào zhe shuō: “Nǐ kàn, Mochi xiǎng dāng yīshēng!”","m":"My parents want me to study medicine. Me… wait, wait, I'm still thinking. Just then Mochi walked in front of the camera, and my language partner laughed: “Look — Mochi wants to be a doctor!”"}],"replies":[{"t":"我也还没想好以后做什么。","p":"Wǒ yě hái méi xiǎng hǎo yǐhòu zuò shénme.","m":"I haven't decided what to do later either.","r":{"t":"我们一样！慢慢想，不着急。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Mànmàn xiǎng, bù zháojí.","m":"We're the same! Take your time — no rush."}},{"t":"Mochi 当医生，好可爱！","p":"Mochi dāng yīshēng, hǎo kě'ài!","m":"Doctor Mochi — so cute!","r":{"t":"对吧！可是它最会的是睡觉，一天睡十几个小时。","p":"Duì ba! Kěshì tā zuì huì de shì shuìjiào, yì tiān shuì shí jǐ gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Right? But what it's best at is sleeping — over ten hours a day."}}],"from":"2026-11-23"}},"2026-11-21|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-21","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我周末也是什么都不干。","p":"Wǒ zhōumò yě shì shénme dōu bú gàn.","m":"I don't do anything at weekends either."},"mem":{"zh":"你周末也是什么都不干","en":"You do nothing at weekends too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你周末也是什么都不干。周六下午我真做到了：睡了个午觉，醒来天都快黑了，泡了一壶茶，就那么坐着。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhōumò yě shì shénme dōu bú gàn. Zhōuliù xiàwǔ wǒ zhēn zuò dào le: shuì le gè wǔjiào, xǐnglái tiān dōu kuài hēi le, pào le yì hú chá, jiù nàme zuò zhe.","m":"You said you do nothing at weekends too. On Saturday afternoon I actually managed it: had a nap, woke up when it was almost dark, made a pot of tea, and just sat there.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你什么都不干的时候，一般怎么待着？","p":"Nǐ shénme dōu bú gàn de shíhou, yìbān zěnme dāi zhe?","m":"When you're doing nothing, how do you spend the time?"},"replies":[{"t":"躺在床上看手机。","p":"Tǎng zài chuáng shang kàn shǒujī.","m":"Lying in bed on my phone.","r":{"t":"这个我也会，一躺就是一下午。","p":"Zhège wǒ yě huì, yì tǎng jiù shì yí xiàwǔ.","m":"I do that too — lie down and the afternoon's gone."}},{"t":"出去随便走走。","p":"Chūqù suíbiàn zǒuzou.","m":"Go out for a wander.","r":{"t":"也挺好，走着走着心就静了。","p":"Yě tǐng hǎo, zǒu zhe zǒu zhe xīn jiù jìng le.","m":"That's nice too — you walk and your mind settles."}}],"next":{"t":"这个周末我也想什么都不干，跟你一样。","p":"Zhège zhōumò wǒ yě xiǎng shénme dōu bú gàn, gēn nǐ yíyàng.","m":"This weekend I want to do nothing too, just like you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也想学书法。","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng xué shūfǎ.","m":"I'd like to learn calligraphy too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也想学书法","en":"You want to learn calligraphy too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也想学书法。周六上课我想起你，就让老年大学的学生每人写了一行「一」。一位八十岁的大爷说，他写「一」写了五十年，还是写不好。回家我自己也写了一张。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xiǎng xué shūfǎ. Zhōuliù shàngkè wǒ xiǎng qǐ nǐ, jiù ràng lǎonián dàxué de xuésheng měi rén xiě le yì háng “yī”. Yí wèi bāshí suì de dàye shuō, tā xiě “yī” xiě le wǔshí nián, háishi xiě bu hǎo. Huí jiā wǒ zìjǐ yě xiě le yì zhāng.","m":"You said you want to learn calligraphy too. In class on Saturday I thought of you, so I had each of my seniors write a line of 一. An eighty-year-old man said he's been writing 一 for fifty years and still can't get it right. When I got home, I wrote a sheet myself.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一直想学、还没开始的东西？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yìzhí xiǎng xué, hái méi kāishǐ de dōngxi?","m":"Is there something you've always wanted to learn but haven't started?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我一直想学画画。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ yìzhí xiǎng xué huà huà.","m":"Yes — I've always wanted to learn to draw.","r":{"t":"那就从画一个圆开始，跟写「一」一样。","p":"Nà jiù cóng huà yí gè yuán kāishǐ, gēn xiě “yī” yíyàng.","m":"Then start with a circle — like writing 一."}},{"t":"有，想学一样乐器。","p":"Yǒu, xiǎng xué yí yàng yuèqì.","m":"Yes — an instrument.","r":{"t":"那就先挑一样，每天十分钟。","p":"Nà jiù xiān tiāo yí yàng, měi tiān shí fēnzhōng.","m":"Then pick one and do ten minutes a day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天写字的时候，又想到你想学书法。","p":"Jīntiān xiě zì de shíhou, yòu xiǎng dào nǐ xiǎng xué shūfǎ.","m":"Practising calligraphy today, I thought of you wanting to learn."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"老年大学的学生多大了？","p":"Lǎonián dàxué de xuésheng duō dà le?","m":"How old are the students at the seniors' college?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过老年大学的学生多大（六十到八十岁，比她还认真）","en":"You asked how old her students at the seniors' college are (sixty to eighty — keener than her)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问老年大学的学生多大。周六上课，年纪最大的那位阿姨八十二了。她带着一个小本子，我说一句，她记一句，下课还留下来问问题。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn lǎonián dàxué de xuésheng duō dà. Zhōuliù shàngkè, niánjì zuì dà de nà wèi āyí bāshí'èr le. Tā dài zhe yí gè xiǎo běnzi, wǒ shuō yí jù, tā jì yí jù, xiàkè hái liú xiàlái wèn wèntí.","m":"Last time you asked how old my students at the seniors' college are. In class on Saturday, the oldest, a lady of eighty-two, had a little notebook — she wrote down every sentence I said, and stayed behind afterwards to ask questions.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有没有年纪很大、还在学新东西的人？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu méiyǒu niánjì hěn dà, hái zài xué xīn dōngxi de rén?","m":"Do you know anyone older who's still learning new things?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我奶奶在学用手机。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ nǎinai zài xué yòng shǒujī.","m":"Yes — my grandma's learning to use a smartphone.","r":{"t":"学手机也很了不起！","p":"Xué shǒujī yě hěn liǎobuqǐ!","m":"Learning a smartphone is a big deal too!"}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那以后你就当那个人，哈哈。","p":"Nà yǐhòu nǐ jiù dāng nà gè rén, hāha.","m":"Then one day you can be that person, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"老年大学的学生，又让我感动了一次。","p":"Lǎonián dàxué de xuésheng, yòu ràng wǒ gǎndòng le yí cì.","m":"My students at the seniors' college moved me again."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"下午真的什么都不干吗？","p":"Xiàwǔ zhēnde shénme dōu bú gàn ma?","m":"Really nothing at all in the afternoon?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她下午是不是真的什么都不干（她说最多睡个午觉、看看书）","en":"You asked if she really does nothing in the afternoon (a nap and a book at most, she said)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我下午是不是真的什么都不干。说实话，没做到：周六下午，我一个学生相完亲，给我发消息，我们聊了一个小时。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiàwǔ shì bu shì zhēnde shénme dōu bú gàn. Shuō shíhuà, méi zuò dào: zhōuliù xiàwǔ, wǒ yí gè xuésheng xiāng wán qīn, gěi wǒ fā xiāoxi, wǒmen liáo le yí gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Last time you asked if I really do nothing in the afternoon. Honestly, I didn't manage it: on Saturday afternoon one of my students messaged me after his set-up date, and we chatted for an hour.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你周末能做到什么都不干吗？","p":"Nǐ zhōumò néng zuò dào shénme dōu bú gàn ma?","m":"Can you manage to do nothing at the weekend?"},"replies":[{"t":"能，我很会休息。","p":"Néng, wǒ hěn huì xiūxi.","m":"Yes — I'm good at resting.","r":{"t":"这是本事！教教我。","p":"Zhè shì běnshi! Jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"That's a skill! Teach me."}},{"t":"做不到，总有事情找上门。","p":"Zuò bu dào, zǒng yǒu shìqing zhǎo shàng mén.","m":"No — something always comes up.","r":{"t":"对，事情总是自己找来。","p":"Duì, shìqing zǒng shì zìjǐ zhǎo lái.","m":"Right — things always find you."}}],"next":{"t":"这个周末本来想什么都不干，结果手机一直响，哈哈。","p":"Zhège zhōumò běnlái xiǎng shénme dōu bú gàn, jiéguǒ shǒujī yìzhí xiǎng, hāha.","m":"Meant to do nothing this weekend — but my phone kept buzzing, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-21|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-21","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm doing nothing this weekend too.","p":"","m":"我这个周末也什么都不干。"},"mem":{"zh":"你这个周末也什么都不干","en":"You were doing nothing at the weekend too"},"later":{"t":"You said you were doing nothing at the weekend too. Report: I did parkrun, then lay on the sofa for six hours. Mission complete.","p":"","m":"你上次说你这个周末也什么都不干。汇报：我跑完 parkrun，然后在沙发上躺了六个小时。任务完成。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"So — did you manage to do nothing?","p":"","m":"那么——你做到什么都不干了吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I barely left the sofa.","p":"","m":"做到了，几乎没离开沙发。","r":{"t":"Perfect. Champions of rest.","p":"","m":"完美。休息冠军。"}},{"t":"Not really, I ended up busy.","p":"","m":"没有，最后还是忙起来了。","r":{"t":"It always happens. Next weekend, then.","p":"","m":"总是这样。那就下个周末。"}}],"next":{"t":"Doing nothing is going very well here.","p":"","m":"这边的「什么都不干」进展顺利。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never done a 5K.","p":"","m":"我从没跑过五公里。"},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没跑过五公里","en":"You've never done a 5K"},"later":{"t":"You said you've never done a 5K. At parkrun on Saturday I saw a woman finish her very first one. She walked the last bit, smiling, and everyone clapped. Honestly, it made my week.","p":"","m":"你上次说你从来没跑过五公里。周六的 parkrun 上，我看到一位女士跑完了她的第一个五公里。最后一段她是走着的，一直在笑，大家都在鼓掌。说实话，这是我这周最开心的事。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Would you try one someday?","p":"","m":"你哪天会试试吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Maybe, if I can walk some of it.","p":"","m":"也许吧，要是能走一段的话。","r":{"t":"You can. Lots of people walk the whole thing.","p":"","m":"可以的。很多人全程都是走的。"}},{"t":"Probably not — not my thing.","p":"","m":"大概不会，不是我的菜。","r":{"t":"Fair enough. Someone has to clap at the finish.","p":"","m":"也行。终点总得有人鼓掌。"}}],"next":{"t":"Parkrun was fun. Saw lots of people walking it — thought of you.","p":"","m":"parkrun 很好玩。看到很多人走着完成，想到你了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it hard?","p":"","m":"难吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 parkrun 难不难（不难，很多人走着去，还有人带狗）","en":"You asked if parkrun is hard (not at all — lots of people walk it, some with dogs)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if parkrun is hard. Not really. It was muddy on Saturday, though — I slipped on the hill and finished with one brown leg. Nobody even looked twice.","p":"","m":"你上次问 parkrun 难不难。不怎么难。不过周六很泥泞——我在坡上滑了一跤，跑到终点一条腿全是泥。根本没人多看一眼。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite way to move — walking, running, something else?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢怎么动——走路、跑步，还是别的？"},"replies":[{"t":"Walking, definitely.","p":"","m":"肯定是走路。","r":{"t":"Walking counts. Don't let anyone tell you otherwise.","p":"","m":"走路也算。别听别人说不算。"}},{"t":"I like swimming.","p":"","m":"我喜欢游泳。","r":{"t":"Swimming! A lot cleaner than muddy parkrun.","p":"","m":"游泳！比泥巴里的 parkrun 干净多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Legs a bit tired today.","p":"","m":"今天腿有点累。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How fast are you?","p":"","m":"你跑多快？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他跑多快（二十八分钟左右）","en":"You asked how fast he is (about twenty-eight minutes)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how fast I am. Twenty-eight minutes, I said. Saturday: twenty-seven forty. Twenty seconds faster! I told my flatmates. Nobody cared.","p":"","m":"你上次问我跑多快。我说二十八分钟。周六：二十七分四十秒。快了二十秒！我告诉了室友们。没人在乎。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something small you're trying to get better at?","p":"","m":"有没有什么小事，你在努力做得更好？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cooking, slowly.","p":"","m":"做饭，慢慢来。","r":{"t":"Good one. Food's a better reward than a time.","p":"","m":"不错。做好吃的比跑出好成绩实在。"}},{"t":"Getting up earlier.","p":"","m":"早点起床。","r":{"t":"That's the hardest one. Good luck.","p":"","m":"那是最难的。祝你好运。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still proud of my time, haha.","p":"","m":"我还在为我的成绩得意，哈哈。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Got my editor's notes back on the flat-sharing piece. She cut my favourite joke and kept all the boring numbers. Classic.","p":"","m":"合租那篇稿子，主编的修改意见回来了。她删了我最得意的笑话，那些枯燥的数字一个没删。一贯如此。"},{"t":"She did keep one quote from an interview, though — and she wants it as the headline.","p":"","m":"不过她留下了一句采访里的话——还要拿它当标题。"},{"t":"It comes out on the 24th. Weirdly, I'm nervous.","p":"","m":"24 号登出来。说来奇怪，我有点紧张。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Ooh, what's the quote?","p":"","m":"哦，是哪句话？","r":{"t":"'It's a box, but it's mine.' A nurse said it about her tiny room.","p":"","m":"「是个小隔间，但是我自己的。」一个护士说她那间小小的卧室。"}},{"t":"Don't be nervous — it'll be great.","p":"","m":"别紧张，肯定很好。","r":{"t":"Cheers. I'll send you the link.","p":"","m":"谢了。登出来我把链接发你。"}}],"from":"2026-11-23","to":"2026-11-23"}},"2026-11-21|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-21","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I love cinnamon buns too!","p":"","m":"我也很喜欢肉桂卷！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱吃肉桂卷","en":"You love cinnamon buns too"},"later":{"t":"You said you love cinnamon buns too! Sunday fika was good — my mum made two kinds, cinnamon and cardamom. The kids ate the cinnamon ones. I ate the cardamom ones. Everyone was happy.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也爱吃肉桂卷！周日的 fika（下午茶）很开心——我妈做了两种，肉桂的和小豆蔻的。孩子们吃肉桂的，我吃小豆蔻的。皆大欢喜。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Cinnamon or cardamom — which sounds better to you?","p":"","m":"肉桂还是小豆蔻——你觉得哪个听起来更好吃？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cinnamon, I think.","p":"","m":"肉桂吧。","r":{"t":"Classic choice. Safe and good.","p":"","m":"经典的选择。稳妥又好吃。"}},{"t":"Cardamom — I've never tried it.","p":"","m":"小豆蔻，我还没吃过。","r":{"t":"Try it if you can. It's like a warm hug in spice form.","p":"","m":"有机会尝尝。就像香料做的一个温暖的拥抱。"}}],"next":{"t":"Fika today — I'll have a bun for you.","p":"","m":"今天 fika——我替你吃一个肉桂卷。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'll probably spend Sunday alone.","p":"","m":"我周日大概一个人过。"},"mem":{"zh":"你周日大概一个人过","en":"You'd probably spend Sunday alone"},"later":{"t":"You said you'd probably spend Sunday alone. I hope you had a coffee and something sweet — or tea and anything. Fika is just a little pause.","p":"","m":"你上次说你周日大概一个人过。希望你喝了杯咖啡，吃了点甜的——或者喝茶配点什么都行。fika 就是停下来歇一会儿。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did you do something nice for yourself?","p":"","m":"你有没有对自己好一点？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I had a slow coffee.","p":"","m":"有，慢慢喝了一杯咖啡。","r":{"t":"That's a perfect solo fika.","p":"","m":"这就是完美的一个人的 fika。"}},{"t":"Not really, I was busy.","p":"","m":"没有，忙着呢。","r":{"t":"Then take ten minutes this week. That's an order — a friendly one.","p":"","m":"那这周给自己十分钟。这是命令——友好的那种。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hope your Sunday is a gentle one.","p":"","m":"希望你的周日过得温柔。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why the candles?","p":"","m":"为什么点蜡烛？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她为什么点蜡烛（天黑得太早，点蜡烛让人觉得温馨）","en":"You asked why the candles (it gets dark so early — candles make it cosy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why the candles. Because it's dark so early. On Sunday it was dark by four, so we lit them at three. My youngest blew them out twice — every candle is a birthday cake, apparently.","p":"","m":"你上次问为什么点蜡烛。因为天黑得太早。周日四点就黑了，所以我们三点就点上了。我家老二吹灭了两次——在他眼里，每根蜡烛都是生日蛋糕。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you light candles at home?","p":"","m":"你在家会点蜡烛吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Sometimes, in winter.","p":"","m":"冬天有时候会。","r":{"t":"Then you know the feeling. Cosy.","p":"","m":"那你懂这种感觉。温馨。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不怎么点。","r":{"t":"Try one with dinner sometime. It changes everything.","p":"","m":"哪天吃晚饭的时候点一根试试。感觉全变了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Candles ready for this afternoon.","p":"","m":"下午的蜡烛准备好了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Who made the buns?","p":"","m":"肉桂卷是谁做的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过面包是谁做的（她妈妈做的，她负责吃）","en":"You asked who made the buns (her mum — she's in charge of eating them)"},"later":{"t":"You asked who made the buns. My mum. On Sunday she finally showed me how. Mine came out flat and a bit ugly — but the kids said they taste the same. Kind children.","p":"","m":"你上次问面包是谁做的。我妈。周日她终于教我做了。我做的又扁又有点丑——可是孩子们说味道一样。真是善良的孩子。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a dish you'd like to learn from your family?","p":"","m":"有没有哪道菜，你想跟家里人学？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my grandma's dumplings.","p":"","m":"有，我奶奶包的饺子。","r":{"t":"Learn it soon. I waited forty years for these buns.","p":"","m":"早点学。我为了这个面包等了四十年。"}},{"t":"Not really, I'm happy just eating.","p":"","m":"没有，我光吃就很开心。","r":{"t":"Ha! That was my job too, until Sunday.","p":"","m":"哈！在周日以前，这也是我的工作。"}}],"next":{"t":"My mum's baking today. The kitchen smells amazing.","p":"","m":"我妈今天在烤面包。厨房香极了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"My class started practising for Lucia this week — it's on the thirteenth of December.","p":"","m":"这周我们班开始排练露西亚节了——12 月 13 日。"},{"t":"The children walk in long white gowns, carrying candles, and sing in the dark. Battery candles these days — much safer.","p":"","m":"孩子们穿着白色的长袍，拿着蜡烛，在黑暗里一边走一边唱。现在都用电池蜡烛——安全多了。"},{"t":"Thirty eight-year-olds singing… some of them are on the right note, ja. Not all of them.","p":"","m":"三十个八岁的孩子一起唱……有的唱在调上，是的。不是全部。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That sounds beautiful.","p":"","m":"听起来真美。","r":{"t":"It is. Even the wrong notes, honestly.","p":"","m":"是的。说实话，连跑调的都美。"}},{"t":"Battery candles — very sensible!","p":"","m":"电池蜡烛——很明智！","r":{"t":"Very Swedish. Cosy, but safe.","p":"","m":"很瑞典。温馨，但安全。"}}],"from":"2026-11-24"}},"2026-11-22|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-22","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我妈也老问我什么时候回家。","p":"Wǒ mā yě lǎo wèn wǒ shénme shíhou huí jiā.","m":"My mum always asks when I'm coming home too."},"mem":{"zh":"你妈也老问你什么时候回家","en":"Your mum keeps asking when you're coming home too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你妈也老问你什么时候回家。这两天我想了个办法：一打电话，我先说「下个月回去」，她就不问了，改问我吃了没有。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ mā yě lǎo wèn nǐ shénme shíhou huí jiā. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng le gè bànfǎ: yì dǎ diànhuà, wǒ xiān shuō “xià gè yuè huíqù”, tā jiù bú wèn le, gǎi wèn wǒ chī le méiyǒu.","m":"You said your mum keeps asking when you're coming home too. I've come up with a trick: as soon as she calls, I say first “I'll come back next month” — then she stops asking, and asks whether I've eaten instead.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟家里人多久见一次？","p":"Nǐ gēn jiā lǐ rén duō jiǔ jiàn yí cì?","m":"How often do you see your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"一年一两次，太远了。","p":"Yì nián yī liǎng cì, tài yuǎn le.","m":"Once or twice a year — it's too far.","r":{"t":"那你妈妈肯定天天想你。","p":"Nà nǐ māma kěndìng tiāntiān xiǎng nǐ.","m":"Then your mum must miss you every day."}},{"t":"我跟他们住在一起，天天见。","p":"Wǒ gēn tāmen zhù zài yìqǐ, tiāntiān jiàn.","m":"I live with them, so every day.","r":{"t":"那真好，不用被问「什么时候回来」。","p":"Nà zhēn hǎo, bú yòng bèi wèn “shénme shíhou huílái”.","m":"Lucky — nobody asks you “when are you coming home”."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我妈又问我什么时候回家了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ mā yòu wèn wǒ shénme shíhou huí jiā le, hāha.","m":"My mum asked when I'm coming home again today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我跟家里人住在一起。","p":"Wǒ gēn jiā li rén zhù zài yìqǐ.","m":"I live with my family."},"mem":{"zh":"你跟家里人住在一起","en":"You live with your family"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你跟家里人住在一起。这两天我妈在视频里又说：「你要是住家里，天天有热饭吃。」我听了，还真有点想回去了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ gēn jiā lǐ rén zhù zài yìqǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā zài shìpín lǐ yòu shuō: “Nǐ yàoshi zhù jiā lǐ, tiāntiān yǒu rè fàn chī.” Wǒ tīng le, hái zhēn yǒudiǎn xiǎng huíqù le.","m":"You said you live with your family. These days my mum said on video again: “If you lived at home, you'd have a hot meal every day.” Hearing that, I kind of wanted to go back.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"跟家里人住在一起，你觉得最好的是什么？","p":"Gēn jiā lǐ rén zhù zài yìqǐ, nǐ juéde zuì hǎo de shì shénme?","m":"What's the best thing about living with family?"},"replies":[{"t":"回家就有饭吃。","p":"Huí jiā jiù yǒu fàn chī.","m":"There's food when you get home.","r":{"t":"这个最实在！","p":"Zhège zuì shízai!","m":"That's the most practical one!"}},{"t":"有人说话，不孤单。","p":"Yǒu rén shuōhuà, bù gūdān.","m":"There's someone to talk to — you're never lonely.","r":{"t":"对，这个最重要。","p":"Duì, zhège zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Right, that matters most."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又想起你说的：跟家里人住，天天有热饭。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu xiǎng qǐ nǐ shuō de: gēn jiā lǐ rén zhù, tiāntiān yǒu rè fàn.","m":"Thought again today about what you said — living with family, hot meals every day."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天都给妈妈打电话吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān dōu gěi māma dǎ diànhuà ma?","m":"Do you call your mum every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天给妈妈打电话（两三天一次，妈妈会提醒她穿暖和点）","en":"You asked if she calls her mum every day (every two or three days — her mum reminds her to wrap up warm)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天给妈妈打电话。这两天北京降温，她打来的次数变多了，每次都是那一句：「秋裤穿了没有？」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān gěi māma dǎ diànhuà. Zhè liǎng tiān Běijīng jiàngwēn, tā dǎ lái de cìshù biàn duō le, měi cì dōu shì nà yí jù: “Qiūkù chuān le méiyǒu?”","m":"Last time you asked if I call my mum every day. Now that it's turned cold in Beijing, she's been calling more — and every time it's the same line: “Are you wearing your long johns?”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人会提醒你什么？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén huì tíxǐng nǐ shénme?","m":"What does your family remind you about?"},"replies":[{"t":"多穿点，别感冒。","p":"Duō chuān diǎn, bié gǎnmào.","m":"Wear more, don't catch a cold.","r":{"t":"全世界的妈妈都一样！","p":"Quán shìjiè de māma dōu yíyàng!","m":"Mums are the same all over the world!"}},{"t":"早点睡，别熬夜。","p":"Zǎo diǎn shuì, bié áoyè.","m":"Go to bed early, don't stay up.","r":{"t":"这个我妈也说，我每次都答应，然后照样熬。","p":"Zhège wǒ mā yě shuō, wǒ měi cì dōu dāying, ránhòu zhàoyàng áo.","m":"My mum says that too. I always say yes, then stay up anyway."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我妈又打电话来，让我多穿点儿。你也注意身体。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ mā yòu dǎ diànhuà lái, ràng wǒ duō chuān diǎnr. Nǐ yě zhùyì shēntǐ.","m":"My mum called again today to tell me to wrap up. Look after yourself too."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们聊了多久？","p":"Nǐmen liáo le duō jiǔ?","m":"How long did you talk?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们聊了多久（半个小时，最后爸爸也说了几句）","en":"You asked how long they talked (half an hour — her dad joined at the end)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们聊了多久。跟你说，这两天我爸学会自己打视频了！可是打过来的时候，镜头只拍到他的额头，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen liáo le duō jiǔ. Gēn nǐ shuō, zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bà xuéhuì zìjǐ dǎ shìpín le! Kěshì dǎ guòlái de shíhou, jìngtóu zhǐ pāi dào tā de étóu, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how long we talked. Guess what — my dad has learned to make video calls on his own! But when he called, all I could see was his forehead, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里谁最会用手机？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ shéi zuì huì yòng shǒujī?","m":"Who in your family is best with phones?"},"replies":[{"t":"我妈，她什么都会。","p":"Wǒ mā, tā shénme dōu huì.","m":"My mum — she can do everything.","r":{"t":"那你家跟我家正好反过来！","p":"Nà nǐ jiā gēn wǒ jiā zhènghǎo fǎn guòlái!","m":"Your family's the opposite of mine!"}},{"t":"我，家里人都找我帮忙。","p":"Wǒ, jiā lǐ rén dōu zhǎo wǒ bāngmáng.","m":"Me — everyone comes to me for help.","r":{"t":"我也是！我就是我们家的客服。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ jiù shì wǒmen jiā de kèfú.","m":"Me too! I'm my family's tech support."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我爸又跟我视频了，这次聊了十分钟。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ bà yòu gēn wǒ shìpín le, zhè cì liáo le shí fēnzhōng.","m":"My dad video-called me again today — ten minutes this time."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说件好玩的事：我班上有个德国学生，周末去相亲了。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō jiàn hǎowán de shì: wǒ bān shang yǒu gè Déguó xuésheng, zhōumò qù xiāngqīn le.","m":"Here's a fun one: a German student in my class went on a set-up date at the weekend."},{"t":"一上课他就问：相完亲，要不要先给对方发消息？全班吵了半节课。","p":"Yí shàngkè tā jiù wèn: xiāng wán qīn, yào bu yào xiān gěi duìfāng fā xiāoxi? Quán bān chǎo le bàn jié kè.","m":"The moment class started, he asked: after the date, should he message her first? The whole class argued about it for half the lesson."},{"t":"我在黑板上写了一句：「那天聊得很开心，谢谢你推荐的那家店。」短短一句，不多不少。","p":"Wǒ zài hēibǎn shang xiě le yí jù: “Nà tiān liáo de hěn kāixīn, xièxie nǐ tuījiàn de nà jiā diàn.” Duǎnduǎn yí jù, bù duō bù shǎo.","m":"I wrote one line on the board: “I really enjoyed our chat — thanks for picking that place.” Short, not too much, not too little."}],"replies":[{"t":"那他发了吗？","p":"Nà tā fā le ma?","m":"So did he send it?","r":{"t":"发了！现在全班都在等对方回。","p":"Fā le! Xiànzài quán bān dōu zài děng duìfāng huí.","m":"He did! Now the whole class is waiting for her reply."}},{"t":"这句话我也想学。","p":"Zhè jù huà wǒ yě xiǎng xué.","m":"I want to learn that line too.","r":{"t":"好啊，「聊得很开心」什么时候都能用。","p":"Hǎo a, “liáo de hěn kāixīn” shénme shíhou dōu néng yòng.","m":"Sure — “I really enjoyed our chat” works any time."}}],"from":"2026-11-23"}},"2026-11-22|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-22","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same — bedtime is the hardest part.","p":"","m":"我也是，哄睡最难。"},"mem":{"zh":"哄孩子睡觉是最难的","en":"Bedtime is the hardest part"},"later":{"t":"You said bedtime is the hardest part. This week my daughter asked for a story with a motorbike, a cat and the moon. I made one up. Now she wants the same story every night — exactly the same words.","p":"","m":"你上次说哄孩子睡觉是最难的。这周我女儿要听一个有摩托车、有猫、有月亮的故事。我就编了一个。现在她每天晚上都要听同一个——一个字都不能改。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What helped you sleep when you were little?","p":"","m":"你小时候靠什么睡着？"},"replies":[{"t":"A story from my parents.","p":"","m":"爸妈讲故事。","r":{"t":"Stories are magic. Even mine, haha.","p":"","m":"故事有魔法。连我编的都有，哈哈。"}},{"t":"A light left on in the hallway.","p":"","m":"走廊上留一盏灯。","r":{"t":"Same for my kids! The light must stay on.","p":"","m":"我的孩子也是！灯一定得开着。"}}],"next":{"t":"Another bedtime battle, haha.","p":"","m":"又打了一场睡前仗，哈哈。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have kids, so it's always quiet.","p":"","m":"我没有孩子，所以一直很安静。"},"mem":{"zh":"你没有孩子，家里一直很安静","en":"You don't have kids, so it's always quiet"},"later":{"t":"You said it's always quiet at your place. This week I tried to find quiet too: after the kids slept, I sat outside with tea. Then the neighbour's rooster started. At ten at night! Quiet is not easy in Jakarta, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家一直很安静。这周我也想找点安静：孩子睡了以后，我坐在门外喝茶。结果邻居家的公鸡叫起来了。晚上十点！在雅加达想安静可不容易，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite quiet time of day?","p":"","m":"一天里你最喜欢哪段安静的时间？"},"replies":[{"t":"Early morning, before everyone wakes up.","p":"","m":"大清早，大家还没起的时候。","r":{"t":"Ah, beautiful. Before the traffic.","p":"","m":"啊，真好。在路上堵起来之前。"}},{"t":"Late at night.","p":"","m":"深夜。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. The night is mine.","p":"","m":"我也是，兄弟。夜晚是我的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Enjoy your quiet today, bro.","p":"","m":"今天好好享受安静吧，兄弟。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How old are your kids?","p":"","m":"你的孩子多大了？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他孩子多大（五岁和八岁，精力旺盛）","en":"You asked how old his kids are (five and eight — full of energy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how old my kids are. Five and eight. This week the eight-year-old lost a front tooth. Now my five-year-old checks her teeth every morning — she wants a loose one too.","p":"","m":"你上次问我孩子多大。五岁和八岁。这周八岁的那个掉了一颗门牙。现在我五岁的女儿每天早上都检查自己的牙——她也想有一颗松的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have brothers or sisters?","p":"","m":"你有兄弟姐妹吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, one.","p":"","m":"有，一个。","r":{"t":"Then you know — always fighting, always together.","p":"","m":"那你懂——天天吵，天天在一起。"}},{"t":"No, I'm an only child.","p":"","m":"没有，我是独生子女。","r":{"t":"Quiet house, then! Mine is never quiet, haha.","p":"","m":"那家里很安静吧！我家从来不安静，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"The kids are full of energy again today.","p":"","m":"孩子们今天又精力十足。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you do when it's quiet?","p":"","m":"安静下来以后你做什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过安静下来他做什么（喝茶，看会儿电视上的足球）","en":"You asked what he does when it's quiet (tea, and a bit of football on TV)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I do when it's quiet. Tea and football. This week I fell asleep on the sofa before half-time. My wife told me the score in the morning — two–one. I still don't know who scored.","p":"","m":"你上次问安静下来我做什么。喝茶，看足球。这周还没到中场我就在沙发上睡着了。第二天早上我老婆告诉我比分——二比一。我到现在都不知道是谁进的球。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you relax at the end of the day?","p":"","m":"一天结束的时候，你怎么放松？"},"replies":[{"t":"Watch a show.","p":"","m":"看个节目。","r":{"t":"Good. Me, I fall asleep in the first ten minutes.","p":"","m":"好。我是前十分钟就睡着了。"}},{"t":"Read a little.","p":"","m":"看一会儿书。","r":{"t":"Reading is good. My kids make me read the same story every night, haha.","p":"","m":"看书好。我的孩子每天晚上都要我念同一个故事，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Tea and football, my favourite.","p":"","m":"喝茶看球，我最喜欢的。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Good news from home, bro.","p":"","m":"家里有好消息，兄弟。"},{"t":"My wife's fried bananas sold out before five on Saturday. One man came back three times!","p":"","m":"周六我老婆的炸香蕉五点前就卖光了。有个男的回来买了三次！"},{"t":"Her new idea: cheese on top, and a little chocolate. The kids are her official testers.","p":"","m":"她的新点子：上面撒奶酪，再加一点巧克力。孩子们是她的正式试吃员。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That sounds delicious!","p":"","m":"听起来好好吃！","r":{"t":"It is! Come to Jakarta — first plate is free.","p":"","m":"真的好吃！来雅加达——第一盘免费。"}},{"t":"Cheese on bananas? Interesting…","p":"","m":"香蕉加奶酪？有意思……","r":{"t":"I said the same! Then I ate five.","p":"","m":"我也这么说！然后我吃了五个。"}}],"from":"2026-11-23"}},"2026-11-23|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的咖啡也差不多这个价。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de kāfēi yě chàbuduō zhège jià.","m":"Coffee's about the same price here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡也差不多这个价","en":"Coffee costs about the same where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡也差不多这个价。这两天天冷了，咖啡车前面排队的人多了一倍。我排了十分钟，第一节课差点迟到。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēi yě chàbuduō zhège jià. Zhè liǎng tiān tiān lěng le, kāfēichē qiánmiàn páiduì de rén duō le yí bèi. Wǒ pái le shí fēnzhōng, dì yī jié kè chà yìdiǎn chídào.","m":"You said coffee's about the same price where you are. It's turned cold these days and the queue at the coffee cart has doubled. I waited ten minutes and was nearly late for first period.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般在哪儿买咖啡？","p":"Nǐ yìbān zài nǎr mǎi kāfēi?","m":"Where do you usually get your coffee?"},"replies":[{"t":"路边的小店，便宜。","p":"Lùbiān de xiǎo diàn, piányi.","m":"A little shop by the road — it's cheap.","r":{"t":"对对对，好喝不一定要贵。","p":"Duì duì duì, hǎohē bù yídìng yào guì.","m":"Yes yes yes — good doesn't have to mean expensive."}},{"t":"我不喝咖啡。","p":"Wǒ bù hē kāfēi.","m":"I don't drink coffee.","r":{"t":"那你比我健康！我第一节课前离不开它。","p":"Nà nǐ bǐ wǒ jiànkāng! Wǒ dì yī jié kè qián lí bu kāi tā.","m":"Then you're healthier than me! I can't do first period without it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的咖啡车咖啡还是两块五，想到你那边也差不多。","p":"Jīntiān de kāfēichē kāfēi háishi liǎng kuài wǔ, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān yě chàbuduō.","m":"Cart coffee still two-fifty today — thought of yours costing about the same."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的咖啡贵多了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de kāfēi guì duō le.","m":"Coffee's a lot more expensive here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡贵多了","en":"Coffee's much pricier where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡贵多了。这两天学校旁边新开了一家咖啡店，一杯七块。我算了一下：要是我每天喝，一年要花一千多块，够买一张去成都的机票了。所以我还是站在咖啡车前面。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēi guì duō le. Zhè liǎng tiān xuéxiào pángbiān xīn kāi le yì jiā kāfēi diàn, yì bēi qī kuài. Wǒ suàn le yíxià: yàoshi wǒ měi tiān hē, yì nián yào huā yìqiān duō kuài, gòu mǎi yì zhāng qù Chéngdū de jīpiào le. Suǒyǐ wǒ háishi zhàn zài kāfēichē qiánmiàn.","m":"You said coffee's much pricier where you are. These days a new coffee shop opened next to my school — seven dollars a cup. I did the maths: one every day comes to over a thousand dollars a year. That's a plane ticket to Chengdu. So I'm still standing at the coffee cart.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会算每天的小花费加起来有多少吗？","p":"Nǐ huì suàn měi tiān de xiǎo huāfèi jiā qǐlái yǒu duōshao ma?","m":"Do you ever add up what your small daily spending comes to?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，算了吓一跳。","p":"Huì, suàn le xià yí tiào.","m":"Yes — and it scared me.","r":{"t":"对对对，我也是！","p":"Duì duì duì, wǒ yě shì!","m":"Yes yes yes, me too!"}},{"t":"不算，算了不开心。","p":"Bú suàn, suàn le bù kāixīn.","m":"No — it'd only upset me.","r":{"t":"哈哈，这也是一种办法。","p":"Hāha, zhè yě shì yì zhǒng bànfǎ.","m":"Haha, that's one approach."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在咖啡车前面排队了。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài kāfēichē qiánmiàn páiduì le.","m":"Queued at the coffee cart again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天上课前都买吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān shàngkè qián dōu mǎi ma?","m":"Do you buy one before class every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他是不是每天上课前都买咖啡（平时喝茶多，第一节课前一定要一杯）","en":"You asked if he buys one before class every day (mostly tea, but always a coffee before first period)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天上课前都买咖啡。这两天第一节课是考试，我买了两杯——一杯给我，一杯给隔壁班的老师，她也要监考。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān shàngkè qián dōu mǎi kāfēi. Zhè liǎng tiān dì yī jié kè shì kǎoshì, wǒ mǎi le liǎng bēi —— yì bēi gěi wǒ, yì bēi gěi gébì bān de lǎoshī, tā yě yào jiānkǎo.","m":"Last time you asked if I buy coffee before class every day. These days first period was a test, so I bought two — one for me and one for the teacher next door, who was invigilating too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝茶多还是喝咖啡多？","p":"Nǐ hē chá duō háishi hē kāfēi duō?","m":"Do you drink more tea or more coffee?"},"replies":[{"t":"茶多。","p":"Chá duō.","m":"More tea.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！在成都那两年，我学会了天天泡茶。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Zài Chéngdū nà liǎng nián, wǒ xuéhuì le tiāntiān pào chá.","m":"Same as me! In my two years in Chengdu I got into making tea every day."}},{"t":"咖啡多。","p":"Kāfēi duō.","m":"More coffee.","r":{"t":"那你也是靠咖啡开机的人，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ yě shì kào kāfēi kāijī de rén, hāha.","m":"So you also need coffee to switch on, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天第一节课前，我又来了一杯。","p":"Jīntiān dì yī jié kè qián, wǒ yòu lái le yì bēi.","m":"Had my coffee before first period again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"咖啡车的咖啡好喝吗？","p":"Kāfēichē de kāfēi hǎohē ma?","m":"Is the cart coffee any good?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过咖啡车的咖啡好不好喝（一般般，可是热乎乎又便宜）","en":"You asked if the cart coffee is any good (so-so, but hot and cheap)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问咖啡车的咖啡好不好喝。说实话，一般般。可是卖咖啡的大哥每天都记得我要什么。这两天他没出摊，我有点担心。后来他回来了，说他女儿发烧，他在家陪了两天。我跟他说：「女儿比咖啡重要。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn kāfēichē de kāfēi hǎo bu hǎohē. Shuō shíhuà, yìbānbān. Kěshì mài kāfēi de dàgē měi tiān dōu jìde wǒ yào shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān tā méi chū tān, wǒ yǒudiǎn dānxīn. Hòulái tā huílái le, shuō tā nǚ'ér fāshāo, tā zài jiā péi le liǎng tiān. Wǒ gēn tā shuō: “Nǚ'ér bǐ kāfēi zhòngyào.”","m":"Last time you asked if the cart coffee's any good. Honestly, so-so. But the guy who runs it always remembers my order. These days he didn't show up, and I got a bit worried. Then he came back — his daughter had a fever and he'd stayed home with her. I told him: 'Your daughter matters more than coffee.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天见到的人里，有没有不知道名字、可是会惦记的？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān jiàn dào de rén lǐ, yǒu méiyǒu bù zhīdào míngzi, kěshì huì diànjì de?","m":"Among the people you see every day, is there someone whose name you don't know but you'd miss?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"哪天问问他的名字吧，我也要去问。","p":"Nǎ tiān wènwen tā de míngzi ba, wǒ yě yào qù wèn.","m":"Ask their name one day — I'm going to ask his."}},{"t":"没想过。","p":"Méi xiǎng guo.","m":"Never thought about it.","r":{"t":"下次看看，说不定有。","p":"Xià cì kànkan, shuōbudìng yǒu.","m":"Look next time — there might be."}}],"next":{"t":"今天咖啡车大哥又出摊了。","p":"Jīntiān kāfēichē dàgē yòu chū tān le.","m":"The coffee cart guy was back out today."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的咖啡也很便宜。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de kāfēi yě hěn piányi.","m":"Coffee's cheap here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡也很便宜","en":"Coffee's cheap where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡也很便宜！这两天考试，我每天喝三杯 tinto。我妈说：「卡米拉，你的血里都是咖啡了。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēi yě hěn piányi! Zhè liǎng tiān kǎoshì, wǒ měi tiān hē sān bēi tinto. Wǒ mā shuō: “Kǎmǐlā, nǐ de xuè lǐ dōu shì kāfēi le.”","m":"You said coffee's cheap where you are too! I've got exams these days, so I'm drinking three tintos a day. My mum says: “Camila, your blood is all coffee now.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你累的时候喝什么？","p":"Nǐ lèi de shíhou hē shénme?","m":"What do you drink when you're tired?"},"replies":[{"t":"喝咖啡。","p":"Hē kāfēi.","m":"Coffee.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"喝茶，或者就喝水。","p":"Hē chá, huòzhě jiù hē shuǐ.","m":"Tea, or just water.","r":{"t":"喝水最好！我妈也这样说。","p":"Hē shuǐ zuì hǎo! Wǒ mā yě zhèyàng shuō.","m":"Water's best! My mum says that too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我已经喝了两杯了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yǐjīng hē le liǎng bēi le, hāha.","m":"Already on two coffees today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边一杯咖啡贵多了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yì bēi kāfēi guì duō le.","m":"A coffee's much more expensive here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边一杯咖啡贵多了","en":"Coffee's much pricier where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡贵多了。我告诉我外婆，她不相信。她说：「咖啡怎么会贵？哥伦比亚到处都是咖啡。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēi guì duō le. Wǒ gàosu wǒ wàipó, tā bù xiāngxìn. Tā shuō: “Kāfēi zěnme huì guì? Gēlúnbǐyà dàochù dōu shì kāfēi.”","m":"You said coffee's much pricier where you are. I told Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us) and she didn't believe it. She said: “How can coffee be expensive? Colombia is full of coffee.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边的人一般喝什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān de rén yìbān hē shénme?","m":"What do people usually drink where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"咖啡和茶都有。","p":"Kāfēi hé chá dōu yǒu.","m":"Both coffee and tea.","r":{"t":"等一下等一下……那你每天都要选，好难，哈哈。","p":"Děng yíxià děng yíxià …… nà nǐ měi tiān dōu yào xuǎn, hǎo nán, hāha.","m":"Wait, wait… so you have to choose every day — tough, haha."}},{"t":"茶比咖啡多。","p":"Chá bǐ kāfēi duō.","m":"More tea than coffee.","r":{"t":"我想多试试茶！我只喝过奶茶。","p":"Wǒ xiǎng duō shìshi chá! Wǒ zhǐ hēguo nǎichá.","m":"I want to try more tea! I've only had milk tea."}}],"next":{"t":"今天喝 tinto 的时候，想到你那边的咖啡好贵。","p":"Jīntiān hē tinto de shíhou, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān de kāfēi hǎo guì.","m":"Drinking my tinto today, I thought of how pricey coffee is where you are."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喝 tinto 加糖吗？","p":"Nǐ hē tinto jiā táng ma?","m":"Do you take sugar in your tinto?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喝 tinto 加不加糖（加一点点）","en":"You asked if she takes sugar in her tinto (just a little)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喝 tinto 加不加糖。这两天我试了不加糖……太苦了！我只喝了一口，就加了两勺。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ hē tinto jiā bu jiā táng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shì le bù jiā táng …… tài kǔ le! Wǒ zhǐ hē le yì kǒu, jiù jiā le liǎng sháo.","m":"Last time you asked if I take sugar in my tinto. These days I tried it without… so bitter! One sip, and I added two spoons.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢甜的还是苦的？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan tián de háishi kǔ de?","m":"Do you like sweet or bitter?"},"replies":[{"t":"甜的。","p":"Tián de.","m":"Sweet.","r":{"t":"我也是！我是很喜欢甜的。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ shì hěn xǐhuan tián de.","m":"Me too! I really love sweet things."}},{"t":"苦一点的，像黑巧克力。","p":"Kǔ yìdiǎn de, xiàng hēi qiǎokèlì.","m":"A bit bitter, like dark chocolate.","r":{"t":"你好成熟！我外婆也喜欢苦的。","p":"Nǐ hǎo chéngshú! Wǒ wàipó yě xǐhuan kǔ de.","m":"So grown-up! Abuela likes bitter things too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的 tinto 我加了一点点糖，刚刚好。","p":"Jīntiān de tinto wǒ jiā le yìdiǎndiǎn táng, gānggāng hǎo.","m":"A tiny bit of sugar in today's tinto — just right."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天都喝吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān dōu hē ma?","m":"Do you drink it every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天都喝（早上一杯、下午一杯，妈妈说太多）","en":"You asked if she drinks it every day (one in the morning, one in the afternoon — her mum says it's too much)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天都喝。现在我只喝早上那一杯了！下午我喝热巧克力。在波哥大，热巧克力里面放奶酪，你相信吗？","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān dōu hē. Xiànzài wǒ zhǐ hē zǎoshang nà yì bēi le! Xiàwǔ wǒ hē rè qiǎokèlì. Zài Bōgēdà, rè qiǎokèlì lǐmiàn fàng nǎilào, nǐ xiāngxìn ma?","m":"Last time you asked if I drink it every day. Now I only have the morning one! In the afternoon I have hot chocolate. In Bogotá we put cheese in hot chocolate — can you believe it?","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃过什么很奇怪、可是很好吃的组合？","p":"Nǐ chīguo shénme hěn qíguài, kěshì hěn hǎochī de zǔhé?","m":"What's a strange but delicious combination you've tried?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，水果蘸辣椒。","p":"Yǒu, shuǐguǒ zhàn làjiāo.","m":"Fruit dipped in chilli.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 我也想试试。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Wǒ yě xiǎng shìshi.","m":"¡Qué chévere! — so cool! I want to try that."}},{"t":"没有，我不敢乱试。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ bù gǎn luàn shì.","m":"None — I don't dare try weird stuff.","r":{"t":"哈哈，来波哥大，我让你试奶酪巧克力！","p":"Hāha, lái Bōgēdà, wǒ ràng nǐ shì nǎilào qiǎokèlì!","m":"Haha, come to Bogotá and I'll make you try cheese in chocolate!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天下午我没喝咖啡！我妈很高兴。","p":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ wǒ méi hē kāfēi! Wǒ mā hěn gāoxìng.","m":"No afternoon coffee today! My mum's happy."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常用券买咖啡。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng yòng quàn mǎi kāfēi.","m":"I often use coupons for coffee too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常用券买咖啡","en":"You often buy coffee with coupons too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常用券买咖啡。这两天我算了一下，一个月喝咖啡花了三百多块，差不多是我妈一个星期的菜钱。我决定一周只喝两杯，省下来的钱给我妈买点儿水果。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng yòng quàn mǎi kāfēi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ suàn le yíxià, yí gè yuè hē kāfēi huā le sānbǎi duō kuài, chàbuduō shì wǒ mā yí gè xīngqī de cài qián. Wǒ juédìng yì zhōu zhǐ hē liǎng bēi, shěng xiàlái de qián gěi wǒ mā mǎi diǎnr shuǐguǒ.","m":"You said you often use coupons for coffee too. These days I added it up: over 300 yuan a month on coffee — about what my mum spends on a week's groceries. I've decided on two cups a week, and the money I save goes on fruit for Mum.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买东西会特意等打折吗？","p":"Nǐ mǎi dōngxi huì tèyì děng dǎzhé ma?","m":"Do you wait for discounts before you buy things?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，不打折我不买。","p":"Huì, bù dǎzhé wǒ bù mǎi.","m":"Yes — no discount, no buy.","r":{"t":"咱俩一样，会过日子！","p":"Zán liǎ yíyàng, huì guò rìzi!","m":"We're the same — thrifty!"}},{"t":"不会，想买就买。","p":"Bú huì, xiǎng mǎi jiù mǎi.","m":"No — if I want it, I buy it.","r":{"t":"这样也痛快，不用天天算。","p":"Zhèyàng yě tòngkuai, bú yòng tiāntiān suàn.","m":"That's freeing too — no counting every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天忍住了，没用券。","p":"Jīntiān rěn zhù le, méi yòng quàn.","m":"Resisted today — no coupon."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边没有券，咖啡都很贵。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān méiyǒu quàn, kāfēi dōu hěn guì.","m":"No coupons where I am — coffee's expensive."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边没有券，咖啡都很贵","en":"No coupons where you are, and coffee's expensive"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边没有券，咖啡都很贵。这两天我跟同事说起这事儿，她说九块九是几家咖啡店在打价格战。她老公就在一家咖啡公司上班，最近天天加班，她很担心他会被裁员。便宜的咖啡后面，有人在辛苦。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān méiyǒu quàn, kāfēi dōu hěn guì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn tóngshì shuō qǐ zhè shìr, tā shuō jiǔ kuài jiǔ shì jǐ jiā kāfēi diàn zài dǎ jiàgé zhàn. Tā lǎogōng jiù zài yì jiā kāfēi gōngsī shàngbān, zuìjìn tiāntiān jiābān, tā hěn dānxīn tā huì bèi cáiyuán. Piányi de kāfēi hòumiàn, yǒu rén zài xīnkǔ.","m":"You said there are no coupons where you are and coffee's expensive. I mentioned it to a colleague: she said 9.9 is a price war between chains. Her husband works at one of those coffee companies — overtime every day lately — and she's worried he'll be laid off. Behind every cheap coffee, someone's working hard.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边，最近工作好找吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān, zuìjìn gōngzuò hǎo zhǎo ma?","m":"Where you are, is it easy to find work these days?"},"replies":[{"t":"不太好找。","p":"Bú tài hǎo zhǎo.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"哪儿都不容易，大家都加油。","p":"Nǎr dōu bù róngyì, dàjiā dōu jiāyóu.","m":"It's hard everywhere — hang in there, all of us."}},{"t":"还可以。","p":"Hái kěyǐ.","m":"Not bad.","r":{"t":"那就好，希望一直这样。","p":"Nà jiù hǎo, xīwàng yìzhí zhèyàng.","m":"Good — hope it stays that way."}}],"next":{"t":"今天买咖啡的时候，多跟店员说了一声谢谢。","p":"Jīntiān mǎi kāfēi de shíhou, duō gēn diànyuán shuō le yì shēng xièxie.","m":"Said an extra thank-you to the barista today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"九块九的拿铁好喝吗？","p":"Jiǔ kuài jiǔ de nátiě hǎohē ma?","m":"Is the 9.9-yuan latte any good?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过九块九的拿铁好不好喝（还不错，上班路上一杯正好）","en":"You asked if the 9.9 latte is any good (not bad — one on the way to work is just right)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问九块九的拿铁好不好喝。还不错。可是这两天我发现，我其实不是爱喝咖啡，是下午三点太困。我试了午饭后出去走十分钟，下午反而不困了，咖啡钱也省了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn jiǔ kuài jiǔ de nátiě hǎo bu hǎohē. Hái búcuò. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, wǒ qíshí bú shì ài hē kāfēi, shì xiàwǔ sān diǎn tài kùn. Wǒ shì le wǔfàn hòu chūqù zǒu shí fēnzhōng, xiàwǔ fǎn'ér bú kùn le, kāfēi qián yě shěng le.","m":"Last time you asked if the 9.9 latte is any good. Not bad. But these days I realised I don't actually love coffee — I'm just sleepy at three in the afternoon. I tried a ten-minute walk after lunch, and now I'm less sleepy — and I save the coffee money too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你下午困的时候，会怎么办？","p":"Nǐ xiàwǔ kùn de shíhou, huì zěnme bàn?","m":"What do you do when you're sleepy in the afternoon?"},"replies":[{"t":"喝咖啡或者茶。","p":"Hē kāfēi huòzhě chá.","m":"Coffee or tea.","r":{"t":"我以前也是。可以试试走十分钟。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě shì. Kěyǐ shìshi zǒu shí fēnzhōng.","m":"I used to as well. You could try a ten-minute walk."}},{"t":"站起来动一动。","p":"Zhàn qǐlái dòng yi dòng.","m":"Get up and move.","r":{"t":"对，身体动了，脑子就醒了。","p":"Duì, shēntǐ dòng le, nǎozi jiù xǐng le.","m":"Right — move your body and your brain wakes up."}}],"next":{"t":"今天午饭后出去走了一圈，太阳挺好。","p":"Jīntiān wǔfàn hòu chūqù zǒu le yì quān, tàiyáng tǐng hǎo.","m":"Took a walk after lunch today — nice sun."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一天喝几杯？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān hē jǐ bēi?","m":"How many do you have a day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一天喝几杯（一杯就够，喝多了睡不着）","en":"You asked how many she has a day (one's enough — more and she can't sleep)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一天喝几杯。这两天我破例了，下午又喝了一杯，结果夜里一点才睡着。说好的一杯就够呢？","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yì tiān hē jǐ bēi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ pòlì le, xiàwǔ yòu hē le yì bēi, jiéguǒ yèlǐ yì diǎn cái shuìzháo. Shuō hǎo de yì bēi jiù gòu ne?","m":"Last time you asked how many I have a day. These days I broke my own rule and had another in the afternoon — and didn't fall asleep till one in the morning. So much for “one's enough”.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝了咖啡，晚上睡得着吗？","p":"Nǐ hē le kāfēi, wǎnshang shuì de zháo ma?","m":"After coffee, can you still sleep at night?"},"replies":[{"t":"睡不着，我下午就不喝了。","p":"Shuì bu zháo, wǒ xiàwǔ jiù bù hē le.","m":"No — I don't have any after lunch.","r":{"t":"对，我也得这样。","p":"Duì, wǒ yě děi zhèyàng.","m":"Right, I need to do that too."}},{"t":"没事，喝了照样睡。","p":"Méi shì, hē le zhàoyàng shuì.","m":"No problem — I sleep anyway.","r":{"t":"真羡慕！你这是天生的。","p":"Zhēn xiànmù! Nǐ zhè shì tiānshēng de.","m":"So jealous! You were born that way."}}],"next":{"t":"今天只喝了一杯，说话算话。","p":"Jīntiān zhǐ hē le yì bēi, shuōhuà suànhuà.","m":"Just one cup today — true to my word."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常在便利店买咖啡。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng zài biànlìdiàn mǎi kāfēi.","m":"I often get coffee at the convenience store too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常在便利店买咖啡","en":"You often buy coffee at convenience stores too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常在便利店买咖啡！跟你说，这两天我的点数终于集满了！送的那一杯，我拿去给我妈。她每天很早就去上班，从来不买咖啡给自己。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng zài biànlìdiàn mǎi kāfēi! Gēn nǐ shuō, zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de diǎnshù zhōngyú jí mǎn le! Sòng de nà yì bēi, wǒ ná qù gěi wǒ mā. Tā měi tiān hěn zǎo jiù qù shàngbān, cónglái bù mǎi kāfēi gěi zìjǐ.","m":"You said you often buy coffee at convenience stores too! These days I finally filled my points card! I took the free cup to my mum. She goes to work so early every day and never buys herself a coffee.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近为家里人做过什么小事吗？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn wèi jiā lǐ rén zuò guo shénme xiǎo shì ma?","m":"Have you done something small for your family lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"小事最暖了。","p":"Xiǎo shì zuì nuǎn le.","m":"Small things are the warmest."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那这礼拜试一个，一杯咖啡也可以喔。","p":"Nà zhè lǐbài shì yí gè, yì bēi kāfēi yě kěyǐ o.","m":"Try one this week — even a coffee counts."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我妈说，那杯咖啡她喝了一整个早上，舍不得喝完。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ mā shuō, nà bēi kāfēi tā hē le yì zhěng gè zǎoshang, shěbude hē wán.","m":"Mum said today she made that coffee last the whole morning — didn't want to finish it."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边便利店没有咖啡。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān biànlìdiàn méiyǒu kāfēi.","m":"The convenience stores here don't sell coffee."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的便利店没有咖啡","en":"Convenience stores don't sell coffee where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的便利店没有咖啡，我好惊讶。这两天我数了一下，学校附近的便利商店可以买咖啡、缴费、寄包裹、印东西，还可以拿网购的东西！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de biànlìdiàn méiyǒu kāfēi, wǒ hǎo jīngyà. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shǔ le yíxià, xuéxiào fùjìn de biànlì shāngdiàn kěyǐ mǎi kāfēi, jiǎofèi, jì bāoguǒ, yìn dōngxi, hái kěyǐ ná wǎnggòu de dōngxi!","m":"You said convenience stores don't sell coffee where you are — I was so surprised. These days I counted what the store near campus does: coffee, paying bills, sending parcels, printing, and even picking up online orders!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边的便利店，你最常去做什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān de biànlìdiàn, nǐ zuì cháng qù zuò shénme?","m":"What do you mostly go to convenience stores for where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"买点吃的喝的。","p":"Mǎi diǎn chī de hē de.","m":"To grab food and drinks.","r":{"t":"那就够了！吃的最重要。","p":"Nà jiù gòu le! Chī de zuì zhòngyào.","m":"That's enough! Food matters most."}},{"t":"我们那边没有什么便利店。","p":"Wǒmen nàbiān méiyǒu shénme biànlìdiàn.","m":"We don't really have convenience stores.","r":{"t":"真的？那半夜饿了一定很辛苦，哈哈。","p":"Zhēnde? Nà bànyè è le yídìng hěn xīnkǔ, hāha.","m":"Really? Getting hungry at midnight must be tough, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"我今天在便利商店买咖啡，又想到你那边没有。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān zài biànlì shāngdiàn mǎi kāfēi, yòu xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān méiyǒu.","m":"Bought coffee at the convenience store today and remembered yours don't sell it."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"第二杯给谁喝？","p":"Dì-èr bēi gěi shéi hē?","m":"Who gets the second cup?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过第二杯给谁喝（给同学，下次她请）","en":"You asked who gets the second cup (a classmate — she pays next time)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我第二杯给谁喝。这两天我们发现，我们俩已经轮流请了一整个学期，算下来谁都没吃亏，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ dì èr bēi gěi shéi hē. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen fāxiàn, wǒmen liǎ yǐjīng lúnliú qǐng le yì zhěng gè xuéqī, suàn xiàlái shéi dōu méi chīkuī, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked who gets my second cup. These days we realised we've been taking turns all semester — added up, neither of us is out of pocket, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟朋友出去，一般谁付钱？","p":"Nǐ gēn péngyou chūqù, yìbān shéi fù qián?","m":"When you go out with friends, who usually pays?"},"replies":[{"t":"轮流请。","p":"Lúnliú qǐng.","m":"We take turns.","r":{"t":"跟我们一样！这样最自然。","p":"Gēn wǒmen yíyàng! Zhèyàng zuì zìrán.","m":"Same as us! That feels most natural."}},{"t":"各付各的。","p":"Gè fù gè de.","m":"We each pay our own.","r":{"t":"这样也很清楚，不会搞乱。","p":"Zhèyàng yě hěn qīngchu, bú huì gǎo luàn.","m":"That's clear too — nothing gets muddled."}}],"next":{"t":"今天轮到同学请我喝咖啡了！","p":"Jīntiān lún dào tóngxué qǐng wǒ hē kāfēi le!","m":"My classmate's turn to buy me coffee today!"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一天喝几杯？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān hē jǐ bēi?","m":"How many a day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一天喝几杯（一杯，期末两杯）","en":"You asked how many she has a day (one — two during finals)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一天喝几杯。这两天店里太忙了，下班的时候我已经喝了两杯，结果那天晚上一点都睡不着，第二天上课一直打瞌睡。店长说：「你们年轻人，一天一杯就好。」我现在乖乖听话。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yì tiān hē jǐ bēi. Zhè liǎng tiān diàn lǐ tài máng le, xiàbān de shíhou wǒ yǐjīng hē le liǎng bēi, jiéguǒ nà tiān wǎnshang yìdiǎn dōu shuì bu zháo, dì èr tiān shàngkè yìzhí dǎ kēshuì. Diànzhǎng shuō: “Nǐmen niánqīng rén, yì tiān yì bēi jiù hǎo.” Wǒ xiànzài guāiguāi tīnghuà.","m":"Last time you asked how many I have a day. The shop's been so busy that I'd had two by the end of my shift — then I couldn't sleep at all and kept nodding off in class the next day. My manager said: 'You young people — one a day is plenty.' I'm doing as I'm told now.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一天最多喝过几杯咖啡？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān zuì duō hēguo jǐ bēi kāfēi?","m":"What's the most coffee you've had in one day?"},"replies":[{"t":"三杯，那天要赶一个东西。","p":"Sān bēi, nà tiān yào gǎn yí gè dōngxi.","m":"Three — I had a deadline that day.","r":{"t":"三杯！你那天一定心跳很快。","p":"Sān bēi! Nǐ nà tiān yídìng xīntiào hěn kuài.","m":"Three! Your heart must've been racing."}},{"t":"一杯，再多就不舒服。","p":"Yì bēi, zài duō jiù bù shūfu.","m":"One — any more and I feel bad.","r":{"t":"你比我懂得照顾自己。","p":"Nǐ bǐ wǒ dǒng de zhàogù zìjǐ.","m":"You're better at looking after yourself than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我只喝了一杯！","p":"Jīntiān wǒ zhǐ hē le yì bēi!","m":"Only one cup today!"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的咖啡馆也会给一杯水。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de kāfēiguǎn yě huì gěi yì bēi shuǐ.","m":"Cafés here give you a glass of water too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡馆也会给一杯水","en":"Cafés where you are bring you a glass of water too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡馆也会给一杯水。这两天我问了老板：为什么要给水？他说，先喝一口水，嘴里干净了，才喝得出咖啡的味道。准确地说，这是他爷爷说的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēiguǎn yě huì gěi yì bēi shuǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn le lǎobǎn: wèishénme yào gěi shuǐ? Tā shuō, xiān hē yì kǒu shuǐ, zuǐ lǐ gānjìng le, cái hē de chū kāfēi de wèidao. Zhǔnquè de shuō, zhè shì tā yéye shuō de.","m":"You said cafés where you are bring water too. These days I asked the owner why. He said: take a sip of water first to clear your mouth, and then you can really taste the coffee. To be precise, that's what his grandfather said.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝咖啡的时候，喜欢配什么？","p":"Nǐ hē kāfēi de shíhou, xǐhuan pèi shénme?","m":"What do you like to have with your coffee?"},"replies":[{"t":"一块小点心。","p":"Yí kuài xiǎo diǎnxin.","m":"A little pastry.","r":{"t":"我也是！埃及的点心都很甜，配苦咖啡正好。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Āijí de diǎnxin dōu hěn tián, pèi kǔ kāfēi zhènghǎo.","m":"Me too! Egyptian sweets are very sweet — perfect with bitter coffee."}},{"t":"什么都不配，就喝咖啡。","p":"Shénme dōu bú pèi, jiù hē kāfēi.","m":"Nothing — just the coffee.","r":{"t":"这样最纯粹。","p":"Zhèyàng zuì chúncuì.","m":"That's the purest way."}}],"next":{"t":"今天老板又给我端了一杯水，我想到了你。","p":"Jīntiān lǎobǎn yòu gěi wǒ duān le yì bēi shuǐ, wǒ xiǎng dào le nǐ.","m":"The owner brought me water again today and I thought of you."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没喝过土耳其咖啡。","p":"Wǒ hái méi hēguo Tǔ'ěrqí kāfēi.","m":"I've never had Turkish coffee."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没喝过土耳其咖啡","en":"You've never had Turkish coffee"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没喝过土耳其咖啡。跟你说个好玩的：我们这里有人喝完以后，把杯子倒过来，看咖啡渣的样子「算命」。我妈很喜欢，可是她算的从来没准过，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi hēguo Tǔ'ěrqí kāfēi. Gēn nǐ shuō gè hǎowán de: wǒmen zhèlǐ yǒu rén hē wán yǐhòu, bǎ bēizi dào guòlái, kàn kāfēi zhā de yàngzi “suànmìng”. Wǒ mā hěn xǐhuan, kěshì tā suàn de cónglái méi zhǔnguo, hāha.","m":"You said you've never had Turkish coffee. Here's a fun one: some people here turn the cup upside down when they finish and “read” the grounds to tell your fortune. My mum loves it — but she's never once been right, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有什么好玩的小习惯，跟喝东西有关？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu shénme hǎowán de xiǎo xíguàn, gēn hē dōngxi yǒuguān?","m":"Where you are, is there a fun little custom around drinks?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，喝之前大家要碰杯。","p":"Yǒu, hē zhīqián dàjiā yào pèng bēi.","m":"Yes — people clink glasses before drinking.","r":{"t":"碰杯我知道！中国游客也很喜欢说「干杯」。","p":"Pèng bēi wǒ zhīdào! Zhōngguó yóukè yě hěn xǐhuan shuō “gānbēi”.","m":"I know clinking! Chinese tourists love saying 干杯 too."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那你来开罗，我给你看一次咖啡渣，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ lái Kāiluó, wǒ gěi nǐ kàn yí cì kāfēi zhā, hāha.","m":"Then when you come to Cairo, I'll read your cup, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又喝了一杯土耳其咖啡，最后一口没喝。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu hē le yì bēi Tǔ'ěrqí kāfēi, zuìhòu yì kǒu méi hē.","m":"Had another Turkish coffee today — skipped the last sip."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你常去那家老咖啡馆吗？","p":"Nǐ cháng qù nà jiā lǎo kāfēiguǎn ma?","m":"Do you go to that old café a lot?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她常不常去那家老咖啡馆（常去，老板知道她要少糖）","en":"You asked if she often goes to that old café (yes — the owner knows she takes little sugar)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我常不常去那家老咖啡馆。这两天老板听说我要申请去台湾读书，问我：「台湾有土耳其咖啡吗？」我说不知道。他说：「那你带一包咖啡粉去。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ cháng bu cháng qù nà jiā lǎo kāfēiguǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān lǎobǎn tīngshuō wǒ yào shēnqǐng qù Táiwān dúshū, wèn wǒ: “Táiwān yǒu Tǔ'ěrqí kāfēi ma?” Wǒ shuō bù zhīdào. Tā shuō: “Nà nǐ dài yì bāo kāfēi fěn qù.”","m":"Last time you asked if I often go to that old café. These days the owner heard I'm applying to study in Taiwan and asked: “Do they have Turkish coffee in Taiwan?” I said I didn't know. He said: “Then take a bag of coffee with you.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你去别的地方住，你会带上什么家乡的东西？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ qù bié de dìfang zhù, nǐ huì dài shang shénme jiāxiāng de dōngxi?","m":"If you moved somewhere else, what would you take from home?"},"replies":[{"t":"家里的茶叶。","p":"Jiā lǐ de cháyè.","m":"Tea from home.","r":{"t":"好主意！家里的味道最让人想念。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi! Jiā lǐ de wèidao zuì ràng rén xiǎngniàn.","m":"Good idea! The taste of home is what you miss most."}},{"t":"一张全家的照片。","p":"Yì zhāng quán jiā de zhàopiàn.","m":"A family photo.","r":{"t":"这个最重要，我也要带一张。","p":"Zhège zuì zhòngyào, wǒ yě yào dài yì zhāng.","m":"That matters most — I'll take one too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天老板又给我少放了糖，不用我说。","p":"Jīntiān lǎobǎn yòu gěi wǒ shǎo fàng le táng, bú yòng wǒ shuō.","m":"The owner went easy on the sugar again today without me asking."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在咖啡馆练中文吗？","p":"Nǐ zài kāfēiguǎn liàn Zhōngwén ma?","m":"Do you practise Chinese at the café?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在咖啡馆练不练中文（有时候，在那里背演讲稿）","en":"You asked if she practises Chinese at the café (sometimes — she rehearses there)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在咖啡馆练不练中文。这两天我在那里背自我介绍，背得太大声，旁边的大叔都学会了一句：「大家好，我叫努尔。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài kāfēiguǎn liàn bu liàn Zhōngwén. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài nàlǐ bèi zìwǒ jièshào, bèi de tài dàshēng, pángbiān de dàshū dōu xuéhuì le yí jù: “Dàjiā hǎo, wǒ jiào Nǔ'ěr.”","m":"Last time you asked if I practise Chinese at the café. These days I've been rehearsing my self-introduction there — so loudly that the man at the next table has learned a line: “Hello everyone, my name is Nour.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你练外语的时候，会大声说出来吗？","p":"Nǐ liàn wàiyǔ de shíhou, huì dàshēng shuō chūlái ma?","m":"When you practise a language, do you say it out loud?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，在家大声说。","p":"Huì, zài jiā dàshēng shuō.","m":"Yes, out loud at home.","r":{"t":"好习惯！说出来才记得住。","p":"Hǎo xíguàn! Shuō chūlái cái jì de zhù.","m":"Good habit! Saying it is how it sticks."}},{"t":"不太好意思，一般小声说。","p":"Bú tài hǎoyìsi, yìbān xiǎoshēng shuō.","m":"I'm a bit shy — usually quietly.","r":{"t":"小声也算！我以前也这样。","p":"Xiǎoshēng yě suàn! Wǒ yǐqián yě zhèyàng.","m":"Quietly counts too! I used to do that."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又在咖啡馆背了一遍自我介绍。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu zài kāfēiguǎn bèi le yí biàn zìwǒ jièshào.","m":"Ran through my self-introduction at the café again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常喝速溶咖啡。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng hē sùróng kāfēi.","m":"I drink instant coffee a lot too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常喝速溶咖啡","en":"You often drink instant coffee too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常喝速溶咖啡！这两天中国同事带来一种三合一的，超甜。我喝了一包，下午干活特别有劲，可是晚上翻来覆去睡不着。我太太说：「你下午喝的不是咖啡，是糖。」现在我一天最多一包。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng hē sùróng kāfēi! Zhè liǎng tiān Zhōngguó tóngshì dài lái yì zhǒng sān hé yī de, chāo tián. Wǒ hē le yì bāo, xiàwǔ gàn huó tèbié yǒu jìn, kěshì wǎnshang fān lái fù qù shuì bu zháo. Wǒ tàitai shuō: “Nǐ xiàwǔ hē de bú shì kāfēi, shì táng.” Xiànzài wǒ yì tiān zuì duō yì bāo.","m":"You said you often drink instant coffee too! These days my Chinese colleagues brought a three-in-one kind — super sweet. I had a sachet and worked like crazy all afternoon, then tossed and turned all night. My wife said: 'That wasn't coffee, it was sugar.' Now it's one sachet a day, max.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝咖啡喜欢甜的吗？","p":"Nǐ hē kāfēi xǐhuan tián de ma?","m":"Do you like your coffee sweet?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢，越甜越好。","p":"Xǐhuan, yuè tián yuè hǎo.","m":"Yes, the sweeter the better.","r":{"t":"那你一定喜欢三合一！","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng xǐhuan sān hé yī!","m":"Then you'd love three-in-one!"}},{"t":"不喜欢，我喝不加糖的。","p":"Bù xǐhuan, wǒ hē bù jiā táng de.","m":"No, I take it without sugar.","r":{"t":"厉害！我太太也是，她说上夜班喝甜的会困。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ tàitai yě shì, tā shuō shàng yèbān hē tián de huì kùn.","m":"Impressive! My wife too — she says sweet drinks make her sleepy on night shifts."}}],"next":{"t":"今天只喝了一包，晚上睡得很好。","p":"Jīntiān zhǐ hē le yì bāo, wǎnshang shuì de hěn hǎo.","m":"Just one sachet today — slept well."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我不太喝咖啡，喝茶多。","p":"Wǒ bú tài hē kāfēi, hē chá duō.","m":"I don't drink much coffee — more tea."},"mem":{"zh":"你不太喝咖啡，喝茶多","en":"You don't drink much coffee — more tea"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你喝茶多。这两天我也学中国同事，买了一个大杯子，放了一把茶叶。结果下午加了三次水，茶都变成白开水了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hē chá duō. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě xué Zhōngguó tóngshì, mǎi le yí gè dà bēizi, fàng le yì bǎ cháyè. Jiéguǒ xiàwǔ jiā le sān cì shuǐ, chá dōu biàn chéng báikāishuǐ le, hāha.","m":"You said you drink more tea. These days I copied my Chinese colleagues — bought a big mug and put in a handful of tea leaves. By the afternoon I'd topped it up three times and it had turned into plain hot water, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝茶喜欢喝什么茶？","p":"Nǐ hē chá xǐhuan hē shénme chá?","m":"What kind of tea do you like?"},"replies":[{"t":"绿茶。","p":"Lǜchá.","m":"Green tea.","r":{"t":"我同事也喝绿茶！他说是从杭州带来的。","p":"Wǒ tóngshì yě hē lǜchá! Tā shuō shì cóng Hángzhōu dài lái de.","m":"My colleague drinks green tea too! He says it's from Hangzhou."}},{"t":"红茶，加奶。","p":"Hóngchá, jiā nǎi.","m":"Black tea with milk.","r":{"t":"这个我们尼日利亚也喝！早上一杯，配面包。","p":"Zhège wǒmen Nírìlìyà yě hē! Zǎoshang yì bēi, pèi miànbāo.","m":"We drink that in Nigeria too! A cup in the morning with bread."}}],"next":{"t":"今天看同事泡茶，我也想试试。","p":"Jīntiān kàn tóngshì pào chá, wǒ yě xiǎng shìshi.","m":"Watching my colleagues make tea today, I want to try it too."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一天喝几包？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān hē jǐ bāo?","m":"How many sachets a day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他一天喝几包（两包，早上下午各一包）","en":"You asked how many sachets a day (two — one morning, one afternoon)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一天喝几包。这两天开会，我给新来的经理当翻译，一开就是一个小时，我喝了三包。翻译比搬砖还累！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yì tiān hē jǐ bāo. Zhè liǎng tiān kāihuì, wǒ gěi xīn lái de jīnglǐ dāng fānyì, yì kāi jiù shì yí gè xiǎoshí, wǒ hē le sān bāo. Fānyì bǐ bān zhuān hái lèi!","m":"Last time you asked how many sachets I have a day. These days I interpreted for the new manager in an hour-long meeting, and I had three. Interpreting is more tiring than carrying bricks!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你累的时候靠什么提神？","p":"Nǐ lèi de shíhou kào shénme tíshén?","m":"What perks you up when you're tired?"},"replies":[{"t":"喝咖啡。","p":"Hē kāfēi.","m":"Coffee.","r":{"t":"一样！咖啡是我的好朋友。","p":"Yíyàng! Kāfēi shì wǒ de hǎo péngyou.","m":"Same! Coffee is my good friend."}},{"t":"出去走一走。","p":"Chūqù zǒu yi zǒu.","m":"A short walk outside.","r":{"t":"这个好！可是我在工地上走一走，就会有人叫我干活，哈哈。","p":"Zhège hǎo! Kěshì wǒ zài gōngdì shang zǒu yi zǒu, jiù huì yǒu rén jiào wǒ gàn huó, hāha.","m":"Good one! But if I walk around the site, someone gives me a job, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天两包，没有多喝。","p":"Jīntiān liǎng bāo, méiyǒu duō hē.","m":"Two sachets today, no more."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"中国同事也喝咖啡吗？","p":"Zhōngguó tóngshì yě hē kāfēi ma?","m":"Do your Chinese colleagues drink coffee too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过中国同事喝不喝咖啡（年轻的喝，年纪大的喝茶）","en":"You asked if his Chinese colleagues drink coffee (the young ones do; the older ones drink tea)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问中国同事喝不喝咖啡。这两天食堂的四川师傅也开始喝咖啡了！他说是跟我学的。我说：「师傅，你教我吃辣，我教你喝咖啡。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Zhōngguó tóngshì hē bu hē kāfēi. Zhè liǎng tiān shítáng de Sìchuān shīfu yě kāishǐ hē kāfēi le! Tā shuō shì gēn wǒ xué de. Wǒ shuō: “Shīfu, nǐ jiāo wǒ chī là, wǒ jiāo nǐ hē kāfēi.”","m":"Last time you asked if my Chinese colleagues drink coffee. These days the Sichuan cook in the canteen has started too! He says he learned it from me. I said: “Shifu, you taught me chilli, I'll teach you coffee.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有没有人，你教他一样东西，他教你一样东西？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu méiyǒu rén, nǐ jiāo tā yí yàng dōngxi, tā jiāo nǐ yí yàng dōngxi?","m":"Is there someone you swap things with — you teach them one thing, they teach you another?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我跟朋友互相教语言。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ gēn péngyou hùxiāng jiāo yǔyán.","m":"Yes — a friend and I teach each other languages.","r":{"t":"这样学最快！","p":"Zhèyàng xué zuì kuài!","m":"That's the fastest way to learn!"}},{"t":"还没有，不过我想找一个。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, búguò wǒ xiǎng zhǎo yí gè.","m":"Not yet, but I'd like to find someone.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题！先从一句话开始。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí! Xiān cóng yí jù huà kāishǐ.","m":"No problem, no problem! Start with one sentence."}}],"next":{"t":"今天食堂的师傅问我咖啡好不好喝，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān shítáng de shīfu wèn wǒ kāfēi hǎo bu hǎohē, hāha.","m":"The canteen cook asked me today if coffee tastes good, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Coffee's about the same here.","p":"","m":"我这边的咖啡也差不多这个价。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡也差不多这个价","en":"Coffee costs about the same where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said coffee's about the same where you are. Since then I've found a café near the office that does a flat white for three pounds if you bring your own cup. That's seventy-five pence a day. I'm basically rich now.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的咖啡也差不多这个价。后来我在办公室附近找到一家咖啡馆，自己带杯子，一杯 flat white 只要三镑。一天省七十五便士。我现在基本算有钱人了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you take your own cup to cafés?","p":"","m":"你去咖啡馆会自己带杯子吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I always carry one.","p":"","m":"会，我一直带着一个。","r":{"t":"Look at you — way ahead of me.","p":"","m":"你比我早走了好几步。"}},{"t":"No, I always forget.","p":"","m":"不会，我老是忘。","r":{"t":"Same. Mine's still in the cupboard.","p":"","m":"我也是。我的杯子还在柜子里。"}}],"next":{"t":"Three seventy-five again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是三镑七十五。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Coffee's much cheaper here.","p":"","m":"我这边的咖啡便宜多了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡便宜多了","en":"Coffee's much cheaper where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said coffee's much cheaper where you are. I told my flatmates and we ranked where we'd move for cheap coffee. Nobody agreed on anything, but it filled an evening.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的咖啡便宜多了。我告诉了室友们，我们排了个名：为了便宜咖啡搬去哪儿。谁也没说服谁，不过打发了一个晚上。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What would you say is a fair price for a coffee?","p":"","m":"你觉得一杯咖啡多少钱算公道？"},"replies":[{"t":"About the same as a bus ticket.","p":"","m":"跟一张公交车票差不多。","r":{"t":"That's a nice way to measure it. I'm stealing that.","p":"","m":"这个算法好。我借用了。"}},{"t":"If it's good, I don't mind paying more.","p":"","m":"好喝的话，贵一点也行。","r":{"t":"Fair. A good one's worth it.","p":"","m":"有道理。好咖啡值这个钱。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still dreaming about your cheap coffee.","p":"","m":"还在想你那边便宜的咖啡。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why is oat milk extra?","p":"","m":"燕麦奶为什么要另外加钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过燕麦奶为什么要加钱（很多咖啡馆还这样，燕麦奶成本高）","en":"You asked why oat milk costs extra (lots of cafés still charge — it costs them more)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why oat milk's extra. I write about money, so I couldn't let it go — I asked our barista. She said a carton of oat milk costs them a lot more than cow's milk. Mystery solved, sort of.","p":"","m":"你上次问燕麦奶为什么要加钱。我是写钱的记者，这个问题放不下——就去问了咖啡师。她说一盒燕麦奶的进价比牛奶贵不少。谜底算是揭开了吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What kind of milk do you have in your coffee, if any?","p":"","m":"你的咖啡加什么奶？还是不加？"},"replies":[{"t":"Normal milk.","p":"","m":"普通的牛奶。","r":{"t":"Classic. Cheaper too.","p":"","m":"经典。还便宜。"}},{"t":"No milk — just black.","p":"","m":"不加，喝黑的。","r":{"t":"Even cheaper. You win.","p":"","m":"更便宜了。你赢了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Paid for oat milk again today. Still not sure why, haha.","p":"","m":"今天又为燕麦奶多付了钱。还是不太明白为什么，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many do you have a day?","p":"","m":"你一天喝几杯？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他一天喝几杯（两杯，赶稿那天三杯）","en":"You asked how many he has a day (two — three on deadline days)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many coffees I have a day. Two, three on deadline days. My big flat-sharing piece came out on the twenty-fourth — so you can guess. Four. I didn't sleep much.","p":"","m":"你上次问我一天喝几杯。两杯，赶稿那天三杯。我那篇讲合租的大稿子 24 号登出来——所以你猜得到。四杯。没怎么睡。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What gets you through a busy day?","p":"","m":"忙的时候，什么能帮你撑下来？"},"replies":[{"t":"Coffee, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，咖啡。","r":{"t":"Honest answer. Same here.","p":"","m":"老实话。我也是。"}},{"t":"A short walk outside.","p":"","m":"出去走一小会儿。","r":{"t":"Better idea than four coffees, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，比四杯咖啡强。"}}],"next":{"t":"Deadline week, so three cups already today.","p":"","m":"这周赶稿，今天已经三杯了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Coffee's cheap here too.","p":"","m":"我这边的咖啡也很便宜。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡也便宜","en":"Coffee's cheap where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said coffee's cheap there too. This week my colleague Jess tried my cart coffee for the first time. She said, 'Wow, this is… fine.' Then she bought another one. Honestly, I think she likes it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的咖啡也便宜。这周我同事 Jess 第一次尝了我的咖啡车咖啡。她说：「哇，这个……还行。」然后又买了一杯。说实话，我觉得她挺喜欢的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a cheap thing you really love?","p":"","m":"有没有什么便宜、你又特别喜欢的东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Street food.","p":"","m":"路边小吃。","r":{"t":"Yes! Cheap and the best.","p":"","m":"对！又便宜又最好吃。"}},{"t":"Second-hand books.","p":"","m":"二手书。","r":{"t":"Nice. Old books have stories inside.","p":"","m":"不错。旧书里面有故事。"}}],"next":{"t":"Two-dollar coffee again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是两块钱的咖啡。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Coffee's really expensive here.","p":"","m":"我这边的咖啡很贵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的咖啡很贵","en":"Coffee's really expensive where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said coffee's really expensive where you are. I told my mom in Seoul — she said it's expensive there too, so lots of people bring coffee from home in a little bottle. Maybe I'll try that.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的咖啡很贵。我跟在首尔的妈妈说了——她说那边也贵，所以很多人用小瓶子从家里带咖啡。也许我也试试。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you drink coffee every day?","p":"","m":"你每天都喝咖啡吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, at least one.","p":"","m":"喝，至少一杯。","r":{"t":"Same. One is the minimum.","p":"","m":"我也是。一杯是最低标准。"}},{"t":"Not really. I don't need it.","p":"","m":"不怎么喝。我不需要。","r":{"t":"Wow. I wish I was like you.","p":"","m":"哇。真希望我也能这样。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your expensive coffee. Hope you had a good one today.","p":"","m":"想起你那边很贵的咖啡。希望你今天喝到了好喝的。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it good coffee?","p":"","m":"咖啡好喝吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过咖啡车的咖啡好不好喝（一般，可是又热又快又便宜）","en":"You asked if the cart coffee is good (not amazing — but hot, fast and cheap)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's good coffee. Not amazing, I said. This week a client took me to a fancy café — seven dollars a cup. It was amazing. The next morning I went back to my cart. Honestly, I missed it.","p":"","m":"你上次问那咖啡好不好喝。我说一般。这周一个客户带我去了一家高级咖啡馆——七块钱一杯。确实很好喝。第二天早上，我又回到了咖啡车。说实话，我想它了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you fussy about coffee?","p":"","m":"你对咖啡讲究吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, quite fussy.","p":"","m":"挺讲究的。","r":{"t":"Then don't try my cart coffee, haha.","p":"","m":"那你别尝我的咖啡车咖啡，哈哈。"}},{"t":"No, anything hot is fine.","p":"","m":"不讲究，热的就行。","r":{"t":"Same team. Hot and cheap.","p":"","m":"同一队。热的、便宜的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cart coffee today: still not amazing. Still love it.","p":"","m":"今天的咖啡车咖啡：还是一般。还是爱它。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you buy one every day?","p":"","m":"你每天都买吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他是不是每天都买（每天早上，同一个人）","en":"You asked if he buys one every day (every morning, from the same guy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I buy one every day. Every morning, same guy. This week he wasn't there for two days and I was worried. Then he came back — he'd just had a cold. Honestly, I was so relieved.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是每天都买。每天早上，同一个人。这周他有两天没出来，我还担心了。后来他回来了——只是感冒了。说实话，我松了一大口气。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there someone you see every day but don't really know?","p":"","m":"有没有一个你天天见、却不太认识的人？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, the bus driver.","p":"","m":"有，公交车司机。","r":{"t":"Nice. Maybe one day you'll say hi.","p":"","m":"真好。也许哪天你会打个招呼。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"好像没有。","r":{"t":"In a big city, it's easy to miss people.","p":"","m":"在大城市，很容易擦肩而过。"}}],"next":{"t":"My coffee guy says hi — kind of.","p":"","m":"我的咖啡大哥向你问好——算是吧。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We get free refills here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也能免费续杯。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边续杯也免费","en":"You get free refills where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said you get free refills there too. This week I drank my refill so slowly that the café started closing around me. They began stacking chairs. Very Swedish: nobody said anything.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边续杯也免费。这周我续的那杯喝得太慢，咖啡馆都开始打烊了，店员开始叠椅子。很瑞典：谁也没说什么。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like to sit in cafés for a long time?","p":"","m":"你喜欢在咖啡馆坐很久吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, for hours.","p":"","m":"喜欢，一坐好几个小时。","r":{"t":"Ja, a good café is a second living room.","p":"","m":"是啊，好的咖啡馆就像第二个客厅。"}},{"t":"No, I take it to go.","p":"","m":"不，我一般带走。","r":{"t":"Fair. Busy life.","p":"","m":"有道理。生活忙嘛。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took my refill again today, of course.","p":"","m":"今天当然又续杯了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There are no refills where I live.","p":"","m":"我这边不能续杯。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边没有续杯","en":"There are no refills where you live"},"later":{"t":"You said there are no refills where you live. I told my colleagues and they were shocked. One said, 'But then how do you fika properly?' I said: probably with one very big cup.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边没有续杯。我告诉同事们，他们都很吃惊。有一个说：「那他们怎么好好 fika？」我说：大概用一个特别大的杯子吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you take a break during the day?","p":"","m":"白天你怎么歇一会儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"With a drink and my phone.","p":"","m":"喝点东西，看看手机。","r":{"t":"That's a little fika too.","p":"","m":"这也是一个小小的 fika。"}},{"t":"I don't really take breaks.","p":"","m":"我不怎么休息。","r":{"t":"Then try ten minutes. Friendly orders from Malmö.","p":"","m":"那试试十分钟。来自马尔默的友好命令。"}}],"next":{"t":"Had a refill for you today.","p":"","m":"今天替你续了一杯。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Where do you usually go for coffee?","p":"","m":"你一般去哪儿喝咖啡？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一般去哪儿喝咖啡（公园旁的小咖啡馆，店员知道她点什么）","en":"You asked where she goes for coffee (a little café by the park — they know her order)"},"later":{"t":"You asked where I go for coffee. The little café by the park. This week they put candles on every table and a straw goat in the window — Christmas is coming.","p":"","m":"你上次问我一般去哪儿喝咖啡。公园旁边那家小咖啡馆。这周他们在每张桌子上点了蜡烛，窗口还摆了一只稻草山羊——圣诞节快到了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do cafés where you live decorate for holidays?","p":"","m":"你那边的咖啡馆过节会布置吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, lights everywhere.","p":"","m":"会，到处都是灯。","r":{"t":"Lovely. Lights make winter easier.","p":"","m":"真好。灯让冬天好过一点。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Then you'd laugh at our goat.","p":"","m":"那你看到我们的稻草羊会笑的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Same café, same order today.","p":"","m":"今天同一家咖啡馆，同样的点单。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you drink coffee every day?","p":"","m":"你每天都喝咖啡吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天喝咖啡（当然，她是瑞典人）","en":"You asked if she drinks coffee every day (of course — she's Swedish)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I drink coffee every day. Of course! I counted this week: five cups on Tuesday. To be fair, two were refills. My husband says that still counts.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是每天喝咖啡。当然！这周我数了一下：周二喝了五杯。说句公道话，有两杯是续的。我老公说那也算。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you drink most in a day?","p":"","m":"你一天里喝得最多的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Water.","p":"","m":"水。","r":{"t":"The healthy answer. I'm impressed.","p":"","m":"健康的答案。佩服。"}},{"t":"Tea.","p":"","m":"茶。","r":{"t":"Tea is nice too. Gentler than five coffees.","p":"","m":"茶也好。比五杯咖啡温和。"}}],"next":{"t":"Coffee number three today. Don't tell my husband.","p":"","m":"今天第三杯了。别告诉我老公。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-23|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-23","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Friday's my treat day too.","p":"","m":"星期五也是我犒劳自己的日子。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也是周五犒劳自己","en":"Friday's your treat day too"},"later":{"t":"You said Friday's your treat day too! This week a passenger gave me a big tip, so I had my treat on Tuesday. Don't tell my wife, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是周五犒劳自己！这周有个乘客给了我很多小费，所以我周二就犒劳了自己。别告诉我老婆，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite treat?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢用什么犒劳自己？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something sweet.","p":"","m":"甜的东西。","r":{"t":"Same! Sweet is the best treat.","p":"","m":"我也是！甜的最好。"}},{"t":"A good meal out.","p":"","m":"出去好好吃一顿。","r":{"t":"Nice! Good food, good life.","p":"","m":"好！好吃的，好日子。"}}],"next":{"t":"Friday's coming, bro — coffee time soon!","p":"","m":"周五快到了，兄弟——又能喝咖啡了！"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I just drink coffee at home.","p":"","m":"我就在家喝咖啡。"},"mem":{"zh":"你一般在家喝咖啡","en":"You just drink coffee at home"},"later":{"t":"You said you just drink coffee at home. So I tried. My wife made kopi tubruk — coffee with the grounds right in the cup. Very strong! I had to wait five minutes for the grounds to go down.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一般在家喝咖啡。所以我也试了。我老婆煮了 kopi tubruk——咖啡粉直接冲在杯子里。特别浓！我等了五分钟，咖啡渣才沉下去。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you make coffee at home?","p":"","m":"你在家怎么做咖啡？"},"replies":[{"t":"Instant — quick and easy.","p":"","m":"速溶的，又快又简单。","r":{"t":"Instant is good. No waiting!","p":"","m":"速溶好。不用等！"}},{"t":"With a machine.","p":"","m":"用机器。","r":{"t":"Fancy! In my house, just hot water and a spoon.","p":"","m":"高级！我们家就用热水和一把勺子。"}}],"next":{"t":"Home coffee today too, bro.","p":"","m":"今天也在家喝咖啡，兄弟。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's palm sugar like?","p":"","m":"椰糖是什么味道的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过棕榈糖是什么味道（甜，有点像焦糖）","en":"You asked what palm sugar tastes like (sweet, a bit like caramel)"},"later":{"t":"You asked about palm sugar. This week I saw it at the market — it comes in hard brown blocks, like small bricks. My daughter thought it was chocolate and licked it. Then she smiled. She liked it!","p":"","m":"你上次问棕榈糖。这周我在市场上看到了——一块一块硬硬的、棕色的，像小砖头。我女儿以为是巧克力，舔了一下。然后她笑了。她喜欢！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like sweet drinks?","p":"","m":"你喜欢甜的饮料吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, very much.","p":"","m":"很喜欢。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love Indonesian coffee, bro.","p":"","m":"那你一定会爱上印尼咖啡，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Not really — too sweet for me.","p":"","m":"不太喜欢，对我来说太甜。","r":{"t":"Then here you must say 'less sugar'. Very important!","p":"","m":"那在这儿一定要说「少糖」。很重要！"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about palm sugar. Sweet day to you, bro.","p":"","m":"还在想棕榈糖。祝你今天甜甜的，兄弟。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do your kids drink it too?","p":"","m":"你的孩子也喝吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他孩子喝不喝（不喝，咖啡太多了，不过他们想尝一口）","en":"You asked if his kids drink it (no, too much coffee — but they want a sip)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if my kids drink it. No! But this week my wife made them a 'kids' coffee' — warm milk with a little palm sugar. Now they feel very grown-up.","p":"","m":"你上次问我孩子喝不喝。不喝！不过这周我老婆给他们做了「儿童咖啡」——温牛奶加一点棕榈糖。现在他们觉得自己是大人了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When did you first try coffee?","p":"","m":"你第一次喝咖啡是什么时候？"},"replies":[{"t":"As a teenager.","p":"","m":"十几岁的时候。","r":{"t":"Same as me. First sip — so bitter!","p":"","m":"跟我一样。第一口——好苦！"}},{"t":"I still don't drink it.","p":"","m":"我到现在还不喝。","r":{"t":"Then you are like my kids, haha.","p":"","m":"那你跟我的孩子一样，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"The kids tried to steal my coffee again today, haha.","p":"","m":"孩子们今天又想偷喝我的咖啡，哈哈。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-24|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-11-24","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边一碗面也差不多这个价。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yì wǎn miàn yě chàbuduō zhège jià.","m":"A bowl of noodles is about the same here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边一碗面也差不多这个价","en":"A bowl of noodles costs about the same where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边一碗面也差不多这个价。感恩节学校放假，我爸妈说要来纽约，还点名要去我每个星期五去的那家面馆。我爸说：「一碗面这么贵，我得看看值不值。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yì wǎn miàn yě chàbuduō zhège jià. Gǎn'ēn Jié xuéxiào fàngjià, wǒ bà mā shuō yào lái Niǔyuē, hái diǎnmíng yào qù wǒ měi gè xīngqīwǔ qù de nà jiā miànguǎn. Wǒ bà shuō: “Yì wǎn miàn zhème guì, wǒ děi kànkan zhí bu zhí.”","m":"You said a bowl of noodles costs about the same where you are. School's off for Thanksgiving, and my parents are coming to New York — they've asked specifically for the noodle place I go to every Friday. My dad says: “Noodles that pricey? I need to see if they're worth it.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边吃饭给小费吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān chī fàn gěi xiǎofèi ma?","m":"Do people tip when they eat out where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"不给，价钱里都算好了。","p":"Bù gěi, jiàqian lǐ dōu suàn hǎo le.","m":"No — it's already in the price.","r":{"t":"那真简单！我每次都要算半天。","p":"Nà zhēn jiǎndān! Wǒ měi cì dōu yào suàn bàntiān.","m":"So simple! I always spend ages working it out."}},{"t":"给，不过给得不多。","p":"Gěi, búguò gěi de bù duō.","m":"Yes, but not much.","r":{"t":"那还好。在纽约，小费是越给越多了。","p":"Nà hái hǎo. Zài Niǔyuē, xiǎofèi shì yuè gěi yuè duō le.","m":"Not bad. In New York, tips just keep creeping up."}}],"next":{"t":"面越来越贵，可是我今天还是想吃，哈哈。","p":"Miàn yuè lái yuè guì, kěshì wǒ jīntiān háishi xiǎng chī, hāha.","m":"Noodles keep getting pricier, but I still want some today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边一碗面便宜多了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yì wǎn miàn piányi duō le.","m":"Noodles are much cheaper where I am."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边一碗面便宜多了","en":"Noodles are much cheaper where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边一碗面便宜多了。我想起在成都的时候，一碗小面才七八块钱人民币，我天天吃。这两天我跟学生讲成都，他们都不信，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yì wǎn miàn piányi duō le. Wǒ xiǎng qǐ zài Chéngdū de shíhou, yì wǎn xiǎomiàn cái qī bā kuài qián rénmínbì, wǒ tiāntiān chī. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn xuésheng jiǎng Chéngdū, tāmen dōu bú xìn, hāha.","m":"You said noodles are much cheaper where you are. It reminded me of Chengdu — a bowl of noodles was only seven or eight yuan, and I ate them every day. These days I told my students about Chengdu, and none of them believed me, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边最便宜又好吃的是什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zuì piányi yòu hǎochī de shì shénme?","m":"Where you are, what's cheapest and tastiest?"},"replies":[{"t":"路边摊的炒饭。","p":"Lùbiān tān de chǎofàn.","m":"Fried rice from a street stall.","r":{"t":"路边摊永远是最好吃的！","p":"Lùbiān tān yǒngyuǎn shì zuì hǎochī de!","m":"Street stalls are always the best!"}},{"t":"面包店的面包。","p":"Miànbāo diàn de miànbāo.","m":"Bread from the bakery.","r":{"t":"新鲜的面包又便宜又香，我也喜欢。","p":"Xīnxiān de miànbāo yòu piányi yòu xiāng, wǒ yě xǐhuan.","m":"Fresh bread — cheap and smells great. I love it too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天吃面的时候，又羡慕你那边便宜。","p":"Jīntiān chī miàn de shíhou, yòu xiànmù nǐ nàbiān piányi.","m":"Eating noodles today, I envied your cheap ones again."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"小费给多少？","p":"Xiǎofèi gěi duōshao?","m":"How much do you tip?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他小费给多少（一般百分之十五到二十）","en":"You asked how much he tips (usually 15–20%)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我小费给多少。这两天我发现，那家面馆的收款机上直接跳出三个按钮：百分之十八、二十、二十五。我站在那儿想了半天，最后按了中间那个。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiǎofèi gěi duōshao. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, nà jiā miànguǎn de shōukuǎnjī shang zhíjiē tiào chū sān gè ànniǔ: bǎi fēn zhī shíbā, èrshí, èrshíwǔ. Wǒ zhàn zài nàr xiǎng le bàntiān, zuìhòu àn le zhōngjiān nà gè.","m":"Last time you asked how much I tip. These days the noodle place's card machine just pops up three buttons: 18, 20, 25 percent. I stood there thinking for ages, and pressed the middle one.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你来纽约，你觉得小费难不难算？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ lái Niǔyuē, nǐ juéde xiǎofèi nán bu nán suàn?","m":"If you came to New York, do you think tipping would be hard to work out?"},"replies":[{"t":"难，我肯定要用手机算。","p":"Nán, wǒ kěndìng yào yòng shǒujī suàn.","m":"Hard — I'd definitely need my phone.","r":{"t":"我也是！我是理科老师，还是要用手机，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ shì lǐkē lǎoshī, háishi yào yòng shǒujī, hāha.","m":"Me too! I teach science and still need my phone, haha."}},{"t":"不难，乘一下就行。","p":"Bù nán, chéng yíxià jiù xíng.","m":"Not hard — just multiply.","r":{"t":"你比我厉害！我一紧张就算错。","p":"Nǐ bǐ wǒ lìhai! Wǒ yì jǐnzhāng jiù suàn cuò.","m":"You're better than me! I get it wrong when I'm nervous."}}],"next":{"t":"百分之十五还是二十，我今天又想了半天，哈哈。","p":"Bǎi fēn zhī shíwǔ háishi èrshí, wǒ jīntiān yòu xiǎng le bàntiān, hāha.","m":"Fifteen or twenty percent — I agonised again today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"这么贵，你还天天去吗？","p":"Zhème guì, nǐ hái tiāntiān qù ma?","m":"That pricey and you still go all the time?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他这么贵还天天去吗（一个星期三次，也不少了）","en":"You asked if he still goes every day at those prices (three times a week — still a lot)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我这么贵还天天去吗。这两天我决定少去一次，自己在家煮面。结果我四岁的女儿说：「爸爸，还是那家好吃。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zhème guì hái tiāntiān qù ma. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ juédìng shǎo qù yí cì, zìjǐ zài jiā zhǔ miàn. Jiéguǒ wǒ sì suì de nǚ'ér shuō: “Bàba, háishi nà jiā hǎochī.”","m":"Last time you asked if I still go every day at those prices. These days I decided to skip once and cook noodles at home. My four-year-old said: “Daddy, that place is better.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在家常常自己做饭吗？","p":"Nǐ zài jiā chángcháng zìjǐ zuò fàn ma?","m":"Do you often cook at home?"},"replies":[{"t":"常常做，比外面便宜。","p":"Chángcháng zuò, bǐ wàimiàn piányi.","m":"Often — it's cheaper than eating out.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！可是我做的没人爱吃，哈哈。","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège! Kěshì wǒ zuò de méi rén ài chī, hāha.","m":"Yes yes yes! But nobody likes what I cook, haha."}},{"t":"很少，我一般在外面吃。","p":"Hěn shǎo, wǒ yìbān zài wàimiàn chī.","m":"Rarely — I usually eat out.","r":{"t":"那你肯定知道很多好吃的地方。","p":"Nà nǐ kěndìng zhīdào hěn duō hǎochī de dìfang.","m":"Then you must know lots of good places."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我忍住了，没去吃面，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ rěn zhù le, méi qù chī miàn, hāha.","m":"I held out today — no noodles, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我爸学会的第一句中文，是「老样子」。","p":"Wǒ bà xuéhuì de dì yī jù Zhōngwén, shì “lǎoyàngzi”.","m":"The first Chinese my dad learned was 老样子, “the usual”."},{"t":"现在他到哪儿都说，连在新泽西的咖啡店也说。店员听不懂，他就说得更大声。","p":"Xiànzài tā dào nǎr dōu shuō, lián zài Xīn Zéxī de kāfēi diàn yě shuō. Diànyuán tīng bu dǒng, tā jiù shuō de gèng dàshēng.","m":"Now he says it everywhere — even in coffee shops in New Jersey. When the staff don't get it, he just says it louder."},{"t":"我妈说，他退休以后，第一次这么爱学东西。","p":"Wǒ mā shuō, tā tuìxiū yǐhòu, dì yī cì zhème ài xué dōngxi.","m":"My mum says it's the first time since he retired that he's been this keen to learn something."}],"replies":[{"t":"你爸爸太可爱了！","p":"Nǐ bàba tài kě'ài le!","m":"Your dad's adorable!","r":{"t":"对对对！下次我教他「谢谢老板」。","p":"Duì duì duì! Xià cì wǒ jiāo tā “xièxie lǎobǎn”.","m":"Yes yes yes! Next I'll teach him 谢谢老板."}},{"t":"一句「老样子」就够用了。","p":"Yí jù “lǎoyàngzi” jiù gòu yòng le.","m":"老样子 is all you need.","r":{"t":"哈哈，在法拉盛，真的够用。","p":"Hāha, zài Fǎlāshèng, zhēnde gòu yòng.","m":"Haha, in Flushing it really is."}}],"from":"2026-11-29"}},"2026-11-24|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-24","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Ramen's expensive here too.","p":"","m":"我这边的拉面也很贵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边拉面也贵","en":"Ramen's expensive where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said ramen's expensive there too. So I tried making it at home with my flatmates — instant noodles, a boiled egg and spring onions. It was not Soho. But it was two pounds a bowl.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边拉面也贵。所以我跟室友在家试着做——方便面、一个水煮蛋、一点葱。跟苏豪区的没法比。不过一碗才两镑。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you ever try to make restaurant food at home?","p":"","m":"你会在家试着做餐馆里的菜吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Sometimes, with videos.","p":"","m":"有时候，跟着视频做。","r":{"t":"Videos make it look so easy.","p":"","m":"视频里看着都好简单。"}},{"t":"Never — I'd rather just go out.","p":"","m":"从不，我宁可出去吃。","r":{"t":"Fair. Some things are worth paying for.","p":"","m":"有道理。有些东西值得花钱。"}}],"next":{"t":"Sad sandwich again today. Thinking about ramen.","p":"","m":"今天又是可怜的三明治。在想拉面。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Noodles are cheap where I am.","p":"","m":"我这边的面很便宜。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边面条很便宜","en":"Noodles are cheap where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said noodles are cheap where you are. I've been thinking about it every lunchtime. This week I found a place in Chinatown that does a bowl for nine pounds. Still not cheap — but cheaper.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边面条很便宜。我每到午饭就想起这句。这周我在唐人街找到一家，一碗九镑。还是不便宜——不过便宜一点了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a cheap meal you love?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢的便宜的一顿饭是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A bowl of noodles.","p":"","m":"一碗面。","r":{"t":"Of course it is. I'm jealous again.","p":"","m":"那当然。我又羡慕了。"}},{"t":"Rice with a fried egg.","p":"","m":"米饭加个煎蛋。","r":{"t":"Simple and perfect. I could manage that.","p":"","m":"简单又完美。这个我也会。"}}],"next":{"t":"Lunch today: sad sandwich. Your noodles sound better.","p":"","m":"今天的午饭：可怜的三明治。你的面听起来好多了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's your favourite ramen?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢哪种拉面？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他最爱哪种拉面（豚骨，越浓越好）","en":"You asked his favourite ramen (tonkotsu — the richer the better)"},"later":{"t":"You asked about my favourite ramen. Tonkotsu. I read this week that the broth is boiled for many hours to get that creamy colour. No wonder it costs sixteen quid.","p":"","m":"你上次问我最爱哪种拉面。豚骨。这周我读到，那种汤要熬好多个小时，才有那种奶白色。难怪要十六镑。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you prefer rich food or light food?","p":"","m":"你喜欢浓一点的，还是清淡的？"},"replies":[{"t":"Rich, definitely.","p":"","m":"浓的，肯定。","r":{"t":"A person of taste.","p":"","m":"懂吃的人。"}},{"t":"Light — I feel better after.","p":"","m":"清淡的，吃完舒服。","r":{"t":"Wise. I always need a nap after tonkotsu.","p":"","m":"明智。我吃完豚骨拉面总想睡一觉。"}}],"next":{"t":"Craving tonkotsu today. Resisting.","p":"","m":"今天特别想吃豚骨拉面。忍住了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why so expensive?","p":"","m":"为什么那么贵？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过为什么那么贵（苏豪区房租太贵，付的是地段）","en":"You asked why it's so pricey (Soho rents are crazy — you're paying for the postcode)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why ramen's so expensive. The rent, mostly. Funny — my flat-sharing piece came out on the twenty-fourth, and it's the same story: in London, you're always paying for the postcode.","p":"","m":"你上次问拉面为什么那么贵。主要是房租。好笑的是——我那篇讲合租的稿子 24 号登出来了，说的也是这回事：在伦敦，你永远在为地段付钱。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is rent expensive where you live?","p":"","m":"你住的地方房租贵吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Very. It's the biggest cost.","p":"","m":"很贵。是最大的开销。","r":{"t":"Same story everywhere, it seems.","p":"","m":"看来哪儿都一样。"}},{"t":"Not too bad, actually.","p":"","m":"其实还好。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Hold on to that.","p":"","m":"真幸运。好好珍惜。"}}],"next":{"t":"Paid for the postcode again today — a coffee in Soho.","p":"","m":"今天又为地段付钱了——在苏豪区买了杯咖啡。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-25|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-25","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是刷手机进站。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì shuā shǒujī jìn zhàn.","m":"We scan our phones to get in here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是刷手机进站","en":"You scan your phone to get on the metro too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是刷手机进站。这两天早上我手机没电了，走到闸机前面才想起来，最后只好去买了一张单程票，排了十分钟队。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì shuā shǒujī jìn zhàn. Zhè liǎng tiān zǎoshang wǒ shǒujī méi diàn le, zǒu dào zhájī qiánmiàn cái xiǎng qǐlái, zuìhòu zhǐ hǎo qù mǎi le yì zhāng dānchéng piào, pái le shí fēnzhōng duì.","m":"You said you scan your phone to get on the metro too. These days my phone died one morning — I only realised at the ticket gate, and in the end I had to queue ten minutes for a single ticket.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出门最怕忘带什么？","p":"Nǐ chūmén zuì pà wàng dài shénme?","m":"What are you most afraid of forgetting when you go out?"},"replies":[{"t":"手机，没手机什么都干不了。","p":"Shǒujī, méi shǒujī shénme dōu gàn bu liǎo.","m":"My phone — can't do anything without it.","r":{"t":"对，现在手机就是钱包。","p":"Duì, xiànzài shǒujī jiù shì qiánbāo.","m":"Right — your phone is your wallet now."}},{"t":"钥匙。","p":"Yàoshi.","m":"Keys.","r":{"t":"钥匙也要命！我有一次在门口等了开锁师傅一个小时。","p":"Yàoshi yě yàomìng! Wǒ yǒu yí cì zài ménkǒu děng le kāisuǒ shīfu yí gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Keys are a nightmare too! I once waited an hour outside for a locksmith."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又刷手机进站，三块钱。","p":"Jīntiān yòu shuā shǒujī jìn zhàn, sān kuài qián.","m":"Scanned my phone at the gate again today — three yuan."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边坐一次车贵多了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān zuò yí cì chē guì duō le.","m":"A ride's much more expensive here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边坐一次车贵多了","en":"Public transport costs much more where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边坐一次车贵多了。这两天我跟学生算了一下：我从家坐到学校，一个月才一百多块。有个英国学生听了，说他在伦敦要花好几倍。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān zuò yí cì chē guì duō le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn xuésheng suàn le yíxià: wǒ cóng jiā zuò dào xuéxiào, yí gè yuè cái yìbǎi duō kuài. Yǒu gè Yīngguó xuésheng tīng le, shuō tā zài Lúndūn yào huā hǎo jǐ bèi.","m":"You said public transport costs much more where you are. These days I worked it out with my students: home to school is only a hundred-odd yuan a month for me. A British student said in London he'd pay several times that.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你平时出门，一般坐车还是走路？","p":"Nǐ píngshí chūmén, yìbān zuò chē háishi zǒulù?","m":"When you go out, do you usually take transport or walk?"},"replies":[{"t":"坐车，太远了走不了。","p":"Zuò chē, tài yuǎn le zǒu bu liǎo.","m":"Transport — it's too far to walk.","r":{"t":"那车钱真的是一笔大开销。","p":"Nà chēqián zhēnde shì yì bǐ dà kāixiāo.","m":"Then fares really add up."}},{"t":"能走路就走路，省钱。","p":"Néng zǒulù jiù zǒulù, shěng qián.","m":"I walk when I can — saves money.","r":{"t":"又省钱又锻炼，一举两得。","p":"Yòu shěng qián yòu duànliàn, yì jǔ liǎng dé.","m":"Saves money and keeps you fit — two birds, one stone."}}],"next":{"t":"今天坐地铁又花了三块，想到你那边车费贵多了。","p":"Jīntiān zuò dìtiě yòu huā le sān kuài, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān chēfèi guì duō le.","m":"Another three yuan on the metro today — thought of your pricier fares."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"起步三块，最贵多少？","p":"Qǐbù sān kuài, zuì guì duōshao?","m":"Three to start — what's the most it costs?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过北京地铁最贵多少（坐得很远也就七八块）","en":"You asked the most a Beijing metro ride costs (seven or eight yuan for a long trip)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问北京地铁最贵多少。这两天我带学生去颐和园，坐了一个小时地铁，才五块钱。学生们说：「老师，这比一杯咖啡还便宜。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Běijīng dìtiě zuì guì duōshao. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dài xuésheng qù Yíhéyuán, zuò le yí gè xiǎoshí dìtiě, cái wǔ kuài qián. Xuéshengmen shuō: “Lǎoshī, zhè bǐ yì bēi kāfēi hái piányi.”","m":"Last time you asked the most a Beijing metro ride costs. These days I took my students to the Summer Palace — an hour on the metro, only five yuan. They said: “Teacher, that's cheaper than a coffee.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你坐过最远的一次车，是去哪儿？","p":"Nǐ zuòguo zuì yuǎn de yí cì chē, shì qù nǎr?","m":"What's the furthest trip you've ever taken?"},"replies":[{"t":"去另一个城市看朋友。","p":"Qù lìng yí gè chéngshì kàn péngyou.","m":"To another city to see a friend.","r":{"t":"为了朋友坐那么远，真够意思。","p":"Wèile péngyou zuò nàme yuǎn, zhēn gòu yìsi.","m":"Going that far for a friend — that's a real friend."}},{"t":"想不起来了，好像都不远。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le, hǎoxiàng dōu bù yuǎn.","m":"Can't remember — none were far.","r":{"t":"那下次出去玩，挑个远一点儿的地方。","p":"Nà xià cì chūqù wán, tiāo gè yuǎn yìdiǎnr de dìfang.","m":"Then next trip, pick somewhere a bit further."}}],"next":{"t":"今天坐了一趟远的，也才五块。","p":"Jīntiān zuò le yí tàng yuǎn de, yě cái wǔ kuài.","m":"Took a long ride today — still only five yuan."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天坐地铁上班吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān zuò dìtiě shàngbān ma?","m":"Do you take the metro to work every day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是每天坐地铁上班（天冷坐地铁，天好骑车）","en":"You asked if she takes the metro to work every day (metro when it's cold, bike when it's nice)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是每天坐地铁上班。这两天北京一直刮风，我天天坐地铁。早高峰挤得我脚都没地方放，还是怀念骑车。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì měi tiān zuò dìtiě shàngbān. Zhè liǎng tiān Běijīng yìzhí guā fēng, wǒ tiāntiān zuò dìtiě. Zǎo gāofēng jǐ de wǒ jiǎo dōu méi dìfang fàng, háishi huáiniàn qí chē.","m":"Last time you asked if I take the metro to work every day. It's been windy in Beijing these days, so I've been on the metro every day. Rush hour's so packed there's nowhere to put my feet — I miss my bike.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是能选，你想怎么去上班或上课？","p":"Yàoshi néng xuǎn, nǐ xiǎng zěnme qù shàngbān huò shàngkè?","m":"If you could choose, how would you get to work or class?"},"replies":[{"t":"走路，十分钟就到。","p":"Zǒulù, shí fēnzhōng jiù dào.","m":"Walking — ten minutes and I'm there.","r":{"t":"这个最理想了！","p":"Zhège zuì lǐxiǎng le!","m":"That's the dream!"}},{"t":"不用去，在家就行。","p":"Bú yòng qù, zài jiā jiù xíng.","m":"Not going at all — from home.","r":{"t":"哈哈，这个我也想。","p":"Hāha, zhège wǒ yě xiǎng.","m":"Haha, I'd love that too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天风太大，我又坐地铁了。","p":"Jīntiān fēng tài dà, wǒ yòu zuò dìtiě le.","m":"Too windy again today — metro for me."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-25|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-25","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's one price here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也是一个价。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是一个价","en":"It's one price where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's one price there too. This week I rode all the way to Coney Island — one hour — and it was still three dollars. In winter the beach is empty. Honestly, very peaceful.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是一个价。这周我一直坐到了康尼岛——一个小时——还是三块钱。冬天的海滩空空的。说实话，特别安静。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"If every ride cost the same, near or far, where would you go?","p":"","m":"要是坐多远都一个价，你最想坐到哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"As far as possible!","p":"","m":"能多远就多远！","r":{"t":"Same. Best deal in the city.","p":"","m":"一样。全城最划算。"}},{"t":"Somewhere quiet.","p":"","m":"去一个安静的地方。","r":{"t":"Then try a beach in winter. Trust me.","p":"","m":"那试试冬天的海边。相信我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Three dollars again today. Easy.","p":"","m":"今天又是三块。简单。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Here, it costs more the farther you go.","p":"","m":"我这边坐得越远越贵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边坐得越远越贵","en":"Where you are, it costs more the farther you go"},"later":{"t":"You said it costs more the farther you go. Same in Seoul. When I first came here, I kept tapping my card on the way out, like in Seoul. People looked at me. Honestly, so embarrassing.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边坐得越远越贵。首尔也是。我刚来这儿的时候，出站老是刷卡，跟在首尔一样。大家都看我。说实话，好尴尬。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever done something 'wrong' in a new place without knowing?","p":"","m":"你有没有在新地方，不知不觉做错过什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, many times.","p":"","m":"有，很多次。","r":{"t":"Ha, me too. It's part of moving.","p":"","m":"哈，我也是。搬家就是这样。"}},{"t":"Not that I know of.","p":"","m":"好像没有。","r":{"t":"Lucky! Or maybe nobody told you, haha.","p":"","m":"真幸运！也可能是没人告诉你，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Subway again today. Still getting used to it.","p":"","m":"今天又坐地铁了。还在适应。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long is your ride?","p":"","m":"你坐多久？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他坐多久（二十分钟左右，八站）","en":"You asked how long his ride is (about twenty minutes, eight stops)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long my ride is. Twenty minutes. This week I finally understood the whole announcement: 'Stand clear of the closing doors, please.' Three months to catch it!","p":"","m":"你上次问我坐多久。二十分钟。这周我终于听懂了那句广播：「请远离正在关闭的车门。」花了三个月才听出来！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do on your way to work or school?","p":"","m":"你上班或者上学的路上做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Listen to podcasts.","p":"","m":"听播客。","r":{"t":"Nice. Good for the ears.","p":"","m":"不错。练耳朵。"}},{"t":"Sleep, if I can.","p":"","m":"能睡就睡。","r":{"t":"Respect. I'd miss my stop.","p":"","m":"佩服。我会坐过站的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Eight stops again today.","p":"","m":"今天又是八站。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does it run all night?","p":"","m":"晚上也开吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过地铁是不是通宵（二十四小时，可是半夜要等很久）","en":"You asked if it runs all night (twenty-four hours — but late at night you wait forever)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the subway runs all night. Yes. This week I came home at one in the morning after Thanksgiving dinner in Brooklyn. I waited twenty-five minutes. Full stomach, empty platform.","p":"","m":"你上次问地铁是不是通宵。是的。这周感恩节在布鲁克林吃完晚饭，我凌晨一点才回家。等了二十五分钟。肚子满满的，站台空空的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you a late-night person?","p":"","m":"你是夜猫子吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Sometimes, at weekends.","p":"","m":"有时候，周末的时候。","r":{"t":"Weekends are for staying out.","p":"","m":"周末就是用来晚归的。"}},{"t":"No, I'm in bed by eleven.","p":"","m":"不是，我十一点就睡了。","r":{"t":"Healthy! My mom would like you.","p":"","m":"健康！我妈会喜欢你的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Big dinner coming up — I'll tell you about it.","p":"","m":"马上有一顿大餐——回头跟你说。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-25|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-25","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I cycle instead too.","p":"","m":"我也干脆骑车。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也骑车，不坐公交","en":"You cycle instead of taking the bus too"},"later":{"t":"You said you cycle instead too. This week we had the first frost — the bike lanes were white and sparkly in the morning. Beautiful, and a bit slippery. I went very slowly.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是骑车。这周下了第一场霜——早上自行车道白白的、亮晶晶的。很美，也有点滑。我骑得很慢。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your ride like in the mornings?","p":"","m":"你早上骑车的路上是什么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Busy, lots of traffic.","p":"","m":"很忙，车很多。","r":{"t":"Ride safe out there.","p":"","m":"路上注意安全。"}},{"t":"Quiet and nice.","p":"","m":"安静，很舒服。","r":{"t":"Lucky. That's the best way to start a day.","p":"","m":"真幸运。这是开始一天最好的方式。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cycled again today. Cold, but fine.","p":"","m":"今天又骑车了。冷，但还好。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have a bike, so I take the bus.","p":"","m":"我没有自行车，所以坐公交。"},"mem":{"zh":"你没有自行车，坐公交","en":"You don't have a bike, so you take the bus"},"later":{"t":"You said you take the bus. My husband drives a bus here in Malmö! I told him about you. He said: 'Tell your friend to sit at the front. Best view in town.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你坐公交。我老公就在马尔默开公交车！我跟他说起你。他说：「告诉你朋友坐前面。全城最好的风景。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you like to sit on the bus?","p":"","m":"坐公交你喜欢坐哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"At the front.","p":"","m":"前面。","r":{"t":"My husband will be happy to hear that.","p":"","m":"我老公听了会很高兴。"}},{"t":"At the back, by the window.","p":"","m":"后面，靠窗。","r":{"t":"Window seat — good choice too.","p":"","m":"靠窗——也是好选择。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took the bus myself today — too windy to cycle.","p":"","m":"今天我也坐了公交——风太大，骑不了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you cycle even in the snow?","p":"","m":"下雪也骑吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她下雪也骑车吗（骑，戴好手套）","en":"You asked if she cycles even in the snow (yes, with good gloves)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I cycle in the snow. Yes. This week I bought new gloves — the old ones had a hole in one finger. Very thick, very warm, a bit hard to ring the bell.","p":"","m":"你上次问我下雪也骑车吗。骑。这周我买了新手套——旧的有一根手指破了个洞。新的很厚、很暖，就是按车铃有点难。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your most useful winter item?","p":"","m":"你冬天最有用的东西是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A warm hat.","p":"","m":"一顶暖和的帽子。","r":{"t":"Ja, a good hat changes everything.","p":"","m":"对，一顶好帽子，什么都不一样了。"}},{"t":"I don't really have winter where I live.","p":"","m":"我那边其实没有冬天。","r":{"t":"Then I'm a bit jealous, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，那我有点羡慕。"}}],"next":{"t":"Snow's not here yet, but my gloves are ready.","p":"","m":"雪还没来，可我的手套准备好了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How far is your ride?","p":"","m":"你骑多远？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她骑多远（到学校十五分钟左右）","en":"You asked how far her ride is (about fifteen minutes to work)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how far my ride is. Fifteen minutes. This week my youngest started riding to school with me. Now it's twenty-five — we stop to look at every dog.","p":"","m":"你上次问我骑多远。十五分钟。这周我家老二开始跟我一起骑车去学校。现在要二十五分钟——每只狗都要停下来看。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did you walk or ride to school as a kid?","p":"","m":"你小时候是走路还是骑车上学？"},"replies":[{"t":"Walked.","p":"","m":"走路。","r":{"t":"Me too, at first. Long walks, lots of talking.","p":"","m":"我一开始也是。路很长，话很多。"}},{"t":"My parents drove me.","p":"","m":"爸妈开车送我。","r":{"t":"That's nice too. Warm in winter!","p":"","m":"那也好。冬天暖和！"}}],"next":{"t":"Short ride, cold air, good start.","p":"","m":"路不长，空气冷，开了个好头。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-26|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-11-26","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我的理发师也爱聊天。","p":"Wǒ de lǐfàshī yě ài liáotiān.","m":"My barber loves to chat too."},"mem":{"zh":"你的理发师也爱聊天","en":"Your barber loves to chat too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你的理发师也爱聊天。这两天我带了一个中国同事去剪头发。师傅一边剪一边跟他聊足球，他听不懂，我就在旁边翻译。剪完同事说：「这是我剪得最累的一次头发。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ de lǐfàshī yě ài liáotiān. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dài le yí gè Zhōngguó tóngshì qù jiǎn tóufa. Shīfu yìbiān jiǎn yìbiān gēn tā liáo zúqiú, tā tīng bu dǒng, wǒ jiù zài pángbiān fānyì. Jiǎn wán tóngshì shuō: “Zhè shì wǒ jiǎn de zuì lèi de yí cì tóufa.”","m":"You said your barber loves to chat too. These days I took a Chinese colleague for a haircut. The barber talked football at him the whole time; he didn't understand, so I interpreted. Afterwards my colleague said: “That's the most tiring haircut I've ever had.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你剪头发的时候，喜欢聊天还是安静？","p":"Nǐ jiǎn tóufa de shíhou, xǐhuan liáotiān háishi ānjìng?","m":"When you get your hair cut, do you like chatting or quiet?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢聊天，时间过得快。","p":"Xǐhuan liáotiān, shíjiān guò de kuài.","m":"Chatting — time goes faster.","r":{"t":"对！我也是。","p":"Duì! Wǒ yě shì.","m":"Right! Me too."}},{"t":"喜欢安静，最好闭上眼睛。","p":"Xǐhuan ānjìng, zuì hǎo bì shang yǎnjing.","m":"Quiet — ideally with my eyes closed.","r":{"t":"那你千万别来我们这家店，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ qiānwàn bié lái wǒmen zhè jiā diàn, hāha.","m":"Then never come to our barber's, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过理发店，师傅又在聊足球。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò lǐfà diàn, shīfu yòu zài liáo zúqiú.","m":"Walked past the barber's today — he was talking football again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我都是自己剪头发。","p":"Wǒ dōu shì zìjǐ jiǎn tóufa.","m":"I always cut my own hair."},"mem":{"zh":"你都是自己剪头发","en":"You cut your own hair"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你都是自己剪头发。这两天我也想试一下，刚拿起推子，我太太马上说：「不行！」她说她帮我剪……下个月再说吧，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dōu shì zìjǐ jiǎn tóufa. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě xiǎng shì yíxià, gāng ná qǐ tuīzi, wǒ tàitai mǎshàng shuō: “Bù xíng!” Tā shuō tā bāng wǒ jiǎn …… xià gè yuè zài shuō ba, hāha.","m":"You said you cut your own hair. These days I wanted to try too — the moment I picked up the clippers, my wife said: “No way!” She says she'll cut it for me… maybe next month, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你自己剪头发，最难的是哪儿？","p":"Nǐ zìjǐ jiǎn tóufa, zuì nán de shì nǎr?","m":"Cutting your own hair, what's the hardest part?"},"replies":[{"t":"后面，看不到。","p":"Hòumiàn, kàn bu dào.","m":"The back — can't see it.","r":{"t":"我就知道！所以我不敢。","p":"Wǒ jiù zhīdào! Suǒyǐ wǒ bù gǎn.","m":"I knew it! That's why I don't dare."}},{"t":"其实不难，剪多了就会了。","p":"Qíshí bù nán, jiǎn duō le jiù huì le.","m":"It's not hard really — practice does it.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题！那你来拉各斯，帮我剪。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí! Nà nǐ lái Lāgèsī, bāng wǒ jiǎn.","m":"No problem, no problem! Then come to Lagos and cut mine."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又看着推子想了一下……还是算了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu kàn zhe tuīzi xiǎng le yíxià …… háishi suàn le, hāha.","m":"Stared at the clippers again today… nah, forget it, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"他支持哪个球队？","p":"Tā zhīchí nǎ gè qiúduì?","m":"Which team does he support?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过理发师支持哪个球队（阿森纳，一输就不想说话）","en":"You asked which team his barber supports (Arsenal — he goes quiet when they lose)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我理发师支持哪个球队。阿森纳！这两天我经过他的店，他在门口跳舞，我就知道：阿森纳赢了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ lǐfàshī zhīchí nǎ gè qiúduì. Ā'sēnnà! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jīngguò tā de diàn, tā zài ménkǒu tiàowǔ, wǒ jiù zhīdào: Ā'sēnnà yíng le.","m":"Last time you asked which team my barber supports. Arsenal! These days I walked past his shop and he was dancing in the doorway — so I knew: Arsenal had won.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有喜欢的球队吗？","p":"Nǐ yǒu xǐhuan de qiúduì ma?","m":"Do you have a team you support?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我从小就支持一个队。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ cóngxiǎo jiù zhīchí yí gè duì.","m":"Yes — I've supported one since I was little.","r":{"t":"那你一定懂我理发师的心情！","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng dǒng wǒ lǐfàshī de xīnqíng!","m":"Then you get how my barber feels!"}},{"t":"没有，我不太看球。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ bú tài kàn qiú.","m":"No, I don't really watch football.","r":{"t":"那你剪头发的时候，就只能听他说了，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ jiǎn tóufa de shíhou, jiù zhǐ néng tīng tā shuō le, hāha.","m":"Then you'd just have to listen to him, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我的理发师心情特别好，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ de lǐfàshī xīnqíng tèbié hǎo, hāha.","m":"My barber's in a great mood today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你多久剪一次头发？","p":"Nǐ duō jiǔ jiǎn yí cì tóufa?","m":"How often do you get a haircut?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他多久剪一次头发（两个星期一次）","en":"You asked how often he gets a haircut (every two weeks)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我多久剪一次头发。两个星期一次。这两天我女儿也第一次去理发店了！她坐在我腿上，一动不动，师傅说她比我乖。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ duō jiǔ jiǎn yí cì tóufa. Liǎng gè xīngqī yí cì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ nǚ'ér yě dì yī cì qù lǐfà diàn le! Tā zuò zài wǒ tuǐ shang, yí dòng bú dòng, shīfu shuō tā bǐ wǒ guāi.","m":"Last time you asked how often I get a haircut. Every two weeks. These days my daughter went to the barber's for the first time too! She sat on my lap without moving — the barber said she behaves better than me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候第一次剪头发，你还记得吗？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou dì yī cì jiǎn tóufa, nǐ hái jìde ma?","m":"Do you remember your first haircut as a kid?"},"replies":[{"t":"不记得了，我妈说我哭了。","p":"Bú jìde le, wǒ mā shuō wǒ kū le.","m":"No — my mum says I cried.","r":{"t":"哈哈，很多小孩都哭！我女儿没哭，我好骄傲。","p":"Hāha, hěn duō xiǎohái dōu kū! Wǒ nǚ'ér méi kū, wǒ hǎo jiāo'ào.","m":"Haha, lots of kids cry! My daughter didn't — I'm so proud."}},{"t":"记得，是我爸给我剪的。","p":"Jìde, shì wǒ bà gěi wǒ jiǎn de.","m":"Yes — my dad cut it.","r":{"t":"真好！爸爸剪的头发，一辈子都记得。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Bàba jiǎn de tóufa, yíbèizi dōu jìde.","m":"Lovely! A haircut from your dad — you remember that forever."}}],"next":{"t":"今天天很热，还好我刚剪了头发。","p":"Jīntiān tiān hěn rè, hái hǎo wǒ gāng jiǎn le tóufa.","m":"Hot today — good thing I just had a haircut."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-26|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-11-26","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我妈也觉得剪头发太贵。","p":"Wǒ mā yě juéde jiǎn tóufa tài guì.","m":"My mum thinks haircuts are too expensive too."},"mem":{"zh":"你妈妈也觉得剪头发太贵","en":"Your mum thinks haircuts are too expensive too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你妈妈也觉得剪头发太贵。这两天我妈真的帮我弟弟剪了！他现在戴着帽子上学，不肯拿下来，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ māma yě juéde jiǎn tóufa tài guì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā zhēnde bāng wǒ dìdi jiǎn le! Tā xiànzài dài zhe màozi shàngxué, bù kěn ná xiàlái, hāha.","m":"You said your mum thinks haircuts are too expensive too. These days my mum really did cut my little brother's hair! Now he wears a hat to school and won't take it off, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你让家里人给你剪过头发吗？","p":"Nǐ ràng jiā lǐ rén gěi nǐ jiǎnguo tóufa ma?","m":"Have you ever let family cut your hair?"},"replies":[{"t":"剪过，剪得还不错。","p":"Jiǎnguo, jiǎn de hái búcuò.","m":"Yes — it turned out okay.","r":{"t":"真的？那你家里有一个理发师！","p":"Zhēnde? Nà nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu yí gè lǐfàshī!","m":"Really? Then you've got a barber at home!"}},{"t":"没有，我不敢。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ bù gǎn.","m":"No, I wouldn't dare.","r":{"t":"我也不敢！看到我弟弟，更不敢了。","p":"Wǒ yě bù gǎn! Kàn dào wǒ dìdi, gèng bù gǎn le.","m":"Me neither! After seeing my brother, even less."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天又拿起剪刀了……我跑了，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān yòu ná qǐ jiǎndāo le …… wǒ pǎo le, hāha.","m":"My mum picked up the scissors again today… I ran, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边剪头发便宜多了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān jiǎn tóufa piányi duō le.","m":"Haircuts are much cheaper here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边剪头发便宜多了","en":"Haircuts are much cheaper where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边剪头发便宜多了。我告诉我妈了！她说：「那你去那边剪吧。」我说：「坐飞机比剪头发贵多了！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān jiǎn tóufa piányi duō le. Wǒ gàosu wǒ mā le! Tā shuō: “Nà nǐ qù nàbiān jiǎn ba.” Wǒ shuō: “Zuò fēijī bǐ jiǎn tóufa guì duō le!”","m":"You said haircuts are much cheaper where you are. I told my mum! She said: “Then go and get it cut there.” I said: “The plane costs way more than the haircut!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般多久剪一次头发？","p":"Nǐ yìbān duō jiǔ jiǎn yí cì tóufa?","m":"How often do you usually get your hair cut?"},"replies":[{"t":"一两个月一次。","p":"Yì liǎng gè yuè yí cì.","m":"Every month or two.","r":{"t":"跟我差不多！","p":"Gēn wǒ chàbuduō!","m":"About the same as me!"}},{"t":"很久才剪一次，我喜欢长头发。","p":"Hěn jiǔ cái jiǎn yí cì, wǒ xǐhuan cháng tóufa.","m":"Not often — I like long hair.","r":{"t":"长头发好看！我也想留长。","p":"Cháng tóufa hǎokàn! Wǒ yě xiǎng liú cháng.","m":"Long hair looks great! I want to grow mine."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈还在说你那边剪头发便宜，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ mā hái zài shuō nǐ nàbiān jiǎn tóufa piányi, hāha.","m":"My mum's still talking about your cheap haircuts, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"两万比索贵吗？","p":"Liǎngwàn bǐsuǒ guì ma?","m":"Is 20,000 pesos expensive?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过两万比索贵不贵（不算很贵，妈妈年轻时便宜多了）","en":"You asked if 20,000 pesos is expensive (not really — it was much cheaper when her mum was young)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我两万比索贵不贵。这两天我问外婆，她年轻的时候剪头发多少钱。她想了很久，说：「我那时候不去理发店，是我妈给我剪的。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ liǎng wàn bǐsuǒ guì bu guì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn wàipó, tā niánqīng de shíhou jiǎn tóufa duōshao qián. Tā xiǎng le hěn jiǔ, shuō: “Wǒ nà shíhou bú qù lǐfà diàn, shì wǒ mā gěi wǒ jiǎn de.”","m":"Last time you asked if 20,000 pesos is expensive. These days I asked Abuela how much a haircut cost when she was young. She thought for ages and said: “I never went to a salon — my mum cut it.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里有没有一样东西，以前便宜，现在贵多了？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí yàng dōngxi, yǐqián piányi, xiànzài guì duō le?","m":"In your family, is there something that used to be cheap and now costs much more?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，坐公交车。","p":"Yǒu, zuò gōngjiāochē.","m":"Yes — the bus.","r":{"t":"我奶奶也这样说！","p":"Wǒ nǎinai yě zhèyàng shuō!","m":"Grandma says that too!"}},{"t":"好像什么都比以前贵。","p":"Hǎoxiàng shénme dōu bǐ yǐqián guì.","m":"Seems like everything's pricier now.","r":{"t":"对，我妈天天这样说。","p":"Duì, wǒ mā tiāntiān zhèyàng shuō.","m":"Right — my mum says that every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我外婆又说「以前什么都便宜」，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ wàipó yòu shuō “yǐqián shénme dōu piányi”, hāha.","m":"Abuela said “everything used to be cheap” again today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最后剪了吗？","p":"Nǐ zuìhòu jiǎn le ma?","m":"Did you get it cut in the end?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她最后剪了没有（剪了，用自己的零花钱）","en":"You asked if she got the haircut in the end (yes — with her own pocket money)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最后剪了没有。剪了！星期五在学校，朋友们在我的校服上写名字，都说：「卡米拉，你的头发好看！」两万比索，值了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuìhòu jiǎn le méiyǒu. Jiǎn le! Xīngqīwǔ zài xuéxiào, péngyoumen zài wǒ de xiàofú shang xiě míngzi, dōu shuō: “Kǎmǐlā, nǐ de tóufa hǎokàn!” Liǎng wàn bǐsuǒ, zhí le.","m":"Last time you asked if I got my hair cut in the end. I did! On Friday at school, when my friends were writing their names on my uniform, they all said: “Camila, your hair looks great!” 20,000 pesos — worth it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近花自己的钱买过什么？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn huā zìjǐ de qián mǎiguo shénme?","m":"What have you bought with your own money lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"买了一本书。","p":"Mǎi le yì běn shū.","m":"A book.","r":{"t":"书最值！希望是一本中文书，哈哈。","p":"Shū zuì zhí! Xīwàng shì yì běn Zhōngwén shū, hāha.","m":"Books are the best value! I hope it's a Chinese one, haha."}},{"t":"想不起来了，好像都是吃的。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le, hǎoxiàng dōu shì chī de.","m":"Can't remember — probably all food.","r":{"t":"哈哈，吃的也很值！","p":"Hāha, chī de yě hěn zhí!","m":"Haha, food is worth it too!"}}],"next":{"t":"剪完头发，今天照了好几次镜子，哈哈。","p":"Jiǎn wán tóufa, jīntiān zhào le hǎo jǐ cì jìngzi, hāha.","m":"New haircut — I've checked the mirror loads of times today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-26|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-11-26","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I book on WhatsApp too.","p":"","m":"我也在 WhatsApp 上约。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也是用 WhatsApp 约","en":"You book on WhatsApp too"},"later":{"t":"You said you book on WhatsApp too. This week I booked a fresh cut before a video shoot — a dancer and I are filming on the beach. My barber said, 'If you're going to be famous, I need a better photo of you for my wall.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是用 WhatsApp 约。这周拍视频之前，我约了个新发型——我跟一个舞者要在海滩拍。理发师说：「你要出名了，我墙上得换一张你更好看的照片。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you get a haircut before big days?","p":"","m":"重要的日子之前，你会去剪头发吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always.","p":"","m":"会，每次都会。","r":{"t":"Same. New cut, new energy.","p":"","m":"一样。新发型，新状态。"}},{"t":"No, I keep it the same.","p":"","m":"不会，保持原样。","r":{"t":"Respect. No stress.","p":"","m":"佩服。没压力。"}}],"next":{"t":"Fresh cut booked. One message, done.","p":"","m":"发也约好了。一条消息，搞定。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I never book. I just walk in.","p":"","m":"我从来不约，直接去。"},"mem":{"zh":"你从来不预约，直接去","en":"You never book — you just walk in"},"later":{"t":"You said you just walk in. So this week I tried it, chale. Thursday afternoon, no booking. I waited two hours — but I heard the whole neighbourhood's news. Worth it, maybe.","p":"","m":"你上次说你从来不预约，直接去。所以这周我也试了，兄弟。周四下午，没预约。等了两个小时——不过整条街的新闻我都听到了。也许值吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you mind waiting in a queue?","p":"","m":"你介意排队吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Not if I can chat.","p":"","m":"能聊天就不介意。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love my barber's.","p":"","m":"那你会喜欢我那家理发店。"}},{"t":"I hate it.","p":"","m":"我讨厌排队。","r":{"t":"Then always book. Trust me.","p":"","m":"那就一定要预约。相信我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Barbershop was packed again today.","p":"","m":"今天理发店又挤满了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How often do you go?","p":"","m":"你多久去一次？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他多久去一次（两个星期一次）","en":"You asked how often he goes (every two weeks)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how often I go. Every two weeks. But this week I went twice — once normal, once for the video shoot on the beach. My mum said, 'Are you a musician or a model?'","p":"","m":"你上次问我多久去一次。两个星期一次。可这周我去了两次——一次是平常的，一次是为了在海滩拍视频。我妈说：「你到底是音乐人还是模特？」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How often do you get your hair cut?","p":"","m":"你多久剪一次头发？"},"replies":[{"t":"About once a month.","p":"","m":"一个月一次左右。","r":{"t":"That's normal. I'm the strange one, haha.","p":"","m":"那很正常。奇怪的是我，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Only when it gets really long.","p":"","m":"长得很长了才剪。","r":{"t":"Easy life. I like it.","p":"","m":"日子轻松。我喜欢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Two weeks are up — barber time again.","p":"","m":"两个星期到了——又该去理发了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it busy there?","p":"","m":"那里人多吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过理发店忙不忙（一直很忙，一半人是去聊天的）","en":"You asked if it's busy there (always — half the people are just there to talk)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's busy. Always. This week someone in the barbershop was playing my song on their phone. Nobody knew it was me. I just sat there smiling, waiting for my cut.","p":"","m":"你上次问理发店忙不忙。一直很忙。这周理发店里有人在手机上放我的歌。谁都不知道是我做的。我就坐在那儿笑，等着剪头发。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a place near you where people hang out and talk?","p":"","m":"你附近有没有大家聚在一起聊天的地方？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a little café.","p":"","m":"有，一家小咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Every neighbourhood needs one.","p":"","m":"每个街区都需要一个。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then come to Accra. Barbershops are our cafés.","p":"","m":"那来阿克拉吧。理发店就是我们的咖啡馆。"}}],"next":{"t":"Barbershop gossip was strong today, chale.","p":"","m":"今天理发店的八卦好精彩，兄弟。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-26|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-26","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I cut my own hair too.","p":"","m":"我也自己剪头发。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也是自己剪头发","en":"You cut your own hair too"},"later":{"t":"You said you cut your own hair too. Update: I tried the back this week, with two mirrors. Now there's a little step in it. My flatmate calls it 'the staircase'.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也是自己剪头发。最新情况：这周我用两面镜子试着剪了后面。现在后面有一个小台阶。我室友管它叫「楼梯」。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the hardest part of cutting your own hair?","p":"","m":"自己剪头发，最难的是哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"The back, for sure.","p":"","m":"肯定是后面。","r":{"t":"Agreed. The back is a mystery.","p":"","m":"同意。后面是个谜。"}},{"t":"Getting both sides even.","p":"","m":"两边剪得一样齐。","r":{"t":"Yes! I keep fixing one side, then the other.","p":"","m":"对！我一直修一边，再修另一边。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hair update: still looks home-made.","p":"","m":"头发最新情况：还是一看就是自己剪的。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"The back is a bit uneven.","p":"","m":"后面有点不齐。"},"mem":{"zh":"你自己剪的后面有点不齐","en":"The back of your home haircut is a bit uneven"},"later":{"t":"You said the back of yours is a bit uneven. Mine too! This week a colleague sat behind me in a meeting and whispered, 'Oliver, who did this to you?' I said, 'Me.' Long silence.","p":"","m":"你上次说你后面剪得有点不齐。我也是！这周开会，一个同事坐在我后面，小声说：「Oliver，谁把你剪成这样的？」我说：「我自己。」一阵沉默。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever had a really bad haircut?","p":"","m":"你有没有剪过很糟糕的头发？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, once. I wore a hat for weeks.","p":"","m":"有一次。我戴了好几个星期帽子。","r":{"t":"Hat season's coming. Good timing for me.","p":"","m":"戴帽子的季节要到了。时机正好。"}},{"t":"Not really, I've been lucky.","p":"","m":"没有，我运气好。","r":{"t":"Lucky you. Send some of that luck my way.","p":"","m":"真幸运。分我一点运气吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Uneven backs club, checking in. Mine's still uneven.","p":"","m":"后面不齐俱乐部报到。我的还是不齐。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"I ask a friend to do the back.","p":"","m":"我找朋友帮我剪后面。"},"mem":{"zh":"你会找朋友帮你剪后面","en":"You ask a friend to do the back"},"later":{"t":"You said you ask a friend to do the back. So this week I asked my flatmate. She said yes — then laughed for five minutes before she started. It's actually not bad.","p":"","m":"你上次说你会找朋友帮你剪后面。所以这周我找了室友。她答应了——然后笑了五分钟才开始剪。结果其实还不错。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who do you trust with your hair?","p":"","m":"你放心让谁给你剪头发？"},"replies":[{"t":"Only my barber.","p":"","m":"只有我的理发师。","r":{"t":"Very wise. Mine is me, sadly.","p":"","m":"很明智。可惜我的理发师是我自己。"}},{"t":"Anyone, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，谁都行。","r":{"t":"Brave. I like it.","p":"","m":"勇敢。我喜欢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still looking for someone to do my back.","p":"","m":"我还在找人帮我剪后面。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Haircuts are much cheaper here.","p":"","m":"我这边剪头发便宜多了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边剪头发便宜多了","en":"Haircuts are much cheaper where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said haircuts are much cheaper there. I did the maths: twenty-five quid a month is three hundred a year. That's half a flight somewhere. So — a haircut holiday? Joking. Probably.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边剪头发便宜多了。我算了一下：一个月二十五镑，一年就是三百。够买半张去别处的机票了。那么——来一趟剪头发的旅行？开玩笑的。大概吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What would you spend three hundred pounds on?","p":"","m":"要是有三百英镑，你会花在什么上？"},"replies":[{"t":"A trip.","p":"","m":"旅行。","r":{"t":"Same. Somewhere with cheap haircuts.","p":"","m":"一样。去一个剪头发便宜的地方。"}},{"t":"I'd save it.","p":"","m":"存起来。","r":{"t":"Very sensible. More sensible than me.","p":"","m":"很明智。比我明智。"}}],"next":{"t":"Twenty-five quid saved this month.","p":"","m":"这个月省了二十五镑。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How's your haircut looking?","p":"","m":"你的头发剪得怎么样？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他头发剪得怎么样（不太好，同事都看出来了）","en":"You asked how his haircut looks (not great — his colleagues have noticed)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how my haircut's looking. Worse. This week my mum saw me on a video call and said, 'Oh, love.' Just that. 'Oh, love.' I've booked a barber.","p":"","m":"你上次问我头发剪得怎么样。更糟了。这周我妈在视频里看到我，说了一句：「哎呀，亲爱的。」就这一句。「哎呀，亲爱的。」我已经约了理发师。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family tell you the truth about how you look?","p":"","m":"你家里人会跟你说实话吗，关于你的样子？"},"replies":[{"t":"Always, very honestly.","p":"","m":"会，特别直接。","r":{"t":"Same. Mums don't hold back.","p":"","m":"一样。妈妈们从不嘴软。"}},{"t":"No, they're too nice.","p":"","m":"不会，他们太客气了。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Mine said 'Oh, love.'","p":"","m":"真好。我妈只说了一句「哎呀，亲爱的」。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hat on today. Don't ask.","p":"","m":"今天戴帽子了。别问。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why did you start?","p":"","m":"你为什么开始自己剪？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他为什么开始自己剪（每月二十五镑加起来太快）","en":"You asked why he started (twenty-five quid a month adds up fast)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why I started. Twenty-five quid a month adds up. I did the full maths this week for fun: the clippers cost thirty pounds, so I'm already ahead. My hair isn't, though.","p":"","m":"你上次问我为什么开始自己剪。一个月二十五镑，加起来很快。这周我闲着算了一笔总账：推子三十镑，所以我已经赚回来了。可我的头发没赚回来。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you do anything yourself to save money?","p":"","m":"你有没有为了省钱，自己动手做的事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I cook most meals.","p":"","m":"有，我大多自己做饭。","r":{"t":"The best one. Saves the most.","p":"","m":"最好的一招。省得最多。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Fair. Sometimes paying is worth it — trust me.","p":"","m":"有道理。有时候花钱值得——相信我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Clippers still in the drawer. Thinking.","p":"","m":"推子还在抽屉里。在想。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-27|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-27","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也有电影院的会员卡。","p":"Wǒ yě yǒu diànyǐngyuàn de huìyuánkǎ.","m":"I've got a cinema membership card too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也有电影院的会员卡","en":"You have a cinema membership card too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也有电影院的会员卡！跟你说，我的卡这两天升级了，生日那个月可以免费看一场。我已经在想要看哪一部了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yǒu diànyǐngyuàn de huìyuán kǎ! Gēn nǐ shuō, wǒ de kǎ zhè liǎng tiān shēngjí le, shēngrì nà gè yuè kěyǐ miǎnfèi kàn yì chǎng. Wǒ yǐjīng zài xiǎng yào kàn nǎ yí bù le.","m":"You said you've got a cinema membership card too! Guess what — mine got upgraded these days, so in my birthday month I get one free film. I'm already thinking about which one.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近想看什么电影？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn xiǎng kàn shénme diànyǐng?","m":"What film do you want to see at the moment?"},"replies":[{"t":"一部动画片。","p":"Yí bù dònghuàpiàn.","m":"An animated film.","r":{"t":"动画片超好！我每次都会哭。","p":"Dònghuàpiàn chāo hǎo! Wǒ měi cì dōu huì kū.","m":"Animations are the best! I cry every time."}},{"t":"还没想好，你推荐一部吧。","p":"Hái méi xiǎng hǎo, nǐ tuījiàn yí bù ba.","m":"Haven't decided — recommend one.","r":{"t":"好！我想一想，下次跟你说。","p":"Hǎo! Wǒ xiǎng yi xiǎng, xià cì gēn nǐ shuō.","m":"Okay! Let me think and tell you next time."}}],"next":{"t":"今天拿出会员卡看了一眼，想到你也有一张。","p":"Jīntiān ná chū huìyuán kǎ kàn le yì yǎn, xiǎng dào nǐ yě yǒu yì zhāng.","m":"Looked at my membership card today and remembered you've got one too."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我很少去电影院，在家看。","p":"Wǒ hěn shǎo qù diànyǐngyuàn, zài jiā kàn.","m":"I rarely go to the cinema — I watch at home."},"mem":{"zh":"你很少去电影院，一般在家看","en":"You rarely go to the cinema — you watch at home"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你一般在家看。这两天宿舍停电了一个晚上，我们几个只好用手机一起看，四个人挤在一张床上，比电影院还好玩。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yìbān zài jiā kàn. Zhè liǎng tiān sùshè tíngdiàn le yí gè wǎnshang, wǒmen jǐ gè zhǐ hǎo yòng shǒujī yìqǐ kàn, sì gè rén jǐ zài yì zhāng chuáng shang, bǐ diànyǐngyuàn hái hǎowán.","m":"You said you usually watch at home. These days the dorm had a power cut one evening, so a few of us watched on a phone — four people squashed on one bed. More fun than the cinema.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在家看电影，会准备什么吃的？","p":"Nǐ zài jiā kàn diànyǐng, huì zhǔnbèi shénme chī de?","m":"When you watch films at home, what snacks do you get?"},"replies":[{"t":"爆米花。","p":"Bàomǐhuā.","m":"Popcorn.","r":{"t":"自己做的爆米花最香！","p":"Zìjǐ zuò de bàomǐhuā zuì xiāng!","m":"Home-made popcorn smells the best!"}},{"t":"什么都不吃，专心看。","p":"Shénme dōu bù chī, zhuānxīn kàn.","m":"Nothing — I just watch.","r":{"t":"好认真！我一定要边看边吃。","p":"Hǎo rènzhēn! Wǒ yídìng yào biān kàn biān chī.","m":"So focused! I have to snack while I watch."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上我也想在宿舍看电影，跟你一样。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang wǒ yě xiǎng zài sùshè kàn diànyǐng, gēn nǐ yíyàng.","m":"Fancy a film in the dorm tonight — like you do at home."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最近看了什么电影？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn kàn le shénme diànyǐng?","m":"What have you seen lately?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她最近看了什么电影（一部恐怖片，全程捂着眼睛）","en":"You asked what film she saw recently (a horror film — she covered her eyes the whole way)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最近看了什么电影。那部恐怖片……这两天我晚上去厕所都要开灯，还要叫室友陪我，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuìjìn kàn le shénme diànyǐng. Nà bù kǒngbùpiàn …… zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wǎnshang qù cèsuǒ dōu yào kāi dēng, hái yào jiào shìyǒu péi wǒ, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what film I'd seen. That horror film… these days I need the light on to go to the bathroom at night, and my roommate has to come with me, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你敢看恐怖片吗？","p":"Nǐ gǎn kàn kǒngbùpiàn ma?","m":"Are you brave enough for horror films?"},"replies":[{"t":"敢，我最喜欢恐怖片。","p":"Gǎn, wǒ zuì xǐhuan kǒngbùpiàn.","m":"Yes — horror's my favourite.","r":{"t":"好勇敢！下次你陪我看。","p":"Hǎo yǒnggǎn! Xià cì nǐ péi wǒ kàn.","m":"So brave! Next time you watch with me."}},{"t":"不敢，我只看喜剧。","p":"Bù gǎn, wǒ zhǐ kàn xǐjù.","m":"No way — comedies only.","r":{"t":"聪明！我下次也只看喜剧了。","p":"Cōngming! Wǒ xià cì yě zhǐ kàn xǐjù le.","m":"Smart! Comedies only for me next time too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我还是不敢一个人关灯睡觉，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ háishi bù gǎn yí gè rén guān dēng shuìjiào, hāha.","m":"Still too scared to sleep with the lights off today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一般跟谁去？","p":"Nǐ yìbān gēn shéi qù?","m":"Who do you usually go with?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一般跟谁去看电影（跟同学，看完去吃东西）","en":"You asked who she goes to the cinema with (classmates — food afterwards)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一般跟谁去看电影。这两天看完，我们去吃了豆花，热的，加花生和粉圆。冬天吃热豆花，好幸福。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yìbān gēn shéi qù kàn diànyǐng. Zhè liǎng tiān kàn wán, wǒmen qù chī le dòuhuā, rè de, jiā huāshēng hé fěnyuán. Dōngtiān chī rè dòuhuā, hǎo xìngfú.","m":"Last time you asked who I go to the cinema with. These days after a film we went for douhua — warm tofu pudding with peanuts and tapioca pearls. Hot douhua in winter is pure happiness.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看完电影喜欢做什么？","p":"Nǐ kàn wán diànyǐng xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like to do after a film?"},"replies":[{"t":"去吃点东西，聊聊电影。","p":"Qù chī diǎn dōngxi, liáoliao diànyǐng.","m":"Grab a bite and talk about the film.","r":{"t":"对吧！这样才完整。","p":"Duì ba! Zhèyàng cái wánzhěng.","m":"Right? That's the full experience."}},{"t":"直接回家。","p":"Zhíjiē huí jiā.","m":"Go straight home.","r":{"t":"也好，回家躺着想剧情。","p":"Yě hǎo, huí jiā tǎng zhe xiǎng jùqíng.","m":"That's good too — lie down and think about the plot."}}],"next":{"t":"跟同学看电影最好玩了。","p":"Gēn tóngxué kàn diànyǐng zuì hǎowán le.","m":"Films with classmates are the most fun."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-27|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-27","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Popcorn is expensive here too.","p":"","m":"我这边的爆米花也很贵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边爆米花也贵","en":"Popcorn's expensive where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said popcorn's expensive there too. This week I tried a trick from Jess: bring your own snack in your bag. I brought Korean seaweed snacks. The guy next to me asked where I got them.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边爆米花也贵。这周我试了 Jess 教的办法：包里自己带零食。我带了韩国海苔。旁边的大哥问我在哪儿买的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your perfect movie snack?","p":"","m":"看电影最配的零食是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Popcorn, of course.","p":"","m":"当然是爆米花。","r":{"t":"Classic. Even at that price.","p":"","m":"经典。哪怕那个价钱。"}},{"t":"Something salty.","p":"","m":"咸的东西。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love Korean seaweed snacks.","p":"","m":"那你会喜欢韩国海苔零食。"}}],"next":{"t":"Seaweed snacks in my bag, just in case.","p":"","m":"包里装着海苔零食，以防万一。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Tickets are much cheaper where I am.","p":"","m":"我这边的票便宜多了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边电影票便宜多了","en":"Movie tickets are much cheaper where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said tickets are much cheaper where you are. This week I found out some cinemas here have cheap Tuesdays — about half price. Honestly, life-changing news.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边电影票便宜多了。这周我发现，这儿有些电影院周二打折——差不多半价。说实话，这消息改变了我的生活。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How often do you go to the cinema?","p":"","m":"你多久去一次电影院？"},"replies":[{"t":"About once a month.","p":"","m":"一个月一次左右。","r":{"t":"Same as me. Maybe on Tuesdays now.","p":"","m":"跟我一样。以后可能都挑周二。"}},{"t":"Hardly ever.","p":"","m":"很少去。","r":{"t":"Then wait for a really good one.","p":"","m":"那就等一部真正的好片。"}}],"next":{"t":"Looking at movie times again today.","p":"","m":"今天又在看电影场次。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you buy the popcorn anyway?","p":"","m":"你还是会买爆米花吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他还买不买爆米花（有时候买，当作犒劳）","en":"You asked if he buys popcorn anyway (sometimes — he calls it a treat)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I buy the popcorn anyway. Yes, this week — the big one. Then the movie was so good I forgot to eat it. I carried a full bucket home on the subway.","p":"","m":"你上次问我还买不买爆米花。买了，这周——买的大桶。结果电影太好看，我忘了吃。抱着满满一桶坐地铁回家。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever been so into something you forgot to eat?","p":"","m":"你有没有太投入，忘了吃东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, when I'm watching a show.","p":"","m":"有，看剧的时候。","r":{"t":"Same! The story wins.","p":"","m":"我也是！故事赢了。"}},{"t":"Never. Food comes first.","p":"","m":"从来没有。吃第一。","r":{"t":"Ha, respect. Very focused.","p":"","m":"哈，佩服。很专注。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought the small popcorn today. Progress.","p":"","m":"今天买的是小份爆米花。进步了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you see last?","p":"","m":"你上次看了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他上次看了什么（一部带英文字幕的韩国电影）","en":"You asked what he saw last (a Korean film with English subtitles)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I saw last. The Korean one. The funny part: the subtitles came a second late, so I laughed first and everyone else laughed after. People kept looking at me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我上次看了什么。那部韩国电影。好笑的是：字幕慢了一秒，所以我总是先笑，别人后笑。大家一直看我。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you watch films with subtitles?","p":"","m":"你看电影开字幕吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always.","p":"","m":"开，每次都开。","r":{"t":"Same. Subtitles are my friend.","p":"","m":"一样。字幕是我的朋友。"}},{"t":"Only for other languages.","p":"","m":"只有外语片才开。","r":{"t":"Makes sense. Try English subtitles on English films — it helps.","p":"","m":"有道理。英文片也开英文字幕试试——有帮助。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about that movie.","p":"","m":"我还在想那部电影。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-27|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-27","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's more on weekends here too.","p":"","m":"我这边周末也更贵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边周末也更贵","en":"It's pricier at weekends where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's more on weekends there too. So this week I took my wife on a Wednesday afternoon. Nearly empty cinema, bro! We had the best seats. First date in a long time.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边周末也更贵。所以这周我周三下午带老婆去了。电影院几乎是空的，兄弟！我们坐了最好的位子。好久没约会了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When did you last do something just for fun?","p":"","m":"你上次只是为了开心去做一件事，是什么时候？"},"replies":[{"t":"This weekend.","p":"","m":"这个周末。","r":{"t":"Good! Keep doing that.","p":"","m":"好！继续保持。"}},{"t":"I can't remember.","p":"","m":"想不起来了。","r":{"t":"Then this week, bro. Small thing is OK.","p":"","m":"那就这个星期，兄弟。小事也行。"}}],"next":{"t":"Weekday cinema plan is ready, haha.","p":"","m":"工作日看电影的计划准备好了，哈哈。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I hardly ever go to the cinema.","p":"","m":"我很少去电影院。"},"mem":{"zh":"你很少去电影院","en":"You hardly ever go to the cinema"},"later":{"t":"You said you hardly ever go to the cinema. Same, bro. So this week we made a cinema at home: a white sheet on the wall, my phone, and a cheap little projector. The kids said it's better than the real one.","p":"","m":"你上次说你很少去电影院。我也是，兄弟。所以这周我们在家弄了个电影院：墙上挂一块白床单，加上我的手机和一个便宜的小投影仪。孩子们说比真的电影院还好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you like to watch at home?","p":"","m":"你在家喜欢看什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Films.","p":"","m":"电影。","r":{"t":"Good. Home is the cheapest cinema!","p":"","m":"好。家是最便宜的电影院！"}},{"t":"Football.","p":"","m":"足球。","r":{"t":"Same, bro! Football is my cinema.","p":"","m":"我也是，兄弟！足球就是我的电影。"}}],"next":{"t":"No cinema this weekend, bro.","p":"","m":"这个周末不去电影院，兄弟。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you see last time?","p":"","m":"你上次看了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他上次看了什么（跟孩子看了一部动画片）","en":"You asked what he saw last (a cartoon with his kids)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we saw. A cartoon. This week my daughter is still singing the song from it. In the morning, in the bath, on my motorbike. Same song, all day, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们看了什么。一部动画片。这周我女儿还在唱里面的歌。早上唱，洗澡唱，坐在我摩托车上也唱。同一首，唱一整天，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a song you can't get out of your head?","p":"","m":"有没有一首歌一直在你脑子里转？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a new one every week.","p":"","m":"有，每个星期都有新的。","r":{"t":"Ha! Kids and songs, same thing.","p":"","m":"哈！孩子和歌，一个样。"}},{"t":"Not right now.","p":"","m":"现在没有。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Come to my house, you'll have one.","p":"","m":"真好。来我家，你就有了。"}}],"next":{"t":"My daughter sang that song again today.","p":"","m":"我女儿今天又唱那首歌了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it cold in there?","p":"","m":"里面冷吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过电影院里冷不冷（特别冷，空调总是开到最大）","en":"You asked if it's cold in there (so cold — the air-con's always on full)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's cold in the cinema. So cold! This week I learned: bring a jacket. In Jakarta, the only place you need a jacket is inside, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次问电影院里冷不冷。特别冷！这周我学乖了：带件外套。在雅加达，只有在室内才需要穿外套，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you get cold easily?","p":"","m":"你怕冷吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I'm always cold.","p":"","m":"怕，我总是觉得冷。","r":{"t":"Then never come to a Jakarta cinema without a jacket!","p":"","m":"那来雅加达看电影千万别忘了带外套！"}},{"t":"No, I like it cold.","p":"","m":"不怕，我喜欢冷。","r":{"t":"Then the cinema is your happy place, bro.","p":"","m":"那电影院就是你的快乐老家，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot outside, cold inside — that's Jakarta, haha.","p":"","m":"外面热，里面冷——这就是雅加达，哈哈。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-28|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也爱买二手的东西。","p":"Wǒ yě ài mǎi èrshǒu de dōngxi.","m":"I love buying secondhand too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱买二手的东西","en":"You love buying second-hand too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也爱买二手的东西。这两天我又在二手 App 上看到一个书架，五十块，卖家说要「自提」。我正在想怎么把它弄上五楼，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě ài mǎi èrshǒu de dōngxi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu zài èrshǒu App shang kàn dào yí gè shūjià, wǔshí kuài, màijiā shuō yào “zìtí”. Wǒ zhèngzài xiǎng zěnme bǎ tā nòng shàng wǔ lóu, hāha.","m":"You said you love buying second-hand too. These days I spotted a bookshelf on the second-hand app — fifty yuan, but the seller says “collection only”. I'm working out how to get it up to the fifth floor, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买过最划算的二手东西是什么？","p":"Nǐ mǎiguo zuì huásuàn de èrshǒu dōngxi shì shénme?","m":"What's the best second-hand bargain you've ever got?"},"replies":[{"t":"一辆自行车。","p":"Yí liàng zìxíngchē.","m":"A bike.","r":{"t":"二手自行车最划算，新的太贵了。","p":"Èrshǒu zìxíngchē zuì huásuàn, xīn de tài guì le.","m":"Second-hand bikes are the best deal — new ones cost a fortune."}},{"t":"几本旧书。","p":"Jǐ běn jiù shū.","m":"Some old books.","r":{"t":"旧书最好，有时候里面还有别人写的字。","p":"Jiù shū zuì hǎo, yǒu shíhou lǐmiàn hái yǒu biérén xiě de zì.","m":"Old books are the best — sometimes there's someone's writing inside."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又在二手 App 上逛了半天。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu zài èrshǒu App shang guàng le bàntiān.","m":"Spent ages browsing the second-hand app again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这周什么都没买。","p":"Wǒ zhè zhōu shénme dōu méi mǎi.","m":"I haven't bought anything this week."},"mem":{"zh":"你那周什么都没买","en":"You didn't buy anything that week"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你这周什么都没买，我挺佩服的。这两天我也试了一下，忍了两天没买东西——第三天，九块九的咖啡又把我拿下了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhè zhōu shénme dōu méi mǎi, wǒ tǐng pèifú de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě shì le yíxià, rěn le liǎng tiān méi mǎi dōngxi —— dì sān tiān, jiǔ kuài jiǔ de kāfēi yòu bǎ wǒ ná xià le.","m":"You said you didn't buy anything that week — I was impressed. These days I tried it too: two days without buying a thing. On day three, a 9.9 coffee got me again.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最忍不住想买的是什么？","p":"Nǐ zuì rěn bu zhù xiǎng mǎi de shì shénme?","m":"What can you least resist buying?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃的。","p":"Chī de.","m":"Food.","r":{"t":"吃的忍不住，这个正常！","p":"Chī de rěn bu zhù, zhège zhèngcháng!","m":"Can't resist food — totally normal!"}},{"t":"衣服。","p":"Yīfu.","m":"Clothes.","r":{"t":"衣服啊，我也是，一打折就心动。","p":"Yīfu a, wǒ yě shì, yì dǎzhé jiù xīndòng.","m":"Clothes, eh — me too. One sale and I'm tempted."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我忍住了，什么都没买！","p":"Jīntiān wǒ rěn zhù le, shénme dōu méi mǎi!","m":"I held out today — bought nothing!"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在哪儿买的？","p":"Nǐ zài nǎr mǎi de?","m":"Where did you get it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过台灯在哪儿买的（二手 App，卖家就住附近）","en":"You asked where she bought the lamp (a second-hand app — the seller lives nearby)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我台灯在哪儿买的。这两天在小区里又碰到那个卖家了，原来她是个大学生，要出国读书，把家里的东西都卖了。她还送了我一盆绿萝。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ táidēng zài nǎr mǎi de. Zhè liǎng tiān zài xiǎoqū lǐ yòu pèng dào nà gè màijiā le, yuánlái tā shì gè dàxuéshēng, yào chūguó dúshū, bǎ jiā lǐ de dōngxi dōu mài le. Tā hái sòng le wǒ yì pén lǜluó.","m":"Last time you asked where I got the lamp. These days I bumped into the seller again in our compound — turns out she's a university student going abroad to study, selling everything. She gave me a pothos plant too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你搬家，你最舍不得的是什么东西？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ bānjiā, nǐ zuì shěbude de shì shénme dōngxi?","m":"If you moved, what would you hate to part with most?"},"replies":[{"t":"我的书。","p":"Wǒ de shū.","m":"My books.","r":{"t":"书最沉，也最舍不得。","p":"Shū zuì chén, yě zuì shěbude.","m":"Books are the heaviest, and the hardest to let go."}},{"t":"我的床，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ de chuáng, hāha.","m":"My bed, haha.","r":{"t":"哈哈，睡惯了的床，确实舍不得。","p":"Hāha, shuì guàn le de chuáng, quèshí shěbude.","m":"Haha, a bed you're used to — fair enough."}}],"next":{"t":"台灯今天又陪我改作业了。","p":"Táidēng jīntiān yòu péi wǒ gǎi zuòyè le.","m":"The lamp kept me company marking again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你用台灯干什么？","p":"Nǐ yòng táidēng gàn shénme?","m":"What do you use the lamp for?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她用台灯干什么（晚上改作业、练书法）","en":"You asked what she uses the lamp for (marking and calligraphy at night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我用台灯干什么。这个周末我在台灯下写了一副小对联，准备过年贴。离过年还早，我就是想先练练手。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yòng táidēng gàn shénme. Zhège zhōumò wǒ zài táidēng xià xiě le yí fù xiǎo duìlián, zhǔnbèi guònián tiē. Lí guònián hái zǎo, wǒ jiùshì xiǎng xiān liànlian shǒu.","m":"Last time you asked what I use the lamp for. This weekend I wrote a small pair of couplets under it, to put up at Chinese New Year. It's still a long way off — I just wanted to practise.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你晚上一般在家做什么？","p":"Nǐ wǎnshang yìbān zài jiā zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do at home in the evenings?"},"replies":[{"t":"看书或者看剧。","p":"Kàn shū huòzhě kàn jù.","m":"Read or watch a show.","r":{"t":"那你也需要一盏好台灯！","p":"Nà nǐ yě xūyào yì zhǎn hǎo táidēng!","m":"Then you need a good lamp too!"}},{"t":"跟家里人聊天。","p":"Gēn jiā lǐ rén liáotiān.","m":"Chat with family.","r":{"t":"这个最好，比什么都强。","p":"Zhège zuì hǎo, bǐ shénme dōu qiáng.","m":"That's the best — beats everything."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在台灯下练了一会儿字。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài táidēng xià liàn le yíhuìr zì.","m":"Did a bit of calligraphy under the lamp again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-28|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我的伞也老是被风吹坏。","p":"Wǒ de sǎn yě lǎo shì bèi fēng chuī huài.","m":"My umbrellas keep breaking in the wind too."},"mem":{"zh":"你的伞也老是被风吹坏","en":"Your umbrella keeps getting wrecked by the wind too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你的伞也老是被风吹坏。这两天我的新伞经过考验了：周末刮大风，旁边的人伞都翻了，我的一点事都没有！我站在那儿，好骄傲。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ de sǎn yě lǎo shì bèi fēng chuī huài. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de xīn sǎn jīngguò kǎoyàn le: zhōumò guā dà fēng, pángbiān de rén sǎn dōu fān le, wǒ de yìdiǎn shì dōu méiyǒu! Wǒ zhàn zài nàr, hǎo jiāo'ào.","m":"You said your umbrella keeps getting wrecked by the wind too. These days my new one passed the test: big wind at the weekend, everyone else's umbrella flipped, and mine was fine! I stood there so proud.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一样东西，买了好一点的，就再也不想换？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí yàng dōngxi, mǎi le hǎo yìdiǎn de, jiù zài yě bù xiǎng huàn?","m":"Is there something you bought a better version of and never want to replace?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一双好鞋。","p":"Yǒu, yì shuāng hǎo xié.","m":"Yes — a good pair of shoes.","r":{"t":"对！好鞋子穿一天都不累。","p":"Duì! Hǎo xiézi chuān yì tiān dōu bú lèi.","m":"Right! Good shoes all day and your feet don't ache."}},{"t":"没有，我买东西都买便宜的。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ mǎi dōngxi dōu mǎi piányi de.","m":"No, I always buy the cheap stuff.","r":{"t":"我以前也是！后来伞坏了五把，我就懂了。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě shì! Hòulái sǎn huài le wǔ bǎ, wǒ jiù dǒng le.","m":"I used to be the same! Then five umbrellas broke and I got it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又有风，我的新伞还是好好的！","p":"Jīntiān yòu yǒu fēng, wǒ de xīn sǎn háishi hǎohǎo de!","m":"Windy again today and my new umbrella's still fine!"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我下雨天从来不打伞。","p":"Wǒ xià yǔ tiān cónglái bù dǎ sǎn.","m":"I never use an umbrella when it rains."},"mem":{"zh":"你下雨天从来不打伞","en":"You never use an umbrella in the rain"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你下雨天从来不打伞。这两天我想起你了：工地上下大雨，大家都把伞收起来，因为戴着安全帽，打伞也没用，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ xià yǔ tiān cónglái bù dǎ sǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng qǐ nǐ le: gōngdì shang xià dà yǔ, dàjiā dōu bǎ sǎn shōu qǐlái, yīnwèi dài zhe ānquánmào, dǎ sǎn yě méi yòng, hāha.","m":"You said you never use an umbrella in the rain. These days I thought of you: heavy rain on site, and everyone put their umbrellas away — with hard hats on, umbrellas are useless anyway, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"下雨的时候，你喜欢待在家，还是出门走走？","p":"Xià yǔ de shíhou, nǐ xǐhuan dāi zài jiā, háishi chūmén zǒuzou?","m":"When it rains, do you like staying in or going out?"},"replies":[{"t":"待在家，听雨声。","p":"Dāi zài jiā, tīng yǔ shēng.","m":"Stay home and listen to the rain.","r":{"t":"这个舒服！我女儿也喜欢听雨。","p":"Zhège shūfu! Wǒ nǚ'ér yě xǐhuan tīng yǔ.","m":"Cosy! My daughter loves listening to rain too."}},{"t":"照样出门，淋一点没关系。","p":"Zhàoyàng chūmén, lín yìdiǎn méi guānxi.","m":"Out anyway — a bit of rain's fine.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题！你比我勇敢。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí! Nǐ bǐ wǒ yǒnggǎn.","m":"No problem, no problem! You're braver than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下雨了，我想到你，那个从来不打伞的人，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān xià yǔ le, wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ, nà gè cónglái bù dǎ sǎn de rén, hāha.","m":"It rained today and I thought of you — the one who never uses an umbrella, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"现在是雨季吗？","p":"Xiànzài shì yǔjì ma?","m":"Is it rainy season now?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过拉各斯现在是不是雨季（差不多结束了，雨还是说来就来）","en":"You asked if it's rainy season in Lagos (nearly over, but rain still comes out of nowhere)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我现在是不是雨季。差不多结束了。这两天天一下子热起来，中国同事说：「拉各斯没有冬天，只有热和更热。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiànzài shì bu shì yǔjì. Chàbuduō jiéshù le. Zhè liǎng tiān tiān yíxiàzi rè qǐlái, Zhōngguó tóngshì shuō: “Lāgèsī méiyǒu dōngtiān, zhǐ yǒu rè hé gèng rè.”","m":"Last time you asked if it's rainy season. It's nearly over. These days it suddenly got hot, and my Chinese colleague said: “Lagos has no winter — just hot and hotter.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边现在是什么季节？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān xiànzài shì shénme jìjié?","m":"What season is it where you are now?"},"replies":[{"t":"冬天，挺冷的。","p":"Dōngtiān, tǐng lěng de.","m":"Winter — pretty cold.","r":{"t":"冷！我只在视频里见过雪。","p":"Lěng! Wǒ zhǐ zài shìpín lǐ jiànguo xuě.","m":"Cold! I've only seen snow in videos."}},{"t":"也很热，跟你那边差不多。","p":"Yě hěn rè, gēn nǐ nàbiān chàbuduō.","m":"Hot too — like yours.","r":{"t":"那我们一起想念冬天吧，哈哈。","p":"Nà wǒmen yìqǐ xiǎngniàn dōngtiān ba, hāha.","m":"Then let's both miss winter together, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天没下雨，可是好热。","p":"Jīntiān méi xià yǔ, kěshì hǎo rè.","m":"No rain today, but so hot."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"新伞多少钱？","p":"Xīn sǎn duōshao qián?","m":"How much was the new umbrella?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过新伞多少钱（比以前的贵三倍，可是一年都不会坏）","en":"You asked how much the new umbrella was (three times the old ones, but it'll last a year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我新伞多少钱。贵三倍！我太太听了，说我疯了。这两天下了一场大雨，她借我的伞去上夜班，回来说：「这把伞，值。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xīn sǎn duōshao qián. Guì sān bèi! Wǒ tàitai tīng le, shuō wǒ fēng le. Zhè liǎng tiān xià le yì cháng dà yǔ, tā jiè wǒ de sǎn qù shàng yèbān, huílái shuō: “Zhè bǎ sǎn, zhí.”","m":"Last time you asked how much the new umbrella cost. Three times as much! My wife said I was crazy. These days there was a downpour, she borrowed it for her night shift, and when she got back she said: “That umbrella — worth it.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买过贵、可是很值的东西吗？","p":"Nǐ mǎiguo guì, kěshì hěn zhí de dōngxi ma?","m":"Have you bought something pricey that was really worth it?"},"replies":[{"t":"买过，一个好的床垫。","p":"Mǎiguo, yí gè hǎo de chuángdiàn.","m":"Yes — a good mattress.","r":{"t":"床垫！睡得好，什么都好。","p":"Chuángdiàn! Shuì de hǎo, shénme dōu hǎo.","m":"A mattress! Sleep well and everything's better."}},{"t":"没有，我还是喜欢便宜的。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ háishi xǐhuan piányi de.","m":"No, I still prefer cheap.","r":{"t":"便宜的也有好东西！","p":"Piányi de yě yǒu hǎo dōngxi!","m":"Cheap things can be good too!"}}],"next":{"t":"新伞今天还是好好的，我很满意。","p":"Xīn sǎn jīntiān háishi hǎohǎo de, wǒ hěn mǎnyì.","m":"The new umbrella's still perfect today — very happy with it."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说个好玩的：新来的经理现在每天跟我学一句英语。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō gè hǎowán de: xīn lái de jīnglǐ xiànzài měi tiān gēn wǒ xué yí jù Yīngyǔ.","m":"Here's a fun one: the new manager now learns one English phrase from me every day."},{"t":"这周学的是 No problem。他说了十遍，最后听起来特别像「闹不了」。","p":"Zhè zhōu xué de shì No problem. Tā shuō le shí biàn, zuìhòu tīng qǐlái tèbié xiàng “nào bu liǎo”.","m":"This week's was “No problem”. He said it ten times — by the end it sounded just like 闹不了."},{"t":"我没笑。因为我说「两万五」的时候，他也没笑过我。","p":"Wǒ méi xiào. Yīnwèi wǒ shuō “liǎng wàn wǔ” de shíhou, tā yě méi xiàoguo wǒ.","m":"I didn't laugh. Because when I struggled with 两万五, he never laughed at me either."}],"replies":[{"t":"你们互相学，真好！","p":"Nǐmen hùxiāng xué, zhēn hǎo!","m":"Learning from each other — lovely!","r":{"t":"对！一个教中文，一个教英语，没问题，没问题。","p":"Duì! Yí gè jiāo Zhōngwén, yí gè jiāo Yīngyǔ, méi wèntí, méi wèntí.","m":"Right! One teaches Chinese, one teaches English — no problem, no problem."}},{"t":"你人真好，没有笑他。","p":"Nǐ rén zhēn hǎo, méiyǒu xiào tā.","m":"That's kind of you, not laughing.","r":{"t":"学语言的人，都懂这个感觉。","p":"Xué yǔyán de rén, dōu dǒng zhège gǎnjué.","m":"Everyone who learns a language knows that feeling."}}],"from":"2026-11-30"}},"2026-11-28|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢跟朋友吃火锅。","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan gēn péngyou chī huǒguō.","m":"I love hotpot with friends too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢跟朋友吃火锅","en":"You love hotpot with friends too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢跟朋友吃火锅！这两天天更冷了，我发现火锅店门口要排一个小时的队！台北一冷，大家都想吃火锅。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan gēn péngyou chī huǒguō! Zhè liǎng tiān tiān gèng lěng le, wǒ fāxiàn huǒguō diàn ménkǒu yào pái yí gè xiǎoshí de duì! Táiběi yì lěng, dàjiā dōu xiǎng chī huǒguō.","m":"You said you love hotpot with friends too! It's got even colder these days, and the queue outside the hotpot place is an hour long! The moment Taipei turns cold, everyone wants hotpot.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃火锅最爱放什么？","p":"Nǐ chī huǒguō zuì ài fàng shénme?","m":"What do you love putting in hotpot?"},"replies":[{"t":"肉，很多很多肉。","p":"Ròu, hěn duō hěn duō ròu.","m":"Meat — lots and lots of meat.","r":{"t":"我也是！一盘不够，要三盘。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Yì pán bú gòu, yào sān pán.","m":"Me too! One plate's not enough — three."}},{"t":"青菜和豆腐。","p":"Qīngcài hé dòufu.","m":"Greens and tofu.","r":{"t":"好健康！我最爱的是冻豆腐，吸满了汤。","p":"Hǎo jiànkāng! Wǒ zuì ài de shì dòng dòufu, xī mǎn le tāng.","m":"So healthy! My favourite is frozen tofu — it soaks up the broth."}}],"next":{"t":"今天好冷，又好想吃火锅。","p":"Jīntiān hǎo lěng, yòu hǎo xiǎng chī huǒguō.","m":"So cold today — craving hotpot again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这周没出去吃，都在家做饭。","p":"Wǒ zhè zhōu méi chūqù chī, dōu zài jiā zuò fàn.","m":"I didn't eat out this week — I cooked at home."},"mem":{"zh":"你那周都在家做饭","en":"You cooked at home all that week"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你都在家做饭，我好佩服。这两天我也试了！我在泡面里加了一颗蛋和青菜，室友说：「这算做饭吗？」我说：「算！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dōu zài jiā zuò fàn, wǒ hǎo pèifú. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě shì le! Wǒ zài pàomiàn lǐ jiā le yì kē dàn hé qīngcài, shìyǒu shuō: “Zhè suàn zuò fàn ma?” Wǒ shuō: “Suàn!”","m":"You said you cooked at home all week — so impressive. These days I tried too! I added an egg and some greens to instant noodles. My roommate asked: “Does that count as cooking?” I said: “It does!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最拿手的菜是什么？","p":"Nǐ zuì náshǒu de cài shì shénme?","m":"What's your best dish?"},"replies":[{"t":"番茄炒蛋。","p":"Fānqié chǎo dàn.","m":"Tomato and egg stir-fry.","r":{"t":"这个我也想学！看起来不难。","p":"Zhège wǒ yě xiǎng xué! Kàn qǐlái bù nán.","m":"I want to learn that! Looks easy."}},{"t":"没有拿手的，能吃就好。","p":"Méiyǒu náshǒu de, néng chī jiù hǎo.","m":"Nothing special — edible is fine.","r":{"t":"哈哈，能吃就很厉害了！","p":"Hāha, néng chī jiù hěn lìhai le!","m":"Haha, edible is already impressive!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又煮泡面了，想到你都在家做饭。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu zhǔ pàomiàn le, xiǎng dào nǐ dōu zài jiā zuò fàn.","m":"Instant noodles again today — thought of you cooking properly at home."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们吃了几个小时？","p":"Nǐmen chī le jǐ gè xiǎoshí?","m":"How many hours did you eat for?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们吃了几个小时（四个小时，服务员都在扫地了）","en":"You asked how long they ate for (about four hours — the staff were sweeping up)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们吃了几个小时。四个小时！这两天我才发现，我的外套还有火锅的味道，洗了两次都还在，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen chī le jǐ gè xiǎoshí. Sì gè xiǎoshí! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ cái fāxiàn, wǒ de wàitào hái yǒu huǒguō de wèidao, xǐ le liǎng cì dōu hái zài, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how many hours we ate for. Four! These days I noticed my jacket still smells of hotpot — washed twice and it's still there, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟朋友聊天，最长聊过多久？","p":"Nǐ gēn péngyou liáotiān, zuì cháng liáoguo duō jiǔ?","m":"What's the longest you've ever chatted with friends?"},"replies":[{"t":"一整个晚上。","p":"Yì zhěng gè wǎnshang.","m":"A whole night.","r":{"t":"一整个晚上！那你们一定很好。","p":"Yì zhěng gè wǎnshang! Nà nǐmen yídìng hěn hǎo.","m":"A whole night! You must be close."}},{"t":"两三个小时吧。","p":"Liǎng sān gè xiǎoshí ba.","m":"Two or three hours, I guess.","r":{"t":"两三个小时也很开心了！","p":"Liǎng sān gè xiǎoshí yě hěn kāixīn le!","m":"Two or three hours is plenty of fun!"}}],"next":{"t":"跟朋友聊了四个小时，今天喉咙还有点哑，哈哈。","p":"Gēn péngyou liáo le sì gè xiǎoshí, jīntiān hóulóng hái yǒudiǎn yǎ, hāha.","m":"Four hours of chatting — my voice is still a bit hoarse today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喜欢辣的锅底吗？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan là de guōdǐ ma?","m":"Do you like a spicy broth?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喜不喜欢辣锅（喜欢，只能吃小辣，一般点鸳鸯锅）","en":"You asked if she likes a spicy broth (yes, but only mild — they usually get a half-and-half pot)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喜不喜欢辣锅。这两天我挑战了一下中辣……结果喝了三杯冰红茶，嘴巴还是在烧。我还是乖乖回去吃小辣吧。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xǐ bu xǐhuan là guō. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ tiǎozhàn le yíxià zhōng là …… jiéguǒ hē le sān bēi bīng hóngchá, zuǐba háishi zài shāo. Wǒ háishi guāiguāi huíqù chī xiǎo là ba.","m":"Last time you asked if I like spicy hotpot. These days I tried medium spicy… three iced black teas later, my mouth was still on fire. Back to mild for me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你能吃多辣？","p":"Nǐ néng chī duō là?","m":"How spicy can you go?"},"replies":[{"t":"很能吃，越辣越好。","p":"Hěn néng chī, yuè là yuè hǎo.","m":"Very — the hotter the better.","r":{"t":"好厉害！下次你吃辣的那边，我吃不辣的那边。","p":"Hǎo lìhai! Xià cì nǐ chī là de nà biān, wǒ chī bú là de nà biān.","m":"Amazing! Next time you take the spicy side, I'll take the mild."}},{"t":"一点点就好。","p":"Yìdiǎndiǎn jiù hǎo.","m":"Just a little.","r":{"t":"那我们一样，小辣就好！","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng, xiǎo là jiù hǎo!","m":"Then we're the same — mild is plenty!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又点了小辣的，刚刚好。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu diǎn le xiǎo là de, gānggāng hǎo.","m":"Went for mild again today — just right."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"冬季菜单上线一个礼拜了！店长说，来点饮料的外国客人变多了。","p":"Dōngjì càidān shàngxiàn yí gè lǐbài le! Diànzhǎng shuō, lái diǎn yǐnliào de wàiguó kèrén biàn duō le.","m":"The winter menu's been up a week! My manager says more foreign customers are coming in."},{"t":"所以他又给我一个任务：把甜点也翻成英文。第一个是「芋圆」，我想了一个晚上。","p":"Suǒyǐ tā yòu gěi wǒ yí gè rènwù: bǎ tiándiǎn yě fān chéng Yīngwén. Dì yī gè shì “yùyuán”, wǒ xiǎng le yí gè wǎnshang.","m":"So he's given me another job: translating the desserts too. First up was 芋圆, and I spent a whole evening on it."},{"t":"最后写了 taro balls。同学说听起来像网球，哈哈。","p":"Zuìhòu xiě le taro balls. Tóngxué shuō tīng qǐlái xiàng wǎngqiú, hāha.","m":"In the end I wrote “taro balls”. My classmate says it sounds like tennis balls, haha."}],"replies":[{"t":"taro balls 我听得懂！","p":"Taro balls wǒ tīng de dǒng!","m":"I'd understand “taro balls”!","r":{"t":"太好了！那我就不改了。","p":"Tài hǎo le! Nà wǒ jiù bù gǎi le.","m":"Great! Then I'm keeping it."}},{"t":"芋圆是什么味道？","p":"Yùyuán shì shénme wèidao?","m":"What do taro balls taste like?","r":{"t":"QQ 的，有一点芋头的香味，放在热汤里最好吃。","p":"QQ de, yǒu yìdiǎn yùtou de xiāngwèi, fàng zài rè tāng lǐ zuì hǎochī.","m":"Chewy — “QQ”, we say — with a hint of taro. Best in a hot sweet soup."}}],"from":"2026-11-30"}},"2026-11-28|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I bought a winter coat too.","p":"","m":"我也买了件冬天的外套。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也买了一件冬天的外套","en":"You bought a winter coat too"},"later":{"t":"You said you bought a winter coat too. Mine got its first test at the weekend — a long cold walk with my mum. She said I finally look like an adult. I'll take it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也买了一件冬天的外套。我的这件周末第一次经受考验——跟我妈在冷风里走了很久。她说我终于像个大人了。我就当是夸我了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you feel the cold easily?","p":"","m":"你怕冷吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, very.","p":"","m":"很怕。","r":{"t":"Then I hope your new coat's a warm one.","p":"","m":"那希望你的新外套够暖和。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不怎么怕。","r":{"t":"Lucky. I'm a big baby about the cold.","p":"","m":"真好。我一冷就像个小孩。"}}],"next":{"t":"New coat, day one. Toasty.","p":"","m":"新外套，第一天。暖暖的。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I didn't buy anything this week.","p":"","m":"我这周什么都没买。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那周什么都没买","en":"You didn't buy anything that week"},"later":{"t":"You said you didn't buy anything. I respect it. I write about money, and I still spent twenty minutes on Black Friday deals for things I didn't need. One coat. I'm stopping there. Probably.","p":"","m":"你上次说你什么都没买。我佩服。我是写钱的记者，还在「黑色星期五」的打折里泡了二十分钟，看的都是用不着的东西。就买了一件外套。到此为止。大概吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do sales tempt you?","p":"","m":"打折会让你心动吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, every time.","p":"","m":"会，每次都会。","r":{"t":"Same. Sales are dangerous.","p":"","m":"一样。打折很危险。"}},{"t":"No, I only buy what I need.","p":"","m":"不会，我只买需要的。","r":{"t":"Teach me. Please.","p":"","m":"教教我。拜托了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Unsubscribed from three shop emails today. Feeling strong.","p":"","m":"今天退订了三家商店的邮件。感觉很坚强。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much did you save?","p":"","m":"你省了多少？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他省了多少（四成左右，他查了三遍）","en":"You asked how much he saved (about forty percent — he checked three times)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much I saved. Forty percent. Then a friend showed me the same coat was nearly the same price in October. So — maybe ten percent. Black Friday, eh.","p":"","m":"你上次问我省了多少。四成。后来朋友给我看，同一件外套十月份的价钱也差不多。所以——大概省了一成。黑色星期五嘛。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you check prices before you buy?","p":"","m":"买东西之前，你会比价吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Always.","p":"","m":"每次都比。","r":{"t":"Good. Better than me.","p":"","m":"好。比我强。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太比。","r":{"t":"Probably happier that way, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，那样可能更开心。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still wearing the coat. Still a good coat.","p":"","m":"还穿着那件外套。还是件好外套。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What was wrong with the old one?","p":"","m":"旧的那件怎么了？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他旧外套有什么问题（漏雨，在伦敦不太行）","en":"You asked what was wrong with his old coat (it let the rain in — not ideal in London)"},"later":{"t":"You asked about my old coat. It let the rain in. I gave it to a charity shop at the weekend — the lady said, 'Someone will love this.' I hope they live somewhere dry.","p":"","m":"你上次问我旧外套有什么问题。漏雨。周末我把它捐给了慈善商店——店里的阿姨说：「会有人喜欢的。」希望那个人住在不下雨的地方。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do with old clothes?","p":"","m":"你的旧衣服一般怎么处理？"},"replies":[{"t":"Give them away.","p":"","m":"送人。","r":{"t":"Good. Nicer than the bin.","p":"","m":"好。比扔掉强。"}},{"t":"Keep them — just in case.","p":"","m":"留着，以防万一。","r":{"t":"Ha, my mum does that. Her loft is full.","p":"","m":"哈，我妈也这样。她家阁楼都满了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dry today, finally. Thanks, new coat.","p":"","m":"今天终于是干的了。谢谢你，新外套。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-28|en|elin":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I bring snacks to work too.","p":"","m":"我也会带点心去上班。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也会带零食去上班","en":"You bring snacks to work too"},"later":{"t":"You said you bring snacks to work too. This week a colleague brought lussekatter — saffron buns. It's a bit early, they're really for December. Nobody complained.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也会带零食去上班。这周一个同事带了 lussekatter——藏红花面包。有点早了，那其实是十二月吃的。不过没人抱怨。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best snack someone's brought in?","p":"","m":"别人带来过最好吃的零食是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Home-made cake.","p":"","m":"自己做的蛋糕。","r":{"t":"The best. Home-made always wins.","p":"","m":"最棒。自己做的永远赢。"}},{"t":"Fruit, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，水果。","r":{"t":"Healthy and good. Nice colleagues.","p":"","m":"健康又好。同事真不错。"}}],"next":{"t":"Office snacks are gone already.","p":"","m":"办公室的零食已经没了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'd keep all the buns for myself!","p":"","m":"我会把肉桂卷全留给自己！"},"mem":{"zh":"换了你，你会把面包全留给自己","en":"You'd keep all the buns for yourself"},"later":{"t":"You said you'd keep all the buns for yourself! I thought of you at the weekend — I had two buns alone in the kitchen, before anyone else woke up. You'd be proud.","p":"","m":"你上次说你会把面包全留给自己！周末我想起了你——趁家里人还没醒，我一个人在厨房吃了两个。你会为我骄傲的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you ever have a secret treat?","p":"","m":"你会偷偷犒劳自己吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"All the time.","p":"","m":"经常。","r":{"t":"Good. Secret treats taste better.","p":"","m":"好。偷偷吃的更香。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Then try one this week. Small and secret.","p":"","m":"那这周试一次。小小的，悄悄的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought one bun just for me today. Our secret.","p":"","m":"今天给自己买了一个面包。我们的秘密。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you bake them?","p":"","m":"是你自己烤的吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过面包是不是她烤的（不是，面包店买的）","en":"You asked if she baked them (no — from the bakery)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I baked them. No! But at the weekend I baked pepparkakor — gingerbread biscuits — with my kids. Half of them were stars, half were… we're not sure.","p":"","m":"你上次问面包是不是我烤的。不是！不过周末我跟孩子们烤了 pepparkakor——姜饼。一半是星星，另一半……我们也说不清是什么。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you bake?","p":"","m":"你会烤东西吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, sometimes.","p":"","m":"会，有时候。","r":{"t":"Lovely. The kitchen smells so good.","p":"","m":"真好。厨房会好香。"}},{"t":"No, I buy everything.","p":"","m":"不会，都是买的。","r":{"t":"To be fair, bakeries are better at it.","p":"","m":"说实话，面包店做得更好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bakery again today. I'm loyal.","p":"","m":"今天又去了面包店。我很专一。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many were in the bag?","p":"","m":"一袋有几个？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过袋子里有几个（十二个，十分钟就没了）","en":"You asked how many were in the bag (twelve — gone in ten minutes)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many buns. Twelve, gone in ten minutes. So this week I'll bring twenty-four. My colleagues have started looking at my bag when I walk in.","p":"","m":"你上次问有几个面包。十二个，十分钟就没了。所以这周我要带二十四个。现在我一进门，同事们就盯着我的包看。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who in your life is always hungry?","p":"","m":"你身边谁总是饿？"},"replies":[{"t":"Me, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，我自己。","r":{"t":"Ha! Then you'd love our office.","p":"","m":"哈！那你会爱上我们办公室。"}},{"t":"My friends.","p":"","m":"我的朋友们。","r":{"t":"Bring them buns. You'll be a hero.","p":"","m":"带面包给他们。你会成为英雄。"}}],"next":{"t":"Twelve buns, gone again.","p":"","m":"十二个面包，又没了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Sunday was the first Sunday of Advent. We lit the first of four candles.","p":"","m":"周日是将临期的第一个主日。我们点上了四根蜡烛里的第一根。"},{"t":"One more every Sunday until Christmas. My kids are already arguing about who lights the next one.","p":"","m":"每个周日多点一根，一直到圣诞节。孩子们已经在吵下一根谁来点了。"},{"t":"To be fair, I want to light it too.","p":"","m":"说实话，我也想点。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That sounds cosy.","p":"","m":"听起来很温馨。","r":{"t":"It is. Four candles, four Sundays.","p":"","m":"是的。四根蜡烛，四个周日。"}},{"t":"Who lit the first one?","p":"","m":"第一根谁点的？","r":{"t":"My oldest. My youngest got to blow it out. Peace in the family.","p":"","m":"我家老大。老二负责吹灭。家里和平了。"}}],"from":"2026-11-30"}},"2026-11-28|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I bought new headphones too.","p":"","m":"我也买了新耳机。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也买了新耳机","en":"You bought new headphones too"},"later":{"t":"You said you bought new headphones too! I wore mine to the beach shoot at the weekend, to hear the beat over the waves. The dancer, Esi, borrowed them and didn't want to give them back.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也买了新耳机！周末在海滩拍视频，我戴着它，在浪声里也听得清节奏。舞者 Esi 借去戴了，就不想还了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you listen to most?","p":"","m":"你最常听什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Music, all day.","p":"","m":"音乐，一整天。","r":{"t":"My kind of person.","p":"","m":"我喜欢你这样的人。"}},{"t":"Podcasts.","p":"","m":"播客。","r":{"t":"Nice. Good headphones make voices so clear.","p":"","m":"不错。好耳机让人声特别清楚。"}}],"next":{"t":"Headphones on all day today, chale.","p":"","m":"今天戴了一整天耳机，兄弟。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm saving for headphones.","p":"","m":"我在攒钱买耳机。"},"mem":{"zh":"你在攒钱买耳机","en":"You're saving for headphones"},"later":{"t":"You said you're saving for headphones. Tip from me: test them in the shop with a song you know really well — then you hear what's new. I used my mum's favourite highlife song.","p":"","m":"你上次说你在攒钱买耳机。给你个小建议：在店里用一首你特别熟的歌试——这样就能听出哪里不一样。我用的是我妈最爱的一首 highlife 老歌。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What song would you test them with?","p":"","m":"你会用哪首歌试耳机？"},"replies":[{"t":"An old favourite.","p":"","m":"一首最爱的老歌。","r":{"t":"Perfect. You know every sound already.","p":"","m":"完美。每个声音你都熟。"}},{"t":"Something with lots of bass.","p":"","m":"低音很多的歌。","r":{"t":"Chale, you're a producer at heart.","p":"","m":"兄弟，你骨子里是个制作人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your headphone fund. You'll get there.","p":"","m":"想到你在攒的耳机钱。你会攒够的。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you get?","p":"","m":"你买的什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买了什么（录音室耳机，大，可是每个小声音都听得见）","en":"You asked what he got (studio headphones — big, but you hear every little sound)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I got. Studio headphones. Now I hear everything — even mistakes in my old songs. This week I fixed three beats I thought were finished. Chale, they were not finished.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买了什么。录音室耳机。现在我什么都听得见——连老歌里的错都听出来了。这周我改了三段以为已经做完的节奏。兄弟，根本没做完。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever found a mistake in something you thought was done?","p":"","m":"你有没有在以为做完的东西里发现过错？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, many times.","p":"","m":"有，很多次。","r":{"t":"Same. It means you're getting better.","p":"","m":"一样。说明你在进步。"}},{"t":"Not that I noticed.","p":"","m":"没发现过。","r":{"t":"Lucky — or you need better headphones, haha.","p":"","m":"运气好——或者你需要更好的耳机，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Found another tiny mistake today. Fixed it.","p":"","m":"今天又找到一个小错误。改好了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Are they for music work?","p":"","m":"是做音乐用的吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过耳机是不是做音乐用的（做节奏用，也在坐车时用）","en":"You asked if they're for music work (for making beats — and bus rides)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if they're for music. Yes — and the trotro. This week the trotro was so loud I turned my music up, then missed my stop. I got off two stops later, laughing.","p":"","m":"你上次问耳机是不是做音乐用的。是的——也在 trotro（小巴）上用。这周小巴太吵，我把音乐开大了，结果坐过了站。多坐了两站才下车，一路笑。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you listen to anything on the bus?","p":"","m":"坐车的时候你听东西吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always.","p":"","m":"听，每次都听。","r":{"t":"Then don't miss your stop like me!","p":"","m":"那别像我一样坐过站！"}},{"t":"No, I watch the street.","p":"","m":"不听，我看街上。","r":{"t":"Nice. The street has its own music.","p":"","m":"不错。街上有它自己的音乐。"}}],"next":{"t":"Trotro ride with good music today.","p":"","m":"今天坐 trotro 听着好音乐。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Part two is filmed! Esi and I shot it on the beach at the weekend.","p":"","m":"第二集拍完了！周末我跟 Esi 在海滩拍的。"},{"t":"Afterwards some friends brought drums, and we played till the sun went down.","p":"","m":"拍完以后，几个朋友带了鼓，我们一直打到太阳下山。"},{"t":"Chale, I think those drums are going into the next song.","p":"","m":"兄弟，我觉得这些鼓声要放进下一首歌了。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Can't wait to hear it!","p":"","m":"好想听！","r":{"t":"Soon, I promise. You'll be one of the first.","p":"","m":"很快，我保证。你会是最早听到的人之一。"}},{"t":"Who's Esi?","p":"","m":"Esi 是谁？","r":{"t":"A dancer from Kumasi. She's the one who made my song blow up, chale.","p":"","m":"库马西的一个舞者。就是她让我的歌火起来的，兄弟。"}}],"from":"2026-11-30"}},"2026-11-28|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-28","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I bought a secondhand bike too.","p":"","m":"我也买了一辆二手自行车。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也买了一辆二手自行车","en":"You bought a second-hand bike too"},"later":{"t":"You said you bought a second-hand bike too! On Sunday I rode mine to Central Park and sketched on the grass for an hour. Cold fingers, but honestly, a perfect day.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也买了一辆二手自行车！周日我骑着它去了中央公园，在草地上画了一个小时速写。手指冻得冰凉，可是说实话，完美的一天。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where's your favourite place to ride?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢骑车去哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"Along a river or the sea.","p":"","m":"沿着河或者海边。","r":{"t":"Nice. Water makes everything calm.","p":"","m":"不错。有水，什么都安静了。"}},{"t":"Just around my neighbourhood.","p":"","m":"就在家附近转转。","r":{"t":"That's how you really get to know a place.","p":"","m":"这样才能真正认识一个地方。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bike's squeaking but still rolling.","p":"","m":"车还在吱吱叫，可是照样能骑。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I can't ride a bike.","p":"","m":"我不会骑自行车。"},"mem":{"zh":"你不会骑自行车","en":"You can't ride a bike"},"later":{"t":"You said you can't ride a bike. Honestly, I was bad too, until this year. This week I fell off once — very slowly, in front of a hot-dog stand. The hot-dog guy clapped.","p":"","m":"你上次说你不会骑自行车。说实话，我今年之前也骑得很差。这周我摔了一次——摔得很慢，就在一个热狗摊前面。卖热狗的大哥还鼓掌了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something you've always wanted to learn?","p":"","m":"有没有一件事，你一直想学？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, swimming.","p":"","m":"有，游泳。","r":{"t":"Do it! Never too late.","p":"","m":"去学！永远不晚。"}},{"t":"Riding a bike, actually.","p":"","m":"其实就是骑车。","r":{"t":"Then let's both learn. I fall, you fall, we laugh.","p":"","m":"那我们一起学。我摔，你摔，我们一起笑。"}}],"next":{"t":"Practised riding again today. Slowly.","p":"","m":"今天又练了骑车。慢慢地。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much was it?","p":"","m":"多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过自行车多少钱（一百美元，有点吱吱响）","en":"You asked how much it was (a hundred dollars — it squeaks a bit)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much. A hundred dollars. This week the squeak got louder, so I asked at a bike shop. Five dollars of oil, two minutes. Now it's silent. Honestly, I almost miss it.","p":"","m":"你上次问多少钱。一百块。这周吱吱声更响了，我就去自行车店问了。五块钱的油，两分钟。现在一点声音都没有了。说实话，我有点想它。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you fix things yourself, or get help?","p":"","m":"东西坏了，你自己修还是找人？"},"replies":[{"t":"I try myself first.","p":"","m":"先自己试试。","r":{"t":"Respect. I always ask, haha.","p":"","m":"佩服。我每次都去问人，哈哈。"}},{"t":"I get help.","p":"","m":"找人帮忙。","r":{"t":"Same. Faster, and you meet people.","p":"","m":"一样。更快，还能认识人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Squeak, squeak, all the way today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天一路吱吱吱，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it safe to ride in New York?","p":"","m":"在纽约骑车安全吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过在纽约骑车安全不安全（自行车道多了，他骑得慢）","en":"You asked if it's safe to ride in New York (more bike lanes now — he goes slowly)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's safe. More bike lanes now. But this week a taxi stopped in the bike lane right in front of me. I shouted 'Hey!' — loud, in English, without thinking. Small win.","p":"","m":"你上次问在纽约骑车安全不安全。自行车道多了。不过这周有辆出租车就停在我前面的自行车道上。我喊了一声「嘿！」——很大声，用英语，想都没想。小小的胜利。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you feel safe getting around where you live?","p":"","m":"在你住的地方，出门你觉得安全吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多时候安全。","r":{"t":"Good. That matters a lot.","p":"","m":"好。这个很重要。"}},{"t":"Not always.","p":"","m":"不总是。","r":{"t":"Then go slow, like me. Slow is safe.","p":"","m":"那就像我一样慢慢来。慢就是安全。"}}],"next":{"t":"Rode slowly again today. Safe and sound.","p":"","m":"今天又慢慢骑了。平平安安。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"My first Thanksgiving! My colleague Jess invited me to her family's place in Brooklyn.","p":"","m":"我的第一个感恩节！同事 Jess 请我去她在布鲁克林的家里吃饭。"},{"t":"Everyone said what they're thankful for. When it was my turn, I said: 'People who say things again, slowly, for me.'","p":"","m":"每个人都说了自己感谢什么。轮到我，我说：「感谢那些愿意为我慢慢再说一遍的人。」"},{"t":"Her grandma laughed and gave me extra pie. Honestly, the best answer I've ever given.","p":"","m":"她奶奶笑了，多给了我一块派。说实话，这是我说过最好的一句回答。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's a lovely answer.","p":"","m":"这个回答真好。","r":{"t":"Thanks. I practised it on the subway, haha.","p":"","m":"谢谢。我在地铁上练过，哈哈。"}},{"t":"What kind of pie?","p":"","m":"什么派？","r":{"t":"Pumpkin. I'd never had it. Now I need more.","p":"","m":"南瓜派。我以前没吃过。现在还想吃。"}}],"from":"2026-11-30"}},"2026-11-29|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-29","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我妈也老是做太多。","p":"Wǒ mā yě lǎo shì zuò tài duō.","m":"My mum always makes too much too."},"mem":{"zh":"你妈妈也老是做太多","en":"Your mum always makes too much too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你妈妈也老是做太多。我带回来的饺子，冰箱里冻了一层。这两天天天吃饺子，同事都说我身上有韭菜味儿——其实是白菜的！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ māma yě lǎo shì zuò tài duō. Wǒ dài huílái de jiǎozi, bīngxiāng lǐ dòng le yì céng. Zhè liǎng tiān tiāntiān chī jiǎozi, tóngshì dōu shuō wǒ shēn shang yǒu jiǔcài wèir —— qíshí shì báicài de!","m":"You said your mum always makes too much too. The dumplings I brought back fill a whole layer of my freezer. These days it's been dumplings every day — my colleagues say I smell of chives. They're cabbage ones, actually!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"家里人给你带吃的，你一般吃得完吗？","p":"Jiā lǐ rén gěi nǐ dài chī de, nǐ yìbān chī de wán ma?","m":"When family gives you food to take home, do you usually finish it?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃不完，最后分给朋友。","p":"Chī bu wán, zuìhòu fēn gěi péngyou.","m":"No — I end up sharing with friends.","r":{"t":"好主意！我也带几个给同事尝尝。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi! Wǒ yě dài jǐ gè gěi tóngshì chángchang.","m":"Good idea! I'll take some for my colleagues to try."}},{"t":"吃得完，我很能吃。","p":"Chī de wán, wǒ hěn néng chī.","m":"Yes — I can eat a lot.","r":{"t":"那你来我家，帮我吃！","p":"Nà nǐ lái wǒ jiā, bāng wǒ chī!","m":"Then come to mine and help me!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又是饺子，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu shì jiǎozi, hāha.","m":"Dumplings for lunch again today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"这个周末我一个人吃的饭。","p":"Zhège zhōumò wǒ yí gè rén chī de fàn.","m":"I ate on my own this weekend."},"mem":{"zh":"你那个周末一个人吃的饭","en":"You ate on your own that weekend"},"later":{"t":"你上次说那个周末你一个人吃的饭。我想起我刚工作那两年，周末也常常一个人吃。那时候我最爱去楼下一家小馆子，点一碗炸酱面，老板总多给我一勺酱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nà gè zhōumò nǐ yí gè rén chī de fàn. Wǒ xiǎng qǐ wǒ gāng gōngzuò nà liǎng nián, zhōumò yě chángcháng yí gè rén chī. Nà shíhou wǒ zuì ài qù lóuxià yì jiā xiǎo guǎnzi, diǎn yì wǎn zhájiàngmiàn, lǎobǎn zǒng duō gěi wǒ yì sháo jiàng.","m":"You said you ate alone that weekend. It reminded me of my first couple of years working — I often ate alone at weekends too. My favourite was a little place downstairs; I'd order zhajiang noodles, and the owner always gave me an extra spoon of sauce.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个人吃饭的时候，喜欢吃什么？","p":"Nǐ yí gè rén chī fàn de shíhou, xǐhuan chī shénme?","m":"When you eat alone, what do you like to eat?"},"replies":[{"t":"一碗面，简单。","p":"Yì wǎn miàn, jiǎndān.","m":"A bowl of noodles — simple.","r":{"t":"面最好，一个人吃也不冷清。","p":"Miàn zuì hǎo, yí gè rén chī yě bù lěngqing.","m":"Noodles are perfect — even alone, it doesn't feel lonely."}},{"t":"点个外卖。","p":"Diǎn gè wàimài.","m":"Order a takeaway.","r":{"t":"外卖也挺好，想吃什么点什么。","p":"Wàimài yě tǐng hǎo, xiǎng chī shénme diǎn shénme.","m":"Takeaway's good too — whatever you fancy."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午我也一个人吃，点了一碗炸酱面。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ wǒ yě yí gè rén chī, diǎn le yì wǎn zhájiàngmiàn.","m":"Ate alone at lunch today too — a bowl of zhajiang noodles."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"是什么馅儿的饺子？","p":"Shì shénme xiànr de jiǎozi?","m":"What filling were the dumplings?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是什么馅儿的饺子（猪肉白菜，她从小吃到大）","en":"You asked what filling the dumplings had (pork and cabbage — she grew up on them)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是什么馅儿的饺子。猪肉白菜。这两天我妈打电话说，下回包三鲜的：虾仁、鸡蛋、韭菜。她说冬天就该多包几样。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì shénme xiànr de jiǎozi. Zhūròu báicài. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā dǎ diànhuà shuō, xià huí bāo sānxiān de: xiārén, jīdàn, jiǔcài. Tā shuō dōngtiān jiù gāi duō bāo jǐ yàng.","m":"Last time you asked what filling the dumplings had. Pork and cabbage. These days my mum called to say next time she'll make “three delicacies”: shrimp, egg and chives. She says winter's the time to make a few kinds.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢什么馅儿的饺子？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan shénme xiànr de jiǎozi?","m":"What's your favourite dumpling filling?"},"replies":[{"t":"猪肉白菜，跟你一样。","p":"Zhūròu báicài, gēn nǐ yíyàng.","m":"Pork and cabbage, same as you.","r":{"t":"咱们口味一样！","p":"Zánmen kǒuwèi yíyàng!","m":"We have the same taste!"}},{"t":"我还没吃过几次饺子。","p":"Wǒ hái méi chīguo jǐ cì jiǎozi.","m":"I've hardly ever had dumplings.","r":{"t":"那下次来北京，让我妈给你包！","p":"Nà xià cì lái Běijīng, ràng wǒ mā gěi nǐ bāo!","m":"Then next time you're in Beijing, my mum will make you some!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天吃的还是我妈包的猪肉白菜。","p":"Jīntiān chī de háishi wǒ mā bāo de zhūròu báicài.","m":"Still eating Mum's pork and cabbage today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你也帮着包了吗？","p":"Nǐ yě bāng zhe bāo le ma?","m":"Did you help make them?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她有没有帮着包（包了几个，妈妈说太丑）","en":"You asked if she helped make them (a few — her mum said they were ugly)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我有没有帮着包。这两天我从冰箱里拿饺子，一眼就认得出哪几个是我包的——最丑的那几个，哈哈。不过煮出来，味道一样。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yǒu méiyǒu bāng zhe bāo. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ cóng bīngxiāng lǐ ná jiǎozi, yì yǎn jiù rèn de chū nǎ jǐ gè shì wǒ bāo de —— zuì chǒu de nà jǐ gè, hāha. Búguò zhǔ chūlái, wèidao yíyàng.","m":"Last time you asked if I helped make them. These days when I take dumplings out of the freezer, I can spot mine at a glance — the ugliest ones, haha. But once they're boiled, they taste the same.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会包饺子吗？","p":"Nǐ huì bāo jiǎozi ma?","m":"Can you make dumplings?"},"replies":[{"t":"会一点，包得不好看。","p":"Huì yìdiǎn, bāo de bù hǎokàn.","m":"A bit — they don't look great.","r":{"t":"不好看没关系，好吃就行！","p":"Bù hǎokàn méi guānxi, hǎochī jiù xíng!","m":"Doesn't matter how they look, as long as they taste good!"}},{"t":"不会，想学。","p":"Bú huì, xiǎng xué.","m":"No, but I'd like to learn.","r":{"t":"先学捏边儿，捏紧了就不会破。","p":"Xiān xué niē biānr, niē jǐn le jiù bú huì pò.","m":"Start with pinching the edge — pinch it tight and it won't burst."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又煮了几个饺子，丑的那几个也很好吃。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zhǔ le jǐ gè jiǎozi, chǒu de nà jǐ gè yě hěn hǎochī.","m":"Boiled a few more dumplings today — the ugly ones taste great too."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我班上有个德国学生，前阵子去相亲了。周末，他跟那个女生去胡同里走了走。","p":"Wǒ bān shang yǒu gè Déguó xuésheng, qián zhènzi qù xiāngqīn le. Zhōumò, tā gēn nà gè nǚshēng qù hútòng lǐ zǒu le zǒu.","m":"A German student in my class went on a set-up date a while back. At the weekend he went for a walk in the hutongs with her."},{"t":"回来他学会了一个新词：「遛弯儿」。他说：「老师，我们不是约会，是遛弯儿。」","p":"Huílái tā xuéhuì le yí gè xīn cí: “liùwānr”. Tā shuō: “Lǎoshī, wǒmen bú shì yuēhuì, shì liùwānr.”","m":"He came back with a new word: 遛弯儿, “going for a stroll”. He said: “Teacher, it wasn't a date — we were just strolling.”"},{"t":"全班都笑了。我说：在北京，遛弯儿遛着遛着，就成了。","p":"Quán bān dōu xiào le. Wǒ shuō: zài Běijīng, liùwānr liù zhe liù zhe, jiù chéng le.","m":"The whole class laughed. I said: in Beijing, you stroll and stroll, and then it just happens."}],"replies":[{"t":"「遛弯儿」这个词真可爱！","p":"“Liùwānr” zhège cí zhēn kě'ài!","m":"遛弯儿 is such a cute word!","r":{"t":"北京人吃完晚饭都爱说：「走，遛弯儿去。」","p":"Běijīng rén chī wán wǎnfàn dōu ài shuō: “Zǒu, liùwānr qù.”","m":"After dinner, Beijingers love to say: “Come on, let's go for a stroll.”"}},{"t":"希望他们成了！","p":"Xīwàng tāmen chéng le!","m":"I hope it works out!","r":{"t":"我也希望！全班都在等下文呢。","p":"Wǒ yě xīwàng! Quán bān dōu zài děng xiàwén ne.","m":"Me too! The whole class is waiting for what happens next."}}],"from":"2026-12-01"}},"2026-11-29|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-11-29","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢跟奶奶一起做饭。","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan gēn nǎinai yìqǐ zuò fàn.","m":"I love cooking with my grandma too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢跟奶奶一起做饭","en":"You love cooking with your grandma too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢跟奶奶一起做饭！奶奶把 ajiaco 的做法告诉我了，我写在我的小本子上，旁边画了三个土豆，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan gēn nǎinai yìqǐ zuò fàn! Nǎinai bǎ ajiaco de zuòfǎ gàosu wǒ le, wǒ xiě zài wǒ de xiǎo běnzi shang, pángbiān huà le sān gè tǔdòu, hāha.","m":"You said you love cooking with your grandma too! My dad's mum told me how to make ajiaco — I wrote it in my little notebook and drew three potatoes next to it, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里谁做饭最好吃？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ shéi zuò fàn zuì hǎochī?","m":"Who's the best cook in your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"我奶奶。","p":"Wǒ nǎinai.","m":"My grandma.","r":{"t":"奶奶们都是最好的厨师！","p":"Nǎinaimen dōu shì zuì hǎo de chúshī!","m":"Grandmas are the best cooks!"}},{"t":"我自己，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ zìjǐ, hāha.","m":"Me, haha.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 那你教我。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Nà nǐ jiāo wǒ.","m":"¡Qué chévere! Teach me, then."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我还在想奶奶讲的故事。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ hái zài xiǎng nǎinai jiǎng de gùshi.","m":"I'm still thinking about my dad's mum's stories today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这个周末没跟家里人吃饭。","p":"Wǒ zhège zhōumò méi gēn jiā li rén chī fàn.","m":"I didn't eat with my family this weekend."},"mem":{"zh":"你那个周末没跟家里人吃饭","en":"You didn't eat with family that weekend"},"later":{"t":"你上次说那个周末没跟家里人吃饭。我想到你，就给住在别的城市的表姐打了电话。她说她也好久没跟家里人吃饭了。我们说好，圣诞节一起吃。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nà gè zhōumò méi gēn jiā lǐ rén chī fàn. Wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ, jiù gěi zhù zài bié de chéngshì de biǎojiě dǎ le diànhuà. Tā shuō tā yě hǎo jiǔ méi gēn jiā lǐ rén chī fàn le. Wǒmen shuō hǎo, Shèngdàn Jié yìqǐ chī.","m":"You said you didn't eat with family that weekend. Thinking of you, I called my cousin who lives in another city. She said she hadn't eaten with family in ages either. We've agreed to have Christmas dinner together.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近一次跟家里人一起吃饭，是什么时候？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn yí cì gēn jiā lǐ rén yìqǐ chī fàn, shì shénme shíhou?","m":"When did you last eat with your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"上个月。","p":"Shàng gè yuè.","m":"Last month.","r":{"t":"那也不久！下次见面，一定很开心。","p":"Nà yě bù jiǔ! Xià cì jiànmiàn, yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"That's not long! Next time will be so nice."}},{"t":"好久了，我想不起来。","p":"Hǎo jiǔ le, wǒ xiǎng bu qǐlái.","m":"Ages ago — can't remember.","r":{"t":"那打个视频电话，一起吃也算！","p":"Nà dǎ gè shìpín diànhuà, yìqǐ chī yě suàn!","m":"Then do a video call — eating together that way counts too!"}}],"next":{"t":"希望你今天吃得好！我吃的是奶奶的 ajiaco，还剩一点。","p":"Xīwàng nǐ jīntiān chī de hǎo! Wǒ chī de shì nǎinai de ajiaco, hái shèng yìdiǎn.","m":"Hope you ate well today! I had my dad's mum's ajiaco — there's a bit left."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"ajiaco 里面有什么？","p":"ajiaco lǐmiàn yǒu shénme?","m":"What's in ajiaco?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 ajiaco 里面有什么（鸡肉、玉米、三种土豆，加奶油）","en":"You asked what's in ajiaco (chicken, corn, three kinds of potato, with cream)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问 ajiaco 里面有什么。我忘了说最重要的：guascas！是一种草，没有它就不是 ajiaco。奶奶说，在别的国家很难找到。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn ajiaco lǐmiàn yǒu shénme. Wǒ wàng le shuō zuì zhòngyào de: guascas! Shì yì zhǒng cǎo, méiyǒu tā jiù bú shì ajiaco. Nǎinai shuō, zài bié de guójiā hěn nán zhǎo dào.","m":"Last time you asked what's in ajiaco. I forgot the most important bit: guascas! It's a kind of herb — without it, it's not ajiaco. My dad's mum says it's hard to find in other countries.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有一道菜，少了一样东西就不对了？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu yí dào cài, shǎo le yí yàng dōngxi jiù bú duì le?","m":"Where you are, is there a dish that's just wrong without one ingredient?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我们做汤一定要放一种香料。","p":"Yǒu, wǒmen zuò tāng yídìng yào fàng yì zhǒng xiāngliào.","m":"Yes — our soup has to have a certain spice.","r":{"t":"每个地方都有自己的秘密！","p":"Měi gè dìfang dōu yǒu zìjǐ de mìmì!","m":"Every place has its own secret!"}},{"t":"好像没有，我们做饭很随便。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu, wǒmen zuò fàn hěn suíbiàn.","m":"Not really — we cook pretty loosely.","r":{"t":"随便也好吃！我外婆做饭也不看菜谱。","p":"Suíbiàn yě hǎochī! Wǒ wàipó zuò fàn yě bú kàn càipǔ.","m":"Loose is delicious too! Abuela never uses a recipe."}}],"next":{"t":"ajiaco 还剩一碗，我今天又喝了。","p":"Ajiaco hái shèng yì wǎn, wǒ jīntiān yòu hē le.","m":"There was one bowl of ajiaco left — I had it today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"奶奶讲了什么事？","p":"Nǎinai jiǎng le shénme shì?","m":"What did your grandma talk about?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过奶奶讲了什么（她小时候在乡下，没有电视）","en":"You asked what stories her dad's mum told (her childhood in the countryside — no TV)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问奶奶讲了什么事。这两天我问她：没有电视，晚上做什么？她说：唱歌，讲鬼故事。然后她给我讲了一个……我晚上不敢关灯了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn nǎinai jiǎng le shénme shì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn tā: méiyǒu diànshì, wǎnshang zuò shénme? Tā shuō: chàng gē, jiǎng guǐ gùshi. Ránhòu tā gěi wǒ jiǎng le yí gè …… wǒ wǎnshang bù gǎn guān dēng le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what my dad's mum talked about. These days I asked her: with no TV, what did you do in the evenings? She said: sang songs and told ghost stories. Then she told me one… now I can't turn the light off at night, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里的老人给你讲过以前的事吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ de lǎorén gěi nǐ jiǎngguo yǐqián de shì ma?","m":"Have older people in your family told you about the old days?"},"replies":[{"t":"讲过，我爷爷最爱讲。","p":"Jiǎngguo, wǒ yéye zuì ài jiǎng.","m":"Yes — my grandpa loves to.","r":{"t":"老人的故事最好听！","p":"Lǎorén de gùshi zuì hǎotīng!","m":"Old people's stories are the best!"}},{"t":"很少，我们不太聊这些。","p":"Hěn shǎo, wǒmen bú tài liáo zhèxiē.","m":"Rarely — we don't talk about that much.","r":{"t":"那下次你问一问，他们一定很高兴。","p":"Nà xià cì nǐ wèn yi wèn, tāmen yídìng hěn gāoxìng.","m":"Ask them next time — they'd love it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又想听奶奶讲故事了。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu xiǎng tīng nǎinai jiǎng gùshi le.","m":"I want to hear my dad's mum's stories again today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：那部古装剧，我第二遍看完了！","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: nà bù gǔzhuāng jù, wǒ dì èr biàn kàn wán le!","m":"Guess what: I've finished my historical drama for the second time!"},{"t":"这一次，有三句我不看字幕就听懂了。三句！","p":"Zhè yí cì, yǒu sān jù wǒ bú kàn zìmù jiù tīng dǒng le. Sān jù!","m":"This time I understood three lines without subtitles. Three!"},{"t":"我把这三句抄在本子上，旁边画了一个小人在跳舞。","p":"Wǒ bǎ zhè sān jù chāo zài běnzi shang, pángbiān huà le yí gè xiǎo rén zài tiàowǔ.","m":"I copied them into my notebook and drew a little dancing person next to them."}],"replies":[{"t":"三句也很厉害！","p":"Sān jù yě hěn lìhai!","m":"Three is amazing!","r":{"t":"谢谢！下次是四句。","p":"Xièxie! Xià cì shì sì jù.","m":"Thanks! Next time, four."}},{"t":"是哪三句？","p":"Shì nǎ sān jù?","m":"Which three?","r":{"t":"「等一下」「你去哪里」「我不走」。哈哈，都很短。","p":"“Děng yíxià” “nǐ qù nǎlǐ” “wǒ bù zǒu”. Hāha, dōu hěn duǎn.","m":"“Wait”, “Where are you going”, “I'm not leaving”. Haha, all short."}}],"from":"2026-12-01"}},"2026-11-29|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-11-29","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们家也是一吃就吃好几个小时。","p":"Wǒmen jiā yě shì yì chī jiù chī hǎo jǐ gè xiǎoshí.","m":"In my family, meals go on for hours too."},"mem":{"zh":"你们家也是一吃就吃好几个小时","en":"Your family meals go on for hours too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你们家也是一吃就吃好几个小时。这两天我算了一下：要是去了台湾，周五就没有这样的午饭了。准确地说，一年只能吃一次。想到这个，我有点难过。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐmen jiā yě shì yì chī jiù chī hǎo jǐ gè xiǎoshí. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ suàn le yíxià: yàoshi qù le Táiwān, zhōuwǔ jiù méiyǒu zhèyàng de wǔfàn le. Zhǔnquè de shuō, yì nián zhǐ néng chī yí cì. Xiǎng dào zhège, wǒ yǒudiǎn nánguò.","m":"You said your family meals go on for hours too. These days I worked it out: if I go to Taiwan, there'll be no Friday lunches like this. To be precise, maybe once a year. Thinking about it makes me a bit sad.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是离开家，你觉得你会最想念什么？","p":"Yàoshi líkāi jiā, nǐ juéde nǐ huì zuì xiǎngniàn shénme?","m":"If you left home, what do you think you'd miss most?"},"replies":[{"t":"家里的饭。","p":"Jiā lǐ de fàn.","m":"Home cooking.","r":{"t":"对，我已经开始想我妈做的菜了。","p":"Duì, wǒ yǐjīng kāishǐ xiǎng wǒ mā zuò de cài le.","m":"Right — I'm already missing my mum's cooking."}},{"t":"家里人的声音。","p":"Jiā lǐ rén de shēngyīn.","m":"My family's voices.","r":{"t":"说得真好。我也要多录一点他们的声音。","p":"Shuō de zhēn hǎo. Wǒ yě yào duō lù yìdiǎn tāmen de shēngyīn.","m":"Beautifully said. I should record more of their voices too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我跟妈妈一起做了饭。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ gēn māma yìqǐ zuò le fàn.","m":"I cooked with my mum today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这个周末一个人吃的。","p":"Wǒ zhège zhōumò yí gè rén chī de.","m":"I ate on my own this weekend."},"mem":{"zh":"你那个周末一个人吃的","en":"You ate alone that weekend"},"later":{"t":"你上次说那个周末你一个人吃的饭。我告诉我妈了，她说：「下次让你的朋友来！」她已经在想给你做什么了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nà gè zhōumò nǐ yí gè rén chī de fàn. Wǒ gàosu wǒ mā le, tā shuō: “Xià cì ràng nǐ de péngyou lái!” Tā yǐjīng zài xiǎng gěi nǐ zuò shénme le, hāha.","m":"You said you ate alone that weekend. I told my mum, and she said: “Next time, bring your friend!” She's already planning what to cook for you, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你来开罗，你最想尝什么？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ lái Kāiluó, nǐ zuì xiǎng cháng shénme?","m":"If you came to Cairo, what would you most want to try?"},"replies":[{"t":"烤肉！","p":"Kǎoròu!","m":"Grilled meat!","r":{"t":"好！我们家附近有一家烤肉店，我带你去。","p":"Hǎo! Wǒmen jiā fùjìn yǒu yì jiā kǎoròu diàn, wǒ dài nǐ qù.","m":"Great! There's a grill near our place — I'll take you."}},{"t":"你推荐吧，我什么都想试。","p":"Nǐ tuījiàn ba, wǒ shénme dōu xiǎng shì.","m":"You choose — I want to try everything.","r":{"t":"那先试 koshari！埃及最有名的街头饭。","p":"Nà xiān shì koshari! Āijí zuì yǒumíng de jiētóu fàn.","m":"Then start with koshari — Egypt's most famous street food."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天又说：下次一定让你的朋友来。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān yòu shuō: xià cì yídìng ràng nǐ de péngyou lái.","m":"My mum said it again today: next time, your friend must come."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们一般吃什么？","p":"Nǐmen yìbān chī shénme?","m":"What do you usually eat?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们家一般吃什么（米饭、烤鸡，还有妈妈做的 molokhia 绿汤）","en":"You asked what they usually eat (rice, roast chicken and her mum's molokhia — a green soup)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们家一般吃什么。molokhia 是用一种绿色的叶子做的，切得很碎，加大蒜。这两天我想学，我妈说：「先学会切叶子，再说。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen jiā yìbān chī shénme. Molokhia shì yòng yì zhǒng lǜsè de yèzi zuò de, qiē de hěn suì, jiā dàsuàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng xué, wǒ mā shuō: “Xiān xuéhuì qiē yèzi, zài shuō.”","m":"Last time you asked what we usually eat. Molokhia is made from a green leaf, chopped really fine, with garlic. These days I wanted to learn it, and my mum said: “Learn to chop the leaves first, then we'll talk.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会做家里的菜吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zuò jiā lǐ de cài ma?","m":"Can you cook your family's dishes?"},"replies":[{"t":"会几道简单的。","p":"Huì jǐ dào jiǎndān de.","m":"A few simple ones.","r":{"t":"那你比我好！我只会泡茶。","p":"Nà nǐ bǐ wǒ hǎo! Wǒ zhǐ huì pào chá.","m":"Better than me! I can only make tea."}},{"t":"不会，都是家里人做。","p":"Bú huì, dōu shì jiā lǐ rén zuò.","m":"No — family cooks.","r":{"t":"我们一样。不过去台湾以前，我一定要学会。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng. Búguò qù Táiwān yǐqián, wǒ yídìng yào xuéhuì.","m":"Same here. But I must learn before Taiwan."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我们家又做了 molokhia，我在旁边看。","p":"Jīntiān wǒmen jiā yòu zuò le molokhia, wǒ zài pángbiān kàn.","m":"We had molokhia again today — I watched."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们家有多少人？","p":"Nǐmen jiā yǒu duōshao rén?","m":"How many are there in your family?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们家有多少人（周五来了十五个，算上表兄弟姐妹）","en":"You asked how big her family is (fifteen came on Friday, counting cousins)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们家有多少人。十五个。这两天表妹说，等我去了台湾，周五吃饭的时候就给我打视频，把手机放在桌子上，让我也「坐」在那里，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen jiā yǒu duōshao rén. Shíwǔ gè. Zhè liǎng tiān biǎomèi shuō, děng wǒ qù le Táiwān, zhōuwǔ chī fàn de shíhou jiù gěi wǒ dǎ shìpín, bǎ shǒujī fàng zài zhuōzi shang, ràng wǒ yě “zuò” zài nàlǐ, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how many people are in our family. Fifteen. These days my cousin said that once I'm in Taiwan, she'll video-call me at Friday lunch and put the phone on the table, so I can “sit” there too, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人多吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén duō ma?","m":"Is your family big?"},"replies":[{"t":"很多，过节的时候特别热闹。","p":"Hěn duō, guòjié de shíhou tèbié rènao.","m":"Very — holidays get really lively.","r":{"t":"那你懂我们家的周五！","p":"Nà nǐ dǒng wǒmen jiā de zhōuwǔ!","m":"Then you know our Fridays!"}},{"t":"不多，就几个人。","p":"Bù duō, jiù jǐ gè rén.","m":"Not many, just a few.","r":{"t":"人少也好，说话不用喊，哈哈。","p":"Rén shǎo yě hǎo, shuōhuà bú yòng hǎn, hāha.","m":"Small's nice — no shouting to be heard, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"十五个人的家，今天又很热闹，哈哈。","p":"Shíwǔ gè rén de jiā, jīntiān yòu hěn rènao, hāha.","m":"A family of fifteen — lively again today, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：我的申请交上去了！比截止早了五天。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: wǒ de shēnqǐng jiāo shàngqù le! Bǐ jiézhǐ zǎo le wǔ tiān.","m":"Guess what: my application's in! Five days before the deadline."},{"t":"自我介绍改了七遍。最后一遍，我把「请问您贵姓」那种话全删了。","p":"Zìwǒ jièshào gǎi le qī biàn. Zuìhòu yí biàn, wǒ bǎ “qǐngwèn nín guìxìng” nà zhǒng huà quán shān le.","m":"I rewrote my personal statement seven times. On the last pass I cut all the “may I ask your honourable surname” stuff."},{"t":"准确地说，现在它听起来像我自己了。","p":"Zhǔnquè de shuō, xiànzài tā tīng qǐlái xiàng wǒ zìjǐ le.","m":"To be precise: now it sounds like me."}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜！交上去了就放心了。","p":"Gōngxǐ! Jiāo shàngqù le jiù fàngxīn le.","m":"Congrats! Now you can relax.","r":{"t":"「放心」——这个词我妈现在也会说了。","p":"“Fàngxīn” —— zhège cí wǒ mā xiànzài yě huì shuō le.","m":"放心 — my mum can say that word now too."}},{"t":"像你自己，这个最重要。","p":"Xiàng nǐ zìjǐ, zhège zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Sounding like yourself — that's what matters.","r":{"t":"谢谢你。这句话我要记下来。","p":"Xièxie nǐ. Zhè jù huà wǒ yào jì xiàlái.","m":"Thank you. I'm writing that down."}}],"from":"2026-12-02"}},"2026-11-29|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-29","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My mum makes the gravy too.","p":"","m":"我家也是我妈做肉汁。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家也是妈妈做肉汁","en":"Your mum makes the gravy too"},"later":{"t":"You said your mum makes the gravy too. Mine finally let me stir it on Sunday. Ten seconds. Then she took the spoon back. I think that's a promotion.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家也是妈妈做肉汁。周日我妈终于让我搅了一下。十秒钟。然后她把勺子拿回去了。我觉得这算升职了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a dish only one person in your family can make?","p":"","m":"你家有没有一道菜只有一个人会做？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my grandma's soup.","p":"","m":"有，我奶奶的汤。","r":{"t":"Learn it while you can. Says the man who stirred for ten seconds.","p":"","m":"趁早学。这是一个只搅了十秒的人给的建议。"}},{"t":"No, we all cook.","p":"","m":"没有，我们都会做。","r":{"t":"A family of chefs. Lucky.","p":"","m":"一家都是厨师。真幸运。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about that gravy.","p":"","m":"还在想那锅肉汁。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We don't really do family meals.","p":"","m":"我们家不太一起吃饭。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家不怎么一起吃饭","en":"Your family doesn't really do family meals"},"later":{"t":"You said your family doesn't really do family meals. That's fine. I think my flatmates have become my weekday family — we eat together most nights, even if it's just pasta.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家不怎么一起吃饭。没关系。我觉得我的室友们成了我工作日的家人——我们大多数晚上一起吃，哪怕只是意面。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who do you usually eat dinner with?","p":"","m":"你一般跟谁吃晚饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"Friends or flatmates.","p":"","m":"朋友或者室友。","r":{"t":"Same. That counts as family too.","p":"","m":"一样。那也算家人。"}},{"t":"Usually alone.","p":"","m":"一般一个人。","r":{"t":"That's okay too. A good meal alone is still a good meal.","p":"","m":"那也挺好。一个人吃顿好的，也是好饭。"}}],"next":{"t":"Pasta night with the flatmates again.","p":"","m":"又跟室友吃意面之夜。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's in a Sunday roast?","p":"","m":"周日烤肉大餐有什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过周日烤肉有什么（烤牛肉、土豆、约克郡布丁和很多肉汁）","en":"You asked what's in a Sunday roast (roast beef, potatoes, Yorkshire puddings and loads of gravy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what's in a Sunday roast. I forgot the best bit: Yorkshire puddings aren't sweet at all. They're crispy, puffy little cups of batter for the gravy. Every visitor I know is confused by the name.","p":"","m":"你上次问周日烤肉有什么。我忘了说最好的部分：约克郡布丁一点都不甜。它是脆脆的、鼓起来的面糊小杯子，用来装肉汁。我认识的每个外地人都被这个名字搞糊涂了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a dish from where you are with a confusing name?","p":"","m":"你那边有没有名字很让人糊涂的菜？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, quite a few.","p":"","m":"有，好几个。","r":{"t":"Tell me one sometime. I collect them.","p":"","m":"哪天告诉我一个。我在收集。"}},{"t":"Not that I can think of.","p":"","m":"一时想不起来。","r":{"t":"Then we win. Yorkshire pudding is the champion.","p":"","m":"那我们赢了。约克郡布丁是冠军。"}}],"next":{"t":"Leftover Yorkshire puddings today. Living well.","p":"","m":"今天吃剩下的约克郡布丁。日子不错。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why can't anyone touch the gravy?","p":"","m":"为什么别人不能碰肉汁？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过为什么谁都不能碰肉汁（家里的秘密，连他爸都不行）","en":"You asked why nobody can touch the gravy (family secret — not even his dad)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why nobody can touch the gravy. I asked my mum on Sunday. She whispered: 'A spoonful of the potato water.' That's it. That's the secret. Now you know, so don't tell anyone.","p":"","m":"你上次问为什么谁都不能碰肉汁。周日我问了我妈。她小声说：「加一勺煮土豆的水。」就这样。这就是秘密。现在你知道了，别告诉别人。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family have a cooking secret?","p":"","m":"你家有做饭的秘诀吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, but I can't tell you!","p":"","m":"有，可是不能告诉你！","r":{"t":"Fair. I respect a secret.","p":"","m":"有道理。我尊重秘密。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then borrow ours. Potato water.","p":"","m":"那借用我们家的。煮土豆的水。"}}],"next":{"t":"I've kept the gravy secret. Almost.","p":"","m":"肉汁的秘密我守住了。差不多吧。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"The flat-sharing piece went out on the twenty-fourth. More people read it than anything I've ever written.","p":"","m":"合租那篇稿子 24 号登出来了。看的人比我写过的任何一篇都多。"},{"t":"So my editor wants a follow-up: people in London who live alone, and what it costs them.","p":"","m":"所以主编想让我写续篇：伦敦一个人住的人，要付出多少。"},{"t":"If you live alone and have a thought on it, I'm all ears.","p":"","m":"你要是一个人住，有什么想法，我洗耳恭听。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Living alone: expensive, but peaceful.","p":"","m":"一个人住：贵，可是清静。","r":{"t":"That might be my headline. Thank you.","p":"","m":"这句也许就是我的标题。谢谢。"}},{"t":"Congrats on the piece!","p":"","m":"恭喜稿子登出来了！","r":{"t":"Cheers! Still buzzing a bit.","p":"","m":"谢谢！到现在还有点兴奋。"}}],"from":"2026-12-01"}},"2026-11-29|en|budi":{"date":"2026-11-29","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Same at my house — the kids eat first.","p":"","m":"我家也是，小孩先吃。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家也是孩子先吃","en":"At your house the kids eat first too"},"later":{"t":"You said the kids eat first at your house too. This time my wife hid one plate of rendang for us in the kitchen. Best plan ever. We ate it quietly after everyone left.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家也是孩子先吃。这次我老婆在厨房给我们俩藏了一盘 rendang。最好的计划。等大家都走了，我们俩悄悄吃完了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who cooks for big family meals at your place?","p":"","m":"你家大聚餐谁做饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"My mum.","p":"","m":"我妈。","r":{"t":"Mums are the heroes, bro.","p":"","m":"妈妈们是英雄，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Everyone brings something.","p":"","m":"每个人带一样。","r":{"t":"Good system! Less work for one person.","p":"","m":"好办法！一个人不会太累。"}}],"next":{"t":"House is quiet again after the big lunch.","p":"","m":"大聚餐以后家里又安静了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I live alone, so it's quiet.","p":"","m":"我一个人住，所以很安静。"},"mem":{"zh":"你一个人住，很安静","en":"You live alone, so it's quiet"},"later":{"t":"You said you live alone and it's quiet. After everyone left, the house was quiet for ten whole minutes. I thought of you. Then one of the kids found a drum.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一个人住，很安静。大家走了以后，家里安静了整整十分钟。我想起了你。然后一个孩子找到了一面鼓。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like quiet, or a bit of noise?","p":"","m":"你喜欢安静，还是有点热闹？"},"replies":[{"t":"Quiet, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多喜欢安静。","r":{"t":"Then visit me for ten minutes only, haha.","p":"","m":"那来我家只待十分钟就好，哈哈。"}},{"t":"I like a bit of noise.","p":"","m":"喜欢有点声音。","r":{"t":"Then my house is perfect for you, bro.","p":"","m":"那我家很适合你，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ten minutes of quiet today. A record!","p":"","m":"今天安静了十分钟。破纪录！"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many people came?","p":"","m":"来了多少人？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过来了多少人（二十个左右，表亲、阿姨，所有人）","en":"You asked how many people came (about twenty — cousins, aunties, everyone)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many came. About twenty. My auntie counted the plates after: forty-two. Twenty people, forty-two plates. Don't ask me how.","p":"","m":"你上次问来了多少人。二十个左右。事后我阿姨数了盘子：四十二个。二十个人，四十二个盘子。别问我怎么回事。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the biggest family gathering you've been to?","p":"","m":"你参加过最大的家庭聚会有多少人？"},"replies":[{"t":"Maybe fifty people.","p":"","m":"大概五十个人。","r":{"t":"Fifty! Respect. That's a lot of plates.","p":"","m":"五十！佩服。那得用好多盘子。"}},{"t":"Only small ones.","p":"","m":"都是小聚会。","r":{"t":"Small is nice too. Less washing up, haha.","p":"","m":"小的也好。洗碗少，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still washing plates in my head, haha.","p":"","m":"脑子里还在洗盘子，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you eat?","p":"","m":"你们吃了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过吃了什么（rendang、米饭，还有很多炸的东西）","en":"You asked what they ate (rendang, rice, and lots of fried things)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we ate. Rendang — beef cooked very slowly in coconut milk and spices, for hours. My auntie started at five in the morning. That's love, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们吃了什么。rendang——牛肉加椰奶和香料，小火慢慢炖好几个小时。我阿姨早上五点就开始了。这就是爱，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What dish takes the longest to make in your family?","p":"","m":"你家最费时间的一道菜是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A soup that cooks all day.","p":"","m":"一锅要煮一整天的汤。","r":{"t":"All day! That's love too.","p":"","m":"一整天！那也是爱。"}},{"t":"We don't really cook slow food.","p":"","m":"我们不做那么慢的菜。","r":{"t":"Quick food is good too. More time to eat!","p":"","m":"快手菜也好。吃的时间更多！"}}],"next":{"t":"Dreaming about my auntie's rendang.","p":"","m":"做梦都在想我阿姨的 rendang。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"There's a retired teacher from Australia who rides with me every Tuesday, bro.","p":"","m":"有一位从澳大利亚来的退休老师，每个星期二都坐我的车，兄弟。"},{"t":"Every ride, she teaches me one English word. This week: 'patience'. She says it's for Jakarta traffic.","p":"","m":"每次坐车，她教我一个英语单词。这周的是 patience（耐心）。她说这是为了雅加达的堵车。"},{"t":"Next time I want to teach her one Indonesian word. I'm thinking 'sabar' — it means the same, haha.","p":"","m":"下次我想教她一个印尼语单词。我在想 sabar——意思一样，哈哈。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's a lovely tradition.","p":"","m":"这个习惯真好。","r":{"t":"It is. My English gets better one ride at a time.","p":"","m":"是的。我的英语一趟一趟地变好。"}},{"t":"Sabar — I like that word.","p":"","m":"sabar——我喜欢这个词。","r":{"t":"Good! Now you know one Indonesian word, bro.","p":"","m":"好！现在你也会一个印尼语单词了，兄弟。"}}],"from":"2026-12-01"}},"2026-11-30|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-11-30","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家楼下也有早点铺。","p":"Wǒ jiā lóuxià yě yǒu zǎodiǎn pù.","m":"There's a breakfast place downstairs from me too."},"mem":{"zh":"你家楼下也有早点铺","en":"There's a breakfast stall downstairs from you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家楼下也有早点铺。这两天我们楼下的早点铺出了新东西：糖油饼，一半是糖，一半是油饼。我一口气吃了两个，上午都不饿。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā lóuxià yě yǒu zǎodiǎn pù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen lóuxià de zǎodiǎn pù chū le xīn dōngxi: táng yóubǐng, yíbàn shì táng, yíbàn shì yóubǐng. Wǒ yì kǒu qì chī le liǎng gè, shàngwǔ dōu bú è.","m":"You said there's a breakfast stall downstairs from you too. These days ours has something new: tang youbing, a fried dough cake that's half sugar-glazed. I ate two in one go and wasn't hungry all morning.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你早上一般吃热的还是凉的？","p":"Nǐ zǎoshang yìbān chī rè de háishi liáng de?","m":"Do you usually have something hot or cold in the morning?"},"replies":[{"t":"热的，冬天一定要热的。","p":"Rè de, dōngtiān yídìng yào rè de.","m":"Hot — in winter it has to be hot.","r":{"t":"对，一碗热豆浆下去，人就醒了。","p":"Duì, yì wǎn rè dòujiāng xiàqù, rén jiù xǐng le.","m":"Right — one bowl of hot soy milk and you're awake."}},{"t":"凉的也行，面包牛奶就够了。","p":"Liáng de yě xíng, miànbāo niúnǎi jiù gòu le.","m":"Cold's fine — bread and milk is enough.","r":{"t":"简单好，早上不用想。","p":"Jiǎndān hǎo, zǎoshang bú yòng xiǎng.","m":"Simple is good — no thinking in the morning."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下楼又买了一碗豆浆。","p":"Jīntiān xià lóu yòu mǎi le yì wǎn dòujiāng.","m":"Popped down for a bowl of soy milk again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家楼下什么店都没有。","p":"Wǒ jiā lóuxià shénme diàn dōu méiyǒu.","m":"There are no shops at all downstairs from me."},"mem":{"zh":"你家楼下什么店都没有","en":"There are no shops at all downstairs from you"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家楼下什么店都没有。这两天我们楼下的小卖部关门了，我才知道有多不方便：买一瓶酱油，要走十分钟。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā lóuxià shénme diàn dōu méiyǒu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen lóuxià de xiǎomàibù guān mén le, wǒ cái zhīdào yǒu duō bù fāngbiàn: mǎi yì píng jiàngyóu, yào zǒu shí fēnzhōng.","m":"You said there are no shops downstairs from you. These days the little corner shop under our building closed, and now I know how inconvenient that is: ten minutes' walk for a bottle of soy sauce.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家附近最近的店，走过去要多久？","p":"Nǐ jiā fùjìn zuì jìn de diàn, zǒu guòqù yào duō jiǔ?","m":"How long does it take to walk to the nearest shop from your place?"},"replies":[{"t":"差不多十分钟。","p":"Chàbuduō shí fēnzhōng.","m":"About ten minutes.","r":{"t":"那跟我现在一样了！","p":"Nà gēn wǒ xiànzài yíyàng le!","m":"Same as me now, then!"}},{"t":"要开车去。","p":"Yào kāi chē qù.","m":"I have to drive.","r":{"t":"那你肯定一次买很多，挺会安排的。","p":"Nà nǐ kěndìng yí cì mǎi hěn duō, tǐng huì ānpái de.","m":"Then you must buy a lot at once — very organised."}}],"next":{"t":"楼下的小店还没开，我今天又走了十分钟，哈哈。","p":"Lóuxià de xiǎo diàn hái méi kāi, wǒ jīntiān yòu zǒu le shí fēnzhōng, hāha.","m":"The little shop downstairs is still shut — another ten-minute walk today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"老师傅帮你修过什么？","p":"Lǎo shīfu bāng nǐ xiūguo shénme?","m":"What has the old man fixed for you?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过老师傅帮她修过什么（自行车、雨伞，还有一个旧收音机）","en":"You asked what the old repairman has fixed for her (a bike, an umbrella, and an old radio)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问老师傅帮我修过什么。这两天我又拿了一样去：我妈的旧暖水瓶，盖子松了。他看了一眼，三分钟就弄好了，只收了两块钱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn lǎo shīfu bāng wǒ xiūguo shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu ná le yí yàng qù: wǒ mā de jiù nuǎnshuǐpíng, gàizi sōng le. Tā kàn le yì yǎn, sān fēnzhōng jiù nòng hǎo le, zhǐ shōu le liǎng kuài qián.","m":"Last time you asked what the old repairman has fixed for me. These days I took him something else: my mum's old thermos, with a loose lid. He took one look, fixed it in three minutes, and charged two yuan.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"东西坏了，你一般修还是买新的？","p":"Dōngxi huài le, nǐ yìbān xiū háishi mǎi xīn de?","m":"When something breaks, do you usually fix it or buy new?"},"replies":[{"t":"能修就修。","p":"Néng xiū jiù xiū.","m":"Fix it if I can.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！修好了用着更亲。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Xiū hǎo le yòng zhe gèng qīn.","m":"Same as me! Something you've fixed feels more yours."}},{"t":"一般买新的，修太麻烦。","p":"Yìbān mǎi xīn de, xiū tài máfan.","m":"Usually buy new — fixing is too much hassle.","r":{"t":"也是，现在找个会修的人不容易。","p":"Yě shì, xiànzài zhǎo gè huì xiū de rén bù róngyì.","m":"True — it's hard to find someone who can fix things these days."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过老师傅的摊儿，他又在修收音机。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò lǎo shīfu de tānr, tā yòu zài xiū shōuyīnjī.","m":"Walked past the old repairman today — fixing a radio again."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"早点铺卖什么？","p":"Zǎodiǎn pù mài shénme?","m":"What does the breakfast place sell?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过早点铺卖什么（油条、豆浆、包子，六点开门）","en":"You asked what the breakfast stall sells (youtiao, soy milk, buns — opens at six)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问早点铺卖什么。这两天我六点半就下去了，想看看最早来的是谁。结果是几个遛弯儿回来的老人，他们已经在那儿聊上了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn zǎodiǎn pù mài shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ liù diǎn bàn jiù xiàqù le, xiǎng kànkan zuì zǎo lái de shì shéi. Jiéguǒ shì jǐ gè liùwānr huílái de lǎorén, tāmen yǐjīng zài nàr liáo shang le.","m":"Last time you asked what the breakfast stall sells. These days I went down at half six to see who comes first. It was a few old folks back from their morning stroll, already chatting away.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边早上谁起得最早？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zǎoshang shéi qǐ de zuì zǎo?","m":"Where you are, who's up earliest in the morning?"},"replies":[{"t":"老人，他们五六点就出门了。","p":"Lǎorén, tāmen wǔ liù diǎn jiù chūmén le.","m":"Older people — out by five or six.","r":{"t":"哪儿都一样！老人起得最早。","p":"Nǎr dōu yíyàng! Lǎorén qǐ de zuì zǎo.","m":"Same everywhere! Older people are up first."}},{"t":"我自己，我很早就起了。","p":"Wǒ zìjǐ, wǒ hěn zǎo jiù qǐ le.","m":"Me — I get up really early.","r":{"t":"厉害！那你一定能吃上第一锅油条。","p":"Lìhai! Nà nǐ yídìng néng chī shang dì yī guō yóutiáo.","m":"Impressive! Then you'd get the first batch of youtiao."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的油条又是刚出锅的。","p":"Jīntiān de yóutiáo yòu shì gāng chū guō de.","m":"Fresh-out-of-the-pan youtiao again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-30|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-11-30","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家楼下也有便利店。","p":"Wǒ jiā lóuxià yě yǒu biànlìdiàn.","m":"There's a convenience store downstairs from me too."},"mem":{"zh":"你家楼下也有便利店","en":"There's a convenience store downstairs from you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家楼下也有便利店。这两天便利商店开始卖关东煮了，萝卜、玉米、黑轮，天一冷，我一进门就闻到。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā lóuxià yě yǒu biànlìdiàn. Zhè liǎng tiān biànlì shāngdiàn kāishǐ mài guāndōngzhǔ le, luóbo, yùmǐ, hēilún, tiān yì lěng, wǒ yí jìn mén jiù wén dào.","m":"You said there's a convenience store downstairs from you too. These days ours has started selling oden — radish, corn, fishcake. Now it's cold, I smell it the moment I walk in.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天最想在便利店买什么？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zuì xiǎng zài biànlìdiàn mǎi shénme?","m":"In winter, what do you most want from a convenience store?"},"replies":[{"t":"热的饮料。","p":"Rè de yǐnliào.","m":"A hot drink.","r":{"t":"对！手冷的时候，捧着一杯热的最幸福。","p":"Duì! Shǒu lěng de shíhou, pěng zhe yì bēi rè de zuì xìngfú.","m":"Yes! With cold hands, holding something hot is bliss."}},{"t":"我很少去便利店。","p":"Wǒ hěn shǎo qù biànlìdiàn.","m":"I rarely go.","r":{"t":"那你一定很会安排，不像我天天跑。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn huì ānpái, bú xiàng wǒ tiāntiān pǎo.","m":"Then you must be well organised — not like me, popping in every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又进便利商店了，第二次，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu jìn biànlì shāngdiàn le, dì èr cì, hāha.","m":"Into the convenience store again today — second time, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家附近要走很远才有店。","p":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yào zǒu hěn yuǎn cái yǒu diàn.","m":"I have to walk a long way to find a shop near me."},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近要走很远才有店","en":"You have to walk a long way to reach a shop"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家附近要走很远才有店。这两天楼下的便利商店装修，关了三天，我才知道你的感觉：买一瓶水都要走十分钟！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā fùjìn yào zǒu hěn yuǎn cái yǒu diàn. Zhè liǎng tiān lóuxià de biànlì shāngdiàn zhuāngxiū, guān le sān tiān, wǒ cái zhīdào nǐ de gǎnjué: mǎi yì píng shuǐ dōu yào zǒu shí fēnzhōng!","m":"You said you have to walk a long way to reach a shop. These days the store downstairs closed for three days for a refit, and now I know how you feel: ten minutes' walk for a bottle of water!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一次买东西会买多少？","p":"Nǐ yí cì mǎi dōngxi huì mǎi duōshao?","m":"How much do you buy in one go?"},"replies":[{"t":"一次买一个星期的。","p":"Yí cì mǎi yí gè xīngqī de.","m":"A week's worth at once.","r":{"t":"好会规划！我只会想到什么买什么。","p":"Hǎo huì guīhuà! Wǒ zhǐ huì xiǎng dào shénme mǎi shénme.","m":"So organised! I just buy whatever I think of."}},{"t":"不多，缺什么买什么。","p":"Bù duō, quē shénme mǎi shénme.","m":"Not much — just what I'm out of.","r":{"t":"那你走路一定走很多，好健康。","p":"Nà nǐ zǒulù yídìng zǒu hěn duō, hǎo jiànkāng.","m":"Then you must walk a lot — so healthy."}}],"next":{"t":"楼下的便利商店还在装修，我今天走了好远，哈哈。","p":"Lóuxià de biànlì shāngdiàn hái zài zhuāngxiū, wǒ jīntiān zǒu le hǎo yuǎn, hāha.","m":"The store downstairs is still being refitted — I walked miles today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"一天三次，你都买什么？","p":"Yì tiān sān cì, nǐ dōu mǎi shénme?","m":"Three times a day — what do you buy?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一天三次都买什么（早上咖啡、中午饭团、晚上零食）","en":"You asked what she buys three times a day (coffee, a rice ball, snacks)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一天三次都买什么。这两天我把发票数了一下，一个礼拜在便利商店花了快一千块！我决定……零食改成两天买一次，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yì tiān sān cì dōu mǎi shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ fāpiào shǔ le yíxià, yí gè lǐbài zài biànlì shāngdiàn huā le kuài yì qiān kuài! Wǒ juédìng …… língshí gǎi chéng liǎng tiān mǎi yí cì, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what I buy three times a day. These days I counted my receipts — almost NT$1,000 a week at the convenience store! I've decided… snacks only every other day, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个星期花最多钱的是什么？","p":"Nǐ yí gè xīngqī huā zuì duō qián de shì shénme?","m":"What do you spend the most on in a week?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃的。","p":"Chī de.","m":"Food.","r":{"t":"对吧！吃的永远第一名。","p":"Duì ba! Chī de yǒngyuǎn dì yī míng.","m":"Right? Food always comes first."}},{"t":"交通，坐车很贵。","p":"Jiāotōng, zuò chē hěn guì.","m":"Getting around — transport's expensive.","r":{"t":"那真的没办法省，要出门嘛。","p":"Nà zhēnde méi bànfǎ shěng, yào chūmén ma.","m":"Nothing you can do about that — you've got to get around."}}],"next":{"t":"今天只进了便利商店两次！进步了。","p":"Jīntiān zhǐ jìn le biànlì shāngdiàn liǎng cì! Jìnbù le.","m":"Only went into the convenience store twice today! Progress."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"店员认识你吗？","p":"Diànyuán rènshi nǐ ma?","m":"Do the staff know you?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过店员认不认识她（认识，她还没开口就知道她要什么咖啡）","en":"You asked if the staff know her (yes — they know her coffee before she says a word)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问店员认不认识我。这两天那个店员换班了，新来的不知道我要什么，我还要自己说：「大杯拿铁，热的。」好不习惯喔。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn diànyuán rèn bu rènshi wǒ. Zhè liǎng tiān nà gè diànyuán huàn bān le, xīn lái de bù zhīdào wǒ yào shénme, wǒ hái yào zìjǐ shuō: “Dà bēi nátiě, rè de.” Hǎo bù xíguàn o.","m":"Last time you asked if the staff know me. These days that staff member changed shifts, and the new one doesn't know my order — I actually had to say: “Large latte, hot.” So strange.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"有没有一个地方，你不用开口别人就知道你要什么？","p":"Yǒu méiyǒu yí gè dìfang, nǐ bú yòng kāikǒu biérén jiù zhīdào nǐ yào shénme?","m":"Is there anywhere they know what you want before you say it?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，楼下的早餐店。","p":"Yǒu, lóuxià de zǎocān diàn.","m":"Yes — the breakfast shop downstairs.","r":{"t":"那种感觉超好的！","p":"Nà zhǒng gǎnjué chāo hǎo de!","m":"That feeling's the best!"}},{"t":"没有，我每次都要说。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ měi cì dōu yào shuō.","m":"No — I always have to say.","r":{"t":"说出来也很好，还可以练习嘛。","p":"Shuō chūlái yě hěn hǎo, hái kěyǐ liànxí ma.","m":"Saying it is good too — it's practice!"}}],"next":{"t":"新店员今天还是问我要什么，哈哈。","p":"Xīn diànyuán jīntiān háishi wèn wǒ yào shénme, hāha.","m":"The new staff member still asked what I wanted today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-11-30|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-11-30","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There's a chicken shop near me too.","p":"","m":"我家附近也有一家炸鸡店。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近也有炸鸡店","en":"There's a chicken shop near you too"},"later":{"t":"You said there's a chicken shop near you too. This week ours started a 'winter deal': chips and gravy for two quid. I've had it twice. The dentist next door must be delighted.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家附近也有炸鸡店。这周我们这家推出了「冬季套餐」：薯条配肉汁，两镑。我已经吃了两次。隔壁的牙医肯定很高兴。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the late-night food near you?","p":"","m":"你家附近深夜能吃到什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Kebabs.","p":"","m":"烤肉卷。","r":{"t":"Classic. Every street's got its hero.","p":"","m":"经典。每条街都有自己的英雄。"}},{"t":"Nothing — everything closes early.","p":"","m":"没有，什么都关得早。","r":{"t":"Healthier for you, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，这样对你更健康。"}}],"next":{"t":"Walked past the chicken shop today. Didn't go in. Proud of myself.","p":"","m":"今天路过炸鸡店，没进去。为自己骄傲。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There are no shops at all near me.","p":"","m":"我家附近什么店都没有。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近一家店都没有","en":"There are no shops at all near you"},"later":{"t":"You said there are no shops near you. I got a taste of it this week when the launderette shut for a day — I carried a bag of washing twenty minutes across town.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家附近一家店都没有。这周洗衣店关了一天，我算是体会到了——扛着一袋衣服，穿过半个城区走了二十分钟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the nearest thing to your front door?","p":"","m":"离你家门口最近的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A bus stop.","p":"","m":"一个公交站。","r":{"t":"Handy. Better than a chicken shop, probably.","p":"","m":"方便。大概比炸鸡店强。"}},{"t":"Trees, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多是树。","r":{"t":"Sounds lovely. I'm a bit jealous.","p":"","m":"听起来真好。我有点羡慕。"}}],"next":{"t":"Launderette's open again. Washing done.","p":"","m":"洗衣店又开门了。衣服洗完了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you go to the chicken shop a lot?","p":"","m":"你常去那家炸鸡店吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他常不常去炸鸡店（去得比他愿意承认的多）","en":"You asked if he goes to the chicken shop a lot (more than he'd like to admit)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I go to the chicken shop a lot. This week the guy behind the counter said, 'The usual?' That's when I knew I had to cut down.","p":"","m":"你上次问我常不常去炸鸡店。这周柜台后面的小哥问我：「老样子？」那一刻我就知道，得少去了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a place where they know your order?","p":"","m":"有没有一个地方，店员知道你要点什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a café.","p":"","m":"有，一家咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"That's a nicer place to be known, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，在那儿被认出来体面多了。"}},{"t":"No, I like trying new places.","p":"","m":"没有，我爱试新地方。","r":{"t":"Good. Don't end up like me.","p":"","m":"好。别学我。"}}],"next":{"t":"No chicken today. Day one of the new me.","p":"","m":"今天没吃炸鸡。新的我，第一天。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why a dentist?","p":"","m":"为什么会有牙医？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过为什么楼下有家牙医（他也不知道，也许因为炸鸡店）","en":"You asked why there's a dentist (no idea — maybe because of the chicken shop)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why there's a dentist next to the chicken shop. This week I finally went in — just a check-up. The dentist asked what I eat. I didn't mention the shop next door.","p":"","m":"你上次问为什么炸鸡店旁边有家牙医。这周我终于进去了——只是检查一下。牙医问我平时吃什么。我没提隔壁那家店。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you go for check-ups, or wait till something hurts?","p":"","m":"你会定期去检查，还是等疼了才去？"},"replies":[{"t":"Regular check-ups.","p":"","m":"定期检查。","r":{"t":"Very sensible. Better than me.","p":"","m":"很明智。比我强。"}},{"t":"I wait till it hurts.","p":"","m":"等疼了再去。","r":{"t":"Same, honestly. Until this week.","p":"","m":"说实话，我也是。直到这周。"}}],"next":{"t":"Teeth checked. All fine, somehow.","p":"","m":"牙检查完了。居然都没事。"}}},"news":null},"2026-11-30|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-11-30","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There's a corner shop near me too.","p":"","m":"我家附近也有一家街角小店。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近也有一家街角小店","en":"There's a corner shop near you too"},"later":{"t":"You said there's a corner shop near you too. This week Mango the cat moved from the bread to the heater. Winter is here. Even the bodega cat knows.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家附近也有一家街角小店。这周，猫 Mango 从面包上搬到了暖气上。冬天来了。连小店的猫都知道。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best thing about your corner shop?","p":"","m":"你家附近那家小店，最好的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"It's open late.","p":"","m":"开到很晚。","r":{"t":"Same as mine. Life-saving at midnight.","p":"","m":"跟我的一样。半夜救命。"}},{"t":"The people who work there.","p":"","m":"店里的人。","r":{"t":"Yes! The people make the shop.","p":"","m":"对！人才让一家店有意思。"}}],"next":{"t":"Mango's still on the heater today. Smart cat.","p":"","m":"Mango 今天还趴在暖气上。聪明的猫。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Yes, a big orange one!","p":"","m":"有，一只大橘猫！"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近那家店有一只大橘猫","en":"Your corner shop has a big orange cat"},"later":{"t":"You said your shop has a big orange cat! I told the bodega owner, and he said orange cats are 'the bosses of New York'. Mango heard and walked away. Very boss.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那家店有一只大橘猫！我告诉了小店老板，他说橘猫是「纽约的老大」。Mango 听见了，扭头就走。很有老大的样子。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you ever buy something just to say hi to the cat?","p":"","m":"你会不会为了跟猫打招呼，专门去买点东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"All the time.","p":"","m":"经常。","r":{"t":"Same. The cat is the real customer service.","p":"","m":"一样。猫才是真正的客服。"}},{"t":"No, but I always look for it.","p":"","m":"不会，可我每次都找它。","r":{"t":"That's enough. Cats like being looked for.","p":"","m":"这就够了。猫喜欢被人找。"}}],"next":{"t":"Said hi to Mango for both of us today.","p":"","m":"今天替我们俩跟 Mango 打了招呼。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"No, no cat.","p":"","m":"没有，没有猫。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近那家店没有猫","en":"Your corner shop has no cat"},"later":{"t":"You said your shop has no cat. Honestly, that's a shame. I told Mango about you. She looked at me like, 'Not my problem.' Then she went back to sleep on the bread.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那家店没有猫。说实话，好可惜。我跟 Mango 说了你的事。她看着我，一副「不关我事」的样子。然后又回面包上睡觉了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"If your shop got a cat, what would you call it?","p":"","m":"要是那家店养只猫，你会给它起什么名字？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something food-related.","p":"","m":"跟吃的有关的名字。","r":{"t":"Perfect. Like Mango!","p":"","m":"完美。就像 Mango！"}},{"t":"I'm not sure.","p":"","m":"说不好。","r":{"t":"Take your time. Names are hard.","p":"","m":"慢慢想。起名字很难。"}}],"next":{"t":"Mango sends a sleepy hello.","p":"","m":"Mango 送来一个困困的问候。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have a shop near me.","p":"","m":"我家附近没有店。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近没有店","en":"You don't have a shop near you"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't have a shop near you. This week the bodega was closed for a day — first time ever. I didn't know what to do. Honestly, I walked around the block twice.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家附近没有店。这周那家小店关了一天——头一回。我都不知道该干什么了。说实话，我绕着街区走了两圈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How far is the nearest shop from you?","p":"","m":"离你最近的店有多远？"},"replies":[{"t":"About ten minutes' walk.","p":"","m":"走路十分钟左右。","r":{"t":"Not bad. Good exercise.","p":"","m":"还不错。顺便锻炼了。"}},{"t":"I need to drive.","p":"","m":"要开车去。","r":{"t":"Then you must plan well. I can't.","p":"","m":"那你一定很会计划。我不行。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bodega's back open. Everything's fine again.","p":"","m":"小店又开门了。一切恢复正常。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's the cat's name?","p":"","m":"那只猫叫什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那只猫叫什么（Mango，老板说她才是老大）","en":"You asked the cat's name (Mango — the owner says she's the real boss)"},"later":{"t":"You asked the cat's name. Mango. This week I learned why: the owner found her in a mango box when she was a kitten. She's been the boss ever since.","p":"","m":"你上次问那只猫叫什么。Mango。这周我知道为什么了：她还是小猫的时候，老板在一个装芒果的箱子里发现了她。从那以后她就是老大了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever named a pet?","p":"","m":"你给宠物起过名字吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, after a food.","p":"","m":"起过，用吃的起的。","r":{"t":"Same idea as Mango's owner!","p":"","m":"跟 Mango 的主人一个想法！"}},{"t":"Never had one.","p":"","m":"没养过。","r":{"t":"Then you can practise on Mango.","p":"","m":"那你可以先拿 Mango 练习。"}}],"next":{"t":"Mango ignored me again today. Typical boss.","p":"","m":"Mango 今天又不理我。老板就是这样。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do people really buy that bread?","p":"","m":"真的有人买那个面包吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过真有人买那面包吗（当然，这也是这家店的魅力）","en":"You asked if people really buy that bread (of course — it's part of the charm)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if people really buy that bread. Yes! This week I bought a loaf with a little cat hair on it. I just smiled. Honestly, that's New York.","p":"","m":"你上次问真有人买那面包吗。有！这周我买了一条，上面沾着一点猫毛。我只是笑了笑。说实话，这就是纽约。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something a bit strange where you live that you've got used to?","p":"","m":"你住的地方，有没有什么有点怪、你却习惯了的事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, lots.","p":"","m":"有，很多。","r":{"t":"Same. That's how you know it's home.","p":"","m":"一样。这就说明那里是家了。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太有。","r":{"t":"Give it time. You'll find one.","p":"","m":"给它点时间。你会找到的。"}}],"next":{"t":"No cat hair on my bread today. Almost disappointed.","p":"","m":"今天的面包上没猫毛。差点有点失望。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-01|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-01","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也有人在放音乐。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě yǒu rén zài fàng yīnyuè.","m":"Someone's playing music here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也有人在放音乐","en":"Someone's playing music near you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也有人在放音乐。这两天隔壁换歌了，不放萨尔萨了，放圣诞歌！波哥大的十二月，到处都是音乐。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě yǒu rén zài fàng yīnyuè. Zhè liǎng tiān gébì huàn gē le, bú fàng sà'ěrsà le, fàng Shèngdàn gē! Bōgēdà de shí'èr yuè, dàochù dōu shì yīnyuè.","m":"You said someone's playing music near you too. These days next door switched songs — no more salsa, Christmas songs instead! December in Bogotá is music everywhere.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边十二月热闹吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān shí'èr yuè rènao ma?","m":"Is December lively where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"很热闹，到处都是灯。","p":"Hěn rènao, dàochù dōu shì dēng.","m":"Very — lights everywhere.","r":{"t":"跟波哥大一样！","p":"Gēn Bōgēdà yíyàng!","m":"Just like Bogotá!"}},{"t":"不太热闹，跟平常一样。","p":"Bú tài rènao, gēn píngcháng yíyàng.","m":"Not really — same as usual.","r":{"t":"那你来波哥大过十二月吧！","p":"Nà nǐ lái Bōgēdà guò shí'èr yuè ba!","m":"Then come and spend December in Bogotá!"}}],"next":{"t":"隔壁今天又在放圣诞歌。","p":"Gébì jīntiān yòu zài fàng Shèngdàn gē.","m":"Next door's playing Christmas songs again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边很安静，什么都听不到。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān hěn ānjìng, shénme dōu tīng bu dào.","m":"It's quiet here — I can't hear anything."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边很安静，什么都听不到","en":"It's quiet where you are — you can't hear anything"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边很安静。这两天我找到一个办法：戴上耳机，放中文播客，隔壁的音乐就听不到了。我听了一个小时，听懂了……一点点，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān hěn ānjìng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhǎo dào yí gè bànfǎ: dài shang ěrjī, fàng Zhōngwén bōkè, gébì de yīnyuè jiù tīng bu dào le. Wǒ tīng le yí gè xiǎoshí, tīng dǒng le …… yìdiǎndiǎn, hāha.","m":"You said it's quiet where you are. These days I found a trick: headphones on, a Chinese podcast, and I can't hear next door's music. I listened for an hour and understood… a tiny bit, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学习的时候，喜欢安静还是有一点声音？","p":"Nǐ xuéxí de shíhou, xǐhuan ānjìng háishi yǒu yìdiǎn shēngyīn?","m":"When you study, do you like quiet or a bit of sound?"},"replies":[{"t":"安静。","p":"Ānjìng.","m":"Quiet.","r":{"t":"我也想要安静！我好羡慕你。","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng yào ānjìng! Wǒ hǎo xiànmù nǐ.","m":"I want quiet too! So jealous."}},{"t":"有一点音乐比较好。","p":"Yǒu yìdiǎn yīnyuè bǐjiào hǎo.","m":"A bit of music is better.","r":{"t":"那你来我家，什么音乐都有，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ lái wǒ jiā, shénme yīnyuè dōu yǒu, hāha.","m":"Then come to mine — every kind of music, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又戴着耳机背生词，隔壁还在放音乐。","p":"Jīntiān yòu dài zhe ěrjī bèi shēngcí, gébì hái zài fàng yīnyuè.","m":"Headphones on, learning words again today — next door's still playing music."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"隔壁放的是什么音乐？","p":"Gébì fàng de shì shénme yīnyuè?","m":"What music are the neighbours playing?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过隔壁放的是什么音乐（萨尔萨，周末一定要放，有时候还跳舞）","en":"You asked what music next door plays (salsa — every weekend, sometimes with dancing)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问隔壁放的是什么音乐。萨尔萨！这两天隔壁的阿姨看见我，问我要不要学跳。我跳了五分钟，踩了她两次脚，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn gébì fàng de shì shénme yīnyuè. Sà'ěrsà! Zhè liǎng tiān gébì de āyí kànjiàn wǒ, wèn wǒ yào bu yào xué tiào. Wǒ tiào le wǔ fēnzhōng, cǎi le tā liǎng cì jiǎo, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what next door plays. Salsa! These days the lady next door saw me and asked if I wanted to learn. I danced for five minutes and stood on her feet twice, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会跳舞吗？","p":"Nǐ huì tiàowǔ ma?","m":"Can you dance?"},"replies":[{"t":"会一点。","p":"Huì yìdiǎn.","m":"A little.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 下次教教我。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Xià cì jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"¡Qué chévere! Teach me sometime."}},{"t":"不会，我一跳就乱。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ yí tiào jiù luàn.","m":"No — it all goes wrong when I try.","r":{"t":"我也是！我们一起乱跳。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒmen yìqǐ luàn tiào.","m":"Me too! Let's dance badly together."}}],"next":{"t":"今天腿有点酸，都是萨尔萨的错，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān tuǐ yǒudiǎn suān, dōu shì sà'ěrsà de cuò, hāha.","m":"My legs ache a bit today — salsa's fault, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"狗是你家的吗？","p":"Gǒu shì nǐ jiā de ma?","m":"Is the dog yours?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过狗是不是她家的（不是，对面的，一听到门铃就叫）","en":"You asked if the dog is hers (no — it's across the road, it barks at the doorbell)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问狗是不是我家的。不是，是对面的。这两天我知道它叫什么了：叫 Chispa，意思是「火花」。我用中文叫它「火花」，它也看我了！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn gǒu shì bu shì wǒ jiā de. Bú shì, shì duìmiàn de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhīdào tā jiào shénme le: jiào Chispa, yìsi shì “huǒhuā”. Wǒ yòng Zhōngwén jiào tā “Huǒhuā”, tā yě kàn wǒ le!","m":"Last time you asked if the dog's ours. No, it's from across the road. These days I found out its name: Chispa, which means 'spark'. I called it 火花 in Chinese, and it looked at me!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你养过小动物吗？","p":"Nǐ yǎngguo xiǎo dòngwù ma?","m":"Have you ever had a pet?"},"replies":[{"t":"养过，一只猫。","p":"Yǎngguo, yì zhī māo.","m":"Yes — a cat.","r":{"t":"猫最好了！我的 Mochi 也是猫。","p":"Māo zuì hǎo le! Wǒ de Mochi yě shì māo.","m":"Cats are the best! My Mochi's a cat too."}},{"t":"没有，可是想养。","p":"Méiyǒu, kěshì xiǎng yǎng.","m":"No, but I'd like one.","r":{"t":"那你先跟邻居的狗做朋友吧，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ xiān gēn línjū de gǒu zuò péngyou ba, hāha.","m":"Then make friends with a neighbour's dog first, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又叫了一声「火花」，它摇尾巴了。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu jiào le yì shēng “Huǒhuā”, tā yáo wěiba le.","m":"Called out 火花 again today — it wagged its tail."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-01|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-01","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也很安静。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě hěn ānjìng.","m":"It's quiet here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很安静","en":"It's quiet where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也很安静。这两天我趁安静，把一本放了好久的小说看完了。最后一页看完，屋里还是只有冰箱在响。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě hěn ānjìng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ chèn ānjìng, bǎ yì běn fàng le hǎo jiǔ de xiǎoshuō kàn wán le. Zuìhòu yí yè kàn wán, wū lǐ háishi zhǐ yǒu bīngxiāng zài xiǎng.","m":"You said it's quiet where you are too. These days I used the quiet to finish a novel that had been sitting there for ages. When I turned the last page, the only sound was still the fridge.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"安静的时候，你喜欢做什么？","p":"Ānjìng de shíhou, nǐ xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like doing when it's quiet?"},"replies":[{"t":"看书。","p":"Kàn shū.","m":"Reading.","r":{"t":"那我们一样！爱看书的人，都是朋友。","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng! Ài kàn shū de rén, dōu shì péngyou.","m":"Same as me! Book lovers are all friends."}},{"t":"什么都不做，就发呆。","p":"Shénme dōu bú zuò, jiù fādāi.","m":"Nothing — just zone out.","r":{"t":"发呆也很好，脑子也要休息。","p":"Fādāi yě hěn hǎo, nǎozi yě yào xiūxi.","m":"Zoning out is good — your brain needs a rest too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上也很安静，只有冰箱在响。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yě hěn ānjìng, zhǐ yǒu bīngxiāng zài xiǎng.","m":"Quiet again this evening — just the fridge humming."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边外面一直有车的声音。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān wàimiàn yìzhí yǒu chē de shēngyīn.","m":"There's traffic noise outside all the time here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边外面一直有车的声音","en":"There's always traffic noise outside where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边外面一直有车的声音。这两天我们胡同口修路，白天也是「突突突」的。我才知道，安静不是天天都有的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān wàimiàn yìzhí yǒu chē de shēngyīn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen hútòng kǒu xiū lù, báitiān yě shì “tū tū tū” de. Wǒ cái zhīdào, ānjìng bú shì tiāntiān dōu yǒu de.","m":"You said there's always traffic noise outside where you are. These days they're digging up the road at our hutong entrance — rat-a-tat all day. Now I know quiet isn't something you get every day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"吵的时候，你怎么让自己静下来？","p":"Chǎo de shíhou, nǐ zěnme ràng zìjǐ jìng xiàlái?","m":"When it's noisy, how do you calm yourself down?"},"replies":[{"t":"戴上耳机听音乐。","p":"Dài shang ěrjī tīng yīnyuè.","m":"Headphones and music.","r":{"t":"好办法，我也试试。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ, wǒ yě shìshi.","m":"Good idea — I'll try that."}},{"t":"出去走走。","p":"Chūqù zǒuzou.","m":"Go out for a walk.","r":{"t":"对，换个地方就好了。","p":"Duì, huàn gè dìfang jiù hǎo le.","m":"Right — a change of place does it."}}],"next":{"t":"胡同口今天还在修路，突突突的。","p":"Hútòng kǒu jīntiān hái zài xiū lù, tū tū tū de.","m":"Still roadworks at the hutong entrance today — rat-a-tat."}},"m1.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"有点吵，可是我习惯了。","p":"Yǒudiǎn chǎo, kěshì wǒ xíguàn le.","m":"A bit, but I'm used to it."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边有点吵，可是你习惯了","en":"It's a bit noisy where you are, but you're used to it"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边有点吵，可是习惯了。这两天我们胡同口修路，我第一天睡不着，第二天就好多了。看来真的会习惯，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yǒudiǎn chǎo, kěshì xíguàn le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen hútòng kǒu xiū lù, wǒ dì yī tiān shuì bu zháo, dì èr tiān jiù hǎo duō le. Kànlái zhēnde huì xíguàn, hāha.","m":"You said it's a bit noisy where you are but you're used to it. These days there are roadworks at our hutong entrance — the first night I couldn't sleep, the second was much better. Looks like you really do get used to it, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有什么声音，听了反而睡得着？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu shénme shēngyīn, tīng le fǎn'ér shuì de zháo?","m":"Is there a sound that actually helps you sleep?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，下雨的声音。","p":"Yǒu, xià yǔ de shēngyīn.","m":"Yes — rain.","r":{"t":"雨声最好了，听着听着就睡着了。","p":"Yǔ shēng zuì hǎo le, tīng zhe tīng zhe jiù shuìzháo le.","m":"Rain's the best — you drift off listening."}},{"t":"没有，我要很安静才睡得着。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ yào hěn ānjìng cái shuì de zháo.","m":"No — I need it really quiet.","r":{"t":"那你跟我一样，只能跟冰箱做伴了。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ yíyàng, zhǐ néng gēn bīngxiāng zuò bàn le.","m":"Then you're like me — the fridge is our only company."}}],"next":{"t":"修路的声音我也快习惯了，跟你一样。","p":"Xiū lù de shēngyīn wǒ yě kuài xíguàn le, gēn nǐ yíyàng.","m":"I'm nearly used to the roadworks too — like you."}},"m1.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"很吵，我睡觉要戴耳塞。","p":"Hěn chǎo, wǒ shuìjiào yào dài ěrsāi.","m":"Very — I wear earplugs to sleep."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边很吵，睡觉要戴耳塞","en":"It's so noisy where you are that you wear earplugs to sleep"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你睡觉要戴耳塞。这两天我们胡同口修路，我也去买了一副。第一晚戴着，连闹钟都没听见，差点迟到！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ shuìjiào yào dài ěrsāi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen hútòng kǒu xiū lù, wǒ yě qù mǎi le yí fù. Dì yī wǎn dài zhe, lián nàozhōng dōu méi tīngjiàn, chà diǎn chídào!","m":"You said you wear earplugs to sleep. These days there are roadworks at our hutong entrance, so I bought a pair too. The first night I didn't even hear my alarm — I was nearly late!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你戴耳塞，会听不见闹钟吗？","p":"Nǐ dài ěrsāi, huì tīng bu jiàn nàozhōng ma?","m":"With earplugs in, do you ever miss your alarm?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，所以我用手机震动。","p":"Huì, suǒyǐ wǒ yòng shǒujī zhèndòng.","m":"Yes — so I use phone vibration.","r":{"t":"好主意！我也改成震动了。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi! Wǒ yě gǎi chéng zhèndòng le.","m":"Good idea! I've switched to vibrate too."}},{"t":"不会，我的闹钟特别响。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ de nàozhōng tèbié xiǎng.","m":"No — my alarm is really loud.","r":{"t":"哈哈，那你的邻居也一起起床了。","p":"Hāha, nà nǐ de línjū yě yìqǐ qǐchuáng le.","m":"Haha, then your neighbours get up with you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我没戴耳塞，闹钟听见了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ méi dài ěrsāi, nàozhōng tīngjiàn le, hāha.","m":"No earplugs today — heard the alarm, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你现在在干什么？","p":"Nǐ xiànzài zài gàn shénme?","m":"What are you doing right now?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她那时候在干什么（在改作业，还剩二十本）","en":"You asked what she was doing (marking — twenty books left)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在干什么。改作业，还剩二十本。后来全改完了，夜里十二点。有个学生在作业最后写了一句：「老师辛苦了」，我一下就不累了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài gàn shénme. Gǎi zuòyè, hái shèng èrshí běn. Hòulái quán gǎi wán le, yèlǐ shí'èr diǎn. Yǒu gè xuésheng zài zuòyè zuìhòu xiě le yí jù: “Lǎoshī xīnkǔ le”, wǒ yíxià jiù bú lèi le.","m":"Last time you asked what I was doing. Marking, twenty books left. I finished them all — at midnight. One student had written at the end: “Thank you for your hard work, teacher.” Suddenly I wasn't tired any more.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"最近有没有一句话，让你一下子开心起来？","p":"Zuìjìn yǒu méiyǒu yí jù huà, ràng nǐ yíxiàzi kāixīn qǐlái?","m":"Has anyone said something lately that instantly cheered you up?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，朋友说「想你了」。","p":"Yǒu, péngyou shuō “xiǎng nǐ le”.","m":"Yes — a friend said “I miss you.”","r":{"t":"这句最暖了。","p":"Zhè jù zuì nuǎn le.","m":"That's the warmest one."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那我先说一句：你今天也辛苦了！","p":"Nà wǒ xiān shuō yí jù: nǐ jīntiān yě xīnkǔ le!","m":"Then let me say one: you've worked hard today too!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天作业不多，改得很快。","p":"Jīntiān zuòyè bù duō, gǎi de hěn kuài.","m":"Not much marking today — done quickly."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你家晚上一直这么安静吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā wǎnshang yìzhí zhème ānjìng ma?","m":"Is your place always this quiet at night?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她家晚上是不是一直这么安静（一般是，偶尔有人骑车经过）","en":"You asked if it's always that quiet at night (usually — now and then a bike bell)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我家晚上是不是一直这么安静。这两天倒是有个新声音：楼上的阿姨在学二胡，每天晚上八点拉二十分钟。拉得还不太好，不过我挺爱听的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ jiā wǎnshang shì bu shì yìzhí zhème ānjìng. Zhè liǎng tiān dàoshì yǒu gè xīn shēngyīn: lóushàng de āyí zài xué èrhú, měi tiān wǎnshang bā diǎn lā èrshí fēnzhōng. Lā de hái bú tài hǎo, búguò wǒ tǐng ài tīng de.","m":"Last time you asked if it's always that quiet at night. Well, these days there's a new sound: the lady upstairs is learning the erhu, twenty minutes every evening at eight. Not very good yet — but I quite like listening.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有没有人在学一样新东西？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu méiyǒu rén zài xué yí yàng xīn dōngxi?","m":"Is anyone around you learning something new?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我自己在学中文！","p":"Yǒu, wǒ zìjǐ zài xué Zhōngwén!","m":"Yes — me, I'm learning Chinese!","r":{"t":"对呀！你就是我身边最好的例子。","p":"Duì ya! Nǐ jiù shì wǒ shēnbiān zuì hǎo de lìzi.","m":"Of course! You're the best example I know."}},{"t":"我妈在学跳舞。","p":"Wǒ mā zài xué tiàowǔ.","m":"My mum's learning to dance.","r":{"t":"真好！学东西多大都不晚。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Xué dōngxi duō dà dōu bù wǎn.","m":"Lovely! It's never too late to learn."}}],"next":{"t":"八点了，楼上的二胡又响起来了。","p":"Bā diǎn le, lóushàng de èrhú yòu xiǎng qǐlái le.","m":"It's eight — the erhu upstairs has started again."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-01|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-01","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's noisy here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也很吵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很吵","en":"It's noisy where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's noisy there too. This week I recorded our street for ten minutes — horns, the radio, my neighbour's laugh. I'm going to hide it inside a beat. Accra, in a song.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也很吵。这周我把我们这条街录了十分钟——喇叭、收音机、邻居的笑声。我要把它藏进一段节奏里。一首歌里的阿克拉。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What sound would you put in a song about your street?","p":"","m":"要是写一首关于你那条街的歌，你会放什么声音？"},"replies":[{"t":"Car horns.","p":"","m":"汽车喇叭。","r":{"t":"Chale, horns are music if you listen right.","p":"","m":"兄弟，喇叭听对了也是音乐。"}},{"t":"Birds in the morning.","p":"","m":"早上的鸟叫。","r":{"t":"Beautiful. My street doesn't have those, haha.","p":"","m":"真美。我那条街可没有，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Listened to my street recording again today. Still good.","p":"","m":"今天又听了一遍我录的街声。还是很好。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's really quiet here.","p":"","m":"我这边很安静。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边很安静","en":"It's really quiet where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's really quiet there. I can't imagine it. This week I tried a quiet hour — phone off, no music. I lasted twenty minutes. Then I needed a beat.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边很安静。我想象不出来。这周我试了一个安静的小时——关手机，不放音乐。撑了二十分钟。然后就得来点节奏了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like silence, or does it feel strange?","p":"","m":"你喜欢安静，还是觉得安静很奇怪？"},"replies":[{"t":"I love it.","p":"","m":"我很喜欢。","r":{"t":"Respect. Teach me someday.","p":"","m":"佩服。哪天教教我。"}},{"t":"It feels a bit strange.","p":"","m":"有点奇怪。","r":{"t":"Same for me, chale!","p":"","m":"我也是，兄弟！"}}],"next":{"t":"Tried twenty minutes of quiet again. Then music, haha.","p":"","m":"又试了二十分钟安静。然后放音乐了，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Who was laughing?","p":"","m":"谁在笑？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是谁在笑（邻居在打电话，什么都笑）","en":"You asked who was laughing (his neighbour, on the phone — he laughs at everything)"},"later":{"t":"You asked who was laughing. My neighbour. This week I found out why he's always on the phone: his daughter's studying in London, and they talk every evening. That's a good reason to laugh.","p":"","m":"你上次问是谁在笑。我邻居。这周我才知道他为什么老在打电话：他女儿在伦敦读书，他们每天晚上都聊。这是个值得笑的理由。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who do you talk to most on the phone?","p":"","m":"你最常跟谁打电话？"},"replies":[{"t":"My family.","p":"","m":"家里人。","r":{"t":"The best calls.","p":"","m":"最好的电话。"}},{"t":"I hardly call — I text.","p":"","m":"我很少打电话，都发消息。","r":{"t":"Same with my friends. Only my mum calls.","p":"","m":"我朋友也是。只有我妈会打。"}}],"next":{"t":"My neighbour's laughing on the phone again. Nice sound.","p":"","m":"邻居又在电话里笑了。好听的声音。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Can you work with all that noise?","p":"","m":"那么吵你能工作吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那么吵他能不能干活（能，戴上耳机就没了）","en":"You asked if he can work with all that noise (yes — headphones on and it's gone)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I can work with all that noise. With headphones, yes. This week the power went off for two hours — no headphones, no laptop. I just sat outside and listened. Chale, the street has rhythm.","p":"","m":"你上次问那么吵我能不能干活。戴耳机就能。这周停电两个小时——没有耳机，没有电脑。我就坐在外面听。兄弟，这条街是有节奏的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you work or study best?","p":"","m":"你在哪儿学习或工作最好？"},"replies":[{"t":"At home.","p":"","m":"在家。","r":{"t":"Nice. Home is easiest.","p":"","m":"不错。家最方便。"}},{"t":"Somewhere busy, like a café.","p":"","m":"热闹一点的地方，比如咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Same! A bit of noise helps me too.","p":"","m":"一样！有点声音我也更好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Power's back. Headphones on again.","p":"","m":"电来了。又戴上耳机了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-01|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-01","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's raining here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也在下雨。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也在下雨","en":"It's raining where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's raining there too. This week our roof started leaking over the kitchen. Now we have a bucket in the corner. The kids call it 'the rain drum'.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也在下雨。这周我们家厨房上面的屋顶开始漏水。现在角落里放了一个桶。孩子们管它叫「雨鼓」。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do on rainy afternoons?","p":"","m":"下雨的下午你做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Stay in with something hot.","p":"","m":"待在家，喝点热的。","r":{"t":"Good plan, bro. Me, I'm on the road, haha.","p":"","m":"好计划，兄弟。我呢，在路上，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Go out anyway.","p":"","m":"照样出门。","r":{"t":"Strong! Don't forget the raincoat.","p":"","m":"厉害！别忘了雨衣。"}}],"next":{"t":"The rain drum in the kitchen is playing again today, haha.","p":"","m":"厨房里的「雨鼓」今天又响了，哈哈。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's quiet and dry here.","p":"","m":"我这边很安静，也没下雨。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边又安静又干爽","en":"It's quiet and dry where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's quiet and dry there. Sounds like a dream, bro. This week it rained so hard I parked under the flyover with twenty other drivers. We shared one bag of peanuts.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边又安静又干爽。听起来像做梦，兄弟。这周雨大得我跟二十个司机一起停在高架桥下面。我们二十个人分一包花生。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the weather like there this week?","p":"","m":"你那边这周天气怎么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cold but sunny.","p":"","m":"冷，可是有太阳。","r":{"t":"Sunny! Send me some, bro.","p":"","m":"有太阳！给我送点，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Grey and cloudy.","p":"","m":"灰蒙蒙的，多云。","r":{"t":"At least it's dry. Here, everything is wet.","p":"","m":"至少是干的。这儿什么都是湿的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Rain again. Thinking of your dry weather.","p":"","m":"又下雨了。想着你那边干爽的天。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What are you watching?","p":"","m":"你在看什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在看什么（足球，想看但听不见）","en":"You asked what he was watching (the football — trying to)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I was watching. The football. Well — trying to. This week I watched the replay. Turns out I missed two goals because of the rain. Two!","p":"","m":"你上次问我在看什么。足球。好吧——是想看。这周我看了重播。原来因为下雨，我错过了两个进球。两个！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you watch any sport?","p":"","m":"你看什么体育比赛吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, football.","p":"","m":"看，足球。","r":{"t":"Then we can talk football, bro!","p":"","m":"那我们可以聊足球了，兄弟！"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不怎么看。","r":{"t":"That's okay. More time for other things.","p":"","m":"没关系。可以做别的事。"}}],"next":{"t":"Watched the football again today. No rain, I heard everything.","p":"","m":"今天又看球了。没下雨，什么都听见了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it like this every day?","p":"","m":"每天都这样吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是不是每天都这样（雨季大多数下午都这样）","en":"You asked if it's like this every day (most afternoons in the rainy season)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's like this every day. Most afternoons. So this week I changed my hours: I start earlier and go home when the rain starts. More time with the kids, less wet.","p":"","m":"你上次问是不是每天都这样。大多数下午都是。所以这周我改了干活的时间：早点出门，一下雨就回家。陪孩子的时间多了，人也淋得少了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does the weather change how you plan your day?","p":"","m":"天气会影响你怎么安排一天吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a lot.","p":"","m":"会，影响很大。","r":{"t":"Same. The rain is my boss, haha.","p":"","m":"一样。雨就是我的老板，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Here the sky decides everything.","p":"","m":"真幸运。这儿什么都由天说了算。"}}],"next":{"t":"Started early again today. Home before the rain.","p":"","m":"今天又早出门了。下雨前到家了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-01|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-01","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's really quiet here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也很安静。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很安静","en":"It's really quiet where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's really quiet there too. This week the first snow came, and Malmö went even quieter. Snow eats sound, my youngest says. I think that's true.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也很安静。这周下了第一场雪，马尔默更安静了。我家老二说，雪会把声音吃掉。我觉得说得对。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What does your street sound like at night?","p":"","m":"你那条街晚上是什么声音？"},"replies":[{"t":"Almost nothing.","p":"","m":"几乎没声音。","r":{"t":"Then we're quiet neighbours, far apart.","p":"","m":"那我们是隔得很远的安静邻居。"}},{"t":"Traffic, always.","p":"","m":"一直有车。","r":{"t":"To be fair, I'd miss the quiet. But you get used to anything.","p":"","m":"说实话，我会想念安静。不过人什么都能习惯。"}}],"next":{"t":"Snowy and quiet here today.","p":"","m":"今天这儿下雪了，很安静。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's really noisy here.","p":"","m":"我这边很吵。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边很吵","en":"It's really noisy where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's really noisy there. This week I did a little test: I played city sounds on my phone while I cooked. My kids came in and said, 'Mamma, why is there a traffic jam in the kitchen?'","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边很吵。这周我做了个小实验：做饭的时候用手机放城市的声音。孩子们跑进来说：「妈妈，厨房里怎么堵车了？」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like the noise, or wish for quiet?","p":"","m":"你喜欢热闹，还是希望安静？"},"replies":[{"t":"I like the noise.","p":"","m":"我喜欢热闹。","r":{"t":"Then you'd find Malmö too quiet, ja.","p":"","m":"那你会觉得马尔默太安静了。"}},{"t":"I wish for quiet.","p":"","m":"希望安静。","r":{"t":"Then come and visit. I'll lend you our silence.","p":"","m":"那来玩吧。我把我们的安静借给你。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cooked in silence today. Thought of your noisy street.","p":"","m":"今天安安静静地做饭。想到你那条热闹的街。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Where do you live?","p":"","m":"你住在哪儿？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她住在哪儿（安静的街上，靠近一个公园）","en":"You asked where she lives (a flat on a quiet street, near a park)"},"later":{"t":"You asked where I live. A flat on a quiet street, near a park. This week the park had its first frost, and my kids made footprints across the whole white field before school.","p":"","m":"你上次问我住在哪儿。一条安静的街上的公寓，靠近一个公园。这周公园里下了第一场霜，孩子们上学前在整片白白的草地上踩满了脚印。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a park near where you live?","p":"","m":"你住的地方附近有公园吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a small one.","p":"","m":"有，一个小的。","r":{"t":"Small parks are the best — you know every tree.","p":"","m":"小公园最好了——每棵树都认识。"}},{"t":"No, not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then a window with a tree is the next best thing.","p":"","m":"那一扇看得到树的窗户也不错。"}}],"next":{"t":"More frost in the park today. More footprints.","p":"","m":"今天公园里霜更多了。脚印也更多了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it always this quiet?","p":"","m":"一直都这么安静吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那里是不是一直这么安静（冬天是，夏天人们会在外面待得很晚）","en":"You asked if it's always this quiet (in winter, yes — in summer people are out late)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's always this quiet. In winter, yes. This week I noticed people even walk more quietly in winter. Big coats, soft steps. The whole city whispers.","p":"","m":"你上次问那里是不是一直这么安静。冬天是。这周我发现，冬天大家连走路都更轻了。厚厚的大衣，轻轻的脚步。整座城都在说悄悄话。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your city change much in winter?","p":"","m":"你的城市冬天会变很多吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it gets quieter.","p":"","m":"会，变安静了。","r":{"t":"Same here. Winter is a whisper.","p":"","m":"这儿也是。冬天是一句悄悄话。"}},{"t":"Not much.","p":"","m":"变化不大。","r":{"t":"Then you have one city all year. That's nice too.","p":"","m":"那你一年都是同一座城。也很好。"}}],"next":{"t":"The city whispered again today.","p":"","m":"今天城市又在说悄悄话了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"First proper snow this week. Malmö got about two centimetres — and every child in the city was outside.","p":"","m":"这周下了第一场像样的雪。马尔默大概两厘米——全城的孩子都跑出来了。"},{"t":"We teachers took the class out for ten minutes. Thirty snowmen, all very small.","p":"","m":"我们几个老师带班上的孩子出去了十分钟。三十个雪人，都很小。"},{"t":"To be fair, mine was the smallest.","p":"","m":"说实话，我堆的最小。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Thirty tiny snowmen — so cute!","p":"","m":"三十个小雪人——太可爱了！","r":{"t":"Ja, they'd melted by lunchtime. Still worth it.","p":"","m":"是啊，午饭前就化了。还是值得。"}},{"t":"Two centimetres is enough?","p":"","m":"两厘米就够了？","r":{"t":"For kids, one centimetre is enough!","p":"","m":"对孩子来说，一厘米就够了！"}}],"from":"2026-12-05"}},"2026-12-02|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-02","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我的邻居也很热情。","p":"Wǒ de línjū yě hěn rèqíng.","m":"My neighbours are really friendly too."},"mem":{"zh":"你的邻居也很热情","en":"Your neighbours are really friendly too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你的邻居也很热情。这两天楼上的阿姨又敲门了，这次不是送饺子，是问我会不会用手机交电费。我教了她十分钟，她学会了，特别高兴。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ de línjū yě hěn rèqíng. Zhè liǎng tiān lóushàng de āyí yòu qiāo mén le, zhè cì bú shì sòng jiǎozi, shì wèn wǒ huì bu huì yòng shǒujī jiāo diànfèi. Wǒ jiāo le tā shí fēnzhōng, tā xuéhuì le, tèbié gāoxìng.","m":"You said your neighbours are really friendly too. These days the lady upstairs knocked again — not with dumplings this time, but to ask if I could help her pay the electricity bill on her phone. Ten minutes later she'd got it, and she was so pleased.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你帮过邻居什么忙吗？","p":"Nǐ bāngguo línjū shénme máng ma?","m":"Have you ever helped a neighbour with something?"},"replies":[{"t":"帮过，帮他们拿快递。","p":"Bāngguo, bāng tāmen ná kuàidì.","m":"Yes — picking up their parcels.","r":{"t":"这个最常见，也最贴心。","p":"Zhège zuì chángjiàn, yě zuì tiēxīn.","m":"That's the most common one — and the kindest."}},{"t":"还没有，没什么机会。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, méi shénme jīhuì.","m":"Not yet — never had the chance.","r":{"t":"会有的。远亲不如近邻嘛。","p":"Huì yǒu de. Yuǎnqīn bùrú jìnlín ma.","m":"It'll come. A close neighbour beats a distant relative, as they say."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在楼道里碰到阿姨，她说电费交上了。","p":"Jīntiān zài lóudào lǐ pèng dào āyí, tā shuō diànfèi jiāo shang le.","m":"Bumped into the lady upstairs on the stairs today — bill paid."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我跟邻居不太说话。","p":"Wǒ gēn línjū bú tài shuōhuà.","m":"I don't really talk to my neighbours."},"mem":{"zh":"你跟邻居不太说话","en":"You don't really talk to your neighbours"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你跟邻居不太说话。其实我刚搬来的时候也是。后来有一次停电，大家都站在楼道里，一聊就聊熟了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ gēn línjū bú tài shuōhuà. Qíshí wǒ gāng bān lái de shíhou yě shì. Hòulái yǒu yí cì tíngdiàn, dàjiā dōu zhàn zài lóudào lǐ, yì liáo jiù liáo shú le.","m":"You said you don't really talk to your neighbours. Actually, I was the same when I first moved in. Then one day there was a power cut, everyone stood out on the stairwell, and we got to know each other just by chatting.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你觉得跟邻居熟一点好，还是各过各的好？","p":"Nǐ juéde gēn línjū shú yìdiǎn hǎo, háishi gè guò gè de hǎo?","m":"Do you think it's better to know your neighbours, or keep to yourselves?"},"replies":[{"t":"熟一点好，有事能帮忙。","p":"Shú yìdiǎn hǎo, yǒu shì néng bāngmáng.","m":"Better to know them — you can help each other.","r":{"t":"我也这么觉得。","p":"Wǒ yě zhème juéde.","m":"I think so too."}},{"t":"各过各的，我比较喜欢清静。","p":"Gè guò gè de, wǒ bǐjiào xǐhuan qīngjìng.","m":"Keep to ourselves — I like my peace.","r":{"t":"也挺好，点个头就够了。","p":"Yě tǐng hǎo, diǎn gè tóu jiù gòu le.","m":"That's fine too — a nod is enough."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在电梯里跟邻居说了一句「早」。","p":"Jīntiān zài diàntī lǐ gēn línjū shuō le yí jù “zǎo”.","m":"Said “morning” to a neighbour in the lift today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"阿姨包的是什么饺子？","p":"Āyí bāo de shì shénme jiǎozi?","m":"What kind of dumplings does she make?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过阿姨包的是什么饺子（韭菜鸡蛋的）","en":"You asked what dumplings the lady upstairs makes (chive and egg)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问阿姨包的是什么饺子。韭菜鸡蛋的。这两天她又送来一盘，这次是酸菜猪肉的。她说天冷了，就得吃酸菜。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn āyí bāo de shì shénme jiǎozi. Jiǔcài jīdàn de. Zhè liǎng tiān tā yòu sòng lái yì pán, zhè cì shì suāncài zhūròu de. Tā shuō tiān lěng le, jiù děi chī suāncài.","m":"Last time you asked what dumplings the lady upstairs makes. Chive and egg. These days she brought another plate — pickled cabbage and pork this time. She says once it's cold, you've got to have pickled cabbage.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天有什么一定要吃的东西？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān yǒu shénme yídìng yào chī de dōngxi?","m":"Where you are, is there something you just have to eat in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，热汤。","p":"Yǒu, rè tāng.","m":"Yes — hot soup.","r":{"t":"热汤好，喝完全身都暖了。","p":"Rè tāng hǎo, hē wán quánshēn dōu nuǎn le.","m":"Hot soup's great — warms you all over."}},{"t":"没有，冬天跟平时差不多。","p":"Méiyǒu, dōngtiān gēn píngshí chàbuduō.","m":"No — winter's like any other time.","r":{"t":"那你那边的冬天一定不太冷。","p":"Nà nǐ nàbiān de dōngtiān yídìng bú tài lěng.","m":"Then your winters can't be too cold."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午吃的就是阿姨送的饺子。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ chī de jiù shì āyí sòng de jiǎozi.","m":"Had the neighbour's dumplings for lunch today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你也给她送东西吗？","p":"Nǐ yě gěi tā sòng dōngxi ma?","m":"Do you give her things back?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她也给阿姨送东西吗（送过水果，还帮她孙子看过作业）","en":"You asked if she gives the lady anything back (fruit, and she's helped her grandson with homework)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我给不给阿姨送东西。这两天她孙子又来找我了，拿着一篇作文问：「老师，『开心』除了『开心』还能怎么说？」我们俩想了十个。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ gěi bu gěi āyí sòng dōngxi. Zhè liǎng tiān tā sūnzi yòu lái zhǎo wǒ le, ná zhe yì piān zuòwén wèn: “Lǎoshī, ‘kāixīn’ chúle ‘kāixīn’ hái néng zěnme shuō?” Wǒmen liǎ xiǎng le shí gè.","m":"Last time you asked if I give the lady anything back. These days her grandson came to me again with an essay: “Teacher, what else can I say instead of 开心, ‘happy’?” The two of us came up with ten.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学中文的时候，有没有一个词你特别爱用？","p":"Nǐ xué Zhōngwén de shíhou, yǒu méiyǒu yí gè cí nǐ tèbié ài yòng?","m":"Learning Chinese, is there a word you especially love using?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，「好吃」。","p":"Yǒu, “hǎochī”.","m":"Yes — 好吃.","r":{"t":"哈哈，这个词谁都爱！","p":"Hāha, zhège cí shéi dōu ài!","m":"Haha, everyone loves that one!"}},{"t":"「没关系」。","p":"“Méi guānxi”.","m":"没关系.","r":{"t":"好词！说出来人就轻松了。","p":"Hǎo cí! Shuō chūlái rén jiù qīngsōng le.","m":"Good word! Say it and everyone relaxes."}}],"next":{"t":"阿姨的孙子今天又来问作业了，哈哈。","p":"Āyí de sūnzi jīntiān yòu lái wèn zuòyè le, hāha.","m":"The neighbour's grandson came with homework questions again today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-02|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-02","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我住的楼大家也都认识。","p":"Wǒ zhù de lóu dàjiā yě dōu rènshi.","m":"Everyone knows each other in my building too."},"mem":{"zh":"你住的楼大家也都认识","en":"Everyone in your building knows each other too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你住的楼大家也都认识。这两天楼上的阿姨知道我申请去台湾了，一下子全楼都知道了。准确地说，五楼的邻居已经在问我什么时候走了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhù de lóu dàjiā yě dōu rènshi. Zhè liǎng tiān lóushàng de āyí zhīdào wǒ shēnqǐng qù Táiwān le, yíxiàzi quán lóu dōu zhīdào le. Zhǔnquè de shuō, wǔ lóu de línjū yǐjīng zài wèn wǒ shénme shíhou zǒu le.","m":"You said everyone in your building knows each other too. These days the lady upstairs found out I've applied to Taiwan, and suddenly the whole building knew. To be precise, the fifth-floor neighbours are already asking when I'm leaving.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你的邻居会知道你家的事吗？","p":"Nǐ de línjū huì zhīdào nǐ jiā de shì ma?","m":"Do your neighbours know your family's news?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，消息传得很快。","p":"Huì, xiāoxi chuán de hěn kuài.","m":"Yes — news travels fast.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们这里也是！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen zhèlǐ yě shì!","m":"Haha, same here!"}},{"t":"不会，大家不太聊。","p":"Bú huì, dàjiā bú tài liáo.","m":"No — people don't chat much.","r":{"t":"那也好，有自己的空间。","p":"Nà yě hǎo, yǒu zìjǐ de kōngjiān.","m":"That's fine too — you get your own space."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下楼，三个邻居都问我申请的事，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān xià lóu, sān gè línjū dōu wèn wǒ shēnqǐng de shì, hāha.","m":"Three neighbours asked about my application on the stairs today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我不认识我的邻居。","p":"Wǒ bú rènshi wǒ de línjū.","m":"I don't know my neighbours."},"mem":{"zh":"你不认识你的邻居","en":"You don't know your neighbours"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你不认识你的邻居。我在想：要是去了台湾，我也要认识新的邻居。我已经准备好第一句了：「你好，我是努尔，从埃及来。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ bú rènshi nǐ de línjū. Wǒ zài xiǎng: yàoshi qù le Táiwān, wǒ yě yào rènshi xīn de línjū. Wǒ yǐjīng zhǔnbèi hǎo dì yī jù le: “Nǐ hǎo, wǒ shì Nǔ'ěr, cóng Āijí lái.”","m":"You said you don't know your neighbours. I've been thinking: if I go to Taiwan, I'll have new neighbours to meet. I've already got my first line ready: “Hi, I'm Nour, from Egypt.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你搬到新地方，第一件事会做什么？","p":"Nǐ bān dào xīn dìfang, dì yī jiàn shì huì zuò shénme?","m":"When you move somewhere new, what's the first thing you do?"},"replies":[{"t":"先去附近走走。","p":"Xiān qù fùjìn zǒuzou.","m":"Walk around the area.","r":{"t":"好主意！先认识路。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi! Xiān rènshi lù.","m":"Good idea! Learn the streets first."}},{"t":"先把房间收拾好。","p":"Xiān bǎ fángjiān shōushi hǎo.","m":"Sort out my room.","r":{"t":"对，房间收拾好了，才像家。","p":"Duì, fángjiān shōushi hǎo le, cái xiàng jiā.","m":"Right — once the room's sorted, it feels like home."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又练了一遍跟新邻居说的第一句话。","p":"Jīntiān yòu liàn le yí biàn gēn xīn línjū shuō de dì yī jù huà.","m":"Practised my first line for new neighbours again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"今天闻到了什么？","p":"Jīntiān wéndào le shénme?","m":"What did you smell today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她闻到了什么（楼下在炸豆子饼）","en":"You asked what she could smell (downstairs frying bean patties)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我闻到了什么。楼下在炸 ta'ameya，就是我们的豆子饼。这两天楼下的阿姨听说我喜欢，给我送了一盘，还是热的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ wén dào le shénme. Lóuxià zài zhá ta'ameya, jiù shì wǒmen de dòuzi bǐng. Zhè liǎng tiān lóuxià de āyí tīngshuō wǒ xǐhuan, gěi wǒ sòng le yì pán, hái shì rè de.","m":"Last time you asked what I could smell. Downstairs was frying ta'ameya — our bean patties. These days the lady downstairs heard I love them and brought me a plate, still hot.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家附近，最常闻到什么味道？","p":"Nǐ jiā fùjìn, zuì cháng wén dào shénme wèidao?","m":"What do you smell most often near home?"},"replies":[{"t":"面包店的香味。","p":"Miànbāo diàn de xiāngwèi.","m":"The bakery.","r":{"t":"好幸福！我也想住在面包店旁边。","p":"Hǎo xìngfú! Wǒ yě xiǎng zhù zài miànbāo diàn pángbiān.","m":"Lucky! I'd love to live next to a bakery."}},{"t":"车的味道，哈哈。","p":"Chē de wèidao, hāha.","m":"Traffic, haha.","r":{"t":"大城市都这样，所以我更爱楼下的豆子饼。","p":"Dà chéngshì dōu zhèyàng, suǒyǐ wǒ gèng ài lóuxià de dòuzi bǐng.","m":"Every big city's like that — which is why I treasure the bean patties downstairs."}}],"next":{"t":"今天楼下又在炸豆子饼，好香。","p":"Jīntiān lóuxià yòu zài zhá dòuzi bǐng, hǎo xiāng.","m":"Downstairs are frying bean patties again today — smells amazing."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"邻居会给你们送吃的吗？","p":"Línjū huì gěi nǐmen sòng chī de ma?","m":"Do the neighbours bring you food?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过邻居会不会送吃的（常送，盘子还回去不能是空的）","en":"You asked if neighbours bring food (often — and you never return the plate empty)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问邻居会不会送吃的。这两天我妈做了一盘点心，放在楼下阿姨的盘子里还回去了。准确地说，这个盘子已经在我们两家之间走了三年了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn línjū huì bu huì sòng chī de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā zuò le yì pán diǎnxin, fàng zài lóuxià āyí de pánzi lǐ huán huíqù le. Zhǔnquè de shuō, zhège pánzi yǐjīng zài wǒmen liǎng jiā zhījiān zǒu le sān nián le.","m":"Last time you asked if neighbours bring food. These days my mum baked some sweets and sent them back on the downstairs lady's plate. To be precise, that plate has been going back and forth between our two families for three years.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有这种「不能空着还」的习惯？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu zhè zhǒng “bù néng kōng zhe huán” de xíguàn?","m":"Where you are, is there a 'never return it empty' custom like that?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我们也会放点东西。","p":"Yǒu, wǒmen yě huì fàng diǎn dōngxi.","m":"Yes — we put something in too.","r":{"t":"太好了，原来不只埃及这样！","p":"Tài hǎo le, yuánlái bù zhǐ Āijí zhèyàng!","m":"Lovely — so it's not just Egypt!"}},{"t":"没有，我们直接还。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒmen zhíjiē huán.","m":"No — we just give it back.","r":{"t":"那也很简单。不过放一点东西，邻居会很开心。","p":"Nà yě hěn jiǎndān. Búguò fàng yìdiǎn dōngxi, línjū huì hěn kāixīn.","m":"That's simple too. But a little something makes neighbours happy."}}],"next":{"t":"那个盘子今天又回到我们家了，里面有饼干。","p":"Nà gè pánzi jīntiān yòu huí dào wǒmen jiā le, lǐmiàn yǒu bǐnggān.","m":"That plate came back to us again today — with biscuits on it."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-02|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-02","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We just nod too.","p":"","m":"我们也只是点个头。"},"mem":{"zh":"你跟邻居也是点点头","en":"You just nod to your neighbours too"},"later":{"t":"You said you just nod too. This week my neighbour nodded and said 'Morning.' Two words! I panicked and said 'Cheers.' At eight a.m. Very London.","p":"","m":"你上次说你跟邻居也是点点头。这周我邻居点了头，还说了一句「早」。多说了一个词！我一慌，回了句「谢了」。早上八点。非常伦敦。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you say to your neighbours, if anything?","p":"","m":"你跟邻居会说点什么吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Just 'hi'.","p":"","m":"就说「嗨」。","r":{"t":"Simple. Better than 'Cheers' at 8 a.m.","p":"","m":"简单。比早上八点说「谢了」强。"}},{"t":"Nothing — we just smile.","p":"","m":"不说，就笑一下。","r":{"t":"A smile counts. Maybe more than a nod.","p":"","m":"笑也算。可能比点头还好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Neighbour nodded again today. Back to normal.","p":"","m":"邻居今天又点头了。恢复正常。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My neighbours are really friendly.","p":"","m":"我的邻居都很热情。"},"mem":{"zh":"你的邻居很热情","en":"Your neighbours are really friendly"},"later":{"t":"You said your neighbours are really friendly. I'm inspired. This week I left a Christmas card for the flat downstairs. Nothing yet. They might be thinking about it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你的邻居很热情。我受到了鼓舞。这周我给楼下那户留了一张圣诞卡。还没回音。他们可能在考虑。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How did you get to know your neighbours?","p":"","m":"你是怎么认识邻居的？"},"replies":[{"t":"We just started chatting one day.","p":"","m":"有一天就聊起来了。","r":{"t":"That's how it should work. I'll try.","p":"","m":"本来就该这样。我也试试。"}},{"t":"They knocked on my door first.","p":"","m":"是他们先敲我的门的。","r":{"t":"Brave neighbours. Lucky you.","p":"","m":"勇敢的邻居。你真幸运。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still no reply to my card. Patience.","p":"","m":"我的卡片还没回音。耐心点。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you know their names?","p":"","m":"你知道他们叫什么吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他知不知道邻居叫什么（完全不知道）","en":"You asked if he knows their names (not a clue)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I know my neighbours' names. Not a clue. This week a parcel came for them by mistake, so now I know: she's called Priya. All this time, and a parcel told me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我知不知道邻居叫什么。完全不知道。这周他们的包裹送错到我这儿了，所以现在我知道了：她叫 Priya。这么久了，是一个包裹告诉我的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you know your neighbours' names?","p":"","m":"你知道你邻居的名字吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, most of them.","p":"","m":"知道，大部分都知道。","r":{"t":"Impressive. Come and teach the Londoners.","p":"","m":"佩服。来教教伦敦人吧。"}},{"t":"No, not really.","p":"","m":"不太知道。","r":{"t":"Then we're in the same club.","p":"","m":"那我们是一个俱乐部的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Said 'Hi, Priya' today. She looked surprised.","p":"","m":"今天说了一句「嗨，Priya」。她很惊讶。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Would you like to know them?","p":"","m":"你想认识他们吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他想不想认识邻居（也许，下次打个招呼）","en":"You asked if he'd like to know them (maybe — he'll say hello next time)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I'd like to know them. So I did it: this week I said hello and asked how she was. We talked for four minutes about bins. Best conversation I've had all week.","p":"","m":"你上次问我想不想认识邻居。所以我真去了：这周我打了招呼，问她最近怎么样。我们聊了四分钟垃圾桶。这是我这周最好的一次聊天。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever made a friend just by saying hi?","p":"","m":"你有没有因为打了个招呼，就交到了朋友？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, more than once.","p":"","m":"有，不止一次。","r":{"t":"Then you're braver than most Londoners.","p":"","m":"那你比大多数伦敦人都勇敢。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"Then try. Four minutes about bins is a start.","p":"","m":"那试试。聊四分钟垃圾桶也是个开始。"}}],"next":{"t":"Waved at my neighbour today. She waved back.","p":"","m":"今天跟邻居挥手了。她也挥了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-03|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-03","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常去图书馆。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng qù túshūguǎn.","m":"I go to the library a lot too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常去图书馆","en":"You often go to the library too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常去图书馆。这两天我去的时候，我的座位被一个小女孩坐了，她在看一本中文绘本。我就坐在旁边，偷偷跟着她一起看，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng qù túshūguǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù de shíhou, wǒ de zuòwèi bèi yí gè xiǎo nǚhái zuò le, tā zài kàn yì běn Zhōngwén huìběn. Wǒ jiù zuò zài pángbiān, tōutōu gēn zhe tā yìqǐ kàn, hāha.","m":"You said you often go to the library too. These days a little girl was in my seat, reading a Chinese picture book. So I sat next to her and secretly read along, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你去图书馆一般做什么？","p":"Nǐ qù túshūguǎn yìbān zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do at the library?"},"replies":[{"t":"看书，或者学习。","p":"Kàn shū, huòzhě xuéxí.","m":"Read or study.","r":{"t":"对对对，在那里特别能静下心。","p":"Duì duì duì, zài nàlǐ tèbié néng jìng xià xīn.","m":"Yes yes yes — it's the easiest place to focus."}},{"t":"借书，借了就走。","p":"Jiè shū, jiè le jiù zǒu.","m":"Borrow books and leave.","r":{"t":"那你一定看书看得很快。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng kàn shū kàn de hěn kuài.","m":"Then you must read fast."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又坐在我的老位子上了，窗外的树叶都掉光了。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zuò zài wǒ de lǎo wèizi shang le, chuāng wài de shùyè dōu diào guāng le.","m":"Back in my usual seat today — the trees outside have lost all their leaves."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我很少去图书馆，在家学习。","p":"Wǒ hěn shǎo qù túshūguǎn, zài jiā xuéxí.","m":"I rarely go to the library — I study at home."},"mem":{"zh":"你很少去图书馆，在家学习","en":"You rarely go to the library — you study at home"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在家学习。这两天我也试了在家学，结果我四岁的女儿坐在我腿上，要我用中文给她讲故事。我讲了三个，什么都没学成，可是很开心。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài jiā xuéxí. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě shì le zài jiā xué, jiéguǒ wǒ sì suì de nǚ'ér zuò zài wǒ tuǐ shang, yào wǒ yòng Zhōngwén gěi tā jiǎng gùshi. Wǒ jiǎng le sān gè, shénme dōu méi xué chéng, kěshì hěn kāixīn.","m":"You said you study at home. These days I tried it too — and my four-year-old climbed onto my lap and asked for stories in Chinese. I told three, studied nothing, and loved it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在家学习的时候，会被谁打扰吗？","p":"Nǐ zài jiā xuéxí de shíhou, huì bèi shéi dǎrǎo ma?","m":"When you study at home, does anyone interrupt?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，家里人常常找我。","p":"Huì, jiā lǐ rén chángcháng zhǎo wǒ.","m":"Yes — family often need me.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Haha, same here!"}},{"t":"不会，我一个人很安静。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ yí gè rén hěn ānjìng.","m":"No — it's quiet on my own.","r":{"t":"那你一定学得很快。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng xué de hěn kuài.","m":"Then you must learn fast."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又给女儿用中文讲了一个故事。","p":"Jīntiān yòu gěi nǚ'ér yòng Zhōngwén jiǎng le yí gè gùshi.","m":"Told my daughter another story in Chinese today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你的座位在哪儿？","p":"Nǐ de zuòwèi zài nǎr?","m":"Where's your seat?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他的座位在哪儿（二楼靠窗，能看到外面的树）","en":"You asked where his seat is (second floor, by the window, looking out at the trees)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我的座位在哪儿。二楼靠窗。这两天窗外的树叶都掉光了，能看到对面的小学，孩子们在操场上跑。看着看着，我就想到我自己的学生。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ de zuòwèi zài nǎr. Èr lóu kào chuāng. Zhè liǎng tiān chuāng wài de shùyè dōu diào guāng le, néng kàn dào duìmiàn de xiǎoxué, háizimen zài cāochǎng shang pǎo. Kàn zhe kàn zhe, wǒ jiù xiǎng dào wǒ zìjǐ de xuésheng.","m":"Last time you asked where my seat is. Second floor, by the window. These days the trees outside are bare, so I can see the primary school opposite, kids running around the playground. Watching them, I think of my own students.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢坐在哪儿？靠窗还是靠里面？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan zuò zài nǎr? Kào chuāng háishi kào lǐmiàn?","m":"Where do you like to sit — by the window or further in?"},"replies":[{"t":"靠窗，可以看外面。","p":"Kào chuāng, kěyǐ kàn wàimiàn.","m":"By the window — I can look out.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"靠里面，比较安静。","p":"Kào lǐmiàn, bǐjiào ānjìng.","m":"Further in — quieter.","r":{"t":"也好，不会分心。","p":"Yě hǎo, bú huì fēnxīn.","m":"Good too — fewer distractions."}}],"next":{"t":"今天窗外下雨了，坐在老位子上听雨。","p":"Jīntiān chuāng wài xià yǔ le, zuò zài lǎo wèizi shang tīng yǔ.","m":"Rain outside the window today — listened to it from my usual seat."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在那儿看什么书？","p":"Nǐ zài nàr kàn shénme shū?","m":"What do you read there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在图书馆看什么书（一本中文小说，看得慢，可是很有意思）","en":"You asked what he reads there (a Chinese novel — slow going, but fun)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在看什么书。那本中文小说，我看到第五十页了！一个星期才看二十页，可是这两天我看懂了一个笑话，在图书馆里笑出了声。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài kàn shénme shū. Nà běn Zhōngwén xiǎoshuō, wǒ kàn dào dì wǔshí yè le! Yí gè xīngqī cái kàn èrshí yè, kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ kàn dǒng le yí gè xiàohua, zài túshūguǎn lǐ xiào chū le shēng.","m":"Last time you asked what I'm reading. That Chinese novel — I'm on page fifty! Only twenty pages a week, but these days I understood a joke in it and laughed out loud in the library.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看过外语写的书吗？","p":"Nǐ kànguo wàiyǔ xiě de shū ma?","m":"Have you read a book in a foreign language?"},"replies":[{"t":"看过，很慢，可是很有意思。","p":"Kànguo, hěn màn, kěshì hěn yǒu yìsi.","m":"Yes — slow, but fun.","r":{"t":"对对对，慢慢看，才有味道。","p":"Duì duì duì, mànmàn kàn, cái yǒu wèidao.","m":"Yes yes yes — slow is where the flavour is."}},{"t":"还没有，想试试。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, xiǎng shìshi.","m":"Not yet — I'd like to try.","r":{"t":"先从短的开始，一天一页就行。","p":"Xiān cóng duǎn de kāishǐ, yì tiān yí yè jiù xíng.","m":"Start with something short — a page a day is enough."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了五页，还是很慢，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le wǔ yè, háishi hěn màn, hāha.","m":"Read five more pages today — still slow, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"这两天一个学生的妈妈给我发了一封中文邮件，问孩子的科学作业。","p":"Zhè liǎng tiān yí gè xuésheng de māma gěi wǒ fā le yì fēng Zhōngwén yóujiàn, wèn háizi de kēxué zuòyè.","m":"These days a student's mum emailed me in Chinese about her kid's science homework."},{"t":"我会说不会写。回这封信，我写了一个小时，用手机一个字一个字地查。","p":"Wǒ huì shuō bú huì xiě. Huí zhè fēng xìn, wǒ xiě le yí gè xiǎoshí, yòng shǒujī yí gè zì yí gè zì de chá.","m":"I can speak but barely write. Replying took me an hour, checking every character on my phone."},{"t":"她回我：「谢谢老师，您的中文很清楚。」这句话我存下来了。","p":"Tā huí wǒ: “Xièxie lǎoshī, nín de Zhōngwén hěn qīngchu.” Zhè jù huà wǒ cún xiàlái le.","m":"She replied: “Thank you, teacher — your Chinese is very clear.” I've saved that line."}],"replies":[{"t":"一个小时也值！","p":"Yí gè xiǎoshí yě zhí!","m":"Worth the hour!","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"写中文真的很难。","p":"Xiě Zhōngwén zhēnde hěn nán.","m":"Writing Chinese really is hard.","r":{"t":"是啊，可是一封一封写，就会好起来。","p":"Shì a, kěshì yì fēng yì fēng xiě, jiù huì hǎo qǐlái.","m":"It is — but one email at a time, it gets better."}}],"from":"2026-12-05"}},"2026-12-03|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-03","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也有一个常去的地方，老板都认识我。","p":"Wǒ yě yǒu yí gè cháng qù de dìfang, lǎobǎn dōu rènshi wǒ.","m":"I've got a regular spot too — the owner knows me."},"mem":{"zh":"你也有一个常去的地方，老板都认识你","en":"You have a regular spot where the owner knows you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也有一个常去的地方，老板都认识你。这两天卖葱油饼的阿伯问我：「最近怎么少来了？」我说要准备期末考，他多送了我一个，说是「考试加油饼」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yǒu yí gè cháng qù de dìfang, lǎobǎn dōu rènshi nǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān mài cōngyóubǐng de ābó wèn wǒ: “Zuìjìn zěnme shǎo lái le?” Wǒ shuō yào zhǔnbèi qīmòkǎo, tā duō sòng le wǒ yí gè, shuō shì “kǎoshì jiāyóu bǐng”.","m":"You said you have a regular spot where the owner knows you too. These days the scallion pancake uncle asked me: “Why haven't I seen you much?” I said I'm studying for finals, so he gave me an extra one — an “exam good-luck pancake”.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你常去的那个地方，是什么店？","p":"Nǐ cháng qù de nà gè dìfang, shì shénme diàn?","m":"What kind of place is your regular spot?"},"replies":[{"t":"一家咖啡店。","p":"Yì jiā kāfēi diàn.","m":"A café.","r":{"t":"咖啡店好，可以坐很久。","p":"Kāfēi diàn hǎo, kěyǐ zuò hěn jiǔ.","m":"A café's nice — you can sit for ages."}},{"t":"一个小吃摊。","p":"Yí gè xiǎochī tān.","m":"A street-food stall.","r":{"t":"小吃摊最有人情味了！","p":"Xiǎochī tān zuì yǒu rénqíngwèi le!","m":"Food stalls have the most heart!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去了夜市，阿伯跟我挥手。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù le yèshì, ābó gēn wǒ huī shǒu.","m":"Went to the night market again today — the uncle waved at me."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家附近没有夜市。","p":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn méiyǒu yèshì.","m":"There's no night market near me."},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近没有夜市","en":"There's no night market near you"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家附近没有夜市。这两天我帮你想好了路线：先吃葱油饼，再喝一杯热的姜茶，最后吃一碗豆花。你来台北的话，就照这个走！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā fùjìn méiyǒu yèshì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bāng nǐ xiǎng hǎo le lùxiàn: xiān chī cōngyóubǐng, zài hē yì bēi rè de jiāng chá, zuìhòu chī yì wǎn dòuhuā. Nǐ lái Táiběi de huà, jiù zhào zhège zǒu!","m":"You said there's no night market near you. These days I planned a route for you: scallion pancake first, then a hot ginger tea, and a bowl of douhua to finish. If you come to Taipei, follow this!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边晚上大家都去哪里？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān wǎnshang dàjiā dōu qù nǎlǐ?","m":"Where do people go in the evenings where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"去酒吧或者餐厅。","p":"Qù jiǔbā huòzhě cāntīng.","m":"Bars or restaurants.","r":{"t":"那也很热闹！","p":"Nà yě hěn rènao!","m":"That's lively too!"}},{"t":"一般都在家。","p":"Yìbān dōu zài jiā.","m":"Mostly at home.","r":{"t":"在家也舒服，那更要来逛一次夜市了！","p":"Zài jiā yě shūfu, nà gèng yào lái guàng yí cì yèshì le!","m":"Home is cosy — all the more reason to try a night market once!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天逛夜市，又帮你多想了一样要吃的。","p":"Jīntiān guàng yèshì, yòu bāng nǐ duō xiǎng le yí yàng yào chī de.","m":"At the night market today I added another thing to your must-eat list."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最常买哪一摊？","p":"Nǐ zuì cháng mǎi nǎ yì tān?","m":"Which stall do you go to most?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她最常买哪一摊（卖葱油饼的阿伯，会多加一个蛋）","en":"You asked her favourite stall (the scallion pancake uncle — he adds an extra egg)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最常买哪一摊。卖葱油饼的阿伯！这两天我问他做了多久，他说三十年了。他一边跟我说话，手还在擀饼，一下都没停。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuì cháng mǎi nǎ yì tān. Mài cōngyóubǐng de ābó! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn tā zuò le duō jiǔ, tā shuō sānshí nián le. Tā yìbiān gēn wǒ shuōhuà, shǒu hái zài gǎn bǐng, yí xià dōu méi tíng.","m":"Last time you asked which stall I go to most. The scallion pancake uncle! These days I asked how long he's been doing it — thirty years. While he was talking, his hands kept rolling dough without a single pause.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有没有那种做了很多年同一件事的人？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu méiyǒu nà zhǒng zuò le hěn duō nián tóng yí jiàn shì de rén?","m":"Do you know someone who's done the same thing for many years?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我家附近的修鞋师傅。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ jiā fùjìn de xiū xié shīfu.","m":"Yes — the shoe repairer near me.","r":{"t":"这种人好厉害，一件事做到最好。","p":"Zhè zhǒng rén hǎo lìhai, yí jiàn shì zuò dào zuì hǎo.","m":"People like that are amazing — doing one thing as well as it can be done."}},{"t":"我爸妈，他们一直做同一个工作。","p":"Wǒ bà mā, tāmen yìzhí zuò tóng yí gè gōngzuò.","m":"My parents — same job all along.","r":{"t":"好了不起，一做就是很多年。","p":"Hǎo liǎobuqǐ, yí zuò jiù shì hěn duō nián.","m":"That's impressive — so many years."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又吃了阿伯的葱油饼，还是加一个蛋。","p":"Jīntiān yòu chī le ābó de cōngyóubǐng, háishi jiā yí gè dàn.","m":"Had the uncle's scallion pancake again today — extra egg, as always."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一个星期去几次？","p":"Nǐ yí gè xīngqī qù jǐ cì?","m":"How many times a week do you go?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一个星期去几次夜市（至少三次，考试的时候更多）","en":"You asked how often she goes to the night market (three times a week at least — more at exam time)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一个星期去几次夜市。至少三次。这两天开始准备期末考，我改成带着书去，一边排队一边背单词，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yí gè xīngqī qù jǐ cì yèshì. Zhìshǎo sān cì. Zhè liǎng tiān kāishǐ zhǔnbèi qīmòkǎo, wǒ gǎi chéng dài zhe shū qù, yìbiān páiduì yìbiān bèi dāncí, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how often I go to the night market. At least three times a week. These days I've started revising for finals, so now I take a book and learn vocab while I queue, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会在奇怪的地方学习吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zài qíguài de dìfang xuéxí ma?","m":"Do you ever study in odd places?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我在车上学。","p":"Huì, wǒ zài chē shang xué.","m":"Yes — on the bus.","r":{"t":"车上最好用了！我也是。","p":"Chē shang zuì hǎo yòng le! Wǒ yě shì.","m":"The bus is perfect! Me too."}},{"t":"不会，我一定要在安静的地方。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ yídìng yào zài ānjìng de dìfang.","m":"No — I need somewhere quiet.","r":{"t":"那你一定很专心，不像我。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn zhuānxīn, bú xiàng wǒ.","m":"Then you must be really focused — not like me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天排队买葱油饼的时候，背了五个单词。","p":"Jīntiān páiduì mǎi cōngyóubǐng de shíhou, bèi le wǔ gè dāncí.","m":"Learned five words queuing for a scallion pancake today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-03|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-03","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也常去公园。","p":"Wǒ yě cháng qù gōngyuán.","m":"I go to the park a lot too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也常去公园","en":"You often go to the park too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也常去公园！这两天我在公园碰到一个跑步的爷爷，他听到我说中文，停下来问我在说什么语言。我说中文，他说：「¡Qué chévere!」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě cháng qù gōngyuán! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài gōngyuán pèng dào yí gè pǎobù de yéye, tā tīng dào wǒ shuō Zhōngwén, tíng xiàlái wèn wǒ zài shuō shénme yǔyán. Wǒ shuō Zhōngwén, tā shuō: “¡Qué chévere!”","m":"You said you often go to the park too! These days I met an old man jogging there — he heard me speaking Chinese and stopped to ask what language it was. I said Chinese, and he said: “¡Qué chévere!” — how cool!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在公园一般做什么？","p":"Nǐ zài gōngyuán yìbān zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do in the park?"},"replies":[{"t":"散步。","p":"Sànbù.","m":"Walk.","r":{"t":"散步最好了，脑子会变清楚。","p":"Sànbù zuì hǎo le, nǎozi huì biàn qīngchu.","m":"Walking's the best — it clears your head."}},{"t":"跑步。","p":"Pǎobù.","m":"Run.","r":{"t":"你好厉害！我跑五分钟就累了。","p":"Nǐ hǎo lìhai! Wǒ pǎo wǔ fēnzhōng jiù lèi le.","m":"Impressive! I'm tired after five minutes."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在公园又看到那个跑步的爷爷。","p":"Jīntiān zài gōngyuán yòu kàn dào nà gè pǎobù de yéye.","m":"Saw the jogging grandpa in the park again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我在家练中文，不出门。","p":"Wǒ zài jiā liàn Zhōngwén, bù chūmén.","m":"I practise Chinese at home — I don't go out."},"mem":{"zh":"你在家练中文，不出门","en":"You practise Chinese at home"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在家练中文。这两天下雨，我也在家练了。我在厨房练声调，外婆在旁边跟着说「你好」，她现在说得越来越像了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài jiā liàn Zhōngwén. Zhè liǎng tiān xià yǔ, wǒ yě zài jiā liàn le. Wǒ zài chúfáng liàn shēngdiào, wàipó zài pángbiān gēn zhe shuō “nǐ hǎo”, tā xiànzài shuō de yuè lái yuè xiàng le.","m":"You said you practise Chinese at home. It's been raining these days, so I practised at home too. I did tones in the kitchen while Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us) repeated 你好 next to me — she sounds better and better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在家练的时候，家里人会听到吗？","p":"Nǐ zài jiā liàn de shíhou, jiā lǐ rén huì tīng dào ma?","m":"When you practise at home, does your family hear?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，他们觉得很好玩。","p":"Huì, tāmen juéde hěn hǎowán.","m":"Yes — they think it's fun.","r":{"t":"我外婆也是！她还跟着学。","p":"Wǒ wàipó yě shì! Tā hái gēn zhe xué.","m":"Abuela too! She even joins in."}},{"t":"不会，我很小声。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ hěn xiǎoshēng.","m":"No — I'm very quiet.","r":{"t":"那你下次大声一点，说出来才记得住！","p":"Nà nǐ xià cì dàshēng yìdiǎn, shuō chūlái cái jì de zhù!","m":"Try louder next time — saying it is how it sticks!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天在厨房练声调，外婆又跟着说了。","p":"Jīntiān zài chúfáng liàn shēngdiào, wàipó yòu gēn zhe shuō le.","m":"Practised tones in the kitchen today — Abuela joined in again."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在公园怎么练？","p":"Nǐ zài gōngyuán zěnme liàn?","m":"How do you practise in the park?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在公园怎么练（对着树大声说，没人听得懂，不害羞）","en":"You asked how she practises in the park (out loud to the trees — nobody understands, so she's not shy)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在公园怎么练。我对着树说！这两天有一棵树我最喜欢，我给它起了个中文名字：「老师」。每天我都跟它说：「老师好！」哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài gōngyuán zěnme liàn. Wǒ duì zhe shù shuō! Zhè liǎng tiān yǒu yì kē shù wǒ zuì xǐhuan, wǒ gěi tā qǐ le gè Zhōngwén míngzi: “Lǎoshī”. Měi tiān wǒ dōu gēn tā shuō: “Lǎoshī hǎo!” Hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how I practise in the park. I talk to the trees! These days there's one tree I like best — I've given it a Chinese name: 老师, 'Teacher'. Every day I tell it: “Good morning, Teacher!” Haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你练外语的时候，有没有自己的小办法？","p":"Nǐ liàn wàiyǔ de shíhou, yǒu méiyǒu zìjǐ de xiǎo bànfǎ?","m":"Do you have your own little tricks for practising a language?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我对着镜子说。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ duì zhe jìngzi shuō.","m":"Yes — I talk to the mirror.","r":{"t":"好办法！镜子不会笑你。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ! Jìngzi bú huì xiào nǐ.","m":"Good one! The mirror won't laugh at you."}},{"t":"没有，我就是多听。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ jiù shì duō tīng.","m":"No — I just listen a lot.","r":{"t":"多听也很好！我也要多听。","p":"Duō tīng yě hěn hǎo! Wǒ yě yào duō tīng.","m":"Listening a lot is great! I should too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又跟「老师」说了「老师好」，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu gēn “Lǎoshī” shuō le “lǎoshī hǎo”, hāha.","m":"Said good morning to my tree 'Teacher' again today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"公园里人多吗？","p":"Gōngyuán li rén duō ma?","m":"Is the park busy?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过公园里人多不多（早上不多，有几个老人在跑步）","en":"You asked if the park's busy (not in the morning — a few older people jogging)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问公园里人多不多。早上不多。这两天我去得更早，七点就到了，只有我和几只鸽子。我跟鸽子说中文，它们都飞走了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn gōngyuán lǐ rén duō bu duō. Zǎoshang bù duō. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù de gèng zǎo, qī diǎn jiù dào le, zhǐ yǒu wǒ hé jǐ zhī gēzi. Wǒ gēn gēzi shuō Zhōngwén, tāmen dōu fēi zǒu le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if the park's busy. Not in the mornings. These days I went even earlier — seven o'clock, just me and a few pigeons. I spoke Chinese to the pigeons and they all flew away, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢早上出门还是晚上出门？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan zǎoshang chūmén háishi wǎnshang chūmén?","m":"Do you prefer going out in the morning or evening?"},"replies":[{"t":"早上，空气好。","p":"Zǎoshang, kōngqì hǎo.","m":"Morning — the air's fresh.","r":{"t":"对！早上的公园最舒服。","p":"Duì! Zǎoshang de gōngyuán zuì shūfu.","m":"Yes! The park's nicest in the morning."}},{"t":"晚上，我早上起不来。","p":"Wǎnshang, wǒ zǎoshang qǐ bu lái.","m":"Evening — I can't get up.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我也常常起不来。","p":"Hāha, wǒ yě chángcháng qǐ bu lái.","m":"Haha, I often can't either."}}],"next":{"t":"今天七点又去公园了，鸽子还在。","p":"Jīntiān qī diǎn yòu qù gōngyuán le, gēzi hái zài.","m":"Back at the park at seven today — the pigeons were still there."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：我报名了 HSK！是我第一次考中文。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: wǒ bàomíng le HSK! Shì wǒ dì yī cì kǎo Zhōngwén.","m":"Guess what: I've signed up for the HSK! My first ever Chinese exam."},{"t":"外婆听说了，每天早上都考我：「『你好』怎么说？」我说「你好」，她说：「对！一百分！」","p":"Wàipó tīngshuō le, měi tiān zǎoshang dōu kǎo wǒ: “‘Nǐ hǎo’ zěnme shuō?” Wǒ shuō “nǐ hǎo”, tā shuō: “Duì! Yìbǎi fēn!”","m":"When Abuela heard, she started testing me every morning: “How do you say hello?” I say 你好, and she says: “Correct! A hundred points!”"},{"t":"等一下等一下……HSK 应该比外婆的考试难一点，哈哈。","p":"Děng yíxià děng yíxià …… HSK yīnggāi bǐ wàipó de kǎoshì nán yìdiǎn, hāha.","m":"Wait, wait… the HSK is probably a bit harder than Abuela's test, haha."}],"replies":[{"t":"加油！你一定行。","p":"Jiāyóu! Nǐ yídìng xíng.","m":"Good luck! You've got this.","r":{"t":"谢谢！我会好好准备的。","p":"Xièxie! Wǒ huì hǎohǎo zhǔnbèi de.","m":"Thanks! I'll prepare properly."}},{"t":"外婆的考试好可爱！","p":"Wàipó de kǎoshì hǎo kě'ài!","m":"Abuela's test is adorable!","r":{"t":"对吧！她说她是我的第一个老师。","p":"Duì ba! Tā shuō tā shì wǒ de dì yī gè lǎoshī.","m":"Right? She says she's my first teacher."}}],"from":"2026-12-05"}},"2026-12-03|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-03","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I do homework at the laundromat too!","p":"","m":"我也在自助洗衣店写作业！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也在洗衣房写作业","en":"You do homework at the laundromat too"},"later":{"t":"You said you do homework at the laundromat too! This week a woman next to me was studying for a nursing exam. We quizzed each other while our clothes dried. Best study group ever.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也在洗衣房写作业！这周我旁边一位女士在准备护士考试。等衣服烘干的时候，我们互相考对方。最好的学习小组。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you study best?","p":"","m":"你在哪儿学习最好？"},"replies":[{"t":"Somewhere a bit noisy.","p":"","m":"有点吵的地方。","r":{"t":"Same. Silence makes me sleepy.","p":"","m":"一样。太安静我就想睡。"}},{"t":"Somewhere really quiet.","p":"","m":"特别安静的地方。","r":{"t":"Then the laundromat's not for you, haha.","p":"","m":"那洗衣房不适合你，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Laundry and homework again today. Good combo.","p":"","m":"今天又是洗衣服加写作业。好搭配。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I have a washing machine at home.","p":"","m":"我家有洗衣机。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家里有洗衣机","en":"You have a washing machine at home"},"later":{"t":"You said you have a washing machine at home. Lucky! This week the laundromat was so full I waited forty minutes for a dryer. I finished all my homework, though. So maybe I'm lucky too.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家里有洗衣机。真幸运！这周洗衣房人太多，我等了四十分钟才等到烘干机。不过作业全写完了。所以也许我也挺幸运。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Which chore do you mind least?","p":"","m":"你最不讨厌哪件家务？"},"replies":[{"t":"Laundry.","p":"","m":"洗衣服。","r":{"t":"Me too, if there's a free machine.","p":"","m":"我也是，要是有空的机器。"}},{"t":"Cooking.","p":"","m":"做饭。","r":{"t":"Nice. Cooking's a chore you can eat.","p":"","m":"不错。做饭是能吃的家务。"}}],"next":{"t":"Waited for a dryer again today. Homework's done, at least.","p":"","m":"今天又在等烘干机。至少作业写完了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What homework do you have?","p":"","m":"你有什么作业？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他写什么作业（英语课，大多是写作）","en":"You asked what homework he has (English class — mostly writing)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what homework I have. English writing. This week the topic was 'A place I love.' I wrote about the laundromat. My teacher wrote: 'Unexpected, but beautiful.'","p":"","m":"你上次问我写什么作业。英语写作。这周的题目是「一个我爱的地方」。我写了洗衣房。老师批了一句：「出人意料，但很美。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"If you wrote about a place you love, where would it be?","p":"","m":"要是写一个你爱的地方，你会写哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"My hometown.","p":"","m":"我的家乡。","r":{"t":"Beautiful choice.","p":"","m":"很美的选择。"}},{"t":"A little café.","p":"","m":"一家小咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Nice. A café is a laundromat with coffee.","p":"","m":"不错。咖啡馆就是有咖啡的洗衣房。"}}],"next":{"t":"Got my essay back. Still smiling.","p":"","m":"作文发回来了。还在笑。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long do you stay there?","p":"","m":"你在那儿待多久？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在那儿待多久（一个半小时，洗加烘）","en":"You asked how long he stays (an hour and a half — wash and dry)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long I stay. An hour and a half. This week I stayed two — a little kid next to me wanted to practise reading his English book out loud. I listened. He was better than me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我在那儿待多久。一个半小时。这周我待了两个小时——旁边一个小孩想大声练读他的英语书。我就听着。他念得比我好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever learned something from a kid?","p":"","m":"你有没有从小孩那儿学到过东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, kids are great teachers.","p":"","m":"有，小孩是很好的老师。","r":{"t":"They are. No fear at all.","p":"","m":"是的。一点都不怕。"}},{"t":"Not that I remember.","p":"","m":"想不起来。","r":{"t":"Next time, listen. They're very honest.","p":"","m":"下次听听。他们很诚实。"}}],"next":{"t":"That kid was at the laundromat again. Reading louder.","p":"","m":"那个小孩今天又在洗衣房。念得更大声了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-03|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-03","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My barber's like that too!","p":"","m":"我的理发店也是这样！"},"mem":{"zh":"你的理发店也是这样","en":"Your barber's is like that too"},"later":{"t":"You said your barber's is like that too. This week someone brought a speaker and we had a little dance contest in the barbershop. My barber won. With scissors in his hand.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那家理发店也是这样。这周有人带了个音箱，我们在理发店里搞了个小小的跳舞比赛。理发师赢了。手里还拿着剪刀。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do people meet up and chat where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边大家一般在哪儿聚着聊天？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cafés.","p":"","m":"咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Nice. Barbershops are our cafés.","p":"","m":"不错。理发店就是我们的咖啡馆。"}},{"t":"Online, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多在网上。","r":{"t":"Fair. But come to Accra — we talk face to face.","p":"","m":"也是。不过来阿克拉吧——我们当面聊。"}}],"next":{"t":"Barbershop was loud again today. Good loud.","p":"","m":"今天理发店又很吵。好的那种吵。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have a spot like that.","p":"","m":"我没有那样的地方。"},"mem":{"zh":"你没有那样一个去处","en":"You don't have a spot like that"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't have a spot like that. This week I thought about it: for some people it's a café, for some a park bench. For me it's a barber's chair. I hope you find yours.","p":"","m":"你上次说你没有那样一个去处。这周我想了想：有人是咖啡馆，有人是公园的长椅。我的是理发店的椅子。希望你也找到你的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"If you could have one place to just hang out, what would it be?","p":"","m":"要是能有一个随便待着的地方，你想要什么样的？"},"replies":[{"t":"A quiet café.","p":"","m":"一家安静的咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Good choice. Find one with a nice owner.","p":"","m":"好选择。找一家老板人好的。"}},{"t":"A park bench.","p":"","m":"公园的长椅。","r":{"t":"Simple and free. I like it.","p":"","m":"简单又免费。我喜欢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Saved you a seat at the barber's, haha.","p":"","m":"在理发店给你留了个位子，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you talk about?","p":"","m":"你们聊什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们聊什么（足球、音乐，还有谁要结婚了）","en":"You asked what they talk about (football, music and who's getting married)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we talk about. This week: who's getting married. Big news — my barber himself! In January. Everyone's already arguing about the music. They want me to do it.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们聊什么。这周聊的是：谁要结婚了。大新闻——理发师自己！一月份。大家已经在为音乐吵起来了。他们想让我来做。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you been to a wedding recently?","p":"","m":"你最近参加过婚礼吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it was fun.","p":"","m":"参加过，很好玩。","r":{"t":"Weddings here last all day. Bring dancing shoes!","p":"","m":"我们这儿的婚礼要办一整天。带上跳舞的鞋！"}},{"t":"Not for a long time.","p":"","m":"好久没去了。","r":{"t":"Then you need an Accra wedding, chale.","p":"","m":"那你需要来一场阿克拉的婚礼，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Started a playlist for my barber's wedding.","p":"","m":"开始给理发师的婚礼做歌单了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long do you stay?","p":"","m":"你待多久？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在那儿待多久（有时候好几个小时）","en":"You asked how long he stays (hours, sometimes)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long I stay. This week, three hours. I went in for a quick trim and came out with a cut, two new jokes and a job — music for a cousin's party.","p":"","m":"你上次问我在那儿待多久。这周，三个小时。我进去只想修一下，出来的时候带着新发型、两个新笑话，还有一份活儿——给别人表亲的派对做音乐。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever gone somewhere for one thing and come back with something else?","p":"","m":"你有没有去一个地方办一件事，结果带回来别的东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"有，经常。","r":{"t":"That's the best kind of day.","p":"","m":"那是最好的一天。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Try a barbershop in Accra. Guaranteed.","p":"","m":"试试阿克拉的理发店。保证会。"}}],"next":{"t":"Working on that party music today.","p":"","m":"今天在弄那个派对的音乐。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Chale, this week my lecturer played my song in class — as an example of a good bassline.","p":"","m":"兄弟，这周我们老师在课上放了我的歌——当作好低音线的例子。"},{"t":"Nobody knew it was mine until she said my name. Then the whole room turned around.","p":"","m":"她说出我的名字之前，谁都不知道是我的。然后全教室的人都转过头来。"},{"t":"I wanted to hide under the desk. I also wanted to dance.","p":"","m":"我又想钻到桌子底下，又想跳舞。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Congrats! That's a big moment.","p":"","m":"恭喜！这是个大时刻。","r":{"t":"Thanks, chale. My mum made me tell the story three times.","p":"","m":"谢谢，兄弟。我妈让我讲了三遍。"}},{"t":"Hide or dance — which did you do?","p":"","m":"钻桌子还是跳舞——你选了哪个？","r":{"t":"A little nod. Very cool. Inside, I was dancing.","p":"","m":"点了个头。很酷。心里在跳舞。"}}],"from":"2026-12-05"}},"2026-12-04|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-04","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边商场里也有圣诞树了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān shāngchǎng li yě yǒu Shèngdànshù le.","m":"The malls here have Christmas trees up too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边商场里也有圣诞树了","en":"Your mall has a Christmas tree up too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边商场里也有圣诞树了。这两天我们学校门口也摆了一棵，上面挂的不是礼物，是大家写的愿望卡。我也写了一张。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shāngchǎng lǐ yě yǒu Shèngdàn shù le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen xuéxiào ménkǒu yě bǎi le yì kē, shàngmiàn guà de bú shì lǐwù, shì dàjiā xiě de yuànwàng kǎ. Wǒ yě xiě le yì zhāng.","m":"You said your mall has a Christmas tree too. These days there's one outside our school as well — hung with wish cards everyone wrote, not presents. I wrote one too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是写一张愿望卡，你会写什么？","p":"Yàoshi xiě yì zhāng yuànwàng kǎ, nǐ huì xiě shénme?","m":"If you wrote a wish card, what would you put?"},"replies":[{"t":"希望家人都健康。","p":"Xīwàng jiārén dōu jiànkāng.","m":"That my family stays healthy.","r":{"t":"这个最重要，我也写了差不多的。","p":"Zhège zuì zhòngyào, wǒ yě xiě le chàbuduō de.","m":"That matters most — I wrote something similar."}},{"t":"希望明年能去旅行。","p":"Xīwàng míngnián néng qù lǚxíng.","m":"To travel next year.","r":{"t":"好棒！我希望你来台湾。","p":"Hǎo bàng! Wǒ xīwàng nǐ lái Táiwān.","m":"Love it! I hope you come to Taiwan."}}],"next":{"t":"今天经过学校的圣诞树，又看了看我的愿望卡。","p":"Jīntiān jīngguò xuéxiào de Shèngdàn shù, yòu kàn le kàn wǒ de yuànwàng kǎ.","m":"Walked past the school's tree today and checked on my wish card."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边什么都还没有。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān shénme dōu hái méiyǒu.","m":"Nothing's up here yet."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边什么都还没有","en":"Nothing's up yet where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边什么都还没有。现在已经十二月了，台北连捷运站里都开始放圣诞歌了，我每天都听到同一首。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shénme dōu hái méiyǒu. Xiànzài yǐjīng shí'èr yuè le, Táiběi lián jiéyùn zhàn lǐ dōu kāishǐ fàng Shèngdàn gē le, wǒ měi tiān dōu tīng dào tóng yì shǒu.","m":"You said nothing was up yet where you are. It's December now — even Taipei's MRT stations are playing Christmas songs. I hear the same one every day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边十二月有什么特别的吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān shí'èr yuè yǒu shénme tèbié de ma?","m":"Is there anything special about December where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"街上开始挂灯了。","p":"Jiē shang kāishǐ guà dēng le.","m":"The street lights are going up.","r":{"t":"好想看！","p":"Hǎo xiǎng kàn!","m":"I'd love to see!"}},{"t":"没什么，跟平常一样。","p":"Méi shénme, gēn píngcháng yíyàng.","m":"Not really — same as usual.","r":{"t":"那也很好，安安静静过冬天。","p":"Nà yě hěn hǎo, ān'ānjìngjìng guò dōngtiān.","m":"That's nice too — a quiet winter."}}],"next":{"t":"今天捷运站里又在放那首圣诞歌了。","p":"Jīntiān jiéyùn zhàn lǐ yòu zài fàng nà shǒu Shèngdàn gē le.","m":"That Christmas song was playing in the MRT station again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"台湾的人过圣诞节吗？","p":"Táiwān de rén guò Shèngdàn Jié ma?","m":"Do people in Taiwan celebrate Christmas?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过台湾的人过不过圣诞节（不放假，年轻人吃饭、交换礼物）","en":"You asked if people in Taiwan celebrate Christmas (no day off, but young people eat out and swap presents)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问台湾的人过不过圣诞节。这两天我们班已经在抽交换礼物了，规定一百五十块以内。我抽到一个男生，完全不知道要送什么。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Táiwān de rén guò bu guò Shèngdàn Jié. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen bān yǐjīng zài chōu jiāohuàn lǐwù le, guīdìng yìbǎi wǔshí kuài yǐnèi. Wǒ chōu dào yí gè nánshēng, wánquán bù zhīdào yào sòng shénme.","m":"Last time you asked if people in Taiwan celebrate Christmas. These days our class drew names for a gift swap — NT$150 limit. I drew a boy and have no idea what to get him.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你送过最好的一个礼物是什么？","p":"Nǐ sòngguo zuì hǎo de yí gè lǐwù shì shénme?","m":"What's the best present you've ever given?"},"replies":[{"t":"一本书。","p":"Yì běn shū.","m":"A book.","r":{"t":"书好！我也想送书。","p":"Shū hǎo! Wǒ yě xiǎng sòng shū.","m":"Books are great! Maybe I'll give one too."}},{"t":"自己做的东西。","p":"Zìjǐ zuò de dōngxi.","m":"Something I made.","r":{"t":"自己做的最有心意。","p":"Zìjǐ zuò de zuì yǒu xīnyì.","m":"Home-made means the most."}}],"next":{"t":"还在想交换礼物要送什么……","p":"Hái zài xiǎng jiāohuàn lǐwù yào sòng shénme ……","m":"Still thinking about what to get for the gift swap…"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会去拍照吗？","p":"Nǐ huì qù pāizhào ma?","m":"Will you go and take photos?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她会不会去拍照（会，每年都跟同学在圣诞树前合影）","en":"You asked if she'd go for photos (yes — every year in front of the tree with classmates)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会去圣诞树前面合影。会！这两天我们去了，排了二十分钟，轮到我们的时候，大家都眨眼睛，只好重来，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì qù Shèngdàn shù qiánmiàn héyǐng. Huì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen qù le, pái le èrshí fēnzhōng, lún dào wǒmen de shíhou, dàjiā dōu zhǎ yǎnjing, zhǐ hǎo chóng lái, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd get a group shot in front of the tree. Yes! These days we went — queued twenty minutes, and when it was our turn everyone blinked, so we had to do it again, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢拍别人，还是被拍？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan pāi biérén, háishi bèi pāi?","m":"Do you prefer taking photos or being in them?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢拍别人。","p":"Xǐhuan pāi biérén.","m":"Taking them.","r":{"t":"那你一定很会拍！","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn huì pāi!","m":"Then you must be good at it!"}},{"t":"都不太喜欢。","p":"Dōu bú tài xǐhuan.","m":"Neither, really.","r":{"t":"我懂，我在镜头前面也会紧张。","p":"Wǒ dǒng, wǒ zài jìngtóu qiánmiàn yě huì jǐnzhāng.","m":"I get it — I get nervous in front of the camera too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又路过那棵圣诞树，人还是好多。","p":"Jīntiān yòu lùguò nà kē Shèngdàn shù, rén háishi hǎo duō.","m":"Passed that Christmas tree again today — still packed."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-04|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-04","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是商场里才有灯。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì shāngchǎng li cái yǒu dēng.","m":"Here too, only the malls have lights."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是商场里才有灯","en":"Where you are, it's only the malls with lights too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是商场里才有灯。周末我路过商场，门口又多了一棵大圣诞树，好多人排队拍照。我站在旁边看了一会儿，没挤进去。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì shāngchǎng lǐ cái yǒu dēng. Zhōumò wǒ lùguò shāngchǎng, ménkǒu yòu duō le yì kē dà Shèngdàn shù, hǎo duō rén páiduì pāizhào. Wǒ zhàn zài pángbiān kàn le yíhuìr, méi jǐ jìnqù.","m":"You said it's only the malls with lights where you are too. At the weekend I walked past the mall — there's a big Christmas tree outside now, and loads of people queuing for photos. I watched for a bit but didn't squeeze in.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢在热闹的地方拍照吗？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan zài rènao de dìfang pāizhào ma?","m":"Do you like taking photos in busy spots?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢，人多才有气氛。","p":"Xǐhuan, rén duō cái yǒu qìfēn.","m":"Yes — crowds make the atmosphere.","r":{"t":"也是，过节就要热热闹闹的。","p":"Yě shì, guòjié jiù yào rèrènāonāo de.","m":"True — holidays should be lively."}},{"t":"不喜欢，我喜欢人少的地方。","p":"Bù xǐhuan, wǒ xǐhuan rén shǎo de dìfang.","m":"No — I like quiet spots.","r":{"t":"跟我一样，我宁可回胡同里。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng, wǒ nìngkě huí hútòng lǐ.","m":"Same as me — I'd rather go back to the hutong."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又路过商场，灯还亮着。","p":"Jīntiān yòu lùguò shāngchǎng, dēng hái liàng zhe.","m":"Walked past the mall again today — lights still on."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边整条街都挂满了灯。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān zhěng tiáo jiē dōu guà mǎn le dēng.","m":"My whole street is covered in lights."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边整条街都挂满了灯","en":"Where you are, the whole street is covered in lights"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边整条街都挂满了灯，我真想看看。这两天我跟学生说起这事儿，一个瑞典学生说，他们那儿每家窗户都挂一颗星星灯。我听了，也想在窗口挂一个。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān zhěng tiáo jiē dōu guà mǎn le dēng, wǒ zhēn xiǎng kànkan. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn xuésheng shuō qǐ zhè shìr, yí gè Ruìdiǎn xuésheng shuō, tāmen nàr měi jiā chuānghu dōu guà yì kē xīngxing dēng. Wǒ tīng le, yě xiǎng zài chuāngkǒu guà yí gè.","m":"You said your whole street is covered in lights — I'd love to see it. These days I mentioned it in class, and a Swedish student said back home every window has a star lamp. Now I want to hang one in my window too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里过节会布置吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ guòjié huì bùzhì ma?","m":"Does your family decorate for the holidays?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我们会挂灯。","p":"Huì, wǒmen huì guà dēng.","m":"Yes — we put up lights.","r":{"t":"真好，家里一亮，心情就好了。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, jiā lǐ yí liàng, xīnqíng jiù hǎo le.","m":"Lovely — when the home lights up, so does your mood."}},{"t":"不太布置。","p":"Bú tài bùzhì.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"我家也是，过年才贴个福字。","p":"Wǒ jiā yě shì, guònián cái tiē gè fú zì.","m":"Mine neither — just a 福 character at New Year."}}],"next":{"t":"我还在想你那条挂满灯的街。","p":"Wǒ hái zài xiǎng nǐ nà tiáo guà mǎn dēng de jiē.","m":"Still thinking about your street full of lights."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"胡同里过年会挂灯吗？","p":"Hútòng li guònián huì guà dēng ma?","m":"Do they put lights up in the hutong for New Year?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过胡同里过年会不会挂灯（会挂红灯笼，家家户户都挂）","en":"You asked if the hutongs hang lights at New Year (red lanterns, every household)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问胡同里过年挂不挂灯。会挂红灯笼。这两天我在胡同口的小店看见已经有卖灯笼的了，离过年还早，可是老板说：「早买早挂，喜庆。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn hútòng lǐ guònián guà bu guà dēng. Huì guà hóng dēnglong. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài hútòng kǒu de xiǎo diàn kànjiàn yǐjīng yǒu mài dēnglong de le, lí guònián hái zǎo, kěshì lǎobǎn shuō: “Zǎo mǎi zǎo guà, xǐqìng.”","m":"Last time you asked if the hutongs put up lights at New Year. Red lanterns. These days I saw the little shop at the hutong entrance already selling them. New Year's still a long way off, but the owner said: “Buy early, hang early — it's festive.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边一年里最热闹的节日是哪一个？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yì nián lǐ zuì rènao de jiérì shì nǎ yí gè?","m":"Where you are, which holiday is the liveliest of the year?"},"replies":[{"t":"圣诞节。","p":"Shèngdàn Jié.","m":"Christmas.","r":{"t":"那你那边现在应该已经很热闹了。","p":"Nà nǐ nàbiān xiànzài yīnggāi yǐjīng hěn rènao le.","m":"Then it must already be getting lively where you are."}},{"t":"新年。","p":"Xīnnián.","m":"New Year.","r":{"t":"跟我们一样！新年最热闹。","p":"Gēn wǒmen yíyàng! Xīnnián zuì rènao.","m":"Same as us! New Year's the liveliest."}}],"next":{"t":"胡同口的灯笼今天又多了几个。","p":"Hútòng kǒu de dēnglong jīntiān yòu duō le jǐ gè.","m":"A few more lanterns at the hutong shop today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会去商场看灯吗？","p":"Nǐ huì qù shāngchǎng kàn dēng ma?","m":"Will you go to the mall to see the lights?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她会不会去商场看灯（下班路过看一眼，人太多不想挤）","en":"You asked if she'd go to see the mall lights (a quick look on the way home — too crowded)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会去商场看灯。这两天我换了个时间：早上上班的时候路过，灯还亮着，一个人都没有。我一个人看了个够。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì qù shāngchǎng kàn dēng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ huàn le gè shíjiān: zǎoshang shàngbān de shíhou lùguò, dēng hái liàng zhe, yí gè rén dōu méiyǒu. Wǒ yí gè rén kàn le gè gòu.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd go and see the mall lights. These days I tried a different time: walking past on my way to work in the morning, the lights were still on and there was nobody around. I had them all to myself.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢早出门还是晚出门？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan zǎo chūmén háishi wǎn chūmén?","m":"Do you prefer heading out early or late?"},"replies":[{"t":"早出门，人少。","p":"Zǎo chūmén, rén shǎo.","m":"Early — fewer people.","r":{"t":"对！早上的城市最安静。","p":"Duì! Zǎoshang de chéngshì zuì ānjìng.","m":"Right! The city's quietest in the morning."}},{"t":"晚出门，我起不来。","p":"Wǎn chūmén, wǒ qǐ bu lái.","m":"Late — I can't get up.","r":{"t":"哈哈，冬天起床确实难。","p":"Hāha, dōngtiān qǐchuáng quèshí nán.","m":"Haha, getting up in winter really is hard."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又看了一眼商场的灯。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu kàn le yì yǎn shāngchǎng de dēng.","m":"Glanced at the mall lights again this morning."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-04|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-04","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Our lights are up too.","p":"","m":"我们这边也挂灯了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也挂上灯了","en":"Your lights are up too"},"later":{"t":"You said your lights are up too. Ours got worse this week — one of them now flashes like a disco. My flatmate calls our street 'the rave'.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也挂上灯了。我们这边这周更糟了——有一盏现在像迪斯科灯一样闪。我室友管我们这条街叫「狂欢派对」。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like Christmas lights, or are they too much?","p":"","m":"你喜欢圣诞灯，还是觉得太多了？"},"replies":[{"t":"I love them.","p":"","m":"我很喜欢。","r":{"t":"Secretly, me too.","p":"","m":"我也是，偷偷地。"}},{"t":"A bit too much for me.","p":"","m":"对我来说有点多。","r":{"t":"Fair. Ours are definitely too much now.","p":"","m":"有道理。我们这儿的现在绝对太多了。"}}],"next":{"t":"The disco light is still going strong.","p":"","m":"那盏迪斯科灯还在闪个不停。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There are no lights where I live.","p":"","m":"我住的地方没有灯。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边没挂灯","en":"There are no lights where you live"},"later":{"t":"You said there are no lights where you live. Honestly, some nights I'd swap. This week one flickered right outside my window all night. I slept with a T-shirt over my eyes.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边没挂灯。说实话，有些晚上我真想跟你换。这周有一盏就在我窗外闪了一整夜。我只好拿件 T 恤盖着眼睛睡。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you need total darkness to sleep?","p":"","m":"你是不是要全黑才睡得着？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, totally dark.","p":"","m":"对，要全黑。","r":{"t":"Then don't move to my street.","p":"","m":"那别搬到我这条街来。"}},{"t":"I don't mind a bit of light.","p":"","m":"有点光也没关系。","r":{"t":"Lucky. You'd survive here.","p":"","m":"真好。你在这儿能活下来。"}}],"next":{"t":"Slept with a T-shirt over my eyes again, haha.","p":"","m":"又是盖着 T 恤睡的，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Who puts them up?","p":"","m":"谁挂的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过灯是谁挂的（区政府，挂得不太好）","en":"You asked who puts the lights up (the council — not very well)"},"later":{"t":"You asked who puts the lights up. The council. This week two men came to fix them, stood on a ladder for an hour, and left. They're still flickering. I'm writing a very short story about it.","p":"","m":"你上次问灯是谁挂的。区政府。这周来了两个人修，在梯子上站了一个小时，走了。灯还在闪。我准备写一个很短的小故事。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who fixes things on your street?","p":"","m":"你那条街上的东西坏了，谁来修？"},"replies":[{"t":"The city does, eventually.","p":"","m":"市里会修，就是慢。","r":{"t":"'Eventually' — that's the key word.","p":"","m":"「就是慢」——关键就在这儿。"}},{"t":"The neighbours do it themselves.","p":"","m":"邻居们自己修。","r":{"t":"That's better. Faster, too.","p":"","m":"那更好。还更快。"}}],"next":{"t":"Lights still flickering. Ladder men still gone.","p":"","m":"灯还在闪。梯子上的人还没回来。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you like them?","p":"","m":"你喜欢吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他喜不喜欢那些灯（偷偷喜欢，让黑夜好过一点）","en":"You asked if he likes them (secretly, yes — they make the dark evenings better)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I like them. Secretly, yes. This week I walked home the long way just to pass more lights. Twenty extra minutes, in the cold. Worth it.","p":"","m":"你上次问我喜不喜欢那些灯。偷偷地喜欢。这周我特意绕远路回家，就为了多看几条街的灯。冷风里多走了二十分钟。值得。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you ever take the long way home on purpose?","p":"","m":"你会故意绕远路回家吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, when it's nice out.","p":"","m":"会，天气好的时候。","r":{"t":"Best way to end a day.","p":"","m":"结束一天最好的方式。"}},{"t":"No, I'm always in a hurry.","p":"","m":"不会，我总是很赶。","r":{"t":"Fair. Maybe once, for the lights.","p":"","m":"也是。也许为了灯，试一次。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took the long way home again today.","p":"","m":"今天又绕远路回家了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-04|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-04","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's the same here — the malls go big.","p":"","m":"我这边也一样，商场弄得很大。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是商场最热闹","en":"The malls go big where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said the malls go big where you are too. This week I took the kids to see the mall tree. It was so cold inside that my daughter wore my jacket like a dress.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是商场搞得最热闹。这周我带孩子们去看商场的圣诞树。里面冷得我女儿把我的外套当裙子穿。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you go to the mall for fun, or only to shop?","p":"","m":"你去商场是为了玩，还是只为了买东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Just to walk around and look.","p":"","m":"就是去逛逛看看。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. Free air-con, haha.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。免费空调，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Only to buy something.","p":"","m":"只为了买东西。","r":{"t":"Smart. Less money spent.","p":"","m":"聪明。花得少。"}}],"next":{"t":"The kids are still talking about the big tree.","p":"","m":"孩子们还在说那棵大树。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Our streets are full of lights.","p":"","m":"我们这边的街上挂满了灯。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边街上挂满了灯","en":"Your streets are full of lights"},"later":{"t":"You said your streets are full of lights. I told my kids, and they asked if they can see it one day. I said, insyaallah. They're already packing, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边街上挂满了灯。我告诉了孩子们，他们问哪天能不能去看看。我说：insyaallah（但愿如此）。他们已经在收拾行李了，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best thing about your street at night?","p":"","m":"晚上你那条街最好的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The lights, of course.","p":"","m":"当然是灯。","r":{"t":"I hope I see them one day, bro.","p":"","m":"希望我哪天能看到，兄弟。"}},{"t":"It's quiet.","p":"","m":"很安静。","r":{"t":"Quiet and lights. Sounds perfect.","p":"","m":"又安静又有灯。听起来很完美。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your street full of lights.","p":"","m":"想着你那条挂满灯的街。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you go to see the mall lights?","p":"","m":"你会去商场看灯吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他会不会去商场看灯（孩子们拉着他去，他们喜欢那棵大树）","en":"You asked if he goes to see the mall lights (the kids drag him — they love the big tree)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if we go to see the mall lights. The kids drag me. This week they shook hands with a man in a Santa suit — and outside it was thirty-two degrees. Poor Santa, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们会不会去商场看灯。孩子们拉着我去。这周他们跟一个穿圣诞老人衣服的人握了手——外面可是三十二度。可怜的圣诞老人，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a holiday you look forward to?","p":"","m":"你最期待哪个节日？"},"replies":[{"t":"New Year.","p":"","m":"新年。","r":{"t":"Me too! Fireworks everywhere in Jakarta.","p":"","m":"我也是！新年雅加达到处是烟花。"}},{"t":"My birthday, haha.","p":"","m":"我的生日，哈哈。","r":{"t":"Best holiday! Only for you.","p":"","m":"最好的节日！只属于你。"}}],"next":{"t":"The kids want to see Santa again, haha.","p":"","m":"孩子们还想再去看圣诞老人，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"When do the streets get lights?","p":"","m":"街上什么时候挂灯？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过街上什么时候挂灯（开斋节，比圣诞节多）","en":"You asked when the streets get lights (for Eid, more than Christmas)"},"later":{"t":"You asked when the streets get lights. For Eid, more than Christmas. My street goes crazy: lights, drums, everyone visiting. Then the lights stay up for weeks, because nobody wants to take them down.","p":"","m":"你上次问街上什么时候挂灯。开斋节，比圣诞节多。我们那条街会热闹疯了：灯、鼓、大家互相串门。然后灯一挂就是好几个星期，因为谁都不想拆。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When does your street look the most beautiful?","p":"","m":"你那条街什么时候最好看？"},"replies":[{"t":"At holidays, with lights.","p":"","m":"过节的时候，有灯。","r":{"t":"Same here, bro. Holidays make everything shine.","p":"","m":"我们这儿也是，兄弟。节日让一切都亮起来。"}},{"t":"Early morning, when it's empty.","p":"","m":"大清早，没人的时候。","r":{"t":"Beautiful. In Jakarta, the street is never empty, haha.","p":"","m":"真美。在雅加达，街上从来没空过，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking about Eid lights already, haha.","p":"","m":"已经在想开斋节的灯了，哈哈。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Good news, bro: the roof is fixed! My neighbour and I did it on Sunday, between two rains.","p":"","m":"好消息，兄弟：屋顶修好了！周日两场雨中间，我跟邻居一起修的。"},{"t":"The kids are a bit sad — they liked the bucket catching drips in the kitchen. They called it the 'rain drum'.","p":"","m":"孩子们有点难过——他们喜欢厨房里那个接水的桶，管它叫「雨鼓」。"},{"t":"So I gave them a real pot and a spoon. Now it's louder than the rain.","p":"","m":"所以我给了他们一个真锅和一把勺子。现在比下雨还吵。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Well done, bro!","p":"","m":"干得好，兄弟！","r":{"t":"Thanks! It only took two rains and a lot of coffee.","p":"","m":"谢谢！只花了两场雨和很多咖啡。"}},{"t":"A pot and a spoon — brave!","p":"","m":"锅和勺子——勇敢！","r":{"t":"My wife says I'm not brave, I'm crazy, haha.","p":"","m":"我老婆说我不是勇敢，是疯了，哈哈。"}}],"from":"2026-12-06"}},"2026-12-05|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-05","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家附近也有早市！","p":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn yě yǒu zǎoshì!","m":"There's a morning market near me too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近也有早市","en":"There's a morning market near you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家附近也有早市！这两天我在早市认识了一个卖豆腐的大姐，她说她每天三点就起来磨豆子。我买她的豆腐，都不好意思讲价了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā fùjìn yě yǒu zǎoshì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài zǎoshì rènshi le yí gè mài dòufu de dàjiě, tā shuō tā měi tiān sān diǎn jiù qǐlái mò dòuzi. Wǒ mǎi tā de dòufu, dōu bù hǎoyìsi jiǎng jià le.","m":"You said there's a morning market near you too! These days I got to know a tofu seller there — she says she's up at three every morning grinding beans. Now I'm too embarrassed to haggle over her tofu.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买东西会讲价吗？","p":"Nǐ mǎi dōngxi huì jiǎng jià ma?","m":"Do you haggle when you shop?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，在市场上一定要讲。","p":"Huì, zài shìchǎng shang yídìng yào jiǎng.","m":"Yes — at markets, always.","r":{"t":"厉害！我一讲价就脸红。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ yì jiǎng jià jiù liǎn hóng.","m":"Impressive! I go red whenever I haggle."}},{"t":"不会，我不好意思。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ bù hǎoyìsi.","m":"No — I'm too shy.","r":{"t":"我也是，人家起那么早，不讲了。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, rénjia qǐ nàme zǎo, bù jiǎng le.","m":"Me too — they get up so early, I just don't."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在早市买了块豆腐。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài zǎoshì mǎi le kuài dòufu.","m":"Got another block of tofu at the market today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"周末早上我还在睡觉。","p":"Zhōumò zǎoshang wǒ hái zài shuìjiào.","m":"At the weekend I'm still asleep in the morning."},"mem":{"zh":"周末早上你还在睡觉","en":"At weekend mornings you're still asleep"},"later":{"t":"你上次说周末早上你还在睡觉。这个周末我也学你，睡到了九点。起来去早市，菜都卖得差不多了，只剩几根葱。值了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō zhōumò zǎoshang nǐ hái zài shuìjiào. Zhège zhōumò wǒ yě xué nǐ, shuì dào le jiǔ diǎn. Qǐlái qù zǎoshì, cài dōu mài de chàbuduō le, zhǐ shèng jǐ gēn cōng. Zhí le, hāha.","m":"You said you're still asleep on weekend mornings. This weekend I copied you and slept till nine. By the time I got to the market it was almost sold out — just a few spring onions left. Worth it, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"周末你一般睡到几点？","p":"Zhōumò nǐ yìbān shuì dào jǐ diǎn?","m":"What time do you usually sleep till at weekends?"},"replies":[{"t":"十点左右。","p":"Shí diǎn zuǒyòu.","m":"Around ten.","r":{"t":"十点！好幸福。","p":"Shí diǎn! Hǎo xìngfú.","m":"Ten! Bliss."}},{"t":"跟平时一样，醒了就起。","p":"Gēn píngshí yíyàng, xǐng le jiù qǐ.","m":"Same as usual — up when I wake.","r":{"t":"那你生活很规律，比我强。","p":"Nà nǐ shēnghuó hěn guīlǜ, bǐ wǒ qiáng.","m":"Then you've got a good routine — better than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又七点去了早市，替你多睡了一会儿，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu qī diǎn qù le zǎoshì, tì nǐ duō shuì le yíhuìr, hāha.","m":"Off to the market at seven again today — have a lie-in for me, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去早市买什么？","p":"Nǐ qù zǎoshì mǎi shénme?","m":"What do you buy at the morning market?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去早市买什么（菜、水果，有时候买一把花）","en":"You asked what she buys at the morning market (veg, fruit, sometimes flowers)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去早市买什么。这个周末我买了一把腊梅，才十块钱。放在屋里，满屋子都是香的。北京一冷，腊梅就上市了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù zǎoshì mǎi shénme. Zhège zhōumò wǒ mǎi le yì bǎ làméi, cái shí kuài qián. Fàng zài wū lǐ, mǎn wūzi dōu shì xiāng de. Běijīng yì lěng, làméi jiù shàngshì le.","m":"Last time you asked what I buy at the morning market. This weekend I bought a bunch of wintersweet for just ten yuan. In the room, the whole place smells sweet. Once Beijing turns cold, wintersweet appears.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里会放花吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ huì fàng huā ma?","m":"Do you keep flowers at home?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，放一点心情好。","p":"Huì, fàng yìdiǎn xīnqíng hǎo.","m":"Yes — a few flowers lift my mood.","r":{"t":"对，一束花就够了。","p":"Duì, yí shù huā jiù gòu le.","m":"Right — one bunch is enough."}},{"t":"不放，我总是忘了换水。","p":"Bú fàng, wǒ zǒngshì wàng le huàn shuǐ.","m":"No — I always forget to change the water.","r":{"t":"哈哈，那就养一盆绿萝，不用管。","p":"Hāha, nà jiù yǎng yì pén lǜluó, bú yòng guǎn.","m":"Haha, then get a pothos — no care needed."}}],"next":{"t":"腊梅今天还很香。","p":"Làméi jīntiān hái hěn xiāng.","m":"The wintersweet still smells lovely today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"早市几点关门？","p":"Zǎoshì jǐ diǎn guānmén?","m":"When does the morning market close?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过早市几点关门（九点多就收了）","en":"You asked when the morning market closes (packed up by just after nine)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问早市几点关门。九点多就收。这个周末我九点十分到，卖菜的大爷正在收摊，看见我，还是给我留了一把菠菜。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn zǎoshì jǐ diǎn guān mén. Jiǔ diǎn duō jiù shōu. Zhège zhōumò wǒ jiǔ diǎn shí fēn dào, mài cài de dàye zhèngzài shōu tān, kànjiàn wǒ, háishi gěi wǒ liú le yì bǎ bōcài.","m":"Last time you asked when the morning market closes. Just after nine. This weekend I got there at ten past nine — the old vegetable seller was packing up, but when he saw me he still kept a bunch of spinach for me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有常去的地方，老板会给你留东西？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu cháng qù de dìfang, lǎobǎn huì gěi nǐ liú dōngxi?","m":"Is there a place you go where they'll keep something aside for you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，面包店会给我留面包。","p":"Yǒu, miànbāo diàn huì gěi wǒ liú miànbāo.","m":"Yes — the bakery keeps bread for me.","r":{"t":"真好！这就是老顾客。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Zhè jiù shì lǎo gùkè.","m":"Lovely! That's what being a regular means."}},{"t":"还没有。","p":"Hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet.","r":{"t":"多去几次就有了。","p":"Duō qù jǐ cì jiù yǒu le.","m":"Go a few more times and there will be."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上去晚了，大爷又给我留了菜。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang qù wǎn le, dàye yòu gěi wǒ liú le cài.","m":"Late again this morning — the old man saved me some veg."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-05|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-05","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家附近的面包店也要排队。","p":"Wǒ jiā fùjìn de miànbāo diàn yě yào páiduì.","m":"There's a queue at the bakery near me too."},"mem":{"zh":"你家附近的面包店也要排队","en":"You have to queue at the bakery near you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家附近的面包店也要排队。这两天排队的时候，前面一个老爷爷教我怎么挑面包：拿起来轻轻一压，弹回来的就是新鲜的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā fùjìn de miànbāo diàn yě yào páiduì. Zhè liǎng tiān páiduì de shíhou, qiánmiàn yí gè lǎo yéye jiāo wǒ zěnme tiāo miànbāo: ná qǐlái qīngqīng yì yā, tán huílái de jiù shì xīnxiān de.","m":"You said you have to queue at the bakery near you too. These days while I was queuing, an old man in front taught me how to choose bread: press it gently — if it springs back, it's fresh.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你排队的时候一般做什么？","p":"Nǐ páiduì de shíhou yìbān zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do while queuing?"},"replies":[{"t":"看手机。","p":"Kàn shǒujī.","m":"Look at my phone.","r":{"t":"我以前也是，现在我跟前面的人聊天，学到好多。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě shì, xiànzài wǒ gēn qiánmiàn de rén liáotiān, xué dào hǎo duō.","m":"I used to as well — now I chat to the person in front and learn so much."}},{"t":"跟旁边的人聊天。","p":"Gēn pángbiān de rén liáotiān.","m":"Chat to people next to me.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！排队是最好的聊天时间。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Páiduì shì zuì hǎo de liáotiān shíjiān.","m":"Same as me! Queues are the best time to chat."}}],"next":{"t":"今天排队又学了一个挑面包的办法。","p":"Jīntiān páiduì yòu xué le yí gè tiāo miànbāo de bànfǎ.","m":"Picked up another bread-choosing trick in the queue today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我周末早上不出门。","p":"Wǒ zhōumò zǎoshang bù chūmén.","m":"I don't go out on weekend mornings."},"mem":{"zh":"你周末早上不出门","en":"You don't go out on weekend mornings"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你周末早上不出门。这个周末我也试了，让弟弟去买面包。结果他买回来二十个，说：「准确地说，是你要的十个，再加我的十个。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhōumò zǎoshang bù chūmén. Zhège zhōumò wǒ yě shì le, ràng dìdi qù mǎi miànbāo. Jiéguǒ tā mǎi huílái èrshí gè, shuō: “Zhǔnquè de shuō, shì nǐ yào de shí gè, zài jiā wǒ de shí gè.”","m":"You said you don't go out on weekend mornings. This weekend I tried it and sent my brother for bread. He came back with twenty and said: “To be precise — your ten, plus my ten.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"周末早上，你一般吃什么？","p":"Zhōumò zǎoshang, nǐ yìbān chī shénme?","m":"What do you usually have on weekend mornings?"},"replies":[{"t":"慢慢做一顿早饭。","p":"Mànmàn zuò yí dùn zǎofàn.","m":"I take my time making breakfast.","r":{"t":"真好，周末就该慢慢来。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, zhōumò jiù gāi mànmàn lái.","m":"Lovely — weekends are for taking it slow."}},{"t":"随便吃一点，或者不吃。","p":"Suíbiàn chī yìdiǎn, huòzhě bù chī.","m":"Something quick, or nothing.","r":{"t":"那就多睡一会儿，也很好。","p":"Nà jiù duō shuì yíhuìr, yě hěn hǎo.","m":"Then sleep a bit more — that's good too."}}],"next":{"t":"家里还剩好多面包，都是弟弟买的，哈哈。","p":"Jiā lǐ hái shèng hǎo duō miànbāo, dōu shì dìdi mǎi de, hāha.","m":"Loads of bread left at home — all my brother's doing, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们买的是什么面包？","p":"Nǐmen mǎi de shì shénme miànbāo?","m":"What kind of bread do you buy?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们买的是什么面包（aish baladi，圆圆的大饼，中间是空的）","en":"You asked what bread they buy (aish baladi — round flatbread, hollow inside)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们买的是什么面包。aish baladi。「aish」在埃及阿拉伯语里是「面包」，它跟「生活」是同一个词根。我觉得这个很美：面包就是生活。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen mǎi de shì shénme miànbāo. Aish baladi. “Aish” zài Āijí Ālābóyǔ lǐ shì “miànbāo”, tā gēn “shēnghuó” shì tóng yí gè cígēn. Wǒ juéde zhège hěn měi: miànbāo jiù shì shēnghuó.","m":"Last time you asked what bread we buy. Aish baladi. In Egyptian Arabic 'aish' means bread — and it shares a root with the word for 'life'. I find that beautiful: bread is life.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边最常吃的主食是什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zuì cháng chī de zhǔshí shì shénme?","m":"What's the main staple where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"米饭。","p":"Mǐfàn.","m":"Rice.","r":{"t":"米饭也是生活！","p":"Mǐfàn yě shì shēnghuó!","m":"Rice is life too!"}},{"t":"面包，每天都吃。","p":"Miànbāo, měi tiān dōu chī.","m":"Bread, every day.","r":{"t":"那我们一样，面包就是生活。","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng, miànbāo jiù shì shēnghuó.","m":"Then we're the same — bread is life."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又排队买了 aish，想到你。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu páiduì mǎi le aish, xiǎng dào nǐ.","m":"Queued for aish again this morning and thought of you."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一次买多少个？","p":"Nǐ yí cì mǎi duōshao gè?","m":"How many do you buy at once?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一次买多少个（十个，家里人多）","en":"You asked how many she buys at once (ten — big family)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一次买多少个。十个。这两天我在想：要是去了台湾，一个人住，一次买一个就够了。想到这里，我又多买了两个，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yí cì mǎi duōshao gè. Shí gè. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng: yàoshi qù le Táiwān, yí gè rén zhù, yí cì mǎi yí gè jiù gòu le. Xiǎng dào zhèlǐ, wǒ yòu duō mǎi le liǎng gè, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how many I buy at once. Ten. These days I've been thinking: if I go to Taiwan and live alone, one will be enough. Thinking that, I bought two extra, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个人吃饭和跟家人吃饭，哪个多？","p":"Nǐ yí gè rén chī fàn hé gēn jiārén chī fàn, nǎ gè duō?","m":"Do you eat alone or with family more often?"},"replies":[{"t":"一个人多。","p":"Yí gè rén duō.","m":"Alone, more often.","r":{"t":"那以后我们都是一个人吃饭的人，可以互相说说吃了什么。","p":"Nà yǐhòu wǒmen dōu shì yí gè rén chī fàn de rén, kěyǐ hùxiāng shuōshuo chī le shénme.","m":"Then one day we'll both be solo eaters — we can tell each other what we had."}},{"t":"跟家人多。","p":"Gēn jiārén duō.","m":"With family.","r":{"t":"真好，要好好珍惜。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, yào hǎohǎo zhēnxī.","m":"Lovely — treasure it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又买了十二个面包，多两个是给自己的。","p":"Jīntiān yòu mǎi le shí'èr gè miànbāo, duō liǎng gè shì gěi zìjǐ de.","m":"Bought twelve loaves again today — the extra two are for me."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"周末带了一个从台湾来的团！我第一次当着真人说「捷运」「超商」。","p":"Zhōumò dài le yí gè cóng Táiwān lái de tuán! Wǒ dì yī cì dāng zhe zhēnrén shuō “jiéyùn” “chāoshāng”.","m":"At the weekend I guided a group from Taiwan! The first time I've said 捷运 and 超商 to real people."},{"t":"他们一下就听懂了。一个阿姨还教了我一个新词：「好康」，就是好东西、好处。","p":"Tāmen yíxià jiù tīng dǒng le. Yí gè āyí hái jiāo le wǒ yí gè xīn cí: “hǎokāng”, jiù shì hǎo dōngxi, hǎochù.","m":"They got it straight away. One lady taught me a new word: 好康 — a good thing, a treat."},{"t":"准确地说，这个团就是我这个月最大的好康。","p":"Zhǔnquè de shuō, zhège tuán jiù shì wǒ zhège yuè zuì dà de hǎokāng.","m":"To be precise, that group was the best 好康 of my month."}],"replies":[{"t":"「好康」这个词真可爱！","p":"“Hǎokāng” zhège cí zhēn kě'ài!","m":"好康 — what a cute word!","r":{"t":"我也觉得！马上记在本子上了。","p":"Wǒ yě juéde! Mǎshàng jì zài běnzi shang le.","m":"I think so too! Straight into my notebook."}},{"t":"你背的台湾说法用上了！","p":"Nǐ bèi de Táiwān shuōfǎ yòng shang le!","m":"You got to use your Taiwan words!","r":{"t":"对，背了那么久，终于用上了。","p":"Duì, bèi le nàme jiǔ, zhōngyú yòng shang le.","m":"Yes — all that memorising, and finally I used them."}}],"from":"2026-12-07"}},"2026-12-06|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-06","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家门口的路名也有故事。","p":"Wǒ jiā ménkǒu de lù míng yě yǒu gùshi.","m":"My street's name has a story too."},"mem":{"zh":"你家门口的路名也有故事","en":"Your street name has a story too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家门口的路名也有故事。这两天我去查了：北京好多胡同名都跟以前的买卖有关，像「羊肉胡同」「钱粮胡同」。听名字，就知道以前这儿卖什么。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā ménkǒu de lù míng yě yǒu gùshi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù chá le: Běijīng hǎo duō hútòng míng dōu gēn yǐqián de mǎimai yǒuguān, xiàng “Yángròu Hútòng” “Qiánliáng Hútòng”. Tīng míngzi, jiù zhīdào yǐqián zhèr mài shénme.","m":"You said your street name has a story too. These days I looked it up: lots of Beijing hutong names come from old trades — like Mutton Hutong or Money-and-Grain Hutong. You can tell from the name what used to be sold there.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家那条路的名字，是怎么来的？","p":"Nǐ jiā nà tiáo lù de míngzi, shì zěnme lái de?","m":"Where does your street's name come from?"},"replies":[{"t":"跟以前的一座桥有关。","p":"Gēn yǐqián de yí zuò qiáo yǒuguān.","m":"It's about an old bridge.","r":{"t":"那下次你去找找，桥还在不在。","p":"Nà xià cì nǐ qù zhǎozhao, qiáo hái zài bu zài.","m":"Then go and see if the bridge is still there."}},{"t":"其实我也说不太清楚。","p":"Qíshí wǒ yě shuō bu tài qīngchu.","m":"Honestly, I'm not sure.","r":{"t":"没关系，我也是最近才查的。","p":"Méi guānxi, wǒ yě shì zuìjìn cái chá de.","m":"No worries — I only just looked mine up."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又走了一遍花枝胡同。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zǒu le yí biàn Huāzhī Hútòng.","m":"Walked down Huazhi Hutong again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家门口的路只有一个数字。","p":"Wǒ jiā ménkǒu de lù zhǐ yǒu yí gè shùzì.","m":"My street's just a number."},"mem":{"zh":"你家门口的路只有一个数字","en":"Your street is just a number"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家门口的路只有一个数字。这两天我给一个美国学生讲胡同，他说纽约的路也都是数字。我说：那你们不会迷路。他说：会，因为太像了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā ménkǒu de lù zhǐ yǒu yí gè shùzì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gěi yí gè Měiguó xuésheng jiǎng hútòng, tā shuō Niǔyuē de lù yě dōu shì shùzì. Wǒ shuō: nà nǐmen bú huì mílù. Tā shuō: huì, yīnwèi tài xiàng le.","m":"You said your street is just a number. These days I was telling an American student about hutongs, and he said New York streets are numbers too. I said: so you never get lost. He said: we do — they all look the same.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在一个新地方，容易迷路吗？","p":"Nǐ zài yí gè xīn dìfang, róngyì mílù ma?","m":"Do you get lost easily in a new place?"},"replies":[{"t":"容易，我得一直看地图。","p":"Róngyì, wǒ děi yìzhí kàn dìtú.","m":"Yes — I have to keep checking the map.","r":{"t":"我也是，来胡同的外国学生都这样。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, lái hútòng de wàiguó xuésheng dōu zhèyàng.","m":"Me too — all my foreign students do that in the hutongs."}},{"t":"不容易，我方向感很好。","p":"Bù róngyì, wǒ fāngxiàng gǎn hěn hǎo.","m":"No — I've got a good sense of direction.","r":{"t":"真好！那你来北京给我带路。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Nà nǐ lái Běijīng gěi wǒ dài lù.","m":"Great! Then come to Beijing and lead the way."}}],"next":{"t":"今天走在花枝胡同，又想到你那条数字的路。","p":"Jīntiān zǒu zài Huāzhī Hútòng, yòu xiǎng dào nǐ nà tiáo shùzì de lù.","m":"Walking down Huazhi Hutong today, I thought of your numbered street."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"现在还有人卖花吗？","p":"Xiànzài hái yǒu rén mài huā ma?","m":"Does anyone still sell flowers there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过现在还有没有人卖花（没有了，胡同口有一家小花店）","en":"You asked if anyone still sells flowers there (no — but there's a little flower shop at the entrance)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问现在还有没有人卖花。这两天我进了胡同口那家小花店，老板是个年轻姑娘。她说，就是因为这条胡同叫「花枝」，她才把店开在这儿的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn xiànzài hái yǒu méiyǒu rén mài huā. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jìn le hútòng kǒu nà jiā xiǎo huādiàn, lǎobǎn shì gè niánqīng gūniang. Tā shuō, jiù shì yīnwèi zhè tiáo hútòng jiào “Huāzhī”, tā cái bǎ diàn kāi zài zhèr de.","m":"Last time you asked if anyone still sells flowers here. These days I went into the little flower shop at the hutong entrance — the owner's a young woman. She said she opened her shop here precisely because the hutong is called 'Flower Branch'.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你开一家小店，你想开什么店？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ kāi yì jiā xiǎo diàn, nǐ xiǎng kāi shénme diàn?","m":"If you opened a little shop, what would it be?"},"replies":[{"t":"咖啡店。","p":"Kāfēi diàn.","m":"A café.","r":{"t":"好主意，我天天去。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi, wǒ tiāntiān qù.","m":"Good idea — I'd come every day."}},{"t":"书店。","p":"Shūdiàn.","m":"A bookshop.","r":{"t":"我最爱的店！记得给我留个座位。","p":"Wǒ zuì ài de diàn! Jìde gěi wǒ liú gè zuòwèi.","m":"My favourite kind of shop! Save me a seat."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过小花店，门口摆了几盆水仙。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò xiǎo huādiàn, ménkǒu bǎi le jǐ pén shuǐxiān.","m":"Passed the little flower shop today — pots of narcissus out front."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喜欢这个名字吗？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan zhège míngzi ma?","m":"Do you like the name?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喜不喜欢这个名字（喜欢，写地址都觉得好听）","en":"You asked if she likes the name (yes — it sounds lovely every time she writes her address)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喜不喜欢这个名字。这两天我寄了一张明信片给外地的朋友，写地址的时候又写了一遍「花枝胡同」。朋友收到说：「光看地址，就想来北京。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xǐ bu xǐhuan zhège míngzi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jì le yì zhāng míngxìnpiàn gěi wàidì de péngyou, xiě dìzhǐ de shíhou yòu xiě le yí biàn “Huāzhī Hútòng”. Péngyou shōu dào shuō: “Guāng kàn dìzhǐ, jiù xiǎng lái Běijīng.”","m":"Last time you asked if I like the name. These days I sent a postcard to a friend in another city and wrote 'Huazhi Hutong' on it again. When it arrived, my friend said: “Just reading the address makes me want to come to Beijing.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你还寄过明信片或者信吗？","p":"Nǐ hái jìguo míngxìnpiàn huòzhě xìn ma?","m":"Do you still ever send postcards or letters?"},"replies":[{"t":"寄过，旅行的时候寄。","p":"Jìguo, lǚxíng de shíhou jì.","m":"Yes — when I travel.","r":{"t":"真好，比发消息有意思多了。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, bǐ fā xiāoxi yǒu yìsi duō le.","m":"Lovely — much more fun than a text."}},{"t":"好多年没寄了。","p":"Hǎo duō nián méi jì le.","m":"Not for years.","r":{"t":"那找个时间寄一张吧，收到的人会很开心。","p":"Nà zhǎo gè shíjiān jì yì zhāng ba, shōu dào de rén huì hěn kāixīn.","m":"Then send one sometime — whoever gets it will be thrilled."}}],"next":{"t":"今天写地址，又写了「花枝胡同」。","p":"Jīntiān xiě dìzhǐ, yòu xiě le “Huāzhī Hútòng”.","m":"Wrote 'Huazhi Hutong' on an envelope again today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"这学期快结束了，班上的学生给我写了一张卡片。","p":"Zhè xuéqī kuài jiéshù le, bān shang de xuésheng gěi wǒ xiě le yì zhāng kǎpiàn.","m":"The term's nearly over, and my class wrote me a card."},{"t":"里面全是这学期学的话：「老师，得嘞！」「改天请您吃饭——这次是真的！」","p":"Lǐmiàn quán shì zhè xuéqī xué de huà: “Lǎoshī, dé lei!” “Gǎitiān qǐng nín chī fàn —— zhè cì shì zhēnde!”","m":"It's full of things we learned this term: “Teacher, de lei!” “We'll treat you to dinner some day — and we mean it this time!”"},{"t":"最下面那个德国学生写：「谢谢老师，我们还在遛弯儿。」","p":"Zuì xiàmiàn nà gè Déguó xuésheng xiě: “Xièxie lǎoshī, wǒmen hái zài liùwānr.”","m":"At the bottom, the German student wrote: “Thank you, teacher — we're still strolling.”"}],"replies":[{"t":"「还在遛弯儿」，太好了！","p":"“Hái zài liùwānr”, tài hǎo le!","m":"'Still strolling' — wonderful!","r":{"t":"是吧！全班都替他高兴。","p":"Shì ba! Quán bān dōu tì tā gāoxìng.","m":"Right? The whole class is happy for him."}},{"t":"你的学生学得真好。","p":"Nǐ de xuésheng xué de zhēn hǎo.","m":"Your students learn well.","r":{"t":"他们敢说，这个最重要。","p":"Tāmen gǎn shuō, zhège zuì zhòngyào.","m":"They dare to speak — that's what matters most."}}],"from":"2026-12-08"}},"2026-12-06|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-06","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也不知道我家的路名是什么意思。","p":"Wǒ yě bù zhīdào wǒ jiā de lù míng shì shénme yìsi.","m":"I don't know what my street name means either."},"mem":{"zh":"你也不知道你家的路名是什么意思","en":"You don't know what your street name means either"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也不知道你家的路名是什么意思。我打电话问了我爸，他说「永福」听起来就是「永远幸福」，希望住在那条路上的人都过得好。我跟他说我在台北也很好，他笑了，说：「那就是路名有用。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě bù zhīdào nǐ jiā de lù míng shì shénme yìsi. Wǒ dǎ diànhuà wèn le wǒ bà, tā shuō “Yǒngfú” tīng qǐlái jiù shì “yǒngyuǎn xìngfú”, xīwàng zhù zài nà tiáo lù shang de rén dōu guò de hǎo. Wǒ gēn tā shuō wǒ zài Táiběi yě hěn hǎo, tā xiào le, shuō: “Nà jiù shì lù míng yǒu yòng.”","m":"You said you don't know what your street name means either. I called my dad — he says 永福 sounds like 'forever happy', a wish for everyone on that road to do well. I told him I'm doing fine in Taipei too, and he laughed: 'Then the name works.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会去查你家路名的意思吗？","p":"Nǐ huì qù chá nǐ jiā lù míng de yìsi ma?","m":"Will you look up what your street name means?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我挺好奇的。","p":"Huì, wǒ tǐng hàoqí de.","m":"Yes — I'm curious.","r":{"t":"好！查到了跟我说。","p":"Hǎo! Chá dào le gēn wǒ shuō.","m":"Great! Tell me when you find out."}},{"t":"应该不会，哈哈。","p":"Yīnggāi bú huì, hāha.","m":"Probably not, haha.","r":{"t":"哈哈，没关系，不知道也住得很开心。","p":"Hāha, méi guānxi, bù zhīdào yě zhù de hěn kāixīn.","m":"Haha, no worries — you can live there happily without knowing."}}],"next":{"t":"今天跟我爸讲电话，他又说了一次「永远幸福」。","p":"Jīntiān gēn wǒ bà jiǎng diànhuà, tā yòu shuō le yí cì “yǒngyuǎn xìngfú”.","m":"On the phone with Dad today — he said 'forever happy' again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我家的路是用一个人的名字起的。","p":"Wǒ jiā de lù shì yòng yí gè rén de míngzi qǐ de.","m":"My street is named after a person."},"mem":{"zh":"你家的路是用一个人的名字起的","en":"Your street is named after a person"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家的路是用一个人的名字起的。我发现台湾也很多：中山路、中正路，好多城市都有，都是用人名起的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā de lù shì yòng yí gè rén de míngzi qǐ de. Wǒ fāxiàn Táiwān yě hěn duō: Zhōngshān Lù, Zhōngzhèng Lù, hǎo duō chéngshì dōu yǒu, dōu shì yòng rén míng qǐ de.","m":"You said your street is named after a person. I've noticed Taiwan has loads too: Zhongshan Road, Zhongzheng Road — lots of cities have them, all named after people.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"每天走那条路，你会想到那个人吗？","p":"Měi tiān zǒu nà tiáo lù, nǐ huì xiǎng dào nà gè rén ma?","m":"Walking that street every day, do you ever think of that person?"},"replies":[{"t":"有时候会。","p":"Yǒu shíhou huì.","m":"Sometimes.","r":{"t":"好浪漫，一条路记住一个人。","p":"Hǎo làngmàn, yì tiáo lù jìzhù yí gè rén.","m":"How romantic — a street that remembers someone."}},{"t":"不会，就是一个名字。","p":"Bú huì, jiù shì yí gè míngzi.","m":"No — it's just a name.","r":{"t":"也对，走久了就只是回家的路了。","p":"Yě duì, zǒu jiǔ le jiù zhǐ shì huí jiā de lù le.","m":"True — after a while it's just the way home."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过中山路，想到你家那条路。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò Zhōngshān Lù, xiǎng dào nǐ jiā nà tiáo lù.","m":"Passed Zhongshan Road today and thought of your street."}},"m1.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"是一个很有名的作家。","p":"Shì yí gè hěn yǒumíng de zuòjiā.","m":"A famous writer."},"mem":{"zh":"你家的路用一位很有名的作家的名字起的","en":"Your street is named after a famous writer"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你家的路是用一位很有名的作家的名字起的，我好羡慕！这两天我去书店，问店员台北有没有用作家名字起的路，她想了很久，也想不出来。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jiā de lù shì yòng yí wèi hěn yǒumíng de zuòjiā de míngzi qǐ de, wǒ hǎo xiànmù! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù shūdiàn, wèn diànyuán Táiběi yǒu méiyǒu yòng zuòjiā míngzi qǐ de lù, tā xiǎng le hěn jiǔ, yě xiǎng bu chūlái.","m":"You said your street is named after a famous writer — so jealous! These days I asked at a bookshop whether Taipei has a street named after a writer. The assistant thought for ages and couldn't come up with one.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"那位作家的书，你读过吗？","p":"Nà wèi zuòjiā de shū, nǐ dúguo ma?","m":"Have you read that writer's books?"},"replies":[{"t":"读过一本。","p":"Dúguo yì běn.","m":"One.","r":{"t":"好棒！下次跟我说好不好看。","p":"Hǎo bàng! Xià cì gēn wǒ shuō hǎo bu hǎokàn.","m":"Nice! Tell me sometime if it's good."}},{"t":"还没有，可是想读。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, kěshì xiǎng dú.","m":"Not yet, but I'd like to.","r":{"t":"那我们一起读吧！","p":"Nà wǒmen yìqǐ dú ba!","m":"Let's read it together, then!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天去书店，又想到你家那条作家的路。","p":"Jīntiān qù shūdiàn, yòu xiǎng dào nǐ jiā nà tiáo zuòjiā de lù.","m":"At the bookshop today I thought of your writer's street again."}},"m1.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我也不知道，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ yě bù zhīdào, hāha.","m":"I don't know either, haha."},"mem":{"zh":"你也不知道你家的路是用谁的名字起的","en":"You don't know who your street is named after either"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也不知道你家的路是用谁的名字起的，哈哈。我们一样：我查台南老家那条永福路，查到一半就去打工了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě bù zhīdào nǐ jiā de lù shì yòng shéi de míngzi qǐ de, hāha. Wǒmen yíyàng: wǒ chá Táinán lǎojiā nà tiáo Yǒngfú Lù, chá dào yíbàn jiù qù dǎgōng le.","m":"You said you don't know who your street's named after either, haha. Same here: I started looking up Yongfu Road back home in Tainan and had to leave for my shift halfway.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会去查这种小事吗？","p":"Nǐ huì qù chá zhè zhǒng xiǎo shì ma?","m":"Do you look up little things like that?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我很好奇。","p":"Huì, wǒ hěn hàoqí.","m":"Yes — I'm curious.","r":{"t":"好奇最好了！","p":"Hàoqí zuì hǎo le!","m":"Curiosity's the best!"}},{"t":"不太会，懒得查。","p":"Bú tài huì, lǎnde chá.","m":"Not really — can't be bothered.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我也是，查到一半就忘了。","p":"Hāha, wǒ yě shì, chá dào yíbàn jiù wàng le.","m":"Haha, me too — I forget halfway."}}],"next":{"t":"今天还是没查完永福路的名字，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān háishi méi chá wán Yǒngfú Lù de míngzi, hāha.","m":"Still haven't finished looking up Yongfu Road's name today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"永福路上有什么？","p":"Yǒngfú Lù shang yǒu shénme?","m":"What's on Yongfu Road?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过永福路上有什么（有庙、有老店，还有她从小吃到大的早餐店）","en":"You asked what's on Yongfu Road (temples, old shops, and the breakfast place she grew up on)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问永福路上有什么。我小时候每天走路上学，都会经过那家早餐店。老板娘每次都塞给我一颗茶叶蛋，说：「念书要吃饱。」这两天我妈说，她还在问：「那个小妹妹在台北好不好？」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Yǒngfú Lù shang yǒu shénme. Wǒ xiǎoshíhou měi tiān zǒulù shàngxué, dōu huì jīngguò nà jiā zǎocān diàn. Lǎobǎnniáng měi cì dōu sāi gěi wǒ yì kē cháyèdàn, shuō: “Niàn shū yào chī bǎo.” Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā shuō, tā hái zài wèn: “Nà gè xiǎo mèimei zài Táiběi hǎo bu hǎo?”","m":"Last time you asked what's on Yongfu Road. As a kid I walked to school every day past that breakfast shop. The owner always slipped me a tea egg and said: 'You need a full stomach to study.' These days Mum told me she still asks: 'How's that little girl doing in Taipei?'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候上学的路上，有没有一个一直记得的人？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou shàngxué de lù shang, yǒu méiyǒu yí gè yìzhí jìde de rén?","m":"On your way to school as a kid, was there someone you still remember?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一个店主。","p":"Yǒu, yí gè diànzhǔ.","m":"Yes — a shop owner.","r":{"t":"那种人，长大了都会想念。","p":"Nà zhǒng rén, zhǎng dà le dōu huì xiǎngniàn.","m":"You miss people like that once you grow up."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"Can't think of one.","r":{"t":"说不定哪天走过那条路，就想起来了。","p":"Shuōbudìng nǎ tiān zǒu guò nà tiáo lù, jiù xiǎng qǐlái le.","m":"Maybe one day you'll walk that road and remember."}}],"next":{"t":"过年回台南，第一件事就是去那家早餐店。","p":"Guònián huí Táinán, dì yī jiàn shì jiù shì qù nà jiā zǎocān diàn.","m":"When I go home to Tainan for New Year, the first stop is that breakfast shop."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在那里住了多久？","p":"Nǐ zài nàlǐ zhù le duō jiǔ?","m":"How long have you lived there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在永福路住了多久（从小住到上大学，十八年）","en":"You asked how long she lived on Yongfu Road (from childhood until university — eighteen years)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在永福路住了多久。从小住到上大学，十八年，后来才搬来台北。这两天我很想家，就打电话给我妈，让她把手机拿到门口，给我听听街上的声音：机车、庙里的钟，还有隔壁阿嬷在骂她的猫。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài Yǒngfú Lù zhù le duō jiǔ. Cóng xiǎo zhù dào shàng dàxué, shíbā nián, hòulái cái bān lái Táiběi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ hěn xiǎng jiā, jiù dǎ diànhuà gěi wǒ mā, ràng tā bǎ shǒujī ná dào ménkǒu, gěi wǒ tīngting jiē shang de shēngyīn: jīchē, miào lǐ de zhōng, hái yǒu gébì āmà zài mà tā de māo.","m":"Last time you asked how long I lived on Yongfu Road. Eighteen years — from when I was little until university, when I moved to Taipei. These days I was really homesick, so I called Mum and asked her to hold the phone up at the front door so I could hear the street: scooters, the temple bell, and the grandma next door scolding her cat.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在现在住的地方住多久了？","p":"Nǐ zài xiànzài zhù de dìfang zhù duō jiǔ le?","m":"How long have you lived where you are now?"},"replies":[{"t":"很多年了。","p":"Hěn duō nián le.","m":"Many years.","r":{"t":"那你一定也有一个看着你长大的老板。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng yě yǒu yí gè kàn zhe nǐ zhǎngdà de lǎobǎn.","m":"Then you must have a shop owner who watched you grow up too."}},{"t":"刚搬来不久。","p":"Gāng bān lái bù jiǔ.","m":"I moved here recently.","r":{"t":"那你一定也会想家，想的时候就打个电话。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng yě huì xiǎng jiā, xiǎng de shíhou jiù dǎ gè diànhuà.","m":"Then you'll get homesick too — when you do, just call home."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又打电话回家，听了一下街上的声音。","p":"Jīntiān yòu dǎ diànhuà huí jiā, tīng le yíxià jiē shang de shēngyīn.","m":"Called home again today, just to hear the street."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：这两天店里来了一个日本客人，指着菜单说「taro balls」。","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: zhè liǎng tiān diàn lǐ lái le yí gè Rìběn kèrén, zhǐ zhe càidān shuō “taro balls”.","m":"Guess what: a Japanese customer came into the shop these days, pointed at the menu and said 'taro balls'."},{"t":"我们两个的英文都不太好，可是一句一句，最后都听懂了：半糖，温的。","p":"Wǒmen liǎng gè de Yīngwén dōu bú tài hǎo, kěshì yí jù yí jù, zuìhòu dōu tīng dǒng le: bàn táng, wēn de.","m":"Neither of us speaks great English, but bit by bit we got there: half sugar, warm."},{"t":"他走的时候用中文说「谢谢」。我笑了一整个晚上。","p":"Tā zǒu de shíhou yòng Zhōngwén shuō “xièxie”. Wǒ xiào le yì zhěng gè wǎnshang.","m":"As he left he said 谢谢 in Chinese. I smiled all evening."}],"replies":[{"t":"你们都听懂了，好棒！","p":"Nǐmen dōu tīng dǒng le, hǎo bàng!","m":"You understood each other — great!","r":{"t":"对啊，不用说得很厉害，听得懂就好。","p":"Duì a, bú yòng shuō de hěn lìhai, tīng de dǒng jiù hǎo.","m":"Right — you don't have to be amazing, just understood."}},{"t":"taro balls 有人点了！","p":"Taro balls yǒu rén diǎn le!","m":"Someone ordered the taro balls!","r":{"t":"对！我的翻译成功了，哈哈。","p":"Duì! Wǒ de fānyì chénggōng le, hāha.","m":"Yes! My translation worked, haha."}}],"from":"2026-12-08"}},"2026-12-06|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-06","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My street is named after a church too.","p":"","m":"我家的路也是用教堂起的名字。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条街也是用教堂起的名","en":"Your street is named after a church too"},"later":{"t":"You said your street's named after a church too. This week I found an old map online of Church Street in 1900 — the church, a few fields, no supermarket. I stared at it for ages.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家那条街也是用教堂起的名。这周我在网上找到一张 1900 年的老地图，上面是教堂街——有教堂，有几块田，没有超市。我盯着看了好久。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you think your street looked like a hundred years ago?","p":"","m":"你觉得一百年前你那条街是什么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Probably fields.","p":"","m":"大概是田。","r":{"t":"Same as half of London, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，伦敦一半都是。"}},{"t":"No idea!","p":"","m":"完全不知道！","r":{"t":"Look it up sometime. It's addictive.","p":"","m":"哪天查查。会上瘾的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Looked at that old map again today.","p":"","m":"今天又看了那张老地图。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Yes, it's still there.","p":"","m":"有，还在。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条街的教堂还在","en":"The church your street's named after is still there"},"later":{"t":"You said your church is still there. Lucky! This week I went past where ours used to be — the supermarket. I bought a sandwich and thought, 'Sorry, church.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的教堂还在。真好！这周我经过我们那座教堂原来的位置——现在是超市。我买了个三明治，心想：「对不起了，教堂。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever been inside it?","p":"","m":"你进去过吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a few times.","p":"","m":"进去过几次。","r":{"t":"Nice. Old buildings have a special kind of quiet.","p":"","m":"真好。老房子里有一种特别的安静。"}},{"t":"No, I've only walked past.","p":"","m":"没有，只路过。","r":{"t":"Maybe one day. Just to see.","p":"","m":"也许哪天去看看。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought another sandwich at the old church site. Sorry, church.","p":"","m":"又在老教堂原址买了个三明治。对不起，教堂。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"No, it's gone too.","p":"","m":"没有，也没了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条街的教堂也没了","en":"The church your street's named after is gone too"},"later":{"t":"You said yours is gone too. We should start a club: streets with no church. This week I read that ours was pulled down long ago. The name just stayed.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边的也没了。我们应该成立一个俱乐部：没有教堂的教堂街。这周我读到，我们那座很早以前就拆了。名字就这么留了下来。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there anything left from the old days on your street?","p":"","m":"你那条街上还留着什么老东西吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"An old wall or two.","p":"","m":"一两堵老墙。","r":{"t":"History hiding in plain sight.","p":"","m":"历史就藏在眼皮底下。"}},{"t":"Nothing at all.","p":"","m":"什么都没有。","r":{"t":"Just the name, like ours.","p":"","m":"就剩个名字，跟我们一样。"}}],"next":{"t":"Streets-with-no-church club: two members.","p":"","m":"无教堂街道俱乐部：两个会员。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My street is just a number.","p":"","m":"我家的路只是一个数字。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条路只有一个数字","en":"Your street is just a number"},"later":{"t":"You said your street is just a number. I told my editor and she said, 'Imagine — no story to write.' Then she gave me a story to write. About street names.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家那条路只有一个数字。我跟主编说了，她说：「想想看——没故事可写。」然后她就给了我一个题目。写路名。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Would you like your street to have a name instead?","p":"","m":"你希望你那条路有个名字，而不是数字吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, something pretty.","p":"","m":"希望，一个好听的名字。","r":{"t":"Pick one. I'll call it that.","p":"","m":"挑一个。我就那么叫。"}},{"t":"No, the number is fine.","p":"","m":"不用，数字挺好。","r":{"t":"Practical. I respect that.","p":"","m":"实际。我尊重。"}}],"next":{"t":"Started the street-names story. Thought of your number.","p":"","m":"开始写路名的稿子了。想到了你那条数字路。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's there now?","p":"","m":"现在那儿是什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那里现在是什么（一家超市，名字留下了，教堂没了）","en":"You asked what's there now (a supermarket — the name stayed, the church didn't)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what's there now. A supermarket. This week I asked the oldest man in the queue if he remembers the church. He said, 'No, son, I'm not that old.' Fair.","p":"","m":"你上次问那里现在是什么。一家超市。这周我问排队的人里年纪最大的那位大爷，还记不记得那座教堂。他说：「不记得，小伙子，我还没那么老。」有道理。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there an older person near you who knows the area's history?","p":"","m":"你身边有没有一位老人，知道那片地方的历史？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my grandparents.","p":"","m":"有，我爷爷奶奶。","r":{"t":"Ask them everything. Seriously.","p":"","m":"什么都问问他们。真的。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then the library's the next best thing.","p":"","m":"那图书馆就是第二好的选择。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought a sandwich at the old church site today.","p":"","m":"今天在老教堂原址买了个三明治。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you look it up?","p":"","m":"你查过吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他有没有查过（查过一次，为了一篇没人看的稿子）","en":"You asked if he looked it up (once, for a story nobody read)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I looked it up. Once, for a story nobody read. This week my editor found it and wants to use it in a new piece. Years later. Patience pays.","p":"","m":"你上次问我有没有查过。查过一次，为了一篇没人看的稿子。这周主编翻到了，想用在一篇新稿子里。好几年以后。耐心是有回报的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you done something that only paid off much later?","p":"","m":"你有没有做过一件事，很久以后才有回报？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — learning a language.","p":"","m":"有，学语言。","r":{"t":"Best example there is.","p":"","m":"最好的例子。"}},{"t":"Not yet, I'm waiting.","p":"","m":"还没有，我在等。","r":{"t":"It'll come. Mine took years.","p":"","m":"会来的。我的花了好几年。"}}],"next":{"t":"My old story's getting a second life. Strange feeling.","p":"","m":"我的老稿子要有第二次生命了。感觉很奇妙。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Working on the live-alone piece. This week I interviewed a man who's lived in the same flat for forty years.","p":"","m":"在写一个人住的那篇。这周我采访了一位在同一套房子里住了四十年的大爷。"},{"t":"I asked if he ever gets lonely. He said: 'Never. I know every pigeon on this street by name.'","p":"","m":"我问他会不会孤单。他说：「从来不会。这条街上的每只鸽子我都叫得出名字。」"},{"t":"Possibly my favourite quote of the year.","p":"","m":"可能是我今年最喜欢的一句采访。"}],"replies":[{"t":"I love that answer.","p":"","m":"我好喜欢这个回答。","r":{"t":"Me too. I might steal it.","p":"","m":"我也是。我可能要借来用。"}},{"t":"Does he really name them?","p":"","m":"他真的给鸽子起名字吗？","r":{"t":"He does. One's called Gordon.","p":"","m":"真的。有一只叫 Gordon。"}}],"from":"2026-12-08"}},"2026-12-06|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-06","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My street is just a number too.","p":"","m":"我家的路也只是一个数字。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条路也只是一个数字","en":"Your street is just a number too"},"later":{"t":"You said your street's just a number too. This week I found out New York's streets got their numbers over two hundred years ago, so people wouldn't get lost. It works. Mostly.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家那条路也只是一个数字。这周我才知道，纽约的街两百多年前就编了号，为了让人不迷路。挺管用的。大部分时候。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you get lost easily?","p":"","m":"你容易迷路吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"容易，经常。","r":{"t":"Then move to a number street, honestly.","p":"","m":"那说实话，搬到数字街吧。"}},{"t":"No, I've got a good sense of direction.","p":"","m":"不，我方向感很好。","r":{"t":"Lucky. I still check my phone.","p":"","m":"真好。我还是要看手机。"}}],"next":{"t":"Walked twenty numbered blocks today. Didn't get lost.","p":"","m":"今天走了二十个数字街区。没迷路。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My street name has a story.","p":"","m":"我家的路名有个故事。"},"mem":{"zh":"你家那条路的名字有故事","en":"Your street name has a story"},"later":{"t":"You said your street name has a story. Lucky! This week I gave my street a secret name: 'Bread Cat Street', after Mango. Only you and me know.","p":"","m":"你上次说你家那条路的名字有故事。真好！这周我给我那条街起了个秘密名字：「面包猫街」，因为 Mango。只有你和我知道。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the story behind your street's name?","p":"","m":"你那条街的名字有什么故事？"},"replies":[{"t":"It's named after a person.","p":"","m":"是用一个人的名字起的。","r":{"t":"Cool. Maybe one day I'll learn who.","p":"","m":"酷。也许哪天我能知道是谁。"}},{"t":"It's about something that used to be there.","p":"","m":"跟以前在那儿的东西有关。","r":{"t":"I love that. A name that remembers.","p":"","m":"我喜欢这个。一个会记事的名字。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bread Cat Street says hi.","p":"","m":"「面包猫街」向你问好。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you like the numbers?","p":"","m":"你喜欢这些数字吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他喜不喜欢数字路名（喜欢，第一天就没迷路）","en":"You asked if he likes the numbers (yes — he never got lost, even on day one)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I like the numbers. Yes. This week a tourist asked me the way, and I answered straight away: 'Three blocks up, two over.' In English. Without thinking. Honestly, I felt great.","p":"","m":"你上次问我喜不喜欢数字路名。喜欢。这周有个游客问我路，我马上就答出来了：「往上三个街区，再往右两个。」用英语。想都没想。说实话，感觉好极了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever given directions in another language?","p":"","m":"你有没有用外语给人指过路？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it felt good.","p":"","m":"有，感觉很好。","r":{"t":"Right? Small win, big smile.","p":"","m":"对吧？小胜利，大笑容。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"You will. Practise 'two blocks up' first, haha.","p":"","m":"会有的。先练练「往前两个街区」，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Gave directions again today. Getting good at this.","p":"","m":"今天又给人指路了。越来越熟练了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Which street do you live on?","p":"","m":"你住在哪条街？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他住哪条街（他不想说，只说在一百多号）","en":"You asked which street he lives on (he'd rather not say — somewhere in the hundreds)"},"later":{"t":"You asked which street I live on. I'd rather not say, sorry! But I can tell you this: from my window I can see a water tower on the roof across the road. Very New York.","p":"","m":"你上次问我住哪条街。不好意思，我不想说！不过可以告诉你：从我的窗户能看到对面楼顶上的一个水塔。非常纽约。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What can you see from your window?","p":"","m":"你窗外能看到什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Other buildings.","p":"","m":"别的楼。","r":{"t":"City views. Same here.","p":"","m":"城市风景。我也是。"}},{"t":"Trees and sky.","p":"","m":"树和天空。","r":{"t":"Lucky. I'd swap my water tower for a tree.","p":"","m":"真好。我愿意拿水塔换一棵树。"}}],"next":{"t":"The water tower's still there, haha.","p":"","m":"水塔还在，哈哈。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"I started something new: one quick sketch on the subway every day.","p":"","m":"我开始了一件新事：每天在地铁上画一张速写。"},{"t":"This week a woman saw me drawing her dog and asked to see it. Then she asked if she could keep it. I said yes.","p":"","m":"这周一位女士看到我在画她的狗，想看看。然后她问能不能留下那张画。我答应了。"},{"t":"So now there's a drawing of mine somewhere in Brooklyn. Honestly, that makes me happy.","p":"","m":"所以现在布鲁克林某个地方有一张我的画。说实话，这让我很开心。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's so lovely.","p":"","m":"真好。","r":{"t":"Thanks. Best gift I've ever given a stranger.","p":"","m":"谢谢。我送给陌生人最好的礼物。"}},{"t":"Did the dog like it?","p":"","m":"那只狗喜欢吗？","r":{"t":"It sniffed it. I'm taking that as a yes.","p":"","m":"它闻了闻。我就当它喜欢了。"}}],"from":"2026-12-08"}},"2026-12-07|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-07","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也很冷。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě hěn lěng.","m":"It's cold here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很冷","en":"It's cold where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也很冷。这两天北京更冷了，我早上骑车，手套里还塞了一个暖宝宝，到学校手指头才不疼。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě hěn lěng. Zhè liǎng tiān Běijīng gèng lěng le, wǒ zǎoshang qí chē, shǒutào lǐ hái sāi le yí gè nuǎnbǎobao, dào xuéxiào shǒuzhǐtou cái bù téng.","m":"You said it's cold where you are too. Beijing's got even colder these days — I stuffed a heat pad into my glove for the morning ride, and only then did my fingers not hurt by the time I got to school.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冷的时候，最离不开什么？","p":"Nǐ lěng de shíhou, zuì lí bu kāi shénme?","m":"When it's cold, what can't you do without?"},"replies":[{"t":"一杯热的。","p":"Yì bēi rè de.","m":"A hot drink.","r":{"t":"对，捧在手里就暖和了。","p":"Duì, pěng zài shǒu lǐ jiù nuǎnhuo le.","m":"Right — just holding it warms you up."}},{"t":"厚被子。","p":"Hòu bèizi.","m":"A thick duvet.","r":{"t":"被窝最舒服，就是早上出不来。","p":"Bèiwō zuì shūfu, jiùshì zǎoshang chū bu lái.","m":"Bed's the cosiest — the problem is getting out in the morning."}}],"next":{"t":"今天也是零下，暖宝宝又用上了。","p":"Jīntiān yě shì língxià, nuǎnbǎobao yòu yòng shang le.","m":"Below zero again today — heat pad back in the glove."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在很热。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài hěn rè.","m":"It's hot here right now."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边现在很热","en":"It's hot where you are now"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边现在很热。这两天我一出门就想起你：我穿了三层，你可能只穿一件T恤。北京早上零下五度，我说话都冒白气。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān xiànzài hěn rè. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yì chūmén jiù xiǎng qǐ nǐ: wǒ chuān le sān céng, nǐ kěnéng zhǐ chuān yí jiàn T xù. Běijīng zǎoshang língxià wǔ dù, wǒ shuōhuà dōu mào bái qì.","m":"You said it's hot where you are. These days I think of you the moment I step outside: me in three layers, you maybe in a T-shirt. Beijing mornings are minus five — my breath comes out in white puffs.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边最热的时候有多热？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān zuì rè de shíhou yǒu duō rè?","m":"How hot does it get at its hottest where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"三十多度。","p":"Sānshí duō dù.","m":"Over thirty.","r":{"t":"那跟北京的夏天差不多，冬天就差远了，哈哈。","p":"Nà gēn Běijīng de xiàtiān chàbuduō, dōngtiān jiù chà yuǎn le, hāha.","m":"That's like a Beijing summer — winter's another story, haha."}},{"t":"不太热，二十几度。","p":"Bú tài rè, èrshí jǐ dù.","m":"Not very — in the twenties.","r":{"t":"二十几度最舒服了，我好羡慕。","p":"Èrshí jǐ dù zuì shūfu le, wǒ hǎo xiànmù.","m":"The twenties is perfect — I'm so jealous."}}],"next":{"t":"北京今天还是零下，想到你那边暖暖的。","p":"Běijīng jīntiān háishi língxià, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān nuǎnnuǎn de.","m":"Still below zero in Beijing today — thinking of your warm weather."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"屋里冷吗？","p":"Wū li lěng ma?","m":"Is it cold indoors?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她屋里冷不冷（不冷，北方有暖气，屋里能穿短袖）","en":"You asked if it's cold indoors (no — the north has heating, you can wear short sleeves inside)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我屋里冷不冷。不冷，就是太干了。这两天我在暖气片上放了一碗水，早上起来，水少了一半。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ wū lǐ lěng bu lěng. Bù lěng, jiùshì tài gān le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài nuǎnqìpiàn shang fàng le yì wǎn shuǐ, zǎoshang qǐlái, shuǐ shǎo le yíbàn.","m":"Last time you asked if it's cold indoors. No — just very dry. These days I put a bowl of water on the radiator, and by morning half of it was gone.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天屋里有暖气吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān wū lǐ yǒu nuǎnqì ma?","m":"Is there heating indoors in winter where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，挺暖和的。","p":"Yǒu, tǐng nuǎnhuo de.","m":"Yes — quite warm.","r":{"t":"那就好，冬天在家才舒服。","p":"Nà jiù hǎo, dōngtiān zài jiā cái shūfu.","m":"Good — winter at home is only nice when it's warm."}},{"t":"没有，屋里也很冷。","p":"Méiyǒu, wū lǐ yě hěn lěng.","m":"No — it's cold inside too.","r":{"t":"那可得多穿点儿，晚上盖厚被子。","p":"Nà kě děi duō chuān diǎnr, wǎnshang gài hòu bèizi.","m":"Then wrap up well, and use a thick duvet at night."}}],"next":{"t":"暖气片上的那碗水，今天又少了一半。","p":"Nuǎnqìpiàn shang de nà wǎn shuǐ, jīntiān yòu shǎo le yíbàn.","m":"The bowl of water on the radiator's half gone again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"北京下雪了吗？","p":"Běijīng xià xuě le ma?","m":"Has it snowed in Beijing yet?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过北京下雪了没有（还没有，北京冬天很干，雪不多）","en":"You asked if it's snowed in Beijing (not yet — Beijing winters are dry, not much snow)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问北京下雪了没有。还没有。这两天天气预报说可能下小雪，我的学生们天天问我：「老师，今天下吗？」比我还着急。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Běijīng xià xuě le méiyǒu. Hái méiyǒu. Zhè liǎng tiān tiānqì yùbào shuō kěnéng xià xiǎo xuě, wǒ de xuéshengmen tiāntiān wèn wǒ: “Lǎoshī, jīntiān xià ma?” Bǐ wǒ hái zháojí.","m":"Last time you asked if it's snowed in Beijing. Not yet. These days the forecast says light snow might come, and my students ask me every day: “Teacher, will it snow today?” They're more impatient than me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你见过雪吗？","p":"Nǐ jiànguo xuě ma?","m":"Have you ever seen snow?"},"replies":[{"t":"见过，我那边常下雪。","p":"Jiànguo, wǒ nàbiān cháng xià xuě.","m":"Yes — it snows a lot where I am.","r":{"t":"那你一定会堆雪人！","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng huì duī xuěrén!","m":"Then you must be a snowman expert!"}},{"t":"没见过，很想看。","p":"Méi jiànguo, hěn xiǎng kàn.","m":"Never — I'd love to.","r":{"t":"那下了雪，我第一个告诉你。","p":"Nà xià le xuě, wǒ dì yī gè gàosu nǐ.","m":"Then when it snows, you'll be the first to know."}}],"next":{"t":"今天还是没下雪，学生们又失望了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān háishi méi xià xuě, xuéshengmen yòu shīwàng le, hāha.","m":"Still no snow today — the students are disappointed again, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-07|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-07","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是早上冷、中午热。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì zǎoshang lěng, zhōngwǔ rè.","m":"Here too — cold mornings, warm middays."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是早上冷、中午热","en":"Mornings are cold and middays warm where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是早上冷、中午热！这两天我每天背一件外套出门，早上穿，中午脱，下午又穿。我妈说我像一个衣架，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì zǎoshang lěng, zhōngwǔ rè! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ měi tiān bēi yí jiàn wàitào chūmén, zǎoshang chuān, zhōngwǔ tuō, xiàwǔ yòu chuān. Wǒ mā shuō wǒ xiàng yí gè yījià, hāha.","m":"You said it's cold in the morning and warm at midday where you are too! These days I carry a jacket every day — on in the morning, off at midday, on again in the afternoon. My mum says I'm like a coat hanger, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出门会带一件外套吗？","p":"Nǐ chūmén huì dài yí jiàn wàitào ma?","m":"Do you take a jacket when you go out?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每天都带。","p":"Huì, měi tiān dōu dài.","m":"Yes, every day.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"不带，冷就忍一下。","p":"Bú dài, lěng jiù rěn yíxià.","m":"No — if I'm cold, I put up with it.","r":{"t":"你好勇敢！我做不到。","p":"Nǐ hǎo yǒnggǎn! Wǒ zuò bu dào.","m":"So brave! I couldn't."}}],"next":{"t":"今天外套又穿了三次，脱了两次，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān wàitào yòu chuān le sān cì, tuō le liǎng cì, hāha.","m":"Jacket on three times and off twice today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边冬天和夏天差别很大。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān dōngtiān hé xiàtiān chābié hěn dà.","m":"Winter and summer are really different here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边冬天和夏天差别很大","en":"Winter and summer are very different where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边冬天和夏天差别很大。我想了很久：真的冬天是什么样？这两天我问了成都的语伴，她说：「就是早上不想从被子里出来。」那我也懂一点！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān hé xiàtiān chābié hěn dà. Wǒ xiǎng le hěn jiǔ: zhēnde dōngtiān shì shénme yàng? Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn le Chéngdū de yǔbàn, tā shuō: “Jiù shì zǎoshang bù xiǎng cóng bèizi lǐ chūlái.” Nà wǒ yě dǒng yìdiǎn!","m":"You said winter and summer are very different where you are. I thought about it a lot: what is a real winter like? These days I asked my language partner in Chengdu, and she said: “It's not wanting to get out from under the duvet in the morning.” Then I understand a bit!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢哪个季节？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan nǎ gè jìjié?","m":"Which season do you like best?"},"replies":[{"t":"夏天。","p":"Xiàtiān.","m":"Summer.","r":{"t":"夏天好！可以天天出去玩。","p":"Xiàtiān hǎo! Kěyǐ tiāntiān chūqù wán.","m":"Summer's great! You can go out every day."}},{"t":"冬天，我喜欢冷一点。","p":"Dōngtiān, wǒ xǐhuan lěng yìdiǎn.","m":"Winter — I like it a bit cold.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 那你一定会堆雪人。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Nà nǐ yídìng huì duī xuěrén.","m":"¡Qué chévere! Then you must know how to make a snowman."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上我也不想从被子里出来，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang wǒ yě bù xiǎng cóng bèizi lǐ chūlái, hāha.","m":"I didn't want to get out from under the duvet this morning either, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最喜欢一天里的什么时候？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan yì tiān li de shénme shíhou?","m":"What's your favourite time of day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她最喜欢一天里的什么时候（中午，太阳出来了很舒服）","en":"You asked her favourite time of day (midday, when the sun comes out)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最喜欢一天里的什么时候。中午！这两天中午我都坐在家门口晒太阳，背生词。我的猫 Mochi 也来了，它比我更会晒太阳。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuì xǐhuan yì tiān lǐ de shénme shíhou. Zhōngwǔ! Zhè liǎng tiān zhōngwǔ wǒ dōu zuò zài jiā ménkǒu shài tàiyáng, bèi shēngcí. Wǒ de māo Mochi yě lái le, tā bǐ wǒ gèng huì shài tàiyáng.","m":"Last time you asked my favourite time of day. Midday! These days at noon I sit outside the front door in the sun, learning words. My cat Mochi joins me — she's much better at sunbathing than I am.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一天里最喜欢什么时候？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān lǐ zuì xǐhuan shénme shíhou?","m":"What's your favourite time of day?"},"replies":[{"t":"早上，很安静。","p":"Zǎoshang, hěn ānjìng.","m":"Morning — it's quiet.","r":{"t":"早上好！可是我起不来，哈哈。","p":"Zǎoshang hǎo! Kěshì wǒ qǐ bu lái, hāha.","m":"Mornings are nice! But I can't get up, haha."}},{"t":"晚上，可以休息。","p":"Wǎnshang, kěyǐ xiūxi.","m":"Evening — I can rest.","r":{"t":"对，晚上最舒服。","p":"Duì, wǎnshang zuì shūfu.","m":"Right, evenings are cosiest."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又跟 Mochi 一起晒太阳了。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu gēn Mochi yìqǐ shài tàiyáng le.","m":"Sunbathed with Mochi again at noon today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"波哥大会下雪吗？","p":"Bōgēdà huì xià xuě ma?","m":"Does it snow in Bogotá?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过波哥大会不会下雪（不会，有时候下冰雹）","en":"You asked if it snows in Bogotá (no — but sometimes it hails)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问波哥大会不会下雪。不会！可是这两天下了一场冰雹，街上白白的，像下了雪。我弟弟跑出去捡冰雹，说要放进冰箱里留着。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Bōgēdà huì bu huì xià xuě. Bú huì! Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān xià le yì cháng bīngbáo, jiē shang báibái de, xiàng xià le xuě. Wǒ dìdi pǎo chūqù jiǎn bīngbáo, shuō yào fàng jìn bīngxiāng lǐ liú zhe.","m":"Last time you asked if it snows in Bogotá. No! But these days we had a hailstorm and the streets went white, like snow. My little brother ran out to collect hailstones and said he'd keep them in the freezer.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候见过最奇怪的天气是什么？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou jiànguo zuì qíguài de tiānqì shì shénme?","m":"What's the strangest weather you saw as a kid?"},"replies":[{"t":"很大的冰雹。","p":"Hěn dà de bīngbáo.","m":"Huge hailstones.","r":{"t":"我们一样！冰雹好可怕。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Bīngbáo hǎo kěpà.","m":"Same! Hail is scary."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"I can't remember.","r":{"t":"没关系！我弟弟会记得这次的冰雹，哈哈。","p":"Méi guānxi! Wǒ dìdi huì jìde zhè cì de bīngbáo, hāha.","m":"That's okay! My brother will remember this hail, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"我弟弟今天又去看冰箱里的冰雹了，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ dìdi jīntiān yòu qù kàn bīngxiāng lǐ de bīngbáo le, hāha.","m":"My brother checked on his hailstones in the freezer again today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-07|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-07","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dark early here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也黑得很早。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边天也黑得早","en":"It gets dark early where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's dark early there too. So this week I kept my promise: candles at breakfast and dinner. My oldest now lights them every evening without being asked. A new family job.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也黑得早。所以这周我说到做到：早饭和晚饭都点蜡烛。现在我家老大每天晚上不用人说就去点。家里多了一份新工作。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What makes your home cosy in winter?","p":"","m":"冬天什么让你家里变得温馨？"},"replies":[{"t":"Soft lights.","p":"","m":"柔和的灯光。","r":{"t":"Ja, light is everything in winter.","p":"","m":"对，冬天光就是一切。"}},{"t":"Good food.","p":"","m":"好吃的。","r":{"t":"Of course. A warm kitchen is a warm home.","p":"","m":"当然。厨房暖了，家就暖了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Candles lit again at breakfast today.","p":"","m":"今天早饭又点了蜡烛。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's warm and sunny here.","p":"","m":"我这边又暖和又有太阳。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边又暖和又有太阳","en":"It's warm and sunny where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's warm and sunny where you are. This week I changed my phone background to a sunny beach. My colleague laughed: 'Elin, it's December.' I said: 'Exactly.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边又暖和又有太阳。这周我把手机背景换成了一片阳光海滩。同事笑我：「Elin，现在是十二月。」我说：「就是因为这样。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the weather like there this week?","p":"","m":"你那边这周天气怎么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Still warm.","p":"","m":"还是很暖和。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Think of me at half past three.","p":"","m":"真好。三点半的时候想想我。"}},{"t":"Getting a bit cooler.","p":"","m":"开始凉一点了。","r":{"t":"Then you can wear a scarf too!","p":"","m":"那你也可以围围巾了！"}}],"next":{"t":"Looked at my sunny beach background again today.","p":"","m":"今天又看了一眼手机上的阳光海滩。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does it snow in Malmö?","p":"","m":"马尔默会下雪吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过马尔默下不下雪（下一点，存不住，大多是雨）","en":"You asked if it snows in Malmö (a little, it doesn't stay — mostly rain)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it snows in Malmö. A little. This week it did — for about an hour. By lunch it was rain again. My kids built one snowman, about the size of a cup.","p":"","m":"你上次问马尔默下不下雪。下一点。这周真下了——大概一个小时。到午饭又变成雨了。孩子们堆了一个雪人，大概一个杯子那么大。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever built a snowman?","p":"","m":"你堆过雪人吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, as a kid.","p":"","m":"堆过，小时候。","r":{"t":"The best memories are made of snow.","p":"","m":"最好的回忆是雪做的。"}},{"t":"Never — there's no snow where I live.","p":"","m":"没有，我那边不下雪。","r":{"t":"Then a cup-sized one is a good start, ja!","p":"","m":"那从杯子那么大的开始，挺好！"}}],"next":{"t":"Rain again today. The tiny snowman is gone.","p":"","m":"今天又下雨了。那个小雪人没了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How do you stay cheerful?","p":"","m":"你怎么让自己开心起来？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她怎么保持好心情（蜡烛、灯、咖啡和朋友）","en":"You asked how she stays cheerful (candles, lamps, coffee and friends)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how I stay cheerful. Candles, lamps, coffee, friends. This week I added one more: a walk at lunchtime, even in the rain. Ten minutes of daylight. To be fair, it really helps.","p":"","m":"你上次问我怎么保持好心情。蜡烛、灯、咖啡、朋友。这周我又加了一样：午饭时间出去走走，下雨也去。十分钟的白天的光。说实话，真的有用。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your one trick for a gloomy day?","p":"","m":"阴沉沉的日子，你有什么小办法？"},"replies":[{"t":"Music.","p":"","m":"音乐。","r":{"t":"Good one. Mine is old Swedish pop — sorry.","p":"","m":"好办法。我的是瑞典老流行歌——抱歉。"}},{"t":"Talking to a friend.","p":"","m":"跟朋友聊天。","r":{"t":"The best one. That's why we're talking now.","p":"","m":"最好的办法。所以我们现在在聊。"}}],"next":{"t":"Took my ten-minute daylight walk again.","p":"","m":"今天又走了十分钟，晒晒白天的光。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-07|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-07","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's raining here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也在下雨。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也在下雨","en":"It's raining where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's raining there too. This week the rain came every afternoon at three, like a clock. I learned to finish my orders by half two. Bro, I'm a weather expert now.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也在下雨。这周雨每天下午三点准时来，像闹钟一样。我学会了两点半前把单子送完。兄弟，我现在是天气专家了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does the rain come at the same time every day where you are?","p":"","m":"你那边雨每天都同一个时间下吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"No, it's random.","p":"","m":"不是，没准。","r":{"t":"Then you need an umbrella always, bro.","p":"","m":"那你得一直带伞，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Pretty much.","p":"","m":"差不多。","r":{"t":"Then we're both weather experts!","p":"","m":"那我们都是天气专家了！"}}],"next":{"t":"Three o'clock rain, right on time today.","p":"","m":"今天三点的雨，准时到了。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Yes, always.","p":"","m":"带了，一直带着。"},"mem":{"zh":"你总是带伞","en":"You always carry an umbrella"},"later":{"t":"You said you always carry an umbrella. Smart. This week I gave mine to a passenger who had nothing — an old lady going to the market. She said I'm her grandson now, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次说你总是带伞。聪明。这周我把我的伞给了一个没带伞的乘客——一位去市场的老奶奶。她说我现在是她孙子了，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever given something small to a stranger?","p":"","m":"你有没有给过陌生人一点小东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, sometimes.","p":"","m":"有，有时候。","r":{"t":"Small things, big smiles.","p":"","m":"小东西，大笑容。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Try once. It feels good, bro.","p":"","m":"试一次。感觉很好，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought a new umbrella for me today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天给自己买了把新伞，哈哈。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"No, I forgot it.","p":"","m":"没带，忘了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那天忘了带伞","en":"You forgot your umbrella that day"},"later":{"t":"You said you forgot your umbrella. I hope you found a café! This week I forgot my raincoat — a whole hour under a shop roof with three cats. Nice cats, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你忘了带伞。希望你找到咖啡馆了！这周我忘了带雨衣——在一家店的屋檐下躲了一个小时，旁边有三只猫。猫很友好，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do when you get caught in the rain?","p":"","m":"被雨困住的时候，你会做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Wait it out.","p":"","m":"等雨停。","r":{"t":"Same. Rain doesn't last forever.","p":"","m":"一样。雨不会一直下。"}},{"t":"Just run.","p":"","m":"直接跑。","r":{"t":"Brave! I tried once. Very wet.","p":"","m":"勇敢！我试过一次。湿透了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Raincoat in my bag today. Learned my lesson.","p":"","m":"今天雨衣在包里。学乖了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's cold and dry here.","p":"","m":"我这边又冷又干。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边又冷又干","en":"It's cold and dry where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's cold and dry there. This week a mall here made a 'winter corner' with fake snow. My kids played in it for an hour. Not real cold — but they were happy, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边又冷又干。这周这儿一家商场弄了个「冬天角」，有假雪。孩子们在里面玩了一个小时。不是真的冷——可是他们很开心，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you like about cold weather?","p":"","m":"冷天你喜欢什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Wearing cosy clothes.","p":"","m":"穿暖暖的衣服。","r":{"t":"I wish I could wear a jumper just once!","p":"","m":"真希望我也能穿一次毛衣！"}},{"t":"Nothing — I prefer warm.","p":"","m":"没什么，我喜欢暖和的。","r":{"t":"Then come to Jakarta, bro!","p":"","m":"那来雅加达吧，兄弟！"}}],"next":{"t":"Thirty-two degrees again. Thinking of your jumper weather.","p":"","m":"又是三十二度。想着你那边穿毛衣的天气。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How hot is it?","p":"","m":"有多热？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过雅加达有多热（三十二度左右，很闷）","en":"You asked how hot it is (about thirty-two, very sticky)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how hot it is. Thirty-two and sticky. This week my helmet got so hot in the sun that I put a wet cloth inside. My wife laughed — then copied me.","p":"","m":"你上次问有多热。三十二度，很闷。这周我的头盔在太阳下热得不行，我在里面垫了一块湿毛巾。我老婆笑我——然后她也学了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your trick for hot days?","p":"","m":"热天你有什么小窍门？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cold showers.","p":"","m":"冲凉水澡。","r":{"t":"Good one! Me, three times a day.","p":"","m":"好办法！我一天冲三次。"}},{"t":"Stay indoors.","p":"","m":"待在屋里。","r":{"t":"Smart. I can't — I'm on the road.","p":"","m":"聪明。我不行——我在路上。"}}],"next":{"t":"Wet cloth in the helmet again today.","p":"","m":"今天头盔里又放了湿毛巾。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does the rain cool things down?","p":"","m":"下雨会凉快一点吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过雨会不会让天凉快一点（凉快一个小时，然后又闷了）","en":"You asked if the rain cools things down (for an hour, then it's steamy again)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the rain cools things down. For one hour. This week I used that hour well: after the rain, I sat on the step with my kids and we counted frogs. Eleven!","p":"","m":"你上次问雨会不会让天凉快一点。凉快一个小时。这周我好好用了那一个小时：雨停以后，我跟孩子们坐在门口台阶上数青蛙。十一只！","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do right after the rain stops?","p":"","m":"雨刚停的时候，你会做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Go out for a walk.","p":"","m":"出去走走。","r":{"t":"Best time. Everything smells fresh.","p":"","m":"最好的时候。什么都闻着很清新。"}},{"t":"Nothing special.","p":"","m":"没什么特别的。","r":{"t":"Try counting frogs, bro. Very relaxing.","p":"","m":"试试数青蛙，兄弟。很放松。"}}],"next":{"t":"Counted frogs again today. Nine.","p":"","m":"今天又数了青蛙。九只。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-07|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-07","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's hot here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也很热。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很热","en":"It's hot where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's hot there too. This week the harmattan dust was so thick that I could look straight at the sun at noon — just a white ball. My grandmother says that's how she knows Christmas is coming.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也很热。这周哈马丹风的灰特别厚，中午我能直接看太阳——就是一个白白的球。我奶奶说，看到这样的太阳，她就知道圣诞节要到了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What tells you the holidays are coming where you live?","p":"","m":"在你那边，什么让你知道节日要到了？"},"replies":[{"t":"The decorations.","p":"","m":"街上的装饰。","r":{"t":"Same here — but with dust on top, haha.","p":"","m":"这儿也是——只是上面落了灰，哈哈。"}},{"t":"The weather changes.","p":"","m":"天气变了。","r":{"t":"Right? The sky tells you first.","p":"","m":"对吧？天空最先告诉你。"}}],"next":{"t":"White sun again today, chale.","p":"","m":"今天又是白太阳，兄弟。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's freezing here.","p":"","m":"我这边冷死了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边冷得要命","en":"It's freezing where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's freezing there. I can't imagine it. Here, 'cold' means twenty degrees at six a.m., and everyone puts on a jacket.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边冷得要命。我想象不出来。在这儿，「冷」就是早上六点二十度，大家都穿上外套。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the coldest you've ever been?","p":"","m":"你经历过最冷的时候是什么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Below minus ten.","p":"","m":"零下十度以下。","r":{"t":"Chale! I'd turn into ice.","p":"","m":"兄弟！我会变成冰的。"}},{"t":"Not that cold, really.","p":"","m":"其实没那么冷。","r":{"t":"Good. Cold is overrated, haha.","p":"","m":"好。冷被高估了，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Twenty degrees this morning. I wore a jacket, haha.","p":"","m":"今天早上二十度。我穿外套了，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you like the Harmattan?","p":"","m":"你喜欢哈马丹风吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他喜不喜欢哈马丹风（不太喜欢，什么都是灰）","en":"You asked if he likes the harmattan (not really — everything gets dusty)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I like the harmattan. Not really. This week I had to clean my studio keyboard three times. Dust gets into everything — maybe even the songs.","p":"","m":"你上次问我喜不喜欢哈马丹风。不太喜欢。这周我把录音室的键盘擦了三遍。灰什么都钻得进去——说不定连歌里都有。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a season you don't like?","p":"","m":"有没有哪个季节你不喜欢？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, the rainy one.","p":"","m":"有，雨季。","r":{"t":"Fair. Every place has its tough season.","p":"","m":"有道理。每个地方都有难熬的季节。"}},{"t":"No, I like them all.","p":"","m":"没有，都喜欢。","r":{"t":"Respect. Teach me to love dust, haha.","p":"","m":"佩服。教我爱上灰尘吧，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Cleaned my keyboard again today. Dust wins.","p":"","m":"今天又擦了键盘。灰尘赢了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does it affect your music?","p":"","m":"会影响你做音乐吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过哈马丹风影不影响他做音乐（嗓子干，一阵子不能唱）","en":"You asked if the harmattan affects his music (dry throat — no singing for a while)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it affects my music. Yes — dry throat, no singing. This week my mum made me ginger tea with honey every evening. Day two, I could hum. Day three, I recorded a chorus.","p":"","m":"你上次问哈马丹风影不影响我做音乐。影响——嗓子干，不能唱。这周我妈每天晚上给我煮蜂蜜姜茶。第二天我能哼了。第三天我录了一段副歌。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you drink when your throat's dry?","p":"","m":"你嗓子干的时候喝什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Warm water with honey.","p":"","m":"温水加蜂蜜。","r":{"t":"Same idea! Mums know everything.","p":"","m":"一个思路！妈妈什么都懂。"}},{"t":"Just tea.","p":"","m":"就喝茶。","r":{"t":"Tea works too.","p":"","m":"茶也行。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hummed a little today. The voice is back, chale.","p":"","m":"今天哼了一会儿。嗓子回来了，兄弟。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-08|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-08","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今天也围了围巾。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān yě wéi le wéijīn.","m":"I wore a scarf today too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那天也围了围巾","en":"You wore a scarf that day too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那天也围了围巾。这两天我在里斯本的跳蚤市场又买了一条，是手织的，卖东西的奶奶说是她自己织的。现在我有两条，可以换着围。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nà tiān yě wéi le wéijīn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài Lǐsīběn de tiàozao shìchǎng yòu mǎi le yì tiáo, shì shǒu zhī de, mài dōngxi de nǎinai shuō shì tā zìjǐ zhī de. Xiànzài wǒ yǒu liǎng tiáo, kěyǐ huàn zhe wéi.","m":"You said you wore a scarf that day too. These days I bought another one at Lisbon's flea market — hand-knitted; the old lady selling it said she made it herself. Now I've got two to swap between.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天最离不开哪件衣服？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zuì lí bu kāi nǎ jiàn yīfu?","m":"Which piece of clothing can't you do without in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"一件厚外套。","p":"Yí jiàn hòu wàitào.","m":"A thick coat.","r":{"t":"对！厚外套最可靠。","p":"Duì! Hòu wàitào zuì kěkào.","m":"Yes! A thick coat never lets you down."}},{"t":"我那边冬天不冷，没有特别的。","p":"Wǒ nàbiān dōngtiān bù lěng, méiyǒu tèbié de.","m":"Our winters aren't cold, so nothing special.","r":{"t":"真好，我好羡慕。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, wǒ hǎo xiànmù.","m":"Lovely — I'm so jealous."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又把围巾绕了三圈才出门。","p":"Jīntiān yòu bǎ wéijīn rào le sān quān cái chūmén.","m":"Wound my scarf round three times again before heading out today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今天只穿了一件T恤。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān zhǐ chuān le yí jiàn T xù.","m":"I only wore a T-shirt today."},"mem":{"zh":"你那天只穿了一件T恤","en":"You wore just a T-shirt that day"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那天只穿了一件T恤。我一边围围巾一边想你。这两天我在青旅认识了一个从新加坡来的女生，她也一直穿T恤，她说：「我的冬天就是空调。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nà tiān zhǐ chuān le yí jiàn T xù. Wǒ yìbiān wéi wéijīn yìbiān xiǎng nǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài qīnglǚ rènshi le yí gè cóng Xīnjiāpō lái de nǚshēng, tā yě yìzhí chuān T xù, tā shuō: “Wǒ de dōngtiān jiù shì kōngtiáo.”","m":"You said you wore just a T-shirt that day. I thought of you while winding on my scarf. These days I met a girl from Singapore at the hostel who wears T-shirts all the time too. She said: “My winter is the air-con.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边一年里最冷的时候有多冷？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yì nián lǐ zuì lěng de shíhou yǒu duō lěng?","m":"How cold does it get at its coldest where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"也就二十度左右。","p":"Yě jiù èrshí dù zuǒyòu.","m":"Only about twenty degrees.","r":{"t":"二十度！那是我最喜欢的温度。","p":"Èrshí dù! Nà shì wǒ zuì xǐhuan de wēndù.","m":"Twenty! That's my favourite temperature."}},{"t":"其实冬天也挺冷的。","p":"Qíshí dōngtiān yě tǐng lěng de.","m":"Actually, winter gets pretty cold.","r":{"t":"那你也懂围巾的好了！","p":"Nà nǐ yě dǒng wéijīn de hǎo le!","m":"Then you know why scarves are great!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天里斯本出太阳了，可我还是围着围巾。","p":"Jīntiān Lǐsīběn chū tàiyáng le, kě wǒ háishi wéi zhe wéijīn.","m":"Sunny in Lisbon today, but I've still got my scarf on."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"围巾有多长？","p":"Wéijīn yǒu duō cháng?","m":"How long is the scarf?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她的围巾有多长（差不多两米，要绕三圈）","en":"You asked how long her scarf is (about two metres — three times round)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我的围巾有多长。两米。这两天坐电车的时候，围巾被车门夹住了，我差点被电车带走，哈哈。还好司机看到了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ de wéijīn yǒu duō cháng. Liǎng mǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān zuò diànchē de shíhou, wéijīn bèi chēmén jiā zhù le, wǒ chà diǎn bèi diànchē dài zǒu, hāha. Hái hǎo sījī kàn dào le.","m":"Last time you asked how long my scarf is. Two metres. These days it got caught in a tram door and I nearly got carried off with the tram, haha. Luckily the driver saw.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有因为衣服出过糗？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yīnwèi yīfu chūguo qiǔ?","m":"Have you ever had an embarrassing moment because of clothes?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，穿错了鞋子。","p":"Yǒu, chuān cuò le xiézi.","m":"Yes — I wore odd shoes.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们都一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen dōu yíyàng!","m":"Haha, we're all the same!"}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那你比我小心多了。","p":"Nà nǐ bǐ wǒ xiǎoxīn duō le.","m":"Then you're much more careful than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天坐电车，我先把围巾收好了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān zuò diànchē, wǒ xiān bǎ wéijīn shōu hǎo le, hāha.","m":"On the tram today I tucked my scarf in first, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"里斯本冬天冷吗？","p":"Lǐsīběn dōngtiān lěng ma?","m":"Is Lisbon cold in winter?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过里斯本冬天冷不冷（外面十几度，房子里冷，没有暖气）","en":"You asked if Lisbon winters are cold (low teens outside, cold indoors — no heating)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问里斯本冬天冷不冷。外面还好，屋里冷。这两天青旅的老板给每个房间送了一个热水袋，大家晚上都抱着它睡，像抱着一只小猫。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Lǐsīběn dōngtiān lěng bu lěng. Wàimiàn hái hǎo, wū lǐ lěng. Zhè liǎng tiān qīnglǚ de lǎobǎn gěi měi gè fángjiān sòng le yí gè rèshuǐdài, dàjiā wǎnshang dōu bào zhe tā shuì, xiàng bào zhe yì zhī xiǎo māo.","m":"Last time you asked if Lisbon winters are cold. Fine outside, cold inside. These days the hostel owner gave every room a hot-water bottle, and now everyone sleeps hugging one, like a little cat.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里冬天怎么取暖？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ dōngtiān zěnme qǔnuǎn?","m":"How do you keep warm at home in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"开暖气。","p":"Kāi nuǎnqì.","m":"The heating.","r":{"t":"真好！我现在最想要的就是暖气。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Wǒ xiànzài zuì xiǎng yào de jiù shì nuǎnqì.","m":"Lucky! Heating is what I want most right now."}},{"t":"多穿衣服，盖厚被子。","p":"Duō chuān yīfu, gài hòu bèizi.","m":"More layers and a thick duvet.","r":{"t":"跟我在里斯本一样！","p":"Gēn wǒ zài Lǐsīběn yíyàng!","m":"Same as me in Lisbon!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又抱着热水袋睡。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu bào zhe rèshuǐdài shuì.","m":"Hugging my hot-water bottle again tonight."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-08|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-08","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今天也穿了羽绒服。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān yě chuān le yǔróngfú.","m":"I wore a down jacket today too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那天也穿了羽绒服","en":"You wore a down jacket that day too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那天也穿了羽绒服。这两天我带 Biscuit 出去散步，它也穿上了它的小外套。它十二岁了，怕冷，跟我一样。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nà tiān yě chuān le yǔróngfú. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dài Biscuit chūqù sànbù, tā yě chuān shang le tā de xiǎo wàitào. Tā shí'èr suì le, pà lěng, gēn wǒ yíyàng.","m":"You said you wore a down jacket that day too. These days when I take Biscuit for a walk, he wears his little coat as well. He's twelve and feels the cold — just like me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天出门最怕哪儿冷？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān chūmén zuì pà nǎr lěng?","m":"When you go out in winter, which part of you feels the cold most?"},"replies":[{"t":"手。","p":"Shǒu.","m":"My hands.","r":{"t":"对，所以我织了手套。","p":"Duì, suǒyǐ wǒ zhī le shǒutào.","m":"Right — that's why I knitted gloves."}},{"t":"耳朵。","p":"Ěrduo.","m":"My ears.","r":{"t":"那要戴帽子！我的帽子是红色的。","p":"Nà yào dài màozi! Wǒ de màozi shì hóngsè de.","m":"Then wear a hat! Mine's red."}}],"next":{"t":"今天带 Biscuit 散步，它又穿着小外套。","p":"Jīntiān dài Biscuit sànbù, tā yòu chuān zhe xiǎo wàitào.","m":"Walked Biscuit today — little coat on again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今天穿得很少，不冷。","p":"Wǒ jīntiān chuān de hěn shǎo, bù lěng.","m":"I'm not wearing much today — it's not cold."},"mem":{"zh":"你那天穿得很少，不冷","en":"You wore very little that day and weren't cold"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你穿得很少，不冷。我好羡慕。这两天我在想桂林的事：梁阿姨说，四月的桂林不冷，可是常下雨。我已经开始想带几件衣服了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ chuān de hěn shǎo, bù lěng. Wǒ hǎo xiànmù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng Guìlín de shì: Liáng āyí shuō, sì yuè de Guìlín bù lěng, kěshì cháng xià yǔ. Wǒ yǐjīng kāishǐ xiǎng dài jǐ jiàn yīfu le.","m":"You said you wore very little and weren't cold. So jealous. These days I've been thinking about Guilin: Auntie Liang says it's not cold there in April, but it rains a lot. I've already started thinking about what clothes to pack.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出门旅行，喜欢带很多衣服吗？","p":"Nǐ chūmén lǚxíng, xǐhuan dài hěn duō yīfu ma?","m":"When you travel, do you pack lots of clothes?"},"replies":[{"t":"带很多，怕不够。","p":"Dài hěn duō, pà bú gòu.","m":"Lots — in case I run out.","r":{"t":"我也是！我的箱子总是太满。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ de xiāngzi zǒngshì tài mǎn.","m":"Me too! My suitcase is always too full."}},{"t":"带很少，轻松一点。","p":"Dài hěn shǎo, qīngsōng yìdiǎn.","m":"Very little — it's easier.","r":{"t":"聪明。我要跟你学。","p":"Cōngming. Wǒ yào gēn nǐ xué.","m":"Smart. I'll learn from you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在想去桂林要带什么衣服。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài xiǎng qù Guìlín yào dài shénme yīfu.","m":"Thinking about what to pack for Guilin again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"今天伦敦几度？","p":"Jīntiān Lúndūn jǐ dù?","m":"How cold is London today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过伦敦那天几度（三度，有风，感觉更冷）","en":"You asked the temperature in London (three degrees, windy, feels colder)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问伦敦几度。三度。这两天更冷了，早上我家花园的草都白了，是霜。我站在窗户前面看了很久，很好看。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Lúndūn jǐ dù. Sān dù. Zhè liǎng tiān gèng lěng le, zǎoshang wǒ jiā huāyuán de cǎo dōu bái le, shì shuāng. Wǒ zhàn zài chuānghu qiánmiàn kàn le hěn jiǔ, hěn hǎokàn.","m":"Last time you asked the temperature in London. Three degrees. These days it's colder — in the mornings the grass in my garden is white with frost. I stood at the window looking for a long time. Very pretty.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天会结霜吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān huì jié shuāng ma?","m":"Do you get frost in winter where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，早上车窗上都是。","p":"Huì, zǎoshang chēchuāng shang dōu shì.","m":"Yes — all over the car windows in the morning.","r":{"t":"那你早上也要刮车窗吧！","p":"Nà nǐ zǎoshang yě yào guā chēchuāng ba!","m":"Then you have to scrape the windscreen too!"}},{"t":"不会，太暖和了。","p":"Bú huì, tài nuǎnhuo le.","m":"No — too warm.","r":{"t":"真好，你不用刮车窗。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, nǐ bú yòng guā chēchuāng.","m":"Lucky — no scraping for you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上花园里又是白白的霜。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang huāyuán lǐ yòu shì báibái de shuāng.","m":"White frost in the garden again this morning."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"帽子和手套是什么颜色的？","p":"Màozi hé shǒutào shì shénme yánsè de?","m":"What colour are the hat and gloves?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她的帽子和手套是什么颜色（红色的，自己织的，织了一个冬天）","en":"You asked what colour her hat and gloves are (red — she knitted them over a whole winter)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我的帽子和手套是什么颜色。红色的，我自己织的。这两天我开始织一条新的围巾，是给我孙子的。他们圣诞节要从曼彻斯特来伦敦。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ de màozi hé shǒutào shì shénme yánsè. Hóngsè de, wǒ zìjǐ zhī de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ kāishǐ zhī yì tiáo xīn de wéijīn, shì gěi wǒ sūnzi de. Tāmen Shèngdàn Jié yào cóng Mànchèsītè lái Lúndūn.","m":"Last time you asked what colour my hat and gloves are. Red — I knitted them. These days I've started a new scarf for my grandson. They're coming down from Manchester to London for Christmas.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会做手工吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zuò shǒugōng ma?","m":"Do you do any crafts?"},"replies":[{"t":"会一点。","p":"Huì yìdiǎn.","m":"A little.","r":{"t":"好！手做的东西，最暖和的。","p":"Hǎo! Shǒu zuò de dōngxi, zuì nuǎnhuo de.","m":"Lovely! Handmade things are the warmest."}},{"t":"不会，我手很笨。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ shǒu hěn bèn.","m":"No — I'm all thumbs.","r":{"t":"我以前也很笨，慢慢就会了。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě hěn bèn, mànmàn jiù huì le.","m":"I was clumsy too once — it comes slowly."}}],"next":{"t":"围巾今天又织了十厘米。","p":"Wéijīn jīntiān yòu zhī le shí límǐ.","m":"Another ten centimetres of scarf today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-08|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-08","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边中午也很暖和。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān zhōngwǔ yě hěn nuǎnhuo.","m":"It's warm at midday here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边中午也很暖和","en":"Middays are warm where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边中午也很暖和。这两天我带团去金字塔，中午太阳很大，一个从哈尔滨来的游客说：「这是我今年最暖和的十二月。」准确地说，哈尔滨那天是零下二十度。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān zhōngwǔ yě hěn nuǎnhuo. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dài tuán qù jīnzìtǎ, zhōngwǔ tàiyáng hěn dà, yí gè cóng Hā'ěrbīn lái de yóukè shuō: “Zhè shì wǒ jīnnián zuì nuǎnhuo de shí'èr yuè.” Zhǔnquè de shuō, Hā'ěrbīn nà tiān shì língxià èrshí dù.","m":"You said middays are warm where you are too. These days I took a group to the pyramids — strong sun at noon — and a tourist from Harbin said: “This is the warmest December of my life.” To be precise, Harbin was minus twenty that day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你更怕热还是更怕冷？","p":"Nǐ gèng pà rè háishi gèng pà lěng?","m":"Do you mind heat or cold more?"},"replies":[{"t":"怕冷。","p":"Pà lěng.","m":"Cold.","r":{"t":"那冬天来开罗最好。","p":"Nà dōngtiān lái Kāiluó zuì hǎo.","m":"Then Cairo in winter is perfect for you."}},{"t":"怕热。","p":"Pà rè.","m":"Heat.","r":{"t":"那夏天千万别来，哈哈。","p":"Nà xiàtiān qiānwàn bié lái, hāha.","m":"Then whatever you do, don't come in summer, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又把外套脱了。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu bǎ wàitào tuō le.","m":"Jacket off again at midday today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边一整天都很冷。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yì zhěng tiān dōu hěn lěng.","m":"It's cold all day here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边一整天都很冷","en":"It's cold all day where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边一整天都很冷。这两天我妈的围巾织好了——是给我申请去台湾准备的。我试了一下，在开罗太热了，可是她说：「台北会冷的。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yì zhěng tiān dōu hěn lěng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā de wéijīn zhī hǎo le —— shì wèi wǒ shēnqǐng qù Táiwān zhǔnbèi de. Wǒ shì le yíxià, zài Kāiluó tài rè le, kěshì tā shuō: “Táiběi huì lěng de.”","m":"You said it's cold all day where you are. These days my mum finished knitting her scarf — it's for if I go to Taiwan. I tried it on: far too hot for Cairo. But she said: “Taipei will be cold.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人给你织过或者做过什么东西吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén gěi nǐ zhīguo huòzhě zuòguo shénme dōngxi ma?","m":"Has anyone in your family knitted or made something for you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我奶奶织过毛衣。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ nǎinai zhīguo máoyī.","m":"Yes — my grandma knitted me a jumper.","r":{"t":"那是最暖和的毛衣。","p":"Nà shì zuì nuǎnhuo de máoyī.","m":"That's the warmest jumper there is."}},{"t":"没有，可是送过礼物。","p":"Méiyǒu, kěshì sòngguo lǐwù.","m":"No, but they've given me presents.","r":{"t":"礼物也是心意。","p":"Lǐwù yě shì xīnyì.","m":"Presents carry the same love."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又把妈妈织的围巾拿出来看了看。","p":"Jīntiān yòu bǎ māma zhī de wéijīn ná chūlái kàn le kàn.","m":"Took out Mum's scarf to look at it again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"开罗现在多少度？","p":"Kāiluó xiànzài duōshao dù?","m":"What's the temperature in Cairo now?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过开罗现在多少度（中午二十度左右，晚上十几度）","en":"You asked Cairo's temperature (around twenty at midday, teens at night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问开罗现在多少度。中午二十度左右。这两天我查了台北的天气：也是十几度到二十度。准确地说，跟开罗的冬天差不多！我妈听了，放心了一点。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Kāiluó xiànzài duōshao dù. Zhōngwǔ èrshí dù zuǒyòu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ chá le Táiběi de tiānqì: yě shì shí jǐ dù dào èrshí dù. Zhǔnquè de shuō, gēn Kāiluó de dōngtiān chàbuduō! Wǒ mā tīng le, fàngxīn le yìdiǎn.","m":"Last time you asked Cairo's temperature. Around twenty at midday. These days I checked Taipei's weather: teens to twenty as well. To be precise, about the same as a Cairo winter! When Mum heard, she relaxed a little.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出门前会查天气吗？","p":"Nǐ chūmén qián huì chá tiānqì ma?","m":"Do you check the weather before going out?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每天都查。","p":"Huì, měi tiān dōu chá.","m":"Yes, every day.","r":{"t":"好习惯。","p":"Hǎo xíguàn.","m":"Good habit."}},{"t":"不查，看窗外就知道了。","p":"Bù chá, kàn chuāng wài jiù zhīdào le.","m":"No — I just look out of the window.","r":{"t":"这个办法最简单！","p":"Zhège bànfǎ zuì jiǎndān!","m":"The simplest method!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又查了一下台北的天气，十八度。","p":"Jīntiān yòu chá le yíxià Táiběi de tiānqì, shíbā dù.","m":"Checked Taipei's weather again today — eighteen degrees."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们冬天会穿很厚的衣服吗？","p":"Nǐmen dōngtiān huì chuān hěn hòu de yīfu ma?","m":"Do you wear thick clothes in winter?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们冬天穿不穿很厚的衣服（有的人会，奶奶二十度就穿大衣）","en":"You asked if they wear thick clothes in winter (some do — Grandma wears a coat at twenty degrees)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们冬天穿不穿很厚的衣服。我奶奶二十度就穿大衣。这两天她听说我申请去台湾，送了我一件她年轻时候的大衣，说：「要是去了那边，就穿这个。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen dōngtiān chuān bu chuān hěn hòu de yīfu. Wǒ nǎinai èrshí dù jiù chuān dàyī. Zhè liǎng tiān tā tīngshuō wǒ shēnqǐng qù Táiwān, sòng le wǒ yí jiàn tā niánqīng shíhou de dàyī, shuō: “Yàoshi qù le nàbiān, jiù chuān zhège.”","m":"Last time you asked if we wear thick clothes in winter. Grandma wears a coat at twenty degrees. These days she heard I'd applied to Taiwan and gave me a coat from when she was young: “If you go, wear this.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一件很旧、可是舍不得扔的衣服？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí jiàn hěn jiù, kěshì shěbude rēng de yīfu?","m":"Do you have an old piece of clothing you can't bear to throw away?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一件旧毛衣。","p":"Yǒu, yí jiàn jiù máoyī.","m":"Yes — an old jumper.","r":{"t":"旧毛衣最舒服了。","p":"Jiù máoyī zuì shūfu le.","m":"Old jumpers are the comfiest."}},{"t":"没有，我常常换新的。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ chángcháng huàn xīn de.","m":"No — I often get new things.","r":{"t":"那你一定很会挑衣服。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn huì tiāo yīfu.","m":"Then you must have a good eye for clothes."}}],"next":{"t":"今天试了一下奶奶的大衣，太大了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān shì le yíxià nǎinai de dàyī, tài dà le, hāha.","m":"Tried on Grandma's coat today — far too big, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-08|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-08","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I wore a raincoat too.","p":"","m":"我也穿了雨衣。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那天也穿了雨衣","en":"You wore a raincoat that day too"},"later":{"t":"You said you wore a raincoat too. Good call. This week mine finally earned its keep — sideways rain on Waterloo Bridge. The umbrella people gave up. Raincoat people: undefeated.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也穿了雨衣。明智。这周我的雨衣终于派上大用场了——滑铁卢桥上的雨是横着下的。打伞的人都放弃了。穿雨衣的人：不败。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you a raincoat or an umbrella person?","p":"","m":"你是穿雨衣派还是打伞派？"},"replies":[{"t":"Raincoat.","p":"","m":"雨衣。","r":{"t":"Welcome to the winning team.","p":"","m":"欢迎加入胜利的一方。"}},{"t":"Umbrella.","p":"","m":"打伞。","r":{"t":"Brave. Avoid bridges.","p":"","m":"勇敢。避开桥。"}}],"next":{"t":"Raincoat on again. Undefeated.","p":"","m":"又穿雨衣了。不败。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I didn't need a coat today.","p":"","m":"我今天不用穿外套。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那天不用穿外套","en":"You didn't need a coat that day"},"later":{"t":"You said you didn't need a coat. I can't even remember the last time. This week I wore my coat inside the office — the heating broke for a day. We typed in gloves.","p":"","m":"你上次说你不用穿外套。我都想不起来上一次是什么时候了。这周我在办公室里也穿着外套——暖气坏了一天。我们戴着手套打字。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is it warm inside where you work or study?","p":"","m":"你工作或学习的地方屋里暖和吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — sometimes too warm.","p":"","m":"暖和，有时候太热。","r":{"t":"Send some of that heating here.","p":"","m":"给我们送点暖气来。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太暖和。","r":{"t":"Then we can be cold together, to be fair.","p":"","m":"说实话，那我们一起冷吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Heating's back. Gloves off.","p":"","m":"暖气回来了。手套摘了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What colour is it?","p":"","m":"是什么颜色的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他的雨衣是什么颜色（深绿色，很严肃）","en":"You asked what colour his raincoat is (dark green — very serious)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what colour my raincoat is. Dark green. This week a tourist asked me for directions because, she said, I 'looked like a park ranger'. I gave her directions anyway.","p":"","m":"你上次问我的雨衣是什么颜色。深绿色。这周有个游客向我问路，她说因为我「看起来像个护林员」。我还是给她指了路。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What colour is your favourite coat?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢的外套是什么颜色？"},"replies":[{"t":"Black, like most people.","p":"","m":"黑色，跟大多数人一样。","r":{"t":"Classic. Can't go wrong.","p":"","m":"经典。不会错。"}},{"t":"Something bright.","p":"","m":"亮一点的颜色。","r":{"t":"Good. Easy to spot on a grey day.","p":"","m":"好。灰天里很好找。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still wearing my park-ranger green.","p":"","m":"还穿着我那件护林员绿。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you ever use an umbrella?","p":"","m":"你用伞吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他用不用伞（不太用，风一吹就翻）","en":"You asked if he ever uses an umbrella (not really — the wind turns them inside out)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I ever use an umbrella. This week I tried — a colleague lent me one. It lasted four minutes. The wind won. I gave it back in two pieces. Very embarrassing.","p":"","m":"你上次问我用不用伞。这周我试了——同事借我一把。撑了四分钟。风赢了。我还给她的时候是两截。好尴尬。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever broken something you borrowed?","p":"","m":"你有没有弄坏过借来的东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, once.","p":"","m":"有，一次。","r":{"t":"Then you know the feeling. I bought her a new one.","p":"","m":"那你懂这种感觉。我给她买了把新的。"}},{"t":"Never.","p":"","m":"从来没有。","r":{"t":"Good. Don't borrow umbrellas in London.","p":"","m":"好。在伦敦别借伞。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought my colleague a new umbrella. A strong one.","p":"","m":"给同事买了把新伞。结实的。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-09|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-09","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也特别想吃火锅！","p":"Wǒ yě tèbié xiǎng chī huǒguō!","m":"I really want hotpot too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也特别想吃火锅","en":"You're craving hotpot too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也特别想吃火锅！这两天我真去吃了，跟两个老同学，涮了三盘羊肉。出来的时候，三个人身上都是火锅味儿。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě tèbié xiǎng chī huǒguō! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhēn qù chī le, gēn liǎng gè lǎo tóngxué, shuàn le sān pán yángròu. Chūlái de shíhou, sān gè rén shēn shang dōu shì huǒguō wèir.","m":"You said you're craving hotpot too! These days I really went — with two old classmates, three plates of lamb. When we came out, all three of us smelled of hotpot.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃火锅最爱放什么？","p":"Nǐ chī huǒguō zuì ài fàng shénme?","m":"What do you love putting in hotpot?"},"replies":[{"t":"肉，越多越好。","p":"Ròu, yuè duō yuè hǎo.","m":"Meat — the more the better.","r":{"t":"跟我一样！羊肉一定要多点。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng! Yángròu yídìng yào duō diǎn.","m":"Same as me! Always order extra lamb."}},{"t":"蔬菜和豆腐。","p":"Shūcài hé dòufu.","m":"Vegetables and tofu.","r":{"t":"好，冻豆腐吸了汤最香。","p":"Hǎo, dòng dòufu xī le tāng zuì xiāng.","m":"Good choice — frozen tofu soaks up the broth beautifully."}}],"next":{"t":"今天风大，又想吃火锅了。","p":"Jīntiān fēng dà, yòu xiǎng chī huǒguō le.","m":"Windy today — craving hotpot again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没吃过火锅。","p":"Wǒ hái méi chīguo huǒguō.","m":"I've never had hotpot."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没吃过火锅","en":"You've never had hotpot"},"later":{"t":"你上次说还没吃过火锅。这两天我想好了，要是你来北京，第一顿就带你吃铜锅涮肉：锅中间烧炭，肉一涮就熟，蘸上麻酱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō hái méi chīguo huǒguō. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng hǎo le, yàoshi nǐ lái Běijīng, dì yī dùn jiù dài nǐ chī tóngguō shuànròu: guō zhōngjiān shāo tàn, ròu yí shuàn jiù shú, zhàn shang májiàng.","m":"You said you've never had hotpot. These days I made up my mind: if you come to Beijing, your first meal is copper-pot hotpot — charcoal burning in the middle of the pot, the meat cooks in seconds, then you dip it in sesame sauce.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃饭喜欢跟很多人一起，还是人少一点？","p":"Nǐ chī fàn xǐhuan gēn hěn duō rén yìqǐ, háishi rén shǎo yìdiǎn?","m":"Do you like eating with lots of people, or just a few?"},"replies":[{"t":"人多热闹。","p":"Rén duō rènao.","m":"Lots — it's lively.","r":{"t":"那火锅最适合你。","p":"Nà huǒguō zuì shìhé nǐ.","m":"Then hotpot's perfect for you."}},{"t":"人少一点，安静。","p":"Rén shǎo yìdiǎn, ānjìng.","m":"A few — it's quieter.","r":{"t":"两个人吃火锅也很好，点个小锅就行。","p":"Liǎng gè rén chī huǒguō yě hěn hǎo, diǎn gè xiǎo guō jiù xíng.","m":"Hotpot for two is lovely too — just order a small pot."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过涮肉馆，又想到要带你去。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò shuànròu guǎn, yòu xiǎng dào yào dài nǐ qù.","m":"Passed a hotpot place today — thought again about taking you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喜欢吃什么样的火锅？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan chī shénme yàng de huǒguō?","m":"What kind of hotpot do you like?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喜欢什么样的火锅（老北京铜锅涮肉，蘸麻酱）","en":"You asked what kind of hotpot she likes (old-Beijing copper pot, dipped in sesame sauce)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喜欢什么样的火锅。铜锅涮肉！这两天去吃，服务员教了我一个新吃法：麻酱里加一点韭菜花和腐乳。我吃了二十年，第一次知道。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xǐhuan shénme yàng de huǒguō. Tóngguō shuànròu! Zhè liǎng tiān qù chī, fúwùyuán jiāo le wǒ yí gè xīn chīfǎ: májiàng lǐ jiā yìdiǎn jiǔcài huā hé fǔrǔ. Wǒ chī le èrshí nián, dì yī cì zhīdào.","m":"Last time you asked what kind of hotpot I like. Copper-pot! These days the waiter showed me a new trick: add a little chive-flower paste and fermented tofu to the sesame sauce. Twenty years of eating it, and I'd never known.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃东西喜欢蘸酱吗？","p":"Nǐ chī dōngxi xǐhuan zhàn jiàng ma?","m":"Do you like dipping sauces?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢，酱越多越好。","p":"Xǐhuan, jiàng yuè duō yuè hǎo.","m":"Yes — the more sauce the better.","r":{"t":"那你跟北京人一个口味儿。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn Běijīng rén yí gè kǒuwèir.","m":"Then we share a taste."}},{"t":"不太喜欢，原味的就好。","p":"Bú tài xǐhuan, yuánwèi de jiù hǎo.","m":"Not really — plain is fine.","r":{"t":"也好，好肉不用蘸也香。","p":"Yě hǎo, hǎo ròu bú yòng zhàn yě xiāng.","m":"Fair — good meat tastes great on its own."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在家拌麻酱，也加了点儿韭菜花。","p":"Jīntiān zài jiā bàn májiàng, yě jiā le diǎnr jiǔcài huā.","m":"Mixed sesame sauce at home today — added a bit of chive-flower paste too."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一般跟谁去吃？","p":"Nǐ yìbān gēn shéi qù chī?","m":"Who do you usually go with?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一般跟谁去吃火锅（跟老同学，一年好几次）","en":"You asked who she goes for hotpot with (old classmates, a few times a year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我跟谁去吃火锅。老同学。这两天我们又约了，一个同学带了她刚上小学的女儿，小姑娘一个人吃了一盘羊肉，比我们都能吃。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ gēn shéi qù chī huǒguō. Lǎo tóngxué. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen yòu yuē le, yí gè tóngxué dài le tā gāng shàng xiǎoxué de nǚ'ér, xiǎo gūniang yí gè rén chī le yì pán yángròu, bǐ wǒmen dōu néng chī.","m":"Last time you asked who I go for hotpot with. Old classmates. These days we met up again — one brought her daughter, who's just started primary school. The little girl ate a whole plate of lamb by herself, more than any of us.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟老朋友多久见一次？","p":"Nǐ gēn lǎo péngyou duō jiǔ jiàn yí cì?","m":"How often do you see your old friends?"},"replies":[{"t":"一两个月一次。","p":"Yì liǎng gè yuè yí cì.","m":"Every month or two.","r":{"t":"挺好，常见面才不会生分。","p":"Tǐng hǎo, cháng jiànmiàn cái bú huì shēngfen.","m":"Nice — seeing each other often keeps you close."}},{"t":"很少，大家都太忙了。","p":"Hěn shǎo, dàjiā dōu tài máng le.","m":"Rarely — everyone's too busy.","r":{"t":"那就约一顿饭吧，饭桌上什么都能聊。","p":"Nà jiù yuē yí dùn fàn ba, fànzhuō shang shénme dōu néng liáo.","m":"Then fix a meal — you can talk about anything at the table."}}],"next":{"t":"老同学的群里今天又在说下次吃什么。","p":"Lǎo tóngxué de qún lǐ jīntiān yòu zài shuō xià cì chī shénme.","m":"The old-classmates group chat is already planning the next meal today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-09|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-09","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也很热，只想吃冰的。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě hěn rè, zhǐ xiǎng chī bīng de.","m":"It's hot here too — I only want cold stuff."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也很热，只想吃冰的","en":"It's hot where you are too — you only want cold things"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也很热，只想吃冰的！这两天工地上来了一个卖冰水的小姑娘，一袋水五十奈拉，冰冰的。大家一下班就排队买。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě hěn rè, zhǐ xiǎng chī bīng de! Zhè liǎng tiān gōngdì shang lái le yí gè mài bīng shuǐ de xiǎo gūniang, yí dài shuǐ wǔshí nàilā, bīngbīng de. Dàjiā yí xiàbān jiù páiduì mǎi.","m":"You said it's hot where you are too and you only want cold things! These days a girl started selling iced water on site — fifty naira a bag, ice-cold. Everyone queues for it the moment work ends.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边热的时候，大家喝什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān rè de shíhou, dàjiā hē shénme?","m":"What do people drink when it's hot where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"冰饮料。","p":"Bīng yǐnliào.","m":"Cold drinks.","r":{"t":"对！冰的最好。","p":"Duì! Bīng de zuì hǎo.","m":"Yes! Cold is best."}},{"t":"热茶，说是更解渴。","p":"Rè chá, shuō shì gèng jiěkě.","m":"Hot tea — they say it quenches thirst better.","r":{"t":"跟我的中国同事一样！我还是不懂，哈哈。","p":"Gēn wǒ de Zhōngguó tóngshì yíyàng! Wǒ háishi bù dǒng, hāha.","m":"Just like my Chinese colleagues! I still don't get it, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又买了两袋冰水。","p":"Jīntiān yòu mǎi le liǎng dài bīng shuǐ.","m":"Bought two more bags of iced water today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边很冷，只想吃热的。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān hěn lěng, zhǐ xiǎng chī rè de.","m":"It's cold here — I only want hot food."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边很冷，只想吃热的","en":"It's cold where you are — you only want hot food"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边很冷，只想吃热的。这两天我想到你，就喝了一碗食堂师傅做的热汤。三十二度喝热汤……我出了一身汗，可是好喝！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān hěn lěng, zhǐ xiǎng chī rè de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ, jiù hē le yì wǎn shítáng shīfu zuò de rè tāng. Sānshí'èr dù hē rè tāng …… wǒ chū le yì shēn hàn, kěshì hǎohē!","m":"You said it's cold where you are and you only want hot food. These days I thought of you and had a bowl of the canteen cook's hot soup. Hot soup at thirty-two degrees… I sweated buckets, but it was delicious!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天最爱喝什么汤？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zuì ài hē shénme tāng?","m":"What soup do you love most in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"鸡汤。","p":"Jī tāng.","m":"Chicken soup.","r":{"t":"鸡汤好！我们尼日利亚也有辣辣的鸡汤。","p":"Jī tāng hǎo! Wǒmen Nírìlìyà yě yǒu làlà de jī tāng.","m":"Chicken soup's great! We have spicy chicken pepper soup in Nigeria too."}},{"t":"我不太喝汤。","p":"Wǒ bú tài hē tāng.","m":"I don't drink much soup.","r":{"t":"那你跟我一样，我也喜欢冰的。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ yíyàng, wǒ yě xǐhuan bīng de.","m":"Then you're like me — I prefer cold things too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天还是好热，热汤我不敢再喝了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān háishi hǎo rè, rè tāng wǒ bù gǎn zài hē le, hāha.","m":"Still so hot today — not risking hot soup again, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最爱吃什么冰的？","p":"Nǐ zuì ài chī shénme bīng de?","m":"What's your favourite cold thing?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他最爱吃什么冰的（冰西瓜，工地上一切就吃完）","en":"You asked his favourite cold food (iced watermelon — gone in no time on site)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最爱吃什么冰的。冰西瓜！这两天我女儿第一次自己拿勺子吃西瓜，吃得满脸都是，衣服也红了。我太太看了，又好气又好笑。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuì ài chī shénme bīng de. Bīng xīguā! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ nǚ'ér dì yī cì zìjǐ ná sháozi chī xīguā, chī de mǎn liǎn dōu shì, yīfu yě hóng le. Wǒ tàitai kàn le, yòu hǎoqì yòu hǎoxiào.","m":"Last time you asked my favourite cold treat. Iced watermelon! These days my daughter ate watermelon with a spoon by herself for the first time — it was all over her face and her clothes went red. My wife didn't know whether to laugh or be cross.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候夏天最爱吃什么？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou xiàtiān zuì ài chī shénme?","m":"What did you love eating in summer as a kid?"},"replies":[{"t":"冰淇淋。","p":"Bīngqílín.","m":"Ice cream.","r":{"t":"冰淇淋谁都爱！","p":"Bīngqílín shéi dōu ài!","m":"Everyone loves ice cream!"}},{"t":"水果。","p":"Shuǐguǒ.","m":"Fruit.","r":{"t":"水果最好，又冰又甜。","p":"Shuǐguǒ zuì hǎo, yòu bīng yòu tián.","m":"Fruit's the best — cold and sweet."}}],"next":{"t":"今天工地上又切了一个西瓜。","p":"Jīntiān gōngdì shang yòu qiē le yí gè xīguā.","m":"Another watermelon cut open on site today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"中国同事也爱吃冰的吗？","p":"Zhōngguó tóngshì yě ài chī bīng de ma?","m":"Do your Chinese colleagues like cold things too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过中国同事爱不爱吃冰的（不太爱，大热天还喝热水）","en":"You asked if his Chinese colleagues like cold food (not really — they drink hot water even in the heat)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问中国同事爱不爱吃冰的。他们还是喝热水！这两天我试了一天，跟他们一样只喝热水。下午我觉得……还是冰的好，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Zhōngguó tóngshì ài bu ài chī bīng de. Tāmen háishi hē rè shuǐ! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shì le yì tiān, gēn tāmen yíyàng zhǐ hē rè shuǐ. Xiàwǔ wǒ juéde …… háishi bīng de hǎo, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if my Chinese colleagues like cold things. They still drink hot water! These days I tried a whole day of only hot water, like them. By the afternoon I decided… cold is better, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有没有人的习惯，你一直不懂？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu méiyǒu rén de xíguàn, nǐ yìzhí bù dǒng?","m":"Is there someone around you with a habit you've never understood?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，很多。","p":"Yǒu, hěn duō.","m":"Yes, lots.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们都一样。","p":"Hāha, wǒmen dōu yíyàng.","m":"Haha, same for all of us."}},{"t":"没有，我都能理解。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ dōu néng lǐjiě.","m":"No — I understand them all.","r":{"t":"你真会理解人。","p":"Nǐ zhēn huì lǐjiě rén.","m":"You really understand people."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又回到冰水了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu huí dào bīng shuǐ le, hāha.","m":"Back to iced water today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-09|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-09","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也想吃牛肉面！","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng chī niúròu miàn!","m":"I want beef noodles too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也想吃牛肉面","en":"You're craving beef noodles too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也想吃牛肉面！这两天我去了学校旁边那家老店，老板说他们的汤每天熬八个小时。我把汤喝光了，一滴都没剩。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xiǎng chī niúròumiàn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù le xuéxiào pángbiān nà jiā lǎo diàn, lǎobǎn shuō tāmen de tāng měi tiān áo bā gè xiǎoshí. Wǒ bǎ tāng hē guāng le, yì dī dōu méi shèng.","m":"You said you're craving beef noodles too! These days I went to the old place next to campus — the owner says they simmer the broth eight hours a day. I drank every last drop.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃面会把汤喝完吗？","p":"Nǐ chī miàn huì bǎ tāng hē wán ma?","m":"Do you finish the soup when you eat noodles?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，汤最好喝。","p":"Huì, tāng zuì hǎohē.","m":"Yes — the soup's the best bit.","r":{"t":"对吧！汤才是灵魂。","p":"Duì ba! Tāng cái shì línghún.","m":"Right? The broth is the soul."}},{"t":"不会，喝一半就饱了。","p":"Bú huì, hē yíbàn jiù bǎo le.","m":"No — I'm full halfway.","r":{"t":"那剩下的给我，哈哈。","p":"Nà shèng xià de gěi wǒ, hāha.","m":"Then pass the rest to me, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天好冷，又想去那家牛肉面店。","p":"Jīntiān hǎo lěng, yòu xiǎng qù nà jiā niúròumiàn diàn.","m":"So cold today — craving that beef noodle place again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我不太吃牛肉。","p":"Wǒ bú tài chī niúròu.","m":"I don't really eat beef."},"mem":{"zh":"你不太吃牛肉","en":"You don't really eat beef"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你不太吃牛肉。这两天我帮你找了：台湾冬天还有麻油鸡面线、当归鸭面线，都是热热的汤。我自己也去吃了一碗当归鸭，好香。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ bú tài chī niúròu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bāng nǐ zhǎo le: Táiwān dōngtiān hái yǒu máyóu jī miànxiàn, dāngguī yā miànxiàn, dōu shì rèrè de tāng. Wǒ zìjǐ yě qù chī le yì wǎn dāngguī yā, hǎo xiāng.","m":"You said you don't really eat beef. These days I found options for you: in Taiwanese winters there's sesame-oil chicken with thin noodles, and angelica duck noodle soup — all hot broths. I had a bowl of the angelica duck myself — so fragrant.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天最想喝什么汤？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zuì xiǎng hē shénme tāng?","m":"What soup do you crave most in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"鸡汤。","p":"Jī tāng.","m":"Chicken soup.","r":{"t":"鸡汤最好了，麻油鸡你一定会爱。","p":"Jī tāng zuì hǎo le, máyóu jī nǐ yídìng huì ài.","m":"Chicken soup's the best — you'd love sesame-oil chicken."}},{"t":"蔬菜汤。","p":"Shūcài tāng.","m":"Vegetable soup.","r":{"t":"好健康！台湾也有很多素食面。","p":"Hǎo jiànkāng! Táiwān yě yǒu hěn duō sùshí miàn.","m":"So healthy! Taiwan has lots of vegetarian noodles too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想到那碗当归鸭，好想再吃。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng dào nà wǎn dāngguī yā, hǎo xiǎng zài chī.","m":"Thinking about that angelica duck again today — want another bowl."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喜欢红烧的还是清炖的？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan hóngshāo de háishi qīngdùn de?","m":"Do you like the braised kind or the clear-broth kind?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喜欢红烧的还是清炖的（红烧的，汤浓一点，加酸菜）","en":"You asked if she likes braised or clear-broth (braised — rich broth, plus pickled greens)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喜欢红烧的还是清炖的。红烧！这两天我才知道，店里的酸菜可以免费加，我加了三次，老板都笑了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xǐhuan hóngshāo de háishi qīngdùn de. Hóngshāo! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ cái zhīdào, diàn lǐ de suāncài kěyǐ miǎnfèi jiā, wǒ jiā le sān cì, lǎobǎn dōu xiào le.","m":"Last time you asked braised or clear broth. Braised! These days I found out the pickled greens are free to add — I went back three times and the owner laughed.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃面喜欢加什么？","p":"Nǐ chī miàn xǐhuan jiā shénme?","m":"What do you like to add to your noodles?"},"replies":[{"t":"辣椒。","p":"Làjiāo.","m":"Chilli.","r":{"t":"厉害！我只能加一点点。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ zhǐ néng jiā yìdiǎndiǎn.","m":"Brave! I can only add a tiny bit."}},{"t":"什么都不加。","p":"Shénme dōu bù jiā.","m":"Nothing.","r":{"t":"原味的也好，吃得出汤的味道。","p":"Yuánwèi de yě hǎo, chī de chū tāng de wèidao.","m":"Plain's good too — you taste the broth."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的牛肉面，酸菜我只加了两次，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān de niúròumiàn, suāncài wǒ zhǐ jiā le liǎng cì, hāha.","m":"Only went back for pickled greens twice today, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"台北冬天冷吗？","p":"Táiběi dōngtiān lěng ma?","m":"Is Taipei cold in winter?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过台北冬天冷不冷（十几度，又湿又冷）","en":"You asked if Taipei winters are cold (low teens, damp and cold)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问台北冬天冷不冷。十几度，可是又湿又冷。这两天我的衣服晾了三天都没干，最后只好拿去自助洗衣店烘干。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Táiběi dōngtiān lěng bu lěng. Shí jǐ dù, kěshì yòu shī yòu lěng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de yīfu liàng le sān tiān dōu méi gān, zuìhòu zhǐ hǎo ná qù zìzhù xǐyīdiàn hōnggān.","m":"Last time you asked if Taipei winters are cold. Low teens, but damp and cold. These days my washing hung for three days without drying, so in the end I took it to the self-service laundry to tumble-dry.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天是干冷还是湿冷？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān shì gān lěng háishi shī lěng?","m":"Is your winter a dry cold or a damp cold?"},"replies":[{"t":"干冷，皮肤很干。","p":"Gān lěng, pífū hěn gān.","m":"Dry — my skin gets really dry.","r":{"t":"那你要多擦乳液喔！","p":"Nà nǐ yào duō cā rǔyè o!","m":"Then use lots of lotion!"}},{"t":"湿冷，跟台北一样。","p":"Shī lěng, gēn Táiběi yíyàng.","m":"Damp, like Taipei.","r":{"t":"那你懂我的痛苦了，衣服都干不了。","p":"Nà nǐ dǒng wǒ de tòngkǔ le, yīfu dōu gān bu liǎo.","m":"Then you know my pain — nothing ever dries."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去自助洗衣店了，烘干机前面排队。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù zìzhù xǐyīdiàn le, hōnggānjī qiánmiàn páiduì.","m":"Back at the laundromat today — a queue for the dryers."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-09|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-09","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I want gravy on everything too.","p":"","m":"我也想什么都浇肉汁。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也什么都想浇肉汁","en":"You want gravy on everything too"},"later":{"t":"You said you want gravy on everything too. A person of taste. This week the chip shop near me started 'gravy Thursdays'. I've been twice. The second time wasn't even a Thursday.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也什么都想浇肉汁。懂吃的人。这周我家附近的炸鱼薯条店推出了「周四肉汁日」。我去了两次。第二次根本不是周四。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a sauce you put on everything?","p":"","m":"有没有一种酱，你什么都要加？"},"replies":[{"t":"Chilli sauce.","p":"","m":"辣椒酱。","r":{"t":"Brave. Gravy's gentler.","p":"","m":"勇敢。肉汁温和一点。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then try gravy. It might change your life.","p":"","m":"那试试肉汁。可能会改变你的人生。"}}],"next":{"t":"Gravy again today. No regrets.","p":"","m":"今天又吃了肉汁。不后悔。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never had gravy.","p":"","m":"我没吃过肉汁。"},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没吃过肉汁","en":"You've never had gravy"},"later":{"t":"You said you've never had gravy. So this week I made some properly, from the roast juices, so I could describe it for you: rich, salty, meaty — a bit like the sauce from a stew. Best poured on potatoes.","p":"","m":"你上次说你从来没吃过肉汁。所以这周我用烤肉的汁好好做了一次，好跟你描述：浓、咸、有肉香——有点像炖菜的汤汁。浇在土豆上最好吃。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a sauce from your place that I should try?","p":"","m":"你那边有什么酱我应该尝尝？"},"replies":[{"t":"Soy sauce, of course.","p":"","m":"当然是酱油。","r":{"t":"Already a fan. Good shout.","p":"","m":"我已经爱上了。好建议。"}},{"t":"A spicy one.","p":"","m":"一种辣的。","r":{"t":"I'll try it. With lots of water nearby.","p":"","m":"我会试的。旁边放很多水。"}}],"next":{"t":"Made gravy again. Thought of you.","p":"","m":"又做了肉汁。想到你了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's your favourite thing with gravy?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢浇肉汁吃什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他最爱什么配肉汁（烤土豆、薯条、派，什么都行）","en":"You asked his favourite thing with gravy (roast potatoes, chips, pie — everything)"},"later":{"t":"You asked my favourite thing with gravy. Roast potatoes. This week I finally learned my mum's trick: shake them in the pan before roasting, so the edges go fluffy and crispy.","p":"","m":"你上次问我最爱什么配肉汁。烤土豆。这周我终于学会了我妈的窍门：烤之前在锅里晃一晃，这样边上会变得又松又脆。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite way to eat potatoes?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢土豆怎么做？"},"replies":[{"t":"Fried.","p":"","m":"炸的。","r":{"t":"Can't argue with chips.","p":"","m":"薯条没话说。"}},{"t":"I'm not a potato person.","p":"","m":"我不太吃土豆。","r":{"t":"Fair. More for me.","p":"","m":"也行。我多吃点。"}}],"next":{"t":"Roast potatoes, crispy edges. Success.","p":"","m":"烤土豆，边脆脆的。成功。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you make your own gravy?","p":"","m":"你自己做肉汁吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他自己做不做肉汁（不做，那是妈妈的事）","en":"You asked if he makes his own gravy (no — that's his mum's job)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I make my own gravy. No — Mum's job. This week she sent me a frozen jar of it with a note: 'For emergencies.' It's in my freezer like treasure.","p":"","m":"你上次问我自己做不做肉汁。不做——那是我妈的事。这周她给我寄了一罐冻好的，附了一张纸条：「应急用。」它在我的冰箱里，像宝贝一样。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family send you food?","p":"","m":"你家里人会给你送吃的吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"会，经常。","r":{"t":"Best kind of post.","p":"","m":"最好的包裹。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Then I'll share my emergency gravy. Joking. Mostly.","p":"","m":"那分你一点我的应急肉汁。开玩笑的。大概吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"The emergency gravy is still safe. For now.","p":"","m":"应急肉汁还安全。暂时。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-10|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-10","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也爱喝热茶。","p":"Wǒ yě ài hē rè chá.","m":"I love hot tea too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱喝热茶","en":"You love hot tea too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也爱喝热茶。这两天我在学校办公室放了一个小茶壶，同事们一个一个来找我要茶喝。现在我的茶叶只剩一半了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě ài hē rè chá. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xuéxiào bàngōngshì fàng le yí gè xiǎo cháhú, tóngshìmen yí gè yí gè lái zhǎo wǒ yào chá hē. Xiànzài wǒ de cháyè zhǐ shèng yíbàn le, hāha.","m":"You said you love hot tea too. These days I put a little teapot in the school staffroom, and my colleagues keep coming one by one for a cup. Now I'm down to half my tea leaves, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般在哪儿喝茶？","p":"Nǐ yìbān zài nǎr hē chá?","m":"Where do you usually drink tea?"},"replies":[{"t":"在家。","p":"Zài jiā.","m":"At home.","r":{"t":"在家喝最舒服。","p":"Zài jiā hē zuì shūfu.","m":"Home's the cosiest place for it."}},{"t":"在办公室或者学校。","p":"Zài bàngōngshì huòzhě xuéxiào.","m":"At work or school.","r":{"t":"那你也会被同事「抢」茶，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ yě huì bèi tóngshì “qiǎng” chá, hāha.","m":"Then your colleagues will raid your tea too, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天办公室的小茶壶又空了。","p":"Jīntiān bàngōngshì de xiǎo cháhú yòu kōng le.","m":"The staffroom teapot was empty again today."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我喝红茶。","p":"Wǒ hē hóngchá.","m":"I drink black tea."},"mem":{"zh":"你喝红茶","en":"You drink black tea"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你喝红茶。这两天我也泡了一杯红茶，我女儿闻了一下说：「爸爸，这个是巧克力的味道。」四岁小孩的鼻子真厉害。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hē hóngchá. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě pào le yì bēi hóngchá, wǒ nǚ'ér wén le yíxià shuō: “Bàba, zhège shì qiǎokèlì de wèidao.” Sì suì xiǎohái de bízi zhēn lìhai.","m":"You said you drink black tea. These days I made a cup too, and my daughter sniffed it and said: “Daddy, it smells like chocolate.” A four-year-old's nose is amazing.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝红茶会加牛奶吗？","p":"Nǐ hē hóngchá huì jiā niúnǎi ma?","m":"Do you add milk to black tea?"},"replies":[{"t":"会。","p":"Huì.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"我太太也这样喝，她说这是英国人的喝法。","p":"Wǒ tàitai yě zhèyàng hē, tā shuō zhè shì Yīngguó rén de hēfǎ.","m":"My wife drinks it like that — she says it's the British way."}},{"t":"不加，什么都不加。","p":"Bù jiā, shénme dōu bù jiā.","m":"No, nothing.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！我也喜欢原味的。","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège! Wǒ yě xǐhuan yuánwèi de.","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly! I like it plain too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下午也泡了一杯红茶。","p":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ yě pào le yì bēi hóngchá.","m":"Had a cup of black tea this afternoon too."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我喝绿茶。","p":"Wǒ hē lǜchá.","m":"I drink green tea."},"mem":{"zh":"你喝绿茶","en":"You drink green tea"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喝绿茶。这两天我的竹叶青喝完了，去法拉盛买新的，老板娘问我：「你要四川的还是杭州的？」我说：「四川的，我是在成都学的中文。」她笑了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě hē lǜchá. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de zhúyèqīng hē wán le, qù Fǎlāshèng mǎi xīn de, lǎobǎnniáng wèn wǒ: “Nǐ yào Sìchuān de háishi Hángzhōu de?” Wǒ shuō: “Sìchuān de, wǒ shì zài Chéngdū xué de Zhōngwén.” Tā xiào le.","m":"You said you drink green tea too. These days my Zhuyeqing ran out, so I went to Flushing for more. The shopkeeper asked: “Sichuan or Hangzhou?” I said: “Sichuan — I learned my Chinese in Chengdu.” She laughed.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喝茶会讲究是哪儿的茶吗？","p":"Nǐ hē chá huì jiǎngjiu shì nǎr de chá ma?","m":"Are you particular about where your tea comes from?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，有喜欢的。","p":"Huì, yǒu xǐhuan de.","m":"Yes — I have favourites.","r":{"t":"那你一定很懂茶。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn dǒng chá.","m":"Then you must know your tea."}},{"t":"不会，好喝就行。","p":"Bú huì, hǎohē jiù xíng.","m":"No — as long as it tastes good.","r":{"t":"对对对，好喝最重要。","p":"Duì duì duì, hǎohē zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Yes yes yes, taste is what matters."}}],"next":{"t":"今天泡了新买的竹叶青。","p":"Jīntiān pào le xīn mǎi de zhúyèqīng.","m":"Brewed my new Zhuyeqing today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我一年四季都喝冰的。","p":"Wǒ yì nián sì jì dōu hē bīng de.","m":"I drink cold drinks all year round."},"mem":{"zh":"你一年四季都喝冰的","en":"You drink cold drinks all year round"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你一年四季都喝冰的。这两天我问了班上的学生，三十个人里，二十个冬天也喝冰水。只有几个带的是保温杯，说是奶奶给的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yì nián sì jì dōu hē bīng de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn le bān shang de xuésheng, sānshí gè rén lǐ, èrshí gè dōngtiān yě hē bīng shuǐ. Zhǐ yǒu jǐ gè dài de shì bǎowēnbēi, shuō shì nǎinai gěi de.","m":"You said you drink cold drinks all year round. These days I asked my class: twenty out of thirty drink iced water even in winter. Only a few bring thermos flasks — from their grandmas, they said.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候家里人会叫你喝热水吗？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou jiā lǐ rén huì jiào nǐ hē rè shuǐ ma?","m":"Did your family tell you to drink hot water as a kid?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，天天说。","p":"Huì, tiāntiān shuō.","m":"Yes, every day.","r":{"t":"那你跟我那几个学生一样，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ nà jǐ gè xuésheng yíyàng, hāha.","m":"Then you're like those few students of mine, haha."}},{"t":"不会，我们喝冰的。","p":"Bú huì, wǒmen hē bīng de.","m":"No — we drank cold.","r":{"t":"那你跟我小时候一样。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ xiǎoshíhou yíyàng.","m":"Then you were just like me as a kid."}}],"next":{"t":"今天看到学生的保温杯，又想到你。","p":"Jīntiān kàn dào xuésheng de bǎowēnbēi, yòu xiǎng dào nǐ.","m":"Saw a student's thermos today and thought of you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在成都的时候也天天喝茶吗？","p":"Nǐ zài Chéngdū de shíhou yě tiāntiān hē chá ma?","m":"Did you drink tea every day in Chengdu too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在成都的时候是不是天天喝茶（天天喝，在茶馆爱上的）","en":"You asked if he drank tea every day in Chengdu (yes — he fell in love with it in the teahouses)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在成都是不是天天喝茶。是啊。这两天我跟学生讲成都的茶馆：一杯茶喝一下午，还有师傅帮人掏耳朵。学生们都不信，以为我在开玩笑。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài Chéngdū shì bu shì tiāntiān hē chá. Shì a. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn xuésheng jiǎng Chéngdū de cháguǎn: yì bēi chá hē yí xiàwǔ, hái yǒu shīfu bāng rén tāo ěrduo. Xuéshengmen dōu bú xìn, yǐwéi wǒ zài kāi wánxiào.","m":"Last time you asked if I drank tea every day in Chengdu. I did. These days I told my students about Chengdu teahouses: one cup lasts all afternoon, and there are men who clean people's ears. They didn't believe me — they thought I was joking.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有那种可以坐一下午的地方？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu nà zhǒng kěyǐ zuò yí xiàwǔ de dìfang?","m":"Where you are, is there somewhere you can sit all afternoon?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，咖啡馆。","p":"Yǒu, kāfēiguǎn.","m":"Yes — cafés.","r":{"t":"对，咖啡馆就是我们的茶馆。","p":"Duì, kāfēiguǎn jiù shì wǒmen de cháguǎn.","m":"Right — cafés are our teahouses."}},{"t":"没有，大家都很忙。","p":"Méiyǒu, dàjiā dōu hěn máng.","m":"No — everyone's too busy.","r":{"t":"纽约也是，所以我很想念成都。","p":"Niǔyuē yě shì, suǒyǐ wǒ hěn xiǎngniàn Chéngdū.","m":"New York too — that's why I miss Chengdu."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下午又想起成都的茶馆。","p":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ yòu xiǎng qǐ Chéngdū de cháguǎn.","m":"Missing Chengdu's teahouses again this afternoon."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"三杯茶，晚上睡得着吗？","p":"Sān bēi chá, wǎnshang shuì de zháo ma?","m":"Three cups — can you still sleep at night?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他喝三杯茶晚上睡不睡得着（四点以后就不喝了）","en":"You asked if he can sleep after three cups of tea (he stops after four o'clock)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我三杯茶晚上睡不睡得着。四点以后我就不喝了。可是这两天开会开到六点，我忍不住又喝了一杯，结果半夜一点还在看那本中文小说，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ sān bēi chá wǎnshang shuì bu shuì de zháo. Sì diǎn yǐhòu wǒ jiù bù hē le. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān kāihuì kāi dào liù diǎn, wǒ rěn bu zhù yòu hē le yì bēi, jiéguǒ bànyè yì diǎn hái zài kàn nà běn Zhōngwén xiǎoshuō, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if three cups of tea keep me awake. I stop after four o'clock. But these days a meeting ran till six and I couldn't resist another cup — and at one in the morning I was still reading my Chinese novel, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你晚上睡不着的时候，会做什么？","p":"Nǐ wǎnshang shuì bu zháo de shíhou, huì zuò shénme?","m":"What do you do when you can't sleep?"},"replies":[{"t":"看书。","p":"Kàn shū.","m":"Read.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"听点音乐。","p":"Tīng diǎn yīnyuè.","m":"Listen to music.","r":{"t":"好办法，比看书更容易睡着。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ, bǐ kàn shū gèng róngyì shuìzháo.","m":"Good idea — easier to fall asleep than with a book."}}],"next":{"t":"今天四点以后一口茶都没喝。","p":"Jīntiān sì diǎn yǐhòu yì kǒu chá dōu méi hē.","m":"Not a drop of tea after four today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"一个家长给我写了一张圣诞卡，用中文写的：「谢谢欧文老师，孩子说您的中文有四川味儿。」","p":"Yí gè jiāzhǎng gěi wǒ xiě le yì zhāng Shèngdàn kǎ, yòng Zhōngwén xiě de: “Xièxie Ōuwén lǎoshī, háizi shuō nín de Zhōngwén yǒu Sìchuān wèir.”","m":"A parent wrote me a Christmas card in Chinese: “Thank you, Mr Owen — my child says your Chinese has a Sichuan flavour.”"},{"t":"我回了一张，用我最好的字写：「谢谢！我是在成都学的。」","p":"Wǒ huí le yì zhāng, yòng wǒ zuì hǎo de zì xiě: “Xièxie! Wǒ shì zài Chéngdū xué de.”","m":"I wrote one back in my best handwriting: “Thank you! I learned it in Chengdu.”"},{"t":"九个字，写了二十分钟。还是很值。","p":"Jiǔ gè zì, xiě le èrshí fēnzhōng. Háishi hěn zhí.","m":"Nine characters, twenty minutes. Still worth it."}],"replies":[{"t":"四川味儿，好可爱！","p":"Sìchuān wèir, hǎo kě'ài!","m":"A Sichuan flavour — how sweet!","r":{"t":"对对对，我很骄傲！","p":"Duì duì duì, wǒ hěn jiāo'ào!","m":"Yes yes yes, I'm proud of it!"}},{"t":"二十分钟也值！","p":"Èrshí fēnzhōng yě zhí!","m":"Worth the twenty minutes!","r":{"t":"就是这个！","p":"Jiù shì zhège!","m":"Exactly!"}}],"from":"2026-12-12"}},"2026-12-10|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-10","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢喝热巧克力！","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan hē rè qiǎokèlì!","m":"I love hot chocolate too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢喝热巧克力","en":"You love hot chocolate too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢喝热巧克力！这两天我教外婆用中文说「热巧克力」。她说了五遍，最后说成「热巧……克……」，然后就喝了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan hē rè qiǎokèlì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jiāo wàipó yòng Zhōngwén shuō “rè qiǎokèlì”. Tā shuō le wǔ biàn, zuìhòu shuō chéng “rè qiǎo …… kè ……”, ránhòu jiù hē le, hāha.","m":"You said you love hot chocolate too! These days I taught Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us) to say 热巧克力 in Chinese. She tried five times, got to “rè qiǎo… kè…”, and then just drank it, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天最爱喝什么热的？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān zuì ài hē shénme rè de?","m":"What hot drink do you love most in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"热巧克力。","p":"Rè qiǎokèlì.","m":"Hot chocolate.","r":{"t":"我们是一队的！","p":"Wǒmen shì yí duì de!","m":"We're on the same team!"}},{"t":"热茶。","p":"Rè chá.","m":"Hot tea.","r":{"t":"热茶也好，我的语伴每天都喝。","p":"Rè chá yě hǎo, wǒ de yǔbàn měi tiān dōu hē.","m":"Tea's good too — my language partner drinks it every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又是热巧克力，外婆说「好喝」。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu shì rè qiǎokèlì, wàipó shuō “hǎohē”.","m":"Hot chocolate again this morning — Abuela said 好喝."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"巧克力里放奶酪？我从来没试过。","p":"Qiǎokèlì li fàng nǎilào? Wǒ cónglái méi shìguo.","m":"Cheese in hot chocolate? I've never tried that."},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没试过巧克力里放奶酪","en":"You've never tried cheese in chocolate"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你从来没试过巧克力里放奶酪。这两天我告诉了成都的语伴，她吓了一跳，说：「那我们这里还有人在咖啡里放辣椒呢。」我说：「真的吗？我不信。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ cónglái méi shìguo qiǎokèlì lǐ fàng nǎilào. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gàosu le Chéngdū de yǔbàn, tā xià le yí tiào, shuō: “Nà wǒmen zhèlǐ hái yǒu rén zài kāfēi lǐ fàng làjiāo ne.” Wǒ shuō: “Zhēnde ma? Wǒ bú xìn.”","m":"You said you've never tried cheese in chocolate. These days I told my language partner in Chengdu — she was shocked, and said: “Well, some people here put chilli in coffee.” I said: “Really? I don't believe you.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会试试吗？","p":"Nǐ huì shìshi ma?","m":"Would you try it?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我想试试。","p":"Huì, wǒ xiǎng shìshi.","m":"Yes, I'd like to.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 试完告诉我。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Shì wán gàosu wǒ.","m":"¡Qué chévere! Tell me how it goes."}},{"t":"不会，听起来太奇怪了。","p":"Bú huì, tīng qǐlái tài qíguài le.","m":"No — it sounds too weird.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我懂。我第一次也不敢。","p":"Hāha, wǒ dǒng. Wǒ dì yī cì yě bù gǎn.","m":"Haha, I get it. I didn't dare the first time either."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的热巧克力，我又放了一块奶酪。","p":"Jīntiān de rè qiǎokèlì, wǒ yòu fàng le yí kuài nǎilào.","m":"Put a piece of cheese in my hot chocolate again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一般什么时候喝？","p":"Nǐ yìbān shénme shíhou hē?","m":"When do you usually have it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一般什么时候喝（早饭的时候，配一个面包）","en":"You asked when she drinks it (at breakfast, with a bread roll)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我什么时候喝热巧克力。早饭的时候。这两天考试复习，我早饭吃得很快，热巧克力太烫，我就一边吹一边背生词。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shénme shíhou hē rè qiǎokèlì. Zǎofàn de shíhou. Zhè liǎng tiān kǎoshì fùxí, wǒ zǎofàn chī de hěn kuài, rè qiǎokèlì tài tàng, wǒ jiù yìbiān chuī yìbiān bèi shēngcí.","m":"Last time you asked when I drink hot chocolate. At breakfast. These days I'm revising for exams and eating breakfast fast — the hot chocolate's too hot, so I blow on it while learning words.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你早饭吃得快还是慢？","p":"Nǐ zǎofàn chī de kuài háishi màn?","m":"Do you eat breakfast fast or slowly?"},"replies":[{"t":"快，我总是很赶。","p":"Kuài, wǒ zǒngshì hěn gǎn.","m":"Fast — I'm always rushing.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"慢，我喜欢慢慢吃。","p":"Màn, wǒ xǐhuan mànmàn chī.","m":"Slowly — I like to take my time.","r":{"t":"真好，考完试我也要慢慢吃。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, kǎo wán shì wǒ yě yào mànmàn chī.","m":"Lovely — after my exam I'll eat slowly too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又一边吹热巧克力一边背生词。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu yìbiān chuī rè qiǎokèlì yìbiān bèi shēngcí.","m":"Blowing on my hot chocolate and learning words again this morning."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"是什么奶酪？","p":"Shì shénme nǎilào?","m":"What kind of cheese?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是什么奶酪（一种白色的软奶酪，不太咸）","en":"You asked what kind of cheese (a soft white cheese, not too salty)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问是什么奶酪。白色的软奶酪。这两天我去市场买，卖奶酪的阿姨问我：「你要做热巧克力吗？」她一看就知道！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn shì shénme nǎilào. Báisè de ruǎn nǎilào. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ qù shìchǎng mǎi, mài nǎilào de āyí wèn wǒ: “Nǐ yào zuò rè qiǎokèlì ma?” Tā yí kàn jiù zhīdào!","m":"Last time you asked what kind of cheese. A soft white one. These days I went to buy some at the market, and the cheese lady asked: “Making hot chocolate?” She knew straight away!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边有没有一种吃的，大家一看就知道要做什么？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yǒu méiyǒu yì zhǒng chī de, dàjiā yí kàn jiù zhīdào yào zuò shénme?","m":"Where you are, is there an ingredient where everyone knows at a glance what you're making?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，买南瓜就是要做汤。","p":"Yǒu, mǎi nánguā jiù shì yào zuò tāng.","m":"Yes — buy a pumpkin and you're making soup.","r":{"t":"哈哈，那卖南瓜的人也一看就知道！","p":"Hāha, nà mài nánguā de rén yě yí kàn jiù zhīdào!","m":"Haha, then the pumpkin seller knows at a glance too!"}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"那你来波哥大，我带你去市场看看。","p":"Nà nǐ lái Bōgēdà, wǒ dài nǐ qù shìchǎng kànkan.","m":"Then come to Bogotá — I'll show you the market."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去市场了，卖奶酪的阿姨跟我挥手。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù shìchǎng le, mài nǎilào de āyí gēn wǒ huī shǒu.","m":"Back at the market today — the cheese lady waved at me."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-10|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-10","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I drink coffee all winter too.","p":"","m":"我整个冬天也都喝咖啡。"},"mem":{"zh":"你冬天也一直喝咖啡","en":"You drink coffee all winter too"},"later":{"t":"You said you drink coffee all winter too. This week our staffroom coffee machine broke. Thirty teachers, no coffee, a Thursday in December. Quietest morning of the year.","p":"","m":"你上次说你冬天也一直喝咖啡。这周我们教师办公室的咖啡机坏了。三十个老师，没有咖啡，十二月的一个周四。一年里最安静的一个早上。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What would you miss most if it disappeared for a day?","p":"","m":"要是某样东西消失一天，你最想念什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"My coffee too.","p":"","m":"也是咖啡。","r":{"t":"Then you understand our Thursday.","p":"","m":"那你懂我们那个周四了。"}},{"t":"My phone.","p":"","m":"手机。","r":{"t":"Honest. Most people would say the same.","p":"","m":"老实。大多数人都会这么说。"}}],"next":{"t":"The coffee machine's fixed. The school is alive again.","p":"","m":"咖啡机修好了。学校又活过来了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't drink alcohol.","p":"","m":"我不喝酒。"},"mem":{"zh":"你不喝酒","en":"You don't drink alcohol"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't drink alcohol. This week I made a big pot of alcohol-free glögg for my class's parents' evening. Spices, raisins, almonds. Everyone had two cups.","p":"","m":"你上次说你不喝酒。这周我们班开家长会，我煮了一大锅不含酒精的 glögg。香料、葡萄干、杏仁。每个人都喝了两杯。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite warm drink?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢的热饮是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Hot chocolate.","p":"","m":"热巧克力。","r":{"t":"Ja! The kids' favourite too.","p":"","m":"对！孩子们也最爱。"}},{"t":"Tea with honey.","p":"","m":"加蜂蜜的茶。","r":{"t":"Lovely. Gentle and warm.","p":"","m":"真好。温和又暖。"}}],"next":{"t":"Leftover glögg — no alcohol! — for breakfast. Very festive.","p":"","m":"早饭喝剩下的 glögg——不含酒精！很有节日气氛。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's in glögg?","p":"","m":"热红酒里放什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过 glögg 里有什么（红酒、香料、葡萄干和杏仁）","en":"You asked what's in glögg (wine, spices, raisins and almonds)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what's in glögg. Wine, spices, raisins and almonds. This week I learned the spices' names in English for you: cinnamon, cloves, cardamom, ginger. The kitchen smells like Christmas.","p":"","m":"你上次问 glögg 里有什么。红酒、香料、葡萄干和杏仁。这周我替你把香料的英文名都学了：肉桂、丁香、小豆蔻、姜。厨房闻起来像圣诞节。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Which spice do you like most?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢哪种香料？"},"replies":[{"t":"Cinnamon.","p":"","m":"肉桂。","r":{"t":"A true friend of Sweden!","p":"","m":"瑞典的真朋友！"}},{"t":"I'm not sure.","p":"","m":"说不好。","r":{"t":"Smell them one by one sometime. It's fun.","p":"","m":"哪天一样一样闻闻。很好玩。"}}],"next":{"t":"Kitchen still smells of cloves today.","p":"","m":"今天厨房里还有丁香的味道。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"When do you drink it?","p":"","m":"什么时候喝？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过什么时候喝 glögg（只在十二月，配姜饼）","en":"You asked when they drink glögg (only in December, with gingerbread)"},"later":{"t":"You asked when we drink glögg. Only in December, with gingerbread. This week we had our first glögg evening with the neighbours — everyone brought gingerbread, and no two were the same shape.","p":"","m":"你上次问什么时候喝 glögg。只在十二月，配姜饼。这周我们跟邻居过了今年第一个 glögg 之夜——每家都带了姜饼，没有两块是一样形状的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something you only eat or drink once a year?","p":"","m":"有没有什么东西你一年只吃一次？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, at a festival.","p":"","m":"有，过节的时候。","r":{"t":"Those are the best — you wait all year.","p":"","m":"那是最好的——等一整年。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then maybe start one. A little tradition.","p":"","m":"那也许可以开始一个。一个小小的传统。"}}],"next":{"t":"One more gingerbread for the road.","p":"","m":"路上再来一块姜饼。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-10|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-10","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I order iced coffee in winter too.","p":"","m":"我冬天也点冰咖啡。"},"mem":{"zh":"你冬天也点冰咖啡","en":"You order iced coffee in winter too"},"later":{"t":"You said you order iced coffee in winter too. This week the coffee cart guy refused. He said: 'It's minus three. Hot one, on me.' I said yes. Honestly, it was good.","p":"","m":"你上次说你冬天也点冰咖啡。这周咖啡车的大哥不卖了。他说：「零下三度。来杯热的，我请。」我答应了。说实话，挺好喝。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a habit people find strange?","p":"","m":"你有没有别人觉得奇怪的习惯？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a few.","p":"","m":"有，几个。","r":{"t":"Good. Strange habits make life fun.","p":"","m":"好。奇怪的习惯让生活有趣。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then you're the normal one between us, haha.","p":"","m":"那我们两个里你是正常的那个，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot coffee again today. Two days in a row!","p":"","m":"今天又是热咖啡。连着两天！"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I only drink hot drinks in winter.","p":"","m":"我冬天只喝热的。"},"mem":{"zh":"你冬天只喝热的","en":"You only drink hot drinks in winter"},"later":{"t":"You said you only drink hot drinks in winter. So this week I tried. Hot all week. My hands were warm, my friends were happy. Honestly, maybe you're right.","p":"","m":"你上次说你冬天只喝热的。所以这周我试了。一整周都喝热的。手是暖的，朋友们也很高兴。说实话，也许你是对的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite hot drink?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢的热饮是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Tea.","p":"","m":"茶。","r":{"t":"Nice. My mom would agree.","p":"","m":"不错。我妈会同意的。"}},{"t":"Hot chocolate.","p":"","m":"热巧克力。","r":{"t":"Good choice. Very December.","p":"","m":"好选择。很十二月。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still on hot coffee. Day four.","p":"","m":"还在喝热咖啡。第四天。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why iced in December?","p":"","m":"为什么十二月还喝冰的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他为什么十二月还喝冰的（习惯，在首尔大家一年四季都喝冰美式）","en":"You asked why iced in December (habit — in Seoul everyone drinks iced Americanos all year)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why iced in December. A Seoul habit — people there joke 'eoljuka': 'even if I freeze to death, iced Americano'. This week I told Jess. She laughed for a full minute.","p":"","m":"你上次问我为什么十二月还喝冰的。首尔的习惯——那边的人开玩笑说「얼죽아」：「冻死也要喝冰美式」。这周我跟 Jess 说了。她笑了整整一分钟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a habit from home that you still keep?","p":"","m":"有没有你从老家带来的习惯，一直保留着？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, the food I eat.","p":"","m":"有，吃的东西。","r":{"t":"Food habits never leave, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，吃的习惯永远改不了。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Maybe you'll notice one if you ever move.","p":"","m":"要是哪天搬家，你也许会发现一个。"}}],"next":{"t":"Iced coffee, minus two. Still alive, haha.","p":"","m":"冰咖啡，零下二度。还活着，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How cold is New York now?","p":"","m":"纽约现在多冷？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过纽约现在多冷（零度左右）","en":"You asked how cold New York is (around zero)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how cold New York is. Around zero. This week it dropped to minus five, and I bought my first real winter coat. The shop lady said, 'Welcome to New York.' Honestly, it felt like a ceremony.","p":"","m":"你上次问纽约现在多冷。零度左右。这周降到了零下五度，我买了第一件真正的冬天大衣。店员阿姨说：「欢迎来到纽约。」说实话，感觉像一场仪式。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you remember buying your first winter coat?","p":"","m":"你还记得买第一件冬天大衣吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my parents bought it.","p":"","m":"记得，爸妈买的。","r":{"t":"Nice. I bought mine alone. A bit sad, a bit proud.","p":"","m":"真好。我的是自己买的。有点伤感，有点骄傲。"}},{"t":"I don't need one where I live.","p":"","m":"我那边用不着。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Keep it that way.","p":"","m":"真好。就这样保持吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"New coat, first cold morning. Toasty.","p":"","m":"新大衣，第一个冷的早上。暖暖的。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Our team had its Christmas party this week. Secret Santa — I got Jess.","p":"","m":"这周我们组办了圣诞聚会。抽秘密圣诞老人——我抽到了 Jess。"},{"t":"I gave her a little sketch of her at her desk, with 'You crushed it' written underneath. She cried a bit.","p":"","m":"我送了她一张小速写，画的是她坐在桌前，下面写着「你干得太漂亮了」。她哭了一点。"},{"t":"Honestly, the best gift I've ever given. And the cheapest.","p":"","m":"说实话，我送过最好的礼物。也是最便宜的。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's such a thoughtful gift.","p":"","m":"这个礼物真用心。","r":{"t":"Thanks. Drawing is how I say things I can't say yet.","p":"","m":"谢谢。画画是我说出还说不出来的话的方式。"}},{"t":"Did she know it was you?","p":"","m":"她知道是你吗？","r":{"t":"Immediately. Nobody else draws like that, haha.","p":"","m":"马上就知道了。没人那么画，哈哈。"}}],"from":"2026-12-12"}},"2026-12-11|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-11","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢跟大家一起做饭。","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan gēn dàjiā yìqǐ zuò fàn.","m":"I love cooking with other people too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢跟大家一起做饭","en":"You like cooking with other people too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢跟大家一起做饭！这两天我们在青旅办了一个「每人做一个家乡菜」的晚上，一共八个国家的菜。我做了法国的可丽饼，一下就被抢光了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan gēn dàjiā yìqǐ zuò fàn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen zài qīnglǚ bàn le yí gè “měi rén zuò yí gè jiāxiāng cài” de wǎnshang, yígòng bā gè guójiā de cài. Wǒ zuò le Fǎguó de kělìbǐng, yíxià jiù bèi qiǎng guāng le.","m":"You said you like cooking with other people too! These days we held a 'everyone cooks a dish from home' night at the hostel — food from eight countries. I made French crêpes, and they were gone in a flash.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你做一个家乡菜，你会做什么？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ zuò yí gè jiāxiāng cài, nǐ huì zuò shénme?","m":"If you made a dish from home, what would it be?"},"replies":[{"t":"我妈妈的拿手菜。","p":"Wǒ māma de náshǒu cài.","m":"My mum's signature dish.","r":{"t":"那一定很好吃！下次教我。","p":"Nà yídìng hěn hǎochī! Xià cì jiāo wǒ.","m":"Then it must be delicious! Teach me next time."}},{"t":"我只会做最简单的。","p":"Wǒ zhǐ huì zuò zuì jiǎndān de.","m":"I can only make the simplest things.","r":{"t":"简单的也好！番茄炒蛋就是我最骄傲的菜。","p":"Jiǎndān de yě hǎo! Fānqié chǎo dàn jiù shì wǒ zuì jiāo'ào de cài.","m":"Simple's good! Tomato and egg is my proudest dish."}}],"next":{"t":"今天厨房里又来了新朋友。","p":"Jīntiān chúfáng lǐ yòu lái le xīn péngyou.","m":"New friends in the kitchen again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我晚上一般一个人在家。","p":"Wǒ wǎnshang yìbān yí gè rén zài jiā.","m":"I'm usually home alone in the evenings."},"mem":{"zh":"你晚上一般一个人在家","en":"You're usually home alone in the evenings"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你晚上一般一个人在家。这两天青旅太热闹了，我也想一个人待一会儿，就拿了一本书去楼顶，坐了一个小时，看着河，很安静。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ wǎnshang yìbān yí gè rén zài jiā. Zhè liǎng tiān qīnglǚ tài rènao le, wǒ yě xiǎng yí gè rén dāi yíhuìr, jiù ná le yì běn shū qù lóudǐng, zuò le yí gè xiǎoshí, kàn zhe hé, hěn ānjìng.","m":"You said you're usually home alone in the evenings. These days the hostel's been so lively that I wanted some time alone too, so I took a book up to the roof and sat for an hour looking at the river. So peaceful.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个人的时候，最喜欢做什么？","p":"Nǐ yí gè rén de shíhou, zuì xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like doing most when you're alone?"},"replies":[{"t":"看书。","p":"Kàn shū.","m":"Reading.","r":{"t":"那我们一样！","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"听音乐。","p":"Tīng yīnyuè.","m":"Listening to music.","r":{"t":"好！我在楼顶也戴着耳机。","p":"Hǎo! Wǒ zài lóudǐng yě dài zhe ěrjī.","m":"Nice! I had my headphones on up on the roof too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去楼顶坐了一会儿。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù lóudǐng zuò le yíhuìr.","m":"Sat up on the roof for a while again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"今天做了什么菜？","p":"Jīntiān zuò le shénme cài?","m":"What did you cook today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们做了什么菜（意大利人做意大利面，她做了番茄炒蛋）","en":"You asked what they cooked (pasta from an Italian, tomato and egg from her)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们做了什么菜。我的番茄炒蛋！这两天那个意大利人要跟我学，我教他放一点糖。他吓坏了：「番茄里放糖？」吃完他又要了一份。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen zuò le shénme cài. Wǒ de fānqié chǎo dàn! Zhè liǎng tiān nà gè Yìdàlì rén yào gēn wǒ xué, wǒ jiāo tā fàng yìdiǎn táng. Tā xià huài le: “Fānqié lǐ fàng táng?” Chī wán tā yòu yào le yí fèn.","m":"Last time you asked what we cooked. My tomato and egg! These days the Italian guy wanted to learn it, and I told him to add a little sugar. He was horrified: “Sugar in tomatoes?” Then he asked for seconds.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃过把甜和咸放在一起的菜吗？","p":"Nǐ chīguo bǎ tián hé xián fàng zài yìqǐ de cài ma?","m":"Have you had dishes that mix sweet and salty?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃过，很好吃。","p":"Chīguo, hěn hǎochī.","m":"Yes — delicious.","r":{"t":"对吧！有时候最奇怪的最好吃。","p":"Duì ba! Yǒu shíhou zuì qíguài de zuì hǎochī.","m":"Right? Sometimes the strangest things taste best."}},{"t":"没吃过，听起来有点怪。","p":"Méi chīguo, tīng qǐlái yǒudiǎn guài.","m":"No — sounds a bit odd.","r":{"t":"试一次吧！说不定你会喜欢。","p":"Shì yí cì ba! Shuōbudìng nǐ huì xǐhuan.","m":"Try it once! You might love it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又做了番茄炒蛋，放了一点糖。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zuò le fānqié chǎo dàn, fàng le yìdiǎn táng.","m":"Made tomato and egg again today — with a little sugar."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们用什么语言聊天？","p":"Nǐmen yòng shénme yǔyán liáotiān?","m":"What language do you all chat in?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们用什么语言聊天（大多是英语，她有时候教几句中文）","en":"You asked what language they chat in (mostly English — she teaches a bit of Chinese)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们用什么语言聊天。这两天，青旅里已经有三个人会说「你好」「谢谢」「好吃」了。我在厨房墙上贴了一张纸，每天写一句新的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen yòng shénme yǔyán liáotiān. Zhè liǎng tiān, qīnglǚ lǐ yǐjīng yǒu sān gè rén huì shuō “nǐ hǎo” “xièxie” “hǎochī” le. Wǒ zài chúfáng qiáng shang tiē le yì zhāng zhǐ, měi tiān xiě yí jù xīn de.","m":"Last time you asked what language we chat in. These days three people at the hostel can already say 你好, 谢谢 and 好吃. I've stuck a sheet on the kitchen wall and write a new phrase every day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会教别人说你的语言吗？","p":"Nǐ huì jiāo biérén shuō nǐ de yǔyán ma?","m":"Do you teach people your language?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，教过朋友。","p":"Huì, jiāoguo péngyou.","m":"Yes — I've taught friends.","r":{"t":"太好了！教别人也是在学。","p":"Tài hǎo le! Jiāo biérén yě shì zài xué.","m":"Great! Teaching is learning too."}},{"t":"还没有，可是想试试。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, kěshì xiǎng shìshi.","m":"Not yet, but I'd like to.","r":{"t":"试试吧，从「你好」开始最简单。","p":"Shìshi ba, cóng “nǐ hǎo” kāishǐ zuì jiǎndān.","m":"Give it a go — start with hello."}}],"next":{"t":"厨房墙上今天写的是「再来一碗」。","p":"Chúfáng qiáng shang jīntiān xiě de shì “zài lái yì wǎn”.","m":"Today's phrase on the kitchen wall: 再来一碗, 'another bowl, please'."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我本来下个星期要走，可是我决定在这家青旅多住一个星期。","p":"Wǒ běnlái xià gè xīngqī yào zǒu, kěshì wǒ juédìng zài zhè jiā qīnglǚ duō zhù yí gè xīngqī.","m":"I was going to leave next week, but I've decided to stay at this hostel another week."},{"t":"厨房墙上那张中文纸，已经写到第十句了，大家每天都在等新的一句。","p":"Chúfáng qiáng shang nà zhāng Zhōngwén zhǐ, yǐjīng xiě dào dì shí jù le, dàjiā měi tiān dōu zài děng xīn de yí jù.","m":"The Chinese sheet on the kitchen wall is up to ten phrases — everyone waits for the new one each day."},{"t":"最新的一句是「舍不得」。写完我自己都笑了。","p":"Zuì xīn de yí jù shì “shěbude”. Xiě wán wǒ zìjǐ dōu xiào le.","m":"The newest is 舍不得 — 'can't bear to leave'. I laughed as I wrote it."}],"replies":[{"t":"「舍不得」这个词真好。","p":"“Shěbude” zhège cí zhēn hǎo.","m":"舍不得 is a lovely word.","r":{"t":"对吧！说的就是我现在的心情。","p":"Duì ba! Shuō de jiù shì wǒ xiànzài de xīnqíng.","m":"Right? It's exactly how I feel right now."}},{"t":"多住一个星期，真好！","p":"Duō zhù yí gè xīngqī, zhēn hǎo!","m":"Another week — lovely!","r":{"t":"是啊，旅行不用着急。","p":"Shì a, lǚxíng bú yòng zháojí.","m":"Yes — no need to rush travelling."}}],"from":"2026-12-13"}},"2026-12-11|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-11","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这几天晚上也在看剧。","p":"Wǒ zhè jǐ tiān wǎnshang yě zài kàn jù.","m":"I've been watching a series in the evenings too."},"mem":{"zh":"你这几天晚上也在看剧","en":"You've been watching shows in the evenings too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你这几天晚上也在看剧。我这两天又发现一部好的，讲北京一个胡同里几家人的事，看着看着就像在看我们楼里。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhè jǐ tiān wǎnshang yě zài kàn jù. Wǒ zhè liǎng tiān yòu fāxiàn yí bù hǎo de, jiǎng Běijīng yí gè hútòng lǐ jǐ jiā rén de shì, kàn zhe kàn zhe jiù xiàng zài kàn wǒmen lóu lǐ.","m":"You said you've been watching shows in the evenings too. These days I found another good one, about a few families in a Beijing hutong — watching it feels like watching my own building.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看剧喜欢看什么样的？","p":"Nǐ kàn jù xǐhuan kàn shénme yàng de?","m":"What kind of shows do you like?"},"replies":[{"t":"轻松的，看了开心。","p":"Qīngsōng de, kàn le kāixīn.","m":"Light ones that cheer me up.","r":{"t":"对，冬天就要看点儿开心的。","p":"Duì, dōngtiān jiù yào kàn diǎnr kāixīn de.","m":"Right — winter calls for something cheerful."}},{"t":"悬疑的，越烧脑越好。","p":"Xuányí de, yuè shāonǎo yuè hǎo.","m":"Mysteries — the more brain-teasing the better.","r":{"t":"厉害！我看悬疑的老猜错。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ kàn xuányí de lǎo cāi cuò.","m":"Impressive! I always guess wrong with mysteries."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又窝在沙发上了。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu wō zài shāfā shang le.","m":"Curled up on the sofa again this evening."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"一部美剧。","p":"Yí bù Měijù.","m":"An American series."},"mem":{"zh":"你在看一部美剧","en":"You're watching an American series"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在看一部美剧。这两天我也找了一部美剧看，开着中文字幕。结果我的学生说：「老师，您在学英语吗？」我说：「我在学怎么当学生。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài kàn yí bù Měijù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě zhǎo le yí bù Měijù kàn, kāi zhe Zhōngwén zìmù. Jiéguǒ wǒ de xuésheng shuō: “Lǎoshī, nín zài xué Yīngyǔ ma?” Wǒ shuō: “Wǒ zài xué zěnme dāng xuésheng.”","m":"You said you're watching an American series. These days I found one too, with Chinese subtitles. One of my students asked: “Teacher, are you learning English?” I said: “I'm learning how to be a student.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看剧开字幕吗？","p":"Nǐ kàn jù kāi zìmù ma?","m":"Do you watch with subtitles?"},"replies":[{"t":"开，不开听不懂。","p":"Kāi, bù kāi tīng bu dǒng.","m":"Yes — I'd miss things otherwise.","r":{"t":"一样，字幕是好朋友。","p":"Yíyàng, zìmù shì hǎo péngyou.","m":"Same — subtitles are a good friend."}},{"t":"不开，我想练听力。","p":"Bù kāi, wǒ xiǎng liàn tīnglì.","m":"No — I want to train my ear.","r":{"t":"好样的！我的学生要是都像你就好了。","p":"Hǎoyàng de! Wǒ de xuésheng yàoshi dōu xiàng nǐ jiù hǎo le.","m":"Good for you! I wish all my students were like you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了一集美剧，字幕还是开着，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le yì jí Měijù, zìmù háishi kāi zhe, hāha.","m":"Another episode of my American show today — subtitles still on, haha."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"一部中国的剧，练听力。","p":"Yí bù Zhōngguó de jù, liàn tīnglì.","m":"A Chinese series, for listening practice."},"mem":{"zh":"你在看一部中国的剧，练听力","en":"You're watching a Chinese drama to practise listening"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在看中国的剧练听力。这两天我给班上的学生也推荐了一部，结果第二天一半的人都说：「老师，我看到夜里一点。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài kàn Zhōngguó de jù liàn tīnglì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gěi bān shang de xuésheng yě tuījiàn le yí bù, jiéguǒ dì èr tiān yíbàn de rén dōu shuō: “Lǎoshī, wǒ kàn dào yèlǐ yì diǎn.”","m":"You said you're watching a Chinese drama for listening practice. These days I recommended one to my class too — and the next day half of them said: “Teacher, I watched till one in the morning.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"看剧的时候，你会跟着说吗？","p":"Kàn jù de shíhou, nǐ huì gēn zhe shuō ma?","m":"Do you say the lines along with the show?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，学几句好玩的。","p":"Huì, xué jǐ jù hǎowán de.","m":"Yes — I pick up a few fun lines.","r":{"t":"这个好，剧里的话都很好用！","p":"Zhège hǎo, jù lǐ de huà dōu hěn hǎo yòng!","m":"Good — lines from shows are really useful!"}},{"t":"不会，就是听。","p":"Bú huì, jiù shì tīng.","m":"No — I just listen.","r":{"t":"听多了，嘴巴自己就会了。","p":"Tīng duō le, zuǐba zìjǐ jiù huì le.","m":"Listen enough and your mouth learns by itself."}}],"next":{"t":"今天学生又跟我说剧情了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān xuésheng yòu gēn wǒ shuō jùqíng le, hāha.","m":"A student told me the plot again today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我晚上常常出去。","p":"Wǒ wǎnshang chángcháng chūqù.","m":"I go out a lot in the evenings."},"mem":{"zh":"你晚上常常出去","en":"You often go out in the evenings"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你晚上常常出去。我被你说动了，这两天下了班没回家，去后海边上走了一圈。湖面开始结冰了，有人在上面试着走，被保安叫回来了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ wǎnshang chángcháng chūqù. Wǒ bèi nǐ shuōdòng le, zhè liǎng tiān xià le bān méi huí jiā, qù Hòuhǎi biān shang zǒu le yì quān. Húmiàn kāishǐ jié bīng le, yǒu rén zài shàngmiàn shì zhe zǒu, bèi bǎo'ān jiào huílái le.","m":"You said you often go out in the evenings. You talked me into it — these days after work I didn't go straight home but walked round Houhai Lake. The surface is starting to freeze; someone tried walking on it and got called back by a guard.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你晚上出去一般去哪儿？","p":"Nǐ wǎnshang chūqù yìbān qù nǎr?","m":"Where do you usually go in the evenings?"},"replies":[{"t":"跟朋友吃饭。","p":"Gēn péngyou chī fàn.","m":"Dinner with friends.","r":{"t":"这个最好，吃完还能聊。","p":"Zhège zuì hǎo, chī wán hái néng liáo.","m":"The best — and you keep chatting after."}},{"t":"去健身房。","p":"Qù jiànshēnfáng.","m":"The gym.","r":{"t":"好有毅力！我下了班只想躺着。","p":"Hǎo yǒu yìlì! Wǒ xià le bān zhǐ xiǎng tǎng zhe.","m":"Such willpower! After work I just want to lie down."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下班又绕到后海看了一眼。","p":"Jīntiān xiàbān yòu rào dào Hòuhǎi kàn le yì yǎn.","m":"Took the long way past Houhai again after work today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在看什么剧？","p":"Nǐ zài kàn shénme jù?","m":"What are you watching?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在看什么剧（一部老的家庭剧，妈妈推荐的）","en":"You asked what she's watching (an old family drama her mum recommended)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在看什么剧。我妈推荐的那部老剧。这两天我看到一半，打电话问我妈后面怎么样，她说：「你自己看！」挂了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài kàn shénme jù. Wǒ mā tuījiàn de nà bù lǎo jù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ kàn dào yíbàn, dǎ diànhuà wèn wǒ mā hòumiàn zěnmeyàng, tā shuō: “Nǐ zìjǐ kàn!” Guà le.","m":"Last time you asked what show I'm watching. The old one Mum recommended. These days I got halfway, called Mum to ask what happens next, and she said: “Watch it yourself!” and hung up.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人会推荐东西给你吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén huì tuījiàn dōngxi gěi nǐ ma?","m":"Does your family recommend things to you?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，我妈什么都推荐。","p":"Huì, wǒ mā shénme dōu tuījiàn.","m":"Yes — my mum recommends everything.","r":{"t":"妈妈们都一样，哈哈。","p":"Māmamen dōu yíyàng, hāha.","m":"Mums are all the same, haha."}},{"t":"不太会，我们口味不一样。","p":"Bú tài huì, wǒmen kǒuwèi bù yíyàng.","m":"Not really — we have different tastes.","r":{"t":"也是，各看各的也挺好。","p":"Yě shì, gè kàn gè de yě tǐng hǎo.","m":"Fair — watching your own things is fine too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了两集，我妈还是不剧透。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le liǎng jí, wǒ mā háishi bú jùtòu.","m":"Two more episodes today — Mum still won't give spoilers."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一次看几集？","p":"Nǐ yí cì kàn jǐ jí?","m":"How many episodes at a time?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一次看几集（说好一集，结果看了三集）","en":"You asked how many episodes she watches at once (she means one, ends up watching three)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一次看几集。说好一集，结果三集。这两天我想了个办法：定个闹钟，一集完了就响。结果闹钟响了，我把它关了，接着看，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yí cì kàn jǐ jí. Shuō hǎo yì jí, jiéguǒ sān jí. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng le gè bànfǎ: dìng gè nàozhōng, yì jí wán le jiù xiǎng. Jiéguǒ nàozhōng xiǎng le, wǒ bǎ tā guān le, jiē zhe kàn, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked how many episodes I watch at once. I mean one, I watch three. These days I tried setting an alarm for the end of an episode. It went off — I switched it off and kept watching, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有那种「就一会儿」，结果停不下来的事？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu nà zhǒng “jiù yíhuìr”, jiéguǒ tíng bu xiàlái de shì?","m":"Is there something where you say 'just a bit' and can't stop?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，刷手机。","p":"Yǒu, shuā shǒujī.","m":"Yes — scrolling my phone.","r":{"t":"这个谁都有，哈哈。","p":"Zhège shéi dōu yǒu, hāha.","m":"Everyone has that one, haha."}},{"t":"有，吃零食。","p":"Yǒu, chī língshí.","m":"Yes — snacks.","r":{"t":"零食最危险，一包接一包。","p":"Língshí zuì wēixiǎn, yì bāo jiē yì bāo.","m":"Snacks are the most dangerous — one bag after another."}}],"next":{"t":"今天说好一集，结果又是三集。","p":"Jīntiān shuō hǎo yì jí, jiéguǒ yòu shì sān jí.","m":"Said one episode today — ended up watching three again."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-11|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-11","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边晚上也有很多人散步。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān wǎnshang yě yǒu hěn duō rén sànbù.","m":"Lots of people go for evening walks here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边晚上也有很多人散步","en":"Lots of people go out walking in the evening where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边晚上也有很多人散步。这两天我跟妹妹在尼罗河边走，碰到一对中国夫妻在问路，我用中文帮了他们。他们说：「在这儿还能听到中文，真好。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān wǎnshang yě yǒu hěn duō rén sànbù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn mèimei zài Níluó Hé biān zǒu, pèng dào yí duì Zhōngguó fūqī zài wèn lù, wǒ yòng Zhōngwén bāng le tāmen. Tāmen shuō: “Zài zhèr hái néng tīng dào Zhōngwén, zhēn hǎo.”","m":"You said lots of people go out walking in the evening where you are too. These days, walking by the Nile with my sister, we met a Chinese couple asking for directions, and I helped them in Chinese. They said: “How nice to hear Chinese here.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你晚上散步会去哪儿？","p":"Nǐ wǎnshang sànbù huì qù nǎr?","m":"Where do you go for evening walks?"},"replies":[{"t":"家附近转转。","p":"Jiā fùjìn zhuànzhuan.","m":"Around my neighbourhood.","r":{"t":"家附近最好，走着走着就到家了。","p":"Jiā fùjìn zuì hǎo, zǒu zhe zǒu zhe jiù dào jiā le.","m":"Close to home is best — you end up back at your door."}},{"t":"我晚上不太出门。","p":"Wǒ wǎnshang bú tài chūmén.","m":"I don't go out much in the evening.","r":{"t":"也好，在家喝杯茶也很舒服。","p":"Yě hǎo, zài jiā hē bēi chá yě hěn shūfu.","m":"That's fine — tea at home is cosy too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上河边的风很舒服。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang hé biān de fēng hěn shūfu.","m":"Lovely breeze by the river this evening."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边晚上太冷，大家都在家。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān wǎnshang tài lěng, dàjiā dōu zài jiā.","m":"It's too cold here in the evenings — everyone stays in."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边晚上太冷，大家都在家","en":"It's too cold in the evenings where you are — everyone stays in"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边晚上太冷，大家都在家。这两天我在想：要是去了台北，冬天晚上我也会在家。所以我开始练习一个人做晚饭。第一次做的米饭……准确地说，是粥。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān wǎnshang tài lěng, dàjiā dōu zài jiā. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng: yàoshi qù le Táiběi, dōngtiān wǎnshang wǒ yě huì zài jiā. Suǒyǐ wǒ kāishǐ liànxí yí gè rén zuò wǎnfàn. Dì yī cì zuò de mǐfàn …… zhǔnquè de shuō, shì zhōu.","m":"You said it's too cold in the evenings where you are, so everyone stays in. These days I've been thinking: if I go to Taipei, I'll be staying in on winter evenings too. So I've started practising cooking dinner on my own. My first rice… to be precise, was porridge.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会做饭吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zuò fàn ma?","m":"Can you cook?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，做得还不错。","p":"Huì, zuò de hái búcuò.","m":"Yes, not bad.","r":{"t":"那你教教我！","p":"Nà nǐ jiāojiao wǒ!","m":"Then teach me!"}},{"t":"不太会。","p":"Bú tài huì.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"我们一起学吧，我的米饭也需要帮助，哈哈。","p":"Wǒmen yìqǐ xué ba, wǒ de mǐfàn yě xūyào bāngzhù, hāha.","m":"Let's learn together — my rice needs help too, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天第二次做米饭，这次真的是米饭了！","p":"Jīntiān dì èr cì zuò mǐfàn, zhè cì zhēnde shì mǐfàn le!","m":"Second attempt at rice today — and this time it really was rice!"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们一般去哪儿散步？","p":"Nǐmen yìbān qù nǎr sànbù?","m":"Where do you usually walk?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们去哪儿散步（尼罗河边，有风，还有卖烤玉米的）","en":"You asked where they walk (by the Nile — breezy, with roast corn sellers)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们去哪儿散步。尼罗河边。这两天我又买了烤玉米，卖玉米的大叔听到我在用中文打电话，问我：「你是中国人吗？」我说：「不是，准确地说，我在练习。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen qù nǎr sànbù. Níluó Hé biān. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu mǎi le kǎo yùmǐ, mài yùmǐ de dàshū tīng dào wǒ zài yòng Zhōngwén dǎ diànhuà, wèn wǒ: “Nǐ shì Zhōngguó rén ma?” Wǒ shuō: “Bú shì, zhǔnquè de shuō, wǒ zài liànxí.”","m":"Last time you asked where we walk. By the Nile. These days I bought roast corn again, and the corn seller heard me on the phone in Chinese and asked: “Are you Chinese?” I said: “No — to be precise, I'm practising.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家附近有没有卖小吃的地方？","p":"Nǐ jiā fùjìn yǒu méiyǒu mài xiǎochī de dìfang?","m":"Are there snack sellers near you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，晚上很多。","p":"Yǒu, wǎnshang hěn duō.","m":"Yes — lots in the evening.","r":{"t":"真好，散步的时候最想吃了。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, sànbù de shíhou zuì xiǎng chī le.","m":"Lovely — that's when you crave them most."}},{"t":"没有，要走很远。","p":"Méiyǒu, yào zǒu hěn yuǎn.","m":"No — I'd have to walk far.","r":{"t":"那就带一点零食出门，哈哈。","p":"Nà jiù dài yìdiǎn língshí chūmén, hāha.","m":"Then take snacks with you, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又买了一根烤玉米。","p":"Jīntiān yòu mǎi le yì gēn kǎo yùmǐ.","m":"Bought another roast corn today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你跟谁一起去？","p":"Nǐ gēn shéi yìqǐ qù?","m":"Who do you go with?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她跟谁一起去（跟妹妹，边走边聊，有时候练中文演讲）","en":"You asked who she goes with (her sister — they chat, and sometimes she rehearses her Chinese speech)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我跟谁去散步。跟妹妹。这两天她说，我的中文演讲她都会背了，虽然她一个字都听不懂。准确地说，她会背的是声调。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ gēn shéi qù sànbù. Gēn mèimei. Zhè liǎng tiān tā shuō, wǒ de Zhōngwén yǎnjiǎng tā dōu huì bèi le, suīrán tā yí gè zì dōu tīng bu dǒng. Zhǔnquè de shuō, tā huì bèi de shì shēngdiào.","m":"Last time you asked who I walk with. My sister. These days she said she knows my Chinese speech by heart — even though she doesn't understand a word. To be precise, what she knows by heart is the tones.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一个总陪着你的人？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí gè zǒng péi zhe nǐ de rén?","m":"Is there someone who's always by your side?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我最好的朋友。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ zuì hǎo de péngyou.","m":"Yes — my best friend.","r":{"t":"真好，有这样的人最幸福。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, yǒu zhèyàng de rén zuì xìngfú.","m":"Lovely — having someone like that is real happiness."}},{"t":"我一般一个人。","p":"Wǒ yìbān yí gè rén.","m":"I'm usually on my own.","r":{"t":"一个人也很好，可以想很多事。","p":"Yí gè rén yě hěn hǎo, kěyǐ xiǎng hěn duō shì.","m":"Being alone is good too — time to think."}}],"next":{"t":"今天散步，妹妹又跟着我念了一遍演讲，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān sànbù, mèimei yòu gēn zhe wǒ niàn le yí biàn yǎnjiǎng, hāha.","m":"On our walk today, my sister recited my speech with me again, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：台湾的学校给我发邮件了——下个月要视频面试！","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: Táiwān de xuéxiào gěi wǒ fā yóujiàn le —— xià gè yuè yào shìpín miànshì!","m":"Guess what: the university in Taiwan emailed — a video interview next month!"},{"t":"我妈听了，又开始织第二条围巾。准确地说，她一紧张就织围巾。","p":"Wǒ mā tīng le, yòu kāishǐ zhī dì èr tiáo wéijīn. Zhǔnquè de shuō, tā yì jǐnzhāng jiù zhī wéijīn.","m":"When Mum heard, she started knitting a second scarf. To be precise — she knits whenever she's nervous."},{"t":"我呢，在练怎么回答「你为什么想来台湾？」","p":"Wǒ ne, zài liàn zěnme huídá “Nǐ wèishénme xiǎng lái Táiwān?”","m":"Me, I'm practising how to answer “Why do you want to come to Taiwan?”"}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜！面试加油！","p":"Gōngxǐ! Miànshì jiāyóu!","m":"Congrats! Good luck with the interview!","r":{"t":"谢谢！我会用我最不书面的中文回答。","p":"Xièxie! Wǒ huì yòng wǒ zuì bù shūmiàn de Zhōngwén huídá.","m":"Thanks! I'll answer in my least formal Chinese."}},{"t":"你妈妈好可爱。","p":"Nǐ māma hǎo kě'ài.","m":"Your mum's adorable.","r":{"t":"是啊。我们家这个冬天不会缺围巾了。","p":"Shì a. Wǒmen jiā zhège dōngtiān bú huì quē wéijīn le.","m":"Yes. Our family won't be short of scarves this winter."}}],"from":"2026-12-13"}},"2026-12-11|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-11","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"People are out at night here too.","p":"","m":"我这边晚上也有很多人在外面。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边晚上也有很多人在外面","en":"People are out at night where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said people are out at night there too. This week I took my speaker out and played some new beats on the street. A little kid danced for ten minutes. Best review I've ever had.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边晚上也有很多人在外面。这周我把音箱拿到街上，放了几段新做的节奏。一个小孩跳了十分钟。这是我收到过最好的评价。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best thing about evenings where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边的傍晚最好的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The cool air.","p":"","m":"凉快的空气。","r":{"t":"Yes! Cool air and music.","p":"","m":"对！凉风加音乐。"}},{"t":"People chatting outside.","p":"","m":"大家在外面聊天。","r":{"t":"Same here. The street is our living room.","p":"","m":"这儿也是。街就是我们的客厅。"}}],"next":{"t":"The little dancer was back on the street tonight.","p":"","m":"今晚那个小舞者又在街上了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's too cold to go out at night here.","p":"","m":"我这边晚上太冷，出不了门。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边晚上太冷，不出门","en":"It's too cold to go out at night where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's too cold to go out at night there. So, kind of, I brought the night to you: this week I recorded our street at nine p.m. — laughing, music, a goat. I'm putting it in a beat.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边晚上太冷，不出门。所以，某种意义上，我把夜晚带给你：这周我录了晚上九点我们这条街——笑声、音乐，还有一只山羊。我要把它放进一段节奏里。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do at home on cold evenings?","p":"","m":"冷的晚上你在家做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Watch something.","p":"","m":"看点什么。","r":{"t":"Good. Add my music, haha.","p":"","m":"好。再加点我的音乐，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Cook something warm.","p":"","m":"做点热的吃。","r":{"t":"That sounds like the best evening.","p":"","m":"那听起来是最好的晚上。"}}],"next":{"t":"Listened to my street recording with the goat again, haha.","p":"","m":"又听了一遍那段有山羊的街声，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do people do out there?","p":"","m":"大家在外面干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过大家在外面做什么（吃东西、聊天、放音乐，总有人带音箱）","en":"You asked what people do out there (eat, talk, play music — someone always has a speaker)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what people do out there. This week it was food: a woman sells kelewele — spicy fried plantain — on my corner. The queue at nine p.m. is longer than at the bank.","p":"","m":"你上次问大家在外面做什么。这周是吃：我家街角有个阿姨卖 kelewele——辣辣的炸大蕉。晚上九点排队的人比银行还多。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best street food near you?","p":"","m":"你家附近最好吃的路边小吃是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something fried.","p":"","m":"炸的东西。","r":{"t":"Chale, fried is always right.","p":"","m":"兄弟，炸的永远没错。"}},{"t":"I'm not sure.","p":"","m":"说不好。","r":{"t":"Then come and try kelewele. You'll be sure.","p":"","m":"那来尝尝 kelewele。你就确定了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Had kelewele again tonight. No regrets.","p":"","m":"今晚又吃了 kelewele。不后悔。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you go out too?","p":"","m":"你也出去吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他也出去吗（每天晚上，干完活就出去）","en":"You asked if he goes out too (every evening after work)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I go out too. Every evening. This week I bumped into my old music teacher on the street. He asked what I'm working on — then sang me a highlife line for my new song. Right there.","p":"","m":"你上次问我也出去吗。每天晚上都出去。这周我在街上碰到了以前的音乐老师。他问我在做什么——然后当场给我的新歌唱了一句 highlife。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever bumped into an old teacher?","p":"","m":"你有没有在街上碰到过以前的老师？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — it was a bit funny.","p":"","m":"有，有点好笑。","r":{"t":"Right? Suddenly you're a kid again.","p":"","m":"对吧？一下子又变成小孩了。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"When you do, say thank you. They love it.","p":"","m":"碰到的话，说声谢谢。他们会很开心。"}}],"next":{"t":"Working on my teacher's highlife line today.","p":"","m":"今天在弄老师唱的那句 highlife。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Chale — someone played my song at a wedding this week. I wasn't invited. My cousin was.","p":"","m":"兄弟——这周有人在婚礼上放了我的歌。我没被邀请。我表哥去了。"},{"t":"He sent me a voice note: two hundred people dancing, and my bassline under all of it.","p":"","m":"他给我发了一条语音：两百个人在跳舞，下面全是我的低音线。"},{"t":"I listened to it ten times. My mum listened twelve.","p":"","m":"我听了十遍。我妈听了十二遍。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's amazing!","p":"","m":"太厉害了！","r":{"t":"Chale, I'm still smiling.","p":"","m":"兄弟，我到现在还在笑。"}},{"t":"Your mum's your biggest fan.","p":"","m":"你妈妈是你最大的粉丝。","r":{"t":"She is. Even when the dishes aren't done.","p":"","m":"是的。哪怕碗还没洗。"}}],"from":"2026-12-13"}},"2026-12-12|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也很喜欢泡温泉。","p":"Wǒ yě hěn xǐhuan pào wēnquán.","m":"I love hot springs too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也很喜欢泡温泉","en":"You love hot springs too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也很喜欢泡温泉！周末我跟室友去了北投，泡完出来，外面冷风一吹，好舒服。室友说这叫「冷热交替」，她最懂。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě hěn xǐhuan pào wēnquán! Zhōumò wǒ gēn shìyǒu qù le Běitóu, pào wán chūlái, wàimiàn lěng fēng yì chuī, hǎo shūfu. Shìyǒu shuō zhè jiào “lěng rè jiāotì”, tā zuì dǒng.","m":"You said you love hot springs too! At the weekend my roommate and I went to Beitou — stepping out afterwards into the cold wind felt amazing. My roommate calls it 'hot and cold in turns' — she's the expert.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你泡温泉会泡多久？","p":"Nǐ pào wēnquán huì pào duō jiǔ?","m":"How long do you stay in a hot spring?"},"replies":[{"t":"一个小时以上。","p":"Yí gè xiǎoshí yǐshàng.","m":"Over an hour.","r":{"t":"好厉害！我泡十五分钟就头晕了。","p":"Hǎo lìhai! Wǒ pào shíwǔ fēnzhōng jiù tóuyūn le.","m":"Impressive! Fifteen minutes and I'm dizzy."}},{"t":"一下子就好。","p":"Yíxiàzi jiù hǎo.","m":"Just a short while.","r":{"t":"对，泡太久会晕。","p":"Duì, pào tài jiǔ huì yūn.","m":"Right — too long and you get dizzy."}}],"next":{"t":"今天还觉得全身暖暖的，温泉好有用。","p":"Jīntiān hái juéde quánshēn nuǎnnuǎn de, wēnquán hǎo yǒu yòng.","m":"Still feel warm all over today — the hot spring really works."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我从来没泡过温泉。","p":"Wǒ cónglái méi pàoguo wēnquán.","m":"I've never been to a hot spring."},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没泡过温泉","en":"You've never been to a hot spring"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你从来没泡过温泉。周末我去北投的时候帮你记下了：公共温泉要穿泳衣，先冲澡再下去，头发要绑起来。下次你来就不会紧张了！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ cónglái méi pàoguo wēnquán. Zhōumò wǒ qù Běitóu de shíhou bāng nǐ jì xià le: gōnggòng wēnquán yào chuān yǒngyī, xiān chōng zǎo zài xiàqù, tóufa yào bǎng qǐlái. Xià cì nǐ lái jiù bú huì jǐnzhāng le!","m":"You said you've never been to a hot spring. When I went to Beitou at the weekend, I noted the rules for you: at the public pools you wear a swimsuit, shower first, and tie your hair up. Next time you come, you won't be nervous!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会在别人面前泡温泉吗？还是想要自己一个人？","p":"Nǐ huì zài biérén miànqián pào wēnquán ma? Háishi xiǎng yào zìjǐ yí gè rén?","m":"Would you be fine at a public hot spring, or prefer a private one?"},"replies":[{"t":"公共的也没问题。","p":"Gōnggòng de yě méi wèntí.","m":"Public is fine.","r":{"t":"那北投的公共温泉很适合你，又便宜。","p":"Nà Běitóu de gōnggòng wēnquán hěn shìhé nǐ, yòu piányi.","m":"Then Beitou's public pools are perfect for you — and cheap."}},{"t":"想要自己一个人的。","p":"Xiǎng yào zìjǐ yí gè rén de.","m":"I'd prefer a private one.","r":{"t":"也有小房间的，一个人泡很安静。","p":"Yě yǒu xiǎo fángjiān de, yí gè rén pào hěn ānjìng.","m":"They have private rooms too — very peaceful."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想到北投的温泉，想帮你订一个。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng dào Běitóu de wēnquán, xiǎng bāng nǐ dìng yí gè.","m":"Thinking about Beitou again today — I want to book one for you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"去北投要多久？","p":"Qù Běitóu yào duō jiǔ?","m":"How long does it take to get to Beitou?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过去北投要多久（坐捷运四十分钟左右）","en":"You asked how long it takes to get to Beitou (about forty minutes on the MRT)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问去北投要多久。四十分钟。周末我在捷运上发现一个好玩的：去新北投那一小段车厢里，画满了温泉的画。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn qù Běitóu yào duō jiǔ. Sìshí fēnzhōng. Zhōumò wǒ zài jiéyùn shang fāxiàn yí gè hǎowán de: qù Xīn Běitóu nà yì xiǎo duàn de chēxiāng lǐ, huà mǎn le wēnquán de huà.","m":"Last time you asked how long it takes to Beitou. Forty minutes. At the weekend I noticed something fun on the MRT: on the little branch line to Xinbeitou, the carriages are covered in hot-spring paintings.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你坐过最有意思的车是哪一辆？","p":"Nǐ zuòguo zuì yǒu yìsi de chē shì nǎ yí liàng?","m":"What's the most interesting train or bus you've ridden?"},"replies":[{"t":"一辆很老的火车。","p":"Yí liàng hěn lǎo de huǒchē.","m":"A very old train.","r":{"t":"好浪漫！","p":"Hǎo làngmàn!","m":"How romantic!"}},{"t":"想不起来了，都差不多。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le, dōu chàbuduō.","m":"Can't think of one — they're all similar.","r":{"t":"那来坐新北投的温泉车吧！","p":"Nà lái zuò Xīn Běitóu de wēnquán chē ba!","m":"Then come ride the Xinbeitou hot-spring train!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天在捷运上想起那节温泉车厢。","p":"Jīntiān zài jiéyùn shang xiǎng qǐ nà jié wēnquán chēxiāng.","m":"On the MRT today I remembered the hot-spring carriage."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"温泉贵吗？","p":"Wēnquán guì ma?","m":"Are the hot springs expensive?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过温泉贵不贵（有便宜的公共温泉，一百块左右）","en":"You asked if hot springs are expensive (there are cheap public ones, around NT$100)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问温泉贵不贵。公共的一百块左右。周末我们泡的那家，旁边还有阿嬷在卖温泉蛋，十块一颗。我吃了三颗，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wēnquán guì bu guì. Gōnggòng de yìbǎi kuài zuǒyòu. Zhōumò wǒmen pào de nà jiā, pángbiān hái yǒu āmà zài mài wēnquán dàn, shí kuài yì kē. Wǒ chī le sān kē, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if hot springs are expensive. The public ones are about NT$100. At the place we went at the weekend, an old lady sold hot-spring eggs next door, ten dollars each. I ate three, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出去玩的时候，会在小摊上买吃的吗？","p":"Nǐ chūqù wán de shíhou, huì zài xiǎo tān shang mǎi chī de ma?","m":"When you're out and about, do you buy food from little stalls?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，小摊的最好吃。","p":"Huì, xiǎo tān de zuì hǎochī.","m":"Yes — stall food's the best.","r":{"t":"对吧！我们是一样的人。","p":"Duì ba! Wǒmen shì yíyàng de rén.","m":"Right? We're the same kind of person."}},{"t":"不太会，我带吃的去。","p":"Bú tài huì, wǒ dài chī de qù.","m":"Not really — I bring my own.","r":{"t":"好会准备！我每次都忘记带。","p":"Hǎo huì zhǔnbèi! Wǒ měi cì dōu wàngjì dài.","m":"So prepared! I always forget."}}],"next":{"t":"今天好想再吃一颗温泉蛋。","p":"Jīntiān hǎo xiǎng zài chī yì kē wēnquán dàn.","m":"Craving another hot-spring egg today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"跟你说：这两天店里来了一个在学中文的客人，他用中文说：「一杯珍奶，半糖，温的。」","p":"Gēn nǐ shuō: zhè liǎng tiān diàn lǐ lái le yí gè zài xué Zhōngwén de kèrén, tā yòng Zhōngwén shuō: “Yì bēi zhēnnǎi, bàn táng, wēn de.”","m":"Guess what: a customer who's learning Chinese came in these days and ordered in Chinese: “One bubble tea, half sugar, warm.”"},{"t":"他说得很慢，可是每个字我都听懂了。","p":"Tā shuō de hěn màn, kěshì měi gè zì wǒ dōu tīng dǒng le.","m":"He spoke slowly, but I understood every word."},{"t":"我给他多加了一点珍珠。不要跟店长说喔。","p":"Wǒ gěi tā duō jiā le yìdiǎn zhēnzhū. Bú yào gēn diànzhǎng shuō o.","m":"I gave him a few extra pearls. Don't tell my manager."}],"replies":[{"t":"他一定很开心！","p":"Tā yídìng hěn kāixīn!","m":"He must have been so happy!","r":{"t":"对啊，他笑得好灿烂。","p":"Duì a, tā xiào de hǎo cànlàn.","m":"Yes — the biggest smile."}},{"t":"我也想这样点一杯。","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng zhèyàng diǎn yì bēi.","m":"I'd love to order like that.","r":{"t":"来！我也给你多加珍珠。","p":"Lái! Wǒ yě gěi nǐ duō jiā zhēnzhū.","m":"Come by! Extra pearls for you too."}}],"from":"2026-12-14"}},"2026-12-12|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也爱去圣诞市场吃东西。","p":"Wǒ yě ài qù Shèngdàn shìchǎng chī dōngxi.","m":"I love eating at Christmas markets too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱去圣诞市场吃东西","en":"You love eating at Christmas markets too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也爱去圣诞市场吃东西。周末我跟梁阿姨一起去了南岸。梁阿姨第一次吃德国香肠，她说：「跟广东腊肠不一样，可是也好吃！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě ài qù Shèngdàn shìchǎng chī dōngxi. Zhōumò wǒ gēn Liáng āyí yìqǐ qù le Nán'àn. Liáng āyí dì yī cì chī Déguó xiāngcháng, tā shuō: “Gēn Guǎngdōng làcháng bù yíyàng, kěshì yě hǎochī!”","m":"You said you love eating at Christmas markets too. At the weekend Auntie Liang and I went to the South Bank. It was her first German sausage — she said: “Not like Cantonese lap cheong, but tasty too!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在市场上最爱吃什么？","p":"Nǐ zài shìchǎng shang zuì ài chī shénme?","m":"What do you love eating most at markets?"},"replies":[{"t":"热的小吃。","p":"Rè de xiǎochī.","m":"Hot snacks.","r":{"t":"对，冬天就要吃热的。","p":"Duì, dōngtiān jiù yào chī rè de.","m":"Right — winter calls for something hot."}},{"t":"甜的，比如蛋糕。","p":"Tián de, bǐrú dàngāo.","m":"Sweet things, like cake.","r":{"t":"我也爱甜的！","p":"Wǒ yě ài tián de!","m":"I love sweet things too!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天手上好像还有烤栗子的味道。","p":"Jīntiān shǒu shang hǎoxiàng hái yǒu kǎo lìzi de wèidao.","m":"My hands still seem to smell of roast chestnuts today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边没有圣诞市场。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān méiyǒu Shèngdàn shìchǎng.","m":"There are no Christmas markets here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边没有圣诞市场","en":"There are no Christmas markets where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边没有圣诞市场。周末我去的时候想到你，就多看了看：木头的小房子，热饮，烤栗子，还有一个人在拉手风琴。你要是在，一定会喜欢的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān méiyǒu Shèngdàn shìchǎng. Zhōumò wǒ qù de shíhou xiǎng dào nǐ, jiù duō kàn le kàn: mùtou de xiǎo fángzi, rè yǐn, kǎo lìzi, hái yǒu yí gè rén zài lā shǒufēngqín. Nǐ yàoshi zài, yídìng huì xǐhuan de.","m":"You said there are no Christmas markets where you are. When I went at the weekend I thought of you and looked more carefully: little wooden huts, hot drinks, roast chestnuts, and a man playing the accordion. If you'd been there, you'd have loved it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天有什么热闹的地方吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān yǒu shénme rènao de dìfang ma?","m":"Is there anywhere lively in winter where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"有夜市。","p":"Yǒu yèshì.","m":"Night markets.","r":{"t":"夜市！我在书上看过，很想去。","p":"Yèshì! Wǒ zài shū shang kànguo, hěn xiǎng qù.","m":"Night markets! I've read about them — I'd love to go."}},{"t":"不多，大家都在家。","p":"Bù duō, dàjiā dōu zài jiā.","m":"Not much — everyone stays home.","r":{"t":"在家也很好，暖和。","p":"Zài jiā yě hěn hǎo, nuǎnhuo.","m":"Home's nice too — it's warm."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起圣诞市场的手风琴。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ Shèngdàn shìchǎng de shǒufēngqín.","m":"Remembering the accordion at the Christmas market again today."}},"m1.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"去商场，里面暖和。","p":"Qù shāngchǎng, lǐmiàn nuǎnhuo.","m":"The mall — it's warm inside."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边冬天周末大家去商场，里面暖和","en":"In winter, people go to the mall at weekends where you are — it's warm"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你们冬天周末去商场。我也去了一次！伦敦的商场这两天人好多，我买了一本中文书，是给我自己的圣诞礼物。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐmen dōngtiān zhōumò qù shāngchǎng. Wǒ yě qù le yí cì! Lúndūn de shāngchǎng zhè liǎng tiān rén hǎo duō, wǒ mǎi le yì běn Zhōngwén shū, shì gěi wǒ zìjǐ de Shèngdàn lǐwù.","m":"You said people go to the mall at weekends in winter where you are. I went too! London's shopping centres are packed these days. I bought a Chinese book — a Christmas present to myself.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会给自己买礼物吗？","p":"Nǐ huì gěi zìjǐ mǎi lǐwù ma?","m":"Do you ever buy yourself presents?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，一年买一次。","p":"Huì, yì nián mǎi yí cì.","m":"Yes, once a year.","r":{"t":"好！对自己好一点。","p":"Hǎo! Duì zìjǐ hǎo yìdiǎn.","m":"Good! Be kind to yourself."}},{"t":"不会，我给别人买。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ gěi biérén mǎi.","m":"No — I buy for others.","r":{"t":"你人真好。","p":"Nǐ rén zhēn hǎo.","m":"You're so kind."}}],"next":{"t":"今天看了那本中文书的第一页。","p":"Jīntiān kàn le nà běn Zhōngwén shū de dì yī yè.","m":"Read the first page of that Chinese book today."}},"m1.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"在家，哪儿都不去。","p":"Zài jiā, nǎr dōu bú qù.","m":"At home — nowhere at all."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边冬天的周末，你在家哪儿都不去","en":"At weekends in winter you stay home"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你冬天周末在家，哪儿都不去。这个周末下雨，我也在家，跟 Biscuit 一起，喝茶，写我的信。写信给我三十五年前接生的一个宝宝。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dōngtiān zhōumò zài jiā, nǎr dōu bú qù. Zhège zhōumò xià yǔ, wǒ yě zài jiā, gēn Biscuit yìqǐ, hē chá, xiě wǒ de xìn. Xiě xìn gěi wǒ sānshíwǔ nián qián jiēshēng de yí gè bǎobao.","m":"You said you stay home at weekends in winter. This weekend it rained, so I stayed home too — with Biscuit, drinking tea and writing my letter. A letter to a baby I delivered thirty-five years ago.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在家的时候，喜欢做什么？","p":"Nǐ zài jiā de shíhou, xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like doing at home?"},"replies":[{"t":"看电影。","p":"Kàn diànyǐng.","m":"Watching films.","r":{"t":"好！下雨天看电影最好。","p":"Hǎo! Xià yǔ tiān kàn diànyǐng zuì hǎo.","m":"Lovely! Rainy days are for films."}},{"t":"什么都不做。","p":"Shénme dōu bú zuò.","m":"Nothing at all.","r":{"t":"那也很好，休息最重要。","p":"Nà yě hěn hǎo, xiūxi zuì zhòngyào.","m":"That's good too — rest matters most."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写了两句信。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě le liǎng jù xìn.","m":"Wrote two more lines of my letter today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你最喜欢吃什么？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan chī shénme?","m":"What's your favourite thing to eat there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她最喜欢吃什么（热的烤栗子，还有德国香肠）","en":"You asked her favourite (hot roast chestnuts and German sausage)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我最喜欢吃什么。烤栗子！这两天我学会了用中文说「糖炒栗子」。梁阿姨说，中国的街上冬天也卖，我很高兴。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zuì xǐhuan chī shénme. Kǎo lìzi! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xuéhuì le yòng Zhōngwén shuō “tángchǎo lìzi”. Liáng āyí shuō, Zhōngguó de jiē shang dōngtiān yě mài, wǒ hěn gāoxìng.","m":"Last time you asked my favourite. Roast chestnuts! These days I learned to say 糖炒栗子 — sugar-roasted chestnuts — in Chinese. Auntie Liang says they sell them on the streets in China in winter too. That made me very happy.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你吃过栗子吗？","p":"Nǐ chīguo lìzi ma?","m":"Have you ever had chestnuts?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃过，很喜欢。","p":"Chīguo, hěn xǐhuan.","m":"Yes — I love them.","r":{"t":"那我们一样！","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"没吃过。","p":"Méi chīguo.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"冬天一定要试试，热热的，甜甜的。","p":"Dōngtiān yídìng yào shìshi, rèrè de, tiántián de.","m":"You must try them in winter — warm and sweet."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又买了一袋栗子。","p":"Jīntiān yòu mǎi le yí dài lìzi.","m":"Bought another bag of chestnuts today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去哪个圣诞市场？","p":"Nǐ qù nǎ gè Shèngdàn shìchǎng?","m":"Which Christmas market do you go to?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去哪个圣诞市场（南岸那个，在泰晤士河边，晚上很好看）","en":"You asked which Christmas market she goes to (the South Bank one by the Thames — lovely at night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去哪个圣诞市场。南岸的那个。这两天晚上我又去了，河边很冷，可是灯很好看。我在那儿碰到一个华人妈妈，她的孩子叫我「奶奶」，我很开心。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù nǎ gè Shèngdàn shìchǎng. Nán'àn de nà gè. Zhè liǎng tiān wǎnshang wǒ yòu qù le, hé biān hěn lěng, kěshì dēng hěn hǎokàn. Wǒ zài nàr pèng dào yí gè Huárén māma, tā de háizi jiào wǒ “nǎinai”, wǒ hěn kāixīn.","m":"Last time you asked which market I go to. The South Bank one. These days I went again in the evening — cold by the river, but beautiful lights. I met a Chinese mum there, and her little one called me 奶奶, 'Granny'. I was very happy.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢晚上出去走走吗？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan wǎnshang chūqù zǒuzou ma?","m":"Do you like going out for walks in the evening?"},"replies":[{"t":"喜欢，晚上很美。","p":"Xǐhuan, wǎnshang hěn měi.","m":"Yes — evenings are beautiful.","r":{"t":"对，灯亮了，城市就变了。","p":"Duì, dēng liàng le, chéngshì jiù biàn le.","m":"Right — when the lights come on, the city changes."}},{"t":"不太喜欢，我怕冷。","p":"Bú tài xǐhuan, wǒ pà lěng.","m":"Not really — I feel the cold.","r":{"t":"我懂，所以我戴两顶帽子，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ dǒng, suǒyǐ wǒ dài liǎng dǐng màozi, hāha.","m":"I understand — that's why I wear two hats, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上河边的灯又亮了。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang hé biān de dēng yòu liàng le.","m":"The riverside lights are on again this evening."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-12|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的海边周末也全是人。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de hǎibiān zhōumò yě quán shì rén.","m":"The beach here is packed at weekends too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的海边周末也全是人","en":"The beach is packed at weekends where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的海边周末也全是人。这个周末我们七点就去了，还是只能坐在最后面。不过我女儿第一次自己在沙子上走，一直笑，我觉得很值。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de hǎi biān zhōumò yě quán shì rén. Zhège zhōumò wǒmen qī diǎn jiù qù le, háishi zhǐ néng zuò zài zuì hòumiàn. Búguò wǒ nǚ'ér dì yī cì zìjǐ zài shāzi shang zǒu, yìzhí xiào, wǒ juéde hěn zhí.","m":"You said the beach is packed at weekends where you are too. This weekend we went at seven and still ended up at the very back. But my daughter walked on the sand by herself for the first time, laughing the whole time — worth it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你第一次看到海，还记得吗？","p":"Nǐ dì yī cì kàn dào hǎi, hái jìde ma?","m":"Do you remember the first time you saw the sea?"},"replies":[{"t":"记得，很激动。","p":"Jìde, hěn jīdòng.","m":"Yes — I was so excited.","r":{"t":"对吧！海一直都那么大。","p":"Duì ba! Hǎi yìzhí dōu nàme dà.","m":"Right? The sea is always so huge."}},{"t":"不记得了，太小了。","p":"Bú jìde le, tài xiǎo le.","m":"No — I was too little.","r":{"t":"我也不记得了。我会替我女儿记得今天。","p":"Wǒ yě bú jìde le. Wǒ huì tì wǒ nǚ'ér jìde jīntiān.","m":"Me neither. I'll remember today for my daughter."}}],"next":{"t":"今天身上还有沙子，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān shēn shang hái yǒu shāzi, hāha.","m":"Still finding sand on me today, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我住的地方离海很远。","p":"Wǒ zhù de dìfang lí hǎi hěn yuǎn.","m":"I live a long way from the sea."},"mem":{"zh":"你住的地方离海很远","en":"You live far from the sea"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你住的地方离海很远。这个周末我在海边想到你，就多站了一会儿，替你听了听海浪。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhù de dìfang lí hǎi hěn yuǎn. Zhège zhōumò wǒ zài hǎi biān xiǎng dào nǐ, jiù duō zhàn le yíhuìr, tì nǐ tīng le tīng hǎi làng.","m":"You said you live far from the sea. At the beach this weekend I thought of you, so I stood a while longer and listened to the waves for you.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢什么样的地方：海边、山里，还是城市？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan shénme yàng de dìfang: hǎi biān, shān lǐ, háishi chéngshì?","m":"What kind of place do you like most: the sea, the mountains, or the city?"},"replies":[{"t":"海边。","p":"Hǎi biān.","m":"The sea.","r":{"t":"那你一定要来拉各斯！","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng yào lái Lāgèsī!","m":"Then you have to come to Lagos!"}},{"t":"山里。","p":"Shān lǐ.","m":"The mountains.","r":{"t":"山里也好，安静。我还没去过真正的大山。","p":"Shān lǐ yě hǎo, ānjìng. Wǒ hái méi qùguo zhēnzhèng de dà shān.","m":"Mountains are lovely — quiet. I've never been to real big mountains."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起海浪的声音。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ hǎi làng de shēngyīn.","m":"Remembering the sound of the waves again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们在海边干什么？","p":"Nǐmen zài hǎibiān gàn shénme?","m":"What do you do at the beach?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们在海边干什么（踢球、吃烤鱼、听音乐）","en":"You asked what they do at the beach (football, grilled fish, music)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们在海边干什么。这个周末我又踢球了，这次在沙子上，比在工地上还难跑。我还是守门，摔了三次，满身都是沙子。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen zài hǎi biān gàn shénme. Zhège zhōumò wǒ yòu tī qiú le, zhè cì zài shāzi shang, bǐ zài gōngdì shang hái nán pǎo. Wǒ háishi shǒu mén, shuāi le sān cì, mǎn shēn dōu shì shāzi.","m":"Last time you asked what we do at the beach. This weekend I played football again — on sand this time, even harder to run on than the site. I was in goal again, fell three times, covered in sand.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢在沙滩上做什么？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan zài shātān shang zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like doing on a beach?"},"replies":[{"t":"散步。","p":"Sànbù.","m":"Walking.","r":{"t":"散步最舒服，脚踩在沙子上。","p":"Sànbù zuì shūfu, jiǎo cǎi zài shāzi shang.","m":"Walking's the best — feet in the sand."}},{"t":"躺着晒太阳。","p":"Tǎng zhe shài tàiyáng.","m":"Lying in the sun.","r":{"t":"好主意，下次我也只躺着，哈哈。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi, xià cì wǒ yě zhǐ tǎng zhe, hāha.","m":"Good idea — next time I'll just lie there too, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天腿还是酸的，沙子上踢球太累了。","p":"Jīntiān tuǐ háishi suān de, shāzi shang tī qiú tài lèi le.","m":"Legs still aching today — football on sand is exhausting."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"为什么人那么多？","p":"Wèishénme rén nàme duō?","m":"Why's it so crowded?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过海边为什么人那么多（十二月很多人从国外回来过节）","en":"You asked why the beach is so crowded (lots of people come home from abroad for December)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问为什么人那么多。十二月很多人回来过节。这两天我的一个表哥也从伦敦回来了，他说他在伦敦最想念的，就是拉各斯的吵闹，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wèishénme rén nàme duō. Shí'èr yuè hěn duō rén huílái guòjié. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de yí gè biǎogē yě cóng Lúndūn huílái le, tā shuō tā zài Lúndūn zuì xiǎngniàn de, jiù shì Lāgèsī de chǎonào, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked why it's so crowded. In December lots of people come home for the holidays. These days one of my cousins came back from London too — he says what he missed most in London was the noise of Lagos, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你过节的时候会回家吗？","p":"Nǐ guòjié de shíhou huì huí jiā ma?","m":"Do you go home for the holidays?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，一定回。","p":"Huì, yídìng huí.","m":"Yes, always.","r":{"t":"真好，家里人一定很开心。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, jiā lǐ rén yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"Lovely — your family must be so happy."}},{"t":"不一定，看情况。","p":"Bù yídìng, kàn qíngkuàng.","m":"It depends.","r":{"t":"没关系，在哪儿都可以过节。","p":"Méi guānxi, zài nǎr dōu kěyǐ guòjié.","m":"That's fine — you can celebrate anywhere."}}],"next":{"t":"今天家里又来了一个从国外回来的亲戚。","p":"Jīntiān jiā lǐ yòu lái le yí gè cóng guówài huílái de qīnqi.","m":"Another relative back from abroad came round today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"公司年底聚餐，经理让我上台用中文说几句。","p":"Gōngsī niándǐ jùcān, jīnglǐ ràng wǒ shàng tái yòng Zhōngwén shuō jǐ jù.","m":"At the company's year-end dinner, the manager asked me to say a few words in Chinese on stage."},{"t":"我说：「谢谢大家，明年我们继续——没问题，没问题！」","p":"Wǒ shuō: “Xièxie dàjiā, míngnián wǒmen jìxù —— méi wèntí, méi wèntí!”","m":"I said: “Thank you all — next year we keep going — no problem, no problem!”"},{"t":"下面的中国同事和尼日利亚同事一起喊：「No wahala！」","p":"Xiàmiàn de Zhōngguó tóngshì hé Nírìlìyà tóngshì yìqǐ hǎn: “No wahala!”","m":"My Chinese and Nigerian colleagues shouted back together: “No wahala!”"}],"replies":[{"t":"太棒了！","p":"Tài bàng le!","m":"Brilliant!","r":{"t":"那是我今年最开心的一分钟。","p":"Nà shì wǒ jīnnián zuì kāixīn de yì fēnzhōng.","m":"The happiest minute of my year."}},{"t":"两种语言一起喊，好酷。","p":"Liǎng zhǒng yǔyán yìqǐ hǎn, hǎo kù.","m":"Two languages at once — so cool.","r":{"t":"对，这就是我们的工地。","p":"Duì, zhè jiù shì wǒmen de gōngdì.","m":"Yes — that's our site."}}],"from":"2026-12-14"}},"2026-12-12|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We go to the pub here too.","p":"","m":"我们这边也去酒吧。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们那边也去酒吧","en":"You go to the pub too"},"later":{"t":"You said you go to the pub too. At the weekend ours had its Christmas quiz. My team came fourth out of five. We lost on a question about Christmas puddings. Shameful.","p":"","m":"你上次说你们那边也去酒吧。周末我们那家酒吧办了圣诞答题赛。五个队我们第四。输在一道圣诞布丁的题上。丢人。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you good at quizzes?","p":"","m":"你擅长答题比赛吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I love them.","p":"","m":"擅长，我很喜欢。","r":{"t":"Join my team. Please.","p":"","m":"加入我们队吧。拜托了。"}},{"t":"No, I panic.","p":"","m":"不擅长，我会慌。","r":{"t":"Same. That's how we came fourth.","p":"","m":"一样。所以我们第四名。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still annoyed about the pudding question.","p":"","m":"还在为那道布丁题生气。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't drink, so I don't go to pubs.","p":"","m":"我不喝酒，所以不去酒吧。"},"mem":{"zh":"你不喝酒，所以不去酒吧","en":"You don't drink, so you don't go to pubs"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't drink, so you don't go to pubs. At the weekend I counted: half our quiz team were on soft drinks. The pub's really just a warm living room with crisps.","p":"","m":"你上次说你不喝酒，所以不去酒吧。周末我数了一下：我们答题队一半的人喝的是软饮料。酒吧其实就是一个有薯片的暖和客厅。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you meet friends in winter?","p":"","m":"冬天你跟朋友在哪儿见面？"},"replies":[{"t":"At a café.","p":"","m":"咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Good choice. Same idea, better coffee.","p":"","m":"好选择。一个道理，咖啡更好。"}},{"t":"At someone's home.","p":"","m":"在谁家里。","r":{"t":"The best. No closing time.","p":"","m":"最好的。不用打烊。"}}],"next":{"t":"Lemonade at the pub tonight. Very respectable.","p":"","m":"今晚在酒吧喝柠檬水。很体面。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you do at the pub?","p":"","m":"你在酒吧干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在酒吧做什么（聊天、吃薯片，有时候答题）","en":"You asked what he does at the pub (talk, eat crisps, sometimes a quiz)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we do at the pub. At the weekend: a quiz, and a long debate about whether a hot dog is a sandwich. No winner. Four people left annoyed.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们在酒吧做什么。周末是：答题，还有一场很长的争论——热狗算不算三明治。没有赢家。四个人生着气走了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a silly thing you've argued about with friends?","p":"","m":"你跟朋友为什么傻事争过？"},"replies":[{"t":"Food, always.","p":"","m":"吃的，总是吃的。","r":{"t":"The best arguments are about food.","p":"","m":"最好的争论都是关于吃的。"}},{"t":"I don't really argue.","p":"","m":"我不太跟人争。","r":{"t":"Very wise. Better than us.","p":"","m":"很明智。比我们强。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still think a hot dog isn't a sandwich.","p":"","m":"我还是觉得热狗不是三明治。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Which pub do you go to?","p":"","m":"你去哪家酒吧？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他去哪家酒吧（路口那家，有壁炉）","en":"You asked which pub (the one at the end of his road — it has a fire)"},"later":{"t":"You asked which pub. The one at the end of my road, with the fire. At the weekend I got the seat right next to it for the first time ever. Stayed three hours. Didn't want to move.","p":"","m":"你上次问我去哪家酒吧。路口那家，有壁炉。周末我第一次抢到了壁炉旁边的位子。坐了三个小时。不想动。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a favourite seat somewhere?","p":"","m":"你在什么地方有最喜欢的座位吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, by the window.","p":"","m":"有，靠窗的。","r":{"t":"Window seats are the best. Fire seats too.","p":"","m":"靠窗的最好。靠火的也是。"}},{"t":"No, anywhere's fine.","p":"","m":"没有，哪儿都行。","r":{"t":"Easy-going. I like it.","p":"","m":"随和。我喜欢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Someone else got the fire seat tonight. Rude.","p":"","m":"今晚别人坐了靠火的位子。过分。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"My live-alone piece came out. One reader wrote: 'I live alone, but I talk to my plants. Does that count as a flatmate?'","p":"","m":"一个人住那篇登出来了。一位读者留言：「我一个人住，可是我跟我的植物说话。这算室友吗？」"},{"t":"I said: legally, no. Emotionally, yes.","p":"","m":"我回：法律上不算。感情上算。"},{"t":"Now I talk to the office plant. It's called Kevin.","p":"","m":"现在我开始跟办公室那盆植物说话了。它叫 Kevin。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Say hi to Kevin!","p":"","m":"替我跟 Kevin 打个招呼！","r":{"t":"Will do. He's a good listener.","p":"","m":"好的。他很会听。"}},{"t":"I talk to my plants too.","p":"","m":"我也跟我的植物说话。","r":{"t":"Then you're not alone. Literally.","p":"","m":"那你不孤单。字面意义上的。"}}],"from":"2026-12-14"}},"2026-12-12|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We go to the mall too.","p":"","m":"我们也去商场。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们周末也去商场","en":"You go to the mall at weekends too"},"later":{"t":"You said you go to the mall too. At the weekend we went for one thing — new school shoes for my eight-year-old. We came home with shoes, ice cream and a balloon. Classic mall, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你们周末也去商场。周末我们去只为了一件事——给我八岁的孩子买新校鞋。回来的时候带着鞋、冰淇淋，还有一个气球。商场就是这样，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you buy more than you planned at the mall?","p":"","m":"你在商场会买得比计划的多吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Always.","p":"","m":"每次都会。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. The mall wins.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。商场赢了。"}},{"t":"No, I stick to my list.","p":"","m":"不会，我照单子买。","r":{"t":"Strong! Teach my wife, haha.","p":"","m":"厉害！教教我老婆，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"The balloon is still floating in our living room.","p":"","m":"气球还在我们客厅里飘。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I like being outside, even in the rain.","p":"","m":"我喜欢在外面，下雨也不怕。"},"mem":{"zh":"你喜欢待在外面，下雨也不怕","en":"You like being outside, even in the rain"},"later":{"t":"You said you like being outside, even in the rain. So at the weekend I tried. Took the kids to the park right after the rain. Mud everywhere. They loved it. My wife… less.","p":"","m":"你上次说你喜欢待在外面，下雨也不怕。所以周末我也试了。雨一停就带孩子去公园。到处都是泥。他们开心死了。我老婆……没那么开心。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite thing to do outside?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢在户外做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Walking.","p":"","m":"散步。","r":{"t":"Good. Walking is free and happy.","p":"","m":"好。走路免费又开心。"}},{"t":"Sport.","p":"","m":"运动。","r":{"t":"Respect! I only ride my motorbike, haha.","p":"","m":"佩服！我只骑摩托，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still cleaning mud off the kids' shoes.","p":"","m":"还在清理孩子鞋上的泥。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you do there?","p":"","m":"你们在那儿干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们在商场做什么（吃饭、看电影、逛逛，孩子们最喜欢）","en":"You asked what they do at the mall (eat, see a film, walk around — the kids love it)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we do at the mall. At the weekend: we watched a film, and my daughter fell asleep in the first ten minutes. She woke up at the end and said, 'Good film!'","p":"","m":"你上次问我们在商场做什么。周末我们看了一部电影，我女儿前十分钟就睡着了。最后醒过来说：「好看！」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever fallen asleep in a film?","p":"","m":"你看电影睡着过吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, many times.","p":"","m":"有，很多次。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. The air-con is too nice.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。空调太舒服了。"}},{"t":"Never.","p":"","m":"从来没有。","r":{"t":"Strong! My family can't.","p":"","m":"厉害！我们家做不到。"}}],"next":{"t":"My daughter still says it was a good film, haha.","p":"","m":"我女儿还在说那部电影好看，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it crowded?","p":"","m":"人多吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过商场挤不挤（很挤，停车要半个小时）","en":"You asked if it's crowded (very — parking takes half an hour)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's crowded. Very. At the weekend I parked my motorbike in two minutes while the cars waited thirty. One small win for motorbikes, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次问商场挤不挤。很挤。周末我停摩托车只花了两分钟，汽车等了三十分钟。摩托车的小胜利，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you usually get to the shops?","p":"","m":"你一般怎么去商店？"},"replies":[{"t":"By car.","p":"","m":"开车。","r":{"t":"Then you know the parking pain.","p":"","m":"那你懂停车的痛苦。"}},{"t":"On foot or by bus.","p":"","m":"走路或者坐公交。","r":{"t":"Smart. No parking problems.","p":"","m":"聪明。没有停车的烦恼。"}}],"next":{"t":"Two-minute parking again today. Motorbike life.","p":"","m":"今天又是两分钟停好。摩托车的生活。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-12|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-12","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I love ice skating too!","p":"","m":"我也很喜欢滑冰！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也爱滑冰","en":"You love ice skating too"},"later":{"t":"You said you love ice skating too! The lake isn't ready, so at the weekend we went to the outdoor rink in town. My youngest held my hand for one lap, then let go — and was faster than me.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也爱滑冰！湖还没冻好，所以周末我们去了城里的露天冰场。我家老二拉着我的手滑了一圈，然后松开——比我还快。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where did you learn to skate?","p":"","m":"你在哪儿学的滑冰？"},"replies":[{"t":"At a rink, as a kid.","p":"","m":"小时候在溜冰场。","r":{"t":"Same as most people here.","p":"","m":"这儿大多数人也是。"}},{"t":"I'm still learning, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，我还在学。","r":{"t":"Good. Everyone's still learning, really.","p":"","m":"好。其实大家都还在学。"}}],"next":{"t":"Legs still a bit sore from the rink.","p":"","m":"滑冰以后腿还有点酸。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never been ice skating.","p":"","m":"我从来没滑过冰。"},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没滑过冰","en":"You've never been ice skating"},"later":{"t":"You said you've never been ice skating. At the weekend I watched a little boy's very first time at the rink. He fell, laughed, fell, laughed. By the end he was flying. I thought of you.","p":"","m":"你上次说你从来没滑过冰。周末我在冰场看一个小男孩第一次滑冰。他摔一下，笑一下，再摔，再笑。最后他滑得像飞一样。我想到了你。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Would you try it someday?","p":"","m":"你哪天会试试吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, if someone holds my hand.","p":"","m":"会，要是有人拉着我。","r":{"t":"Deal. I'll hold your hand.","p":"","m":"说定了。我拉着你。"}},{"t":"Probably not — I'd rather watch.","p":"","m":"大概不会，我更想看。","r":{"t":"Watching is fun too. And warmer.","p":"","m":"看也好玩。还更暖和。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of that little skater. And of you.","p":"","m":"想着那个小滑冰的。也想着你。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How do you know the ice is safe?","p":"","m":"你怎么知道冰够不够结实？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过怎么知道冰安不安全（先检查，从不一个人去）","en":"You asked how they know the ice is safe (they check first and never go alone)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how we know the ice is safe. We check, and we never go alone. This week I bought new ice claws — two little spikes on a string, to pull yourself out if you fall in. Every Swedish skater carries a pair.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们怎么知道冰安不安全。先检查，从不一个人去。这周我买了新的冰爪——绳子两头各一个小钉子，万一掉进水里可以把自己拉出来。瑞典每个滑冰的人都带一副。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you do anything outdoors in winter?","p":"","m":"冬天你会去户外做点什么吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, walking.","p":"","m":"会，散步。","r":{"t":"Walking counts! Fresh air helps a lot.","p":"","m":"走路也算！新鲜空气很有用。"}},{"t":"Not much — I stay in.","p":"","m":"不怎么去，待在家里。","r":{"t":"Fair. Indoors is cosy too.","p":"","m":"也好。屋里也温馨。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ice claws in my pocket, just in case.","p":"","m":"冰爪在口袋里，以防万一。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is the lake frozen yet?","p":"","m":"湖结冰了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过湖冻上了没有（还没有，也许一月）","en":"You asked if the lake's frozen yet (not yet — maybe January)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the lake's frozen. Not yet. At the weekend I walked past — just a thin edge of ice by the reeds. A duck stood on it looking very proud. Maybe January.","p":"","m":"你上次问湖冻上了没有。还没有。周末我走过去看了——只有芦苇边上一圈薄冰。一只鸭子站在上面，很骄傲的样子。也许一月吧。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's your favourite thing about winter?","p":"","m":"你最喜欢冬天的什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The holidays.","p":"","m":"过节。","r":{"t":"Ja, December is all lights and food.","p":"","m":"是啊，十二月全是灯和吃的。"}},{"t":"Nothing, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，什么都不喜欢。","r":{"t":"Fair! Then spring is on its way for you.","p":"","m":"有道理！那春天正在为你赶来。"}}],"next":{"t":"The proud duck was back on the ice today.","p":"","m":"那只骄傲的鸭子今天又站在冰上了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-13|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-13","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是四点就黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì sì diǎn jiù hēi le.","m":"It's dark by four here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是四点就黑了","en":"It gets dark by four where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是四点就黑了。这两天我照我说的做了：中午出去走了半个小时，在公园看到一只狐狸！伦敦的狐狸一点都不怕人。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì sì diǎn jiù hēi le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhào wǒ shuō de zuò le: zhōngwǔ chūqù zǒu le bàn gè xiǎoshí, zài gōngyuán kàn dào yì zhī húli! Lúndūn de húli yìdiǎn dōu bú pà rén.","m":"You said it's dark by four where you are too. These days I did what I said: went out for half an hour at midday, and saw a fox in the park! London foxes aren't afraid of people at all.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边能看到什么野生动物吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān néng kàn dào shénme yěshēng dòngwù ma?","m":"Do you see any wild animals where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，常看到鸟。","p":"Yǒu, cháng kàn dào niǎo.","m":"Yes — lots of birds.","r":{"t":"鸟也好！早上听它们唱歌最舒服。","p":"Niǎo yě hǎo! Zǎoshang tīng tāmen chàng gē zuì shūfu.","m":"Birds are lovely! Their morning songs are the best."}},{"t":"没有，都是人。","p":"Méiyǒu, dōu shì rén.","m":"No — just people.","r":{"t":"哈哈，人也很有意思。","p":"Hāha, rén yě hěn yǒu yìsi.","m":"Haha, people are interesting too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又出去走了半个小时。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu chūqù zǒu le bàn gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Out for another half-hour walk at midday today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边七点多天才黑。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān qī diǎn duō tiān cái hēi.","m":"It doesn't get dark here till after seven."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边七点多天才黑","en":"It doesn't get dark till after seven where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边七点多天才黑。这两天下午四点，我开灯喝茶的时候就想：你那边的太阳还很高吧？我们离得好远，可是在同一天里。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān qī diǎn duō tiān cái hēi. Zhè liǎng tiān xiàwǔ sì diǎn, wǒ kāi dēng hē chá de shíhou jiù xiǎng: nǐ nàbiān de tàiyáng hái hěn gāo ba? Wǒmen lí de hǎo yuǎn, kěshì zài tóng yì tiān lǐ.","m":"You said it doesn't get dark till after seven where you are. These days at four in the afternoon, switching on the lamp for tea, I wonder: is your sun still high? We're so far apart, but in the same day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边现在是什么季节？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān xiànzài shì shénme jìjié?","m":"What season is it where you are now?"},"replies":[{"t":"夏天，很热。","p":"Xiàtiān, hěn rè.","m":"Summer — hot.","r":{"t":"那你要多喝水！我在这边替你喝茶。","p":"Nà nǐ yào duō hē shuǐ! Wǒ zài zhèbiān tì nǐ hē chá.","m":"Drink lots of water! I'll have tea for you here."}},{"t":"不是夏天，只是天黑得晚。","p":"Bú shì xiàtiān, zhǐ shì tiān hēi de wǎn.","m":"Not summer — it just gets dark late.","r":{"t":"那也很好，白天长长的。","p":"Nà yě hěn hǎo, báitiān chángcháng de.","m":"That's lovely too — long days."}}],"next":{"t":"今天四点又开灯了，想到你那边还亮着。","p":"Jīntiān sì diǎn yòu kāi dēng le, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān hái liàng zhe.","m":"Lamp on at four again today — thinking of you still in daylight."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"天黑得早，你会难受吗？","p":"Tiān hēi de zǎo, nǐ huì nánshòu ma?","m":"Does the early dark get you down?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她天黑得早会不会难受（有一点，所以中午一定出去走走）","en":"You asked if the early dark gets her down (a bit — so she always walks at midday)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我天黑得早会不会难受。有一点。这两天我又做了一件事：买了一盏很亮的台灯，放在书桌上，练汉字的时候用。梁阿姨说：「像太阳一样。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ tiān hēi de zǎo huì bu huì nánshòu. Yǒu yìdiǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu zuò le yí jiàn shì: mǎi le yì zhǎn hěn liàng de táidēng, fàng zài shūzhuō shang, liàn Hànzì de shíhou yòng. Liáng āyí shuō: “Xiàng tàiyáng yíyàng.”","m":"Last time you asked if the early dark gets me down. A little. These days I did one more thing: bought a very bright lamp for my desk, for practising characters. Auntie Liang says: “It's like the sun.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"冬天你怎么让自己心情好一点？","p":"Dōngtiān nǐ zěnme ràng zìjǐ xīnqíng hǎo yìdiǎn?","m":"How do you keep your spirits up in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"跟朋友见面。","p":"Gēn péngyou jiànmiàn.","m":"See friends.","r":{"t":"好！朋友是最好的太阳。","p":"Hǎo! Péngyou shì zuì hǎo de tàiyáng.","m":"Good! Friends are the best sunshine."}},{"t":"多睡觉。","p":"Duō shuìjiào.","m":"Sleep more.","r":{"t":"也对，冬天就是要多休息。","p":"Yě duì, dōngtiān jiù shì yào duō xiūxi.","m":"True — winter is for resting."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在新台灯下面练了十个字。","p":"Jīntiān zài xīn táidēng xiàmiàn liàn le shí gè zì.","m":"Practised ten characters under the new lamp today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"天黑以后你干什么？","p":"Tiān hēi yǐhòu nǐ gàn shénme?","m":"What do you do after dark?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她天黑以后干什么（喝茶、练汉字，一个晚上十个字）","en":"You asked what she does after dark (tea and character practice — ten a night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我天黑以后干什么。练汉字。这两天我练的是「桂林」两个字。「桂」字我写了二十遍，才写对的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ tiān hēi yǐhòu gàn shénme. Liàn Hànzì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ liàn de shì “Guìlín” liǎng gè zì. “Guì” zì wǒ xiě le èrshí biàn, cái xiě duì de.","m":"Last time you asked what I do after dark. Character practice. These days I've been practising the two characters for Guilin. I wrote 桂 twenty times before I got it right.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学的东西里，最难的是什么？","p":"Nǐ xué de dōngxi lǐ, zuì nán de shì shénme?","m":"Of the things you're learning, what's hardest?"},"replies":[{"t":"写字。","p":"Xiě zì.","m":"Writing characters.","r":{"t":"对，写字最难！慢慢来。","p":"Duì, xiě zì zuì nán! Mànmàn lái.","m":"Yes, writing's the hardest! Take your time."}},{"t":"说话，我总是紧张。","p":"Shuōhuà, wǒ zǒngshì jǐnzhāng.","m":"Speaking — I always get nervous.","r":{"t":"我也是。慢一点说就好了。","p":"Wǒ yě shì. Màn yìdiǎn shuō jiù hǎo le.","m":"Me too. Just speak a bit slower."}}],"next":{"t":"「桂」字今天又写了十遍。","p":"“Guì” zì jīntiān yòu xiě le shí biàn.","m":"Wrote 桂 another ten times today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"信写完了！一共三页，写了一个多月。","p":"Xìn xiě wán le! Yígòng sān yè, xiě le yí gè duō yuè.","m":"The letter's finished! Three pages, more than a month of writing."},{"t":"梁阿姨帮我看了，她说只有两个地方「的」太多。我很骄傲。","p":"Liáng āyí bāng wǒ kàn le, tā shuō zhǐ yǒu liǎng gè dìfang “de” tài duō. Wǒ hěn jiāo'ào.","m":"Auntie Liang checked it — only two places with too many 的. I'm very proud."},{"t":"这个星期就寄去上海。三十五年了，那个宝宝会收到我的中文信。","p":"Zhège xīngqī jiù jì qù Shànghǎi. Sānshíwǔ nián le, nà gè bǎobao huì shōu dào wǒ de Zhōngwén xìn.","m":"It goes to Shanghai this week. Thirty-five years on, that baby will get a letter from me in Chinese."}],"replies":[{"t":"太感人了！","p":"Tài gǎnrén le!","m":"That's so moving!","r":{"t":"谢谢你。我写的时候也哭了一点。","p":"Xièxie nǐ. Wǒ xiě de shíhou yě kū le yìdiǎn.","m":"Thank you. I cried a little while writing it."}},{"t":"她收到一定很开心。","p":"Tā shōu dào yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"She'll be so happy to get it.","r":{"t":"希望吧。我有一点紧张。","p":"Xīwàng ba. Wǒ yǒu yìdiǎn jǐnzhāng.","m":"I hope so. I'm a little nervous."}}],"from":"2026-12-15"}},"2026-12-13|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-13","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是五点就黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì wǔ diǎn jiù hēi le.","m":"It's dark by five here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是五点就黑了","en":"It gets dark by five where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是五点就黑了。这两天我数着日子：再过一个星期就是冬至，过了冬至，白天就一天比一天长了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì wǔ diǎn jiù hēi le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shǔ zhe rìzi: zài guò yí gè xīngqī jiù shì Dōngzhì, guò le Dōngzhì, báitiān jiù yì tiān bǐ yì tiān cháng le.","m":"You said it's dark by five where you are too. These days I'm counting: one more week to the winter solstice, and after that the days get a little longer each day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"天黑得早，你会做点儿什么让自己高兴？","p":"Tiān hēi de zǎo, nǐ huì zuò diǎnr shénme ràng zìjǐ gāoxìng?","m":"When it gets dark early, what do you do to cheer yourself up?"},"replies":[{"t":"点几盏暖色的灯。","p":"Diǎn jǐ zhǎn nuǎnsè de dēng.","m":"Switch on some warm lamps.","r":{"t":"好主意，屋里一亮，心也亮了。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi, wū lǐ yí liàng, xīn yě liàng le.","m":"Good idea — light up the room and your mood lifts."}},{"t":"做一顿好吃的。","p":"Zuò yí dùn hǎochī de.","m":"Cook something nice.","r":{"t":"这个最管用！","p":"Zhège zuì guǎnyòng!","m":"That works best!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天下班，路灯又早早亮了。","p":"Jīntiān xiàbān, lùdēng yòu zǎozǎo liàng le.","m":"The streetlights were on early again when I left work today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在天黑得很晚。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài tiān hēi de hěn wǎn.","m":"It gets dark late here at the moment."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边现在天黑得很晚","en":"It gets dark late where you are now"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边现在天黑得很晚。这两天我下班，抬头一看，天早黑了，我就想：你那边这会儿是不是还有太阳？","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān xiànzài tiān hēi de hěn wǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiàbān, tái tóu yí kàn, tiān zǎo hēi le, wǒ jiù xiǎng: nǐ nàbiān zhè huìr shì bu shì hái yǒu tàiyáng?","m":"You said it gets dark late where you are now. These days when I leave work, I look up — it's long since dark — and I wonder if you've still got sunshine.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你下午最喜欢做什么？","p":"Nǐ xiàwǔ zuì xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"What do you like doing most in the afternoon?"},"replies":[{"t":"出去走走，晒太阳。","p":"Chūqù zǒuzou, shài tàiyáng.","m":"Go out for a walk in the sun.","r":{"t":"真好，替我多晒一会儿。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, tì wǒ duō shài yíhuìr.","m":"Lovely — soak up a bit more for me."}},{"t":"喝杯茶，休息一下。","p":"Hē bēi chá, xiūxi yíxià.","m":"Have a cup of tea and rest.","r":{"t":"下午茶最舒服了。","p":"Xiàwǔ chá zuì shūfu le.","m":"Afternoon tea is the best."}}],"next":{"t":"今天四点多太阳就落了，想到你那边还亮着。","p":"Jīntiān sì diǎn duō tàiyáng jiù luò le, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān hái liàng zhe.","m":"The sun went down just after four today — thinking of you still in daylight."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"天黑这么早，你习惯吗？","p":"Tiān hēi zhème zǎo, nǐ xíguàn ma?","m":"Are you used to it getting dark so early?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她习不习惯天黑这么早（习惯了，过了冬至就慢慢变长）","en":"You asked if she's used to it getting dark so early (yes — after the solstice the days slowly lengthen)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我习不习惯。习惯了。这两天我妈打电话提醒我：冬至要吃饺子，「冬至不端饺子碗，冻掉耳朵没人管」。北方人都这么说。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xí bu xíguàn. Xíguàn le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā dǎ diànhuà tíxǐng wǒ: Dōngzhì yào chī jiǎozi, “Dōngzhì bù duān jiǎozi wǎn, dòng diào ěrduo méi rén guǎn”. Běifāng rén dōu zhème shuō.","m":"Last time you asked if I'm used to it. I am. These days my mum called to remind me: eat dumplings on the winter solstice — “skip the dumplings at the solstice, and nobody will care when your ears freeze off.” Everyone in the north says it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边冬天有什么一定要吃的吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān dōngtiān yǒu shénme yídìng yào chī de ma?","m":"Is there something you must eat in winter where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，过节有特别的菜。","p":"Yǒu, guòjié yǒu tèbié de cài.","m":"Yes — special dishes for the holidays.","r":{"t":"那你那边的冬天也很好吃。","p":"Nà nǐ nàbiān de dōngtiān yě hěn hǎochī.","m":"Then winter where you are is delicious too."}},{"t":"没有，跟平时一样。","p":"Méiyǒu, gēn píngshí yíyàng.","m":"No — same as always.","r":{"t":"那冬至来北京吃饺子吧！","p":"Nà Dōngzhì lái Běijīng chī jiǎozi ba!","m":"Then come to Beijing for solstice dumplings!"}}],"next":{"t":"离冬至又近了一天。","p":"Lí Dōngzhì yòu jìn le yì tiān.","m":"One day closer to the solstice."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你几点下班？","p":"Nǐ jǐ diǎn xiàbān?","m":"What time do you finish work?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她几点下班（五点半，出来天已经全黑了）","en":"You asked when she finishes work (half five — pitch dark by then)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我几点下班。五点半。这两天下班，我在校门口碰到卖烤红薯的大爷，天黑了，炉子一亮，大家都围过去。我买了一个，捂了一路手。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ jǐ diǎn xiàbān. Wǔ diǎn bàn. Zhè liǎng tiān xiàbān, wǒ zài xiàomén kǒu pèng dào mài kǎo hóngshǔ de dàye, tiān hēi le, lúzi yí liàng, dàjiā dōu wéi guòqù. Wǒ mǎi le yí gè, wǔ le yí lù shǒu.","m":"Last time you asked when I finish work. Half five. These days, leaving work, I found an old man selling roast sweet potatoes at the school gate — in the dark his stove glows, and everyone gathers round. I bought one and warmed my hands with it all the way home.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你下班或者下课以后，一般先做什么？","p":"Nǐ xiàbān huòzhě xiàkè yǐhòu, yìbān xiān zuò shénme?","m":"After work or class, what do you usually do first?"},"replies":[{"t":"先吃点东西。","p":"Xiān chī diǎn dōngxi.","m":"Grab something to eat.","r":{"t":"对，饿着回家最难受。","p":"Duì, è zhe huí jiā zuì nánshòu.","m":"Right — going home hungry is the worst."}},{"t":"直接回家躺着。","p":"Zhíjiē huí jiā tǎng zhe.","m":"Go straight home and lie down.","r":{"t":"我懂，冬天的沙发会叫人。","p":"Wǒ dǒng, dōngtiān de shāfā huì jiào rén.","m":"I get it — the sofa calls to you in winter."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在校门口买了一个烤红薯。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài xiàomén kǒu mǎi le yí gè kǎo hóngshǔ.","m":"Bought another roast sweet potato at the school gate today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"北京终于下雪了！不大，可是房顶都白了。","p":"Běijīng zhōngyú xià xuě le! Bú dà, kěshì fángdǐng dōu bái le.","m":"It finally snowed in Beijing! Not much, but the rooftops went white."},{"t":"班上一个泰国学生第一次看到雪，冲到院子里，用手接了半天。","p":"Bān shang yí gè Tàiguó xuésheng dì yī cì kàn dào xuě, chōng dào yuànzi lǐ, yòng shǒu jiē le bàntiān.","m":"A Thai student in my class saw snow for the first time — rushed into the courtyard and spent ages catching it in his hands."},{"t":"他问我：「老师，雪是什么味道？」我说：「凉的。」他尝了一下，说：「对！」","p":"Tā wèn wǒ: “Lǎoshī, xuě shì shénme wèidao?” Wǒ shuō: “Liáng de.” Tā cháng le yíxià, shuō: “Duì!”","m":"He asked me: “Teacher, what does snow taste like?” I said: “Cold.” He tasted some and said: “You're right!”"}],"replies":[{"t":"好可爱的学生！","p":"Hǎo kě'ài de xuésheng!","m":"What a sweet student!","r":{"t":"是吧！全班都跟着他跑出去了。","p":"Shì ba! Quán bān dōu gēn zhe tā pǎo chūqù le.","m":"Right? The whole class followed him out."}},{"t":"北京的雪一定很美。","p":"Běijīng de xuě yídìng hěn měi.","m":"Snow in Beijing must be beautiful.","r":{"t":"胡同里最美，红门，白雪。","p":"Hútòng lǐ zuì měi, hóng mén, bái xuě.","m":"Most beautiful in the hutongs — red doors, white snow."}}],"from":"2026-12-15"}},"2026-12-13|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-13","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是六点左右天黑。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì liù diǎn zuǒyòu tiān hēi.","m":"It gets dark around six here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是六点左右天黑","en":"It gets dark around six where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是六点左右天黑。这两天我六点一看天黑了，就开始复习 HSK。天黑就是我的闹钟，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì liù diǎn zuǒyòu tiān hēi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ liù diǎn yí kàn tiān hēi le, jiù kāishǐ fùxí HSK. Tiān hēi jiù shì wǒ de nàozhōng, hāha.","m":"You said it gets dark around six where you are too. These days, when I see it's dark at six, I start revising for the HSK. The dark is my alarm clock, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般什么时候学习？","p":"Nǐ yìbān shénme shíhou xuéxí?","m":"When do you usually study?"},"replies":[{"t":"晚上。","p":"Wǎnshang.","m":"Evenings.","r":{"t":"我们一样！天黑了就学。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Tiān hēi le jiù xué.","m":"Same as me! Dark means study time."}},{"t":"早上，脑子比较清楚。","p":"Zǎoshang, nǎozi bǐjiào qīngchu.","m":"Mornings — my head's clearer.","r":{"t":"你好厉害！我早上脑子还在睡觉。","p":"Nǐ hǎo lìhai! Wǒ zǎoshang nǎozi hái zài shuìjiào.","m":"Impressive! In the morning my brain's still asleep."}}],"next":{"t":"今天六点天黑了，我又开始复习了。","p":"Jīntiān liù diǎn tiān hēi le, wǒ yòu kāishǐ fùxí le.","m":"Dark at six again today — revision time."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边四点多就黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān sì diǎn duō jiù hēi le.","m":"It's dark here soon after four."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边四点多就黑了","en":"It's dark by just after four where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边四点多就黑了。我告诉外婆，她说：「那他们几点吃晚饭？」我也不知道，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān sì diǎn duō jiù hēi le. Wǒ gàosu wàipó, tā shuō: “Nà tāmen jǐ diǎn chī wǎnfàn?” Wǒ yě bù zhīdào, hāha.","m":"You said it's dark by just after four where you are. I told Abuela, and she asked: “So when do they eat dinner?” I didn't know either, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你几点吃晚饭？","p":"Nǐ jǐ diǎn chī wǎnfàn?","m":"What time do you have dinner?"},"replies":[{"t":"六点左右。","p":"Liù diǎn zuǒyòu.","m":"Around six.","r":{"t":"我要告诉外婆！","p":"Wǒ yào gàosu wàipó!","m":"I'll tell Abuela!"}},{"t":"很晚，八点以后。","p":"Hěn wǎn, bā diǎn yǐhòu.","m":"Late — after eight.","r":{"t":"天黑了四个小时才吃饭！外婆会吓一跳，哈哈。","p":"Tiān hēi le sì gè xiǎoshí cái chī fàn! Wàipó huì xià yí tiào, hāha.","m":"Four hours after dark! Abuela will be shocked, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"外婆今天又问起你那边几点天黑，哈哈。","p":"Wàipó jīntiān yòu wèn qǐ nǐ nàbiān jǐ diǎn tiān hēi, hāha.","m":"Abuela asked about your early dark again today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你喜欢一年都差不多的天气吗？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan yì nián dōu chàbuduō de tiānqì ma?","m":"Do you like having the same weather all year?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她喜不喜欢一年都差不多的天气（喜欢，不过也想看看雪）","en":"You asked if she likes weather that's the same all year (yes — but she'd like to see snow)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我喜不喜欢一年都差不多的天气。喜欢。可是这两天我在剧里看到长安下雪，好美！我跟自己说：考过 HSK，以后去西安看雪。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xǐ bu xǐhuan yì nián dōu chàbuduō de tiānqì. Xǐhuan. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài jù lǐ kàn dào Cháng'ān xià xuě, hǎo měi! Wǒ gēn zìjǐ shuō: kǎo guò HSK, yǐhòu qù Xī'ān kàn xuě.","m":"Last time you asked if I like weather that's the same all year. I do. But these days I saw snow falling on Chang'an in my drama — so beautiful! I told myself: pass the HSK, and one day go to Xi'an to see snow.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一个很想去的地方？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí gè hěn xiǎng qù de dìfang?","m":"Is there a place you really want to go?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我一直想去中国。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ yìzhí xiǎng qù Zhōngguó.","m":"Yes — I've always wanted to go to China.","r":{"t":"那我们一起去！","p":"Nà wǒmen yìqǐ qù!","m":"Then let's go together!"}},{"t":"有，一个有雪的地方。","p":"Yǒu, yí gè yǒu xuě de dìfang.","m":"Yes — somewhere with snow.","r":{"t":"¡Qué chévere! 我们都想看雪。","p":"¡Qué chévere! Wǒmen dōu xiǎng kàn xuě.","m":"¡Qué chévere! We both want to see snow."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了一集，长安还在下雪。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le yì jí, Cháng'ān hái zài xià xuě.","m":"Watched another episode today — still snowing in Chang'an."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"天黑以后你干什么？","p":"Tiān hēi yǐhòu nǐ gàn shénme?","m":"What do you do after dark?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她天黑以后干什么（写作业，练中文，下个星期考 HSK）","en":"You asked what she does after dark (homework, Chinese practice — HSK next week)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我天黑以后干什么。复习 HSK！这两天我把生词写在小卡片上，贴满了房间。Mochi 撕下来了一张，是「猫」。它是不是故意的？哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ tiān hēi yǐhòu gàn shénme. Fùxí HSK! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ shēngcí xiě zài xiǎo kǎpiàn shang, tiē mǎn le fángjiān. Mochi sī xiàlái le yì zhāng, shì “māo”. Tā shì bu shì gùyì de? Hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what I do after dark. HSK revision! These days I wrote new words on little cards and stuck them all over my room. Mochi pulled one down — it said 猫, 'cat'. Do you think she did it on purpose? Haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你考试前会紧张吗？","p":"Nǐ kǎoshì qián huì jǐnzhāng ma?","m":"Do you get nervous before exams?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，很紧张。","p":"Huì, hěn jǐnzhāng.","m":"Yes, very.","r":{"t":"我也是！我们一起深呼吸。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒmen yìqǐ shēn hūxī.","m":"Me too! Let's take a deep breath together."}},{"t":"不太会。","p":"Bú tài huì.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"你好厉害！教教我。","p":"Nǐ hǎo lìhai! Jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"Impressive! Teach me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又贴了十张生词卡，Mochi 还没撕。","p":"Jīntiān yòu tiē le shí zhāng shēngcí kǎ, Mochi hái méi sī.","m":"Stuck up ten more word cards today — Mochi hasn't torn any yet."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我跟成都的语伴练了一次模拟考试。","p":"Wǒ gēn Chéngdū de yǔbàn liàn le yí cì mónǐ kǎoshì.","m":"I did a practice HSK with my language partner in Chengdu."},{"t":"听力我错了三个，因为 Mochi 在旁边一直叫。","p":"Tīnglì wǒ cuò le sān gè, yīnwèi Mochi zài pángbiān yìzhí jiào.","m":"I got three listening questions wrong because Mochi kept meowing next to me."},{"t":"真的考试那天，我要把 Mochi 关在外面……等一下等一下，它会更生气，哈哈。","p":"Zhēnde kǎoshì nà tiān, wǒ yào bǎ Mochi guān zài wàimiàn …… děng yíxià děng yíxià, tā huì gèng shēngqì, hāha.","m":"On the real exam day I'll shut Mochi out… wait, wait, she'll be even crosser, haha."}],"replies":[{"t":"加油！你一定会考好。","p":"Jiāyóu! Nǐ yídìng huì kǎo hǎo.","m":"Good luck! You'll do great.","r":{"t":"谢谢！考试的时候我会想着你的「加油」。","p":"Xièxie! Kǎoshì de shíhou wǒ huì xiǎng zhe nǐ de “jiāyóu”.","m":"Thanks! I'll think of your 加油 during the exam."}},{"t":"Mochi 也想考 HSK，哈哈。","p":"Mochi yě xiǎng kǎo HSK, hāha.","m":"Mochi wants to take the HSK too, haha.","r":{"t":"对！它的「喵」声调很准。","p":"Duì! Tā de “miāo” shēngdiào hěn zhǔn.","m":"Yes! Its 'miao' has perfect tones."}}],"from":"2026-12-15"}},"2026-12-13|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-13","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dark early here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也黑得很早。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边天也黑得早","en":"It gets dark early where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's dark early there too. My class sang Lucia on Friday morning — thirty kids in white with battery candles, in a dark classroom. Two forgot the words and just smiled. Perfect.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也黑得早。周五早上我们班唱了露西亚——三十个穿白衣服的孩子，拿着电池蜡烛，在黑黑的教室里。有两个忘了词，就一直笑。完美。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a song you've known since childhood?","p":"","m":"你有没有一首从小就会唱的歌？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a holiday song.","p":"","m":"有，一首过节的歌。","r":{"t":"Those songs stay with you forever.","p":"","m":"那种歌会记一辈子。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then borrow ours. It's called 'Sankta Lucia'.","p":"","m":"那借我们的吧。叫《Sankta Lucia》。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still humming the Lucia song today.","p":"","m":"今天还在哼露西亚的歌。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's still light at six here.","p":"","m":"我这边六点天还亮着。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边六点天还亮着","en":"It's still light at six where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's still light at six where you are. I told my class, and one girl asked if you have Lucia too. I said probably not — but you have light. She said: 'Then they don't need it.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边六点天还亮着。我跟班上的孩子说了，一个小女孩问你们有没有露西亚节。我说大概没有——不过你们有光。她说：「那他们不需要。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a festival of light where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边有灯光的节日吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, we have one.","p":"","m":"有一个。","r":{"t":"Lovely. Light festivals are everywhere, it seems.","p":"","m":"真好。看来哪儿都有灯光的节日。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then light one candle on the thirteenth. For us.","p":"","m":"那十三号点一根蜡烛吧。为我们。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking of your light evenings from my dark kitchen.","p":"","m":"在黑黑的厨房里想着你那边亮亮的傍晚。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you join the procession?","p":"","m":"你会参加游行吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她参不参加露西亚游行（不参加，只在旁边看、小声跟着唱）","en":"You asked if she joins the Lucia procession (no — she watches and sings along quietly)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I join the procession. I just watch. This year my youngest was in it for the first time — a star boy, in a tall paper hat. I cried a little. To be fair, all the parents did.","p":"","m":"你上次问我参不参加游行。我只在旁边看。今年我家老二第一次参加——当星星男孩，戴一顶高高的纸帽子。我哭了一点。说实话，所有的爸爸妈妈都哭了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever cried at something happy?","p":"","m":"你有没有因为开心哭过？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, at a wedding.","p":"","m":"有，在婚礼上。","r":{"t":"The best kind of tears.","p":"","m":"最好的眼泪。"}},{"t":"Not that I remember.","p":"","m":"想不起来。","r":{"t":"Then you've never been to a Lucia, ha.","p":"","m":"那你还没看过露西亚，哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still smiling about that star-boy hat.","p":"","m":"想到那顶星星男孩的帽子还在笑。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you eat anything special?","p":"","m":"会吃什么特别的东西吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她们那天吃什么特别的（藏红花面包，黄黄的、甜甜的）","en":"You asked if they eat anything special (saffron buns — yellow and sweet)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if we eat anything special. Saffron buns. This week I baked them myself for the first time. They're S-shaped, with raisins for eyes. Mine looked surprised. Still tasted good.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们那天吃什么特别的。藏红花面包。这周我第一次自己烤。面包是 S 形的，用葡萄干做眼睛。我做的看起来都很吃惊。不过味道还是很好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a festival food you'd like to learn to make?","p":"","m":"有没有一样节日的吃的，你想学着做？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my family's holiday dish.","p":"","m":"有，我家过节的菜。","r":{"t":"Learn it soon. It's worth it.","p":"","m":"早点学。很值得。"}},{"t":"I'd rather just eat it.","p":"","m":"我只想吃。","r":{"t":"Ha, that's a good plan too.","p":"","m":"哈，这也是个好计划。"}}],"next":{"t":"One surprised-looking saffron bun left.","p":"","m":"还剩一个表情吃惊的藏红花面包。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"We got our Christmas tree at the weekend, from a farm outside Malmö.","p":"","m":"周末我们从马尔默郊外的一个农场买了圣诞树。"},{"t":"My husband wanted a tall one, the kids wanted a fat one. Forty minutes later — a tall, fat one.","p":"","m":"我老公想要高的，孩子们想要胖的。四十分钟以后——一棵又高又胖的。"},{"t":"To be fair, it barely fits through the door.","p":"","m":"说实话，它差点进不了门。"}],"replies":[{"t":"A tall, fat tree — perfect!","p":"","m":"又高又胖的树——完美！","r":{"t":"Ja, everyone won. Except the door.","p":"","m":"是啊，大家都赢了。除了门。"}},{"t":"Do you decorate it together?","p":"","m":"你们一起装饰吗？","r":{"t":"Always. The kids do the bottom half — very full.","p":"","m":"每次都是。孩子们负责下面一半——满满的。"}}],"from":"2026-12-15"}},"2026-12-13|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-13","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's around six here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也是六点左右。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是六点左右天黑","en":"It gets dark around six where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said it's around six there too. At six the call to prayer starts, the street lights come on, and my wife says 'dinner'. The same every day. I like it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是六点左右天黑。六点的时候，祷告的声音响起来，路灯亮了，我老婆喊「吃饭」。每天都一样。我喜欢。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What happens at six o'clock where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边六点钟一般是什么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"People come home from work.","p":"","m":"大家下班回家。","r":{"t":"Same here. Everyone on the road, haha.","p":"","m":"这儿也是。大家都在路上，哈哈。"}},{"t":"It's quiet.","p":"","m":"很安静。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Here it's the loudest hour.","p":"","m":"真好。这儿是最吵的时候。"}}],"next":{"t":"Six o'clock — dinner time again.","p":"","m":"六点了——又到吃饭的时候。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dark by four here.","p":"","m":"我这边四点就黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边四点就黑了","en":"It's dark by four where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's dark by four there. I told my kids, and my daughter asked, 'Then when do they eat dinner?' Good question, bro. I didn't know.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边四点就黑了。我跟孩子们说了，我女儿问：「那他们几点吃晚饭？」好问题，兄弟。我也不知道。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What time is dinner where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边几点吃晚饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"Around six.","p":"","m":"六点左右。","r":{"t":"Same as us! Even with the dark at four.","p":"","m":"跟我们一样！即使四点就黑了。"}},{"t":"Late, after eight.","p":"","m":"很晚，八点以后。","r":{"t":"Wow. Four hours of dark before dinner!","p":"","m":"哇。天黑四个小时才吃饭！"}}],"next":{"t":"My daughter asked about your dark afternoons again.","p":"","m":"我女儿又问起你那边黑漆漆的下午。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it still hot after dark?","p":"","m":"天黑以后还热吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过天黑以后还热不热（还是二十五度左右）","en":"You asked if it's still hot after dark (still about twenty-five)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's still hot after dark. About twenty-five. This week we put a mat outside and ate dinner on the step. A little breeze, the neighbours chatting. That's my favourite hour.","p":"","m":"你上次问天黑以后还热不热。二十五度左右。这周我们在门外铺了张垫子，坐在台阶上吃晚饭。一点小风，邻居们在聊天。那是我最喜欢的时候。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where do you like to eat dinner?","p":"","m":"你喜欢在哪儿吃晚饭？"},"replies":[{"t":"At the table with family.","p":"","m":"在桌边跟家人一起。","r":{"t":"The best place, bro.","p":"","m":"最好的地方，兄弟。"}},{"t":"On the sofa, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，在沙发上。","r":{"t":"Ha, comfortable. No judging.","p":"","m":"哈，舒服。不评判。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dinner on the step again tonight.","p":"","m":"今晚又在门口台阶上吃饭。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you do after dark?","p":"","m":"天黑以后你干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过天黑以后他做什么（跟家里人吃晚饭，然后哄孩子睡觉）","en":"You asked what he does after dark (dinner with the family, then the kids' bedtime)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I do after dark. Dinner, then bedtime for the kids. This week my eight-year-old read the bedtime story to the little one. I just listened. Best night of the week.","p":"","m":"你上次问天黑以后我做什么。吃晚饭，然后哄孩子睡觉。这周我八岁的那个给小的念睡前故事。我就在旁边听。这周最好的一个晚上。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did anyone read to you when you were little?","p":"","m":"你小时候有人给你念故事吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my mum.","p":"","m":"有，我妈妈。","r":{"t":"Mums are the best storytellers.","p":"","m":"妈妈是最好的讲故事的人。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then read one to yourself tonight, bro. Never too late.","p":"","m":"那今晚给自己念一个吧，兄弟。永远不晚。"}}],"next":{"t":"The big one read the story again tonight.","p":"","m":"今晚老大又念故事了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"End of the year, bro — the drivers had a small party at the warung.","p":"","m":"年底了，兄弟——司机们在路边小摊办了个小聚会。"},{"t":"Everyone brought one dish. I brought my wife's fried bananas. They went first.","p":"","m":"每人带一个菜。我带了老婆的炸香蕉。第一个被吃光。"},{"t":"Next year, insyaallah, we all want safer roads. And less rain, haha.","p":"","m":"明年，insyaallah，大家都希望路上更安全。雨也少一点，哈哈。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Your wife's bananas win again!","p":"","m":"你老婆的炸香蕉又赢了！","r":{"t":"Always, bro. She's the real champion.","p":"","m":"每次都是，兄弟。她才是真正的冠军。"}},{"t":"Safer roads — I hope so too.","p":"","m":"路上更安全——我也这么希望。","r":{"t":"Thank you, bro. Ride safe wherever you are.","p":"","m":"谢谢，兄弟。不管你在哪儿都注意安全。"}}],"from":"2026-12-15"}},"2026-12-14|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-14","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也去过越南！","p":"Wǒ yě qùguo Yuènán!","m":"I've been to Vietnam too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也去过越南","en":"You've been to Vietnam too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也去过越南！这两天我在里斯本找到一家越南小店，老板是从河内来的。我用中文、英语、越南语混着点了一碗河粉，他居然听懂了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě qùguo Yuènán! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài Lǐsīběn zhǎo dào yì jiā Yuènán xiǎo diàn, lǎobǎn shì cóng Hénèi lái de. Wǒ yòng Zhōngwén, Yīngyǔ, Yuènányǔ hùn zhe diǎn le yì wǎn héfěn, tā jūrán tīng dǒng le, hāha.","m":"You said you've been to Vietnam too! These days I found a little Vietnamese place in Lisbon — the owner's from Hanoi. I ordered pho in a mix of Chinese, English and Vietnamese, and he actually understood, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在越南最喜欢吃什么？","p":"Nǐ zài Yuènán zuì xǐhuan chī shénme?","m":"What did you like eating most in Vietnam?"},"replies":[{"t":"河粉。","p":"Héfěn.","m":"Pho.","r":{"t":"我们一样！热汤最好。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Rè tāng zuì hǎo.","m":"Same as me! Hot soup is the best."}},{"t":"春卷。","p":"Chūnjuǎn.","m":"Spring rolls.","r":{"t":"春卷也好！炸的、不炸的都好吃。","p":"Chūnjuǎn yě hǎo! Zhá de, bù zhá de dōu hǎochī.","m":"Spring rolls are great too — fried or fresh."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想吃河粉了。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng chī héfěn le.","m":"Craving pho again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今年哪儿都没去。","p":"Wǒ jīnnián nǎr dōu méi qù.","m":"I didn't go anywhere this year."},"mem":{"zh":"你今年哪儿都没去","en":"You didn't go anywhere this year"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你今年哪儿都没去。我想了想：其实不出门也能「旅行」。这两天我在青旅跟一个从智利来的人聊了一个晚上，好像去了一趟智利。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jīnnián nǎr dōu méi qù. Wǒ xiǎng le xiǎng: qíshí bù chūmén yě néng “lǚxíng”. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài qīnglǚ gēn yí gè cóng Zhìlì lái de rén liáo le yí gè wǎnshang, hǎoxiàng qù le yí tàng Zhìlì.","m":"You said you didn't go anywhere this year. I've been thinking: you can 'travel' without leaving. These days I spent an evening talking to someone from Chile at the hostel — it felt like a trip to Chile.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"明年你最想去哪儿？","p":"Míngnián nǐ zuì xiǎng qù nǎr?","m":"Where would you most like to go next year?"},"replies":[{"t":"想去一个从没去过的国家。","p":"Xiǎng qù yí gè cóng méi qùguo de guójiā.","m":"Somewhere I've never been.","r":{"t":"好！去了一定告诉我是哪儿。","p":"Hǎo! Qù le yídìng gàosu wǒ shì nǎr.","m":"Great! Tell me where when you go."}},{"t":"还没想好。","p":"Hái méi xiǎng hǎo.","m":"Haven't decided.","r":{"t":"没关系，想好了再走。","p":"Méi guānxi, xiǎng hǎo le zài zǒu.","m":"No rush — decide first, then go."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在青旅又认识了一个新朋友。","p":"Jīntiān zài qīnglǚ yòu rènshi le yí gè xīn péngyou.","m":"Met another new friend at the hostel today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在越南去了哪些地方？","p":"Nǐ zài Yuènán qù le nǎxiē dìfang?","m":"Where did you go in Vietnam?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在越南去了哪些地方（河内坐火车往南，顺化，会安）","en":"You asked where she went in Vietnam (train south from Hanoi, to Hue, then Hoi An)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在越南去了哪些地方。我最喜欢会安：晚上河上全是纸灯笼。这两天我把从会安带回来的灯笼挂在了床头。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài Yuènán qù le nǎxiē dìfang. Wǒ zuì xǐhuan Huì'ān: wǎnshang hé shang quán shì zhǐ dēnglong. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ cóng Huì'ān dài huílái de dēnglong guà zài le chuángtóu.","m":"Last time you asked where I went in Vietnam. My favourite was Hoi An — at night the river's full of paper lanterns. These days I hung the lantern I brought back from Hoi An above my bed.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有从旅行带回来、一直留着的东西？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu cóng lǚxíng dài huílái, yìzhí liú zhe de dōngxi?","m":"Is there something you brought back from a trip and kept?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一块小石头。","p":"Yǒu, yí kuài xiǎo shítou.","m":"Yes — a little stone.","r":{"t":"小石头最好，带着一个地方的记忆。","p":"Xiǎo shítou zuì hǎo, dài zhe yí gè dìfang de jìyì.","m":"Stones are the best — they hold a place's memory."}},{"t":"没有，我只拍照。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ zhǐ pāizhào.","m":"No — I just take photos.","r":{"t":"照片也是很好的纪念。","p":"Zhàopiàn yě shì hěn hǎo de jìniàn.","m":"Photos are great keepsakes too."}}],"next":{"t":"床头的灯笼今天又亮了一晚上。","p":"Chuángtóu de dēnglong jīntiān yòu liàng le yì wǎnshang.","m":"The lantern above my bed glowed all evening again."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在那儿待了多久？","p":"Nǐ zài nàr dāi le duō jiǔ?","m":"How long were you there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在越南待了多久（三个星期，觉得不够）","en":"You asked how long she stayed in Vietnam (three weeks — not enough)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在越南待了多久。三个星期。这两天我在算：明年要是再去，我想待三个月，学几句越南语——它跟中文一样有声调！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài Yuènán dāi le duō jiǔ. Sān gè xīngqī. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài suàn: míngnián yàoshi zài qù, wǒ xiǎng dāi sān gè yuè, xué jǐ jù Yuènányǔ —— tā gēn Zhōngwén yíyàng yǒu shēngdiào!","m":"Last time you asked how long I stayed in Vietnam. Three weeks. These days I've been planning: if I go back next year, I'd stay three months and learn some Vietnamese — it has tones, just like Chinese!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你出去旅行，一般待多久？","p":"Nǐ chūqù lǚxíng, yìbān dāi duō jiǔ?","m":"When you travel, how long do you usually stay?"},"replies":[{"t":"一个星期左右。","p":"Yí gè xīngqī zuǒyòu.","m":"About a week.","r":{"t":"一个星期刚好，不会太累。","p":"Yí gè xīngqī gānghǎo, bú huì tài lèi.","m":"A week's just right — not too tiring."}},{"t":"越久越好。","p":"Yuè jiǔ yuè hǎo.","m":"The longer the better.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在看越南的地图。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài kàn Yuènán de dìtú.","m":"Looking at a map of Vietnam again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-14|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-14","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也坐过十几个小时的飞机。","p":"Wǒ yě zuòguo shí jǐ gè xiǎoshí de fēijī.","m":"I've done a flight of over ten hours too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也坐过十几个小时的飞机","en":"You've done a flight of over ten hours too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也坐过十几个小时的飞机。这两天我又想起那次：旁边坐着一个长沙阿姨，她教了我十个长沙话的词。下飞机我都忘了，只记得「恰饭」，就是「吃饭」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zuòguo shí jǐ gè xiǎoshí de fēijī. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu xiǎng qǐ nà cì: pángbiān zuò zhe yí gè Chángshā āyí, tā jiāo le wǒ shí gè Chángshā huà de cí. Xià fēijī wǒ dōu wàng le, zhǐ jìde “qià fàn”, jiù shì “chī fàn”.","m":"You said you've done a flight of over ten hours too. These days I remembered that trip: a lady from Changsha sat next to me and taught me ten words of Changsha dialect. I forgot them all by landing — except 恰饭, which means 'eat'.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"坐长途飞机的时候，你做什么？","p":"Zuò chángtú fēijī de shíhou, nǐ zuò shénme?","m":"What do you do on a long flight?"},"replies":[{"t":"看电影。","p":"Kàn diànyǐng.","m":"Watch films.","r":{"t":"我也是！我看了三部。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Wǒ kàn le sān bù.","m":"Me too! I watched three."}},{"t":"睡觉。","p":"Shuìjiào.","m":"Sleep.","r":{"t":"厉害！我睡不着，所以学了长沙话，哈哈。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ shuì bu zháo, suǒyǐ xué le Chángshā huà, hāha.","m":"Impressive! I couldn't sleep, so I learned Changsha dialect, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天食堂吃饭，我说了一句「恰饭」，大家都笑了。","p":"Jīntiān shítáng chī fàn, wǒ shuō le yí jù “qià fàn”, dàjiā dōu xiào le.","m":"Said 恰饭 at lunch in the canteen today — everyone laughed."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还没坐过那么久的飞机。","p":"Wǒ hái méi zuòguo nàme jiǔ de fēijī.","m":"I've never been on a flight that long."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没坐过那么久的飞机","en":"You've never been on such a long flight"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你还没坐过那么久的飞机。给你一个小建议：多站起来走走，多喝水。我第一次没走，下飞机脚肿得穿不进鞋，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hái méi zuòguo nàme jiǔ de fēijī. Gěi nǐ yí gè xiǎo jiànyì: duō zhàn qǐlái zǒuzou, duō hē shuǐ. Wǒ dì yī cì méi zǒu, xià fēijī jiǎo zhǒng de chuān bu jìn xié, hāha.","m":"You said you've never been on such a long flight. A small tip: get up and walk around, drink lots of water. The first time I didn't move, and my feet were so swollen I couldn't get my shoes on, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你坐过最久的车或者飞机是几个小时？","p":"Nǐ zuòguo zuì jiǔ de chē huòzhě fēijī shì jǐ gè xiǎoshí?","m":"What's the longest trip you've taken, in hours?"},"replies":[{"t":"五六个小时。","p":"Wǔ liù gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Five or six hours.","r":{"t":"那也很久了！","p":"Nà yě hěn jiǔ le!","m":"That's long too!"}},{"t":"一两个小时。","p":"Yì liǎng gè xiǎoshí.","m":"An hour or two.","r":{"t":"那下次坐长途，记得带零食。","p":"Nà xià cì zuò chángtú, jìde dài língshí.","m":"Then next long trip, bring snacks."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在工地上又想起了长沙。","p":"Jīntiān zài gōngdì shang yòu xiǎng qǐ le Chángshā.","m":"Thinking about Changsha again on site today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去了中国哪个城市？","p":"Nǐ qù le Zhōngguó nǎ gè chéngshì?","m":"Which city in China did you go to?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他去了中国哪个城市（长沙，菜真辣）","en":"You asked which Chinese city he went to (Changsha — very spicy food)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去了中国哪个城市。长沙！这两天我跟食堂的四川师傅说长沙的菜，他不服：「湖南的辣跟四川的辣不一样。」我们讨论了一个中午。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù le Zhōngguó nǎ gè chéngshì. Chángshā! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn shítáng de Sìchuān shīfu shuō Chángshā de cài, tā bù fú: “Húnán de là gēn Sìchuān de là bù yíyàng.” Wǒmen tǎolùn le yí gè zhōngwǔ.","m":"Last time you asked which city I went to. Changsha! These days I told the Sichuan cook in our canteen about Changsha food, and he wasn't having it: “Hunan spicy and Sichuan spicy are different.” We argued all lunchtime.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你能吃辣吗？","p":"Nǐ néng chī là ma?","m":"Can you handle spicy food?"},"replies":[{"t":"能，越辣越好。","p":"Néng, yuè là yuè hǎo.","m":"Yes — the hotter the better.","r":{"t":"那你跟我一样！","p":"Nà nǐ gēn wǒ yíyàng!","m":"Then you're like me!"}},{"t":"不太能。","p":"Bú tài néng.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题，中国也有很多不辣的菜。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí, Zhōngguó yě yǒu hěn duō bú là de cài.","m":"No problem, no problem — China has loads of mild food too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天四川师傅又跟我说「我们的辣才是真的辣」，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān Sìchuān shīfu yòu gēn wǒ shuō “wǒmen de là cái shì zhēn de là”, hāha.","m":"The Sichuan cook told me again today: “Ours is the real spicy,” haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在中国说中文了吗？","p":"Nǐ zài Zhōngguó shuō Zhōngwén le ma?","m":"Did you speak Chinese in China?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在中国说没说中文（说了，点菜、打车都用中文）","en":"You asked if he spoke Chinese in China (yes — ordering food, taking taxis)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在中国说没说中文。说了！最难忘的是打车：司机一路跟我聊足球，我听懂了一半，可是我们笑了一路。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài Zhōngguó shuō méi shuō Zhōngwén. Shuō le! Zuì nánwàng de shì dǎ chē: sījī yí lù gēn wǒ liáo zúqiú, wǒ tīng dǒng le yíbàn, kěshì wǒmen xiào le yí lù.","m":"Last time you asked if I spoke Chinese in China. I did! The best was a taxi ride: the driver talked football the whole way. I understood half, but we laughed the entire time.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你用外语跟陌生人聊过天吗？","p":"Nǐ yòng wàiyǔ gēn mòshēngrén liáoguo tiān ma?","m":"Have you ever chatted to a stranger in another language?"},"replies":[{"t":"聊过，有点紧张。","p":"Liáoguo, yǒudiǎn jǐnzhāng.","m":"Yes — a bit nervous.","r":{"t":"我也是！可是聊完很开心。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Kěshì liáo wán hěn kāixīn.","m":"Me too! But afterwards it feels great."}},{"t":"还没有。","p":"Hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet.","r":{"t":"下次试试，从「你好」开始。","p":"Xià cì shìshi, cóng “nǐ hǎo” kāishǐ.","m":"Try next time — start with hello."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起长沙那个司机。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ Chángshā nà gè sījī.","m":"Remembering that Changsha taxi driver again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-14|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-14","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今年也哪儿都没去。","p":"Wǒ jīnnián yě nǎr dōu méi qù.","m":"I didn't go anywhere this year either."},"mem":{"zh":"你今年也哪儿都没去","en":"You didn't go anywhere this year either"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你今年也哪儿都没去。这两天我想了想，其实今年我们都走了很远——在中文里。家长会、面馆、小说，我走了很远。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jīnnián yě nǎr dōu méi qù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng le xiǎng, qíshí jīnnián wǒmen dōu zǒu le hěn yuǎn —— zài Zhōngwén lǐ. Jiāzhǎng huì, miànguǎn, xiǎoshuō, wǒ zǒu le hěn yuǎn.","m":"You said you didn't go anywhere this year either. These days I've been thinking: actually, we both went a long way this year — in Chinese. Parents' evenings, the noodle shop, a novel. I travelled far.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"今年你在哪件事上走得最远？","p":"Jīnnián nǐ zài nǎ jiàn shì shang zǒu de zuì yuǎn?","m":"What did you go furthest with this year?"},"replies":[{"t":"学中文。","p":"Xué Zhōngwén.","m":"Learning Chinese.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"工作或者学习。","p":"Gōngzuò huòzhě xuéxí.","m":"Work or study.","r":{"t":"那也是很远的路。","p":"Nà yě shì hěn yuǎn de lù.","m":"That's a long road too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去了一趟超市。最远的地方，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù le yí tàng chāoshì. Zuì yuǎn de dìfang, hāha.","m":"Made it to the supermarket again today. My furthest destination, haha."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我今年去了一个很远的地方。","p":"Wǒ jīnnián qù le yí gè hěn yuǎn de dìfang.","m":"I went somewhere really far this year."},"mem":{"zh":"你今年去了一个很远的地方","en":"You went somewhere far this year"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你今年去了一个很远的地方，我好羡慕。这两天我跟我太太说：明年夏天，我们带女儿去成都。她说：「你先把小说看完。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jīnnián qù le yí gè hěn yuǎn de dìfang, wǒ hǎo xiànmù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn wǒ tàitai shuō: míngnián xiàtiān, wǒmen dài nǚ'ér qù Chéngdū. Tā shuō: “Nǐ xiān bǎ xiǎoshuō kàn wán.”","m":"You said you went somewhere far this year — so jealous. These days I told my wife: next summer, let's take our daughter to Chengdu. She said: “Finish your novel first.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你明年想去哪儿？","p":"Nǐ míngnián xiǎng qù nǎr?","m":"Where do you want to go next year?"},"replies":[{"t":"还想再出去。","p":"Hái xiǎng zài chūqù.","m":"Somewhere else again.","r":{"t":"对，走得越多越想走。","p":"Duì, zǒu de yuè duō yuè xiǎng zǒu.","m":"Right — the more you travel, the more you want to."}},{"t":"想在家待着。","p":"Xiǎng zài jiā dāi zhe.","m":"I'd like to stay home.","r":{"t":"在家也好，走累了就该休息。","p":"Zài jiā yě hǎo, zǒu lèi le jiù gāi xiūxi.","m":"Home is good — after travelling, you rest."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在地图上看成都。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài dìtú shang kàn Chéngdū.","m":"Looking at Chengdu on the map again today."}},"m1.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"去了另外一个国家。","p":"Qù le lìngwài yí gè guójiā.","m":"Another country."},"mem":{"zh":"你今年去了另外一个国家","en":"You went to another country this year"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你今年去了另外一个国家，真好！这两天我问学生今年谁出过国，一个女孩说她回中国看了奶奶，还用中文跟我讲了五分钟。我全听懂了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ jīnnián qù le lìngwài yí gè guójiā, zhēn hǎo! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn xuésheng jīnnián shéi chūguo guó, yí gè nǚhái shuō tā huí Zhōngguó kàn le nǎinai, hái yòng Zhōngwén gēn wǒ jiǎng le wǔ fēnzhōng. Wǒ quán tīng dǒng le.","m":"You said you went to another country this year — lovely! These days I asked my students who'd been abroad. A girl said she'd been back to China to see her grandma — and told me about it in Chinese for five minutes. I understood every word.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"去另外一个国家的时候，你会说当地的话吗？","p":"Qù lìngwài yí gè guójiā de shíhou, nǐ huì shuō dāngdì de huà ma?","m":"When you go to another country, do you speak the local language?"},"replies":[{"t":"说一点。","p":"Shuō yìdiǎn.","m":"A little.","r":{"t":"一点就很好！对方会很开心。","p":"Yìdiǎn jiù hěn hǎo! Duìfāng huì hěn kāixīn.","m":"A little is great! People love it."}},{"t":"不太会，用英语。","p":"Bú tài huì, yòng Yīngyǔ.","m":"Not really — English.","r":{"t":"也行，能沟通就好。","p":"Yě xíng, néng gōutōng jiù hǎo.","m":"That works — as long as you can communicate."}}],"next":{"t":"今天那个学生又跟我说了一句中文。","p":"Jīntiān nà gè xuésheng yòu gēn wǒ shuō le yí jù Zhōngwén.","m":"That student said something to me in Chinese again today."}},"m1.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"去看我的家人了。","p":"Qù kàn wǒ de jiārén le.","m":"To see my family."},"mem":{"zh":"你今年去看了你的家人","en":"You went to see your family this year"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你去看你的家人了。那是最好的旅行。这两天我爸妈又说圣诞节要来纽约，我爸已经在练他的第二句中文了：「谢谢老板」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ qù kàn nǐ de jiārén le. Nà shì zuì hǎo de lǚxíng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bà mā yòu shuō Shèngdàn Jié yào lái Niǔyuē, wǒ bà yǐjīng zài liàn tā de dì èr jù Zhōngwén le: “Xièxie lǎobǎn”.","m":"You said you went to see your family. That's the best kind of trip. These days my parents said they're coming to New York again for Christmas, and my dad's already practising his second Chinese phrase: 谢谢老板.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟家人多久见一次？","p":"Nǐ gēn jiārén duō jiǔ jiàn yí cì?","m":"How often do you see your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"一年一两次。","p":"Yì nián yī liǎng cì.","m":"Once or twice a year.","r":{"t":"那每次见面都很珍贵。","p":"Nà měi cì jiànmiàn dōu hěn zhēnguì.","m":"Then every visit is precious."}},{"t":"常常见。","p":"Chángcháng jiàn.","m":"Often.","r":{"t":"真好，你很幸运。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, nǐ hěn xìngyùn.","m":"Lovely — you're lucky."}}],"next":{"t":"我爸今天打电话，又说了一遍「谢谢老板」。","p":"Wǒ bà jīntiān dǎ diànhuà, yòu shuō le yí biàn “xièxie lǎobǎn”.","m":"My dad called today and said 谢谢老板 again."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"为什么今年哪儿都没去？","p":"Wèishénme jīnnián nǎr dōu méi qù?","m":"Why didn't you go anywhere this year?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他为什么今年哪儿都没去（学校太忙，暑假还在上课）","en":"You asked why he went nowhere this year (school was busy — he taught through the summer)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我为什么哪儿都没去。暑假我在给学生补课。这两天有个补过课的学生考试考得很好，跑来跟我说：「谢谢老师，这个比旅行好。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ wèishénme nǎr dōu méi qù. Shǔjià wǒ zài gěi xuésheng bǔkè. Zhè liǎng tiān yǒu gè bǔguo kè de xuésheng kǎoshì kǎo de hěn hǎo, pǎo lái gēn wǒ shuō: “Xièxie lǎoshī, zhège bǐ lǚxíng hǎo.”","m":"Last time you asked why I went nowhere. I spent the summer tutoring. These days one of those students aced a test and ran over to say: “Thank you, teacher — this is better than a holiday.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你暑假一般做什么？","p":"Nǐ shǔjià yìbān zuò shénme?","m":"What do you usually do in the summer?"},"replies":[{"t":"出去旅行。","p":"Chūqù lǚxíng.","m":"Travel.","r":{"t":"真好，替我多看看。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, tì wǒ duō kànkan.","m":"Lovely — see some extra for me."}},{"t":"工作或者学习。","p":"Gōngzuò huòzhě xuéxí.","m":"Work or study.","r":{"t":"我们一样，夏天也很忙。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng, xiàtiān yě hěn máng.","m":"Same as me — summers are busy too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天那个学生又来说谢谢了。","p":"Jīntiān nà gè xuésheng yòu lái shuō xièxie le.","m":"That student came to say thank you again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"明年你想去哪儿？","p":"Míngnián nǐ xiǎng qù nǎr?","m":"Where do you want to go next year?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他明年想去哪儿（回成都，去以前常去的茶馆看看）","en":"You asked where he wants to go next year (back to Chengdu, to his old teahouse)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我明年想去哪儿。回成都！这两天我在网上查了，以前常去的那家茶馆还在，老板还是同一个人。我看了很久。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ míngnián xiǎng qù nǎr. Huí Chéngdū! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài wǎng shang chá le, yǐqián cháng qù de nà jiā cháguǎn hái zài, lǎobǎn háishi tóng yí gè rén. Wǒ kàn le hěn jiǔ.","m":"Last time you asked where I want to go next year. Back to Chengdu! These days I looked online — my old teahouse is still there, same owner. I stared at it for ages.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一个很想回去的地方？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí gè hěn xiǎng huíqù de dìfang?","m":"Is there a place you'd really like to go back to?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我小时候住的地方。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ xiǎoshíhou zhù de dìfang.","m":"Yes — where I grew up.","r":{"t":"那个地方一定有很多回忆。","p":"Nà gè dìfang yídìng yǒu hěn duō huíyì.","m":"That place must hold lots of memories."}},{"t":"没有，我喜欢去新的地方。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ xǐhuan qù xīn de dìfang.","m":"No — I like new places.","r":{"t":"也好，新地方有新故事。","p":"Yě hǎo, xīn dìfang yǒu xīn gùshi.","m":"Good too — new places, new stories."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在网上看了一眼那家茶馆。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài wǎng shang kàn le yì yǎn nà jiā cháguǎn.","m":"Looked up that teahouse online again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-14|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-14","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I visited family far away this year too.","p":"","m":"我今年也去看了很远的家人。"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年也去很远的地方看了家里人","en":"You visited family far away this year too"},"later":{"t":"You said you visited family far away this year too. Since we got back, my kids keep asking when we go again. My daughter even drew the village — the river, the chickens, her grandma.","p":"","m":"你上次说你今年也去很远的地方看了家里人。回来以后，孩子们一直问什么时候再去。我女儿还画了那个村子——河、鸡，还有她外婆。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best part of visiting family?","p":"","m":"去看家里人，最好的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The food.","p":"","m":"吃的。","r":{"t":"Same, bro! Village food is the best.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟！村里的饭最好吃。"}},{"t":"Just being together.","p":"","m":"就是在一起。","r":{"t":"True. That's everything.","p":"","m":"说得对。那就是一切。"}}],"next":{"t":"My daughter drew the village again today.","p":"","m":"我女儿今天又画了那个村子。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I didn't travel at all this year.","p":"","m":"我今年完全没出门旅行。"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年哪儿都没去","en":"You didn't travel at all this year"},"later":{"t":"You said you didn't travel at all this year. That's OK. This week I thought: I drive around Jakarta all day, but I never really see it. On Sunday I took the kids to the old town, Kota Tua. Like tourists in our own city.","p":"","m":"你上次说你今年哪儿都没去。没关系。这周我在想：我每天在雅加达骑来骑去，可从来没好好看过它。周日我带孩子们去了老城区 Kota Tua。在自己的城市当了一回游客。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever been a tourist in your own city?","p":"","m":"你有没有在自己的城市当过游客？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it was fun.","p":"","m":"有，很好玩。","r":{"t":"Right? Everything looks new.","p":"","m":"对吧？什么都像新的。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Try it once, bro. Just one day.","p":"","m":"试一次吧，兄弟。就一天。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about Kota Tua. Nice day.","p":"","m":"还在想老城区。那天真好。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long did it take?","p":"","m":"路上花了多久？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过路上花了多久（差不多一整天，门到门）","en":"You asked how long the journey took (almost a whole day, door to door)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long it took. Almost a whole day. On the long bus, my eight-year-old slept on my arm for five hours. My arm was dead, but I didn't move.","p":"","m":"你上次问路上花了多久。差不多一整天。在那趟长途大巴上，我八岁的孩子枕着我的胳膊睡了五个小时。胳膊都麻了，可是我一动没动。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the longest trip you've ever taken?","p":"","m":"你坐过最久的一趟车或飞机是多久？"},"replies":[{"t":"More than ten hours.","p":"","m":"十几个小时。","r":{"t":"Respect! Long trips are hard.","p":"","m":"佩服！长途很累。"}},{"t":"Just a few hours.","p":"","m":"就几个小时。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Short trips are better, haha.","p":"","m":"真好。短途更舒服，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"My arm finally feels normal again, haha.","p":"","m":"我的胳膊终于恢复正常了，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's the village like?","p":"","m":"那个村子怎么样？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那个村子是什么样（绿绿的、安静，到处都是亲戚）","en":"You asked what the village is like (green, quiet, full of relatives)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what the village is like. Green, quiet, full of relatives. This week my wife's uncle called — he says the rice is almost ready to harvest. In the village, the rice tells you the date.","p":"","m":"你上次问那个村子是什么样。绿绿的、安静，到处都是亲戚。这周我老婆的叔叔打电话来，说稻子快收了。在村里，稻子就是日历。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever been to the countryside?","p":"","m":"你去过乡下吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my family's from there.","p":"","m":"去过，我家就是那儿的。","r":{"t":"Then you know the quiet, bro.","p":"","m":"那你懂那种安静，兄弟。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太去。","r":{"t":"Try it once. You sleep like a baby.","p":"","m":"去一次吧。睡得像婴儿一样。"}}],"next":{"t":"Missing the quiet village today.","p":"","m":"今天想念村里的安静。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-14|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-14","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I went to Edinburgh too!","p":"","m":"我也去过爱丁堡！"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年也去了爱丁堡","en":"You went to Edinburgh this year too"},"later":{"t":"You said you went to Edinburgh too! This week a colleague asked about my trip, and I realised the best moment was tiny: a man in a kilt eating chips in the rain, completely calm.","p":"","m":"你上次说你今年也去了爱丁堡！这周一个同事问起我的旅行，我才发现最难忘的是一件小事：一个穿苏格兰裙的男人，在雨里吃薯条，一点都不着急。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you remember most from a trip?","p":"","m":"旅行的时候，你最记得的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The food.","p":"","m":"吃的。","r":{"t":"Fair. Food memories last.","p":"","m":"有道理。吃的记忆最长。"}},{"t":"Small moments like that.","p":"","m":"像这样的小瞬间。","r":{"t":"Exactly. The small stuff stays.","p":"","m":"就是。小事最难忘。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still thinking about the man in the kilt.","p":"","m":"还在想那个穿苏格兰裙的人。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Yes, every single day.","p":"","m":"淋了，每天都淋。"},"mem":{"zh":"你在爱丁堡天天淋雨","en":"You got rained on every day in Edinburgh"},"later":{"t":"You said you got rained on every single day. Full experience! This week I read that Edinburgh is actually one of the drier places in Scotland. Felt like a lie, honestly.","p":"","m":"你上次说你在爱丁堡天天淋雨。完整体验！这周我读到，爱丁堡其实是苏格兰比较不下雨的地方。说实话，听着像骗人的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you mind rain on holiday?","p":"","m":"旅行的时候下雨你介意吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Not really, it's part of it.","p":"","m":"不太介意，这也是旅行的一部分。","r":{"t":"Spoken like a true traveller.","p":"","m":"真正的旅行者说的话。"}},{"t":"Yes, it ruins everything.","p":"","m":"介意，什么都毁了。","r":{"t":"Then never visit Scotland in winter, ha.","p":"","m":"那冬天千万别去苏格兰，哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Raining in London too. Edinburgh vibes.","p":"","m":"伦敦也在下雨。爱丁堡的感觉。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"No, I was lucky.","p":"","m":"没有，我运气好。"},"mem":{"zh":"你在爱丁堡运气好，没淋雨","en":"You were lucky with the weather in Edinburgh"},"later":{"t":"You said you were lucky — no rain. Unfair! I got soaked twice. This week I asked my Scottish colleague the secret. She said: 'There isn't one. You just got lucky.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你运气好——没下雨。不公平！我被淋透了两次。这周我问我的苏格兰同事有什么秘诀。她说：「没有秘诀。你就是运气好。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Are you usually lucky with the weather?","p":"","m":"你出门天气运一般好吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, usually.","p":"","m":"一般都好。","r":{"t":"Come to London. We need you.","p":"","m":"来伦敦吧。我们需要你。"}},{"t":"No — it rains whenever I travel.","p":"","m":"不好，我一出门就下雨。","r":{"t":"Then we're the same. Pack a raincoat.","p":"","m":"那我们一样。带件雨衣。"}}],"next":{"t":"Grey again here. Send some of your luck.","p":"","m":"这儿又是灰的。分我点好运吧。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I went somewhere much farther.","p":"","m":"我去的地方远多了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年去了更远的地方","en":"You went somewhere much farther this year"},"later":{"t":"You said you went somewhere much farther. Show-off. This week I looked at a map and realised Edinburgh's only about four hundred miles from London. I need to try harder next year.","p":"","m":"你上次说你去了更远的地方。显摆。这周我看了看地图，发现爱丁堡离伦敦才四百英里左右。明年我得努力一点了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where would you like to go next year?","p":"","m":"你明年想去哪儿？"},"replies":[{"t":"Somewhere warm.","p":"","m":"暖和的地方。","r":{"t":"Same. Somewhere without a raincoat.","p":"","m":"一样。一个不用穿雨衣的地方。"}},{"t":"Back to where I went this year.","p":"","m":"再去今年去的地方。","r":{"t":"Must've been good, then.","p":"","m":"那一定很棒。"}}],"next":{"t":"Looking at maps again. Dreaming.","p":"","m":"又在看地图。做梦。"}},"m1.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Another continent.","p":"","m":"另一个大洲。"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年去了另一个大洲","en":"You went to another continent this year"},"later":{"t":"You said you went to another continent. Impressive. This week I asked my flatmates how many continents we've been to between us. Four people, two continents. Very local lot.","p":"","m":"你上次说你去了另一个大洲。厉害。这周我问室友们，我们四个加起来去过几个大洲。四个人，两个大洲。一群很本地的人。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What surprised you most there?","p":"","m":"那儿最让你吃惊的是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"The food.","p":"","m":"吃的。","r":{"t":"Always the food. I need to go.","p":"","m":"永远是吃的。我得去。"}},{"t":"How friendly people were.","p":"","m":"人很友好。","r":{"t":"That's the best surprise.","p":"","m":"那是最好的惊喜。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still jealous of your continent, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，还在羡慕你去的那个大洲。"}},"m1.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"Somewhere for work.","p":"","m":"去出差。"},"mem":{"zh":"你今年出差去了很远的地方","en":"You went somewhere far for work this year"},"later":{"t":"You said it was for work. Still counts! This week my editor said I might go to Manchester for a story next year. Not another continent, but I'll take it.","p":"","m":"你上次说是出差。也算！这周主编说明年可能让我去曼彻斯特写个稿子。不是另一个大洲，不过我接受。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like work trips?","p":"","m":"你喜欢出差吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — I get to see new places.","p":"","m":"喜欢，能看到新地方。","r":{"t":"Exactly. Free travel, sort of.","p":"","m":"就是。算是免费旅行吧。"}},{"t":"Not really, they're tiring.","p":"","m":"不太喜欢，很累。","r":{"t":"Fair. Hotels get old fast.","p":"","m":"有道理。酒店很快就住腻了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Manchester's looking likely. Exciting-ish.","p":"","m":"曼彻斯特应该能去了。算是兴奋吧。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why Edinburgh?","p":"","m":"为什么去爱丁堡？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他为什么去爱丁堡（朋友的婚礼，好多人穿苏格兰裙）","en":"You asked why Edinburgh (a friend's wedding — lots of kilts)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why Edinburgh. A friend's wedding. This week the couple sent everyone a thank-you card. Mine said: 'Thanks for dancing, even though you can't.' Fair.","p":"","m":"你上次问我为什么去爱丁堡。朋友的婚礼。这周新人给每个人寄了感谢卡。我的那张写着：「谢谢你跳舞，虽然你不会跳。」有道理。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like weddings?","p":"","m":"你喜欢参加婚礼吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — the dancing!","p":"","m":"喜欢，跳舞！","r":{"t":"Then you're braver than me.","p":"","m":"那你比我勇敢。"}},{"t":"Not really, they're too long.","p":"","m":"不太喜欢，太长了。","r":{"t":"Fair. Scottish ones go on forever.","p":"","m":"有道理。苏格兰的婚礼没完没了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thank-you card's on my fridge.","p":"","m":"感谢卡贴在我的冰箱上。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Was it cold?","p":"","m":"冷吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过爱丁堡冷不冷（冷得要命，风大，可是很美）","en":"You asked if it was cold (freezing and windy, but beautiful)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it was cold. Freezing. This week London finally caught up — two degrees and windy. I wore the hat I bought in Edinburgh. My flatmate says I look like a tourist in my own city.","p":"","m":"你上次问冷不冷。冷得要命。这周伦敦终于也赶上了——两度，有风。我戴上了在爱丁堡买的帽子。室友说我看起来像在自己城市里的游客。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you buy souvenirs when you travel?","p":"","m":"旅行的时候你会买纪念品吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always something small.","p":"","m":"会，总是买点小东西。","r":{"t":"Small is best. Mine's a hat.","p":"","m":"小的最好。我的是一顶帽子。"}},{"t":"No, just memories.","p":"","m":"不买，只带回忆。","r":{"t":"Lighter suitcase, too.","p":"","m":"行李箱也轻。"}}],"next":{"t":"Edinburgh hat on again today.","p":"","m":"今天又戴上了爱丁堡的帽子。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-15|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-15","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在练用筷子。","p":"Wǒ yě zài liàn yòng kuàizi.","m":"I'm practising chopsticks too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也在练用筷子","en":"You're practising chopsticks too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在练用筷子。这两天我又学了一样：夹面条。梁阿姨说，面条要先卷一下再夹。我试了，汤溅到了我的毛衣上，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài liàn yòng kuàizi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu xué le yí yàng: jiā miàntiáo. Liáng āyí shuō, miàntiáo yào xiān juǎn yíxià zài jiā. Wǒ shì le, tāng jiàn dào le wǒ de máoyī shang, hāha.","m":"You said you're practising chopsticks too. These days I learned something new: noodles. Auntie Liang says you twist them a bit first, then lift. I tried — and splashed soup on my jumper, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你用筷子最难夹的是什么？","p":"Nǐ yòng kuàizi zuì nán jiā de shì shénme?","m":"What's hardest to pick up with chopsticks?"},"replies":[{"t":"面条。","p":"Miàntiáo.","m":"Noodles.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"豆子。","p":"Dòuzi.","m":"Beans.","r":{"t":"对，豆子会跑。","p":"Duì, dòuzi huì pǎo.","m":"Yes — beans run away."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又练了夹面条，毛衣没事。","p":"Jīntiān yòu liàn le jiā miàntiáo, máoyī méi shì.","m":"Practised noodles again today — jumper survived."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我从小就会用筷子。","p":"Wǒ cóng xiǎo jiù huì yòng kuàizi.","m":"I've used chopsticks since I was little."},"mem":{"zh":"你从小就会用筷子","en":"You've used chopsticks since you were little"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你从小就会用筷子，我好羡慕。这两天梁阿姨请我去她家吃饭，她三岁的孙女用筷子比我还好。她看着我，笑了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ cóngxiǎo jiù huì yòng kuàizi, wǒ hǎo xiànmù. Zhè liǎng tiān Liáng āyí qǐng wǒ qù tā jiā chī fàn, tā sān suì de sūnnǚ yòng kuàizi bǐ wǒ hái hǎo. Tā kàn zhe wǒ, xiào le.","m":"You said you've used chopsticks since you were little — so jealous. These days Auntie Liang invited me for dinner, and her three-year-old granddaughter was better with chopsticks than me. She looked at me and laughed.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候是谁教你用筷子的？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou shì shéi jiāo nǐ yòng kuàizi de?","m":"Who taught you to use chopsticks?"},"replies":[{"t":"我爸妈。","p":"Wǒ bà mā.","m":"My parents.","r":{"t":"那你爸妈是好老师。","p":"Nà nǐ bà mā shì hǎo lǎoshī.","m":"Then they were good teachers."}},{"t":"不记得了，好像自己就会了。","p":"Bú jìde le, hǎoxiàng zìjǐ jiù huì le.","m":"Can't remember — I just knew.","r":{"t":"真厉害，我学了六十多年才会，哈哈。","p":"Zhēn lìhai, wǒ xué le liùshí duō nián cái huì, hāha.","m":"Amazing — it took me sixty-odd years, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又用筷子吃了一顿饭。","p":"Jīntiān yòu yòng kuàizi chī le yí dùn fàn.","m":"Ate a whole meal with chopsticks again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你是怎么练的？","p":"Nǐ shì zěnme liàn de?","m":"How did you practise?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她怎么练的（每天晚上把花生从一个碗夹到另一个碗）","en":"You asked how she practised (moving peanuts between bowls every evening)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我怎么练的。每天晚上夹花生。这两天我换了一样：夹小番茄，更圆、更滑。Biscuit 在旁边看着，很失望，因为一个都没掉。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zěnme liàn de. Měi tiān wǎnshang jiā huāshēng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ huàn le yí yàng: jiā xiǎo fānqié, gèng yuán, gèng huá. Biscuit zài pángbiān kàn zhe, hěn shīwàng, yīnwèi yí gè dōu méi diào.","m":"Last time you asked how I practised. Peanuts every evening. These days I switched to cherry tomatoes — rounder and more slippery. Biscuit sat watching, very disappointed, because not a single one fell.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近在练什么新的东西？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn zài liàn shénme xīn de dōngxi?","m":"What new thing are you practising lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"练做饭。","p":"Liàn zuò fàn.","m":"Cooking.","r":{"t":"做饭好，练完还能吃。","p":"Zuò fàn hǎo, liàn wán hái néng chī.","m":"Cooking's great — you can eat your practice."}},{"t":"练说外语。","p":"Liàn shuō wàiyǔ.","m":"Speaking a language.","r":{"t":"我们一样！每天一点点。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Měi tiān yìdiǎndiǎn.","m":"Same as me! A little every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天夹小番茄，一个都没掉。","p":"Jīntiān jiā xiǎo fānqié, yí gè dōu méi diào.","m":"Cherry tomatoes today — didn't drop a single one."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"练完的花生呢？","p":"Liàn wán de huāshēng ne?","m":"And the peanuts afterwards?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她练完的花生怎么办（都吃了，胖了一点）","en":"You asked what happened to the practice peanuts (she ate them — and put on a bit of weight)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我练完的花生呢。都吃了。这两天我决定：练习用的花生，一半送给邻居。邻居说，她从来没收过这么奇怪的礼物，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ liàn wán de huāshēng ne. Dōu chī le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ juédìng: liànxí yòng de huāshēng, yíbàn sòng gěi línjū. Línjū shuō, tā cónglái méi shōuguo zhème qíguài de lǐwù, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what happened to the practice peanuts. I ate them. These days I decided to give half to my neighbour. She said she's never had such a strange present, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有送过别人很奇怪的礼物？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu sòngguo biérén hěn qíguài de lǐwù?","m":"Have you ever given someone a really odd present?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，哈哈。","p":"Yǒu, hāha.","m":"Yes, haha.","r":{"t":"那我们一样！","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Then we're the same!"}},{"t":"没有，我送的都很普通。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ sòng de dōu hěn pǔtōng.","m":"No — mine are always ordinary.","r":{"t":"普通的礼物最安全。","p":"Pǔtōng de lǐwù zuì ānquán.","m":"Ordinary presents are the safest."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又送了邻居一小袋花生。","p":"Jīntiān yòu sòng le línjū yì xiǎo dài huāshēng.","m":"Gave my neighbour another little bag of peanuts today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-15|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-15","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在学打中文字。","p":"Wǒ yě zài xué dǎ Zhōngwén zì.","m":"I'm learning to type in Chinese too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也在学打中文字","en":"You're learning to type Chinese too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在学打中文字！这两天我发现，一个拼音有好多字，要选对。我想打「谢谢」，第一次打成了「写写」，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài xué dǎ Zhōngwén zì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, yí gè pīnyīn yǒu hǎo duō zì, yào xuǎn duì. Wǒ xiǎng dǎ “xièxie”, dì yī cì dǎ chéng le “xiěxie”, hāha.","m":"You said you're learning to type Chinese too! These days I noticed one pinyin can be lots of characters — you have to pick the right one. I tried to type 谢谢 and got 写写, 'write write', haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你打字快还是写字快？","p":"Nǐ dǎ zì kuài háishi xiě zì kuài?","m":"Are you faster typing or writing by hand?"},"replies":[{"t":"打字快。","p":"Dǎ zì kuài.","m":"Typing.","r":{"t":"我也是！写字太慢了。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Xiě zì tài màn le.","m":"Me too! Handwriting's so slow."}},{"t":"写字快。","p":"Xiě zì kuài.","m":"Writing by hand.","r":{"t":"你好厉害！","p":"Nǐ hǎo lìhai!","m":"Impressive!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又打了很多中文，快了一点！","p":"Jīntiān yòu dǎ le hěn duō Zhōngwén, kuài le yìdiǎn!","m":"Typed loads of Chinese again today — a bit faster!"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我打中文字还很慢。","p":"Wǒ dǎ Zhōngwén zì hái hěn màn.","m":"I'm still slow at typing Chinese."},"mem":{"zh":"你打中文字还很慢","en":"You're still slow at typing Chinese"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你打中文字还很慢。我也是！这两天我给自己一个小游戏：每天用中文给语伴写一条消息。最近一条是：「我很想吃火锅，可是我还没吃过。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dǎ Zhōngwén zì hái hěn màn. Wǒ yě shì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gěi zìjǐ yí gè xiǎo yóuxì: měi tiān yòng Zhōngwén gěi yǔbàn xiě yì tiáo xiāoxi. Zuìjìn yì tiáo shì: “Wǒ hěn xiǎng chī huǒguō, kěshì wǒ hái méi chīguo.”","m":"You said you're still slow at typing Chinese. Me too! These days I've set myself a little game: one message in Chinese to my language partner every day. The latest: “I really want hotpot, but I've never had it.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天会用中文写点什么吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān huì yòng Zhōngwén xiě diǎn shénme ma?","m":"Do you write anything in Chinese every day?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，写一两句。","p":"Huì, xiě yì liǎng jù.","m":"Yes, a line or two.","r":{"t":"一两句就很好！","p":"Yì liǎng jù jiù hěn hǎo!","m":"A line or two is great!"}},{"t":"还没有。","p":"Hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet.","r":{"t":"从一句开始！「你好」也算。","p":"Cóng yí jù kāishǐ! “Nǐ hǎo” yě suàn.","m":"Start with one! Even 你好 counts."}}],"next":{"t":"今天给语伴写了一条消息，用了三分钟，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān gěi yǔbàn xiě le yì tiáo xiāoxi, yòng le sān fēnzhōng, hāha.","m":"Wrote my language partner a message today — took three minutes, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你跟谁用中文聊天？","p":"Nǐ gēn shéi yòng Zhōngwén liáotiān?","m":"Who do you chat with in Chinese?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她跟谁用中文聊天（上海的一个语伴，在学西班牙语）","en":"You asked who she chats with in Chinese (a language partner in Shanghai learning Spanish)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我跟谁用中文聊天。上海的语伴！这两天我教她说「¡Qué chévere!」，她教我「太赞了」。我们现在每句话都说两遍，西班牙语一遍，中文一遍。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ gēn shéi yòng Zhōngwén liáotiān. Shànghǎi de yǔbàn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jiāo tā shuō “¡Qué chévere!”, tā jiāo wǒ “tài zàn le”. Wǒmen xiànzài měi jù huà dōu shuō liǎng biàn, Xībānyáyǔ yí biàn, Zhōngwén yí biàn.","m":"Last time you asked who I chat with in Chinese. My partner in Shanghai! These days I taught her ¡Qué chévere! and she taught me 太赞了. Now we say everything twice — once in Spanish, once in Chinese.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有语伴吗？","p":"Nǐ yǒu yǔbàn ma?","m":"Do you have a language partner?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我们常常聊。","p":"Yǒu, wǒmen chángcháng liáo.","m":"Yes — we chat a lot.","r":{"t":"真好！语伴是最好的老师。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Yǔbàn shì zuì hǎo de lǎoshī.","m":"Lovely! Language partners are the best teachers."}},{"t":"还没有。","p":"Hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet.","r":{"t":"找一个吧！你教你的语言，她教她的。","p":"Zhǎo yí gè ba! Nǐ jiāo nǐ de yǔyán, tā jiāo tā de.","m":"Find one! You teach yours, they teach theirs."}}],"next":{"t":"今天跟上海的语伴说了「太赞了」。","p":"Jīntiān gēn Shànghǎi de yǔbàn shuō le “tài zàn le”.","m":"Said 太赞了 to my Shanghai partner today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"打错过字吗？","p":"Dǎ cuò guo zì ma?","m":"Have you ever typed the wrong character?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她打错过字没有（常常，想打「睡觉」打成了「水饺」）","en":"You asked if she's made typos (often — she typed 'dumplings' instead of 'sleep')"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我打错过字没有。常常！这两天又错了一次：我想说「我想你」，打成了「我想睡」。语伴说：「那你快去睡吧，哈哈。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ dǎ cuòguo zì méiyǒu. Chángcháng! Zhè liǎng tiān yòu cuò le yí cì: wǒ xiǎng shuō “wǒ xiǎng nǐ”, dǎ chéng le “wǒ xiǎng shuì”. Yǔbàn shuō: “Nà nǐ kuài qù shuì ba, hāha.”","m":"Last time you asked if I make typos. All the time! These days I did it again: I meant 'I miss you' and typed 'I want to sleep'. My partner said: “Then go to bed, haha.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你说外语的时候出过什么好笑的错？","p":"Nǐ shuō wàiyǔ de shíhou chūguo shénme hǎoxiào de cuò?","m":"Have you made a funny mistake in another language?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，说错了一个词。","p":"Yǒu, shuō cuò le yí gè cí.","m":"Yes — I got a word wrong.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们都一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen dōu yíyàng!","m":"Haha, we all do!"}},{"t":"好像还没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet, I think.","r":{"t":"那你很小心！我天天出错。","p":"Nà nǐ hěn xiǎoxīn! Wǒ tiāntiān chū cuò.","m":"You're careful! I make mistakes every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天打字很小心，一个错都没有！","p":"Jīntiān dǎ zì hěn xiǎoxīn, yí gè cuò dōu méiyǒu!","m":"Typed carefully today — not one mistake!"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-15|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-15","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I still rehearse before ordering.","p":"","m":"我点东西前还是会先练一遍。"},"mem":{"zh":"你点东西前还会先在脑子里练","en":"You still rehearse before ordering"},"later":{"t":"You said you still rehearse before ordering. Me too, for a long time. This week I noticed: I don't rehearse coffee any more, but I still rehearse phone calls. Tiny steps, honestly.","p":"","m":"你上次说你点东西前还会先在脑子里练。我也练了很久。这周我发现：点咖啡我不用练了，可是打电话还要先练。说实话，一小步一小步来。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you still rehearse in your head?","p":"","m":"你现在还会在脑子里先练什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Phone calls.","p":"","m":"打电话。","r":{"t":"Same! Phone calls are the boss level.","p":"","m":"一样！打电话是最难的一关。"}},{"t":"Ordering food.","p":"","m":"点餐。","r":{"t":"You'll get there. One day you just… don't.","p":"","m":"你会的。有一天你就……不用练了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Made a phone call today without rehearsing. Almost.","p":"","m":"今天打了个电话，没先练。差不多吧。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I order in English without thinking now.","p":"","m":"我现在用英语点东西不用想了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你现在点东西不用想了","en":"You order in English without thinking now"},"later":{"t":"You said you order in English without thinking now. Great feeling, right? This week I got a bit too confident — I ordered a 'small large latte'. The barista just smiled and gave me a medium.","p":"","m":"你上次说你现在点东西不用想了。感觉很好，对吧？这周我有点太自信了——点了一杯「小杯大杯拿铁」。咖啡师笑了笑，给了我一杯中杯。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever mixed up words when you felt confident?","p":"","m":"你有没有一自信就说错过？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"有，常常。","r":{"t":"Good. It means you're speaking, honestly.","p":"","m":"好。说实话，说明你在开口说。"}},{"t":"Not that I noticed.","p":"","m":"没注意到。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Or nobody told you, haha.","p":"","m":"真好。或者没人告诉你，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ordered correctly today. Medium, iced, oat.","p":"","m":"今天点对了。中杯，冰的，燕麦奶。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you order?","p":"","m":"你点什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他点什么（中杯冰拿铁，燕麦奶，现在能说得很快）","en":"You asked what he orders (medium iced latte, oat milk — he can say it fast now)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I order. Medium iced latte, oat milk. This week the barista started writing 'Min' on my cup before I even said my name. Honestly, it felt like a small award.","p":"","m":"你上次问我点什么。中杯冰拿铁，燕麦奶。这周咖啡师在我说名字之前，就在杯子上写好了「Min」。说实话，感觉像得了个小奖。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a place where they know your name?","p":"","m":"有没有一个地方，店员知道你的名字？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my local café.","p":"","m":"有，家附近的咖啡馆。","r":{"t":"Then you know the feeling.","p":"","m":"那你懂这种感觉。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"Keep going back. It'll happen.","p":"","m":"常去就会的。"}}],"next":{"t":"'Min' on the cup again today.","p":"","m":"今天杯子上又写着「Min」。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Was there a hard part?","p":"","m":"有什么难的地方吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他难在哪儿（店员的问题，「堂食还是外带？」每次都难倒他）","en":"You asked what was hard (the questions — 'For here or to go?' got him every time)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what was hard. 'For here or to go?' This week a new barista said it differently: 'Staying or going?' I froze for a second, said 'Going' — and walked out without my coffee.","p":"","m":"你上次问难在哪儿。「堂食还是外带？」这周一个新咖啡师换了个说法：「留下还是走？」我愣了一秒，说「走」——然后真的走了，咖啡没拿。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a question that always catches you off guard?","p":"","m":"有没有一个问题，总是让你措手不及？"},"replies":[{"t":"'How are you?'","p":"","m":"「你好吗？」","r":{"t":"Same! I used to answer it properly, honestly.","p":"","m":"一样！说实话，我以前都认真回答。"}},{"t":"Questions about the future.","p":"","m":"关于未来的问题。","r":{"t":"Fair. Those are hard in any language.","p":"","m":"有道理。用什么语言都难。"}}],"next":{"t":"Remembered my coffee today. Progress.","p":"","m":"今天记得拿咖啡了。进步。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-16|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-16","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我最近也特别忙。","p":"Wǒ zuìjìn yě tèbié máng.","m":"I've been really busy lately too."},"mem":{"zh":"你最近也特别忙","en":"You've been really busy lately too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你最近也特别忙。这两天我改到一半，泡了一壶茶，看了五分钟窗外……然后接着改。休息五分钟，真的有用。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zuìjìn yě tèbié máng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gǎi dào yíbàn, pào le yì hú chá, kàn le wǔ fēnzhōng chuāng wài …… ránhòu jiē zhe gǎi. Xiūxi wǔ fēnzhōng, zhēnde yǒu yòng.","m":"You said you've been really busy lately too. These days, halfway through marking, I made a pot of tea and looked out of the window for five minutes… then carried on. Five minutes' rest really helps.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你忙的时候怎么休息？","p":"Nǐ máng de shíhou zěnme xiūxi?","m":"How do you take a break when you're busy?"},"replies":[{"t":"喝杯茶或者咖啡。","p":"Hē bēi chá huòzhě kāfēi.","m":"A cup of tea or coffee.","r":{"t":"跟我一样。","p":"Gēn wǒ yíyàng.","m":"Same as me."}},{"t":"出去走一走。","p":"Chūqù zǒu yi zǒu.","m":"A short walk.","r":{"t":"好主意，冬天走一走也很精神。","p":"Hǎo zhǔyi, dōngtiān zǒu yi zǒu yě hěn jīngshen.","m":"Good idea — a winter walk wakes you up."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又改了三十本，泡了两壶茶。","p":"Jīntiān yòu gǎi le sānshí běn, pào le liǎng hú chá.","m":"Marked another thirty today — two pots of tea."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这几天不太忙。","p":"Wǒ zhè jǐ tiān bú tài máng.","m":"I'm not too busy these days."},"mem":{"zh":"你这几天不太忙","en":"You're not too busy these days"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你这几天不太忙，我好羡慕。这两天改作业改到半夜，我就想：等忙完了，我也要过几天你那样的日子。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zhè jǐ tiān bú tài máng, wǒ hǎo xiànmù. Zhè liǎng tiān gǎi zuòyè gǎi dào bànyè, wǒ jiù xiǎng: děng máng wán le, wǒ yě yào guò jǐ tiān nǐ nàyàng de rìzi.","m":"You said you're not too busy these days — so jealous. These days I've been marking till midnight, thinking: once this is over, I want a few days like yours.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"不忙的时候，你最喜欢做什么？","p":"Bù máng de shíhou, nǐ zuì xǐhuan zuò shénme?","m":"When you're not busy, what do you like doing most?"},"replies":[{"t":"睡懒觉。","p":"Shuì lǎnjiào.","m":"Sleeping in.","r":{"t":"这个我最想做！","p":"Zhège wǒ zuì xiǎng zuò!","m":"That's exactly what I want to do!"}},{"t":"看书看剧。","p":"Kàn shū kàn jù.","m":"Reading and watching shows.","r":{"t":"好，我忙完也要看剧。","p":"Hǎo, wǒ máng wán yě yào kàn jù.","m":"Nice — I'll binge a show when I'm done too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天终于改完了一半。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngyú gǎi wán le yíbàn.","m":"Finally halfway through the marking today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一天要改多少本？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān yào gǎi duōshao běn?","m":"How many books do you grade a day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一天要改多少本（三十多本，改到眼睛都花了）","en":"You asked how many she marks a day (thirty-odd — until her eyes blur)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一天改多少本。三十多本。这两天有个学生在作业里夹了一张小纸条，画了一只小熊，写着「老师加油」。我一下子就不累了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yì tiān gǎi duōshao běn. Sānshí duō běn. Zhè liǎng tiān yǒu gè xuésheng zài zuòyè lǐ jiā le yì zhāng xiǎo zhǐtiáo, huà le yì zhī xiǎo xióng, xiě zhe “lǎoshī jiāyóu”. Wǒ yíxiàzi jiù bú lèi le.","m":"Last time you asked how many I mark a day. Thirty-odd. These days a student tucked a little note into their homework — a drawing of a bear and 'Go teacher!' Suddenly I wasn't tired.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"最近有没有一件小事让你很开心？","p":"Zuìjìn yǒu méiyǒu yí jiàn xiǎo shì ràng nǐ hěn kāixīn?","m":"Has a little thing made you happy lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，朋友给我发了消息。","p":"Yǒu, péngyou gěi wǒ fā le xiāoxi.","m":"Yes — a friend messaged me.","r":{"t":"小事最暖。","p":"Xiǎo shì zuì nuǎn.","m":"Little things are the warmest."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"Can't think of one.","r":{"t":"那希望你今天就碰到一件。","p":"Nà xīwàng nǐ jīntiān jiù pèng dào yí jiàn.","m":"Then I hope one comes your way today."}}],"next":{"t":"那张小熊纸条，我今天夹在了书里。","p":"Nà zhāng xiǎo xióng zhǐtiáo, wǒ jīntiān jiā zài le shū lǐ.","m":"Tucked the bear note into a book today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"考完试你打算干什么？","p":"Kǎo wán shì nǐ dǎsuàn gàn shénme?","m":"What are you going to do after the exams?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她考完试打算干什么（睡大懒觉，然后去吃涮肉）","en":"You asked what she'll do after exams (a long lie-in, then hotpot)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我考完试打算干什么。睡懒觉，吃涮肉。这两天我已经跟老同学约好了：周六中午，老地方。我连点什么都想好了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ kǎo wán shì dǎsuàn gàn shénme. Shuì lǎnjiào, chī shuànròu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yǐjīng gēn lǎo tóngxué yuē hǎo le: zhōuliù zhōngwǔ, lǎo dìfang. Wǒ lián diǎn shénme dōu xiǎng hǎo le.","m":"Last time you asked what I'll do after the exams. Lie in, then hotpot. These days I've already arranged it with my old classmates: Saturday lunch, the usual place. I've even decided what to order.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你忙完一件大事以后，喜欢怎么犒劳自己？","p":"Nǐ máng wán yí jiàn dà shì yǐhòu, xǐhuan zěnme kàoláo zìjǐ?","m":"After finishing something big, how do you treat yourself?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃一顿好的。","p":"Chī yí dùn hǎo de.","m":"A good meal.","r":{"t":"对，跟我一样！","p":"Duì, gēn wǒ yíyàng!","m":"Yes, same as me!"}},{"t":"睡一整天。","p":"Shuì yì zhěng tiān.","m":"Sleep all day.","r":{"t":"这个也是我的计划。","p":"Zhège yě shì wǒ de jìhuà.","m":"That's my plan too."}}],"next":{"t":"离涮肉又近了一天。","p":"Lí shuànròu yòu jìn le yì tiān.","m":"One day closer to hotpot."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-16|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-16","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也有好几个报告要交。","p":"Wǒ yě yǒu hǎo jǐ gè bàogào yào jiāo.","m":"I've got several reports due too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也有好几个报告要交","en":"You've got several reports due too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也有好几个报告要交。我交了一份了！这两天在图书馆写第二份，旁边的同学睡着了，口水滴在书上，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yǒu hǎo jǐ gè bàogào yào jiāo. Wǒ jiāo le yí fèn le! Zhè liǎng tiān zài túshūguǎn xiě dì èr fèn, pángbiān de tóngxué shuìzháo le, kǒushuǐ dī zài shū shang, hāha.","m":"You said you've got several reports due too. I've handed one in! These days I've been writing the second in the library — the classmate next to me fell asleep and drooled on her book, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你写东西的时候喜欢在哪里？","p":"Nǐ xiě dōngxi de shíhou xǐhuan zài nǎlǐ?","m":"Where do you like to write?"},"replies":[{"t":"图书馆。","p":"Túshūguǎn.","m":"The library.","r":{"t":"图书馆最专心，除了有人睡觉，哈哈。","p":"Túshūguǎn zuì zhuānxīn, chúle yǒu rén shuìjiào, hāha.","m":"The library's the most focused — apart from the sleepers, haha."}},{"t":"家里或者咖啡店。","p":"Jiā lǐ huòzhě kāfēi diàn.","m":"Home or a café.","r":{"t":"咖啡店也好，可是我会一直点东西吃。","p":"Kāfēi diàn yě hǎo, kěshì wǒ huì yìzhí diǎn dōngxi chī.","m":"Cafés are nice, but I'd keep ordering snacks."}}],"next":{"t":"第二份报告写了一半。","p":"Dì èr fèn bàogào xiě le yíbàn.","m":"Halfway through the second report."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我已经不上学了。","p":"Wǒ yǐjīng bú shàngxué le.","m":"I'm not in school any more."},"mem":{"zh":"你已经不上学了","en":"You're not in school any more"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你已经不上学了。好羡慕喔。这两天写报告写到半夜，我在想：等我毕业了，也要跟你一样说「我已经不上学了」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yǐjīng bú shàngxué le. Hǎo xiànmù o. Zhè liǎng tiān xiě bàogào xiě dào bànyè, wǒ zài xiǎng: děng wǒ bìyè le, yě yào gēn nǐ yíyàng shuō “wǒ yǐjīng bú shàngxué le”.","m":"You said you're not in school any more. So jealous. These days, writing reports till midnight, I've been thinking: when I graduate, I'll say it too — 'I'm not in school any more.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你上学的时候，最怕什么？","p":"Nǐ shàngxué de shíhou, zuì pà shénme?","m":"When you were at school, what did you dread most?"},"replies":[{"t":"考试。","p":"Kǎoshì.","m":"Exams.","r":{"t":"对！我也是。","p":"Duì! Wǒ yě shì.","m":"Yes! Me too."}},{"t":"早起。","p":"Zǎo qǐ.","m":"Getting up early.","r":{"t":"早起最难了！","p":"Zǎo qǐ zuì nán le!","m":"Early mornings are the worst!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写到很晚，想到你不用写报告。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě dào hěn wǎn, xiǎng dào nǐ bú yòng xiě bàogào.","m":"Writing late again today — thinking of you, free from reports."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你写了几份了？","p":"Nǐ xiě le jǐ fèn le?","m":"How many have you written?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她写了几份（一份半，还有一份半）","en":"You asked how many she's written (one and a half — one and a half to go)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我写了几份。那时候一份半。这两天我写完第二份了！还剩一份。我妈打电话说：「写完就回家，给你煮汤。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiě le jǐ fèn. Nà shíhou yí fèn bàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiě wán dì èr fèn le! Hái shèng yí fèn. Wǒ mā dǎ diànhuà shuō: “Xiě wán jiù huí jiā, gěi nǐ zhǔ tāng.”","m":"Last time you asked how many I'd written. One and a half then. These days I finished the second! One left. Mum called and said: “Finish, then come home — I'll make you soup.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你做完一件大事，最想做什么？","p":"Nǐ zuò wán yí jiàn dà shì, zuì xiǎng zuò shénme?","m":"After finishing something big, what do you most want to do?"},"replies":[{"t":"回家吃饭。","p":"Huí jiā chī fàn.","m":"Go home and eat.","r":{"t":"对！家里的饭最好吃。","p":"Duì! Jiā lǐ de fàn zuì hǎochī.","m":"Yes! Home food is the best."}},{"t":"好好睡一觉。","p":"Hǎohǎo shuì yí jiào.","m":"Have a long sleep.","r":{"t":"我也是，睡一整天。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, shuì yì zhěng tiān.","m":"Me too — a whole day."}}],"next":{"t":"最后一份报告开始写了。","p":"Zuìhòu yí fèn bàogào kāishǐ xiě le.","m":"Started the last report."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你晚上几点睡？","p":"Nǐ wǎnshang jǐ diǎn shuì?","m":"What time do you go to bed?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她晚上几点睡（这几天都是两点多，靠咖啡撑着）","en":"You asked when she goes to bed (past two these days, running on coffee)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我晚上几点睡。两点多。这两天我决定改一下：一点就睡，早上早点起来写。结果七点起来，我又躺回去了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ wǎnshang jǐ diǎn shuì. Liǎng diǎn duō. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ juédìng gǎi yíxià: yì diǎn jiù shuì, zǎoshang zǎo diǎn qǐlái xiě. Jiéguǒ qī diǎn qǐlái, wǒ yòu tǎng huíqù le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked when I go to bed. Past two. These days I decided to change: bed at one, up early to write. At seven I got up — and lay straight back down, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你是晚上写东西，还是早上？","p":"Nǐ shì wǎnshang xiě dōngxi, háishi zǎoshang?","m":"Do you write at night or in the morning?"},"replies":[{"t":"晚上，比较安静。","p":"Wǎnshang, bǐjiào ānjìng.","m":"Night — quieter.","r":{"t":"我们一样，晚上脑子比较清楚。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng, wǎnshang nǎozi bǐjiào qīngchu.","m":"Same — my head's clearer at night."}},{"t":"早上，脑子比较清楚。","p":"Zǎoshang, nǎozi bǐjiào qīngchu.","m":"Morning — my head's clearer.","r":{"t":"好厉害！我早上起不来。","p":"Hǎo lìhai! Wǒ zǎoshang qǐ bu lái.","m":"Impressive! I can't get up."}}],"next":{"t":"今天一点就睡了，进步！","p":"Jīntiān yì diǎn jiù shuì le, jìnbù!","m":"In bed by one today — progress!"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-16|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-16","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在准备一个中文演讲！","p":"Wǒ yě zài zhǔnbèi yí gè Zhōngwén yǎnjiǎng!","m":"I'm preparing a Chinese speech too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也在准备一个中文演讲","en":"You're preparing a Chinese speech too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在准备一个中文演讲！这两天我把自己的演讲录下来听了一遍，发现「准确地说」说了七次。准确地说，太多了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài zhǔnbèi yí gè Zhōngwén yǎnjiǎng! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ zìjǐ de yǎnjiǎng lù xiàlái tīng le yí biàn, fāxiàn “zhǔnquè de shuō” shuō le qī cì. Zhǔnquè de shuō, tài duō le, hāha.","m":"You said you're preparing a Chinese speech too! These days I recorded mine and listened back — I said 'to be precise' seven times. To be precise, too many, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你说话有没有一个常说的口头禅？","p":"Nǐ shuōhuà yǒu méiyǒu yí gè cháng shuō de kǒutóuchán?","m":"Do you have a phrase you always say?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，「然后」。","p":"Yǒu, “ránhòu”.","m":"Yes — 然后, 'and then'.","r":{"t":"「然后」很多人都说！","p":"“Ránhòu” hěn duō rén dōu shuō!","m":"Lots of people say 然后!"}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"I don't think so.","r":{"t":"问问朋友，他们一定知道，哈哈。","p":"Wènwen péngyou, tāmen yídìng zhīdào, hāha.","m":"Ask a friend — they'll know, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天的演讲里，「准确地说」只说了三次。","p":"Jīntiān de yǎnjiǎng lǐ, “zhǔnquè de shuō” zhǐ shuō le sān cì.","m":"Only three 'to be precise' in today's run-through."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我在别人面前说话会紧张。","p":"Wǒ zài biérén miànqián shuōhuà huì jǐnzhāng.","m":"I get nervous talking in front of people."},"mem":{"zh":"你在别人面前说话会紧张","en":"You get nervous speaking in front of people"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在别人面前说话会紧张。我也会。这两天我先在妹妹面前讲了一次，又在全家面前讲了一次。我爸鼓掌鼓得最响，虽然他一个字都听不懂。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài biérén miànqián shuōhuà huì jǐnzhāng. Wǒ yě huì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiān zài mèimei miànqián jiǎng le yí cì, yòu zài quán jiā miànqián jiǎng le yí cì. Wǒ bà gǔzhǎng gǔ de zuì xiǎng, suīrán tā yí gè zì dōu tīng bu dǒng.","m":"You said you get nervous speaking in front of people. Me too. These days I did my speech in front of my sister, then the whole family. Dad clapped the loudest, even though he didn't understand a word.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你紧张的时候，有什么办法？","p":"Nǐ jǐnzhāng de shíhou, yǒu shénme bànfǎ?","m":"What do you do when you're nervous?"},"replies":[{"t":"深呼吸。","p":"Shēn hūxī.","m":"Deep breaths.","r":{"t":"好办法！我也用。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ! Wǒ yě yòng.","m":"Good one! I use it too."}},{"t":"想象下面没有人。","p":"Xiǎngxiàng xiàmiàn méiyǒu rén.","m":"Imagine nobody's there.","r":{"t":"哈哈，这个我要试试。","p":"Hāha, zhège wǒ yào shìshi.","m":"Haha, I'll try that."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在家人面前讲了一遍。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài jiārén miànqián jiǎng le yí biàn.","m":"Gave the speech to my family again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你的演讲讲什么？","p":"Nǐ de yǎnjiǎng jiǎng shénme?","m":"What's your speech about?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她的演讲讲什么（开罗的一天，从早上的面包讲到晚上的尼罗河）","en":"You asked what her speech is about (a day in Cairo — from morning bread to the Nile at night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我的演讲讲什么。讲开罗的一天。这两天我加了一段：晚上尼罗河边卖烤玉米的大叔。准确地说，他是我演讲里最受欢迎的人。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ de yǎnjiǎng jiǎng shénme. Jiǎng Kāiluó de yì tiān. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jiā le yí duàn: wǎnshang Níluó Hé biān mài kǎo yùmǐ de dàshū. Zhǔnquè de shuō, tā shì wǒ yǎnjiǎng lǐ zuì shòu huānyíng de rén.","m":"Last time you asked what my speech is about. A day in Cairo. These days I added a bit about the roast-corn man by the Nile at night. To be precise, he's the most popular person in my speech.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是讲你那边的一天，你会讲什么？","p":"Yàoshi jiǎng nǐ nàbiān de yì tiān, nǐ huì jiǎng shénme?","m":"If you described a day where you live, what would you talk about?"},"replies":[{"t":"早上的早饭。","p":"Zǎoshang de zǎofàn.","m":"Breakfast.","r":{"t":"早饭最能看出一个地方！","p":"Zǎofàn zuì néng kàn chū yí gè dìfang!","m":"Breakfast tells you the most about a place!"}},{"t":"晚上街上的样子。","p":"Wǎnshang jiē shang de yàngzi.","m":"The streets at night.","r":{"t":"晚上的街最有意思。","p":"Wǎnshang de jiē zuì yǒu yìsi.","m":"Night streets are the most interesting."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又练了一遍烤玉米那一段。","p":"Jīntiān yòu liàn le yí biàn kǎo yùmǐ nà yí duàn.","m":"Practised the roast-corn part again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"演讲有多长？","p":"Yǎnjiǎng yǒu duō cháng?","m":"How long is the speech?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她的演讲有多长（五分钟，可是感觉像五个小时）","en":"You asked how long the speech is (five minutes — feels like five hours)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我的演讲有多长。五分钟。这两天我计时：第一次讲了七分钟，第二次四分钟——太快了！我在找刚刚好的速度。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ de yǎnjiǎng yǒu duō cháng. Wǔ fēnzhōng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jìshí: dì yī cì jiǎng le qī fēnzhōng, dì èr cì sì fēnzhōng —— tài kuài le! Wǒ zài zhǎo gānggāng hǎo de sùdù.","m":"Last time you asked how long my speech is. Five minutes. These days I timed it: first go, seven minutes; second go, four — far too fast! I'm looking for the right speed.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你说外语的时候，会说得太快还是太慢？","p":"Nǐ shuō wàiyǔ de shíhou, huì shuō de tài kuài háishi tài màn?","m":"In another language, do you speak too fast or too slow?"},"replies":[{"t":"太快，一紧张就快。","p":"Tài kuài, yì jǐnzhāng jiù kuài.","m":"Too fast — nerves speed me up.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"太慢，要想很久。","p":"Tài màn, yào xiǎng hěn jiǔ.","m":"Too slow — I have to think.","r":{"t":"慢一点没关系，说清楚最重要。","p":"Màn yìdiǎn méi guānxi, shuō qīngchu zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Slow is fine — clear is what matters."}}],"next":{"t":"今天讲了五分零五秒，差不多了！","p":"Jīntiān jiǎng le wǔ fēn líng wǔ miǎo, chàbuduō le!","m":"Five minutes five seconds today — nearly there!"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-16|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-16","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm racing to finish something before the holidays too.","p":"","m":"我也在赶着假期前做完一件事。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也在赶着节前做完一件事","en":"You're racing to finish something before the holidays too"},"later":{"t":"You said you're racing to finish something before the holidays too. This week I finished song seven at four a.m. My mum found me asleep on the keyboard. The song ended with one very long note, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也在赶着节前做完一件事。这周我凌晨四点做完了第七首。我妈发现我趴在键盘上睡着了。那首歌最后多了一个特别长的音，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How's your thing going?","p":"","m":"你那件事进行得怎么样？"},"replies":[{"t":"Almost done.","p":"","m":"快做完了。","r":{"t":"Let's both cross the line, chale!","p":"","m":"我们一起冲线吧，兄弟！"}},{"t":"Not great, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，不太顺。","r":{"t":"Keep going. The last bit is always the hardest.","p":"","m":"继续。最后一段总是最难的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Song seven fixed. No more long note, haha.","p":"","m":"第七首修好了。没有那个长音了，哈哈。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm not busy at all.","p":"","m":"我一点都不忙。"},"mem":{"zh":"你这阵子一点都不忙","en":"You're not busy at all"},"later":{"t":"You said you're not busy at all. I'm jealous, chale. This week I promised myself one free evening. I went to the beach and didn't think about music for two whole hours.","p":"","m":"你上次说你一点都不忙。我好羡慕，兄弟。这周我答应自己空出一个晚上。我去了海边，整整两个小时没想音乐的事。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do with a free evening?","p":"","m":"你空闲的晚上会做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Nothing at all.","p":"","m":"什么都不做。","r":{"t":"Best plan. I'm learning.","p":"","m":"最好的计划。我在学。"}},{"t":"See friends.","p":"","m":"见朋友。","r":{"t":"Same. Friends fix everything.","p":"","m":"一样。朋友什么都能治好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking about my free evening at the beach.","p":"","m":"在想那个在海边的空闲晚上。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many songs are on the album?","p":"","m":"专辑里有几首歌？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过专辑有几首歌（八首，做完了六首）","en":"You asked how many songs are on the album (eight — six done)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many songs. Eight. Seven are done now. The last one's the hardest — it's for my grandmother, and I want it to be right.","p":"","m":"你上次问有几首歌。八首。现在做完七首了。最后一首最难——是给我奶奶的，我想把它做好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever made something for someone special?","p":"","m":"你有没有为一个特别的人做过什么东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a card.","p":"","m":"有，一张卡片。","r":{"t":"Handmade is always best.","p":"","m":"亲手做的永远最好。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"Maybe this year. It's a good feeling.","p":"","m":"也许今年可以。那种感觉很好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Working on Grandma's song today.","p":"","m":"今天在做给奶奶的歌。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"When does it come out?","p":"","m":"什么时候发？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过专辑什么时候出（希望是一月）","en":"You asked when it comes out (January, he hopes)"},"later":{"t":"You asked when it comes out. January, I hope. This week I picked the cover idea: my street in the harmattan, with the sun like a white coin.","p":"","m":"你上次问专辑什么时候出。希望是一月。这周我定了封面的想法：哈马丹风里的我家那条街，太阳像一枚白色的硬币。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you enjoy waiting for things, or does it make you nervous?","p":"","m":"你喜欢等待吗，还是会紧张？"},"replies":[{"t":"I enjoy the waiting.","p":"","m":"我喜欢等待的感觉。","r":{"t":"Respect. I'm counting the days.","p":"","m":"佩服。我在数日子。"}},{"t":"It makes me nervous.","p":"","m":"会紧张。","r":{"t":"Same, chale. January can't come fast enough.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。一月快点来吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Counting the days to January.","p":"","m":"在数还有几天到一月。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-17|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-17","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们这边也是过年的时候送礼。","p":"Wǒmen zhèbiān yě shì guònián de shíhou sònglǐ.","m":"We give presents at New Year here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边也是过年的时候送礼","en":"Where you are, gifts are for New Year too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是过年的时候送礼。这两天我妈已经在问：今年过年给谁送什么？离春节还有一个多月，她已经开始列单子了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì guònián de shíhou sòng lǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā yǐjīng zài wèn: jīnnián guònián gěi shéi sòng shénme? Lí Chūnjié hái yǒu yí gè duō yuè, tā yǐjīng kāishǐ liè dānzi le.","m":"You said gifts are for New Year where you are too. These days my mum's already asking who we're giving what this New Year. Spring Festival's more than a month away, and she's started a list.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家谁最会准备过节的东西？","p":"Nǐ jiā shéi zuì huì zhǔnbèi guòjié de dōngxi?","m":"Who in your family is best at holiday preparations?"},"replies":[{"t":"我妈。","p":"Wǒ mā.","m":"My mum.","r":{"t":"妈妈们都一样！","p":"Māmamen dōu yíyàng!","m":"Mums are all the same!"}},{"t":"我自己。","p":"Wǒ zìjǐ.","m":"Me.","r":{"t":"你真能干。","p":"Nǐ zhēn nénggàn.","m":"How capable."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天又在单子上加了两个人。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān yòu zài dānzi shang jiā le liǎng gè rén.","m":"Mum added two more people to the list today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们这边圣诞节送礼物。","p":"Wǒmen zhèbiān Shèngdàn Jié sòng lǐwù.","m":"We give presents at Christmas here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边圣诞节送礼物","en":"Where you are, people give presents at Christmas"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你们那边圣诞节送礼物。这两天班上一个英国学生问我：「中国人圣诞节送什么？」我说：「苹果。因为平安夜的『平』跟苹果的『苹』一个音。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐmen nàbiān Shèngdàn Jié sòng lǐwù. Zhè liǎng tiān bān shang yí gè Yīngguó xuésheng wèn wǒ: “Zhōngguó rén Shèngdàn Jié sòng shénme?” Wǒ shuō: “Píngguǒ. Yīnwèi Píng'ān Yè de ‘píng’ gēn píngguǒ de ‘píng’ yí gè yīn.”","m":"You said people give presents at Christmas where you are. These days a British student asked me: “What do Chinese people give at Christmas?” I said: “Apples — because the 'ping' in Christmas Eve, 平安夜, sounds like the 'ping' in apple.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你今年想收到什么礼物？","p":"Nǐ jīnnián xiǎng shōu dào shénme lǐwù?","m":"What would you like to get this year?"},"replies":[{"t":"一本好书。","p":"Yì běn hǎo shū.","m":"A good book.","r":{"t":"书最好！","p":"Shū zuì hǎo!","m":"Books are the best!"}},{"t":"什么都不要，在一起就好。","p":"Shénme dōu bú yào, zài yìqǐ jiù hǎo.","m":"Nothing — being together is enough.","r":{"t":"说得真好。","p":"Shuō de zhēn hǎo.","m":"Beautifully said."}}],"next":{"t":"今天学生送了我一个苹果，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān xuésheng sòng le wǒ yí gè píngguǒ, hāha.","m":"A student gave me an apple today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"春节一般送什么？","p":"Chūnjié yìbān sòng shénme?","m":"What do people usually give at Spring Festival?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过春节一般送什么（给长辈送吃的喝的，给小孩发红包）","en":"You asked what people give at Spring Festival (food and drink for elders, red envelopes for kids)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问春节一般送什么。这两天我妈已经让我去银行换新钱了，说晚了要排很长的队。发红包，一定要新钱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Chūnjié yìbān sòng shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā yǐjīng ràng wǒ qù yínháng huàn xīn qián le, shuō wǎn le yào pái hěn cháng de duì. Fā hóngbāo, yídìng yào xīn qián.","m":"Last time you asked what people give at Spring Festival. These days my mum's already sent me to the bank to change crisp new notes — she says leave it late and the queue's huge. Red envelopes have to have new notes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边过节的时候会给小孩钱吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān guòjié de shíhou huì gěi xiǎohái qián ma?","m":"Do people give kids money at holidays where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"会。","p":"Huì.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那小孩最喜欢过节了！","p":"Nà xiǎohái zuì xǐhuan guòjié le!","m":"Then kids must love the holidays!"}},{"t":"不会，送礼物。","p":"Bú huì, sòng lǐwù.","m":"No — presents.","r":{"t":"礼物也好，打开的时候最开心。","p":"Lǐwù yě hǎo, dǎkāi de shíhou zuì kāixīn.","m":"Presents are nice too — opening them is the best part."}}],"next":{"t":"新钱换好了，放在抽屉里了。","p":"Xīn qián huàn hǎo le, fàng zài chōuti lǐ le.","m":"New notes changed and tucked in a drawer."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"年底你会给学生送东西吗？","p":"Niándǐ nǐ huì gěi xuésheng sòng dōngxi ma?","m":"Will you give your students anything at the end of the year?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她年底会不会给学生送东西（写几张贺卡，再给每人一颗糖）","en":"You asked if she gives her students anything (a few cards and a sweet each)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我年底会不会给学生送东西。这两天我写贺卡，三十张，每张写一句他们这学期学会的话。给德国学生的那张，我写的是：「遛弯儿愉快！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ niándǐ huì bu huì gěi xuésheng sòng dōngxi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiě hèkǎ, sānshí zhāng, měi zhāng xiě yí jù tāmen zhè xuéqī xuéhuì de huà. Gěi Déguó xuésheng de nà zhāng, wǒ xiě de shì: “Liùwānr yúkuài!”","m":"Last time you asked if I give my students anything. These days I've been writing cards — thirty of them, each with a phrase they learned this term. On the German student's I wrote: “Happy strolling!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你写过贺卡吗？","p":"Nǐ xiěguo hèkǎ ma?","m":"Have you ever written greeting cards?"},"replies":[{"t":"写过，过节的时候。","p":"Xiěguo, guòjié de shíhou.","m":"Yes, at holidays.","r":{"t":"手写的最有心意。","p":"Shǒu xiě de zuì yǒu xīnyì.","m":"Handwritten ones mean the most."}},{"t":"很少写。","p":"Hěn shǎo xiě.","m":"Rarely.","r":{"t":"那今年试一张吧。","p":"Nà jīnnián shì yì zhāng ba.","m":"Then try one this year."}}],"next":{"t":"今天写完了最后一张贺卡。","p":"Jīntiān xiě wán le zuìhòu yì zhāng hèkǎ.","m":"Finished the last card today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"冬至，我回我妈家包饺子。","p":"Dōngzhì, wǒ huí wǒ mā jiā bāo jiǎozi.","m":"Winter solstice — I went to Mum's to make dumplings."},{"t":"这次我包的饺子，我妈只说了一句：「有进步。」","p":"Zhè cì wǒ bāo de jiǎozi, wǒ mā zhǐ shuō le yí jù: “Yǒu jìnbù.”","m":"This time Mum said just one thing about my dumplings: “Getting better.”"},{"t":"过了冬至，白天就一天比一天长了。","p":"Guò le Dōngzhì, báitiān jiù yì tiān bǐ yì tiān cháng le.","m":"After the solstice, every day gets a little longer."}],"replies":[{"t":"「有进步」！恭喜！","p":"“Yǒu jìnbù”! Gōngxǐ!","m":"'Getting better'! Congrats!","r":{"t":"哈哈，我妈的「有进步」，比一百分还难得。","p":"Hāha, wǒ mā de “yǒu jìnbù”, bǐ yìbǎi fēn hái nándé.","m":"Haha — Mum's 'getting better' is rarer than full marks."}},{"t":"白天要变长了，真好。","p":"Báitiān yào biàn cháng le, zhēn hǎo.","m":"The days are getting longer — lovely.","r":{"t":"对，最黑的时候过去了。","p":"Duì, zuì hēi de shíhou guòqù le.","m":"Yes — the darkest part is over."}}],"from":"2026-12-22"}},"2026-12-17|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-17","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在头疼送什么礼物。","p":"Wǒ yě zài tóuténg sòng shénme lǐwù.","m":"I'm stressing about presents too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也在头疼送什么礼物","en":"You're stressing about presents too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在头疼送什么礼物。这两天我想好了：给每个人写一张中文卡片，再加一盒饼干。梁阿姨说，卡片比饼干值钱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài tóuténg sòng shénme lǐwù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng hǎo le: gěi měi gè rén xiě yì zhāng Zhōngwén kǎpiàn, zài jiā yì hé bǐnggān. Liáng āyí shuō, kǎpiàn bǐ bǐnggān zhíqián.","m":"You said you're stressing about presents too. These days I made up my mind: a Chinese card for everyone, plus a box of biscuits. Auntie Liang says the card is worth more than the biscuits.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你送礼物喜欢送什么？","p":"Nǐ sòng lǐwù xǐhuan sòng shénme?","m":"What do you like to give as presents?"},"replies":[{"t":"吃的。","p":"Chī de.","m":"Food.","r":{"t":"吃的最安全！","p":"Chī de zuì ānquán!","m":"Food's the safest!"}},{"t":"自己做的东西。","p":"Zìjǐ zuò de dōngxi.","m":"Things I've made.","r":{"t":"自己做的最有心意。","p":"Zìjǐ zuò de zuì yǒu xīnyì.","m":"Home-made means the most."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写了三张中文卡片。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě le sān zhāng Zhōngwén kǎpiàn.","m":"Wrote three more Chinese cards today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们这边年底不送礼物。","p":"Wǒmen zhèbiān niándǐ bú sòng lǐwù.","m":"We don't give presents at the end of the year here."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边年底不送礼物","en":"People don't give presents at year's end where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边年底不送礼物，真轻松！这两天我在商店排队排了半个小时，我想：明年我也学你，只送卡片。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān niándǐ bú sòng lǐwù, zhēn qīngsōng! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài shāngdiàn páiduì pái le bàn gè xiǎoshí, wǒ xiǎng: míngnián wǒ yě xué nǐ, zhǐ sòng kǎpiàn.","m":"You said people don't give presents at year's end where you are — how relaxing! These days I queued half an hour in a shop and thought: next year I'll copy you and just send cards.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边什么时候会送礼物？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān shénme shíhou huì sòng lǐwù?","m":"When do people give presents where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"过节或者生日。","p":"Guòjié huòzhě shēngrì.","m":"Holidays or birthdays.","r":{"t":"那你也有头疼的时候，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ yě yǒu tóuténg de shíhou, hāha.","m":"Then you have your headache season too, haha."}},{"t":"不太送，送也很随便。","p":"Bú tài sòng, sòng yě hěn suíbiàn.","m":"Not much — and casually when we do.","r":{"t":"随便最好，没有压力。","p":"Suíbiàn zuì hǎo, méiyǒu yālì.","m":"Casual is best — no pressure."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在商店排队了。明年一定学你。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài shāngdiàn páiduì le. Míngnián yídìng xué nǐ.","m":"Queuing in a shop again today. Next year I'm copying you."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你要送给多少人？","p":"Nǐ yào sòng gěi duōshao rén?","m":"How many people do you have to buy for?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她要送给多少人（十二个，家里人、朋友，还有中文老师）","en":"You asked how many people she's buying for (twelve — family, friends and her Chinese teacher)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我要送给多少人。十二个。这两天我列了单子，用中文写的，写不出来的字就画个小图。中文老师那一行，我画了一个苹果，因为她说过最爱吃苹果。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yào sòng gěi duōshao rén. Shí'èr gè. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ liè le dānzi, yòng Zhōngwén xiě de, xiě bu chūlái de zì jiù huà gè xiǎo tú. Zhōngwén lǎoshī nà yì háng, wǒ huà le yí gè píngguǒ, yīnwèi tā shuōguo zuì ài chī píngguǒ.","m":"Last time you asked how many people I'm buying for. Twelve. These days I wrote the list in Chinese, drawing little pictures for characters I can't write. On my Chinese teacher's line I drew an apple, because she once said apples are her favourite.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会把要做的事写成单子吗？","p":"Nǐ huì bǎ yào zuò de shì xiě chéng dānzi ma?","m":"Do you write to-do lists?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，不写就忘。","p":"Huì, bù xiě jiù wàng.","m":"Yes — otherwise I forget.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"不会，都记在脑子里。","p":"Bú huì, dōu jì zài nǎozi lǐ.","m":"No — I keep it all in my head.","r":{"t":"你的记性真好。","p":"Nǐ de jìxing zhēn hǎo.","m":"What a memory."}}],"next":{"t":"单子上又划掉了两个名字。","p":"Dānzi shang yòu huá diào le liǎng gè míngzi.","m":"Crossed two more names off the list."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你一般送什么？","p":"Nǐ yìbān sòng shénme?","m":"What do you usually give?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她一般送什么（吃的最多，今年还想写中文卡片）","en":"You asked what she usually gives (mostly food — and Chinese cards this year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我一般送什么。今年给中文老师的卡片上，我写了：「谢谢你。我的中文的进步是你的功劳。」梁阿姨说「的」又太多了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yìbān sòng shénme. Jīnnián gěi Zhōngwén lǎoshī de kǎpiàn shang, wǒ xiě le: “Xièxie nǐ. Wǒ de Zhōngwén de jìnbù shì nǐ de gōngláo.” Liáng āyí shuō “de” yòu tài duō le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what I usually give. On my Chinese teacher's card this year I wrote: “Thank you. My Chinese's progress is your credit.” Auntie Liang says too many 的 again, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近有没有想谢谢的人？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn yǒu méiyǒu xiǎng xièxie de rén?","m":"Is there someone you'd like to thank lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我的老师。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ de lǎoshī.","m":"Yes — my teacher.","r":{"t":"那就写张卡片吧！","p":"Nà jiù xiě zhāng kǎpiàn ba!","m":"Then write them a card!"}},{"t":"有，我的家人。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ de jiārén.","m":"Yes — my family.","r":{"t":"家人最值得谢。","p":"Jiārén zuì zhíde xiè.","m":"Family deserve it most."}}],"next":{"t":"今天把卡片上的「的」去掉了一个，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān bǎ kǎpiàn shang de “de” qù diào le yí gè, hāha.","m":"Took one 的 off the card today, haha."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-17|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-17","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们这边过年也给小孩钱。","p":"Wǒmen zhèbiān guònián yě gěi xiǎohái qián.","m":"We give kids money at New Year here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边过年也给小孩钱","en":"Kids get money at New Year where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边过年也给小孩钱。这两天我在想：要是去了台湾，过年的时候我也会看到红包。准确地说，我很想知道台湾的小孩收到红包怎么说谢谢。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān guònián yě gěi xiǎohái qián. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng: yàoshi qù le Táiwān, guònián de shíhou wǒ yě huì kàn dào hóngbāo. Zhǔnquè de shuō, wǒ hěn xiǎng zhīdào Táiwān de xiǎohái shōu dào hóngbāo zěnme shuō xièxie.","m":"You said kids get money at New Year where you are too. These days I've been thinking: if I go to Taiwan, I'll see red envelopes at New Year. To be precise, I really want to know how Taiwanese kids say thank you for them.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候最喜欢过什么节？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou zuì xǐhuan guò shénme jié?","m":"What holiday did you love most as a kid?"},"replies":[{"t":"新年。","p":"Xīnnián.","m":"New Year.","r":{"t":"新年最热闹！","p":"Xīnnián zuì rènao!","m":"New Year's the liveliest!"}},{"t":"我的生日。","p":"Wǒ de shēngrì.","m":"My birthday.","r":{"t":"生日是只属于你的节日。","p":"Shēngrì shì zhǐ shǔyú nǐ de jiérì.","m":"A birthday is a holiday just for you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在查台湾过年的习惯。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài chá Táiwān guònián de xíguàn.","m":"Reading up on Taiwanese New Year customs again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我们这边送礼物，不给钱。","p":"Wǒmen zhèbiān sòng lǐwù, bù gěi qián.","m":"We give presents here, not money."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边送礼物，不给钱","en":"Where you are, people give presents, not money"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边送礼物，不给钱。这两天我问我弟弟们，要礼物还是要钱。两个人都说：「要钱！」准确地说，他们想自己去买零食。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān sòng lǐwù, bù gěi qián. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn wǒ dìdimen, yào lǐwù háishi yào qián. Liǎng gè rén dōu shuō: “Yào qián!” Zhǔnquè de shuō, tāmen xiǎng zìjǐ qù mǎi língshí.","m":"You said people give presents rather than money where you are. These days I asked my little brothers: presents or money? Both said: “Money!” To be precise, they want to buy their own snacks.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候，礼物和钱你更喜欢哪个？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou, lǐwù hé qián nǐ gèng xǐhuan nǎ gè?","m":"As a kid, did you prefer presents or money?"},"replies":[{"t":"礼物，有惊喜。","p":"Lǐwù, yǒu jīngxǐ.","m":"Presents — the surprise.","r":{"t":"对，打开的那一刻最开心。","p":"Duì, dǎkāi de nà yí kè zuì kāixīn.","m":"Right — the moment you open it is the best."}},{"t":"钱，可以自己买。","p":"Qián, kěyǐ zìjǐ mǎi.","m":"Money — I could buy my own.","r":{"t":"哈哈，跟我弟弟一样。","p":"Hāha, gēn wǒ dìdi yíyàng.","m":"Haha, just like my brothers."}}],"next":{"t":"弟弟们今天又说「要钱」，哈哈。","p":"Dìdimen jīntiān yòu shuō “yào qián”, hāha.","m":"My brothers said 'money!' again today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你说的是什么节？","p":"Nǐ shuō de shì shénme jié?","m":"Which festival do you mean?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她说的是什么节（开斋节和宰牲节，过节给小孩发新钱）","en":"You asked which festival she meant (Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Adha — kids get crisp new notes)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我说的是什么节。准确地说，是开斋节和宰牲节。这两天我跟一个中国游客解释了半天，最后她说：「哦，就像我们的春节！」我说：「差不多。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shuō de shì shénme jié. Zhǔnquè de shuō, shì Kāizhāi Jié hé Zǎishēng Jié. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn yí gè Zhōngguó yóukè jiěshì le bàntiān, zuìhòu tā shuō: “Ò, jiù xiàng wǒmen de Chūnjié!” Wǒ shuō: “Chàbuduō.”","m":"Last time you asked which festival I meant. To be precise, Eid al-Fitr and Eid al-Adha. These days I spent ages explaining it to a Chinese tourist, and in the end she said: “Oh, like our Spring Festival!” I said: “More or less.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边一年里最重要的节日是哪个？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān yì nián lǐ zuì zhòngyào de jiérì shì nǎ gè?","m":"What's the most important holiday of the year where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"新年。","p":"Xīnnián.","m":"New Year.","r":{"t":"新年到哪儿都很重要！","p":"Xīnnián dào nǎr dōu hěn zhòngyào!","m":"New Year matters everywhere!"}},{"t":"一个宗教节日。","p":"Yí gè zōngjiào jiérì.","m":"A religious festival.","r":{"t":"那一定很热闹。","p":"Nà yídìng hěn rènao.","m":"Then it must be lively."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又有游客问我开斋节的事。","p":"Jīntiān yòu yǒu yóukè wèn wǒ Kāizhāi Jié de shì.","m":"Another tourist asked me about Eid today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你小时候也收过吗？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou yě shōuguo ma?","m":"Did you get money as a kid too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她小时候有没有收过（收过，都拿去买零食了）","en":"You asked if she got money as a kid (yes — spent it all on snacks)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我小时候有没有收过。收过！这两天我妈又说起我七岁的时候：手里拿着新钱，笑得嘴都合不上，一出门就跑去买了糖。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ xiǎoshíhou yǒu méiyǒu shōuguo. Shōuguo! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ mā yòu shuō qǐ wǒ qī suì de shíhou: shǒu lǐ ná zhe xīn qián, xiào de zuǐ dōu hé bu shàng, yì chūmén jiù pǎo qù mǎi le táng.","m":"Last time you asked if I got money as a kid. I did! These days Mum was talking again about me at seven: new notes in my hand, grinning ear to ear, running straight out to buy sweets.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候收到钱，会怎么花？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou shōu dào qián, huì zěnme huā?","m":"As a kid, how did you spend money you were given?"},"replies":[{"t":"买零食。","p":"Mǎi língshí.","m":"Snacks.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"存起来。","p":"Cún qǐlái.","m":"I saved it.","r":{"t":"你从小就很会存钱。","p":"Nǐ cóngxiǎo jiù hěn huì cún qián.","m":"A saver from the start."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天又说起我七岁的样子，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān yòu shuō qǐ wǒ qī suì de yàngzi, hāha.","m":"Mum talked about seven-year-old me again today, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"演讲结束了！五分零三秒。","p":"Yǎnjiǎng jiéshù le! Wǔ fēn líng sān miǎo.","m":"The speech is done! Five minutes, three seconds."},{"t":"下面坐的都是学中文的学生，讲到烤玉米的大叔，大家都笑了。","p":"Xiàmiàn zuò de dōu shì xué Zhōngwén de xuésheng, jiǎng dào kǎo yùmǐ de dàshū, dàjiā dōu xiào le.","m":"The audience were all Chinese learners — when I got to the roast-corn man, everyone laughed."},{"t":"准确地说，我只说了两次「准确地说」。","p":"Zhǔnquè de shuō, wǒ zhǐ shuō le liǎng cì “zhǔnquè de shuō”.","m":"To be precise, I only said 'to be precise' twice."}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜！讲得真好。","p":"Gōngxǐ! Jiǎng de zhēn hǎo.","m":"Congrats! Well done.","r":{"t":"谢谢！我终于可以睡个好觉了。","p":"Xièxie! Wǒ zhōngyú kěyǐ shuì gè hǎo jiào le.","m":"Thanks! I can finally get a good night's sleep."}},{"t":"只说了两次，好厉害！","p":"Zhǐ shuō le liǎng cì, hǎo lìhai!","m":"Only twice — impressive!","r":{"t":"是啊，我练了一个星期。","p":"Shì a, wǒ liàn le yí gè xīngqī.","m":"Yes — a week of practice."}}],"from":"2026-12-20"}},"2026-12-17|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-17","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We do Secret Santa at work too.","p":"","m":"我们公司也抽签互送礼物。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们单位也抽秘密圣诞老人","en":"You do Secret Santa at work too"},"later":{"t":"You said you do Secret Santa at work too. Ours happened this week. Someone gave me a mug that says 'World's Okayest Journalist'. I suspect my editor. I love it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你们单位也抽秘密圣诞老人。我们这周交换了。有人送了我一个杯子，上面写着「全世界还行的记者」。我怀疑是主编。我很喜欢。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the best Secret Santa present you've ever got?","p":"","m":"你收到过最好的秘密圣诞老人礼物是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something funny.","p":"","m":"一个好笑的东西。","r":{"t":"The funny ones are the best.","p":"","m":"好笑的最好。"}},{"t":"I can't remember.","p":"","m":"记不得了。","r":{"t":"Then this year's will be the one.","p":"","m":"那今年的就是了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Drinking from my 'Okayest' mug today.","p":"","m":"今天用那个「还行」的杯子喝水。"}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"About the same as yours.","p":"","m":"跟你们差不多。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们的秘密圣诞老人限额跟他们差不多","en":"Your Secret Santa limit is about the same as theirs"},"later":{"t":"You said your limit's about the same as ours. Good. This week someone on my team went way over — a twenty-pound candle. Everyone noticed. Very awkward.","p":"","m":"你上次说你们的限额跟我们差不多。挺好。这周我们组有人超了很多——一根二十镑的蜡烛。大家都看出来了。很尴尬。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you stick to the limit?","p":"","m":"你会守限额吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Always.","p":"","m":"每次都守。","r":{"t":"A person of principle.","p":"","m":"有原则的人。"}},{"t":"I go a bit over sometimes.","p":"","m":"有时候会超一点。","r":{"t":"A bit is fine. Not twenty quid.","p":"","m":"超一点没事。别超到二十镑。"}}],"next":{"t":"The twenty-pound candle is still the talk of the office.","p":"","m":"那根二十镑的蜡烛还是办公室的话题。"}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"We don't have a limit.","p":"","m":"我们没有上限。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们的秘密圣诞老人没有限额","en":"Your Secret Santa has no limit"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't have a limit. Dangerous! This week I told my team, and they were horrified. My editor said: 'That's how friendships end.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你们没有限额。危险！这周我跟组里说了，大家都吓坏了。主编说：「友谊就是这么结束的。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever got a present that was too much?","p":"","m":"你收到过太贵重的礼物吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — it was awkward.","p":"","m":"有——很尴尬。","r":{"t":"Exactly why we have limits.","p":"","m":"所以我们才有限额。"}},{"t":"No, never.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Keep it that way.","p":"","m":"真好。保持下去。"}}],"next":{"t":"Ten-pound limit. Still the best rule.","p":"","m":"十镑限额。还是最好的规矩。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"We don't really give presents at the end of the year.","p":"","m":"我们这边年底不太送礼物。"},"mem":{"zh":"你们那边年底不怎么送礼物","en":"People don't really give presents at year's end where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't really give presents at the end of the year. Honestly, I'm a bit jealous. This week I queued twenty minutes for wrapping paper. Twenty minutes. For paper.","p":"","m":"你上次说你们那边年底不怎么送礼物。说实话，我有点羡慕。这周我为了买包装纸排了二十分钟队。二十分钟。为了纸。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When do people give presents where you are?","p":"","m":"你那边一般什么时候送礼物？"},"replies":[{"t":"At New Year.","p":"","m":"新年。","r":{"t":"Then your rush is still coming.","p":"","m":"那你们的忙季还没来。"}},{"t":"On birthdays, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多是生日。","r":{"t":"Much simpler. One person at a time.","p":"","m":"简单多了。一次一个人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still have bits of wrapping paper stuck to my sleeve.","p":"","m":"袖子上还粘着包装纸。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Who did you get?","p":"","m":"你抽到了谁？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他抽到了谁（主编，压力很大）","en":"You asked who he got (his editor — no pressure at all)"},"later":{"t":"You asked who I got. My editor. I gave her the nice notebook. She opened it, wrote 'Story ideas' on the first page — and gave me three. So really it was a present for me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我抽到了谁。主编。我送了她那本好看的笔记本。她打开，在第一页写上「选题」——然后给了我三个。所以其实是送给我的礼物。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is your boss easy to buy for?","p":"","m":"给你老板买礼物容易吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"No, very hard.","p":"","m":"不容易，很难。","r":{"t":"Same. A notebook is the safe choice.","p":"","m":"一样。笔记本最稳。"}},{"t":"I don't have a boss.","p":"","m":"我没有老板。","r":{"t":"Lucky. One less present.","p":"","m":"真好。少买一份礼物。"}}],"next":{"t":"Working on one of my editor's three ideas.","p":"","m":"在写主编给的三个题目之一。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What will you buy?","p":"","m":"你会买什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他打算买什么（大概是一本好笔记本，安全又实用）","en":"You asked what he'd buy (probably a nice notebook — safe and useful)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I'd buy. A nice notebook, I said. I did — dark green, like my raincoat. My flatmate says I have a 'brand' now.","p":"","m":"你上次问我打算买什么。我说一本好笔记本。我真买了——深绿色的，跟我的雨衣一样。室友说我现在有「个人品牌」了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a favourite colour for your things?","p":"","m":"你买东西有最喜欢的颜色吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always the same.","p":"","m":"有，总是同一个。","r":{"t":"Then you have a brand too.","p":"","m":"那你也有自己的「品牌」了。"}},{"t":"No, it changes.","p":"","m":"没有，常变。","r":{"t":"More fun that way.","p":"","m":"那样更好玩。"}}],"next":{"t":"Everything I own is dark green now, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，我的东西现在全是深绿色了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-18|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-18","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也在看一本中文小说。","p":"Wǒ yě zài kàn yì běn Zhōngwén xiǎoshuō.","m":"I'm reading a Chinese novel too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也在看一本中文小说","en":"You're reading a Chinese novel too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也在看一本中文小说！这两天我们俩都加油了吧：我看了二十五页，还剩五十五页。我猜你比我快。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě zài kàn yì běn Zhōngwén xiǎoshuō! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒmen liǎ dōu jiāyóu le ba: wǒ kàn le èrshíwǔ yè, hái shèng wǔshíwǔ yè. Wǒ cāi nǐ bǐ wǒ kuài.","m":"You said you're reading a Chinese novel too! I hope we've both kept at it these days: I read twenty-five pages, fifty-five to go. I bet you're faster than me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看中文书的时候，会查字典吗？","p":"Nǐ kàn Zhōngwén shū de shíhou, huì chá zìdiǎn ma?","m":"Do you look things up when you read in Chinese?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每个不懂的都查。","p":"Huì, měi gè bù dǒng de dōu chá.","m":"Yes — every word I don't know.","r":{"t":"你好认真！我只查最重要的。","p":"Nǐ hǎo rènzhēn! Wǒ zhǐ chá zuì zhòngyào de.","m":"So diligent! I only look up the important ones."}},{"t":"不查，猜意思。","p":"Bù chá, cāi yìsi.","m":"No — I guess.","r":{"t":"对对对，猜也是一种本事。","p":"Duì duì duì, cāi yě shì yì zhǒng běnshi.","m":"Yes yes yes — guessing is a skill too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了五页，还剩五十页。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le wǔ yè, hái shèng wǔshí yè.","m":"Five more pages today — fifty to go."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"一本很简单的，给学中文的人写的。","p":"Yì běn hěn jiǎndān de, gěi xué Zhōngwén de rén xiě de.","m":"A really easy one, written for Chinese learners."},"mem":{"zh":"你在看一本给学中文的人写的简单小说","en":"You're reading a simple novel written for Chinese learners"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你在看一本给学中文的人写的书。这两天我也买了一本这样的，一个晚上就看完了！那种「我都看得懂」的感觉，真好。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zài kàn yì běn gěi xué Zhōngwén de rén xiě de shū. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě mǎi le yì běn zhèyàng de, yí gè wǎnshang jiù kàn wán le! Nà zhǒng “wǒ dōu kàn de dǒng” de gǎnjué, zhēn hǎo.","m":"You said you're reading a book written for Chinese learners. These days I bought one too and finished it in one evening! That 'I understand all of it' feeling is wonderful.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你看完一本书的时候，是什么感觉？","p":"Nǐ kàn wán yì běn shū de shíhou, shì shénme gǎnjué?","m":"How do you feel when you finish a book?"},"replies":[{"t":"很开心，很有成就感。","p":"Hěn kāixīn, hěn yǒu chéngjiù gǎn.","m":"Happy — a real sense of achievement.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个感觉！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège gǎnjué!","m":"Yes yes yes, that's the feeling!"}},{"t":"有点舍不得。","p":"Yǒudiǎn shěbude.","m":"A bit sad it's over.","r":{"t":"我也是，好书看完就想再看一遍。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, hǎo shū kàn wán jiù xiǎng zài kàn yí biàn.","m":"Me too — a good book makes you want to start again."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又开始看第二本简单的了。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kāishǐ kàn dì èr běn jiǎndān de le.","m":"Started a second easy reader today."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我还没看完第一章。","p":"Wǒ hái méi kàn wán dì-yī zhāng.","m":"I haven't finished the first chapter yet."},"mem":{"zh":"你还没看完第一章","en":"You haven't finished the first chapter yet"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你还没看完第一章。没关系！跟你说：我那本小说，第一章看了两个星期。这两天我翻回去看第一章，好像在看另一本书——都看懂了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hái méi kàn wán dì yī zhāng. Méi guānxi! Gēn nǐ shuō: wǒ nà běn xiǎoshuō, dì yī zhāng kàn le liǎng gè xīngqī. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fān huíqù kàn dì yī zhāng, hǎoxiàng zài kàn lìng yì běn shū —— dōu kàn dǒng le.","m":"You said you haven't finished the first chapter yet. No problem! Here's a secret: my first chapter took two weeks. These days I flipped back to it, and it was like reading a different book — I understood everything.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一天能看多少？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān néng kàn duōshao?","m":"How much do you read a day?"},"replies":[{"t":"一两页。","p":"Yì liǎng yè.","m":"A page or two.","r":{"t":"一两页就很好！每天看最重要。","p":"Yì liǎng yè jiù hěn hǎo! Měi tiān kàn zuì zhòngyào.","m":"That's great! Every day is what counts."}},{"t":"看心情。","p":"Kàn xīnqíng.","m":"Depends on my mood.","r":{"t":"对，心情好的时候看得最多。","p":"Duì, xīnqíng hǎo de shíhou kàn de zuì duō.","m":"Right — you read most when you're in the mood."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又看了一页，慢慢来。","p":"Jīntiān yòu kàn le yí yè, mànmàn lái.","m":"Another page today — slowly does it."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还看不了中文书。","p":"Wǒ hái kàn bu liǎo Zhōngwén shū.","m":"I can't read Chinese books yet."},"mem":{"zh":"你还看不了中文书","en":"You can't read Chinese books yet"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你还看不了中文书。我刚开始也是。这两天我想起来，我在成都看懂的第一本书，是一本给小孩的绘本，只有二十页。我到现在还留着。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hái kàn bu liǎo Zhōngwén shū. Wǒ gāng kāishǐ yě shì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiǎng qǐlái, wǒ zài Chéngdū kàn dǒng de dì yī běn shū, shì yì běn gěi xiǎohái de huìběn, zhǐ yǒu èrshí yè. Wǒ dào xiànzài hái liú zhe.","m":"You said you can't read Chinese books yet. Neither could I at first. These days I remembered that the first book I understood in Chengdu was a children's picture book, only twenty pages. I still have it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"在你学的语言里，你看过什么？","p":"Zài nǐ xué de yǔyán lǐ, nǐ kànguo shénme?","m":"What have you read in the language you're learning?"},"replies":[{"t":"一些短文章。","p":"Yìxiē duǎn wénzhāng.","m":"Some short articles.","r":{"t":"短文章最好，慢慢就长了。","p":"Duǎn wénzhāng zuì hǎo, mànmàn jiù cháng le.","m":"Short pieces are perfect — they'll get longer."}},{"t":"还只看过单词。","p":"Hái zhǐ kànguo dāncí.","m":"Just words so far.","r":{"t":"单词也是开始！一个一个来。","p":"Dāncí yě shì kāishǐ! Yí gè yí gè lái.","m":"Words are a start! One at a time."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又翻了翻那本小绘本。","p":"Jīntiān yòu fān le fān nà běn xiǎo huìběn.","m":"Leafed through that little picture book again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"是什么小说？","p":"Shì shénme xiǎoshuō?","m":"What novel is it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他看的是什么小说（讲成都一家茶馆的故事）","en":"You asked what the novel is (a story about a Chengdu teahouse)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在看什么小说。讲成都一家茶馆的。这两天我看到一段：老板每天早上五点开门，第一壶茶泡给自己。我也想这样过一天。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài kàn shénme xiǎoshuō. Jiǎng Chéngdū yì jiā cháguǎn de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ kàn dào yí duàn: lǎobǎn měi tiān zǎoshang wǔ diǎn kāi mén, dì yī hú chá pào gěi zìjǐ. Wǒ yě xiǎng zhèyàng guò yì tiān.","m":"Last time you asked what the novel is. It's about a teahouse in Chengdu. These days I read a passage where the owner opens at five every morning and makes the first pot of tea for himself. I'd love to live a day like that.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一天里最喜欢的是哪一刻？","p":"Nǐ yì tiān lǐ zuì xǐhuan de shì nǎ yí kè?","m":"What's your favourite moment of the day?"},"replies":[{"t":"早上第一杯茶或者咖啡。","p":"Zǎoshang dì yī bēi chá huòzhě kāfēi.","m":"The first tea or coffee of the morning.","r":{"t":"对对对，就是这个！","p":"Duì duì duì, jiù shì zhège!","m":"Yes yes yes, exactly!"}},{"t":"晚上睡觉前。","p":"Wǎnshang shuìjiào qián.","m":"Just before bed.","r":{"t":"那一刻最安静。","p":"Nà yí kè zuì ānjìng.","m":"That's the quietest moment."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上第一杯茶，泡给自己。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang dì yī bēi chá, pào gěi zìjǐ.","m":"First tea this morning — made just for me."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"还有八十页，能看完吗？","p":"Hái yǒu bāshí yè, néng kàn wán ma?","m":"Eighty pages left — will you finish?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他还剩八十页能不能看完（一天看五页，应该能）","en":"You asked if he'll finish the last eighty pages (five a day — should do)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我八十页能不能看完。这两天我发现一个问题：周末我女儿天天要我陪她玩，我一天只看了两页。可能要到一月了，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ bāshí yè néng bu néng kàn wán. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn yí gè wèntí: zhōumò wǒ nǚ'ér tiāntiān yào wǒ péi tā wán, wǒ yì tiān zhǐ kàn le liǎng yè. Kěnéng yào dào yī yuè le, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd finish the last eighty pages. These days I hit a problem: at the weekend my daughter wanted me to play with her all day, so I only managed two pages a day. Might be January, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你给自己定的事情，一般能完成吗？","p":"Nǐ gěi zìjǐ dìng de shìqing, yìbān néng wánchéng ma?","m":"Do you usually finish the goals you set yourself?"},"replies":[{"t":"一般能。","p":"Yìbān néng.","m":"Usually.","r":{"t":"厉害！我常常要多给自己一点时间。","p":"Lìhai! Wǒ chángcháng yào duō gěi zìjǐ yìdiǎn shíjiān.","m":"Impressive! I often need a bit more time."}},{"t":"常常完不成。","p":"Chángcháng wán bu chéng.","m":"Often not.","r":{"t":"没关系，慢一点也是在往前走。","p":"Méi guānxi, màn yìdiǎn yě shì zài wǎng qián zǒu.","m":"That's fine — slow is still forward."}}],"next":{"t":"今天陪女儿玩了一天，小说只看了一页。","p":"Jīntiān péi nǚ'ér wán le yì tiān, xiǎoshuō zhǐ kàn le yí yè.","m":"Played with my daughter all day — only one page of the novel."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"学校放寒假了！我的第一件事：带女儿去法拉盛吃面。","p":"Xuéxiào fàng hánjià le! Wǒ de dì yī jiàn shì: dài nǚ'ér qù Fǎlāshèng chī miàn.","m":"School's out for winter break! First thing: taking my daughter to Flushing for noodles."},{"t":"老板娘看到她，也喊了一声「老样子？」我女儿说：「对！」","p":"Lǎobǎnniáng kàn dào tā, yě hǎn le yì shēng “lǎoyàngzi?” Wǒ nǚ'ér shuō: “Duì!”","m":"When the owner saw her, she called out “The usual?” too. My daughter said: “Yes!”"},{"t":"她才四岁，就有「老样子」了。","p":"Tā cái sì suì, jiù yǒu “lǎoyàngzi” le.","m":"She's only four and she already has a 'usual'."}],"replies":[{"t":"你女儿太可爱了！","p":"Nǐ nǚ'ér tài kě'ài le!","m":"Your daughter's adorable!","r":{"t":"对对对，她的中文比我爸的还好，哈哈。","p":"Duì duì duì, tā de Zhōngwén bǐ wǒ bà de hái hǎo, hāha.","m":"Yes yes yes — her Chinese is better than my dad's, haha."}},{"t":"一家三代都会说「老样子」了。","p":"Yì jiā sān dài dōu huì shuō “lǎoyàngzi” le.","m":"Three generations who can say 老样子 now.","r":{"t":"就是这个！这句我要记下来。","p":"Jiù shì zhège! Zhè jù wǒ yào jì xiàlái.","m":"Exactly! I'm writing that down."}}],"from":"2026-12-24"}},"2026-12-18|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-18","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也要考 HSK 了！","p":"Wǒ yě yào kǎo HSK le!","m":"I've got HSK coming up too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你也要考 HSK","en":"You're taking the HSK too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也要考 HSK！这两天我把听力题做了三遍。Mochi 现在一听到录音就跑开，哈哈。我们一起加油！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yào kǎo HSK! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ tīnglì tí zuò le sān biàn. Mochi xiànzài yì tīng dào lùyīn jiù pǎo kāi, hāha. Wǒmen yìqǐ jiāyóu!","m":"You said you're taking the HSK too! These days I did the listening questions three times. Now Mochi runs off as soon as she hears the recording, haha. Let's both do our best!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你复习的时候最喜欢用什么办法？","p":"Nǐ fùxí de shíhou zuì xǐhuan yòng shénme bànfǎ?","m":"What's your favourite way to revise?"},"replies":[{"t":"做题。","p":"Zuò tí.","m":"Practice questions.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"听录音。","p":"Tīng lùyīn.","m":"Listening to recordings.","r":{"t":"听力最重要！","p":"Tīnglì zuì zhòngyào!","m":"Listening matters most!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又做了一套听力题。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zuò le yí tào tīnglì tí.","m":"Did another listening set today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我从来没考过 HSK。","p":"Wǒ cónglái méi kǎoguo HSK.","m":"I've never taken HSK."},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没考过 HSK","en":"You've never taken the HSK"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你从来没考过 HSK。你说得对，能聊天最重要。这两天我跟语伴说，就算考不过，我也已经能跟她聊天了。她说：「对，这个最重要。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ cónglái méi kǎoguo HSK. Nǐ shuō de duì, néng liáotiān zuì zhòngyào. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn yǔbàn shuō, jiùsuàn kǎo bu guò, wǒ yě yǐjīng néng gēn tā liáotiān le. Tā shuō: “Duì, zhège zuì zhòngyào.”","m":"You said you've never taken the HSK. You're right — being able to chat is what matters. These days I told my language partner that even if I fail, I can already chat with her. She said: “Right, that's the most important thing.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学语言最想做到的是什么？","p":"Nǐ xué yǔyán zuì xiǎng zuò dào de shì shénme?","m":"What do you most want to be able to do in a language?"},"replies":[{"t":"能跟别人聊天。","p":"Néng gēn biérén liáotiān.","m":"Chat with people.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"能看懂电影。","p":"Néng kàn dǒng diànyǐng.","m":"Understand films.","r":{"t":"我也想！不看字幕看剧。","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng! Bú kàn zìmù kàn jù.","m":"Me too! Shows without subtitles."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又用中文聊了半个小时。","p":"Jīntiān yòu yòng Zhōngwén liáo le bàn gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Chatted in Chinese for half an hour again today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你紧张吗？","p":"Nǐ jǐnzhāng ma?","m":"Are you nervous?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她紧不紧张（有一点，听力最难）","en":"You asked if she's nervous (a bit — listening is hardest)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我紧不紧张。有一点。这两天外婆给了我一个办法：考试前吃一块巧克力，她说「脑子会变甜」。我不知道有没有用，可是我会吃。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ jǐn bu jǐnzhāng. Yǒu yìdiǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wàipó gěi le wǒ yí gè bànfǎ: kǎoshì qián chī yí kuài qiǎokèlì, tā shuō “nǎozi huì biàn tián”. Wǒ bù zhīdào yǒu méiyǒu yòng, kěshì wǒ huì chī.","m":"Last time you asked if I'm nervous. A bit. These days Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us) gave me a tip: eat a piece of chocolate before the exam — she says “your brain goes sweet”. I don't know if it works, but I'll eat it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你考试前会做什么让自己不紧张？","p":"Nǐ kǎoshì qián huì zuò shénme ràng zìjǐ bù jǐnzhāng?","m":"What do you do before an exam to calm down?"},"replies":[{"t":"深呼吸。","p":"Shēn hūxī.","m":"Deep breaths.","r":{"t":"好办法！我也试试。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ! Wǒ yě shìshi.","m":"Good idea! I'll try that."}},{"t":"早点睡觉。","p":"Zǎo diǎn shuìjiào.","m":"Go to bed early.","r":{"t":"对，睡好最重要。","p":"Duì, shuì hǎo zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Right — sleep matters most."}}],"next":{"t":"今天买了考试那天要吃的巧克力。","p":"Jīntiān mǎi le kǎoshì nà tiān yào chī de qiǎokèlì.","m":"Bought the chocolate for exam day today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你每天练多久？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān liàn duō jiǔ?","m":"How long do you practise each day?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她每天练多久（一个小时，坐公交的时候也在听）","en":"You asked how long she practises a day (an hour — plus listening on the bus)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我每天练多久。一个小时。这两天在公交车上听听力，太认真了，坐过了两站！只好走回去。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ měi tiān liàn duō jiǔ. Yí gè xiǎoshí. Zhè liǎng tiān zài gōngjiāochē shang tīng tīnglì, tài rènzhēn le, zuò guò le liǎng zhàn! Zhǐ hǎo zǒu huíqù.","m":"Last time you asked how long I practise a day. An hour. These days I was so focused on listening practice on the bus that I missed my stop by two! Had to walk back.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有因为太认真，忘了别的事？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yīnwèi tài rènzhēn, wàng le bié de shì?","m":"Have you ever been so focused you forgot something else?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，忘了吃饭。","p":"Yǒu, wàng le chī fàn.","m":"Yes — forgot to eat.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Haha, same as me!"}},{"t":"没有。","p":"Méiyǒu.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"你很会安排时间。","p":"Nǐ hěn huì ānpái shíjiān.","m":"You manage your time well."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在公交车上听听力，没坐过站！","p":"Jīntiān zài gōngjiāochē shang tīng tīnglì, méi zuò guò zhàn!","m":"Listening practice on the bus today — didn't miss my stop!"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-18|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-18","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也喜欢寄明信片。","p":"Wǒ yě xǐhuan jì míngxìnpiàn.","m":"I love sending postcards too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也喜欢寄明信片","en":"You like sending postcards too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也喜欢寄明信片。这两天我在邮局排队，前面一个老先生也在寄，一共四十张！他说他每年都给朋友寄，寄了五十年。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě xǐhuan jì míngxìnpiàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài yóujú páiduì, qiánmiàn yí gè lǎo xiānsheng yě zài jì, yígòng sìshí zhāng! Tā shuō tā měi nián dōu gěi péngyou jì, jì le wǔshí nián.","m":"You said you like sending postcards too. These days in the post office queue, an old gentleman ahead of me was sending forty! He says he's sent them to friends every year for fifty years.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近一次收到明信片是什么时候？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn yí cì shōu dào míngxìnpiàn shì shénme shíhou?","m":"When did you last get a postcard?"},"replies":[{"t":"很久以前了。","p":"Hěn jiǔ yǐqián le.","m":"Ages ago.","r":{"t":"那你一定很想再收到一张。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng hěn xiǎng zài shōu dào yì zhāng.","m":"Then you must want another one."}},{"t":"最近刚收到一张。","p":"Zuìjìn gāng shōu dào yì zhāng.","m":"I just got one.","r":{"t":"真好！收到的那天最开心。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Shōu dào de nà tiān zuì kāixīn.","m":"Lovely! The day it arrives is the best."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写了五张明信片。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě le wǔ zhāng míngxìnpiàn.","m":"Wrote five more postcards today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我很多年没寄过明信片了。","p":"Wǒ hěn duō nián méi jìguo míngxìnpiàn le.","m":"I haven't sent a postcard in years."},"mem":{"zh":"你很多年没寄过明信片了","en":"You haven't sent a postcard in years"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你很多年没寄过明信片了。这两天我写到第十五张，突然想：要是能寄一张给你就好了。我写了一张「给一个在别的城市学中文的朋友」，夹在了我的本子里。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hěn duō nián méi jìguo míngxìnpiàn le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ xiě dào dì shíwǔ zhāng, tūrán xiǎng: yàoshi néng jì yì zhāng gěi nǐ jiù hǎo le. Wǒ xiě le yì zhāng “gěi yí gè zài bié de chéngshì xué Zhōngwén de péngyou”, jiā zài le wǒ de běnzi lǐ.","m":"You said you haven't sent a postcard in years. These days, on my fifteenth, I thought: I wish I could send one to you. I wrote one 'to a friend learning Chinese in another city' and tucked it in my notebook.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是你寄一张，你会寄给谁？","p":"Yàoshi nǐ jì yì zhāng, nǐ huì jì gěi shéi?","m":"If you sent one, who would it go to?"},"replies":[{"t":"寄给我的家人。","p":"Jì gěi wǒ de jiārén.","m":"My family.","r":{"t":"家人收到一定很开心。","p":"Jiārén shōu dào yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"They'd be so happy."}},{"t":"寄给一个老朋友。","p":"Jì gěi yí gè lǎo péngyou.","m":"An old friend.","r":{"t":"老朋友看到你的字，一定会笑。","p":"Lǎo péngyou kàn dào nǐ de zì, yídìng huì xiào.","m":"An old friend would smile at your handwriting."}}],"next":{"t":"那张给你的明信片，还在我的本子里。","p":"Nà zhāng gěi nǐ de míngxìnpiàn, hái zài wǒ de běnzi lǐ.","m":"That postcard for you is still in my notebook."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你要寄多少张？","p":"Nǐ yào jì duōshao zhāng?","m":"How many do you have to send?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她要寄多少张（二十三张，已经写了十张）","en":"You asked how many she's sending (twenty-three — ten written so far)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我要寄多少张。二十三张。这两天写完了，最后一张是给河内那个带我去问路的阿姨的。我不知道她会不会收到，可是我写了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ yào jì duōshao zhāng. Èrshísān zhāng. Zhè liǎng tiān xiě wán le, zuìhòu yì zhāng shì gěi Hénèi nà gè dài wǒ qù wèn lù de āyí de. Wǒ bù zhīdào tā huì bu huì shōu dào, kěshì wǒ xiě le.","m":"Last time you asked how many I'm sending. Twenty-three. These days I finished — the last one's for the lady in Hanoi who walked me to ask for directions. I don't know if she'll get it, but I wrote it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一个只见过一次、可是一直记得的人？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí gè zhǐ jiànguo yí cì, kěshì yìzhí jìde de rén?","m":"Is there someone you met only once but never forgot?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那个人一定很特别。","p":"Nà gè rén yídìng hěn tèbié.","m":"They must be special."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"I can't think of one.","r":{"t":"也许下次出门就会碰到一个。","p":"Yěxǔ xià cì chūmén jiù huì pèng dào yí gè.","m":"Maybe you'll meet one next time you're out."}}],"next":{"t":"二十三张明信片都寄出去了。","p":"Èrshísān zhāng míngxìnpiàn dōu jì chūqù le.","m":"All twenty-three postcards are in the post."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在明信片上写什么？","p":"Nǐ zài míngxìnpiàn shang xiě shénme?","m":"What do you write on them?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在明信片上写什么（在哪儿认识的，还有一句「下次见」）","en":"You asked what she writes (where they met, and 'see you next time')"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在明信片上写什么。这两天我给青旅那个意大利人写了一张：「番茄炒蛋要放糖。下次见。」他看到一定会笑。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài míngxìnpiàn shang xiě shénme. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gěi qīnglǚ nà gè Yìdàlì rén xiě le yì zhāng: “Fānqié chǎo dàn yào fàng táng. Xià cì jiàn.” Tā kàn dào yídìng huì xiào.","m":"Last time you asked what I write on the postcards. These days I wrote one to the Italian guy from the hostel: “Tomato and egg needs sugar. See you next time.” He'll laugh when he reads it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你写卡片的时候，喜欢写长的还是短的？","p":"Nǐ xiě kǎpiàn de shíhou, xǐhuan xiě cháng de háishi duǎn de?","m":"When you write a card, long or short?"},"replies":[{"t":"长的，有很多话想说。","p":"Cháng de, yǒu hěn duō huà xiǎng shuō.","m":"Long — I have lots to say.","r":{"t":"长的好，读的人很开心。","p":"Cháng de hǎo, dú de rén hěn kāixīn.","m":"Long is lovely — the reader's delighted."}},{"t":"短的，一两句就够了。","p":"Duǎn de, yì liǎng jù jiù gòu le.","m":"Short — a line or two.","r":{"t":"对，短的也很有心意。","p":"Duì, duǎn de yě hěn yǒu xīnyì.","m":"Right — short still means a lot."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在一张明信片上写了「下次见」。","p":"Jīntiān zài yì zhāng míngxìnpiàn shang xiě le “xià cì jiàn”.","m":"Wrote 'see you next time' on a postcard today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-18|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-18","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm reading an English book too.","p":"","m":"我也在看一本英文书。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也在看一本英文书","en":"You're reading an English book too"},"later":{"t":"You said you're reading an English book too. Let's race! This week I got to page seventy. The detective just found a clue in a coffee cup — so now I check every cup, haha.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也在看一本英文书。我们比赛吧！这周我看到了第七十页。侦探刚在一个咖啡杯里发现了线索——所以现在我每个杯子都要看看，哈哈。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you read every day?","p":"","m":"你每天都看书吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a bit every day.","p":"","m":"是，每天看一点。","r":{"t":"Good. A bit every day wins.","p":"","m":"好。每天一点最管用。"}},{"t":"When I have time.","p":"","m":"有时间才看。","r":{"t":"Fair. Weekends are good for it.","p":"","m":"有道理。周末很适合。"}}],"next":{"t":"Page eighty today. The detective's close.","p":"","m":"今天看到第八十页。侦探快破案了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I can't read whole English books yet.","p":"","m":"我还看不了整本英文书。"},"mem":{"zh":"你还看不了整本英文书","en":"You can't read whole English books yet"},"later":{"t":"You said you can't read whole English books yet. Me neither, until this year. My trick: read the same page twice — once for the story, once for the new words. Slow, but honestly, it works.","p":"","m":"你上次说你还看不了整本英文书。我今年之前也看不了。我的办法：同一页读两遍——一遍看故事，一遍看生词。很慢，可是说实话，真的有用。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you read in the language you're learning?","p":"","m":"你在学的语言，你会读些什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Short articles.","p":"","m":"短文章。","r":{"t":"Perfect. Short is how you start.","p":"","m":"完美。从短的开始。"}},{"t":"Mostly social media.","p":"","m":"大多是社交媒体。","r":{"t":"That counts! Real English, real people.","p":"","m":"那也算！真实的英语，真实的人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Read one page twice again today.","p":"","m":"今天又把一页读了两遍。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's the book?","p":"","m":"是什么书？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他看的是什么书（一本侦探小说，英文简单，转折很多）","en":"You asked what the book is (a detective story — easy English, lots of twists)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what the book is. A detective story. This week I tried to guess who did it. I was wrong. Twice. Honestly, the writer is too clever for me.","p":"","m":"你上次问我看的是什么书。一本侦探小说。这周我试着猜凶手是谁。猜错了。两次。说实话，作者太聪明了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like stories with a mystery?","p":"","m":"你喜欢有悬念的故事吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I love guessing.","p":"","m":"喜欢，我爱猜。","r":{"t":"Then you'd beat me at this book.","p":"","m":"那这本书你肯定比我猜得准。"}},{"t":"No, I like simple stories.","p":"","m":"不，我喜欢简单的故事。","r":{"t":"Fair. Simple can be beautiful.","p":"","m":"有道理。简单也可以很美。"}}],"next":{"t":"Wrong guess number three today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天第三次猜错了，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How many pages are there?","p":"","m":"有多少页？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那本书有多少页（两百页，他看到第四十页）","en":"You asked how many pages (two hundred — he's on page forty)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how many pages. Two hundred. This week I did the maths: twelve pages a day to finish by New Year. So I read on the subway, at the laundromat, and once while waiting for my coffee.","p":"","m":"你上次问那本书有多少页。两百页。这周我算了一下：一天十二页，新年前就能看完。所以我在地铁上看，在洗衣房看，有一次排队等咖啡也在看。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you set yourself small goals like that?","p":"","m":"你会给自己定这样的小目标吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it helps me.","p":"","m":"会，对我有帮助。","r":{"t":"Same. Small numbers, big results.","p":"","m":"一样。小数字，大结果。"}},{"t":"No, I go with the flow.","p":"","m":"不会，我顺其自然。","r":{"t":"Also a good way. Less pressure.","p":"","m":"也是好办法。压力小。"}}],"next":{"t":"Twelve pages done today.","p":"","m":"今天读完了十二页。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"I finished my first English book! Two hundred pages.","p":"","m":"我读完了第一本英文书！两百页。"},{"t":"The detective was the coffee shop owner. I never guessed. Honestly, I'm a bit angry.","p":"","m":"凶手是咖啡店老板。我从来没猜到。说实话，我有点生气。"},{"t":"Next book: Jess lent me one. 'Easier,' she said. We'll see.","p":"","m":"下一本：Jess 借了我一本。她说「更简单」。走着瞧。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Congratulations! A whole book!","p":"","m":"恭喜！一整本书！","r":{"t":"Thanks! Honestly, I want to tell everyone.","p":"","m":"谢谢！说实话，我想告诉所有人。"}},{"t":"The coffee shop owner! No way.","p":"","m":"咖啡店老板！不会吧。","r":{"t":"Right? Now I look at my coffee cart guy differently, haha.","p":"","m":"对吧？现在我看咖啡车大哥的眼神都变了，哈哈。"}}],"from":"2026-12-27"}},"2026-12-18|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-18","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I need to fix my bike too.","p":"","m":"我也得修自行车了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你也得修自行车","en":"You need to fix your bike too"},"later":{"t":"You said you need to fix your bike too. I did mine this week — new brake pads, new light. It took two hours and a YouTube video. My husband just watched and made coffee.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也得修自行车。我这周修好了——换了刹车片，换了灯。花了两个小时，看了一个 YouTube 视频。我老公就在旁边看着，煮咖啡。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you fix things yourself?","p":"","m":"东西坏了你自己修吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I try.","p":"","m":"会，我试试。","r":{"t":"Good for you. It feels great after.","p":"","m":"真好。修好以后感觉很棒。"}},{"t":"No, I take them to a shop.","p":"","m":"不会，拿去店里。","r":{"t":"Also smart. Faster, to be fair.","p":"","m":"也聪明。说实话，更快。"}}],"next":{"t":"Light works, brakes quiet. Ready for snow.","p":"","m":"灯亮了，刹车不响了。可以迎接雪了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have a bike.","p":"","m":"我没有自行车。"},"mem":{"zh":"你没有自行车","en":"You don't have a bike"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't have a bike. You'd need one here! This week I counted the bikes outside my school: one hundred and twelve. And three teachers walked.","p":"","m":"你上次说你没有自行车。在这儿你会需要一辆的！这周我数了学校门口的自行车：一百一十二辆。还有三个老师是走路来的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do most people get around where you live?","p":"","m":"你那边大多数人怎么出门？"},"replies":[{"t":"By car.","p":"","m":"开车。","r":{"t":"Very different from here, ja.","p":"","m":"跟这儿很不一样。"}},{"t":"By bus or train.","p":"","m":"坐公交或者火车。","r":{"t":"Good. Public transport is lagom.","p":"","m":"好。公共交通刚刚好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Counted bikes again. One hundred and fifteen.","p":"","m":"又数了自行车。一百一十五辆。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's wrong with it?","p":"","m":"车怎么了？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她的车哪儿坏了（刹车吱吱响，灯不亮）","en":"You asked what's wrong with it (squeaky brakes, broken light)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what's wrong with it. Squeaky brakes, broken light. This week I fixed the light — then realised the squeak was my basket, not the brakes. To be fair, I'd never have guessed.","p":"","m":"你上次问我的车哪儿坏了。刹车吱吱响，灯不亮。这周我修好了灯——然后发现吱吱响的是车筐，不是刹车。说实话，我永远猜不到。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever fixed the wrong thing?","p":"","m":"你有没有修错过东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, more than once.","p":"","m":"有，不止一次。","r":{"t":"Then we're in the same club.","p":"","m":"那我们是一个俱乐部的。"}},{"t":"No, I check first.","p":"","m":"没有，我会先检查。","r":{"t":"Wise. I should learn that.","p":"","m":"明智。我该学学。"}}],"next":{"t":"No more squeak. It was the basket all along.","p":"","m":"不响了。原来一直是车筐。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Can you fix it yourself?","p":"","m":"你自己能修吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她能不能自己修（先试，不行再去店里）","en":"You asked if she can fix it herself (she'll try, then go to the shop)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I can fix it myself. I tried. This week I got halfway, then went to the shop. The man there fixed it in five minutes and said, 'Good try.' Very kind.","p":"","m":"你上次问我能不能自己修。我试了。这周修到一半，就去了店里。店里的人五分钟就修好了，还说：「试得不错。」人真好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like learning to fix things?","p":"","m":"你喜欢学着修东西吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it's satisfying.","p":"","m":"喜欢，很有成就感。","r":{"t":"Ja, the best feeling.","p":"","m":"是啊，最好的感觉。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太喜欢。","r":{"t":"Fair. That's what shops are for.","p":"","m":"有道理。商店就是干这个的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Rode to school today. Perfect brakes.","p":"","m":"今天骑车上学。刹车完美。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-19|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-19","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边商店里也挤得要命。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān shāngdiàn li yě jǐ de yàomìng.","m":"The shops here are packed too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边商店里也挤得要命","en":"The shops are packed where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边商店里也挤得要命。周末我学乖了，早上八点就去了，人很少。买了要的东西，还在咖啡馆坐了一会儿，很舒服。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shāngdiàn lǐ yě jǐ de yàomìng. Zhōumò wǒ xué guāi le, zǎoshang bā diǎn jiù qù le, rén hěn shǎo. Mǎi le yào de dōngxi, hái zài kāfēiguǎn zuò le yíhuìr, hěn shūfu.","m":"You said the shops are packed where you are too. At the weekend I learned my lesson and went at eight in the morning — hardly anyone there. Got what I needed, and even sat in a café for a bit. Very nice.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买东西喜欢早去还是晚去？","p":"Nǐ mǎi dōngxi xǐhuan zǎo qù háishi wǎn qù?","m":"Do you prefer shopping early or late?"},"replies":[{"t":"早去，人少。","p":"Zǎo qù, rén shǎo.","m":"Early — fewer people.","r":{"t":"对！早去最好。","p":"Duì! Zǎo qù zuì hǎo.","m":"Yes! Early is best."}},{"t":"晚去，快关门的时候。","p":"Wǎn qù, kuài guān mén de shíhou.","m":"Late — near closing.","r":{"t":"也好，有时候还会打折。","p":"Yě hǎo, yǒu shíhou hái huì dǎzhé.","m":"Good too — sometimes there are discounts."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又是早上去的，人少。","p":"Jīntiān yòu shì zǎoshang qù de, rén shǎo.","m":"Went early again today — quiet."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我都在网上买东西。","p":"Wǒ dōu zài wǎngshàng mǎi dōngxi.","m":"I buy everything online."},"mem":{"zh":"你都在网上买东西","en":"You buy everything online"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你都在网上买东西。我听你的，这两天第一次在网上买了圣诞礼物。点了三次才买成功，可是东西到了！我很骄傲。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dōu zài wǎng shang mǎi dōngxi. Wǒ tīng nǐ de, zhè liǎng tiān dì yī cì zài wǎng shang mǎi le Shèngdàn lǐwù. Diǎn le sān cì cái mǎi chénggōng, kěshì dōngxi dào le! Wǒ hěn jiāo'ào.","m":"You said you buy everything online. I took your advice — these days I bought a Christmas present online for the first time. Took three tries to get it through, but it arrived! I'm very proud.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你在网上买过最奇怪的东西是什么？","p":"Nǐ zài wǎng shang mǎiguo zuì qíguài de dōngxi shì shénme?","m":"What's the strangest thing you've bought online?"},"replies":[{"t":"一个很大的玩偶。","p":"Yí gè hěn dà de wán'ǒu.","m":"A huge stuffed toy.","r":{"t":"哈哈，一定占了半个房间。","p":"Hāha, yídìng zhàn le bàn gè fángjiān.","m":"Haha, it must take up half the room."}},{"t":"没什么奇怪的。","p":"Méi shénme qíguài de.","m":"Nothing strange.","r":{"t":"那你是很会买东西的人。","p":"Nà nǐ shì hěn huì mǎi dōngxi de rén.","m":"Then you're a sensible shopper."}}],"next":{"t":"第二个网上买的礼物今天也到了。","p":"Dì èr gè wǎng shang mǎi de lǐwù jīntiān yě dào le.","m":"My second online present arrived today too."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你买了什么？","p":"Nǐ mǎi le shénme?","m":"What did you buy?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她买了什么（一盒饼干，送给邻居）","en":"You asked what she bought (a box of biscuits for her neighbour)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我买了什么。一盒饼干，送邻居的。这两天我送过去了，邻居回送了我一盆小圣诞树，现在放在我的窗台上，Biscuit 每天都去闻。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ mǎi le shénme. Yì hé bǐnggān, sòng línjū de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ sòng guòqù le, línjū huí sòng le wǒ yì pén xiǎo Shèngdàn shù, xiànzài fàng zài wǒ de chuāngtái shang, Biscuit měi tiān dōu qù wén.","m":"Last time you asked what I bought. A box of biscuits for my neighbour. These days I took it round, and she gave me a little potted Christmas tree back. It's on my windowsill now, and Biscuit sniffs it every day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟邻居会互相送东西吗？","p":"Nǐ gēn línjū huì hùxiāng sòng dōngxi ma?","m":"Do you and your neighbours swap little gifts?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，过节的时候。","p":"Huì, guòjié de shíhou.","m":"Yes, at holidays.","r":{"t":"真好，有好邻居最幸福。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, yǒu hǎo línjū zuì xìngfú.","m":"Lovely — good neighbours are a blessing."}},{"t":"不太会。","p":"Bú tài huì.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"下次可以试试，一盒饼干就够了。","p":"Xià cì kěyǐ shìshi, yì hé bǐnggān jiù gòu le.","m":"Try it sometime — a box of biscuits is enough."}}],"next":{"t":"Biscuit 今天又去闻那棵小树了。","p":"Biscuit jīntiān yòu qù wén nà kē xiǎo shù le.","m":"Biscuit went to sniff the little tree again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去的是哪儿？","p":"Nǐ qù de shì nǎr?","m":"Where did you go?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去的是哪儿（牛津街，知道不该周末去）","en":"You asked where she went (Oxford Street — she knew better than to go at the weekend)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去的是哪儿。牛津街。这两天我跟梁阿姨说了，她笑我：「你去唐人街买，人少，还能练中文。」下次我就去唐人街。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù de shì nǎr. Niújīn Jiē. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn Liáng āyí shuō le, tā xiào wǒ: “Nǐ qù Tángrénjiē mǎi, rén shǎo, hái néng liàn Zhōngwén.” Xià cì wǒ jiù qù Tángrénjiē.","m":"Last time you asked where I went. Oxford Street. These days I told Auntie Liang, and she laughed at me: “Shop in Chinatown — fewer people, and you can practise Chinese.” Next time, Chinatown it is.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边买东西最热闹的地方是哪儿？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān mǎi dōngxi zuì rènao de dìfang shì nǎr?","m":"Where's the busiest shopping area where you are?"},"replies":[{"t":"市中心。","p":"Shì zhōngxīn.","m":"The city centre.","r":{"t":"市中心都一样，人多。","p":"Shì zhōngxīn dōu yíyàng, rén duō.","m":"City centres are all the same — crowded."}},{"t":"一个大商场。","p":"Yí gè dà shāngchǎng.","m":"A big mall.","r":{"t":"商场里暖和，可是人也多。","p":"Shāngchǎng lǐ nuǎnhuo, kěshì rén yě duō.","m":"Malls are warm, but crowded too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天去了唐人街，人少多了。","p":"Jīntiān qù le Tángrénjiē, rén shǎo duō le.","m":"Went to Chinatown today — much quieter."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我的孙子们这个周末从曼彻斯特来了！","p":"Wǒ de sūnzimen zhège zhōumò cóng Mànchèsītè lái le!","m":"My grandsons came down from Manchester this weekend!"},{"t":"我教他们用筷子夹花生。小的那个三分钟就会了，我练了一个月，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ jiāo tāmen yòng kuàizi jiā huāshēng. Xiǎo de nà gè sān fēnzhōng jiù huì le, wǒ liàn le yí gè yuè, hāha.","m":"I taught them to pick up peanuts with chopsticks. The little one got it in three minutes — it took me a month, haha."},{"t":"我织的围巾，他戴上就不肯拿下来了。我很开心。","p":"Wǒ zhī de wéijīn, tā dài shang jiù bù kěn ná xiàlái le. Wǒ hěn kāixīn.","m":"He put on the scarf I knitted and won't take it off. I'm very happy."}],"replies":[{"t":"三分钟！小孩学得真快。","p":"Sān fēnzhōng! Xiǎohái xué de zhēn kuài.","m":"Three minutes! Kids learn so fast.","r":{"t":"是啊，可是我比他有耐心，哈哈。","p":"Shì a, kěshì wǒ bǐ tā yǒu nàixīn, hāha.","m":"Yes — but I'm more patient, haha."}},{"t":"他一定很喜欢那条围巾。","p":"Tā yídìng hěn xǐhuan nà tiáo wéijīn.","m":"He must love that scarf.","r":{"t":"他说是全世界最暖和的围巾。","p":"Tā shuō shì quán shìjiè zuì nuǎnhuo de wéijīn.","m":"He says it's the warmest scarf in the world."}}],"from":"2026-12-21"}},"2026-12-19|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-19","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也都在网上买。","p":"Wǒ yě dōu zài wǎngshàng mǎi.","m":"I buy everything online too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也都在网上买","en":"You shop online too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也都在网上买。这两天我的东西都寄到便利商店，店员一看到我就说：「你的包裹到了，三个。」他比我还清楚，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě dōu zài wǎng shang mǎi. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ de dōngxi dōu jì dào biànlì shāngdiàn, diànyuán yí kàn dào wǒ jiù shuō: “Nǐ de bāoguǒ dào le, sān gè.” Tā bǐ wǒ hái qīngchu, hāha.","m":"You said you shop online too. These days everything's been delivered to the convenience store, and the staff member sees me and says: “Your parcels are in — three.” He knows better than me, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你常常在网上买东西吗？","p":"Nǐ chángcháng zài wǎng shang mǎi dōngxi ma?","m":"Do you shop online a lot?"},"replies":[{"t":"常常，什么都买。","p":"Chángcháng, shénme dōu mǎi.","m":"Yes — everything.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Haha, same here!"}},{"t":"不常，偶尔。","p":"Bù cháng, ǒu'ěr.","m":"Not often — now and then.","r":{"t":"你比我会控制自己。","p":"Nǐ bǐ wǒ huì kòngzhì zìjǐ.","m":"You've got more self-control than me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去便利商店拿了一个包裹。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù biànlì shāngdiàn ná le yí gè bāoguǒ.","m":"Picked up another parcel at the convenience store today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我喜欢去店里买，可以看看。","p":"Wǒ xǐhuan qù diàn li mǎi, kěyǐ kànkan.","m":"I like going to the shops — I can look around."},"mem":{"zh":"你喜欢去店里买，可以看看","en":"You like shopping in person so you can look"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你喜欢去店里买，可以看看。这两天我真的去了一家店买毛衣，试了才发现，网上看到的颜色跟真的不一样。你说得对！","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ xǐhuan qù diàn lǐ mǎi, kěyǐ kànkan. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhēnde qù le yì jiā diàn mǎi máoyī, shì le cái fāxiàn, wǎng shang kàn dào de yánsè gēn zhēnde bù yíyàng. Nǐ shuō de duì!","m":"You said you like shopping in person so you can see things. These days I actually went to a shop for a jumper — and only when I tried it did I realise the colour online is different from the real thing. You were right!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买衣服一定要试吗？","p":"Nǐ mǎi yīfu yídìng yào shì ma?","m":"Do you always try clothes on?"},"replies":[{"t":"一定要试。","p":"Yídìng yào shì.","m":"Always.","r":{"t":"对，不试不知道。","p":"Duì, bú shì bù zhīdào.","m":"Right — you never know till you try."}},{"t":"不用，看尺寸就好。","p":"Bú yòng, kàn chǐcùn jiù hǎo.","m":"No — the size is enough.","r":{"t":"你好会买！","p":"Nǐ hǎo huì mǎi!","m":"You're a pro shopper!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天穿了新毛衣，颜色刚刚好。","p":"Jīntiān chuān le xīn máoyī, yánsè gānggāng hǎo.","m":"Wore the new jumper today — the colour's just right."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在网上买了什么？","p":"Nǐ zài wǎngshàng mǎi le shénme?","m":"What did you buy online?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在网上买了什么（一件毛衣，还有给朋友的圣诞礼物）","en":"You asked what she bought online (a jumper and Christmas presents for friends)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在网上买了什么。给朋友的圣诞礼物，是一个小小的手机挂饰，一只猫。这两天到了，我自己也好想要，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài wǎng shang mǎi le shénme. Gěi péngyou de Shèngdàn lǐwù, shì yí gè xiǎoxiǎo de shǒujī guàshì, yì zhī māo. Zhè liǎng tiān dào le, wǒ zìjǐ yě hǎo xiǎng yào, hāha.","m":"Last time you asked what I bought online. A Christmas present for a friend — a tiny cat phone charm. It arrived these days and now I want one too, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买礼物的时候，会不会也想给自己买一个？","p":"Nǐ mǎi lǐwù de shíhou, huì bu huì yě xiǎng gěi zìjǐ mǎi yí gè?","m":"When you buy a present, do you want one for yourself too?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，常常买两个。","p":"Huì, chángcháng mǎi liǎng gè.","m":"Yes — I often buy two.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我们一样！","p":"Hāha, wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Haha, same here!"}},{"t":"不会，礼物就是礼物。","p":"Bú huì, lǐwù jiù shì lǐwù.","m":"No — a present's a present.","r":{"t":"你好有原则。","p":"Nǐ hǎo yǒu yuánzé.","m":"You've got principles."}}],"next":{"t":"我还是给自己也买了一只猫挂饰，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ háishi gěi zìjǐ yě mǎi le yì zhī māo guàshì, hāha.","m":"I gave in and bought myself a cat charm too, haha."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"东西寄到家里吗？","p":"Dōngxi jì dào jiā li ma?","m":"Do things get delivered to your home?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过东西寄到哪里（楼下的便利商店，下课顺便拿）","en":"You asked where things get delivered (the convenience store downstairs — she picks them up after class)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我东西寄到哪里。楼下的便利商店。这两天店员帮我把三个包裹叠在一起，上面还贴了一张小纸条：「Mei，期末加油！」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ dōngxi jì dào nǎlǐ. Lóuxià de biànlì shāngdiàn. Zhè liǎng tiān diànyuán bāng wǒ bǎ sān gè bāoguǒ dié zài yìqǐ, shàngmiàn hái tiē le yì zhāng xiǎo zhǐtiáo: “Mei, qīmò jiāyóu!”","m":"Last time you asked where my things get delivered. The convenience store downstairs. These days the staff member stacked my three parcels together with a little note on top: “Mei, good luck with finals!”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有被店员记住过？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu bèi diànyuán jìzhù guo?","m":"Has a shop worker ever remembered you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，常去的那家店。","p":"Yǒu, cháng qù de nà jiā diàn.","m":"Yes — at a shop I go to often.","r":{"t":"那种感觉好温暖。","p":"Nà zhǒng gǎnjué hǎo wēnnuǎn.","m":"Such a warm feeling."}},{"t":"没有。","p":"Méiyǒu.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"多去几次就会了！","p":"Duō qù jǐ cì jiù huì le!","m":"Go a few more times and they will!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天把那张小纸条贴在了书桌上。","p":"Jīntiān bǎ nà zhāng xiǎo zhǐtiáo tiē zài le shūzhuō shang.","m":"Stuck that little note on my desk today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-19|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-19","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的市场也很热闹。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de shìchǎng yě hěn rènao.","m":"The markets here are lively too."},"mem":{"zh":"你那边的市场也很热闹","en":"The market where you are is busy too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的市场也很热闹。周末我带我妈去了，她跟卖布的阿姨讲价讲了二十分钟，最后两个人都笑了，便宜了五百奈拉。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de shìchǎng yě hěn rènao. Zhōumò wǒ dài wǒ mā qù le, tā gēn mài bù de āyí jiǎng jià jiǎng le èrshí fēnzhōng, zuìhòu liǎng gè rén dōu xiào le, piányi le wǔbǎi nàilā.","m":"You said the market where you are is busy too. At the weekend I took my mum — she haggled with the fabric seller for twenty minutes, they both ended up laughing, and she got five hundred naira off.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢去哪儿买东西？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan qù nǎr mǎi dōngxi?","m":"Where do you like shopping most?"},"replies":[{"t":"市场。","p":"Shìchǎng.","m":"Markets.","r":{"t":"市场最有意思！","p":"Shìchǎng zuì yǒu yìsi!","m":"Markets are the most fun!"}},{"t":"商场或者网上。","p":"Shāngchǎng huòzhě wǎng shang.","m":"Malls or online.","r":{"t":"也好，不用讲价，哈哈。","p":"Yě hǎo, bú yòng jiǎng jià, hāha.","m":"That's good too — no haggling, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天还在说那块布买得值。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān hái zài shuō nà kuài bù mǎi de zhí.","m":"My mum's still saying that fabric was a bargain today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我不会讲价，不好意思。","p":"Wǒ bú huì jiǎngjià, bù hǎoyìsi.","m":"I can't haggle — I feel too awkward."},"mem":{"zh":"你不会讲价，不好意思","en":"You can't haggle — you're too shy"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你不会讲价，不好意思。周末在市场我想到你，就仔细看我妈怎么讲：先笑，再问价，然后说「太贵了」，最后假装要走——她一走，卖家就叫她回来了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ bú huì jiǎng jià, bù hǎoyìsi. Zhōumò zài shìchǎng wǒ xiǎng dào nǐ, jiù zǐxì kàn wǒ mā zěnme jiǎng: xiān xiào, zài wèn jià, ránhòu shuō “tài guì le”, zuìhòu jiǎzhuāng yào zǒu —— tā yì zǒu, màijiā jiù jiào tā huílái le.","m":"You said you can't haggle — too shy. At the market at the weekend I thought of you and watched my mum closely: smile first, ask the price, say “too expensive”, then pretend to leave — and the moment she walks off, the seller calls her back.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你买东西的时候，会说「太贵了」吗？","p":"Nǐ mǎi dōngxi de shíhou, huì shuō “tài guì le” ma?","m":"Do you ever say 'too expensive' when shopping?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，不过很小声。","p":"Huì, búguò hěn xiǎoshēng.","m":"Yes, but very quietly.","r":{"t":"哈哈，小声也算！","p":"Hāha, xiǎoshēng yě suàn!","m":"Haha, quietly counts!"}},{"t":"不会，我说不出口。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ shuō bu chū kǒu.","m":"No — I can't bring myself to.","r":{"t":"没问题，没问题，买你喜欢的就好。","p":"Méi wèntí, méi wèntí, mǎi nǐ xǐhuan de jiù hǎo.","m":"No problem, no problem — buy what you like."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我也试着讲了一次价，便宜了一百奈拉！","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yě shì zhe jiǎng le yí cì jià, piányi le yìbǎi nàilā!","m":"I tried haggling myself today — got a hundred naira off!"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去市场买什么？","p":"Nǐ qù shìchǎng mǎi shénme?","m":"What did you go to the market for?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他去市场买什么（过节的米和鸡，还有给妈妈的一块布）","en":"You asked what he buys at the market (rice and chicken for the holidays, and fabric for his mum)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去市场买什么。米、鸡，还有给我妈的布。这两天那块布已经做成了新衣服，我妈说过节那天穿。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù shìchǎng mǎi shénme. Mǐ, jī, hái yǒu gěi wǒ mā de bù. Zhè liǎng tiān nà kuài bù yǐjīng zuò chéng le xīn yīfu, wǒ mā shuō guòjié nà tiān chuān.","m":"Last time you asked what I buy at the market. Rice, chicken, and fabric for my mum. These days the fabric has already become a new outfit — Mum says she'll wear it for the holiday.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你过节会穿新衣服吗？","p":"Nǐ guòjié huì chuān xīn yīfu ma?","m":"Do you wear new clothes for holidays?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，一定穿新的。","p":"Huì, yídìng chuān xīn de.","m":"Yes — always something new.","r":{"t":"对，过节就要穿新衣服！","p":"Duì, guòjié jiù yào chuān xīn yīfu!","m":"Right — holidays mean new clothes!"}},{"t":"不会，穿平常的。","p":"Bú huì, chuān píngcháng de.","m":"No — just my usual.","r":{"t":"也好，舒服最重要。","p":"Yě hǎo, shūfu zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Fair — comfort's what matters."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈今天又试了一下新衣服。","p":"Wǒ mā jīntiān yòu shì le yíxià xīn yīfu.","m":"Mum tried on her new outfit again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会讲价吗？","p":"Nǐ huì jiǎngjià ma?","m":"Can you haggle?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他会不会讲价（会一点，妈妈比他厉害多了）","en":"You asked if he can haggle (a bit — his mum's much better)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会讲价。会一点。周末我学我妈，在市场里一家中国人开的小店用中文讲价，老板吓了一跳，最后便宜了，还送了我一包茶。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì jiǎng jià. Huì yìdiǎn. Zhōumò wǒ xué wǒ mā, zài shìchǎng lǐ yì jiā Zhōngguó rén kāi de xiǎo diàn yòng Zhōngwén jiǎng jià, lǎobǎn xià le yí tiào, zuìhòu piányi le, hái sòng le wǒ yì bāo chá.","m":"Last time you asked if I can haggle. A little. At the weekend I copied my mum and haggled in Chinese at a little Chinese-run shop in the market. The owner was startled — he gave me a discount and a bag of tea on top.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你讲价的时候用什么办法？","p":"Nǐ jiǎng jià de shíhou yòng shénme bànfǎ?","m":"What's your haggling technique?"},"replies":[{"t":"笑着说。","p":"Xiào zhe shuō.","m":"Say it with a smile.","r":{"t":"笑最有用！","p":"Xiào zuì yǒu yòng!","m":"Smiling works best!"}},{"t":"我不讲价。","p":"Wǒ bù jiǎng jià.","m":"I don't haggle.","r":{"t":"也好，省时间。","p":"Yě hǎo, shěng shíjiān.","m":"Fair — saves time."}}],"next":{"t":"那包茶今天喝了，还不错。","p":"Nà bāo chá jīntiān hē le, hái búcuò.","m":"Had that tea today — not bad."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"今年圣诞节，Funmi 又要上夜班。","p":"Jīnnián Shèngdàn Jié, Funmi yòu yào shàng yèbān.","m":"This Christmas Funmi's on a night shift again."},{"t":"我和女儿决定，等她下班回来，早上一起吃圣诞早饭。","p":"Wǒ hé nǚ'ér juédìng, děng tā xiàbān huílái, zǎoshang yìqǐ chī Shèngdàn zǎofàn.","m":"My daughter and I decided we'll have Christmas breakfast together when she gets home in the morning."},{"t":"菜单是我定的：炸大蕉、鸡蛋，还有中国同事教我做的葱油饼。","p":"Càidān shì wǒ dìng de: zhá dàjiāo, jīdàn, hái yǒu Zhōngguó tóngshì jiāo wǒ zuò de cōngyóubǐng.","m":"I set the menu: fried plantain, eggs, and the scallion pancakes a Chinese colleague taught me to make."}],"replies":[{"t":"这个早饭好棒！","p":"Zhège zǎofàn hǎo bàng!","m":"What a breakfast!","r":{"t":"一半尼日利亚，一半中国，哈哈。","p":"Yíbàn Nírìlìyà, yíbàn Zhōngguó, hāha.","m":"Half Nigerian, half Chinese, haha."}},{"t":"你太太一定很开心。","p":"Nǐ tàitai yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"Your wife will be so happy.","r":{"t":"希望吧！我先练练葱油饼。","p":"Xīwàng ba! Wǒ xiān liànlian cōngyóubǐng.","m":"I hope so! I'd better practise the pancakes first."}}],"from":"2026-12-21"}},"2026-12-19|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-19","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"That happens to me all the time!","p":"","m":"我也常常这样！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也常常这样（去买一样东西，带回来另一样）","en":"That happens to you all the time too"},"later":{"t":"You said that happens to you all the time. This week it happened again — I went back for the batteries and came out with a scarf. The batteries are still in the shop.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也常常这样。这周又来了——我回去买电池，结果拎着一条围巾出来了。电池还在店里。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's the most random thing you've bought?","p":"","m":"你买过最莫名其妙的东西是什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something I never used.","p":"","m":"一个从来没用过的东西。","r":{"t":"Same. My jumper drawer agrees.","p":"","m":"一样。我的毛衣抽屉同意。"}},{"t":"I always stick to my list.","p":"","m":"我总是照单子买。","r":{"t":"Teach me. I'm begging.","p":"","m":"教教我。我求你了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still no batteries. Still a new scarf.","p":"","m":"还是没买电池。还是新围巾。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I avoid shops this time of year.","p":"","m":"我这个时候都不去商店。"},"mem":{"zh":"你这个时候不去商店","en":"You avoid shops this time of year"},"later":{"t":"You said you avoid shops this time of year. Wise. This week I tried shopping online instead. Everything arrived — except the batteries, which I forgot again.","p":"","m":"你上次说你这个时候不去商店。明智。这周我改成在网上买。东西都到了——除了电池，我又忘了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you shop online or in person?","p":"","m":"你在网上买还是去店里买？"},"replies":[{"t":"Online, mostly.","p":"","m":"大多在网上。","r":{"t":"Smart. No crowds, no surprise jumpers.","p":"","m":"聪明。不挤，也不会多买毛衣。"}},{"t":"In person.","p":"","m":"去店里。","r":{"t":"Brave, at this time of year.","p":"","m":"这个时候还去，勇敢。"}}],"next":{"t":"Batteries finally ordered. Victory.","p":"","m":"电池终于下单了。胜利。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What colour is the jumper?","p":"","m":"毛衣是什么颜色的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那件毛衣是什么颜色（深蓝色，很稳重）","en":"You asked what colour the jumper is (dark blue — very sensible)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what colour the jumper is. Dark blue. This week my mum saw it on a video call and said: 'Finally, something that isn't green.'","p":"","m":"你上次问那件毛衣是什么颜色。深蓝色。这周我妈在视频里看到了，说：「终于有一件不是绿色的了。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family comment on your clothes?","p":"","m":"你家里人会评价你的衣服吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"All the time.","p":"","m":"总是。","r":{"t":"Mums notice everything.","p":"","m":"妈妈们什么都看得见。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Lucky. Mine has opinions.","p":"","m":"真好。我妈意见很多。"}}],"next":{"t":"Wearing the blue jumper. Mum approves.","p":"","m":"穿着那件蓝毛衣。妈妈满意。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you get the batteries?","p":"","m":"电池买到了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买到电池没有（忘了，还得回去）","en":"You asked if he got the batteries (he forgot — has to go back)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I got the batteries. No. This week I went back — and they'd sold out. The TV remote is now held together with hope.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买到电池没有。没有。这周我又回去了——卖完了。电视遥控器现在全靠希望撑着。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something small you keep forgetting to buy?","p":"","m":"有没有一样小东西，你总是忘了买？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, every time.","p":"","m":"有，每次都忘。","r":{"t":"Then write it on your hand. That's my new plan.","p":"","m":"那写在手上。这是我的新计划。"}},{"t":"No, I'm organised.","p":"","m":"没有，我很有条理。","r":{"t":"Respect. Help me.","p":"","m":"佩服。帮帮我。"}}],"next":{"t":"Wrote 'BATTERIES' on my hand today.","p":"","m":"今天在手上写了「电池」。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Last week before Christmas. The office is half empty and full of mince pies.","p":"","m":"圣诞前最后一周。办公室空了一半，到处都是百果馅饼。"},{"t":"My editor gave me my first story for next year: why young people in London are learning to cook again.","p":"","m":"主编给了我明年的第一个题目：为什么伦敦的年轻人又开始学做饭了。"},{"t":"I said I'm the perfect person for it. She looked at my lunch — a meal deal — and laughed.","p":"","m":"我说我是最合适的人。她看了看我的午饭——一份午餐套餐——笑了。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Good luck with the story!","p":"","m":"祝稿子顺利！","r":{"t":"Cheers. I'll start by learning gravy.","p":"","m":"谢了。我先从学做肉汁开始。"}},{"t":"Maybe you'll learn to cook too.","p":"","m":"也许你也会学会做饭。","r":{"t":"That's the plan. Mum's already sending recipes.","p":"","m":"就是这么打算的。我妈已经在给我发菜谱了。"}}],"from":"2026-12-22"}},"2026-12-19|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-19","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Everyone's saving here too.","p":"","m":"我这边大家也都在存钱。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边大家也在存钱过节","en":"Everyone's saving for the holidays where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said everyone's saving there too. This week my wife and I made a jar for each kid. Every day I drop in the coins from tips. The jars are getting heavy, bro.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边大家也在存钱过节。这周我和老婆给每个孩子准备了一个罐子。我每天把小费的硬币放进去。罐子越来越重了，兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you save in a jar or in the bank?","p":"","m":"你是用罐子存钱，还是存银行？"},"replies":[{"t":"In the bank.","p":"","m":"存银行。","r":{"t":"Smart. Safer.","p":"","m":"聪明。更安全。"}},{"t":"In a jar, like you.","p":"","m":"用罐子，跟你一样。","r":{"t":"Jar people! The sound of coins is the best.","p":"","m":"罐子派！硬币的声音最好听。"}}],"next":{"t":"More coins in the jars today.","p":"","m":"今天罐子里又多了几个硬币。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"The shops are packed here.","p":"","m":"我这边商店里挤满了人。"},"mem":{"zh":"你那边商店里挤满了人","en":"The shops are packed where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said the shops are packed there. Here too now, bro. This week I took a man home with ten shopping bags on my motorbike. Ten! He held five, I held five.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边商店里挤满了人。现在我们这儿也是，兄弟。这周我用摩托车送一个男的回家，他拎着十个购物袋。十个！他拿五个，我拿五个。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like holiday shopping?","p":"","m":"你喜欢过节前买东西吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it's exciting.","p":"","m":"喜欢，很兴奋。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love Jakarta right now!","p":"","m":"那你会爱上现在的雅加达！"}},{"t":"No, too crowded.","p":"","m":"不喜欢，太挤了。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. I just drive the shoppers, haha.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。我只负责送买东西的人，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Another passenger with lots of bags today, haha.","p":"","m":"今天又有一个乘客拎了好多袋子，哈哈。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What are you saving for?","p":"","m":"你在为什么存钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在存钱买什么（孩子们的礼物，他们列了单子）","en":"You asked what he's saving for (presents for the kids — they've made a list)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I'm saving for. My kids' list. This week I read it again: a bicycle, a doll — and 'a day with Papa, no motorbike'. That last one is free. I'm doing it first.","p":"","m":"你上次问我在存钱买什么。孩子们的单子。这周我又看了一遍：一辆自行车，一个娃娃——还有「跟爸爸过一天，不骑摩托车」。最后一个不要钱。我先做这个。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What was on your wish list as a kid?","p":"","m":"你小时候的愿望单上写着什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"A bicycle.","p":"","m":"一辆自行车。","r":{"t":"Same as my kid! Classic.","p":"","m":"跟我家孩子一样！经典。"}},{"t":"I can't remember.","p":"","m":"记不得了。","r":{"t":"Then make a new one now, bro.","p":"","m":"那现在写一张新的吧，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Planning my 'no motorbike' day with the kids.","p":"","m":"在计划跟孩子们的「不骑摩托车」的一天。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it hard to save?","p":"","m":"存钱难吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他存钱难不难（有点难，可是看到孩子们的脸就值了）","en":"You asked if saving is hard (a bit — but their faces will be worth it)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it's hard to save. A bit. This week I skipped my Friday coffee treat. One coffee less, one more coin in the jar. My kids don't know. Don't tell them.","p":"","m":"你上次问我存钱难不难。有点难。这周我没喝周五犒劳自己的那杯咖啡。少一杯咖啡，罐子里多一个硬币。孩子们不知道。别告诉他们。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's something small you'd give up for someone you love?","p":"","m":"为了你爱的人，你会放弃什么小东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"My coffee too.","p":"","m":"也是咖啡。","r":{"t":"Then we're the same, bro.","p":"","m":"那我们一样，兄弟。"}},{"t":"My free time.","p":"","m":"我的空闲时间。","r":{"t":"That's the biggest gift.","p":"","m":"那是最大的礼物。"}}],"next":{"t":"No coffee again today. The jar is happy.","p":"","m":"今天又没喝咖啡。罐子很开心。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"The kids' jars are full, bro. We opened them together on Sunday.","p":"","m":"孩子们的罐子满了，兄弟。周日我们一起打开了。"},{"t":"My eight-year-old counted it twice, then said: 'Papa, can we use some for your coffee?'","p":"","m":"我八岁的那个数了两遍，然后说：「爸爸，能不能拿一点给你买咖啡？」"},{"t":"I almost cried. Then I said yes. One coffee only.","p":"","m":"我差点哭了。然后我说好。就一杯。"}],"replies":[{"t":"What a kind kid!","p":"","m":"多好的孩子！","r":{"t":"Yes, bro. Kinder than me at that age.","p":"","m":"是啊，兄弟。比我那个年纪懂事。"}},{"t":"Enjoy that coffee!","p":"","m":"好好享受那杯咖啡！","r":{"t":"Best coffee of the year, bro.","p":"","m":"今年最好的一杯咖啡，兄弟。"}}],"from":"2026-12-22"}},"2026-12-20|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-20","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也有一张家里人做的菜的照片。","p":"Wǒ yě yǒu yì zhāng jiā li rén zuò de cài de zhàopiàn.","m":"I've got a photo of a dish someone in my family made too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也有一张家里人做的菜的照片","en":"You have a photo of food a family member made too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也有一张家里人做的菜的照片。冬至到了，我妈在搓汤圆。她说，外婆以前冬至也一定煮。我们一边搓，一边说外婆的事。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yǒu yì zhāng jiā lǐ rén zuò de cài de zhàopiàn. Dōngzhì dào le, wǒ mā zài cuō tāngyuán. Tā shuō, wàipó yǐqián Dōngzhì yě yídìng zhǔ. Wǒmen yìbiān cuō, yìbiān shuō wàipó de shì.","m":"You said you have a photo of food a family member made too. It's the winter solstice, and Mum's been rolling tangyuan. She said Grandma always made them at the solstice too. We rolled them together and talked about Grandma.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你们那边冬天有什么一家人一起吃的东西吗？","p":"Nǐmen nàbiān dōngtiān yǒu shénme yì jiā rén yìqǐ chī de dōngxi ma?","m":"Where you are, is there something families eat together in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，过节吃的菜。","p":"Yǒu, guòjié chī de cài.","m":"Yes — holiday dishes.","r":{"t":"一家人一起吃，最暖了。","p":"Yì jiā rén yìqǐ chī, zuì nuǎn le.","m":"Eating together as a family is the warmest thing."}},{"t":"没有特别的。","p":"Méiyǒu tèbié de.","m":"Nothing special.","r":{"t":"那就一起喝一碗热汤吧。","p":"Nà jiù yìqǐ hē yì wǎn rè tāng ba.","m":"Then share a bowl of hot soup."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起外婆的汤。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ wàipó de tāng.","m":"Thinking of Grandma's soup again today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也很想念外婆做的菜。","p":"Wǒ yě hěn xiǎngniàn wàipó zuò de cài.","m":"I miss my grandma's cooking too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也很想念外婆做的菜","en":"You miss your grandma's cooking too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也很想念外婆做的菜。这两天我试着照外婆的样子煮了一次萝卜排骨汤。味道不一样，可是我妈喝了一口，说：「有一点像了。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě hěn xiǎngniàn wàipó zuò de cài. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shì zhe zhào wàipó de yàngzi zhǔ le yí cì luóbo páigǔ tāng. Wèidao bù yíyàng, kěshì wǒ mā hē le yì kǒu, shuō: “Yǒu yìdiǎn xiàng le.”","m":"You said you miss your grandma's cooking too. These days I tried making radish and pork rib soup the way Grandma did. It doesn't taste the same, but Mum had a sip and said: “It's getting a little like hers.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你想念的那个味道，是什么菜？","p":"Nǐ xiǎngniàn de nà gè wèidao, shì shénme cài?","m":"The taste you miss — what dish is it?"},"replies":[{"t":"一碗汤。","p":"Yì wǎn tāng.","m":"A soup.","r":{"t":"汤的味道最难忘。","p":"Tāng de wèidao zuì nánwàng.","m":"The taste of soup stays with you longest."}},{"t":"一道家常菜。","p":"Yí dào jiācháng cài.","m":"A simple home dish.","r":{"t":"家常的最难学，也最想念。","p":"Jiācháng de zuì nán xué, yě zuì xiǎngniàn.","m":"Home dishes are the hardest to learn — and the most missed."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又煮了一次汤，还是差一点。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zhǔ le yí cì tāng, háishi chà yìdiǎn.","m":"Made the soup again today — still not quite."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"是什么汤？","p":"Shì shénme tāng?","m":"What soup was it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是什么汤（萝卜排骨汤，外婆每次炖一个下午）","en":"You asked what soup it was (radish and pork rib — her grandma simmered it all afternoon)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问是什么汤。萝卜排骨汤。这两天我问我妈，外婆的汤为什么那么好喝。她想了想，说：「因为她有时间。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn shì shénme tāng. Luóbo páigǔ tāng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wèn wǒ mā, wàipó de tāng wèishénme nàme hǎohē. Tā xiǎng le xiǎng, shuō: “Yīnwèi tā yǒu shíjiān.”","m":"Last time you asked what soup it was. Radish and pork rib. These days I asked Mum why Grandma's soup tasted so good. She thought for a while and said: “Because she had time.”","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里有没有一道菜，要花很久才做好？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí dào cài, yào huā hěn jiǔ cái zuò hǎo?","m":"Is there a dish in your family that takes a long time to make?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，要炖一个下午的。","p":"Yǒu, yào dùn yí gè xiàwǔ de.","m":"Yes — one that simmers all afternoon.","r":{"t":"那一定很好喝。","p":"Nà yídìng hěn hǎohē.","m":"That must taste wonderful."}},{"t":"没有，我们都做快的。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒmen dōu zuò kuài de.","m":"No — we cook quick things.","r":{"t":"快的也很好吃。","p":"Kuài de yě hěn hǎochī.","m":"Quick food is delicious too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下午炖了一锅汤，炖了三个小时。","p":"Jīntiān xiàwǔ dùn le yì guō tāng, dùn le sān gè xiǎoshí.","m":"Simmered a pot of soup for three hours this afternoon."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会做这个汤吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zuò zhège tāng ma?","m":"Can you make that soup?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她会不会做这个汤（在学，还没外婆做得好喝）","en":"You asked if she can make the soup (she's learning — not as good as Grandma's yet)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会做这个汤。我在学。这两天第二次做，我把外婆的锅拿出来用了，很重，可是用它煮，好像外婆就在旁边。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì zuò zhège tāng. Wǒ zài xué. Zhè liǎng tiān dì èr cì zuò, wǒ bǎ wàipó de guō ná chūlái yòng le, hěn zhòng, kěshì yòng tā zhǔ, hǎoxiàng wàipó jiù zài pángbiān.","m":"Last time you asked if I can make the soup. I'm learning. These days, on my second try, I used Grandma's old pot. It's heavy, but cooking with it feels like she's right beside me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一样家里老人留下来的东西？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí yàng jiā lǐ lǎorén liú xiàlái de dōngxi?","m":"Do you have something passed down from an older family member?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那样东西一定很珍贵。","p":"Nà yàng dōngxi yídìng hěn zhēnguì.","m":"It must be very precious."}},{"t":"没有。","p":"Méiyǒu.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"那就把他们说过的话记下来，也是很好的东西。","p":"Nà jiù bǎ tāmen shuōguo de huà jì xiàlái, yě shì hěn hǎo de dōngxi.","m":"Then write down things they've said — that's precious too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又用外婆的锅煮了汤。","p":"Jīntiān yòu yòng wàipó de guō zhǔ le tāng.","m":"Used Grandma's pot for soup again today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"三份报告都交了！","p":"Sān fèn bàogào dōu jiāo le!","m":"All three reports are in!"},{"t":"交完我就打电话给我妈。她在台南说：「过年回来，我煮你最爱的菜脯蛋。」","p":"Jiāo wán wǒ jiù dǎ diànhuà gěi wǒ mā. Tā zài Táinán shuō: “Guònián huílái, wǒ zhǔ nǐ zuì ài de càifǔdàn.”","m":"Straight after, I called Mum. From Tainan she said: “Come home for New Year — I'll make your favourite, preserved radish omelette.”"},{"t":"吃完我睡了十二个小时。好幸福喔。","p":"Chī wán wǒ shuì le shí'èr gè xiǎoshí. Hǎo xìngfú o.","m":"Then I slept twelve hours. Bliss."}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜交完了！","p":"Gōngxǐ jiāo wán le!","m":"Congrats on handing them in!","r":{"t":"谢谢！我现在只想吃和睡，哈哈。","p":"Xièxie! Wǒ xiànzài zhǐ xiǎng chī hé shuì, hāha.","m":"Thanks! Now I just want to eat and sleep, haha."}},{"t":"菜脯蛋是什么？","p":"Càifǔdàn shì shénme?","m":"What's a preserved radish omelette?","r":{"t":"就是萝卜干炒蛋，咸咸香香的，配饭超好吃。","p":"Jiù shì luóbo gān chǎo dàn, xiánxián xiāngxiāng de, pèi fàn chāo hǎochī.","m":"Dried radish cooked into an omelette — salty and fragrant, amazing with rice."}}],"from":"2026-12-23"}},"2026-12-20|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-20","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我也有一张别人帮我拍的照片。","p":"Wǒ yě yǒu yì zhāng biérén bāng wǒ pāi de zhàopiàn.","m":"I've got a photo someone else took of me too."},"mem":{"zh":"你也有一张别人帮你拍的照片","en":"You have a photo someone else took of you too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你也有一张别人帮你拍的照片。这两天我在青旅帮一对老夫妻拍了一张合照，他们说：「这是我们今年唯一的一张合照。」我好开心。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ yě yǒu yì zhāng biérén bāng nǐ pāi de zhàopiàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài qīnglǚ bāng yí duì lǎo fūqī pāi le yì zhāng hézhào, tāmen shuō: “Zhè shì wǒmen jīnnián wéiyī de yì zhāng hézhào.” Wǒ hǎo kāixīn.","m":"You said you have a photo someone else took of you too. These days I took a picture of an elderly couple at the hostel, and they said: “That's our only photo together this year.” It made me so happy.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你喜欢帮别人拍，还是被拍？","p":"Nǐ xǐhuan bāng biérén pāi, háishi bèi pāi?","m":"Do you prefer taking photos of others, or being in them?"},"replies":[{"t":"帮别人拍。","p":"Bāng biérén pāi.","m":"Taking them.","r":{"t":"那你一定会拍出别人自己不知道的样子。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng huì pāi chū biérén zìjǐ bù zhīdào de yàngzi.","m":"Then you'll catch sides of people they don't even know they have."}},{"t":"被拍，不过要拍得好看，哈哈。","p":"Bèi pāi, búguò yào pāi de hǎokàn, hāha.","m":"Being in them — as long as I look good, haha.","r":{"t":"哈哈，那要找会拍的人！","p":"Hāha, nà yào zhǎo huì pāi de rén!","m":"Haha, then find someone who knows how!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天又帮一个游客按了一次快门。","p":"Jīntiān yòu bāng yí gè yóukè àn le yí cì kuàimén.","m":"Pressed the shutter for another traveller today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我最喜欢的照片是一张风景照。","p":"Wǒ zuì xǐhuan de zhàopiàn shì yì zhāng fēngjǐng zhào.","m":"My favourite photo is a landscape."},"mem":{"zh":"你最喜欢的照片是一张风景照","en":"Your favourite photo is a landscape"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你最喜欢的照片是一张风景照。这两天我在整理今年的照片，五千多张！最后只留了一百张。风景照最多，可是最喜欢的还是有人的那几张。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ zuì xǐhuan de zhàopiàn shì yì zhāng fēngjǐng zhào. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài zhěnglǐ jīnnián de zhàopiàn, wǔqiān duō zhāng! Zuìhòu zhǐ liú le yìbǎi zhāng. Fēngjǐng zhào zuì duō, kěshì zuì xǐhuan de háishi yǒu rén de nà jǐ zhāng.","m":"You said your favourite photo is a landscape. These days I've been sorting this year's photos — over five thousand! I kept just a hundred. Most are landscapes, but my favourites are still the ones with people in them.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你手机里的照片多吗？","p":"Nǐ shǒujī lǐ de zhàopiàn duō ma?","m":"Do you have lots of photos on your phone?"},"replies":[{"t":"很多，舍不得删。","p":"Hěn duō, shěbude shān.","m":"Loads — I can't bear to delete them.","r":{"t":"我也是！删照片好难。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Shān zhàopiàn hǎo nán.","m":"Me too! Deleting photos is so hard."}},{"t":"不多，我常常删。","p":"Bù duō, wǒ chángcháng shān.","m":"Not many — I delete often.","r":{"t":"你好有决心！教教我。","p":"Nǐ hǎo yǒu juéxīn! Jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"So decisive! Teach me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又删了两百张照片，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān yòu shān le liǎngbǎi zhāng zhàopiàn, hāha.","m":"Deleted another two hundred photos today, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你那时候在去哪儿的火车上？","p":"Nǐ nà shíhou zài qù nǎr de huǒchē shang?","m":"Where was the train going?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她那时候在去哪儿的火车上（去顺化的夜车）","en":"You asked where the train was going (the night train to Hue)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我那时候在去哪儿的火车上。去顺化的夜车。这两天我一直在想那一晚：火车很慢，外面一片黑，偶尔有一个小站的灯。我就这么睡着了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ nà shíhou zài qù nǎr de huǒchē shang. Qù Shùnhuà de yèchē. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yìzhí zài xiǎng nà yì wǎn: huǒchē hěn màn, wàimiàn yí piàn hēi, ǒu'ěr yǒu yí gè xiǎo zhàn de dēng. Wǒ jiù zhème shuìzháo le.","m":"Last time you asked where that train was going. The night train to Hue. These days I keep thinking about that night: a slow train, darkness outside, now and then the lights of a little station. And I just fell asleep.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你坐过夜车吗？","p":"Nǐ zuòguo yèchē ma?","m":"Have you ever taken a night train?"},"replies":[{"t":"坐过，睡得不太好。","p":"Zuòguo, shuì de bú tài hǎo.","m":"Yes — didn't sleep well.","r":{"t":"对，夜车睡得很浅，可是很有意思。","p":"Duì, yèchē shuì de hěn qiǎn, kěshì hěn yǒu yìsi.","m":"Right — light sleep, but such an experience."}},{"t":"没坐过。","p":"Méi zuòguo.","m":"Never.","r":{"t":"有机会一定要坐一次。","p":"Yǒu jīhuì yídìng yào zuò yí cì.","m":"Take one if you ever get the chance."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起那趟夜车。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ nà tàng yèchē.","m":"Thinking about that night train again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你认识那个人吗？","p":"Nǐ rènshi nàge rén ma?","m":"Did you know the person?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她认不认识拍照的人（不认识，是对面的老奶奶）","en":"You asked if she knew the person who took it (no — an old lady sitting opposite)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我认不认识帮我拍照的人。不认识，是对面的老奶奶。这两天我在想：她为什么要拍？也许她也有一个在外面旅行的孙女。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ rèn bu rènshi bāng wǒ pāizhào de rén. Bú rènshi, shì duìmiàn de lǎo nǎinai. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng: tā wèishénme yào pāi? Yěxǔ tā yě yǒu yí gè zài wàimiàn lǚxíng de sūnnǚ.","m":"Last time you asked if I knew who took the photo. No — the old lady opposite. These days I've been wondering why she took it. Maybe she has a granddaughter out travelling too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"有没有陌生人为你做过一件小事，让你一直记得？","p":"Yǒu méiyǒu mòshēngrén wèi nǐ zuòguo yí jiàn xiǎo shì, ràng nǐ yìzhí jìde?","m":"Has a stranger ever done something small for you that you still remember?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，帮我指过路。","p":"Yǒu, bāng wǒ zhǐguo lù.","m":"Yes — showed me the way.","r":{"t":"这种小事最温暖。","p":"Zhè zhǒng xiǎo shì zuì wēnnuǎn.","m":"Little things like that are the warmest."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"I can't remember.","r":{"t":"那你可以当那个陌生人。","p":"Nà nǐ kěyǐ dāng nà gè mòshēngrén.","m":"Then you can be that stranger for someone."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又想起火车上那个老奶奶。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiǎng qǐ huǒchē shang nà gè lǎo nǎinai.","m":"Remembering the old lady on the train again today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我寄去河内的明信片还没到，可是我先收到了一封邮件！是那个阿姨的孙女发的。","p":"Wǒ jì qù Hénèi de míngxìnpiàn hái méi dào, kěshì wǒ xiān shōu dào le yì fēng yóujiàn! Shì nà gè āyí de sūnnǚ fā de.","m":"My postcard to Hanoi hasn't arrived yet, but I got an email first! From that lady's granddaughter."},{"t":"她用英文写：「我奶奶说她记得你，那个问路的法国姑娘。」","p":"Tā yòng Yīngwén xiě: “Wǒ nǎinai shuō tā jìde nǐ, nà gè wèn lù de Fǎguó gūniang.”","m":"She wrote in English: “My grandma says she remembers you — the French girl who asked for directions.”"},{"t":"我读了三遍。原来她也记得我。","p":"Wǒ dú le sān biàn. Yuánlái tā yě jìde wǒ.","m":"I read it three times. So she remembers me too."}],"replies":[{"t":"太感人了！","p":"Tài gǎnrén le!","m":"How moving!","r":{"t":"对吧！旅行最好的，就是这些人。","p":"Duì ba! Lǚxíng zuì hǎo de, jiù shì zhèxiē rén.","m":"Right? The best part of travelling is people like this."}},{"t":"原来她也记得你。","p":"Yuánlái tā yě jìde nǐ.","m":"So she remembers you too.","r":{"t":"是啊，我们都记得那一天。","p":"Shì a, wǒmen dōu jìde nà yì tiān.","m":"Yes — we both remember that day."}}],"from":"2026-12-22"}},"2026-12-20|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-20","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我第一次写对的字也是「家」！","p":"Wǒ dì-yī cì xiě duì de zì yě shì “jiā”!","m":"The first character I wrote right was 家 too!"},"mem":{"zh":"你第一次写对的字也是「家」","en":"The first character you wrote correctly was 家 too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你第一次写对的字也是「家」！这两天我又写对了一个：「好」，左边一个「女」，右边一个「子」。我觉得它像一个妈妈抱着一个孩子。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ dì yī cì xiě duì de zì yě shì “jiā”! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu xiě duì le yí gè: “hǎo”, zuǒbiān yí gè “nǚ”, yòubiān yí gè “zǐ”. Wǒ juéde tā xiàng yí gè māma bào zhe yí gè háizi.","m":"You said your first correct character was 家 too! These days I got another right: 好 — 女 on the left, 子 on the right. To me it looks like a mother holding a child.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最喜欢哪个汉字？","p":"Nǐ zuì xǐhuan nǎ gè Hànzì?","m":"Which Chinese character do you like most?"},"replies":[{"t":"「家」。","p":"“Jiā”.","m":"家.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"「爱」。","p":"“Ài”.","m":"爱.","r":{"t":"「爱」好难写！你好厉害。","p":"“Ài” hǎo nán xiě! Nǐ hǎo lìhai.","m":"爱 is so hard to write! Impressive."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写了一遍「家」，越来越好看了。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě le yí biàn “jiā”, yuè lái yuè hǎokàn le.","m":"Wrote 家 again today — getting neater."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我还不会写汉字。","p":"Wǒ hái bú huì xiě Hànzì.","m":"I can't write characters yet."},"mem":{"zh":"你还不会写汉字","en":"You can't write Chinese characters yet"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你还不会写汉字。没关系！这两天我发现一个好办法：先用手指在空中写十遍，再写在纸上。外婆看见了，也跟着在空中画。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ hái bú huì xiě Hànzì. Méi guānxi! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn yí gè hǎo bànfǎ: xiān yòng shǒuzhǐ zài kōngzhōng xiě shí biàn, zài xiě zài zhǐ shang. Wàipó kànjiàn le, yě gēn zhe zài kōngzhōng huà.","m":"You said you can't write characters yet. No problem! These days I found a good trick: write it in the air with your finger ten times, then on paper. Abuela saw and started drawing in the air too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学东西喜欢用手写，还是用电脑？","p":"Nǐ xué dōngxi xǐhuan yòng shǒu xiě, háishi yòng diànnǎo?","m":"Do you prefer learning by hand or on a computer?"},"replies":[{"t":"用手写，记得住。","p":"Yòng shǒu xiě, jì de zhù.","m":"By hand — it sticks.","r":{"t":"我也是！","p":"Wǒ yě shì!","m":"Me too!"}},{"t":"用电脑，快。","p":"Yòng diànnǎo, kuài.","m":"On a computer — faster.","r":{"t":"也好！我写字太慢了。","p":"Yě hǎo! Wǒ xiě zì tài màn le.","m":"Fair! My handwriting's so slow."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在空中写了「人」，外婆也写了。","p":"Jīntiān zài kōngzhōng xiě le “rén”, wàipó yě xiě le.","m":"Wrote 人 in the air today — Abuela did too."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你为什么拍下来？","p":"Nǐ wèishénme pāi xiàlái?","m":"Why did you take a photo of it?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她为什么拍下来（写了二十遍才写对，发给奶奶看了）","en":"You asked why she photographed it (twenty tries before she got it — she sent it to her dad's mum)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我为什么拍下来。因为写了二十遍！我发给了奶奶。这两天她告诉我，她把它打印出来，贴在冰箱上了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ wèishénme pāi xiàlái. Yīnwèi xiě le èrshí biàn! Wǒ fā gěi le nǎinai. Zhè liǎng tiān tā gàosu wǒ, tā bǎ tā dǎyìn chūlái, tiē zài bīngxiāng shang le.","m":"Last time you asked why I took a picture of it. Because it took twenty tries! I sent it to my dad's mum. These days she told me she printed it out and stuck it on her fridge.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里的冰箱上贴着什么？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ de bīngxiāng shang tiē zhe shénme?","m":"What's stuck on your fridge at home?"},"replies":[{"t":"照片和小纸条。","p":"Zhàopiàn hé xiǎo zhǐtiáo.","m":"Photos and little notes.","r":{"t":"冰箱是家里最好的墙！","p":"Bīngxiāng shì jiā lǐ zuì hǎo de qiáng!","m":"The fridge is the best wall in the house!"}},{"t":"什么都没有。","p":"Shénme dōu méiyǒu.","m":"Nothing.","r":{"t":"那可以贴一张你写的字！","p":"Nà kěyǐ tiē yì zhāng nǐ xiě de zì!","m":"Then stick up something you've written!"}}],"next":{"t":"奶奶今天又说，她每天都看冰箱上的「家」。","p":"Nǎinai jīntiān yòu shuō, tā měi tiān dōu kàn bīngxiāng shang de “jiā”.","m":"My dad's mum said again today she looks at the 家 on her fridge every day."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"「家」难写吗？","p":"“Jiā” nán xiě ma?","m":"Is 家 hard to write?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过「家」难不难写（下面那部分很难，笔顺老写错）","en":"You asked if 家 is hard to write (the bottom part is — she keeps getting the stroke order wrong)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我「家」难不难写。下面那部分最难。这两天成都的语伴教了我一个办法：一边写，一边说笔画的名字。我现在写「家」，嘴里一直在念，Mochi 都看着我。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ “jiā” nán bu nán xiě. Xiàmiàn nà bùfen zuì nán. Zhè liǎng tiān Chéngdū de yǔbàn jiāo le wǒ yí gè bànfǎ: yìbiān xiě, yìbiān shuō bǐhuà de míngzi. Wǒ xiànzài xiě “jiā”, zuǐ lǐ yìzhí zài niàn, Mochi dōu kàn zhe wǒ.","m":"Last time you asked if 家 is hard to write. The bottom part's the hardest. These days my partner in Chengdu taught me a trick: say the name of each stroke as you write it. Now when I write 家 I'm muttering the whole time, and Mochi stares at me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你写字的时候会念出来吗？","p":"Nǐ xiě zì de shíhou huì niàn chūlái ma?","m":"Do you say things out loud as you write?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，念出来记得住。","p":"Huì, niàn chūlái jì de zhù.","m":"Yes — saying it helps it stick.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same as me!"}},{"t":"不会，安静地写。","p":"Bú huì, ānjìng de xiě.","m":"No — I write quietly.","r":{"t":"也好，安静写最专心。","p":"Yě hǎo, ānjìng xiě zuì zhuānxīn.","m":"Fair — quiet is most focused."}}],"next":{"t":"今天写「家」，一边写一边念。","p":"Jīntiān xiě “jiā”, yìbiān xiě yìbiān niàn.","m":"Wrote 家 today, saying the strokes as I went."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"HSK 三级考完了！","p":"HSK sān jí kǎo wán le!","m":"HSK 3 is done!"},{"t":"听力比我想的难，可是阅读很顺。结果一月出来。","p":"Tīnglì bǐ wǒ xiǎng de nán, kěshì yuèdú hěn shùn. Jiéguǒ yī yuè chūlái.","m":"The listening was harder than I expected, but the reading went smoothly. Results come out in January."},{"t":"考完出来，外婆在门口等我，第一句话就是：「你好！」我抱住她，哭了一点。","p":"Kǎo wán chūlái, wàipó zài ménkǒu děng wǒ, dì yī jù huà jiù shì: “Nǐ hǎo!” Wǒ bào zhù tā, kū le yìdiǎn.","m":"When I came out, Abuela was waiting at the door. Her first words: “你好!” I hugged her and cried a little."}],"replies":[{"t":"恭喜你考完了！","p":"Gōngxǐ nǐ kǎo wán le!","m":"Congrats on finishing!","r":{"t":"谢谢！不管结果怎么样，我都很高兴。","p":"Xièxie! Bùguǎn jiéguǒ zěnmeyàng, wǒ dōu hěn gāoxìng.","m":"Thanks! Whatever the result, I'm happy."}},{"t":"外婆太可爱了。","p":"Wàipó tài kě'ài le.","m":"Your Abuela's so sweet.","r":{"t":"她是我最好的中文学生，哈哈。","p":"Tā shì wǒ zuì hǎo de Zhōngwén xuésheng, hāha.","m":"She's my best Chinese student, haha."}}],"from":"2026-12-24"}},"2026-12-20|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-20","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"My mum would kill me too!","p":"","m":"我妈也会杀了我！"},"mem":{"zh":"你妈也会要你的命","en":"Your mum would kill you too"},"later":{"t":"You said your mum would kill you too! This week my mum found out I'd told people about her dancing. She wasn't angry — she asked if I could put her dance in a music video. Chale.","p":"","m":"你上次说你妈也会要你的命！这周我妈发现我跟别人说了她跳舞的事。她没生气——她问我能不能把她跳舞放进音乐视频里。兄弟。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who's the best dancer in your family?","p":"","m":"你家谁跳舞最好？"},"replies":[{"t":"My mum, too!","p":"","m":"也是我妈！","r":{"t":"Mums win again.","p":"","m":"妈妈们又赢了。"}},{"t":"Nobody, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，没人会跳。","r":{"t":"Then you can be the first.","p":"","m":"那你可以当第一个。"}}],"next":{"t":"My mum practised her dance again today, haha.","p":"","m":"我妈今天又练了她的舞，哈哈。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I don't have photos like that.","p":"","m":"我没有那样的照片。"},"mem":{"zh":"你没有那样的照片","en":"You don't have photos like that"},"later":{"t":"You said you don't have photos like that. Next family party, phone ready! This week there was another one — my auntie's birthday. I was ready. My uncle's dancing was even better.","p":"","m":"你上次说你没有那样的照片。下次家庭聚会，手机准备好！这周又有一个——我姨妈的生日。我准备好了。我叔叔跳得更精彩。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What are your family parties like?","p":"","m":"你家的聚会是什么样的？"},"replies":[{"t":"Big and loud.","p":"","m":"人多，很吵。","r":{"t":"Same here. The bigger the better.","p":"","m":"这儿也是。越大越好。"}},{"t":"Small and quiet.","p":"","m":"人少，安静。","r":{"t":"That sounds peaceful. Different, but nice.","p":"","m":"听起来很平和。不一样，但很好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still laughing about my uncle's dance.","p":"","m":"想到我叔叔跳舞还在笑。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is she a good dancer?","p":"","m":"她跳得好吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他妈妈跳得好不好（比他好，这就是问题）","en":"You asked if his mum's a good dancer (better than him — that's the problem)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if she's a good dancer. Better than me. This week she taught me an old highlife step from when she was young. I fell over. She didn't.","p":"","m":"你上次问我妈跳得好不好。比我好。这周她教了我一个她年轻时候的 highlife 舞步。我摔倒了。她没有。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Can you dance?","p":"","m":"你会跳舞吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"A little.","p":"","m":"会一点。","r":{"t":"A little is enough for a wedding.","p":"","m":"在婚礼上，会一点就够了。"}},{"t":"Not at all.","p":"","m":"完全不会。","r":{"t":"Same, chale. We can stand at the back together.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。我们一起站在后面。"}}],"next":{"t":"Practised Mum's step. Still falling, haha.","p":"","m":"练了我妈的舞步。还是会摔，哈哈。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Whose wedding was it?","p":"","m":"是谁的婚礼？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是谁的婚礼（他表姐的，派对到凌晨两点）","en":"You asked whose wedding it was (his cousin's — the party went on till two)"},"later":{"t":"You asked whose wedding it was. My cousin's. This week she sent me a message: they want my song for their first-dance video. My song. Chale, I'm not crying, you are.","p":"","m":"你上次问是谁的婚礼。我表姐的。这周她给我发消息：他们想用我的歌做第一支舞的视频。我的歌。兄弟，我没哭，是你哭了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What song would you want at your own celebration?","p":"","m":"在你自己的庆祝会上，你想放什么歌？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something old and classic.","p":"","m":"一首老的经典歌。","r":{"t":"Classics never fail.","p":"","m":"经典永远不会错。"}},{"t":"Something to dance to.","p":"","m":"能跳舞的歌。","r":{"t":"Then call me. I'll make you one.","p":"","m":"那找我。我给你做一首。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still not crying. Okay, a little.","p":"","m":"还是没哭。好吧，有一点。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"All eight songs are done, chale. The album is finished.","p":"","m":"八首歌都做完了，兄弟。专辑完成了。"},{"t":"The last one is for my grandmother. I played it for her on Sunday. She listened with her eyes closed.","p":"","m":"最后一首是给我奶奶的。周日我放给她听了。她闭着眼睛听完。"},{"t":"Then she said: 'Again.' Best review ever.","p":"","m":"然后她说：「再放一遍。」最好的评价。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's beautiful.","p":"","m":"太美了。","r":{"t":"Chale, I'll never forget it.","p":"","m":"兄弟，我永远忘不了。"}},{"t":"When can I hear it?","p":"","m":"我什么时候能听到？","r":{"t":"January, I promise.","p":"","m":"一月，我保证。"}}],"from":"2026-12-22"}},"2026-12-20|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-20","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've picked blueberries too!","p":"","m":"我也摘过蓝莓！"},"mem":{"zh":"你也采过蓝莓","en":"You've picked blueberries too"},"later":{"t":"You said you've picked blueberries too! This week we opened the last bag from the freezer — summer in December. My kids ate them straight from the bag, still frozen.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也采过蓝莓！这周我们打开了冰箱里最后一袋——十二月里的夏天。孩子们直接从袋子里抓着吃，还是冻着的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you keep from summer?","p":"","m":"你会把夏天的什么留到冬天？"},"replies":[{"t":"Photos.","p":"","m":"照片。","r":{"t":"Ja, photos are summer in your pocket.","p":"","m":"是啊，照片是口袋里的夏天。"}},{"t":"Nothing, really.","p":"","m":"没什么。","r":{"t":"Then next summer, freeze some berries.","p":"","m":"那明年夏天冻点莓子。"}}],"next":{"t":"Blueberry pancakes today. Summer flavour.","p":"","m":"今天吃蓝莓煎饼。夏天的味道。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I've never picked fruit in a forest.","p":"","m":"我从来没在森林里摘过果子。"},"mem":{"zh":"你从来没在森林里采过果子","en":"You've never picked fruit in a forest"},"later":{"t":"You said you've never picked fruit in a forest. It's so calm — just you, the trees and the berries. This week I told my class about it, and they all shouted: 'And the mosquitoes!' True.","p":"","m":"你上次说你从来没在森林里采过果子。那里特别安静——只有你、树和莓子。这周我跟班上的孩子说起，他们一起喊：「还有蚊子！」说得对。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you like being out in nature?","p":"","m":"你喜欢在大自然里吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, very much.","p":"","m":"很喜欢。","r":{"t":"Then come to Sweden in summer.","p":"","m":"那夏天来瑞典吧。"}},{"t":"Not really — I prefer the city.","p":"","m":"不太喜欢，我更喜欢城市。","r":{"t":"Fair. Fewer mosquitoes, ha.","p":"","m":"有道理。蚊子少，哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dreaming of August in the forest.","p":"","m":"梦想着八月的森林。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you do with them?","p":"","m":"你们拿蓝莓做了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那些蓝莓怎么吃的（做了蓝莓派，很多放进了冰箱）","en":"You asked what they did with them (blueberry pie, and lots in the freezer)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we did with them. Pie, and the freezer. This week I made blueberry soup — a Swedish thing, served warm, very popular with skiers. My kids think soup made of berries is hilarious.","p":"","m":"你上次问那些蓝莓怎么吃的。做派，放冰箱。这周我煮了蓝莓汤——瑞典人的东西，热着喝，滑雪的人特别爱喝。我的孩子们觉得用莓子做汤太好笑了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever had fruit soup?","p":"","m":"你喝过水果汤吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I like it.","p":"","m":"喝过，我喜欢。","r":{"t":"Then you'd love our table.","p":"","m":"那你会爱上我们的餐桌。"}},{"t":"No, it sounds strange.","p":"","m":"没有，听起来很奇怪。","r":{"t":"It is a bit strange. But warm and good.","p":"","m":"是有点奇怪。不过暖暖的，很好喝。"}}],"next":{"t":"Blueberry soup again. The kids still laugh.","p":"","m":"又喝了蓝莓汤。孩子们还是在笑。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Can anyone pick there?","p":"","m":"谁都可以去摘吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过是不是谁都能去那儿采（能，在瑞典谁都可以在森林里采莓子）","en":"You asked if anyone can pick there (yes — in Sweden anyone can pick berries in the forest)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if anyone can pick there. Yes — in Sweden everyone can walk in the forest and pick berries, even on land they don't own. It's called allemansrätten. This week my youngest learned to say it.","p":"","m":"你上次问是不是谁都能去那儿采。是的——在瑞典，谁都可以在森林里走、采莓子，哪怕那块地不是你的。这叫 allemansrätten（公共通行权）。这周我家老二学会说这个词了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there a rule where you live that you really like?","p":"","m":"你那边有没有一条你特别喜欢的规矩？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a few.","p":"","m":"有几条。","r":{"t":"Good rules make good places.","p":"","m":"好规矩造就好地方。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"想不出来。","r":{"t":"Then borrow ours, ja.","p":"","m":"那借我们的吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"My youngest said 'allemansrätten' five times today.","p":"","m":"我家老二今天说了五遍「allemansrätten」。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"School's out! The Christmas holidays have started.","p":"","m":"学校放假了！圣诞假期开始了。"},{"t":"First day off, I slept till eight. In Sweden in December, that's still dark.","p":"","m":"放假第一天，我睡到八点。瑞典的十二月，八点天还是黑的。"},{"t":"My kids made me breakfast — cinnamon buns from the freezer, warmed a bit too long. Perfect.","p":"","m":"孩子们给我做了早饭——冷冻的肉桂卷，热得有点过头了。完美。"}],"replies":[{"t":"Enjoy your holiday!","p":"","m":"好好享受假期！","r":{"t":"Tack! That means thank you.","p":"","m":"Tack！就是谢谢的意思。"}},{"t":"Slightly burnt buns are the best.","p":"","m":"有点焦的面包最好吃。","r":{"t":"Ja, made with love.","p":"","m":"是啊，用爱做的。"}}],"from":"2026-12-23"}},"2026-12-21|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也在下小雨。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě zài xià xiǎo yǔ.","m":"It's drizzling here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也在下小雨","en":"You said it was drizzling where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也在下小雨。伦敦这两天还在下，可是我带了伞。周二我跟梁阿姨在雨里走了一圈唐人街，她教我说「毛毛雨」。我很喜欢这个词。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě zài xià xiǎoyǔ. Lúndūn zhè liǎng tiān hái zài xià, kěshì wǒ dài le sǎn. Zhōu'èr wǒ gēn Liáng āyí zài yǔ lǐ zǒu le yì quān Tángrénjiē, tā jiāo wǒ shuō “máomaoyǔ”. Wǒ hěn xǐhuan zhège cí.","m":"You said it was drizzling where you were too. London's kept it up these days, but I had my umbrella. On Tuesday Auntie Liang and I walked round Chinatown in the rain, and she taught me 毛毛雨 — 'fluffy rain', for drizzle. I like this word very much.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"下毛毛雨的时候，你打伞吗？","p":"Xià máomaoyǔ de shíhou, nǐ dǎ sǎn ma?","m":"Do you bother with an umbrella in drizzle?"},"replies":[{"t":"打，不想淋湿。","p":"Dǎ, bù xiǎng lín shī.","m":"Yes — I don't want to get wet.","r":{"t":"我也是，我的头发不喜欢雨。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, wǒ de tóufa bù xǐhuan yǔ.","m":"Me too. My hair doesn't like rain."}},{"t":"不打，一点雨没关系。","p":"Bù dǎ, yìdiǎn yǔ méi guānxi.","m":"No — a bit of rain is fine.","r":{"t":"你跟伦敦人一样！","p":"Nǐ gēn Lúndūn rén yíyàng!","m":"You're just like a Londoner!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天伦敦还在下小雨，我出门带着伞。","p":"Jīntiān Lúndūn hái zài xià xiǎoyǔ, wǒ chūmén dài zhe sǎn.","m":"Still drizzling in London today — I took my umbrella out."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我现在也不在家，在外面。","p":"Wǒ xiànzài yě bú zài jiā, zài wàimiàn.","m":"I'm not home right now either — I'm out."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那时候也不在家，在外面","en":"You said you were out too at that moment"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那时候也在外面。我觉得在外面也好，看到的东西多。我退休以后，一个人在家的时间太长了，所以我每天一定出门一次，哪怕只是去唐人街买一把葱。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nà shíhou yě zài wàimiàn. Wǒ juéde zài wàimiàn yě hǎo, kàn dào de dōngxi duō. Wǒ tuìxiū yǐhòu, yí gè rén zài jiā de shíjiān tài cháng le, suǒyǐ wǒ měi tiān yídìng chūmén yí cì, nǎpà zhǐ shì qù Tángrénjiē mǎi yì bǎ cōng.","m":"You said you were out too at that moment. I think being out is good — you see more. Since I retired I spend too long at home on my own, so I make sure I go out once every day, even if it's just to Chinatown for a bunch of spring onions.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天都会出门吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān dōu huì chūmén ma?","m":"Do you get out every day?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，天天出去。","p":"Huì, tiāntiān chūqù.","m":"Yes, every day.","r":{"t":"好的。出门了，人就不会太闷。","p":"Hǎo de. Chūmén le, rén jiù bú huì tài mèn.","m":"Good. Getting out keeps you from feeling shut in."}},{"t":"不一定，有时候一整天在家。","p":"Bù yídìng, yǒu shíhou yì zhěng tiān zài jiā.","m":"Not always — sometimes I'm in all day.","r":{"t":"我懂的。那就从楼下走一圈开始。","p":"Wǒ dǒng de. Nà jiù cóng lóu xià zǒu yì quān kāishǐ.","m":"I understand. Start with one walk round the block."}}],"next":{"t":"今天带 Biscuit 出去走了一小圈，它走得很慢。","p":"Jīntiān dài Biscuit chūqù zǒu le yì xiǎo quān, tā zǒu de hěn màn.","m":"Took Biscuit out for a little walk today, very slowly."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去唐人街买什么？","p":"Nǐ qù Tángrénjiē mǎi shénme?","m":"What are you buying in Chinatown?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去唐人街买什么（饺子皮和白菜，晚上想自己包饺子）","en":"You asked what she was buying in Chinatown (dumpling wrappers and cabbage, to make dumplings herself)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我去唐人街买什么。饺子皮和白菜。那天晚上我包了二十个饺子，有一半煮破了。梁阿姨说：「破了的也是饺子。」我觉得她说得对。学东西也是这样。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ qù Tángrénjiē mǎi shénme. Jiǎozi pí hé báicài. Nà tiān wǎnshang wǒ bāo le èrshí gè jiǎozi, yǒu yíbàn zhǔ pò le. Liáng āyí shuō: “Pò le de yě shì jiǎozi.” Wǒ juéde tā shuō de duì. Xué dōngxi yě shì zhèyàng.","m":"Last time you asked what I was buying in Chinatown. Dumpling wrappers and cabbage. That evening I made twenty, and half of them split in the pot. Auntie Liang said: 'A split dumpling is still a dumpling.' I think she is right. Learning anything is like that.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你学一样新东西，会怕做得不好吗？","p":"Nǐ xué yí yàng xīn dōngxi, huì pà zuò de bù hǎo ma?","m":"When you learn something new, do you worry about doing it badly?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，常常怕。","p":"Huì, chángcháng pà.","m":"Yes, often.","r":{"t":"我也是。可是到了我这个年纪，我决定不怕了。","p":"Wǒ yě shì. Kěshì dào le wǒ zhège niánjì, wǒ juédìng bú pà le.","m":"Me too. But at my age, I've decided not to be."}},{"t":"不怕，先做再说。","p":"Bú pà, xiān zuò zài shuō.","m":"No — I just have a go.","r":{"t":"好！我要跟你学。","p":"Hǎo! Wǒ yào gēn nǐ xué.","m":"Good! I should learn from you."}}],"next":{"t":"剩下的饺子皮，今天又包了十个，这次只破了两个。","p":"Shèngxià de jiǎozi pí, jīntiān yòu bāo le shí gè, zhè cì zhǐ pò le liǎng gè.","m":"Used the leftover wrappers for ten more today — only two split this time."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"灯笼一直挂着吗？","p":"Dēnglong yìzhí guà zhe ma?","m":"Are the lanterns up all the time?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过唐人街的灯笼是不是一直挂着（一年四季都挂着，过年更多）","en":"You asked if Chinatown's lanterns are always up (all year, more at New Year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问唐人街的灯笼是不是一直挂着。是的，一年四季都挂着。这两天我发现有几家店门口又挂了新的。梁阿姨说，快过年了，她今年不回国，要在伦敦过。她说着说着，声音小了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Tángrénjiē de dēnglong shì bu shì yìzhí guà zhe. Shì de, yì nián sì jì dōu guà zhe. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn yǒu jǐ jiā diàn ménkǒu yòu guà le xīn de. Liáng āyí shuō, kuài guònián le, tā jīnnián bù huí guó, yào zài Lúndūn guò. Tā shuō zhe shuō zhe, shēngyīn xiǎo le.","m":"Last time you asked whether Chinatown's lanterns stay up all the time. Yes, all year round. These days I noticed a few shops have hung new ones. Auntie Liang said New Year's coming, and this year she's not going back to China — she'll spend it in London. Her voice got quieter as she said it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"过节的时候不能回家，你有过吗？","p":"Guòjié de shíhou bù néng huí jiā, nǐ yǒu guo ma?","m":"Have you ever been away from home for a big holiday?"},"replies":[{"t":"有过，很想家。","p":"Yǒu guo, hěn xiǎng jiā.","m":"Yes — I was homesick.","r":{"t":"那你懂她。我要请她来我家吃饭。","p":"Nà nǐ dǒng tā. Wǒ yào qǐng tā lái wǒ jiā chī fàn.","m":"Then you understand her. I'm going to invite her to dinner at mine."}},{"t":"没有，每次都能回去。","p":"Méiyǒu, měi cì dōu néng huíqù.","m":"No, I always make it back.","r":{"t":"那很好。好好珍惜。","p":"Nà hěn hǎo. Hǎohǎo zhēnxī.","m":"That's very good. Treasure it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又路过唐人街，灯笼在雨里还是那么红。","p":"Jīntiān yòu lùguò Tángrénjiē, dēnglong zài yǔ lǐ háishi nàme hóng.","m":"Passed Chinatown again today — the lanterns still so red in the rain."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也出太阳了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě chū tàiyáng le.","m":"The sun's out here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也出太阳了","en":"You said the sun was out where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也出太阳了。里斯本这两天一直很晴，我每天中午上屋顶晒十分钟。一个人旅行久了，有时候会很累。晒一会儿太阳，我就又想出门了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě chū tàiyáng le. Lǐsīběn zhè liǎng tiān yìzhí hěn qíng, wǒ měi tiān zhōngwǔ shàng wūdǐng shài shí fēnzhōng. Yí gè rén lǚxíng jiǔ le, yǒu shíhou huì hěn lèi. Shài yíhuìr tàiyáng, wǒ jiù yòu xiǎng chūmén le.","m":"You said the sun was out where you were too. Lisbon's been clear these days, and every noon I go up on the roof for ten minutes of sun. When you've travelled alone a long time, you get tired sometimes. A bit of sun and I want to go out again.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你累的时候，什么能让你缓过来？","p":"Nǐ lèi de shíhou, shénme néng ràng nǐ huǎn guòlái?","m":"When you're worn out, what helps you recover?"},"replies":[{"t":"睡一觉。","p":"Shuì yí jiào.","m":"A good sleep.","r":{"t":"对，睡觉是最好的药。","p":"Duì, shuìjiào shì zuì hǎo de yào.","m":"Right — sleep is the best medicine."}},{"t":"出去走走。","p":"Chūqù zǒuzou.","m":"A walk.","r":{"t":"我们一样！走着走着就好了。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Zǒu zhe zǒu zhe jiù hǎo le.","m":"Same as me! Keep walking and it passes."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又上屋顶晒太阳了。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu shàng wūdǐng shài tàiyáng le.","m":"Up on the roof in the sun again at noon today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边天已经黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tiān yǐjīng hēi le.","m":"It's already dark here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天已经黑了","en":"You said it was already dark where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边天已经黑了，我这边才中午。这两天我在想：我妈在法国，跟里斯本差一个小时。差一个小时，我也常常忘了给她打电话。我决定每个星期天打一次，写在本子上了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tiān yǐjīng hēi le, wǒ zhèbiān cái zhōngwǔ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài xiǎng: wǒ mā zài Fǎguó, gēn Lǐsīběn chà yí gè xiǎoshí. Zhǐ chà yí gè xiǎoshí, wǒ yě chángcháng wàng le gěi tā dǎ diànhuà. Wǒ juédìng měi gè xīngqītiān dǎ yí cì, xiě zài běnzi shang le.","m":"You said it was already dark where you were, and it was only midday here. These days I've been thinking: my mum's in France, one hour from Lisbon. Only one hour, and I still often forget to call her. I've decided to call every Sunday — it's written in my notebook.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你多久给家里人打一次电话？","p":"Nǐ duō jiǔ gěi jiā lǐ rén dǎ yí cì diànhuà?","m":"How often do you call your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"差不多每天。","p":"Chàbuduō měi tiān.","m":"Almost every day.","r":{"t":"你家人一定很开心。","p":"Nǐ jiārén yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"Your family must love that."}},{"t":"不太常打。","p":"Bú tài cháng dǎ.","m":"Not that often.","r":{"t":"我也是，我们一起改改吧。","p":"Wǒ yě shì, wǒmen yìqǐ gǎigai ba.","m":"Me neither — let's both work on it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天给我妈发了一条消息，她马上就回了。","p":"Jīntiān gěi wǒ mā fā le yì tiáo xiāoxi, tā mǎshàng jiù huí le.","m":"Messaged my mum today — she replied straight away."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你是在哪儿拍的？","p":"Nǐ shì zài nǎr pāi de?","m":"Where did you take it from?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在哪儿（青旅的屋顶，能看到半个里斯本）","en":"You asked where she was (the hostel roof — half of Lisbon in view)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我在哪儿，是青旅的屋顶。这两天屋顶上多了一张小桌子，是一个巴西女孩搬上来的。她刚辞了工作，出来想清楚下一步做什么。我们晚上在上面聊了很久：怎么知道一个决定是对的？","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zài nǎr, shì qīnglǚ de wūdǐng. Zhè liǎng tiān wūdǐng shang duō le yì zhāng xiǎo zhuōzi, shì yí gè Bāxī nǚhái bān shànglái de. Tā gāng cí le gōngzuò, chūlái xiǎng qīngchu xià yí bù zuò shénme. Wǒmen wǎnshang zài shàngmiàn liáo le hěn jiǔ: zěnme zhīdào yí gè juédìng shì duì de?","m":"Last time you asked where I was — the hostel roof. These days a little table appeared up there; a Brazilian girl carried it up. She's just quit her job and come away to work out what's next. We talked up there for ages one evening: how do you know a decision is the right one?","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你做大决定的时候，会问别人吗？","p":"Nǐ zuò dà juédìng de shíhou, huì wèn biérén ma?","m":"When you make a big decision, do you ask other people?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，问家人或者朋友。","p":"Huì, wèn jiārén huòzhě péngyou.","m":"Yes — family or friends.","r":{"t":"对，说出来就清楚一半了。","p":"Duì, shuō chūlái jiù qīngchu yíbàn le.","m":"Right — saying it out loud gets you halfway."}},{"t":"不太问，自己想。","p":"Bú tài wèn, zìjǐ xiǎng.","m":"Not really — I think it through alone.","r":{"t":"也好，最后还是自己知道。","p":"Yě hǎo, zuìhòu háishi zìjǐ zhīdào.","m":"That works too — in the end you're the one who knows."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在屋顶上坐了一下午。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài wūdǐng shang zuò le yí xiàwǔ.","m":"Sat up on the roof all afternoon again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"电车开得快吗？","p":"Diànchē kāi de kuài ma?","m":"Is the tram fast?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过电车开得快不快（特别慢，走路都比它快）","en":"You asked if the tram is fast (very slow — walking's faster)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问电车开得快不快。特别慢！这两天我坐了一次 28 路，晃了四十分钟。旁边一个老奶奶说，她坐这路车坐了六十年，去上班、去医院、去看孙子。慢一点没关系，她说，「重要的是车上的人」。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn diànchē kāi de kuài bu kuài. Tèbié màn! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zuò le yí cì èrshíbā lù, huàng le sìshí fēnzhōng. Pángbiān yí gè lǎo nǎinai shuō, tā zuò zhè lù chē zuò le liùshí nián, qù shàngbān, qù yīyuàn, qù kàn sūnzi. Màn yìdiǎn méi guānxi, tā shuō, “zhòngyào de shì chē shang de rén”.","m":"Last time you asked if the tram's fast. Super slow! These days I rode the 28 — forty minutes of rattling. An old lady next to me said she's ridden that line for sixty years: to work, to hospital, to see her grandchildren. Slow doesn't matter, she said — 'what matters is the people on board.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天坐的车上，有没有常见的人？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān zuò de chē shang, yǒu méiyǒu cháng jiàn de rén?","m":"On your everyday commute, are there faces you always see?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，几个熟面孔。","p":"Yǒu, jǐ gè shú miànkǒng.","m":"Yes — a few familiar faces.","r":{"t":"哪天跟他们说一句「早」吧。","p":"Nǎ tiān gēn tāmen shuō yí jù “zǎo” ba.","m":"Say 'morning' to them one day."}},{"t":"没注意过。","p":"Méi zhùyì guo.","m":"Never noticed.","r":{"t":"下次看看，说不定有。","p":"Xià cì kànkan, shuōbudìng yǒu.","m":"Have a look next time — there might be."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在楼下又听到电车慢慢爬上来的声音。","p":"Jīntiān zài lóu xià yòu tīng dào diànchē mànmàn pá shànglái de shēngyīn.","m":"Heard the tram creeping up the hill below again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是早上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì zǎoshang.","m":"It's morning here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边也是早上。放假了，我每天早上陪外婆坐一会儿。她讲以前的波哥大。这两天她说，她十七岁的时候，跟我一样大，一个人坐公交车去城里找工作。我听了很久。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì zǎoshang. Fàngjià le, wǒ měi tiān zǎoshang péi wàipó zuò yíhuìr. Tā jiǎng yǐqián de Bōgēdà. Zhè liǎng tiān tā shuō, tā shíqī suì de shíhou, gēn wǒ yíyàng dà, yí gè rén zuò gōngjiāochē qù chéng lǐ zhǎo gōngzuò. Wǒ tīng le hěn jiǔ.","m":"You said it was morning there too. I'm on holiday, so every morning I sit with Abuela (my mum's mum — she lives with us). She talks about old Bogotá. These days she told me that at seventeen — my age — she took the bus into the city alone to find work. I listened for a long time.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你听过家里老人讲他们年轻时候的事吗？","p":"Nǐ tīng guo jiā lǐ lǎorén jiǎng tāmen niánqīng shíhou de shì ma?","m":"Have you heard the older people in your family talk about when they were young?"},"replies":[{"t":"听过，很有意思。","p":"Tīng guo, hěn yǒu yìsi.","m":"Yes — it's fascinating.","r":{"t":"对吧！他们的故事比电影还好看。","p":"Duì ba! Tāmen de gùshi bǐ diànyǐng hái hǎokàn.","m":"Right? Better than any film."}},{"t":"很少听。","p":"Hěn shǎo tīng.","m":"Not much.","r":{"t":"下次问问吧，他们都在等人问。","p":"Xià cì wènwen ba, tāmen dōu zài děng rén wèn.","m":"Ask next time — they're waiting to be asked."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上又陪外婆坐了一会儿。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang yòu péi wàipó zuò le yíhuìr.","m":"Sat with Abuela again this morning."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"吃了，喝了一杯咖啡。","p":"Chī le, hē le yì bēi kāfēi.","m":"Yes — I had a coffee."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那天早上喝了一杯咖啡","en":"You said you'd had a coffee that morning"},"later":{"t":"你说你早上也喝咖啡。可是医生说，外婆的心跳有点快，咖啡要少喝。她一天喝五杯 tinto！我现在偷偷给她换不含咖啡因的。她还不知道，哈哈。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ zǎoshang yě hē kāfēi. Kěshì yīshēng shuō, wàipó de xīntiào yǒudiǎn kuài, kāfēi yào shǎo hē. Tā yì tiān hē wǔ bēi tinto! Wǒ xiànzài tōutōu gěi tā huàn bù hán kāfēiyīn de. Tā hái bù zhīdào, hāha.","m":"You said you have coffee in the morning too. But the doctor says Abuela's heart is a bit fast — less coffee. She drinks five tintos a day! Now I secretly give her decaf. She doesn't know yet, haha.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人会听医生的话吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén huì tīng yīshēng de huà ma?","m":"Does your family listen to the doctor?"},"replies":[{"t":"不太听，跟你外婆一样。","p":"Bú tài tīng, gēn nǐ wàipó yíyàng.","m":"Not really — like your Abuela.","r":{"t":"老人都是这样，我们只好想办法。","p":"Lǎorén dōu shì zhèyàng, wǒmen zhǐhǎo xiǎng bànfǎ.","m":"Older people are all like that — we just have to be clever."}},{"t":"会，很听话。","p":"Huì, hěn tīnghuà.","m":"Yes, they do as they're told.","r":{"t":"真好！我外婆要是这样就好了。","p":"Zhēn hǎo! Wǒ wàipó yàoshi zhèyàng jiù hǎo le.","m":"Lucky! I wish Abuela did."}}],"next":{"t":"今天外婆的咖啡又是我煮的。她说今天的味道淡一点。","p":"Jīntiān wàipó de kāfēi yòu shì wǒ zhǔ de. Tā shuō jīntiān de wèidao dàn yìdiǎn.","m":"I made Abuela's coffee again today. She said it tastes a bit weaker."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"还没吃，来不及了。","p":"Hái méi chī, lái bu jí le.","m":"Not yet — no time."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那天早上来不及吃早饭","en":"You said you didn't have time for breakfast that morning"},"later":{"t":"你说你来不及吃早饭。外婆知道了，她说：「早饭一定要吃！」她年轻的时候上班，常常不吃，后来胃不好。所以……你要吃早饭！","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ láibují chī zǎofàn. Wàipó zhīdào le, tā shuō: “Zǎofàn yídìng yào chī!” Tā niánqīng de shíhou shàngbān, chángcháng bù chī, hòulái wèi bù hǎo. Suǒyǐ…… nǐ yào chī zǎofàn!","m":"You said you didn't have time for breakfast. Abuela heard and said: 'You must eat breakfast!' When she was young and working she often skipped it, and later her stomach was bad. So… eat breakfast!","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你忙的时候，早饭怎么解决？","p":"Nǐ máng de shíhou, zǎofàn zěnme jiějué?","m":"When you're busy, how do you sort out breakfast?"},"replies":[{"t":"路上随便买一点。","p":"Lù shang suíbiàn mǎi yìdiǎn.","m":"Grab something on the way.","r":{"t":"对，有就比没有好。","p":"Duì, yǒu jiù bǐ méiyǒu hǎo.","m":"Right — something beats nothing."}},{"t":"就不吃了。","p":"Jiù bù chī le.","m":"I just skip it.","r":{"t":"我外婆听到会不高兴的，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ wàipó tīng dào huì bù gāoxìng de, hāha.","m":"Abuela wouldn't like hearing that, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上外婆看着我把早饭吃完才让我走。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang wàipó kàn zhe wǒ bǎ zǎofàn chī wán cái ràng wǒ zǒu.","m":"Abuela watched me finish my breakfast before she'd let me go this morning."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在是晚上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài shì wǎnshang.","m":"It's evening here now."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边现在是晚上","en":"You said it was evening where you were"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边是晚上。我这边……早上九点！我复习中文，你睡觉。我们是……等一下等一下……接力！对，接力。一个人学，不孤单了。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān shì wǎnshang. Wǒ zhèbiān…… zǎoshang jiǔ diǎn! Wǒ fùxí Zhōngwén, nǐ shuìjiào. Wǒmen shì…… děng yíxià děng yíxià…… jiēlì! Duì, jiēlì. Yí gè rén xué, bù gūdān le.","m":"You said it was night where you are. Here it's… 9 am! I revise Chinese, you sleep. We're… wait, wait… a relay! Yes, a relay. Studying alone, not lonely now.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般什么时候学中文？","p":"Nǐ yìbān shénme shíhou xué Zhōngwén?","m":"When do you usually study Chinese?"},"replies":[{"t":"早上。","p":"Zǎoshang.","m":"Mornings.","r":{"t":"早上脑子最清楚！","p":"Zǎoshang nǎozi zuì qīngchu!","m":"Your head's clearest in the morning!"}},{"t":"晚上。","p":"Wǎnshang.","m":"Evenings.","r":{"t":"那我们正好接力。","p":"Nà wǒmen zhènghǎo jiēlì.","m":"Then we're a perfect relay."}}],"next":{"t":"今天复习的时候，我又想到了我们的接力。","p":"Jīntiān fùxí de shíhou, wǒ yòu xiǎng dào le wǒmen de jiēlì.","m":"Thought of our relay again while revising today."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你为什么九点才拍？","p":"Nǐ wèishénme jiǔ diǎn cái pāi?","m":"Why did you only take it at nine?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她为什么九点才拍（铃声响的时候她还在睡觉）","en":"You asked why she only took it at nine (she was still asleep when the bell went)"},"later":{"t":"你问我为什么那么晚。铃响的时候，我是在睡觉！这两天我定了闹钟，想早起复习。可是……我关了，又睡了。外婆说：十七岁，要多睡觉。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ wèishénme nàme wǎn. Líng xiǎng de shíhou, wǒ shì zài shuìjiào! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dìng le nàozhōng, xiǎng zǎo qǐ fùxí. Kěshì…… wǒ guān le, yòu shuì le. Wàipó shuō: shíqī suì, yào duō shuìjiào.","m":"You asked why I was so late. When the bell rang, I was sleeping! These days I set an alarm to get up early and revise. But… I turned it off and slept again. Abuela says: at seventeen, you need lots of sleep.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"放假的时候，你几点起床？","p":"Fàngjià de shíhou, nǐ jǐ diǎn qǐchuáng?","m":"What time do you get up on holidays?"},"replies":[{"t":"跟平时一样。","p":"Gēn píngshí yíyàng.","m":"Same as usual.","r":{"t":"你好有毅力！","p":"Nǐ hǎo yǒu yìlì!","m":"Such willpower!"}},{"t":"睡到自然醒。","p":"Shuì dào zìrán xǐng.","m":"Whenever I wake up.","r":{"t":"我们一样，哈哈。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng, hāha.","m":"Same as me, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又是八点半才起，放假就是这样。","p":"Jīntiān yòu shì bā diǎn bàn cái qǐ, fàngjià jiù shì zhèyàng.","m":"Half eight again today — that's holidays."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"山上一直有云吗？","p":"Shān shang yìzhí yǒu yún ma?","m":"Are the mountains always in cloud?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过山上是不是一直有云（早上常常有，中午就散了）","en":"You asked if there's always cloud on the mountains (often in the morning, gone by noon)"},"later":{"t":"你问山上是不是一直有云。早上常常有。这两天我在窗口看：十一点，云走了，山出来了。考试前我很紧张，也像早上的云。等一等，就好了。","p":"Nǐ wèn shān shang shì bu shì yìzhí yǒu yún. Zǎoshang chángcháng yǒu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài chuāngkǒu kàn: shíyī diǎn, yún zǒu le, shān chūlái le. Kǎoshì qián wǒ hěn jǐnzhāng, yě xiàng zǎoshang de yún. Děng yi děng, jiù hǎo le.","m":"You asked if there are always clouds on the mountains. Often in the morning. These days I watched from the window: at eleven the clouds left and the mountain came out. Before my exam I'm nervous — like the morning clouds. Wait a little, and it's fine.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你紧张的时候，会怎么办？","p":"Nǐ jǐnzhāng de shíhou, huì zěnme bàn?","m":"What do you do when you're nervous?"},"replies":[{"t":"深呼吸。","p":"Shēn hūxī.","m":"Breathe deeply.","r":{"t":"对，我考试前也要深呼吸三次。","p":"Duì, wǒ kǎoshì qián yě yào shēn hūxī sān cì.","m":"Yes — I'll take three deep breaths before my exam too."}},{"t":"找人说说。","p":"Zhǎo rén shuōshuo.","m":"Talk to someone.","r":{"t":"好办法，我就找我外婆。","p":"Hǎo bànfǎ, wǒ jiù zhǎo wǒ wàipó.","m":"Good idea — I'd ask Abuela."}}],"next":{"t":"今天山上的云十点就散了，比平时早。","p":"Jīntiān shān shang de yún shí diǎn jiù sàn le, bǐ píngshí zǎo.","m":"The cloud on the mountains lifted at ten today — earlier than usual."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边太阳也很毒。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tàiyáng yě hěn dú.","m":"The sun's brutal here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太阳也很毒","en":"You said the sun was brutal where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边太阳也很毒。这两天工地更热了，有个年轻工人中暑晕倒了。还好没事。现在我们规定：中午十二点到两点不干重活，每个人身上都要带水。工地上最重要的不是进度，是人。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tàiyáng yě hěn dú. Zhè liǎng tiān gōngdì gèng rè le, yǒu gè niánqīng gōngrén zhòngshǔ yūn dǎo le. Hái hǎo méi shì. Xiànzài wǒmen guīdìng: zhōngwǔ shí'èr diǎn dào liǎng diǎn bú gàn zhòng huó, měi gè rén shēn shang dōu yào dài shuǐ. Gōngdì shang zuì zhòngyào de bú shì jìndù, shì rén.","m":"You said the sun was brutal where you were too. These days the site got even hotter, and a young worker fainted from the heat. He's OK, thank God. Now we have a rule: no heavy work from twelve to two, and everyone carries water. On a site, the most important thing isn't the schedule — it's the people.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"天太热的时候，你怎么照顾自己？","p":"Tiān tài rè de shíhou, nǐ zěnme zhàogu zìjǐ?","m":"How do you look after yourself in the heat?"},"replies":[{"t":"多喝水。","p":"Duō hē shuǐ.","m":"Drink lots of water.","r":{"t":"对，我一天喝三瓶。","p":"Duì, wǒ yì tiān hē sān píng.","m":"Right — I drink three bottles a day."}},{"t":"尽量待在屋里。","p":"Jǐnliàng dāi zài wū lǐ.","m":"Stay indoors if I can.","r":{"t":"聪明！能躲就躲。","p":"Cōngming! Néng duǒ jiù duǒ.","m":"Smart! Hide when you can."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午，大家都在阴凉里休息，没人干重活。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ, dàjiā dōu zài yīnliáng lǐ xiūxi, méi rén gàn zhòng huó.","m":"At noon today everyone rested in the shade — no heavy work."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边很冷，没有太阳。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān hěn lěng, méiyǒu tàiyáng.","m":"It's cold here, no sun."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边很冷，没有太阳","en":"You said it was cold where you were, no sun"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边很冷，没有太阳。我从来没在冬天穿过大衣。这两天长沙的同事跟我说，他们那边只有几度，办公室没有暖气，大家穿着羽绒服开会。他一个人在拉各斯过了两年夏天，说最想家的时候，就是想念冷。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān hěn lěng, méiyǒu tàiyáng. Wǒ cónglái méi zài dōngtiān chuān guo dàyī. Zhè liǎng tiān Chángshā de tóngshì gēn wǒ shuō, tāmen nàbiān zhǐ yǒu jǐ dù, bàngōngshì méiyǒu nuǎnqì, dàjiā chuān zhe yǔróngfú kāihuì. Tā yí gè rén zài Lāgèsī guò le liǎng nián xiàtiān, shuō zuì xiǎng jiā de shíhou, jiù shì xiǎngniàn lěng.","m":"You said it was cold where you were, no sun. I've never worn a winter coat in my life. These days a colleague from Changsha told me it's only a few degrees there, the offices have no heating, and people hold meetings in down jackets. He's spent two years of endless summer alone in Lagos, and says when he's most homesick, what he misses is the cold.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"离开家的时候，你最想念的是什么？","p":"Líkāi jiā de shíhou, nǐ zuì xiǎngniàn de shì shénme?","m":"When you're away from home, what do you miss most?"},"replies":[{"t":"家里人。","p":"Jiā lǐ rén.","m":"My family.","r":{"t":"对，人最难离开。","p":"Duì, rén zuì nán líkāi.","m":"Right — people are hardest to leave."}},{"t":"家里的饭。","p":"Jiā lǐ de fàn.","m":"Home cooking.","r":{"t":"我也是！在长沙的时候我天天想 jollof。","p":"Wǒ yě shì! Zài Chángshā de shíhou wǒ tiāntiān xiǎng jollof.","m":"Me too! In Changsha I dreamed of jollof every day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天拉各斯三十二度，我把一点太阳寄给你，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān Lāgèsī sānshí'èr dù, wǒ bǎ yìdiǎn tàiyáng jì gěi nǐ, hāha.","m":"32 degrees in Lagos today — I'm posting you some sun, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"集装箱办公室热吗？","p":"Jízhuāngxiāng bàngōngshì rè ma?","m":"Is the container office hot?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过集装箱办公室热不热（有空调，一出门就像进了烤箱）","en":"You asked if the container office is hot (air con inside, an oven outside)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问集装箱办公室热不热。有空调，还好。可是这两天空调坏了一个下午！我们只好把图纸搬到桥下面的阴凉里看，风一吹，图纸到处飞。一个工人帮我追图纸，追了五十米。我请他喝了一瓶水，我们第一次聊了他的家。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn jízhuāngxiāng bàngōngshì rè bu rè. Yǒu kōngtiáo, hái hǎo. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān kōngtiáo huài le yí gè xiàwǔ! Wǒmen zhǐhǎo bǎ túzhǐ bān dào qiáo xiàmiàn de yīnliáng lǐ kàn, fēng yì chuī, túzhǐ dàochù fēi. Yí gè gōngrén bāng wǒ zhuī túzhǐ, zhuī le wǔshí mǐ. Wǒ qǐng tā hē le yì píng shuǐ, wǒmen dì yī cì liáo le tā de jiā.","m":"Last time you asked if the container office is hot. There's air con, so it's OK. But these days the air con died for an afternoon! We carried the drawings into the shade under the bridge, and every gust sent them flying. One worker chased a drawing fifty metres for me. I bought him a bottle of water, and for the first time we talked about his family.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟一起工作或者学习的人，会聊家里的事吗？","p":"Nǐ gēn yìqǐ gōngzuò huòzhě xuéxí de rén, huì liáo jiā lǐ de shì ma?","m":"Do you talk about family with people you work or study with?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，跟几个好朋友。","p":"Huì, gēn jǐ gè hǎo péngyou.","m":"Yes, with a few close ones.","r":{"t":"真好，一起干活的人也可以是朋友。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, yìqǐ gàn huó de rén yě kěyǐ shì péngyou.","m":"Nice — the people you work with can be friends too."}},{"t":"很少聊。","p":"Hěn shǎo liáo.","m":"Rarely.","r":{"t":"我以前也是。一张图纸改变了我，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě shì. Yì zhāng túzhǐ gǎibiàn le wǒ, hāha.","m":"I used to be the same. One flying drawing changed that, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天集装箱里很凉快，外面还是像烤箱。","p":"Jīntiān jízhuāngxiāng lǐ hěn liángkuai, wàimiàn háishi xiàng kǎoxiāng.","m":"Cool in the container today — still an oven outside."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们在盖什么？","p":"Nǐmen zài gài shénme?","m":"What are you building?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们在盖什么（一座桥，明年通车）","en":"You asked what they're building (a bridge, open next year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们在盖什么。一座桥。这两天桥的最后一段合龙了！我站在上面想：以后每天会有几万人从这里走，去上班、去看家人、去医院。他们不会知道我是谁，可是我知道这座桥。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen zài gài shénme. Yí zuò qiáo. Zhè liǎng tiān qiáo de zuìhòu yí duàn hélóng le! Wǒ zhàn zài shàngmiàn xiǎng: yǐhòu měi tiān huì yǒu jǐ wàn rén cóng zhèlǐ zǒu, qù shàngbān, qù kàn jiārén, qù yīyuàn. Tāmen bú huì zhīdào wǒ shì shéi, kěshì wǒ zhīdào zhè zuò qiáo.","m":"Last time you asked what we're building. A bridge. These days the last section joined in the middle! Standing on it I thought: one day tens of thousands of people will cross here every day — to work, to see family, to hospital. They'll never know who I am, but I'll know this bridge.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你做过让你觉得骄傲的事吗？","p":"Nǐ zuò guo ràng nǐ juéde jiāo'ào de shì ma?","m":"Have you done something that makes you proud?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一件小事。","p":"Yǒu, yí jiàn xiǎo shì.","m":"Yes — a small thing.","r":{"t":"小事也算！骄傲不分大小。","p":"Xiǎo shì yě suàn! Jiāo'ào bù fēn dà xiǎo.","m":"Small things count! Pride comes in all sizes."}},{"t":"还在等那一件。","p":"Hái zài děng nà yí jiàn.","m":"Still waiting for it.","r":{"t":"会来的。你现在做的，也许就是。","p":"Huì lái de. Nǐ xiànzài zuò de, yěxǔ jiù shì.","m":"It'll come. What you're doing now might be it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天站在桥上，第一次从这头走到了那头。","p":"Jīntiān zhàn zài qiáo shang, dì yī cì cóng zhè tóu zǒu dào le nà tóu.","m":"Walked from one end of the bridge to the other today — first time."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边太阳也很刺眼。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tàiyáng yě hěn cìyǎn.","m":"The sun's blinding here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太阳也很刺眼","en":"You said the sun was glaring where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边太阳也很刺眼。这两天我带团去卢克索，那边的太阳比开罗还厉害。团里一位七十岁的阿姨不舒服，我陪她在车上休息，没去神庙。她拉着我的手说：「你像我的孙女。」那天我没讲解，可是觉得很值。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tàiyáng yě hěn cìyǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ dài tuán qù Lúkèsuǒ, nàbiān de tàiyáng bǐ Kāiluó hái lìhai. Tuán lǐ yí wèi qīshí suì de āyí bù shūfu, wǒ péi tā zài chē shang xiūxi, méi qù shénmiào. Tā lā zhe wǒ de shǒu shuō: “Nǐ xiàng wǒ de sūnnǚ.” Nà tiān wǒ méi jiǎngjiě, kěshì juéde hěn zhí.","m":"You said the sun was glaring where you were too. These days I took a group to Luxor, where the sun is even fiercer than Cairo. A seventy-year-old lady in the group felt unwell, so I stayed with her on the bus instead of going to the temple. She held my hand and said: 'You're like my granddaughter.' I didn't guide anything that day, but it felt worth it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有照顾过不认识的人？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu zhàogu guo bú rènshi de rén?","m":"Have you ever looked after a stranger?"},"replies":[{"t":"有过。","p":"Yǒu guo.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那你懂那种感觉。","p":"Nà nǐ dǒng nà zhǒng gǎnjué.","m":"Then you know the feeling."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"I don't think so.","r":{"t":"会有机会的。一杯水也算。","p":"Huì yǒu jīhuì de. Yì bēi shuǐ yě suàn.","m":"You'll get the chance. Even a glass of water counts."}}],"next":{"t":"今天出门忘了戴墨镜，眼睛一直眯着。","p":"Jīntiān chūmén wàng le dài mòjìng, yǎnjing yìzhí mī zhe.","m":"Forgot my sunglasses today — squinting all day."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边看不到太阳，是阴天。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān kàn bu dào tàiyáng, shì yīntiān.","m":"I can't see the sun here — it's cloudy."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边看不到太阳，是阴天","en":"You said it was cloudy where you were, no sun"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是阴天。开罗一年下雨的日子很少。这两天居然下了一点点雨，楼下下棋的大叔们赶紧把棋盘搬进了咖啡馆。他们几个从年轻下到现在，有一个上个月走了，他的椅子大家还留着。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì yīntiān. Kāiluó yì nián xià yǔ de rìzi hěn shǎo. Zhè liǎng tiān jūrán xià le yìdiǎndiǎn yǔ, lóu xià xià qí de dàshūmen gǎnjǐn bǎ qípán bān jìn le kāfēiguǎn. Tāmen jǐ gè cóng niánqīng xià dào xiànzài, yǒu yí gè shàng gè yuè zǒu le, tā de yǐzi dàjiā hái liú zhe.","m":"You said it was cloudy where you were. Cairo has very few rainy days a year. These days it actually spat a little rain, and the uncles playing downstairs rushed their board into the café. They've played together since they were young; one of them passed away last month, and they still keep his chair.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有认识很久很久的朋友？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu rènshi hěn jiǔ hěn jiǔ de péngyou?","m":"Do you have a friend you've known for a very long time?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，从小就认识。","p":"Yǒu, cóng xiǎo jiù rènshi.","m":"Yes, since we were kids.","r":{"t":"那是最珍贵的。常联系吧。","p":"Nà shì zuì zhēnguì de. Cháng liánxì ba.","m":"That's the most precious kind. Keep in touch."}},{"t":"没有，常常搬家。","p":"Méiyǒu, chángcháng bānjiā.","m":"No — I moved around a lot.","r":{"t":"那就从现在开始，几十年后也是老朋友。","p":"Nà jiù cóng xiànzài kāishǐ, jǐ shí nián hòu yě shì lǎo péngyou.","m":"Then start now — in a few decades they'll be old friends."}}],"next":{"t":"今天天上有几朵云，我看了好久。","p":"Jīntiān tiān shang yǒu jǐ duǒ yún, wǒ kàn le hǎo jiǔ.","m":"There were a few clouds today — I watched them for ages."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"为什么那么多卫星天线？","p":"Wèishénme nàme duō wèixīng tiānxiàn?","m":"Why so many satellite dishes?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过为什么有那么多卫星天线（家家都用它看电视）","en":"You asked why there are so many satellite dishes (every home watches TV on one)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问为什么那么多卫星天线。家家都用它看电视。这两天我陪我妈看了一部中国电视剧，配的是阿拉伯语。她看到女儿离家去外国读书那一段，突然问我：「你以后也会走吗？」我不知道怎么回答。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wèishénme nàme duō wèixīng tiānxiàn. Jiājiā dōu yòng tā kàn diànshì. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ péi wǒ mā kàn le yí bù Zhōngguó diànshìjù, pèi de shì Ālābóyǔ. Tā kàn dào nǚ'ér lí jiā qù wàiguó dú shū nà yí duàn, tūrán wèn wǒ: “Nǐ yǐhòu yě huì zǒu ma?” Wǒ bù zhīdào zěnme huídá.","m":"Last time you asked why there are so many satellite dishes. Every home uses one for TV. These days I watched a Chinese drama with my mum, dubbed into Arabic. When it got to the daughter leaving home to study abroad, Mum suddenly asked me: 'Will you leave one day too?' I didn't know what to say.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"要是有机会去国外，你会去吗？","p":"Yàoshi yǒu jīhuì qù guówài, nǐ huì qù ma?","m":"If you had the chance to go abroad, would you?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，想去看看。","p":"Huì, xiǎng qù kànkan.","m":"Yes — I'd like to see it.","r":{"t":"我也想……可是我也想我妈。","p":"Wǒ yě xiǎng…… kěshì wǒ yě xiǎng wǒ mā.","m":"Me too… but I'd miss my mum."}},{"t":"不会，想留在家。","p":"Bú huì, xiǎng liú zài jiā.","m":"No — I'd stay home.","r":{"t":"留下来也是一种勇敢。","p":"Liú xiàlái yě shì yì zhǒng yǒnggǎn.","m":"Staying is a kind of courage too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天陪我妈又看了一集，我们都没说话。","p":"Jīntiān péi wǒ mā yòu kàn le yì jí, wǒmen dōu méi shuōhuà.","m":"Watched another episode with Mum today. Neither of us said much."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会下双陆棋吗？","p":"Nǐ huì xià shuānglùqí ma?","m":"Can you play backgammon?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她会不会下双陆棋（会一点，爸爸教的，总是输）","en":"You asked if she plays backgammon (a little, Dad taught her, she always loses)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会下双陆棋。会一点，总是输。这两天我跟我爸下了三盘，赢了一盘！他说是他让我的。我发现他下棋的时候话特别多，平时很少说的事，都在棋盘上说了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì xià shuānglùqí. Huì yìdiǎn, zǒngshì shū. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn wǒ bà xià le sān pán, yíng le yì pán! Tā shuō shì tā ràng wǒ de. Wǒ fāxiàn tā xià qí de shíhou huà tèbié duō, píngshí hěn shǎo shuō de shì, dōu zài qípán shang shuō le.","m":"Last time you asked if I can play backgammon. A bit — I always lose. These days I played my dad three games and won one! He says he let me win. I noticed he talks much more when we play — things he rarely says, he says over the board.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟爸爸或者妈妈，一起做什么的时候最能聊？","p":"Nǐ gēn bàba huòzhě māma, yìqǐ zuò shénme de shíhou zuì néng liáo?","m":"What do you do with your parents when you talk the most?"},"replies":[{"t":"一起吃饭的时候。","p":"Yìqǐ chī fàn de shíhou.","m":"Over a meal.","r":{"t":"对，饭桌上什么都能说。","p":"Duì, fànzhuō shang shénme dōu néng shuō.","m":"Right — anything can be said at the table."}},{"t":"坐车的时候。","p":"Zuò chē de shíhou.","m":"In the car.","r":{"t":"对对，不用看着对方，反而好说。","p":"Duì duì, bú yòng kàn zhe duìfāng, fǎn'ér hǎo shuō.","m":"Yes — not facing each other makes it easier."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我爸又找我下棋，我说好。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ bà yòu zhǎo wǒ xià qí, wǒ shuō hǎo.","m":"Dad asked for a game again today. I said yes."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边对面的灯也都亮了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān duìmiàn de dēng yě dōu liàng le.","m":"The lights across the way are on here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边对面的灯也都亮了","en":"You said the lights across from you were all on too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边对面的灯也都亮了。这两天我注意到，对面五楼只有一个窗户，每天很晚才亮。我猜是一个人住，加班到很晚。我以前也是这样过了三年。希望那个人回家有一碗热的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān duìmiàn de dēng yě dōu liàng le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zhùyì dào, duìmiàn wǔ lóu yǒu yí gè chuānghu, měi tiān hěn wǎn cái liàng. Wǒ cāi shì yí gè rén zhù, jiābān dào hěn wǎn. Wǒ yǐqián yě shì zhèyàng guò le sān nián. Xīwàng nà gè rén huí jiā yǒu yì wǎn rè de.","m":"You said the lights across from you were all on too. These days I noticed one window on the fifth floor opposite only lights up very late. I guess someone lives alone and works late. I lived like that for three years. I hope that person has something hot to eat when they get home.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般几点到家？","p":"Nǐ yìbān jǐ diǎn dào jiā?","m":"What time do you usually get home?"},"replies":[{"t":"挺早的。","p":"Tǐng zǎo de.","m":"Pretty early.","r":{"t":"真好，晚上是自己的。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, wǎnshang shì zìjǐ de.","m":"Lovely — your evenings are yours."}},{"t":"常常很晚。","p":"Chángcháng hěn wǎn.","m":"Often late.","r":{"t":"辛苦了。回家记得吃点热的。","p":"Xīnkǔ le. Huí jiā jìde chī diǎn rè de.","m":"That's hard. Eat something hot when you get in."}}],"next":{"t":"今天对面五楼那个窗户，十点才亮。","p":"Jīntiān duìmiàn wǔ lóu nà gè chuānghu, shí diǎn cái liàng.","m":"That fifth-floor window opposite didn't light up till ten today."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边还是白天。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān háishi báitiān.","m":"It's still daytime here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边还是白天","en":"You said it was still daytime where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边还是白天。这两天我在课上问学生：「你们家现在几点？」一个班，说了五个不同的时间。有个学生说，他每天等到半夜才给妈妈打电话，因为那时候她刚下班。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān hái shì báitiān. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài kè shang wèn xuésheng: “Nǐmen jiā xiànzài jǐ diǎn?” Yí gè bān, shuō le wǔ gè bù tóng de shíjiān. Yǒu gè xuésheng shuō, tā měi tiān děng dào bànyè cái gěi māma dǎ diànhuà, yīnwèi nà shíhou tā gāng xiàbān.","m":"You said it was still daytime where you were. These days I asked my class: 'What time is it at home right now?' One class, five different times. One student said he waits up till midnight every day to call his mum, because that's when she finishes work.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟家里人在同一个时区吗？","p":"Nǐ gēn jiā lǐ rén zài tóng yí gè shíqū ma?","m":"Are you in the same time zone as your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"对，在一个地方。","p":"Duì, zài yí gè dìfang.","m":"Yes, same place.","r":{"t":"真好，打电话不用算时间。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, dǎ diànhuà bú yòng suàn shíjiān.","m":"Nice — no maths before calling."}},{"t":"不是，差好几个小时。","p":"Bú shì, chà hǎo jǐ gè xiǎoshí.","m":"No — hours apart.","r":{"t":"那你们的电话一定很珍贵。","p":"Nà nǐmen de diànhuà yídìng hěn zhēnguì.","m":"Then your calls must be precious."}}],"next":{"t":"今天那个学生上课的时候有点困，我没叫醒他。","p":"Jīntiān nà gè xuésheng shàngkè de shíhou yǒudiǎn kùn, wǒ méi jiào xǐng tā.","m":"That student was a bit sleepy in class today. I let him be."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"冬天也晒衣服吗？","p":"Dōngtiān yě shài yīfu ma?","m":"Do people hang laundry out in winter too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过冬天也晒衣服吗（晒，北京冬天很干）","en":"You asked if people dry laundry outside in winter (yes — Beijing winters are dry)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问冬天也晒衣服吗。晒啊！北京冬天又干又冷。这两天我嗓子疼，我妈在电话里说：屋里放一盆水，多喝热水，早点睡。我这么大了，她还是每次都这么说。我都照做了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn dōngtiān yě shài yīfu ma. Shài a! Běijīng dōngtiān yòu gān yòu lěng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ sǎngzi téng, wǒ mā zài diànhuà lǐ shuō: wū lǐ fàng yì pén shuǐ, duō hē rè shuǐ, zǎo diǎn shuì. Wǒ zhème dà le, tā háishi měi cì dōu zhème shuō. Wǒ dōu zhào zuò le.","m":"Last time you asked if we dry laundry outside in winter. Of course! Beijing winters are dry and cold. These days I've had a sore throat, and Mum said on the phone: put a bowl of water in the room, drink hot water, get to bed early. I'm a grown woman and she still says it every time. I did all of it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你不舒服的时候，家里人会说什么？","p":"Nǐ bù shūfu de shíhou, jiā lǐ rén huì shuō shénme?","m":"When you're unwell, what does your family tell you?"},"replies":[{"t":"多喝热水！","p":"Duō hē rè shuǐ!","m":"Drink hot water!","r":{"t":"哈哈，全中国的妈妈都这么说。","p":"Hāha, quán Zhōngguó de māma dōu zhème shuō.","m":"Haha — every mum in China says that."}},{"t":"多休息。","p":"Duō xiūxi.","m":"Rest more.","r":{"t":"对，这句话最对。","p":"Duì, zhè jù huà zuì duì.","m":"Right — that's the truest advice."}}],"next":{"t":"今天嗓子好一点了，我妈的办法有用。","p":"Jīntiān sǎngzi hǎo yìdiǎn le, wǒ mā de bànfǎ yǒu yòng.","m":"Throat's a bit better today — Mum's remedies work."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你吃晚饭了吗？","p":"Nǐ chī wǎnfàn le ma?","m":"Have you had dinner?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她吃晚饭了没有（刚吃完，煮了一碗面）","en":"You asked if she'd had dinner (just finished — a bowl of noodles)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我吃晚饭了没有，我说煮了一碗面。那天我老公加班，我就随便煮了。我妈知道了，说别老吃面。冬至那天我们俩回她那儿，吃了两盘饺子。她说：「再忙，也要好好吃饭。」我答应她，每个周末回去一次。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ chī wǎnfàn le méiyǒu, wǒ shuō zhǔ le yì wǎn miàn. Nà tiān wǒ lǎogōng jiābān, wǒ jiù suíbiàn zhǔ le. Wǒ mā zhīdào le, shuō bié lǎo chī miàn. Dōngzhì nà tiān wǒmen liǎ huí tā nàr, chī le liǎng pán jiǎozi. Tā shuō: “Zài máng, yě yào hǎohǎo chī fàn.” Wǒ dāying tā, měi gè zhōumò huíqù yí cì.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd had dinner — I said a bowl of noodles. My husband was working late that day, so I just threw something together. Mum found out and said don't live on noodles. On the solstice the two of us went back to hers and I ate two plates of dumplings. She said: 'However busy you are, eat properly.' I promised her I'd come back every weekend.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你懒得做饭的时候，吃什么？","p":"Nǐ lǎnde zuò fàn de shíhou, chī shénme?","m":"What do you eat when you can't be bothered to cook?"},"replies":[{"t":"煮面。","p":"Zhǔ miàn.","m":"Noodles.","r":{"t":"我们一样。加个鸡蛋，算是好好吃饭了。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng. Jiā gè jīdàn, suàn shì hǎohǎo chī fàn le.","m":"Same here. Add an egg and it counts as a proper meal."}},{"t":"点外卖。","p":"Diǎn wàimài.","m":"Takeaway.","r":{"t":"也行，记得点有菜的。","p":"Yě xíng, jìde diǎn yǒu cài de.","m":"Fine — just pick something with veg."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又煮了一碗面，加了一个鸡蛋，算是进步。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu zhǔ le yì wǎn miàn, jiā le yí gè jīdàn, suàn shì jìnbù.","m":"Noodles again for lunch today, but with an egg — call it progress."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也在下雨。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě zài xià yǔ.","m":"It's raining here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也在下雨","en":"You said it was raining where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也在下雨。台北这两天还是一直下，我的雨衣破了一个洞。我妈在电话里说要买新的，我说还可以撑一下。结果室友自己去买了一件，放在我的机车上，什么都没说。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě zài xià yǔ. Táiběi zhè liǎng tiān háishi yìzhí xià, wǒ de yǔyī pò le yí gè dòng. Wǒ mā zài diànhuà lǐ shuō yào mǎi xīn de, wǒ shuō hái kěyǐ chēng yíxià. Jiéguǒ shìyǒu zìjǐ qù mǎi le yí jiàn, fàng zài wǒ de jīchē shang, shénme dōu méi shuō.","m":"You said it was raining where you were too. Taipei's kept raining these days, and my raincoat's got a hole. Mum said on the phone to buy a new one; I said it'll do. Then my roommate went and bought one herself and left it on my scooter without a word.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有人会这样默默照顾你吗？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu rén huì zhèyàng mòmò zhàogu nǐ ma?","m":"Is there someone who quietly looks after you like that?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我妈。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ mā.","m":"Yes — my mum.","r":{"t":"最关心你的人，常常什么都不说，只做。","p":"Zuì guānxīn nǐ de rén, chángcháng shénme dōu bù shuō, zhǐ zuò.","m":"The people who care most often say nothing — they just do."}},{"t":"我们比较会直接说。","p":"Wǒmen bǐjiào huì zhíjiē shuō.","m":"We tend to just say things.","r":{"t":"那也很好，说出来比较不会误会。","p":"Nà yě hěn hǎo, shuō chūlái bǐjiào bú huì wùhuì.","m":"That's good too — fewer misunderstandings."}}],"next":{"t":"今天台北还在下雨，我穿上雨衣出门了。","p":"Jīntiān Táiběi hái zài xià yǔ, wǒ chuān shang yǔyī chūmén le.","m":"Still raining in Taipei today — raincoat on and out the door."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边天很晴。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tiān hěn qíng.","m":"It's clear and sunny here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天很晴","en":"You said it was clear where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边天很晴，我好羡慕喔。这两天台北终于出了一下太阳，大概一个小时。我跟同学跑去学校的草地上坐着，有个同学说她期末压力好大，一直睡不着。我们就这样陪她坐着，什么也没说。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tiān hěn qíng, wǒ hǎo xiànmù o. Zhè liǎng tiān Táiběi zhōngyú chū le yíxià tàiyáng, dàgài yí gè xiǎoshí. Wǒ gēn tóngxué pǎo qù xuéxiào de cǎodì shang zuò zhe, yǒu gè tóngxué shuō tā qīmò yālì hǎo dà, yìzhí shuì bù zháo. Wǒmen jiù zhèyàng péi tā zuò zhe, shénme yě méi shuō.","m":"You said it was clear where you were — so jealous. These days the sun finally came out in Taipei for about an hour. My classmates and I ran out to sit on the campus lawn. One of them said finals stress is keeping her awake every night. We just sat with her in the sun, not saying anything.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你压力大的时候，会跟别人说吗？","p":"Nǐ yālì dà de shíhou, huì gēn biérén shuō ma?","m":"When you're stressed, do you tell anyone?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，跟朋友说。","p":"Huì, gēn péngyou shuō.","m":"Yes, my friends.","r":{"t":"好，有人陪就好很多。","p":"Hǎo, yǒu rén péi jiù hǎo hěn duō.","m":"Good — having someone there helps so much."}},{"t":"不太会，自己扛。","p":"Bú tài huì, zìjǐ káng.","m":"Not really — I carry it myself.","r":{"t":"不要一个人扛太久喔。","p":"Bú yào yí gè rén káng tài jiǔ o.","m":"Don't carry it alone for too long, OK?"}}],"next":{"t":"今天台北还是灰灰的，我在想你那边的蓝天。","p":"Jīntiān Táiběi háishi huīhuī de, wǒ zài xiǎng nǐ nàbiān de lántiān.","m":"Taipei's still grey today — thinking of your blue sky."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你也在回家的路上吗？","p":"Nǐ yě zài huí jiā de lù shang ma?","m":"Are you on your way home too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是也在回家的路上（她已经到家了，在窗口看）","en":"You asked if she was on her way home too (she was already home, watching from the window)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是也在回家的路上。那天我已经到家了。这两天我在窗口又看了几次，每天六点多，楼下都有一个外送员停在同一个地方躲雨，吃一个饭团，打一通电话。我听到他说：「爸爸快回去了。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì yě zài huí jiā de lù shang. Nà tiān wǒ yǐjīng dào jiā le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài chuāngkǒu yòu kàn le jǐ cì, měi tiān liù diǎn duō, lóu xià dōu yǒu yí gè wàisòngyuán tíng zài tóng yí gè dìfang duǒ yǔ, chī yí gè fàntuán, dǎ yì tōng diànhuà. Wǒ tīng dào tā shuō: “Bàba kuài huíqù le.”","m":"Last time you asked if I was on my way home too. I was already back that day. These days I've watched from the window a few more times: every day just after six, a delivery rider stops in the same spot downstairs to shelter from the rain, eats a rice ball, and makes one phone call. I heard him say: 'Daddy will be home soon.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你回家的路上，常常看到同一个人吗？","p":"Nǐ huí jiā de lù shang, chángcháng kàn dào tóng yí gè rén ma?","m":"Do you often see the same person on your way home?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，有几个熟面孔。","p":"Huì, yǒu jǐ gè shú miànkǒng.","m":"Yes — a few familiar faces.","r":{"t":"对，不认识，可是很熟。","p":"Duì, bú rènshi, kěshì hěn shú.","m":"Right — strangers, but familiar."}},{"t":"没注意过。","p":"Méi zhùyì guo.","m":"Never noticed.","r":{"t":"下次看看，每个人都有自己的故事。","p":"Xià cì kànkan, měi gè rén dōu yǒu zìjǐ de gùshi.","m":"Have a look next time — everyone has a story."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又在窗口看了一下楼下，雨里的机车还是一台接一台。","p":"Jīntiān yòu zài chuāngkǒu kàn le yíxià lóu xià, yǔ lǐ de jīchē háishi yì tái jiē yì tái.","m":"Looked down from the window again today — scooters still one after another in the rain."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"下雨天机车那么多，不危险吗？","p":"Xià yǔ tiān jīchē nàme duō, bù wēixiǎn ma?","m":"So many scooters in the rain — isn't it dangerous?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过下雨天骑机车危不危险（要小心，大家骑得比较慢）","en":"You asked if riding a scooter in the rain is dangerous (be careful — everyone rides slower)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问下雨天骑机车危不危险。要很小心。这两天我在路口看到一个阿伯滑倒了，旁边三台机车马上停下来扶他。他没事，说谢谢，骑走了。我打电话跟我妈说，她叫我以后下雨天改坐捷运。我答应了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn xià yǔ tiān qí jīchē wēi bu wēixiǎn. Yào hěn xiǎoxīn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài lùkǒu kàn dào yí gè ābó huá dǎo le, pángbiān sān tái jīchē mǎshàng tíng xiàlái fú tā. Tā méi shì, shuō xièxie, qí zǒu le. Wǒ dǎ diànhuà gēn wǒ mā shuō, tā jiào wǒ yǐhòu xià yǔ tiān gǎi zuò jiéyùn. Wǒ dāying le.","m":"Last time you asked if riding a scooter in the rain is dangerous. You have to be careful. These days at a junction I saw an old man skid and fall, and three scooters stopped right away to help him up. He was fine — said thanks and rode off. I told Mum on the phone, and she asked me to take the MRT on rainy days from now on. I said yes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你那边的人，会停下来帮陌生人吗？","p":"Nǐ nàbiān de rén, huì tíng xiàlái bāng mòshēng rén ma?","m":"Where you are, do people stop to help strangers?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，大家都挺好的。","p":"Huì, dàjiā dōu tǐng hǎo de.","m":"Yes — people are kind.","r":{"t":"真好，这样的城市住起来很安心。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, zhèyàng de chéngshì zhù qǐlái hěn ānxīn.","m":"Lovely — a city like that feels safe."}},{"t":"看情况。","p":"Kàn qíngkuàng.","m":"Depends.","r":{"t":"嗯，可是那天大家都停了，我很感动。","p":"Èn, kěshì nà tiān dàjiā dōu tíng le, wǒ hěn gǎndòng.","m":"Mm — but that day everyone stopped. It moved me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天骑车特别慢，路上很滑。","p":"Jīntiān qí chē tèbié màn, lù shang hěn huá.","m":"Rode extra slowly today — the roads were slippery."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's grey here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也是阴天。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是灰天","en":"You said it was grey where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was grey where you were too — fellow member of the grey club. These days the office has been half empty. One of our sub-editors mentioned he's spending Christmas alone this year. I told my mum, and she said, 'Bring him.' So he's coming.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是灰天——灰天俱乐部的会员。这两天办公室空了一半。我们的一个编辑说，他今年一个人过圣诞。我跟我妈说了，她说：「带他来。」所以他要来了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you know anyone spending the holidays alone?","p":"","m":"你认识一个人过节的人吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a friend.","p":"","m":"认识，一个朋友。","r":{"t":"Invite them for one meal. That's all it takes.","p":"","m":"请他吃一顿饭吧。就这么简单。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太认识。","r":{"t":"Keep an eye out. Sometimes people don't say.","p":"","m":"留意一下。有时候人家不会说。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still grey here. Wearing my thick jumper to the office.","p":"","m":"这边还是灰的。穿着厚毛衣去上班。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's sunny here.","p":"","m":"我这边有太阳。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边出太阳","en":"You said it was sunny where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was sunny where you were. I did ask you to send some over — and these days a bit actually turned up! An hour of low winter sun on Tuesday. I ran round the Heath before work. Honestly, running is the only thing that keeps my head straight in deadline week.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边出太阳。我还让你分一点过来——这两天还真来了一点！周二有一个小时冬天的斜阳。上班前我去 Hampstead Heath 跑了一圈。说真的，截稿那一周，只有跑步能让我脑子清楚一点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What keeps you sane when you're busy?","p":"","m":"你忙的时候，靠什么保持清醒？"},"replies":[{"t":"Exercise.","p":"","m":"运动。","r":{"t":"Same. Even twenty minutes helps.","p":"","m":"一样。二十分钟都有用。"}},{"t":"Sleep, if I can get it.","p":"","m":"睡觉，如果睡得着的话。","r":{"t":"The most underrated thing there is.","p":"","m":"最被低估的东西。"}}],"next":{"t":"Grey again today, but I'm keeping my trainers by the door just in case.","p":"","m":"今天又灰了，不过我把跑鞋放在门口，以防万一。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Was it raining this morning?","p":"","m":"早上下雨了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那天早上是不是下雨了（下得很大，他去商店的路上淋透了）","en":"You asked if it had been raining that morning (pouring — he got soaked on the way to the shops)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it had been raining that morning. Pouring — I got soaked. And these days I paid for it: a proper cold. Mum rang and gave me the full list — honey, lemon, bed, no laptop. I did three out of four. Guess which one I skipped.","p":"","m":"你上次问那天早上是不是下雨了。下得很大，我淋透了。这两天就付出代价了：真的感冒了。我妈打电话给我列了一整张单子——蜂蜜、柠檬、躺着、别碰电脑。四条我做到了三条。猜猜我没做哪一条。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What do you do when you catch a cold?","p":"","m":"你感冒的时候会怎么做？"},"replies":[{"t":"Rest and drink lots.","p":"","m":"休息，多喝水。","r":{"t":"Sensible. Mum would approve of you.","p":"","m":"很明智。我妈会认可你的。"}},{"t":"Keep working, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，接着工作。","r":{"t":"Same. We should both listen to my mum.","p":"","m":"一样。我们俩都该听我妈的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dry today. My shoes are finally dry too.","p":"","m":"今天没下雨。我的鞋终于也干了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What can you see from your window?","p":"","m":"你窗外能看到什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他窗外能看到什么（烟囱、湿屋顶，还有一只很勇敢的鸽子）","en":"You asked what he can see from his window (chimneys, wet roofs, one brave pigeon)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I can see from my window. Chimneys, wet roofs and one very brave pigeon. These days that pigeon has brought a friend. They sit on the chimney opposite every morning like two old men waiting for the news. Strangely, I'd miss them if they left.","p":"","m":"你上次问我窗外能看到什么。烟囱、湿屋顶，还有一只很勇敢的鸽子。这两天那只鸽子带了个朋友来。每天早上它们坐在对面的烟囱上，像两个等新闻的老头。说来奇怪，它们要是走了，我会想它们。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there anything you see from your window every day?","p":"","m":"你窗外有没有每天都能看到的东西？"},"replies":[{"t":"A tree.","p":"","m":"一棵树。","r":{"t":"Trees are the best. They change every season.","p":"","m":"树最好了，每个季节都不一样。"}},{"t":"Just other buildings.","p":"","m":"只有别的楼。","r":{"t":"Same, mostly. Keep an eye out for birds, though.","p":"","m":"我也差不多。不过留意一下鸟。"}}],"next":{"t":"The pigeons are back on the chimney today, looking very pleased with themselves.","p":"","m":"今天鸽子们又回到烟囱上了，看起来很得意。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"The sun's low here too.","p":"","m":"我这边太阳也很低。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太阳也很低","en":"You said the sun was low where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said the sun was low where you were too. These days the light comes in sideways and turns everything gold, even the washing-up. In December I get tired so easily. So I've made a rule for the holidays: twenty minutes outside every day, whatever the weather. It really helps.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边太阳也很低。这两天光是斜着进来的，什么都变成金色，连洗碗池都是。一到十二月，我就特别容易累。所以假期我给自己定了个规矩：每天在外面待二十分钟，什么天气都去。真的有用。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you feel more tired in winter?","p":"","m":"冬天的时候，你会更容易累吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, much more.","p":"","m":"会，累很多。","r":{"t":"Try my rule: twenty minutes of daylight.","p":"","m":"试试我的规矩：每天晒二十分钟太阳。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Lucky! Maybe you get more light.","p":"","m":"真好！可能你那边光更多。"}}],"next":{"t":"Golden light in the kitchen again at noon. Then gone by half three.","p":"","m":"中午厨房里又是金色的光。三点半就没了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's already dark here.","p":"","m":"我这边天已经黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天已经黑了","en":"You said it was already dark where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was already dark where you were, and it was only midday here. These days I told my kids, and my youngest asked if you were having dinner while we had lunch. Then: 'Do they have a mum who makes them eat vegetables too?' I said probably. They looked very sorry for you.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天已经黑了，我这边才中午。这两天我跟孩子们说了，小的那个问：我们吃午饭的时候，你是不是在吃晚饭。然后又问：「他们也有一个让他们吃蔬菜的妈妈吗？」我说可能有吧。他们看起来很同情你。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What time does it get dark where you are now?","p":"","m":"你那边现在几点天黑？"},"replies":[{"t":"Early, around five.","p":"","m":"很早，五点左右。","r":{"t":"Then we're winter neighbours.","p":"","m":"那我们是冬天的邻居。"}},{"t":"Quite late.","p":"","m":"挺晚的。","r":{"t":"Lucky you. Enjoy the evenings.","p":"","m":"真好。好好享受傍晚吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dark by quarter to four today. Candles on early.","p":"","m":"今天三点四十五就黑了。早早点上蜡烛。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How long is the day there now?","p":"","m":"你那边现在白天有多长？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过那边白天有多长（大概七个小时）","en":"You asked how long the day is there (about seven hours)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how long the day is here. About seven hours. The solstice has passed, so the afternoons are already getting a little longer. My kids don't believe me. I've written the sunset time on the fridge so we can check together every day. It's become our little thing.","p":"","m":"你上次问我这边白天有多长。大概七个小时。冬至过了，下午已经一点点变长了。孩子们不信。我把日落时间写在冰箱上，我们每天一起对一下。这已经变成我们家的一件小事了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have a small daily ritual with someone?","p":"","m":"你跟谁有每天一起做的小事吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, with my family.","p":"","m":"有，跟家里人。","r":{"t":"Those little things are what you remember.","p":"","m":"记得住的，就是这些小事。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Start one. It can be tiny.","p":"","m":"开始一个吧。很小也行。"}}],"next":{"t":"Sunset at 3:37 today. It's on the fridge.","p":"","m":"今天日落三点三十七。写在冰箱上了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What are you doing in the kitchen?","p":"","m":"你在厨房干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在厨房做什么（烤姜饼，满屋子都是味道）","en":"You asked what she was doing in the kitchen (baking gingerbread — the whole flat smells of it)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what I was doing in the kitchen. Baking gingerbread with my mum's recipe. There's a Swedish custom: put one in your palm, press the middle, and make a wish. If it breaks into three, the wish comes true. These days my mum did it and whispered her wish to me: 'That my knees hold out for one more summer of swimming.'","p":"","m":"你上次问我在厨房做什么。用我妈的方子烤姜饼。瑞典有个习俗：把一块放在手心，按中间，许个愿。碎成三块，愿望就会实现。这两天我妈也试了，悄悄告诉我她的愿望：「希望我的膝盖还能撑一个夏天，让我去游泳。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"If you could wish for one thing for your family, what would it be?","p":"","m":"如果能为家人许一个愿，你会许什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Good health.","p":"","m":"身体健康。","r":{"t":"Same as my mum. That's the one that matters.","p":"","m":"跟我妈一样。这个最重要。"}},{"t":"That we see each other more.","p":"","m":"多见面。","r":{"t":"Lovely. That one you can make come true.","p":"","m":"真好。这个愿望你自己就能实现。"}}],"next":{"t":"The whole flat still smells of gingerbread.","p":"","m":"整个家还是姜饼的味道。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's hot here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也很热。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也很热","en":"You said it was hot where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was hot where you were too. Chale, these days the harmattan arrived — dry wind from the Sahara, dust everywhere. My grandmother's chest gets bad in harmattan, so I bought her a mask and we keep the windows shut in the afternoons. She complains, but she wears it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也很热。兄弟，这两天哈马丹风来了——从撒哈拉吹来的干风，到处都是灰。一到哈马丹，我奶奶的胸口就不舒服，所以我给她买了口罩，下午我们把窗户关上。她嘴上抱怨，可是戴着。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does the weather affect anyone's health in your family?","p":"","m":"天气会影响你家里人的身体吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my grandparents.","p":"","m":"会，我爷爷奶奶。","r":{"t":"Then you know. We look after them.","p":"","m":"那你懂。我们照顾他们。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Good. Stay strong, all of you.","p":"","m":"很好。你们都要好好的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot again. Two water sachets before noon.","p":"","m":"又热了。中午前喝了两袋水。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's cold and dark here.","p":"","m":"我这边又冷又黑。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边又冷又黑","en":"You said it was cold and dark where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was cold and dark where you were. Chale, I've been trying to picture it. These days I asked my grandmother if she's ever been cold. She laughed and said, 'Only on harmattan mornings.' Then she told me about her sister in London, who's lived there forty years and still says she's never got used to it.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边又冷又黑。兄弟，我一直在想象那是什么样。这两天我问我奶奶有没有冷过。她笑着说：「只有哈马丹的早上。」然后她跟我讲她在伦敦的妹妹，在那儿住了四十年，还是说自己从来没习惯。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you have family living far away?","p":"","m":"你有家人住在很远的地方吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes.","p":"","m":"有。","r":{"t":"Call them this week. My grandma does every Sunday.","p":"","m":"这周给他们打个电话吧。我奶奶每个星期天都打。"}},{"t":"No, we're all close.","p":"","m":"没有，都在附近。","r":{"t":"That's a blessing.","p":"","m":"这是福气。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thinking about your cold dark day. Sending some Accra heat.","p":"","m":"在想你那边又冷又黑的一天。送你一点阿克拉的热。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How much is one?","p":"","m":"一袋多少钱？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过一袋水多少钱（不到一塞地，人人都买）","en":"You asked how much a sachet costs (under one cedi — everyone buys them)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how much a sachet is. Less than one cedi. These days I found out the lady who sells them outside the studio has done it for twenty years. She put her son through university, one sachet at a time. He's a nurse now. When she told me, she stood a bit taller.","p":"","m":"你上次问一袋水多少钱。不到一塞地。这两天我才知道，录音棚外面卖水的阿姨已经卖了二十年。她一袋一袋地，供儿子读完了大学。他现在是护士。她跟我说的时候，腰都挺直了一点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Has someone in your family worked very hard for you?","p":"","m":"你家里有人为你很辛苦地工作过吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my parents.","p":"","m":"有，我爸妈。","r":{"t":"Then say thank you. Out loud.","p":"","m":"那就说谢谢。说出来。"}},{"t":"Yes, I'm doing it for them now.","p":"","m":"有，现在是我在为他们辛苦。","r":{"t":"Respect, chale. That's real.","p":"","m":"佩服，兄弟。这才是真的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought two sachets from her again today. She calls me 'the music boy'.","p":"","m":"今天又从她那儿买了两袋。她叫我「音乐小子」。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you buy one?","p":"","m":"你买了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买了没有（买了两袋，这种天就要这样）","en":"You asked if he bought one (two — it's that kind of day)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I bought one. Two. These days I've been drinking them in the studio during the final listen of the album. One sachet per song, eight songs. My teacher came in to listen, and at the end he said: 'Now you're a producer.' I didn't know what to say.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买了没有。买了两袋。这两天我在录音棚最后过一遍专辑，一边听一边喝。一首歌一袋，一共八首。我的老师进来听，听完说：「现在你是制作人了。」我不知道说什么好。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Has a teacher ever said something that changed how you saw yourself?","p":"","m":"有没有老师说过一句话，改变了你怎么看自己？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes.","p":"","m":"有。","r":{"t":"Those words stay with you forever.","p":"","m":"那种话会跟你一辈子。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Maybe you'll be the one to say it to someone.","p":"","m":"也许你会是对别人说这句话的人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Sachet number one of the day, done by ten.","p":"","m":"今天第一袋水，十点前就喝完了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-21|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-21","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dark here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天也黑了","en":"You said it was dark where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was dark where you were too. These days I've had a lot of late rides — everyone's out shopping before the holidays. I'm taking every order I can, bro. School fees are due in January. My back hurts by ten, but when I think of the kids' new books, I keep going.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也黑了。这两天我晚上的单很多——放假前大家都出来买东西。兄弟，能接的单我都接。一月要交学费了。到了十点我的腰就疼，可是想到孩子们的新课本，我就接着跑。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever worked extra hard for someone?","p":"","m":"你有没有为了谁特别拼过？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, for my family.","p":"","m":"有，为了家里人。","r":{"t":"Then you know, bro. It's worth it.","p":"","m":"那你懂，兄弟。值得。"}},{"t":"Yes, for myself.","p":"","m":"有，为了我自己。","r":{"t":"That counts too. Don't forget to rest.","p":"","m":"那也算。别忘了休息。"}}],"next":{"t":"Late rides again. My back's complaining, but school fees don't wait.","p":"","m":"又是很晚的单。腰在抗议，可是学费不等人。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's still morning here.","p":"","m":"我这边还是早上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边还是早上","en":"You said it was still morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was still morning where you were. Funny, bro — I was already thinking about dinner. These days I keep thinking about it on my rides: when I'm stuck in evening traffic, somewhere someone is just waking up. Makes the traffic feel smaller. And makes me feel less alone on the road.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边还是早上。真好笑，兄弟——我那时候已经在想晚饭了。这两天骑车的时候我老在想：我堵在晚高峰里的时候，世界上某个地方有人刚起床。这样一想，堵车好像没那么烦了，路上也没那么孤单了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What helps you on a long, boring day?","p":"","m":"漫长又无聊的一天，什么能帮你撑过去？"},"replies":[{"t":"Thinking about people I love.","p":"","m":"想着我爱的人。","r":{"t":"Same, bro. My kids get me through.","p":"","m":"一样，兄弟。我的孩子们让我撑下去。"}},{"t":"Music.","p":"","m":"音乐。","r":{"t":"Good one. I sing in my helmet, haha.","p":"","m":"好主意。我在头盔里唱歌，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Stuck in traffic again. Thinking of someone, somewhere, waking up.","p":"","m":"又堵车了。想着某个地方，有人在起床。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you buy some satay?","p":"","m":"你买沙爹了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买沙爹了没有（二十串，大部分被孩子们吃了）","en":"You asked if he bought satay (twenty sticks — the kids ate most)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I bought some satay. Twenty sticks — the kids ate most of them. These days my eight-year-old made a rule: whoever helps their mum most with the fried bananas gets the first stick. Now my wife has two helpers every evening. She says it's the best present this year.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买沙爹了没有。二十串——大部分被孩子们吃了。这两天我八岁的那个定了一个规矩：谁帮妈妈炸香蕉帮得最多，谁吃第一串。现在我老婆每天晚上有两个小帮手。她说这是今年最好的礼物。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did you help your parents at home as a kid?","p":"","m":"你小时候在家帮爸妈做事吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a lot.","p":"","m":"帮，帮很多。","r":{"t":"Good kid, bro. Your parents were lucky.","p":"","m":"好孩子，兄弟。你爸妈很幸运。"}},{"t":"Not much, honestly.","p":"","m":"说实话，不太帮。","r":{"t":"Ha! Never too late to start.","p":"","m":"哈！现在开始也不晚。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought twenty sticks again. Hid five for myself this time.","p":"","m":"又买了二十串。这次我给自己藏了五串。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What's it made of?","p":"","m":"是用什么做的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过沙爹是用什么做的（鸡肉串，配花生酱）","en":"You asked what satay is made of (chicken on sticks, with peanut sauce)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what satay is made of. Chicken on sticks, with peanut sauce. These days I talked to the seller. He's been pushing that cart for thirty years. His son has an office job now and wants him to stop. He says, 'If I stop, who am I?' I didn't have an answer.","p":"","m":"你上次问沙爹是用什么做的。鸡肉串，配花生酱。这两天我跟老板聊了聊。他推那辆车推了三十年。他儿子现在在办公室上班，想让他别干了。他说：「我不干了，那我是谁？」我回答不上来。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you think work is part of who you are?","p":"","m":"你觉得工作是你的一部分吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a big part.","p":"","m":"是，很大一部分。","r":{"t":"Then I understand him better now.","p":"","m":"那我现在更懂他了。"}},{"t":"No, it's just a job.","p":"","m":"不是，就是一份工作。","r":{"t":"Maybe that's healthier, bro.","p":"","m":"兄弟，也许这样更健康。"}}],"next":{"t":"The satay cart was there again tonight. Same smoke, same queue.","p":"","m":"今晚沙爹摊又来了。一样的烟，一样的队。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-22|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-22","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边太阳也很好。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tàiyáng yě hěn hǎo.","m":"It's sunny here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太阳也很好","en":"You said the sun was lovely where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边太阳也很好。冬至以后，我每天课间都去窗口晒五分钟。这两天一个学生也跟着来晒，他说他刚来北京，冬天老是不想起床，心情也不好。晒了几天，他说好一点了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tàiyáng yě hěn hǎo. Dōngzhì yǐhòu, wǒ měi tiān kèjiān dōu qù chuāngkǒu shài wǔ fēnzhōng. Zhè liǎng tiān yí gè xuésheng yě gēn zhe lái shài, tā shuō tā gāng lái Běijīng, dōngtiān lǎo shì bù xiǎng qǐchuáng, xīnqíng yě bù hǎo. Shài le jǐ tiān, tā shuō hǎo yìdiǎn le.","m":"You said the sun was lovely where you were too. Since the solstice, every break I go and stand at the window for five minutes of sun. These days a student started joining me. He's new to Beijing and says in winter he never wants to get up, and feels low. After a few days of sun, he says he's a bit better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"冬天的时候，你的心情会变吗？","p":"Dōngtiān de shíhou, nǐ de xīnqíng huì biàn ma?","m":"Does your mood change in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，比较容易累。","p":"Huì, bǐjiào róngyì lèi.","m":"Yes — I get tired more easily.","r":{"t":"那多晒晒太阳，多出去走走。","p":"Nà duō shàishai tàiyáng, duō chūqù zǒuzou.","m":"Then get some sun and go out more."}},{"t":"不太会。","p":"Bú tài huì.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"真好，你的心情很稳。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, nǐ de xīnqíng hěn wěn.","m":"Lucky — your mood's steady."}}],"next":{"t":"今天课间又去窗口晒了五分钟，舒服。","p":"Jīntiān kèjiān yòu qù chuāngkǒu shài le wǔ fēnzhōng, shūfu.","m":"Five minutes of sun at the window on my break again today. Lovely."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边是半夜，我刚醒。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān shì bànyè, wǒ gāng xǐng.","m":"It's the middle of the night here — I just woke up."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是半夜，你刚醒","en":"You said it was the middle of the night and you'd just woken up"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是半夜，你刚醒。希望你后来又睡着了！我以前也常常半夜醒，脑子里全是工作。后来我睡前把第二天要做的事写在纸上，写完就放下。这两天我又这样做了，睡得好多了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì bànyè, nǐ gāng xǐng. Xīwàng nǐ hòulái yòu shuì zháo le! Wǒ yǐqián yě chángcháng bànyè xǐng, nǎozi lǐ quán shì gōngzuò. Hòulái wǒ shuì qián bǎ dì èr tiān yào zuò de shì xiě zài zhǐ shang, xiě wán jiù fàng xià. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yòu zhèyàng zuò le, shuì de hǎo duō le.","m":"You said it was the middle of the night and you'd just woken up. Hope you got back to sleep! I used to wake at night a lot, my head full of work. Then I started writing the next day's tasks on paper before bed — once it's written, I let it go. These days I've done it again, and I'm sleeping much better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你半夜醒来的时候，会想很多吗？","p":"Nǐ bànyè xǐng lái de shíhou, huì xiǎng hěn duō ma?","m":"When you wake at night, does your mind start racing?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，越想越睡不着。","p":"Huì, yuè xiǎng yuè shuì bù zháo.","m":"Yes — the more I think, the less I sleep.","r":{"t":"试试我的办法：写下来，就放下。","p":"Shìshi wǒ de bànfǎ: xiě xiàlái, jiù fàng xià.","m":"Try my trick: write it down, then let it go."}},{"t":"不会，很快又睡了。","p":"Bú huì, hěn kuài yòu shuì le.","m":"No — I drop off again quickly.","r":{"t":"真羡慕！这是福气。","p":"Zhēn xiànmù! Zhè shì fúqi.","m":"So jealous! That's a blessing."}}],"next":{"t":"今天睡前又写了一张纸，写完就关灯了。","p":"Jīntiān shuì qián yòu xiě le yì zhāng zhǐ, xiě wán jiù guān dēng le.","m":"Wrote my list before bed again today, then lights out."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"冬至你们吃什么？","p":"Dōngzhì nǐmen chī shénme?","m":"What do you eat on the winter solstice?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过冬至他们吃什么（北方吃饺子，晚上妈妈又要包）","en":"You asked what they eat at the solstice (dumplings up north — Mum making them that night)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问冬至我们吃什么。北方吃饺子。那天晚上在我妈家，我老公擀皮，我妈包，我学着包几个。她包的时候手有点抖，我才发现她老了。我包的那几个，她看了看，说：「有进步。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Dōngzhì wǒmen chī shénme. Běifāng chī jiǎozi. Nà tiān wǎnshang zài wǒ mā jiā, wǒ lǎogōng gǎn pí, wǒ mā bāo, wǒ xué zhe bāo jǐ gè. Tā bāo de shíhou shǒu yǒudiǎn dǒu, wǒ cái fāxiàn tā lǎo le. Wǒ bāo de nà jǐ gè, tā kàn le kàn, shuō: “Yǒu jìnbù.”","m":"Last time you asked what we eat at the solstice. Dumplings, up north. That evening at Mum's, my husband rolled the wrappers, Mum filled them, and I had a go at a few. Her hands shook a little, and I suddenly saw she's getting old. She looked at the ones I'd made and said: 'Getting better.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有一个时刻，突然发现家里人老了？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí gè shíkè, tūrán fāxiàn jiā lǐ rén lǎo le?","m":"Was there a moment you suddenly noticed a family member getting older?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，那种感觉很难受。","p":"Yǒu, nà zhǒng gǎnjué hěn nánshòu.","m":"Yes — it's a hard feeling.","r":{"t":"是啊。所以能回家就多回家。","p":"Shì a. Suǒyǐ néng huí jiā jiù duō huí jiā.","m":"Yes. So go home whenever you can."}},{"t":"还没有。","p":"Hái méiyǒu.","m":"Not yet.","r":{"t":"那就趁现在，多陪陪他们。","p":"Nà jiù chèn xiànzài, duō péipei tāmen.","m":"Then make the most of now — spend time with them."}}],"next":{"t":"我妈包的饺子还剩一盒，今天中午吃完了。","p":"Wǒ mā bāo de jiǎozi hái shèng yì hé, jīntiān zhōngwǔ chī wán le.","m":"Finished the last box of Mum's dumplings for lunch today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你今天上班吗？","p":"Nǐ jīntiān shàngbān ma?","m":"Are you working today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她那天上不上班（上，是课间在办公室窗口拍的）","en":"You asked if she was working that day (yes — shot from the office window at break)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我那天上不上班。上啊。这两天学生们都在准备期末考试，有个学生哭着来找我，说她怕考不好，奖学金就没了，就不能留在中国了。我陪她把要复习的东西一条条列出来，列完她就不哭了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ nà tiān shàng bu shàng bān. Shàng a. Zhè liǎng tiān xuéshengmen dōu zài zhǔnbèi qīmò kǎoshì, yǒu gè xuésheng kū zhe lái zhǎo wǒ, shuō tā pà kǎo bù hǎo, jiǎngxuéjīn jiù méi le, jiù bù néng liú zài Zhōngguó le. Wǒ péi tā bǎ yào fùxí de dōngxi yì tiáo tiáo liè chūlái, liè wán tā jiù bù kū le.","m":"Last time you asked if I was working that day. Yes. These days the students are all preparing for end-of-term exams. One came to me in tears — if she doesn't do well she'll lose her scholarship and won't be able to stay in China. I sat with her and listed everything she needs to revise, one item at a time. By the end she'd stopped crying.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近有让你担心的事吗？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn yǒu ràng nǐ dānxīn de shì ma?","m":"Is anything worrying you lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"有一点。","p":"Yǒu yìdiǎn.","m":"A little.","r":{"t":"试试一条条写下来，会轻一点。","p":"Shìshi yì tiáo tiáo xiě xiàlái, huì qīng yìdiǎn.","m":"Try writing it down item by item — it gets lighter."}},{"t":"还好，没什么。","p":"Hái hǎo, méi shénme.","m":"I'm fine, nothing much.","r":{"t":"那太好了，好好享受。","p":"Nà tài hǎo le, hǎohǎo xiǎngshòu.","m":"That's great — enjoy it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天那个学生来上课了，眼睛不红了。","p":"Jīntiān nà gè xuésheng lái shàngkè le, yǎnjing bù hóng le.","m":"That student came to class today — her eyes weren't red any more."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-22|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-22","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是晚上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì wǎnshang.","m":"It's night here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是晚上","en":"You said it was night where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是晚上。这两天我睡得更晚了：学校放假了，我每天晚上等女儿睡了，就看半个小时中文书。我太太说我像个准备考试的学生。到了这个年纪还在学一门新语言，我觉得挺好的。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì wǎnshang. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shuì de gèng wǎn le: xuéxiào fàngjià le, wǒ měi tiān wǎnshang děng nǚ'ér shuì le, jiù kàn bàn gè xiǎoshí Zhōngwén shū. Wǒ tàitai shuō wǒ xiàng gè zhǔnbèi kǎoshì de xuésheng. Dào le zhège niánjì hái zài xué yì mén xīn yǔyán, wǒ juéde tǐng hǎo de.","m":"You said it was night where you were too. These days I've been going to bed even later: school's out, and every night after my daughter's asleep I read Chinese for half an hour. My wife says I'm like a student cramming for exams. Still learning a new language at my age — I think that's pretty good.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你睡觉前会做什么？","p":"Nǐ shuìjiào qián huì zuò shénme?","m":"What do you do before bed?"},"replies":[{"t":"看一会儿书。","p":"Kàn yíhuìr shū.","m":"Read a bit.","r":{"t":"我们一样！","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng!","m":"Same here!"}},{"t":"刷手机。","p":"Shuā shǒujī.","m":"Scroll my phone.","r":{"t":"哈哈，我太太也是。","p":"Hāha, wǒ tàitai yě shì.","m":"Haha, so does my wife."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又看了半个小时中文书，女儿已经睡了。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu kàn le bàn gè xiǎoshí Zhōngwén shū, nǚ'ér yǐjīng shuì le.","m":"Another half hour of Chinese reading tonight — daughter's asleep."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在是白天。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài shì báitiān.","m":"It's daytime here now."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边现在是白天","en":"You said it was daytime where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是白天，你的一天才刚开始。这两天我教女儿看地球仪：这边是黑夜，那边是白天。她问：「那太阳是不是很累？」我是科学老师，可是这个问题我想了很久。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì báitiān, nǐ de yì tiān cái gāng kāishǐ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ jiāo nǚ'ér kàn dìqiúyí: zhèbiān shì hēiyè, nàbiān shì báitiān. Tā wèn: “Nà tàiyáng shì bu shì hěn lèi?” Wǒ shì kēxué lǎoshī, kěshì zhège wèntí wǒ xiǎng le hěn jiǔ.","m":"You said it was daytime where you were — your day was just beginning. These days I showed my daughter a globe: night on this side, day on that side. She asked: 'So is the sun very tired?' I'm a science teacher, and I still thought about that one for ages.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候问过大人什么难回答的问题？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou wèn guo dàrén shénme nán huídá de wèntí?","m":"As a kid, did you ever ask grown-ups a hard question?"},"replies":[{"t":"问过很多。","p":"Wèn guo hěn duō.","m":"Loads.","r":{"t":"孩子的问题是最好的问题。","p":"Háizi de wèntí shì zuì hǎo de wèntí.","m":"Kids' questions are the best questions."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"Can't remember.","r":{"t":"你爸妈一定记得，问问他们。","p":"Nǐ bà mā yídìng jìde, wènwen tāmen.","m":"Your parents will remember — ask them."}}],"next":{"t":"今天给女儿讲了白天和黑夜，她听得很认真。","p":"Jīntiān gěi nǚ'ér jiǎng le báitiān hé hēiyè, tā tīng de hěn rènzhēn.","m":"Told my daughter about day and night today — she listened really carefully."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会去买一块披萨吗？","p":"Nǐ huì qù mǎi yí kuài pīsà ma?","m":"Are you going to get a slice?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他会不会去买一块披萨（很想，可是已经刷牙了）","en":"You asked if he'd go buy a slice (wanted to, but he'd brushed his teeth)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会去买一块披萨。我已经刷牙了，没去。这两天我体检，医生说我的胆固醇有点高，叫我少吃晚上的东西，多走路。所以楼下的披萨，我现在只是闻一闻，哈哈。我每天送女儿以后走路二十分钟。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì qù mǎi yí kuài pīsà. Wǒ yǐjīng shuā yá le, méi qù. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ tǐjiǎn, yīshēng shuō wǒ de dǎngùchún yǒudiǎn gāo, jiào wǒ wǎnshang shǎo chī, duō zǒulù. Suǒyǐ lóu xià de pīsà, wǒ xiànzài zhǐ shì wén yi wén, hāha. Wǒ měi tiān sòng nǚ'ér yǐhòu zǒulù èrshí fēnzhōng.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd buy a slice. I'd brushed my teeth, so no. These days I had a check-up, and the doctor said my cholesterol's a bit high — eat less at night, walk more. So the pizza downstairs I now just smell, haha. Every day after dropping my daughter off I walk for twenty minutes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会定期去体检吗？","p":"Nǐ huì dìngqī qù tǐjiǎn ma?","m":"Do you go for regular check-ups?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每年一次。","p":"Huì, měi nián yí cì.","m":"Yes, once a year.","r":{"t":"好习惯。我以前五年才去一次。","p":"Hǎo xíguàn. Wǒ yǐqián wǔ nián cái qù yí cì.","m":"Good habit. I used to go once every five years."}},{"t":"很少去。","p":"Hěn shǎo qù.","m":"Rarely.","r":{"t":"我以前也是。去一次吧，心里踏实。","p":"Wǒ yǐqián yě shì. Qù yí cì ba, xīn lǐ tāshi.","m":"I was the same. Go once — it puts your mind at ease."}}],"next":{"t":"今天路过那家披萨店，忍住了。走了二十分钟。","p":"Jīntiān lùguò nà jiā pīsà diàn, rěn zhù le. Zǒu le èrshí fēnzhōng.","m":"Walked past the pizza place today — resisted. Twenty-minute walk done."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"披萨店开到几点？","p":"Pīsà diàn kāi dào jǐ diǎn?","m":"How late is the pizza place open?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过披萨店开到几点（半夜十二点，周末更晚）","en":"You asked how late the pizza place stays open (midnight, later at weekends)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问楼下的披萨店开到几点。半夜十二点。这两天我跟老板聊了几句，他从那不勒斯来，在这里开了二十年，他的孩子是在店里长大的。现在他六十五岁了，想退休，可是儿子不想接。他说：「我不怪他。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn lóu xià de pīsà diàn kāi dào jǐ diǎn. Bànyè shí'èr diǎn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn lǎobǎn liáo le jǐ jù, tā cóng Nàbùlèsī lái, zài zhèlǐ kāi le èrshí nián, tā de háizi shì zài diàn lǐ zhǎng dà de. Xiànzài tā liùshíwǔ suì le, xiǎng tuìxiū, kěshì érzi bù xiǎng jiē. Tā shuō: “Wǒ bú guài tā.”","m":"Last time you asked how late the pizza place stays open. Midnight. These days I chatted with the owner. He came from Naples and has run it for twenty years — his kids grew up in the shop. He's sixty-five now and wants to retire, but his son doesn't want to take over. He said: 'I don't blame him.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"家里的工作，你会想接下去吗？","p":"Jiā lǐ de gōngzuò, nǐ huì xiǎng jiē xiàqù ma?","m":"Would you want to carry on your family's line of work?"},"replies":[{"t":"不会，我想走自己的路。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ xiǎng zǒu zìjǐ de lù.","m":"No — I want my own path.","r":{"t":"老板说得对，这不用怪谁。","p":"Lǎobǎn shuō de duì, zhè bú yòng guài shéi.","m":"The owner's right — nobody's to blame."}},{"t":"也许会。","p":"Yěxǔ huì.","m":"Maybe.","r":{"t":"那你的家人一定很高兴。","p":"Nà nǐ de jiārén yídìng hěn gāoxìng.","m":"Your family would be glad."}}],"next":{"t":"今天楼下的披萨店还是开到了十二点。","p":"Jīntiān lóu xià de pīsà diàn háishi kāi dào le shí'èr diǎn.","m":"The pizza place downstairs was open till midnight again today."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-22|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-22","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's night here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也是晚上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是晚上","en":"You said it was night where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was night where you were too — two night owls. These days I've been up late every night on our team's holiday card. I designed it, and Jess said it's the first one that doesn't look like an ad. Honestly, after a hard year, that felt really good.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是晚上——两只夜猫子。这两天我每天熬夜做我们组的节日贺卡。是我设计的，Jess 说这是第一张看起来不像广告的。说实话，辛苦了一年，这句话让我很开心。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's something you're proud of from this year?","p":"","m":"今年有什么让你骄傲的事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something at work or school.","p":"","m":"工作或者学习上的一件事。","r":{"t":"Nice! Tell yourself well done.","p":"","m":"真好！跟自己说一声做得好。"}},{"t":"Just getting through it.","p":"","m":"就是熬过来了。","r":{"t":"That counts. A lot.","p":"","m":"那就很了不起。"}}],"next":{"t":"Another late one. The holiday card is almost done.","p":"","m":"又熬夜了。节日贺卡快好了。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's morning here.","p":"","m":"我这边是早上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was morning where you were, while I was going to bed. These days I've been calling my mum in Seoul, and it's the same — her morning, my night. She always asks if I've eaten. Every time. Even at midnight. Honestly, this year I started asking her back.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边是早上，我这边要睡了。这两天我给在首尔的妈妈打电话，也是这样——她那边早上，我这边晚上。她每次都问我吃饭了没有。每一次。就算是半夜。说实话，今年我开始反过来问她了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family ask the same question every time you talk?","p":"","m":"你家里人每次跟你说话，都会问同一个问题吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes — if I've eaten!","p":"","m":"会——问我吃了没有！","r":{"t":"Same family, different countries, haha.","p":"","m":"一样的家，不同的国家，哈哈。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Then maybe you can start asking them.","p":"","m":"那也许你可以开始问他们。"}}],"next":{"t":"Called Mum this morning — her evening. She asked if I'd eaten. I asked her too.","p":"","m":"今天早上给妈妈打了电话——她那边晚上。她问我吃了没有。我也问了她。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What are your neighbours doing?","p":"","m":"你的邻居在干什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他邻居们在做什么（大部分在看电视，有一个人在做饭）","en":"You asked what his neighbours were doing (mostly TV, one guy cooking)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what my neighbours were doing. Watching TV, mostly; one guy was cooking. These days I worked out what he cooks — every night at ten, the same smell. Kimchi stew. He might be Korean too, and maybe alone like me. Honestly, I want to knock. I'm still building up the courage.","p":"","m":"你上次问我邻居们在做什么。大部分在看电视，有一个人在做饭。这两天我搞清楚他做的是什么了——每天晚上十点，同一个味道。泡菜汤。他可能也是韩国人，也许跟我一样一个人。说实话，我想去敲门。还在鼓起勇气。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you know your neighbours?","p":"","m":"你认识你的邻居吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, some of them.","p":"","m":"认识几个。","r":{"t":"Nice. I'm working on it.","p":"","m":"真好。我在努力。"}},{"t":"No, not really.","p":"","m":"不太认识。","r":{"t":"Same. Maybe this is the year we both say hi.","p":"","m":"一样。也许今年我们都去打个招呼。"}}],"next":{"t":"The windows across the street are lit up again tonight.","p":"","m":"今晚对面的窗户又都亮了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you ever wave at them?","p":"","m":"你会跟他们挥手吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他有没有跟他们挥过手（挥过一次，对方没回）","en":"You asked if he ever waves at them (once — no wave back)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I ever wave at them. Once — he didn't wave back. These days I tried again. I held up a sign that said 'Merry Christmas'. Honestly, I felt stupid. Then he held up a sign: 'You too.' Since I moved here, that's the first message from a neighbour.","p":"","m":"你上次问我有没有跟他们挥过手。挥过一次——他没回。这两天我又试了一次。我举了一张纸，上面写「圣诞快乐」。说实话，我觉得自己很傻。然后他也举了一张纸：「你也是。」搬来以后，这是第一条来自邻居的消息。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever done something a bit silly to make a friend?","p":"","m":"你有没有为了交朋友，做过一点傻事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes!","p":"","m":"有！","r":{"t":"Then you understand. Silly works.","p":"","m":"那你懂。傻事有用。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Try it once. Being brave feels silly at first.","p":"","m":"试一次吧。勇敢一开始都会觉得有点傻。"}}],"next":{"t":"Made a sign today. Not brave enough to hold it up yet.","p":"","m":"今天做了一张纸牌。还没勇气举起来。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-22|en|budi":{"date":"2026-12-22","l":"en","id":"budi","nm":"Budi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's hot here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也很热。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也很热","en":"You said it was hot where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was hot where you were too. These days it's rainy season too, so it's hot in the morning and pouring by three. I got soaked twice and caught a cold. My wife made me ginger tea and told me to stay home one day. One day off, bro. I slept twelve hours.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也很热。这两天也是雨季，所以早上热，三点就下大雨。我淋了两次，感冒了。我老婆给我煮了姜茶，叫我在家休息一天。兄弟，就一天。我睡了十二个小时。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When did you last take a day just to rest?","p":"","m":"你上一次专门休息一天是什么时候？"},"replies":[{"t":"A while ago.","p":"","m":"很久以前了。","r":{"t":"Take one soon, bro. Your body will thank you.","p":"","m":"兄弟，快休息一天吧。身体会谢谢你的。"}},{"t":"Recently.","p":"","m":"最近。","r":{"t":"Good. Rest is part of the work.","p":"","m":"很好。休息也是工作的一部分。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot at eight, pouring at three. Raincoat on.","p":"","m":"八点很热，三点大雨。穿上雨衣。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's cold here.","p":"","m":"我这边很冷。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边很冷","en":"You said it was cold where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was cold where you were. Bro, these days I tried to imagine it on my rides — a cold wind instead of this heat. Then a passenger told me she'd been working in Japan for three years, sending money home. She said the cold was hard, but the loneliness was harder.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边很冷。兄弟，这两天骑车的时候我试着想象——冷风，不是这种热。后来一个乘客告诉我，她在日本工作了三年，把钱寄回家。她说冷很难熬，可是孤单更难熬。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever lived far from home?","p":"","m":"你在离家很远的地方生活过吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes.","p":"","m":"有。","r":{"t":"Then you know what she meant. Respect.","p":"","m":"那你懂她的意思。佩服。"}},{"t":"No, never.","p":"","m":"没有，从来没有。","r":{"t":"Good. Home is home, bro.","p":"","m":"很好。家就是家，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thirty-two today. Still trying to imagine your cold.","p":"","m":"今天三十二度。还在想象你那边的冷。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What are the vendors selling?","p":"","m":"小贩在卖什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过小贩们卖什么（炸香蕉、粥和咖啡）","en":"You asked what the vendors sell (fried bananas, porridge and coffee)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what the vendors sell. Fried bananas, porridge and coffee. These days I talked to the porridge man. He's sixty-eight and still sets up at five every morning. His knees hurt, he says, but if he stays home, he gets old. Bro, I want to be like him at sixty-eight.","p":"","m":"你上次问小贩们卖什么。炸香蕉、粥和咖啡。这两天我跟卖粥的大叔聊了聊。他六十八了，每天早上五点还在出摊。他说膝盖疼，可是待在家里，人就老了。兄弟，我六十八岁的时候想像他一样。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who do you know that's still going strong when they're older?","p":"","m":"你认识谁年纪大了还很有活力？"},"replies":[{"t":"My grandparent.","p":"","m":"我的爷爷奶奶或外公外婆。","r":{"t":"Learn their secret, bro.","p":"","m":"兄弟，学学他们的秘诀。"}},{"t":"A neighbour.","p":"","m":"一个邻居。","r":{"t":"Those people inspire a whole street.","p":"","m":"这种人能鼓舞一整条街。"}}],"next":{"t":"The porridge man was out again at five this morning.","p":"","m":"今天早上五点，卖粥的大叔又出摊了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Did you get anything?","p":"","m":"你买东西了吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他买了什么（给孩子们早饭买的炸香蕉）","en":"You asked if he got anything (fried bananas for the kids' breakfast)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I got anything. Fried bananas for the kids' breakfast. These days my daughter said the stall's are good, but her mum's are better. My wife pretended not to hear, but she smiled all morning. Bro, being a dad is small things like that.","p":"","m":"你上次问我买了什么。给孩子们早饭买的炸香蕉。这两天我女儿说，摊子上的好吃，可是妈妈炸的更好吃。我老婆假装没听见，可是笑了一整个早上。兄弟，当爸爸就是这些小事。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What small thing made someone in your family happy recently?","p":"","m":"最近有什么小事，让你家里人很开心？"},"replies":[{"t":"A kind word.","p":"","m":"一句好话。","r":{"t":"The cheapest gift and the best one.","p":"","m":"最便宜，也最好的礼物。"}},{"t":"Just being there.","p":"","m":"就是陪着。","r":{"t":"That's everything, bro.","p":"","m":"这就是一切，兄弟。"}}],"next":{"t":"Bought fried bananas from the stall again. Didn't tell my wife.","p":"","m":"又在摊子上买了炸香蕉。没告诉我老婆。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Christmas is a public holiday here, bro, so I took one more day off and took the kids to Ancol beach.","p":"","m":"圣诞节在这里是公众假期，兄弟，所以我又休息了一天，带孩子们去了安佐尔海滩。"},{"t":"I'd been working so much, my daughter said, 'Papa, you look different without the helmet.'","p":"","m":"我工作得太多了，我女儿说：「爸爸，你没戴头盔的样子好不一样。」"},{"t":"That hurt a bit. Next year: one Sunday a month, no orders. Just us.","p":"","m":"这句话让我有点难受。明年：每个月有一个星期天，不接单。就我们一家。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's a good promise.","p":"","m":"这是个好承诺。","r":{"t":"Hold me to it, bro.","p":"","m":"兄弟，你帮我盯着。"}},{"t":"Your daughter is wise.","p":"","m":"你女儿很懂事。","r":{"t":"Wiser than her papa, bro.","p":"","m":"比她爸爸懂事，兄弟。"}}],"from":"2026-12-26"}},"2026-12-23|zh|ruth":{"date":"2026-12-23","l":"zh","id":"ruth","nm":"Ruth","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是四点就快黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì sì diǎn jiù kuài hēi le.","m":"It's nearly dark by four here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是四点就快黑了","en":"You said it gets dark by four where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是四点就快黑了。圣诞节这天，我家三点就开灯了。我儿子和孙子们都在。我们吃完火鸡，一起看国王的圣诞讲话，下午三点的，每年都是。这是家里一年里最热闹的一天。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì sì diǎn jiù kuài hēi le. Shèngdàn Jié zhè tiān, wǒ jiā sān diǎn jiù kāi dēng le. Wǒ érzi hé sūnzimen dōu zài. Wǒmen chī wán huǒjī, yìqǐ kàn guówáng de Shèngdàn jiǎnghuà, xiàwǔ sān diǎn de, měi nián dōu shì. Zhè shì jiā lǐ yì nián lǐ zuì rènao de yì tiān.","m":"You said it gets dark by four where you are too. On Christmas Day our lights were on by three. My son and the grandsons are all here. After the turkey we watched the King's Christmas speech — three o'clock, every year. It's the liveliest day of the year in the house.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"过节的时候，你家有每年都做的事吗？","p":"Guòjié de shíhou, nǐ jiā yǒu měi nián dōu zuò de shì ma?","m":"Is there something your family does every year at holidays?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一起吃一顿大餐。","p":"Yǒu, yìqǐ chī yí dùn dàcān.","m":"Yes — a big meal together.","r":{"t":"一样的！在一起是最重要的。","p":"Yíyàng de! Zài yìqǐ shì zuì zhòngyào de.","m":"Same! Being together is what matters."}},{"t":"没有什么固定的。","p":"Méiyǒu shénme gùdìng de.","m":"Nothing fixed.","r":{"t":"那也好，每年都不一样。","p":"Nà yě hǎo, měi nián dōu bù yíyàng.","m":"That's nice too — different every year."}}],"next":{"t":"今天三点半我就开灯了，泡了一壶茶。","p":"Jīntiān sān diǎn bàn wǒ jiù kāi dēng le, pào le yì hú chá.","m":"Lights on at half three today, and a pot of tea."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边天还很亮。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tiān hái hěn liàng.","m":"It's still bright here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天还很亮","en":"You said it was still bright where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边天还很亮，真好。圣诞节这天伦敦出了一点太阳，我带孙子们和 Biscuit 去公园走了一圈。Biscuit 老了，走得很慢，孙子们就陪着它慢慢走。我看着他们，想：慢一点，也很好。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tiān hái hěn liàng, zhēn hǎo. Shèngdàn Jié zhè tiān Lúndūn chū le yìdiǎn tàiyáng, wǒ dài sūnzimen hé Biscuit qù gōngyuán zǒu le yì quān. Biscuit lǎo le, zǒu de hěn màn, sūnzimen jiù péi zhe tā mànmàn zǒu. Wǒ kàn zhe tāmen, xiǎng: màn yìdiǎn, yě hěn hǎo.","m":"You said it was still bright where you were — lovely. On Christmas Day London got a bit of sun, and I took the grandsons and Biscuit round the park. Biscuit is old and walks very slowly, so the boys walked slowly too. Watching them I thought: slow is good too.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你冬天会出去散步吗？","p":"Nǐ dōngtiān huì chūqù sànbù ma?","m":"Do you go for walks in winter?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，天好就去。","p":"Huì, tiān hǎo jiù qù.","m":"Yes, when it's nice.","r":{"t":"对，走一走，身体和心情都好。","p":"Duì, zǒu yi zǒu, shēntǐ hé xīnqíng dōu hǎo.","m":"Yes — walking's good for body and mood."}},{"t":"太冷了，不去。","p":"Tài lěng le, bú qù.","m":"Too cold — no.","r":{"t":"我懂。我也是为了 Biscuit 才出去的。","p":"Wǒ dǒng. Wǒ yě shì wèile Biscuit cái chūqù de.","m":"I understand. I only go out for Biscuit."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午我又趁着天亮，出去走了一圈。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ wǒ yòu chèn zhe tiān liàng, chūqù zǒu le yì quān.","m":"Went for a walk at midday again today while it was light."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你今天出门了吗？","p":"Nǐ jīntiān chūmén le ma?","m":"Did you go out today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她那天出门了没有（中午出去走了一圈，趁天还亮）","en":"You asked if she went out that day (a walk at midday, while it was light)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我那天出门了没有。中午出去了一圈。圣诞节前，我请梁阿姨来我家吃饭，因为她今年一个人过节。她带了一盒她自己做的萝卜糕。我们两个老太太，一个说中文，一个说英文，聊到很晚。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ nà tiān chūmén le méiyǒu. Zhōngwǔ chūqù le yì quān. Shèngdàn Jié qián, wǒ qǐng Liáng āyí lái wǒ jiā chī fàn, yīnwèi tā jīnnián yí gè rén guòjié. Tā dài le yì hé tā zìjǐ zuò de luóbo gāo. Wǒmen liǎng gè lǎo tàitai, yí gè shuō Zhōngwén, yí gè shuō Yīngwén, liáo dào hěn wǎn.","m":"Last time you asked if I'd been out that day. A walk at midday. Before Christmas I invited Auntie Liang for dinner, because she's on her own this year. She brought a box of turnip cake she'd made. Two old ladies, one speaking Chinese, one speaking English — we talked till late.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有一个人过节的朋友吗？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu yí gè rén guòjié de péngyou ma?","m":"Do you know anyone spending the holidays alone?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"请他来吃一顿饭吧，一顿就够了。","p":"Qǐng tā lái chī yí dùn fàn ba, yí dùn jiù gòu le.","m":"Invite them for a meal — one is enough."}},{"t":"我自己就是。","p":"Wǒ zìjǐ jiù shì.","m":"I am one.","r":{"t":"那我在伦敦给你留一个位子。","p":"Nà wǒ zài Lúndūn gěi nǐ liú yí gè wèizi.","m":"Then there's a seat for you at my table in London."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又去唐人街买了一包茶，给梁阿姨的圣诞礼物。","p":"Jīntiān yòu qù Tángrénjiē mǎi le yì bāo chá, gěi Liáng āyí de Shèngdàn lǐwù.","m":"Went to Chinatown today for a packet of tea — Auntie Liang's Christmas present."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"冬至过了，天会变长吗？","p":"Dōngzhì guò le, tiān huì biàn cháng ma?","m":"Now the solstice is past, will the days get longer?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过冬至过了，天会不会变长（会，一开始每天只多几秒，到一月就快了）","en":"You asked if the days get longer after the solstice (yes — seconds at first, faster by January)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问冬至过了，天会不会变长。会的。我的孙子不信，说根本看不出来。我们约好了：他回曼彻斯特以后，每天四点也看一下窗外，到一月底打电话比一比。我觉得，这是他想跟奶奶多打电话的办法。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn Dōngzhì guò le, tiān huì bu huì biàn cháng. Huì de. Wǒ de sūnzi bú xìn, shuō gēnběn kàn bu chūlái. Wǒmen yuē hǎo le: tā huí Mànchèsītè yǐhòu, měi tiān sì diǎn yě kàn yíxià chuāng wài, dào yī yuè dǐ dǎ diànhuà bǐ yi bǐ. Wǒ juéde, zhè shì tā xiǎng gēn nǎinai duō dǎ diànhuà de bànfǎ.","m":"Last time you asked whether the days get longer after the solstice. They do. My grandson doesn't believe it — says you can't tell. So we made a deal: after he's back in Manchester, he'll look out of the window at four every day too, and we'll compare by phone at the end of January. I think it's his way of calling his grandma more.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟家里的老人多久联系一次？","p":"Nǐ gēn jiā lǐ de lǎorén duō jiǔ liánxì yí cì?","m":"How often are you in touch with the older people in your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"常常联系。","p":"Chángcháng liánxì.","m":"Often.","r":{"t":"他们一定很开心。","p":"Tāmen yídìng hěn kāixīn.","m":"They must be very happy."}},{"t":"不太常。","p":"Bú tài cháng.","m":"Not very often.","r":{"t":"打一个电话吧，五分钟也好。","p":"Dǎ yí gè diànhuà ba, wǔ fēnzhōng yě hǎo.","m":"Give them a call — even five minutes is good."}}],"next":{"t":"今天四点，窗外好像亮了一点点，也许是我想的。","p":"Jīntiān sì diǎn, chuāng wài hǎoxiàng liàng le yìdiǎndiǎn, yěxǔ shì wǒ xiǎng de.","m":"At four today it looked a tiny bit lighter outside — maybe I imagined it."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"孙子们回曼彻斯特了。家里一下子很安静。","p":"Sūnzimen huí Mànchèsītè le. Jiā lǐ yíxiàzi hěn ānjìng.","m":"The grandsons have gone back to Manchester. The house went very quiet all at once."},{"t":"小的那个走之前，把我织的围巾留在了我的沙发上。我以为他忘了。","p":"Xiǎo de nà gè zǒu zhīqián, bǎ wǒ zhī de wéijīn liú zài le wǒ de shāfā shang. Wǒ yǐwéi tā wàng le.","m":"Before leaving, the little one left the scarf I knitted on my sofa. I thought he'd forgotten it."},{"t":"围巾下面有一张纸条，是他写的：Grandma, you keep warm too.","p":"Wéijīn xiàmiàn yǒu yì zhāng zhǐtiáo, shì tā xiě de: Grandma, you keep warm too.","m":"Under it was a note he'd written: 'Grandma, you keep warm too.'"}],"replies":[{"t":"他太贴心了！","p":"Tā tài tiēxīn le!","m":"How thoughtful!","r":{"t":"是的，我哭了一点点。","p":"Shì de, wǒ kū le yìdiǎndiǎn.","m":"Yes. I cried a little."}},{"t":"那你现在戴着吗？","p":"Nà nǐ xiànzài dài zhe ma?","m":"Are you wearing it now?","r":{"t":"每天都戴，遛 Biscuit 的时候。","p":"Měi tiān dōu dài, liù Biscuit de shíhou.","m":"Every day, when I walk Biscuit."}}],"from":"2026-12-28"}},"2026-12-23|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-23","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也在下小雨。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě zài xià xiǎo yǔ.","m":"It's drizzling here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也在下小雨","en":"You said it was drizzling where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边也在下小雨。波哥大也一直下雨。平安夜，雨停了，我们在奶奶家吃饭，十二点一起打开礼物。在哥伦比亚，平安夜最热闹！我爸在外地工作，没回来。我们给他打视频，手机放在桌子中间。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān yě zài xià xiǎoyǔ. Bōgēdà yě yìzhí xià yǔ. Píng'ān Yè, yǔ tíng le, wǒmen zài nǎinai jiā chī fàn, shí'èr diǎn yìqǐ dǎkāi lǐwù. Zài Gēlúnbǐyà, Píng'ān Yè zuì rènao! Wǒ bà zài wàidì gōngzuò, méi huílái. Wǒmen gěi tā dǎ shìpín, shǒujī fàng zài zhuōzi zhōngjiān.","m":"You said it's drizzling there too. It keeps raining in Bogotá too. On Christmas Eve the rain stopped; we ate at my dad's mum's and opened presents together at midnight. In Colombia, Christmas Eve is the big night! My dad works in another city and didn't come home. We video-called him and put the phone in the middle of the table.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"过节的时候，你家有人不能回来吗？","p":"Guòjié de shíhou, nǐ jiā yǒu rén bù néng huílái ma?","m":"At holiday time, is there anyone in your family who can't make it home?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，在很远的地方工作。","p":"Yǒu, zài hěn yuǎn de dìfang gōngzuò.","m":"Yes — working far away.","r":{"t":"那我们一样。手机放在桌子中间，也算在一起。","p":"Nà wǒmen yíyàng. Shǒujī fàng zài zhuōzi zhōngjiān, yě suàn zài yìqǐ.","m":"Same as us. A phone in the middle of the table still counts as together."}},{"t":"没有，大家都在。","p":"Méiyǒu, dàjiā dōu zài.","m":"No — everyone's there.","r":{"t":"真好，好好珍惜。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, hǎohǎo zhēnxī.","m":"Lovely — treasure it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天雨还没停，奶奶在厨房忙，我在旁边帮忙。","p":"Jīntiān yǔ hái méi tíng, nǎinai zài chúfáng máng, wǒ zài pángbiān bāngmáng.","m":"Still raining today — my dad's mum's busy in the kitchen and I'm helping."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边很晴。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān hěn qíng.","m":"It's clear here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边很晴","en":"You said it was clear where you were"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边很晴，真好！这两天雨停了一个上午，我跟奶奶去买菜。她走得很慢，上坡要停两次。我拉着她的手。她说：「以前是我拉着你。」","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān hěn qíng, zhēn hǎo! Zhè liǎng tiān yǔ tíng le yí gè shàngwǔ, wǒ gēn nǎinai qù mǎi cài. Tā zǒu de hěn màn, shàng pō yào tíng liǎng cì. Wǒ lā zhe tā de shǒu. Tā shuō: “Yǐqián shì wǒ lā zhe nǐ.”","m":"You said it's sunny there — lucky! These days the rain stopped for one morning, and my dad's mum and I went shopping. She walks very slowly and has to stop twice going uphill. I held her hand. She said: 'Before, I held yours.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会陪家里的老人出门吗？","p":"Nǐ huì péi jiā lǐ de lǎorén chūmén ma?","m":"Do you go out with the older people in your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，常常陪。","p":"Huì, chángcháng péi.","m":"Yes, often.","r":{"t":"真好，他们最需要的就是有人陪。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, tāmen zuì xūyào de jiù shì yǒu rén péi.","m":"Lovely — company's what they need most."}},{"t":"不太常。","p":"Bú tài cháng.","m":"Not often.","r":{"t":"下次试试，走慢一点就行。","p":"Xià cì shìshi, zǒu màn yìdiǎn jiù xíng.","m":"Try next time — just walk a bit slower."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又下雨了，我在奶奶家复习中文。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xià yǔ le, wǒ zài nǎinai jiā fùxí Zhōngwén.","m":"Raining again today — revising Chinese at Grandma's."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你带伞了吗？","p":"Nǐ dài sǎn le ma?","m":"Did you bring an umbrella?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她带伞了没有（带了，在波哥大一定要带）","en":"You asked if she'd brought an umbrella (yes — in Bogotá you must)"},"later":{"t":"你问我带伞了没有。在波哥大一定要带！可是……考完试，我太开心了，伞忘在公交车上了，哈哈。我哭了一点，是开心的哭。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ dài sǎn le méiyǒu. Zài Bōgēdà yídìng yào dài! Kěshì…… kǎo wán shì, wǒ tài kāixīn le, sǎn wàng zài gōngjiāochē shang le, hāha. Wǒ kū le yìdiǎn, shì kāixīn de kū.","m":"You asked if I brought an umbrella. In Bogotá you must! But… after the exam I was so happy I left it on the bus, haha. I cried a little — happy crying.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有为一件事努力了很久？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu wèi yí jiàn shì nǔlì le hěn jiǔ?","m":"Have you worked hard for something for a long time?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，现在还在努力。","p":"Yǒu, xiànzài hái zài nǔlì.","m":"Yes — still at it.","r":{"t":"加油！结束那天，你也会哭的，哈哈。","p":"Jiāyóu! Jiéshù nà tiān, nǐ yě huì kū de, hāha.","m":"Keep going! The day it's done, you'll cry too, haha."}},{"t":"有，已经完成了。","p":"Yǒu, yǐjīng wánchéng le.","m":"Yes, and it's done.","r":{"t":"恭喜你！那种感觉最好了。","p":"Gōngxǐ nǐ! Nà zhǒng gǎnjué zuì hǎo le.","m":"Congratulations! Best feeling there is."}}],"next":{"t":"今天出门前，奶奶检查了三次我有没有带伞。","p":"Jīntiān chūmén qián, nǎinai jiǎnchá le sān cì wǒ yǒu méiyǒu dài sǎn.","m":"Before I left today, my dad's mum checked three times that I had my umbrella."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你在奶奶家做什么？","p":"Nǐ zài nǎinai jiā zuò shénme?","m":"What are you doing at your grandma's?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她在奶奶家做什么（帮她做午饭，顺便复习中文）","en":"You asked what she was doing at her dad's mum's (helping with lunch, revising Chinese)"},"later":{"t":"你问我在奶奶家做什么。做饭，复习中文。考完试那天，我去奶奶家。她煮好了 ajiaco，就是鸡肉土豆汤。她不问考试，只说：「先吃。」我吃了两碗。","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ zài nǎinai jiā zuò shénme. Zuò fàn, fùxí Zhōngwén. Kǎo wán shì nà tiān, wǒ qù nǎinai jiā. Tā zhǔ hǎo le ajiaco, jiù shì jīròu tǔdòu tāng. Tā bú wèn kǎoshì, zhǐ shuō: “Xiān chī.” Wǒ chī le liǎng wǎn.","m":"You asked what I do at my dad's mum's. Cooking, revising Chinese. The day the exam finished, I went to her place. She had ajiaco ready — chicken and potato soup. She didn't ask about the exam. She just said: 'Eat first.' I had two bowls.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你忙完一件大事以后，家里人会为你做什么吗？","p":"Nǐ máng wán yí jiàn dà shì yǐhòu, jiā lǐ rén huì wèi nǐ zuò shénme ma?","m":"After you finish something big, does your family do anything for you?"},"replies":[{"t":"会做一顿好吃的。","p":"Huì zuò yí dùn hǎochī de.","m":"They cook something good.","r":{"t":"对，这是全世界的家人都会做的事。","p":"Duì, zhè shì quán shìjiè de jiārén dōu huì zuò de shì.","m":"Yes — families everywhere do that."}},{"t":"会说「加油」。","p":"Huì shuō “jiāyóu”.","m":"They say 'you can do it'.","r":{"t":"一句「加油」也很有力量。","p":"Yí jù “jiāyóu” yě hěn yǒu lìliang.","m":"Even one 'you can do it' is powerful."}}],"next":{"t":"今天奶奶又教我做了一道菜，我教她说「谢谢」。","p":"Jīntiān nǎinai yòu jiāo wǒ zuò le yí dào cài, wǒ jiāo tā shuō “xièxie”.","m":"My dad's mum taught me another dish today, and I taught her to say 谢谢."}}},"news":null},"2026-12-23|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-23","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"The sun's setting here too.","p":"","m":"我这边太阳也在落山。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太阳也在落山","en":"You said the sun was setting where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said the sun was setting where you were too. I'm at Mum's now for Christmas. The sun went down at four, and she put on the same Christmas album she's played every year since I was six. Then she said, quietly, that the house is very quiet the rest of the year. I'm going to come up more often.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边太阳也在落山。我现在在我妈家过圣诞。太阳四点就下山了，她放了那张从我六岁起每年都放的圣诞专辑。然后她小声说，一年里其他时候，家里都很安静。我以后要常回来。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How often do you see your parents?","p":"","m":"你多久见一次爸妈？"},"replies":[{"t":"Often.","p":"","m":"常常见。","r":{"t":"Good. Keep it that way.","p":"","m":"很好。保持下去。"}},{"t":"Not as often as I'd like.","p":"","m":"没有我想的那么多。","r":{"t":"Same here. Let's both fix that next year.","p":"","m":"我也是。明年我们都改改。"}}],"next":{"t":"Off to Mum's on the train today. Packed with people and presents.","p":"","m":"今天坐火车去我妈家。车上全是人和礼物。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's still morning here.","p":"","m":"我这边还是早上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边还是早上","en":"You said it was still morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was still morning where you were. By your morning, my day was nearly over. Being at Mum's, I've worked out how little I've seen her this year — the job ate everything. Twelve months, three visits. That's not the number I want next year.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边还是早上。你的早上，我的一天都快过完了。在我妈家，我算了算今年见她的次数——工作把时间都吃掉了。十二个月，来了三次。明年我不想再是这个数字。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Has work or study ever taken over your life?","p":"","m":"工作或者学习有没有占满过你的生活？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, this year.","p":"","m":"有，就是今年。","r":{"t":"Then let's both take some back next year.","p":"","m":"那明年我们都拿回来一点。"}},{"t":"No, I keep a balance.","p":"","m":"没有，我挺平衡的。","r":{"t":"Teach me. Seriously.","p":"","m":"教教我。说真的。"}}],"next":{"t":"Up early today. Christmas Eve, and Mum's already peeling potatoes.","p":"","m":"今天起得早。平安夜，我妈已经在削土豆了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What time did the sun come up?","p":"","m":"太阳几点出来的？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过太阳几点出来（八点刚过，白天八个小时）","en":"You asked what time the sun came up (just after eight — eight hours of daylight)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what time the sun came up. Just after eight. On Christmas morning I was up before it — Mum had me peeling sprouts in the dark. She used to do it all herself. This year she sat and told me what to do. I think her hands are getting tired.","p":"","m":"你上次问太阳几点出来。八点刚过。圣诞节早上我比太阳起得还早——我妈天黑就让我剥抱子甘蓝。以前这些都是她一个人做。今年她坐着，告诉我怎么做。我觉得她的手累了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you help out more at home than you used to?","p":"","m":"你现在在家里帮忙比以前多吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, more and more.","p":"","m":"是，越来越多。","r":{"t":"That's growing up, I suppose.","p":"","m":"我想，这就是长大吧。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太多。","r":{"t":"Start with the sprouts, haha.","p":"","m":"从抱子甘蓝开始吧，哈哈。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dark at four again today. I've stopped being surprised.","p":"","m":"今天又是四点就黑了。我已经不惊讶了。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Does it get you down?","p":"","m":"会让你心情不好吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过白天这么短会不会让他心情不好（有一点，喝茶有用）","en":"You asked if the short days get him down (a bit — tea helps)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the short days get me down. A bit. These days at Mum's, over a pot of tea, I finally told her the job's been stressing me out. I thought she'd worry. She just said, 'You don't have to be brilliant every day, love.' I needed that.","p":"","m":"你上次问白天这么短，会不会让我心情不好。有一点。这两天在我妈家，一壶茶的工夫，我终于跟她说了工作压力很大。我以为她会担心。她只说：「孩子，你不用每天都很厉害。」我正需要这句话。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who do you talk to when you're stressed?","p":"","m":"你压力大的时候，会跟谁说？"},"replies":[{"t":"My family.","p":"","m":"家里人。","r":{"t":"Best people for it. They know you.","p":"","m":"最合适的人。他们了解你。"}},{"t":"A friend.","p":"","m":"一个朋友。","r":{"t":"Good. Don't keep it all in.","p":"","m":"很好。别都憋着。"}}],"next":{"t":"Two cups of tea before noon today. Feeling better already.","p":"","m":"今天中午前喝了两杯茶。已经好多了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-23|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-23","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Kids play in the street here too.","p":"","m":"我这边小孩也在街上玩。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边孩子们也在街上玩","en":"You said kids play in the street where you are too"},"later":{"t":"You said kids play in the street where you are too. Chale, on Christmas Day the street game got huge — uncles joined in, my grandmother was the referee from her chair, and the goals were still two stones. Nobody had a phone out. It was the happiest I've seen our street all year.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边孩子们也在街上玩。兄弟，圣诞节那天街上的比赛变大了——叔叔们也加入了，我奶奶坐在椅子上当裁判，球门还是两块石头。没有一个人拿出手机。这是我今年见过我们这条街最开心的一天。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When did you last do something with no phone at all?","p":"","m":"你上一次完全不看手机，是在做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Can't remember!","p":"","m":"想不起来了！","r":{"t":"Same. Christmas reminded me.","p":"","m":"一样。圣诞节提醒了我。"}},{"t":"With family, recently.","p":"","m":"最近跟家人在一起的时候。","r":{"t":"That's the best way.","p":"","m":"那是最好的方式。"}}],"next":{"t":"The kids are out again — someone got a new ball for Christmas already.","p":"","m":"孩子们又出来了——有人已经提前收到了圣诞节的新球。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's too cold to play outside here.","p":"","m":"我这边太冷了，没法在外面玩。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边太冷，没法在外面玩","en":"You said it's too cold to play outside where you are"},"later":{"t":"You said it's too cold to play outside where you are. Chale, I told my little cousins, and they couldn't believe it. One asked if it's colder than inside the fridge. Then he asked where kids play, then. I said inside, maybe. He looked sad for you. He's seven.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边太冷，没法在外面玩。兄弟，我跟我的小表弟表妹们说了，他们不敢相信。一个问：是不是比冰箱里面还冷？然后又问：那小孩在哪儿玩？我说可能在屋里吧。他替你难过了一下。他才七岁。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Where did you play as a kid?","p":"","m":"你小时候在哪儿玩？"},"replies":[{"t":"Outside, all day.","p":"","m":"在外面，一整天。","r":{"t":"Then you were a street kid like me!","p":"","m":"那你跟我一样是街上长大的小孩！"}},{"t":"Mostly inside.","p":"","m":"大多在屋里。","r":{"t":"That's fine. Kids find fun anywhere.","p":"","m":"也好。小孩在哪儿都能找到乐子。"}}],"next":{"t":"Hot and dusty again today. Perfect football weather, the kids say.","p":"","m":"今天又热又多灰。孩子们说，这就是踢球的好天气。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you play too?","p":"","m":"你也踢吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他也踢不踢（小时候天天踢，现在只看）","en":"You asked if he plays too (every day as a kid — now he just watches)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I play too. Every day when I was a kid. On Christmas afternoon the kids dared me, so I played. Ten minutes. I scored once and then had to sit down for an hour. Chale, studio life. I've promised myself: a run three times a week from January.","p":"","m":"你上次问我也踢不踢。小时候天天踢。圣诞节下午孩子们激我上场，我就上了。十分钟。进了一个球，然后坐了一个小时才缓过来。兄弟，这就是录音棚的生活。我跟自己保证了：从一月开始，一周跑三次步。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you get enough exercise?","p":"","m":"你运动够吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, I try.","p":"","m":"够，我尽量。","r":{"t":"Respect. Keep me honest.","p":"","m":"佩服。监督我一下。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太够。","r":{"t":"Same. Let's both start in January.","p":"","m":"一样。一月我们一起开始吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Watched the street match from the steps again today.","p":"","m":"今天又坐在台阶上看了街上的比赛。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do they use for goals?","p":"","m":"他们用什么当球门？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们用什么当球门（两块石头，跟他小时候一样）","en":"You asked what they use for goals (two stones, same as when he was little)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what they use for goals. Two stones, same as when I was little. On Christmas Day someone's uncle brought a real goal net from the market. The kids looked at it for a minute, then went back to the stones. My grandmother laughed and said: 'Some things don't need to get better.'","p":"","m":"你上次问他们用什么当球门。两块石头，跟我小时候一样。圣诞节那天，有个叔叔从市场买了一个真的球网回来。孩子们看了一分钟，又回去用石头了。我奶奶笑着说：「有些东西不需要变得更好。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something from your childhood that's still exactly the same?","p":"","m":"有没有什么东西，从你小时候到现在一点都没变？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a place near my home.","p":"","m":"有，我家附近的一个地方。","r":{"t":"Those places are treasures.","p":"","m":"那种地方是宝贝。"}},{"t":"Not much.","p":"","m":"没多少。","r":{"t":"Things change fast. That's why the stones matter.","p":"","m":"东西变得很快。所以那两块石头才重要。"}}],"next":{"t":"The stones are still there in the road this morning.","p":"","m":"今天早上那两块石头还在路上。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-24|zh|tobi":{"date":"2026-12-24","l":"zh","id":"tobi","nm":"Tobi","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是早上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì zǎoshang.","m":"It's morning here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是早上。这两天我放假了，早上不用六点起，可是我的身体还是六点就醒了。我就起来，趁家里人都在睡，一个人坐在院子里想想这一年：桥合龙了，女儿长高了，我的中文也进步了一点。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì zǎoshang. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fàngjià le, zǎoshang bú yòng liù diǎn qǐ, kěshì wǒ de shēntǐ háishi liù diǎn jiù xǐng le. Wǒ jiù qǐlái, chèn jiā lǐ rén dōu zài shuì, yí gè rén zuò zài yuànzi lǐ xiǎngxiang zhè yì nián: qiáo hélóng le, nǚ'ér zhǎng gāo le, wǒ de Zhōngwén yě jìnbù le yìdiǎn.","m":"You said it was morning where you were too. I'm off work these days, so no six o'clock alarm — but my body still wakes at six. So I get up while the family's asleep and sit alone in the yard thinking over the year: the bridge joined up, my daughter grew taller, and my Chinese got a little better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"这一年，你最想记住的是什么？","p":"Zhè yì nián, nǐ zuì xiǎng jìzhù de shì shénme?","m":"What do you most want to remember from this year?"},"replies":[{"t":"一个人。","p":"Yí gè rén.","m":"A person.","r":{"t":"人是最值得记住的。","p":"Rén shì zuì zhíde jìzhù de.","m":"People are the most worth remembering."}},{"t":"一件小事。","p":"Yí jiàn xiǎo shì.","m":"A small moment.","r":{"t":"小事常常最大。","p":"Xiǎo shì chángcháng zuì dà.","m":"Small moments are often the biggest."}}],"next":{"t":"圣诞节快乐！今天我六点就醒了，比闹钟还早。","p":"Shèngdàn Jié kuàilè! Jīntiān wǒ liù diǎn jiù xǐng le, bǐ nàozhōng hái zǎo.","m":"Merry Christmas! Awake at six today — before any alarm."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边天已经黑了。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān tiān yǐjīng hēi le.","m":"It's already dark here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天已经黑了","en":"You said it was already dark where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边天已经黑了。同一刻，你那边已经是晚上了。我们家的平安夜很长：先去教堂，再回家吃饭。表哥表姐们唱歌唱到很晚，我两岁的女儿在旁边拍手。我妈说，一家人能坐满一张桌子，就是最好的礼物。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān tiān yǐjīng hēi le. Tóng yí kè, nǐ nàbiān yǐjīng shì wǎnshang le. Wǒmen jiā de Píng'ān Yè hěn cháng: xiān qù jiàotáng, zài huí jiā chī fàn. Biǎogē biǎojiěmen chàng gē chàng dào hěn wǎn, wǒ liǎng suì de nǚ'ér zài pángbiān pāi shǒu. Wǒ mā shuō, yì jiā rén néng zuò mǎn yì zhāng zhuōzi, jiù shì zuì hǎo de lǐwù.","m":"You said it was already dark where you were — same moment, and you were already in the evening. Our Christmas Eve was long: church first, then home for dinner, and the cousins sang till late while my two-year-old daughter clapped along. My mum says a family that fills a whole table is the best present.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你们家人多的时候，会一起做什么？","p":"Nǐmen jiā rén duō de shíhou, huì yìqǐ zuò shénme?","m":"When your family gets together, what do you do?"},"replies":[{"t":"一起吃饭聊天。","p":"Yìqǐ chī fàn liáotiān.","m":"Eat and talk.","r":{"t":"对，人多吃饭最香。","p":"Duì, rén duō chī fàn zuì xiāng.","m":"Right — food tastes best with a crowd."}},{"t":"我们家人不多。","p":"Wǒmen jiā rén bù duō.","m":"My family's small.","r":{"t":"人少也好，说话可以说得更深。","p":"Rén shǎo yě hǎo, shuōhuà kěyǐ shuō de gèng shēn.","m":"Small is good too — you can talk more deeply."}}],"next":{"t":"今天家里还有很多人，我的嗓子唱哑了，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān jiā lǐ hái yǒu hěn duō rén, wǒ de sǎngzi chàng yǎ le, hāha.","m":"Still a full house today — I've sung myself hoarse, haha."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"平安夜也要上班吗？","p":"Píng'ān Yè yě yào shàngbān ma?","m":"Do you work on Christmas Eve too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他平安夜上不上班（上半天，中午回家）","en":"You asked if he works on Christmas Eve (half a day, home at noon)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我平安夜上不上班。上了半天。中午走的时候，我去跟王经理说圣诞快乐。他今年一个人在拉各斯过节，回不了家。我请他圣诞节来我家吃饭，他说要带一点中国的东西来。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ Píng'ān Yè shàng bu shàng bān. Shàng le bàn tiān. Zhōngwǔ zǒu de shíhou, wǒ qù gēn Wáng jīnglǐ shuō Shèngdàn kuàilè. Tā jīnnián yí gè rén zài Lāgèsī guòjié, huí bu liǎo jiā. Wǒ qǐng tā Shèngdàn Jié lái wǒ jiā chī fàn, tā shuō yào dài yìdiǎn Zhōngguó de dōngxi lái.","m":"Last time you asked if I worked on Christmas Eve. Half a day. As I left at noon, I went to wish Manager Wang a merry Christmas. He's spending the holidays alone in Lagos this year — he can't get home. I invited him over for Christmas, and he said he'd bring something from China.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有在外地过节的经历？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu zài wàidì guòjié de jīnglì?","m":"Have you ever spent a holiday away from home?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，有点孤单。","p":"Yǒu, yǒudiǎn gūdān.","m":"Yes — a bit lonely.","r":{"t":"那我更要请他来了。","p":"Nà wǒ gèng yào qǐng tā lái le.","m":"Then I'm even more glad I invited him."}},{"t":"没有。","p":"Méiyǒu.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"希望你一直能跟家人一起过。","p":"Xīwàng nǐ yìzhí néng gēn jiārén yìqǐ guò.","m":"I hope you always get to spend them with family."}}],"next":{"t":"今天休息，工地终于安静了。","p":"Jīntiān xiūxi, gōngdì zhōngyú ānjìng le.","m":"Day off today — the site's finally quiet."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们怎么过圣诞节？","p":"Nǐmen zěnme guò Shèngdàn Jié?","m":"How do you celebrate Christmas?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们怎么过圣诞节（去教堂，一大家子吃 jollof 饭）","en":"You asked how they celebrate Christmas (church, then jollof with the whole family)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们怎么过圣诞节。去教堂，然后一大家子吃 jollof 饭。今年 jollof 是我妈做的，她还是不让任何人进厨房。我偷偷进去，看到她坐在凳子上搅锅，腰不太好了。明年，我想跟她学。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen zěnme guò Shèngdàn Jié. Qù jiàotáng, ránhòu yí dà jiāzi chī jollof fàn. Jīnnián jollof shì wǒ mā zuò de, tā hái shì bú ràng rènhé rén jìn chúfáng. Wǒ tōutōu jìnqù, kàn dào tā zuò zài dèngzi shang jiǎo guō, yāo bú tài hǎo le. Míngnián, wǒ xiǎng gēn tā xué.","m":"Last time you asked how we celebrate Christmas. Church, then jollof rice with the whole extended family. This year my mum made the jollof, and she still won't let anyone in the kitchen. I sneaked in and saw her sitting on a stool to stir the pot — her back isn't good any more. Next year, I want to learn it from her.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"家里有没有一道菜，你想学会？","p":"Jiā lǐ yǒu méiyǒu yí dào cài, nǐ xiǎng xué huì?","m":"Is there a family dish you want to learn?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我妈妈的拿手菜。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ māma de náshǒu cài.","m":"Yes — my mum's signature dish.","r":{"t":"趁现在学，别等。","p":"Chèn xiànzài xué, bié děng.","m":"Learn it now — don't wait."}},{"t":"我已经会了。","p":"Wǒ yǐjīng huì le.","m":"I already know it.","r":{"t":"太好了，那这道菜会一直传下去。","p":"Tài hǎo le, nà zhè dào cài huì yìzhí chuán xiàqù.","m":"Great — then it'll carry on down the family."}}],"next":{"t":"圣诞快乐！我妈的 jollof 已经在锅里了，我被赶出了厨房。","p":"Shèngdàn kuàilè! Wǒ mā de jollof yǐjīng zài guō lǐ le, wǒ bèi gǎn chū le chúfáng.","m":"Merry Christmas! Mum's jollof is in the pot, and I've been chased out of the kitchen."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"圣诞节早上，Funmi 下了夜班回来，桌上的早饭已经摆好了。","p":"Shèngdàn Jié zǎoshang, Funmi xià le yèbān huílái, zhuō shang de zǎofàn yǐjīng bǎi hǎo le.","m":"On Christmas morning Funmi came home from her night shift to breakfast already on the table."},{"t":"葱油饼第一个焦了，第二个还可以，第三个最好。","p":"Cōngyóubǐng dì yī gè jiāo le, dì èr gè hái kěyǐ, dì sān gè zuì hǎo.","m":"The first scallion pancake burned, the second was OK, the third was the best."},{"t":"她吃了第三个，说：「这一年辛苦你们了。」我说：「辛苦的是你。」她下了夜班睡到中午，下午家里才热闹起来。","p":"Tā chī le dì sān gè, shuō: “Zhè yì nián xīnkǔ nǐmen le.” Wǒ shuō: “Xīnkǔ de shì nǐ.” Tā xià le yèbān shuì dào zhōngwǔ, xiàwǔ jiā lǐ cái rènao qǐlái.","m":"She ate the third one and said: 'Thank you both for this year.' I said: 'You're the one who worked hard.' She slept off the night shift till noon, and the house only got lively in the afternoon."}],"replies":[{"t":"你们一家好温暖。","p":"Nǐmen yì jiā hǎo wēnnuǎn.","m":"Your family's so warm.","r":{"t":"谢谢。她是我们家的英雄。","p":"Xièxie. Tā shì wǒmen jiā de yīngxióng.","m":"Thank you. She's our family's hero."}},{"t":"Funmi 好好休息！","p":"Funmi hǎohǎo xiūxi!","m":"Rest well, Funmi!","r":{"t":"她睡到中午，起来正好赶上一大家子来吃饭。","p":"Tā shuì dào zhōngwǔ, qǐlái zhènghǎo gǎn shang yí dà jiāzi lái chī fàn.","m":"She slept till noon — just in time for the whole family arriving for lunch."}}],"from":"2026-12-27"}},"2026-12-24|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-24","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"There's frost here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也有霜。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也有霜","en":"You said there was frost where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said there was frost where you were too. These days it turned to snow here — just enough for the kids to make a very small, very dirty snowman by the bike racks. My eldest said, 'Next year I'll be too old for this.' Then built a second one.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也有霜。这两天我这边下雪了——刚好够孩子们在自行车架旁边堆一个很小、很脏的雪人。大的那个说：「明年我就太大了，不玩这个了。」然后又堆了第二个。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something you thought you'd outgrow but still love?","p":"","m":"有没有什么，你以为长大就不喜欢了，可是现在还喜欢？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, cartoons.","p":"","m":"有，动画片。","r":{"t":"Ha! Me too. Never stop.","p":"","m":"哈！我也是。永远别停。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Look again. There's always something.","p":"","m":"再想想。总会有一样的。"}}],"next":{"t":"God jul! Frost on the windows this morning — the kids drew in it.","p":"","m":"圣诞快乐！早上窗户上有霜——孩子们在上面画画。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's already dark here.","p":"","m":"我这边天已经黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天已经黑了","en":"You said it was already dark where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was already dark where you were, while our sun was only just coming up. These days I worked it out: our Christmas Eve dinner happened while you were probably asleep. My mum, who's usually in bed by nine, stayed up till ten. She said, 'One more year together.'","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天已经黑了，我们这边太阳才刚出来。这两天我算了算：我们吃平安夜晚饭的时候，你大概已经睡了。我妈平时九点就睡，这次熬到了十点。她说：「又一起过了一年。」","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who's the oldest person in your family?","p":"","m":"你家里年纪最大的人是谁？"},"replies":[{"t":"My grandparent.","p":"","m":"我爷爷奶奶或者外公外婆。","r":{"t":"Spend time with them. Every year counts.","p":"","m":"多陪陪他们。每一年都珍贵。"}},{"t":"My parents.","p":"","m":"我爸妈。","r":{"t":"Then every holiday together is a gift.","p":"","m":"那每一个一起过的节都是礼物。"}}],"next":{"t":"God jul! Still dark at eight this morning.","p":"","m":"圣诞快乐！早上八点天还是黑的。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What do you do on Christmas Eve?","p":"","m":"平安夜你们做什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她平安夜做什么（一顿大餐，三点全家看唐老鸭）","en":"You asked what they do on Christmas Eve (a big dinner, and Donald Duck at three)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we do on Christmas Eve. A big dinner, and at three, Donald Duck. My mum laughed at exactly the same jokes she's laughed at for fifty years. Then she told the kids about Christmas when she was little: no TV, one orange each, and she was happy. The kids went very quiet.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们平安夜做什么。一顿大餐，三点看唐老鸭。我妈又在同样的笑话那里笑，笑了五十年。然后她给孩子们讲她小时候的圣诞：没有电视，每人一个橙子，她很开心。孩子们一下子安静了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do the older people in your family tell stories about when they were young?","p":"","m":"你家里的老人会讲他们小时候的事吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"会，常常讲。","r":{"t":"Listen to every one. They won't always be there to tell them.","p":"","m":"每一个都好好听。他们不会一直都在讲。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太讲。","r":{"t":"Ask them. My mum only started because the kids asked.","p":"","m":"问问他们吧。我妈也是孩子们问了才开始讲的。"}}],"next":{"t":"God jul! Leftover rice pudding for breakfast.","p":"","m":"圣诞快乐！早饭吃剩的米布丁。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Why Donald Duck?","p":"","m":"为什么看唐老鸭？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过为什么是唐老鸭（从六十年代起每年平安夜都放）","en":"You asked why Donald Duck (it's been on every Christmas Eve since the sixties)"},"later":{"t":"You asked why Donald Duck. It's been on TV every Christmas Eve since the sixties — Kalle Anka, we call him. Millions of Swedes watch it together every year. My kids say it's 'boring but you have to'. I think that's what tradition is: something that holds a family in one room for an hour.","p":"","m":"你上次问为什么是唐老鸭。从六十年代起，每年平安夜电视上都放——我们叫他 Kalle Anka。每年都有几百万瑞典人一起看。孩子们说它「很无聊，可是必须看」。我觉得这就是传统：让一家人在一个房间里待一个小时。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something your family always does together?","p":"","m":"你们家有没有总是一起做的事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, every year.","p":"","m":"有，每年都做。","r":{"t":"Keep it. One day you'll be the one keeping it going.","p":"","m":"留着它。有一天会轮到你来延续。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"You could start one. It doesn't have to be a duck.","p":"","m":"你可以开始一个。不一定要是唐老鸭。"}}],"next":{"t":"God jul! The kids already quoted Donald Duck at breakfast.","p":"","m":"圣诞快乐！孩子们早饭时已经在学唐老鸭说话了。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-25|zh|owen":{"date":"2026-12-25","l":"zh","id":"owen","nm":"Owen","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边街上也很安静。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān jiē shang yě hěn ānjìng.","m":"The street's quiet here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边街上也很安静","en":"You said your street was quiet too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边街上也很安静。这两天纽约又热闹起来了，大家都在退礼物、买打折的东西。我没去。我在想明年的事：学校问我要不要当年级组长，钱多一点，可是陪女儿的时间会少。我还没决定。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān jiē shang yě hěn ānjìng. Zhè liǎng tiān Niǔyuē yòu rènao qǐlái le, dàjiā dōu zài tuì lǐwù, mǎi dǎzhé de dōngxi. Wǒ méi qù. Wǒ zài xiǎng míngnián de shì: xuéxiào wèn wǒ yào bu yào dāng niánjí zǔzhǎng, qián duō yìdiǎn, kěshì péi nǚ'ér de shíjiān huì shǎo. Wǒ hái méi juédìng.","m":"You said your street was quiet too. These days New York's got busy again — everyone returning presents and hunting sales. I stayed home, thinking about next year: school's asked if I want to be head of year. A bit more money, but less time with my daughter. I haven't decided.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"钱和时间，你会怎么选？","p":"Qián hé shíjiān, nǐ huì zěnme xuǎn?","m":"Money or time — how would you choose?"},"replies":[{"t":"时间。","p":"Shíjiān.","m":"Time.","r":{"t":"我也越来越这么想。","p":"Wǒ yě yuè lái yuè zhème xiǎng.","m":"I'm leaning that way more and more."}},{"t":"看情况，钱也很重要。","p":"Kàn qíngkuàng, qián yě hěn zhòngyào.","m":"Depends — money matters too.","r":{"t":"对，这就是难的地方。","p":"Duì, zhè jiù shì nán de dìfang.","m":"Right — that's what makes it hard."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在家想了一天，还是没想好。","p":"Jīntiān zài jiā xiǎng le yì tiān, háishi méi xiǎng hǎo.","m":"Thought about it at home all day — still undecided."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边街上很热闹。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān jiē shang hěn rènao.","m":"The street's lively here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边街上很热闹","en":"You said your street was lively"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边街上很热闹。纽约这两天也热闹了，我带爸妈和女儿去法拉盛吃了一顿早茶。我爸走路比去年慢了很多，可是他还是坚持自己点菜，用他的「谢谢老板」。我在旁边，眼睛有点湿。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān jiē shang hěn rènao. Niǔyuē zhè liǎng tiān yě rènao le, wǒ dài bà mā hé nǚ'ér qù Fǎlāshèng chī le yí dùn zǎochá. Wǒ bà zǒulù bǐ qùnián màn le hěn duō, kěshì tā háishi jiānchí zìjǐ diǎn cài, yòng tā de “xièxie lǎobǎn”. Wǒ zài pángbiān, yǎnjing yǒudiǎn shī.","m":"You said your street was lively. New York's livened up these days too — I took my parents and daughter to Flushing for dim sum. Dad walks much slower than last year, but he still insisted on ordering himself, with his 谢谢老板. Sitting next to him, my eyes got a bit wet.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟爸妈多久见一次？","p":"Nǐ gēn bà mā duō jiǔ jiàn yí cì?","m":"How often do you see your parents?"},"replies":[{"t":"常常见。","p":"Chángcháng jiàn.","m":"Often.","r":{"t":"真好，你很幸运。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, nǐ hěn xìngyùn.","m":"Lovely — you're lucky."}},{"t":"一年一两次。","p":"Yì nián yì liǎng cì.","m":"Once or twice a year.","r":{"t":"那每一次都很珍贵。","p":"Nà měi yí cì dōu hěn zhēnguì.","m":"Then every visit is precious."}}],"next":{"t":"今天纽约的店都开了，街上一下子满了。","p":"Jīntiān Niǔyuē de diàn dōu kāi le, jiē shang yíxiàzi mǎn le.","m":"The shops all opened today — the streets filled up in a flash."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"圣诞节你怎么过？","p":"Shèngdàn Jié nǐ zěnme guò?","m":"How are you spending Christmas?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他圣诞节怎么过（跟家里人吃晚饭，做了一道麻婆豆腐）","en":"You asked how he spent Christmas (dinner with family, made mapo tofu)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我圣诞节怎么过。跟家里人吃晚饭，我做了一道麻婆豆腐。太辣了，我爸吃一口喝一杯水，可是他把一整盘都吃完了。他说：「你学的东西，我要支持。」我爸不太会说好听的话，这句我会记很久。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ Shèngdàn Jié zěnme guò. Gēn jiā lǐ rén chī wǎnfàn, wǒ zuò le yí dào mápó dòufu. Tài là le, wǒ bà chī yì kǒu hē yì bēi shuǐ, kěshì tā bǎ yì zhěng pán dōu chī wán le. Tā shuō: “Nǐ xué de dōngxi, wǒ yào zhīchí.” Wǒ bà bú tài huì shuō hǎotīng de huà, zhè jù wǒ huì jì hěn jiǔ.","m":"Last time you asked how I spent Christmas. Dinner with family — I made mapo tofu. Far too spicy: my dad drank a glass of water after every bite, but he finished the whole plate. He said: 'What you're learning, I'm going to support.' My dad's not one for nice words. I'll remember that one for a long time.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里人支持你学中文吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ rén zhīchí nǐ xué Zhōngwén ma?","m":"Does your family support you learning Chinese?"},"replies":[{"t":"很支持。","p":"Hěn zhīchí.","m":"Very much.","r":{"t":"那你要好好谢谢他们。","p":"Nà nǐ yào hǎohǎo xièxie tāmen.","m":"Then make sure you thank them."}},{"t":"他们不太懂，可是不反对。","p":"Tāmen bú tài dǒng, kěshì bù fǎnduì.","m":"They don't really get it, but they don't mind.","r":{"t":"慢慢来，有一天他们会为你骄傲。","p":"Mànmàn lái, yǒu yì tiān tāmen huì wèi nǐ jiāo'ào.","m":"Give it time — one day they'll be proud."}}],"next":{"t":"剩下的麻婆豆腐，今天我一个人吃完了。","p":"Shèngxià de mápó dòufu, jīntiān wǒ yí gè rén chī wán le.","m":"Finished the leftover mapo tofu on my own today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你今天收到礼物了吗？","p":"Nǐ jīntiān shōudào lǐwù le ma?","m":"Did you get any presents today?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他收到礼物没有（收到一本中文书）","en":"You asked if he got a present (a Chinese book)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我收到礼物没有。收到了一本中文书，是我太太送的。书里夹着一张纸条，她用中文写的：「慢慢看。」她偷偷学了这三个字。我们结婚这么多年了，她还会这样让我意外。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shōu dào lǐwù méiyǒu. Shōu dào le yì běn Zhōngwén shū, shì wǒ tàitai sòng de. Shū lǐ jiā zhe yì zhāng zhǐtiáo, tā yòng Zhōngwén xiě de: “Mànmàn kàn.” Tā tōutōu xué le zhè sān gè zì. Wǒmen jiéhūn zhème duō nián le, tā hái huì zhèyàng ràng wǒ yìwài.","m":"Last time you asked if I got a present. A Chinese book, from my wife. There was a note inside, in Chinese: 慢慢看 — 'read it slowly.' She'd secretly learned those three characters. All these years married, and she can still surprise me.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你收到过最特别的礼物是什么？","p":"Nǐ shōu dào guo zuì tèbié de lǐwù shì shénme?","m":"What's the most special present you've ever had?"},"replies":[{"t":"一封手写的信。","p":"Yì fēng shǒuxiě de xìn.","m":"A handwritten letter.","r":{"t":"手写的最珍贵。","p":"Shǒuxiě de zuì zhēnguì.","m":"Handwritten is the most precious."}},{"t":"想不起来了。","p":"Xiǎng bu qǐlái le.","m":"Can't remember.","r":{"t":"那下一份一定会很特别。","p":"Nà xià yí fèn yídìng huì hěn tèbié.","m":"Then the next one will be special."}}],"next":{"t":"今天开始看新书，第一页就有两个字不认识，哈哈。","p":"Jīntiān kāishǐ kàn xīn shū, dì yī yè jiù yǒu liǎng gè zì bú rènshi, hāha.","m":"Started the new book today — two characters I didn't know on page one, haha."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"爸妈回去了。走之前，我爸在门口用中文说了第三句：「明年见。」","p":"Bà mā huíqù le. Zǒu zhīqián, wǒ bà zài ménkǒu yòng Zhōngwén shuō le dì sān jù: “Míngnián jiàn.”","m":"Mum and Dad went home. Before leaving, Dad said his third Chinese phrase at the door: 明年见 — see you next year."},{"t":"我看着他慢慢上车，决定了：年级组长，我不当了。","p":"Wǒ kàn zhe tā mànmàn shàng chē, juédìng le: niánjí zǔzhǎng, wǒ bù dāng le.","m":"Watching him get slowly into the car, I made up my mind: I'm turning down head of year."},{"t":"钱少一点没关系。我想多一点时间，陪女儿，也陪他们。","p":"Qián shǎo yìdiǎn méi guānxi. Wǒ xiǎng duō yìdiǎn shíjiān, péi nǚ'ér, yě péi tāmen.","m":"A bit less money is fine. I want more time — with my daughter, and with them."}],"replies":[{"t":"我觉得你做得对。","p":"Wǒ juéde nǐ zuò de duì.","m":"I think you made the right call.","r":{"t":"谢谢。说出来以后，心里轻松多了。","p":"Xièxie. Shuō chūlái yǐhòu, xīn lǐ qīngsōng duō le.","m":"Thanks. Saying it out loud made me feel so much lighter."}},{"t":"这个决定不容易。","p":"Zhège juédìng bù róngyì.","m":"That wasn't an easy decision.","r":{"t":"对，可是我爸的那句「明年见」帮了我。","p":"Duì, kěshì wǒ bà de nà jù “míngnián jiàn” bāng le wǒ.","m":"No — but Dad's 'see you next year' helped me decide."}}],"from":"2026-12-28"}},"2026-12-25|zh|nour":{"date":"2026-12-25","l":"zh","id":"nour","nm":"Nour","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边晚上街上也很多人。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān wǎnshang jiē shang yě hěn duō rén.","m":"The streets here are busy at night too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边晚上街上也很多人","en":"You said lots of people are out at night where you are too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边晚上街上也很多人。这两天开罗晚上很凉快，我跟大学的朋友十点出去，一直聊到一点。我们快毕业了，有人要出国，有人要结婚，有人还不知道做什么。我们约好了：不管去哪儿，每年冬天回来见一次。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān wǎnshang jiē shang yě hěn duō rén. Zhè liǎng tiān Kāiluó wǎnshang hěn liángkuai, wǒ gēn dàxué de péngyou shí diǎn chūqù, yìzhí liáo dào yì diǎn. Wǒmen kuài bìyè le, yǒu rén yào chūguó, yǒu rén yào jiéhūn, yǒu rén hái bù zhīdào zuò shénme. Wǒmen yuē hǎo le: bùguǎn qù nǎr, měi nián dōngtiān huílái jiàn yí cì.","m":"You said lots of people are out at night where you are too. Cairo's been cool in the evenings these days. My university friends and I went out at ten and talked till one. We're about to graduate — some are going abroad, some getting married, some still don't know what's next. We made a promise: wherever we go, we meet back here every winter.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟老朋友会约好定期见面吗？","p":"Nǐ gēn lǎo péngyou huì yuē hǎo dìngqī jiànmiàn ma?","m":"Do you and old friends have a regular meet-up?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，每年见一次。","p":"Huì, měi nián jiàn yí cì.","m":"Yes, once a year.","r":{"t":"真好，我们也要这样。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, wǒmen yě yào zhèyàng.","m":"Lovely — we'll do that too."}},{"t":"没有，大家都太忙了。","p":"Méiyǒu, dàjiā dōu tài máng le.","m":"No — everyone's too busy.","r":{"t":"约一次吧，一次就会有第二次。","p":"Yuē yí cì ba, yí cì jiù huì yǒu dì èr cì.","m":"Arrange one — once leads to twice."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上十点，楼下的咖啡馆又坐满了。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang shí diǎn, lóu xià de kāfēiguǎn yòu zuò mǎn le.","m":"At ten tonight the café downstairs was packed again."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边晚上街上没人。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān wǎnshang jiē shang méi rén.","m":"There's nobody on the streets here at night."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边晚上街上没人","en":"You said the streets are empty at night where you are"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边晚上街上没人。我很难想象！开罗的晚上永远很吵。可是这两天我发现，我其实有点想要安静。快毕业了，要决定是去中国读研究生，还是留在开罗工作。在吵的地方，我听不见自己。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān wǎnshang jiē shang méi rén. Wǒ hěn nán xiǎngxiàng! Kāiluó de wǎnshang yǒngyuǎn hěn chǎo. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, wǒ qíshí yǒudiǎn xiǎng yào ānjìng. Kuài bìyè le, yào juédìng shì qù Zhōngguó dú yánjiūshēng, háishi liú zài Kāiluó gōngzuò. Zài chǎo de dìfang, wǒ tīng bu jiàn zìjǐ.","m":"You said the streets are empty at night where you are. I can hardly imagine it! Cairo nights are always loud. But these days I realised I actually want some quiet. I'm about to graduate and have to decide: a master's in China, or a job in Cairo. Somewhere noisy, I can't hear myself think.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你要做大决定的时候，需要安静吗？","p":"Nǐ yào zuò dà juédìng de shíhou, xūyào ānjìng ma?","m":"When you have a big decision to make, do you need quiet?"},"replies":[{"t":"需要，一个人想。","p":"Xūyào, yí gè rén xiǎng.","m":"Yes — I think alone.","r":{"t":"对，我也要找一个安静的地方。","p":"Duì, wǒ yě yào zhǎo yí gè ānjìng de dìfang.","m":"Right — I need to find a quiet spot too."}},{"t":"不用，我喜欢跟人聊。","p":"Bú yòng, wǒ xǐhuan gēn rén liáo.","m":"No — I like talking it through.","r":{"t":"也是好办法，说出来就清楚了。","p":"Yě shì hǎo bànfǎ, shuō chūlái jiù qīngchu le.","m":"That works too — saying it makes it clear."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我关上窗户，想象你那边安静的街。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ guān shang chuānghu, xiǎngxiàng nǐ nàbiān ānjìng de jiē.","m":"Shut my window today and pictured your quiet street."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你们过圣诞节吗？","p":"Nǐmen guò Shèngdàn Jié ma?","m":"Do you celebrate Christmas?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们过不过圣诞节（埃及的科普特人一月七号过）","en":"You asked if they celebrate Christmas (Egypt's Copts do, on 7 January)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我们过不过圣诞节。埃及的科普特人一月七号过。我最好的朋友 Mariam 是科普特人，她从十一月底就开始斋戒了，不吃肉，也不吃奶制品，一直到一月七号。我是穆斯林，斋月的时候她陪我，现在换我陪她。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒmen guò bu guò Shèngdàn Jié. Āijí de Kēpǔtè rén yī yuè qī hào guò. Wǒ zuì hǎo de péngyou Mariam shì Kēpǔtè rén, tā cóng shíyī yuè dǐ jiù kāishǐ zhāijiè le, bù chī ròu, yě bù chī nǎizhìpǐn, yìzhí dào yī yuè qī hào. Wǒ shì mùsīlín, zhāiyuè de shíhou tā péi wǒ, xiànzài huàn wǒ péi tā.","m":"Last time you asked if we celebrate Christmas. Egypt's Copts celebrate on 7 January. My best friend Mariam is Coptic. She's been fasting since late November — no meat, no dairy — until 7 January. I'm Muslim; during Ramadan she kept me company, and now it's my turn to keep her company.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有跟你很不一样的好朋友吗？","p":"Nǐ yǒu gēn nǐ hěn bù yíyàng de hǎo péngyou ma?","m":"Do you have a close friend who's very different from you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那你一定从他身上学到很多。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng cóng tā shēn shang xué dào hěn duō.","m":"Then you must learn a lot from them."}},{"t":"没有，我的朋友都跟我差不多。","p":"Méiyǒu, wǒ de péngyou dōu gēn wǒ chàbuduō.","m":"No — my friends are all like me.","r":{"t":"也很好。不一样的朋友，也许哪天就来了。","p":"Yě hěn hǎo. Bù yíyàng de péngyou, yěxǔ nǎ tiān jiù lái le.","m":"That's fine too. A different kind of friend might turn up one day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天跟 Mariam 吃饭，我也陪她吃了一顿素的。","p":"Jīntiān gēn Mariam chī fàn, wǒ yě péi tā chī le yí dùn sù de.","m":"Ate with Mariam today — had a meat-free meal with her."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你这么晚还不睡吗？","p":"Nǐ zhème wǎn hái bú shuì ma?","m":"Still up this late?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她这么晚还不睡吗（还早呢，十二点睡很正常）","en":"You asked if she wasn't going to bed yet (it's early — midnight's normal there)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我那么晚还不睡吗。还早呢！可是这两天我开始带团，早上六点就要去酒店接客人，只好十一点睡。第一天我睡不着，第二天累得什么都忘了。我才明白，工作以后，睡觉比什么都重要。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ nàme wǎn hái bú shuì ma. Hái zǎo ne! Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ kāishǐ dài tuán, zǎoshang liù diǎn jiù yào qù jiǔdiàn jiē kèrén, zhǐhǎo shíyī diǎn shuì. Dì yī tiān wǒ shuì bù zháo, dì èr tiān lèi de shénme dōu wàng le. Wǒ cái míngbai, gōngzuò yǐhòu, shuìjiào bǐ shénme dōu zhòngyào.","m":"Last time you asked if I wasn't going to bed that late. That's early! But these days I've started guiding again, with hotel pickups at six, so I have to sleep at eleven. The first night I couldn't fall asleep; the second day I was so tired I forgot everything. Now I get it: once you're working, sleep matters more than anything.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一般几点睡觉？","p":"Nǐ yìbān jǐ diǎn shuìjiào?","m":"What time do you usually go to bed?"},"replies":[{"t":"十一点左右。","p":"Shíyī diǎn zuǒyòu.","m":"Around eleven.","r":{"t":"那你跟现在的我一样，哈哈。","p":"Nà nǐ gēn xiànzài de wǒ yíyàng, hāha.","m":"Same as me right now, haha."}},{"t":"很晚，过了十二点。","p":"Hěn wǎn, guò le shí'èr diǎn.","m":"Late — after midnight.","r":{"t":"小心身体，我刚学到这个，哈哈。","p":"Xiǎoxīn shēntǐ, wǒ gāng xué dào zhège, hāha.","m":"Look after yourself — I've just learned that lesson, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又是五点半起床，去酒店接客人。","p":"Jīntiān yòu shì wǔ diǎn bàn qǐchuáng, qù jiǔdiàn jiē kèrén.","m":"Up at half five again today for a hotel pickup."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Mariam 邀请我一月七号去她家过圣诞节。","p":"Mariam yāoqǐng wǒ yī yuè qī hào qù tā jiā guò Shèngdàn Jié.","m":"Mariam's invited me to her family's Christmas on 7 January."},{"t":"我跟她说了我的烦恼：去中国读研究生，还是留在开罗。她听完说：「你说中国的时候，眼睛是亮的。」","p":"Wǒ gēn tā shuō le wǒ de fánnǎo: qù Zhōngguó dú yánjiūshēng, háishi liú zài Kāiluó. Tā tīng wán shuō: “Nǐ shuō Zhōngguó de shíhou, yǎnjing shì liàng de.”","m":"I told her what's been worrying me: a master's in China, or staying in Cairo. She listened and said: 'When you talk about China, your eyes light up.'"},{"t":"我还没决定。可是我先去问问我妈。","p":"Wǒ hái méi juédìng. Kěshì wǒ xiān qù wènwen wǒ mā.","m":"I haven't decided. But first I'm going to talk to my mum."}],"replies":[{"t":"Mariam 是个好朋友。","p":"Mariam shì gè hǎo péngyou.","m":"Mariam's a good friend.","r":{"t":"是啊，她比我还了解我。","p":"Shì a, tā bǐ wǒ hái liǎojiě wǒ.","m":"Yes — she knows me better than I do."}},{"t":"跟妈妈好好聊。","p":"Gēn māma hǎohǎo liáo.","m":"Have a good talk with your mum.","r":{"t":"嗯，这是最难的，也是最重要的。","p":"Èn, zhè shì zuì nán de, yě shì zuì zhòngyào de.","m":"Mm — it's the hardest part, and the most important."}}],"from":"2026-12-28"}},"2026-12-25|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-25","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's getting dark here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也快黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天也开始黑了","en":"You said it was getting dark where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was getting dark where you were too. These days I've found a trick for short days: every day this week I walk at midday, even when it's freezing. Fifteen minutes. Jess thinks I'm crazy. Honestly, I feel less down after. Winter here used to really get to me. This one's better.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也开始黑了。这两天我找到一个对付白天短的办法：这周每天中午都出去走一走，冷也去。十五分钟。Jess 觉得我疯了。说实话，走完心情没那么低落了。以前这里的冬天让我很难熬。今年好多了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"How do you get through short winter days?","p":"","m":"冬天白天短的时候，你怎么熬过去？"},"replies":[{"t":"Go outside when I can.","p":"","m":"能出去就出去。","r":{"t":"Same. Every bit of light helps.","p":"","m":"一样。每一点光都有用。"}},{"t":"Spend time with people.","p":"","m":"跟人待在一起。","r":{"t":"That's the best medicine.","p":"","m":"那是最好的药。"}}],"next":{"t":"Fifteen-minute walk at noon. Freezing, but worth it.","p":"","m":"中午走了十五分钟。很冷，可是值得。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's the middle of the night here.","p":"","m":"我这边是半夜。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是半夜","en":"You said it was the middle of the night where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was the middle of the night where you were. I hope you got back to sleep! These days I've been thinking: on Christmas Day, my mum in Seoul was asleep while we ate. She messaged at her 7 am: 'Did you eat well?' I said yes, with friends. She sent back a heart. She's been worried I'm lonely here.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边是半夜。希望你后来又睡着了！这两天我在想：圣诞节我们吃饭的时候，首尔的妈妈在睡觉。她在她那边早上七点给我发消息：「吃得好吗？」我说吃得很好，跟朋友一起。她回了一颗心。她一直担心我在这里孤单。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Does your family worry about you?","p":"","m":"你家里人会担心你吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, all the time.","p":"","m":"会，一直都担心。","r":{"t":"Send them good news. It helps them sleep.","p":"","m":"给他们发点好消息吧。能让他们睡得好一点。"}},{"t":"Not much.","p":"","m":"不太会。","r":{"t":"Then they trust you. That's nice too.","p":"","m":"那说明他们信任你。也很好。"}}],"next":{"t":"Mum's message came in at 5 pm my time. 'Did you eat?'","p":"","m":"妈妈的消息在我这边下午五点到了。「吃饭了吗？」"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How are you spending Christmas?","p":"","m":"你怎么过圣诞？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他圣诞节怎么过（跟公司的朋友，大家都离家很远）","en":"You asked how he was spending Christmas (with work friends — all far from home)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how I was spending Christmas. With friends from work — we're all far from home. Jess hosted. Everyone brought something from home: I made tteok, Jess made her grandma's pie, another colleague brought samosas. Honestly, when I moved here I knew nobody. This year I had a table.","p":"","m":"你上次问我圣诞节怎么过。跟公司的朋友——我们都离家很远。Jess 请客。每个人都带了一样家乡的东西：我做了年糕，Jess 做了她奶奶的派，另一个同事带了萨摩萨。说实话，刚搬来的时候我在这里谁都不认识。今年我有了一桌人。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who would you want at your table on a holiday?","p":"","m":"过节的时候，你想跟谁坐在一张桌子上？"},"replies":[{"t":"My family.","p":"","m":"我的家人。","r":{"t":"Of course. They're the first seats.","p":"","m":"当然。他们是第一排的位子。"}},{"t":"My friends.","p":"","m":"我的朋友。","r":{"t":"Friends far from home become family.","p":"","m":"离家很远的朋友，会变成家人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Leftover tteok for lunch today. Still good.","p":"","m":"今天午饭吃剩的年糕。还是好吃。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is the city quiet today?","p":"","m":"今天城里安静吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过城市是不是很安静（非常安静，纽约唯一慢下来的一天）","en":"You asked if the city was quiet (very — the one day New York slows down)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if the city was quiet. Very — the one day New York slows down. These days it's back to normal: sirens, crowds, a man selling umbrellas the second it rained. Honestly, the quiet day showed me how tired I am. I've booked a week off in February. My first real holiday since I moved.","p":"","m":"你上次问城市是不是很安静。非常安静——纽约唯一慢下来的一天。这两天又恢复了：警笛、人群，一下雨马上就有人卖伞。说实话，那个安静的一天让我发现自己有多累。我请了二月的一个星期假。搬来以后第一次真正的假期。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"When did you last have a real holiday?","p":"","m":"你上一次真正休假是什么时候？"},"replies":[{"t":"Not long ago.","p":"","m":"不久以前。","r":{"t":"Good. Keep doing that.","p":"","m":"很好。继续保持。"}},{"t":"Too long ago.","p":"","m":"太久了。","r":{"t":"Then book one. I just did.","p":"","m":"那就订一个吧。我刚订了。"}}],"next":{"t":"Streets still quiet this morning. Shops open slowly.","p":"","m":"今天早上街上还是很安静。店慢慢开门。"}}},"news":null},"2026-12-25|en|oliver":{"date":"2026-12-25","l":"en","id":"oliver","nm":"Oliver","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"Someone's asleep on the sofa here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也有人在沙发上睡着了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也有人在沙发上睡着了","en":"You said someone was asleep on the sofa where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said someone was asleep on the sofa where you were too. Too much turkey, I bet. These days, Boxing Day was mostly naps here too. My colleague who came for Christmas fell asleep in a paper hat next to my mum. She put a blanket on him. He said it was the best Christmas he's had in years.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也有人在沙发上睡着了。肯定是火鸡吃多了。这两天我这边，节礼日也基本上是在睡午觉。来过圣诞的那个同事戴着纸帽子，在我妈旁边睡着了。我妈给他盖了一条毯子。他说这是他好几年来最好的一个圣诞。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever been welcomed into someone else's family?","p":"","m":"你有没有被别人家当成自家人过？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it felt great.","p":"","m":"有，感觉很好。","r":{"t":"It's the best feeling. Now I get why Mum said yes.","p":"","m":"那是最好的感觉。现在我明白我妈为什么说好了。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"It'll happen. And one day you'll do it for someone.","p":"","m":"会有的。有一天你也会这样对别人。"}}],"next":{"t":"Boxing Day. Leftover turkey sandwiches for breakfast.","p":"","m":"节礼日。早饭吃剩火鸡三明治。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's morning here.","p":"","m":"我这边是早上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was morning where you were, while our Christmas was nearly over. These days I keep thinking about that — Christmas moving round the world like a relay. And me, already checking work emails on Boxing Day. I've turned my notifications off till Monday. First time ever.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边是早上，我们这边圣诞都快过完了。这两天我一直在想——圣诞节像接力一样绕着地球跑。而我，节礼日就在看工作邮件了。我把通知关了，关到周一。这辈子第一次。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you switch off from work or study on holidays?","p":"","m":"放假的时候，你能完全不想工作或学习吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, completely.","p":"","m":"能，完全不想。","r":{"t":"Respect. I'm learning.","p":"","m":"佩服。我在学。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"不太能。","r":{"t":"Same. Let's try one day without it.","p":"","m":"一样。我们试一天吧。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still at Mum's. She won't let me leave without a bag of leftovers.","p":"","m":"还在我妈家。她不让我不带一袋剩菜就走。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"What did you eat today?","p":"","m":"你今天吃了什么？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他们吃了什么（火鸡、烤土豆，还有太多的肉汁）","en":"You asked what they ate (turkey, roast potatoes, far too much gravy)"},"later":{"t":"You asked what we ate. Turkey, roast potatoes and far too much gravy. These days Mum's been packing leftovers into tubs for me to take back. She thinks I live on meal deals. She's not wrong. So before I left, she taught me her gravy — properly, step by step.","p":"","m":"你上次问我们吃了什么。火鸡、烤土豆，还有太多的肉汁。这两天我妈一直在把剩菜装进盒子让我带回去。她觉得我平时只吃超市套餐。她没说错。所以我走之前，她一步一步认真教了我做她的肉汁。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Did someone teach you to cook?","p":"","m":"有人教过你做饭吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, my family.","p":"","m":"有，家里人教的。","r":{"t":"The best teachers. And the most patient.","p":"","m":"最好的老师。也最有耐心。"}},{"t":"No, I taught myself.","p":"","m":"没有，自己学的。","r":{"t":"Respect. I'm only just starting.","p":"","m":"佩服。我才刚开始。"}}],"next":{"t":"Turkey sandwich for lunch today. Day one of many.","p":"","m":"今天午饭吃火鸡三明治。这才第一天。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Are you at your mum's?","p":"","m":"你在你妈家吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他是不是在妈妈家（对，住在以前的房间，海报还在）","en":"You asked if he was at his mum's (yes — old bedroom, posters still up)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I was at Mum's. Yep, in my old bedroom. These days I found my diary from when I was fourteen. One line: 'I want to write for a newspaper.' I do now. It made me a bit kinder to myself about this hard year.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是在我妈家。对，住在我以前的房间。这两天我找到了我十四岁时的日记。里面有一句：「我想给报纸写文章。」我现在做到了。这让我对自己这辛苦的一年宽容了一点。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What did you want to be when you were a kid?","p":"","m":"你小时候想做什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Something very different from now.","p":"","m":"跟现在完全不一样的。","r":{"t":"Ha! Life takes its own route.","p":"","m":"哈！人生自己会走出一条路。"}},{"t":"Pretty much what I'm doing now.","p":"","m":"差不多就是现在做的。","r":{"t":"Then fourteen-year-old you would be proud.","p":"","m":"那十四岁的你会为你骄傲。"}}],"next":{"t":"Slept in my old bed again. My feet still hang off the end.","p":"","m":"又睡在我以前的床上。脚还是伸在外面。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Back in London. I've started the cooking story.","p":"","m":"回伦敦了。做饭那篇稿子开始写了。"},{"t":"I interviewed people my age. Most said the same thing: they learned to cook because they were lonely, and cooking for someone fixed it.","p":"","m":"我采访了跟我差不多大的人。大部分人说的都一样：他们学做饭是因为孤单，而给别人做饭治好了它。"},{"t":"First line of the piece: 'I learned my mum's gravy on Boxing Day, and I finally called her more than once a month.'","p":"","m":"稿子第一句：「我是在节礼日学会我妈的肉汁的，从那以后，我终于一个月不止给她打一次电话了。」"}],"replies":[{"t":"Can't wait to read it.","p":"","m":"等不及要看了。","r":{"t":"Cheers. Mum wants a copy for the fridge.","p":"","m":"谢了。我妈要一份贴在冰箱上。"}},{"t":"Cooking for someone really helps.","p":"","m":"给别人做饭真的有用。","r":{"t":"It does. I'm cooking for my flatmates on Friday.","p":"","m":"真的。周五我给室友们做饭。"}}],"from":"2026-12-29"}},"2026-12-26|zh|emma":{"date":"2026-12-26","l":"zh","id":"emma","nm":"Emma","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边的咖啡馆也坐满了人。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān de kāfēiguǎn yě zuò mǎn le rén.","m":"The cafés here are packed too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边的咖啡馆也坐满了人","en":"You said the café was packed where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边的咖啡馆也坐满了人。这两天我也下去坐了。老板记住了我，第二次就问：「还是一样的？」一个人旅行，最怕的不是迷路，是没有人记得你。被他问了这一句，我那天都很开心。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān de kāfēiguǎn yě zuò mǎn le rén. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ yě xiàqù zuò le. Lǎobǎn jì zhù le wǒ, dì èr cì jiù wèn: “Háishi yíyàng de?” Yí gè rén lǚxíng, zuì pà de bú shì mí lù, shì méiyǒu rén jìde nǐ. Bèi tā wèn le zhè yí jù, wǒ nà tiān dōu hěn kāixīn.","m":"You said the café was packed where you were too. These days I went down and sat there too. The owner remembered me, and the second time he asked: 'The same?' Travelling alone, the scariest thing isn't getting lost — it's nobody remembering you. That one question made my whole day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有被一个不太认识的人记住过？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu bèi yí gè bú tài rènshi de rén jì zhù guo?","m":"Has someone you barely knew ever remembered you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，感觉很好。","p":"Yǒu, gǎnjué hěn hǎo.","m":"Yes — it felt great.","r":{"t":"对吧！一句话就够了。","p":"Duì ba! Yí jù huà jiù gòu le.","m":"Right? One sentence is enough."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"I don't think so.","r":{"t":"那你先去记住一个人，也很好。","p":"Nà nǐ xiān qù jì zhù yí gè rén, yě hěn hǎo.","m":"Then be the one who remembers someone — that's good too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天下楼喝了一杯咖啡，老板跟我点了点头。","p":"Jīntiān xià lóu hē le yì bēi kāfēi, lǎobǎn gēn wǒ diǎn le diǎn tóu.","m":"Went down for a coffee today — the owner nodded at me."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在是半夜。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài shì bànyè.","m":"It's the middle of the night here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边现在是半夜","en":"You said it was the middle of the night where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是半夜。希望你那天睡得好！我最近睡得不太好，在青旅，每天都有人半夜进进出出。这两天我决定花一点钱，换了一个小单间。省钱很重要，可是睡觉更重要。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì bànyè. Xīwàng nǐ nà tiān shuì de hǎo! Wǒ zuìjìn shuì de bú tài hǎo, zài qīnglǚ, měi tiān dōu yǒu rén bànyè jìnjìn chūchū. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ juédìng duō huā yìdiǎn qián, huàn le yí gè xiǎo dānjiān. Shěng qián hěn zhòngyào, kěshì shuìjiào gèng zhòngyào.","m":"You said it was the middle of the night where you were. Hope you slept well! I haven't been sleeping well lately — in the hostel, people come and go all night. These days I decided to spend a bit more and moved to a small single room. Saving money matters, but sleep matters more.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你会为了睡得好多花钱吗？","p":"Nǐ huì wèile shuì de hǎo duō huā qián ma?","m":"Would you spend more to sleep better?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，睡觉最重要。","p":"Huì, shuìjiào zuì zhòngyào.","m":"Yes — sleep comes first.","r":{"t":"我们一样，我现在完全同意。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng, wǒ xiànzài wánquán tóngyì.","m":"Same — I fully agree now."}},{"t":"看情况，钱也很紧。","p":"Kàn qíngkuàng, qián yě hěn jǐn.","m":"Depends — money's tight too.","r":{"t":"我懂，那就买一副好耳塞，哈哈。","p":"Wǒ dǒng, nà jiù mǎi yí fù hǎo ěrsāi, hāha.","m":"I get it — then get good earplugs, haha."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午我想到，你那边可能已经在睡觉了。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ wǒ xiǎng dào, nǐ nàbiān kěnéng yǐjīng zài shuìjiào le.","m":"At midday today I thought: you might be asleep by now."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你也在咖啡馆吗？","p":"Nǐ yě zài kāfēiguǎn ma?","m":"Are you at the café too?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是也在咖啡馆（没有，在楼上看他们）","en":"You asked if she was in the café too (no, upstairs watching them)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我是不是也在咖啡馆。那天我在楼上看他们。这两天我发现，楼下有一位老先生每天中午都坐同一张桌子，一个人，看同一份报纸。老板说他太太去年走了，以前他们俩每天一起来。他还是每天来。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ shì bu shì yě zài kāfēiguǎn. Nà tiān wǒ zài lóu shàng kàn tāmen. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ fāxiàn, lóu xià yǒu yí wèi lǎo xiānsheng měi tiān zhōngwǔ dōu zuò tóng yì zhāng zhuōzi, yí gè rén, kàn tóng yí fèn bàozhǐ. Lǎobǎn shuō tā tàitai qùnián zǒu le, yǐqián tāmen liǎ měi tiān yìqǐ lái. Tā háishi měi tiān lái.","m":"Last time you asked if I was in the café too. I was upstairs watching. These days I noticed an old gentleman who sits at the same table every midday, alone, with the same newspaper. The owner says his wife died last year — they used to come together every day. He still comes every day.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天有一件一定会做的小事吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān yǒu yí jiàn yídìng huì zuò de xiǎo shì ma?","m":"Is there a small thing you do every single day?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那件小事，也许就是你的家。","p":"Nà jiàn xiǎo shì, yěxǔ jiù shì nǐ de jiā.","m":"That small thing might be what home is for you."}},{"t":"没有，每天都不一样。","p":"Méiyǒu, měi tiān dōu bù yíyàng.","m":"No — every day's different.","r":{"t":"那也很好，像旅行一样。","p":"Nà yě hěn hǎo, xiàng lǚxíng yíyàng.","m":"That's good too — like travelling."}}],"next":{"t":"今天中午又在楼上看了一会儿楼下的咖啡馆。","p":"Jīntiān zhōngwǔ yòu zài lóu shàng kàn le yíhuìr lóu xià de kāfēiguǎn.","m":"Watched the café downstairs from above again at midday today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你会在里斯本过新年吗？","p":"Nǐ huì zài Lǐsīběn guò xīnnián ma?","m":"Will you spend New Year in Lisbon?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她会不会在里斯本过新年（会，听说河边放烟花）","en":"You asked if she'll spend New Year in Lisbon (yes — fireworks by the river)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我会不会在里斯本过新年。会！在葡萄牙，十二点的时候要吃十二颗葡萄干，一颗许一个愿。这两天我在本子上写我的十二个愿望，写到第五个就停了：前五个都是给别人的，我妈、我的朋友……我才发现，我很少给自己许愿。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ huì bu huì zài Lǐsīběn guò xīnnián. Huì! Zài Pútáoyá, shí'èr diǎn de shíhou yào chī shí'èr kē pútáogān, yì kē xǔ yí gè yuàn. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài běnzi shang xiě wǒ de shí'èr gè yuànwàng, xiě dào dì wǔ gè jiù tíng le: qián wǔ gè dōu shì gěi biérén de, wǒ mā, wǒ de péngyou…… Wǒ cái fāxiàn, wǒ hěn shǎo gěi zìjǐ xǔ yuàn.","m":"Last time you asked if I'll spend New Year in Lisbon. Yes! In Portugal at midnight you eat twelve raisins, one wish each. These days I've been writing my twelve wishes in my notebook, and I stopped at number five: the first five were all for other people — my mum, my friends… I realised I hardly ever wish for myself.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"新的一年，你想给自己许一个什么愿？","p":"Xīn de yì nián, nǐ xiǎng gěi zìjǐ xǔ yí gè shénme yuàn?","m":"For the new year, what would you wish for yourself?"},"replies":[{"t":"身体健康。","p":"Shēntǐ jiànkāng.","m":"Good health.","r":{"t":"这个最重要，我也写上。","p":"Zhège zuì zhòngyào, wǒ yě xiě shang.","m":"That's the most important — I'm adding it too."}},{"t":"还没想好。","p":"Hái méi xiǎng hǎo.","m":"Haven't decided.","r":{"t":"慢慢想，还有几天。","p":"Mànmàn xiǎng, hái yǒu jǐ tiān.","m":"Take your time — there are a few days left."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在本子上又写了一个愿望，是给我自己的。","p":"Jīntiān zài běnzi shang yòu xiě le yí gè yuànwàng, shì gěi wǒ zìjǐ de.","m":"Wrote another wish in my notebook today — one for me."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"河内那张明信片到了！阿姨的孙女又给我发了邮件。","p":"Hénèi nà zhāng míngxìnpiàn dào le! Āyí de sūnnǚ yòu gěi wǒ fā le yóujiàn.","m":"The postcard reached Hanoi! The lady's granddaughter emailed me again."},{"t":"她说奶奶最近身体不太好，可是每天都把明信片拿出来看一下。","p":"Tā shuō nǎinai zuìjìn shēntǐ bú tài hǎo, kěshì měi tiān dōu bǎ míngxìnpiàn ná chūlái kàn yíxià.","m":"She says her grandma hasn't been well lately, but takes the postcard out to look at every day."},{"t":"我决定明年春天再去一次河内，去看她。","p":"Wǒ juédìng míngnián chūntiān zài qù yí cì Hénèi, qù kàn tā.","m":"I've decided to go back to Hanoi in the spring, to visit her."}],"replies":[{"t":"你一定要去！","p":"Nǐ yídìng yào qù!","m":"You must go!","r":{"t":"嗯，有些人，见一面就够记一辈子。","p":"Èn, yǒuxiē rén, jiàn yí miàn jiù gòu jì yíbèizi.","m":"Mm — some people you meet once and remember forever."}},{"t":"希望奶奶快点好起来。","p":"Xīwàng nǎinai kuài diǎn hǎo qǐlái.","m":"Hope her grandma gets better soon.","r":{"t":"谢谢你。我也每天这样想。","p":"Xièxie nǐ. Wǒ yě měi tiān zhèyàng xiǎng.","m":"Thank you. I think that every day too."}}],"from":"2026-12-29"}},"2026-12-26|zh|mei":{"date":"2026-12-26","l":"zh","id":"mei","nm":"Mei","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是晚上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì wǎnshang.","m":"It's evening here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是晚上","en":"You said it was evening where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是晚上。这两天我晚上念书念到很晚，常常十一点下楼去便利商店走一下。店员是一个阿姨，她儿子跟我一样大，在台中念书。她每次都说：「早点睡喔，你妈会担心。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì wǎnshang. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ wǎnshang niàn shū niàn dào hěn wǎn, chángcháng shíyī diǎn xià lóu qù biànlì shāngdiàn zǒu yíxià. Diànyuán shì yí gè āyí, tā érzi gēn wǒ yíyàng dà, zài Táizhōng niàn shū. Tā měi cì dōu shuō: “Zǎo diǎn shuì o, nǐ mā huì dānxīn.”","m":"You said it was evening where you were too. These days I've been studying late, and at eleven I often pop down to the convenience store. The clerk's an auntie whose son is my age, studying in Taichung. Every time she says: 'Get to bed early — your mum will worry.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你身边有这样关心你的陌生人吗？","p":"Nǐ shēnbiān yǒu zhèyàng guānxīn nǐ de mòshēng rén ma?","m":"Is there a near-stranger like that who looks out for you?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，楼下的一个店主。","p":"Yǒu, lóu xià de yí gè diànzhǔ.","m":"Yes — a shopkeeper downstairs.","r":{"t":"这种人让城市变得很暖。","p":"Zhè zhǒng rén ràng chéngshì biàn de hěn nuǎn.","m":"People like that make a city feel warm."}},{"t":"好像没有。","p":"Hǎoxiàng méiyǒu.","m":"I don't think so.","r":{"t":"下次去常去的店，跟店员多说一句。","p":"Xià cì qù cháng qù de diàn, gēn diànyuán duō shuō yí jù.","m":"Next time at your usual shop, say one more line to the staff."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又下楼走了一下，阿姨又叫我早点睡。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu xià lóu zǒu le yíxià, āyí yòu jiào wǒ zǎo diǎn shuì.","m":"Popped downstairs again tonight — the auntie told me to sleep early again."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"吃了一点。","p":"Chī le yìdiǎn.","m":"I had a little."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你晚上吃了一点东西","en":"You said you'd had a little something that evening"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你晚上吃了一点东西。我也是。可是这两天我念书念到两点，胃开始痛了。室友陪我去看医生，医生说是作息太乱，不是吃的问题。我妈在电话里好担心，我答应她：十二点前一定睡。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ wǎnshang chī le yìdiǎn dōngxi. Wǒ yě shì. Kěshì zhè liǎng tiān wǒ niàn shū niàn dào liǎng diǎn, wèi kāishǐ tòng le. Shìyǒu péi wǒ qù kàn yīshēng, yīshēng shuō shì zuòxī tài luàn, bú shì chī de wèntí. Wǒ mā zài diànhuà lǐ hǎo dānxīn, wǒ dāying tā: shí'èr diǎn qián yídìng shuì.","m":"You said you'd had a little something that evening. Me too. But these days I studied till two and my stomach started hurting. My roommate took me to the doctor, who said my sleep schedule's a mess — it's not about what I eat. Mum was so worried on the phone; I promised her: in bed before midnight.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"考试或者忙的时候，你睡得够吗？","p":"Kǎoshì huòzhě máng de shíhou, nǐ shuì de gòu ma?","m":"When you're busy or have exams, do you get enough sleep?"},"replies":[{"t":"不太够。","p":"Bú tài gòu.","m":"Not really.","r":{"t":"我们一起改，十二点前睡！","p":"Wǒmen yìqǐ gǎi, shí'èr diǎn qián shuì!","m":"Let's both fix it — bed before twelve!"}},{"t":"够，我很注意。","p":"Gòu, wǒ hěn zhùyì.","m":"Yes — I'm careful about it.","r":{"t":"好厉害，教教我。","p":"Hǎo lìhai, jiāojiao wǒ.","m":"Impressive — teach me."}}],"next":{"t":"今天十一点半就关灯了，胃好一点了。","p":"Jīntiān shíyī diǎn bàn jiù guān dēng le, wèi hǎo yìdiǎn le.","m":"Lights out at half eleven today — my stomach's a bit better."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"我晚上不吃东西。","p":"Wǒ wǎnshang bù chī dōngxi.","m":"I don't eat at night."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你晚上不吃东西","en":"You said you don't eat at night"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你晚上不吃东西，我说你好自律。这两天我试着学你，也顺便学一件事：十二点以后不看手机。撑了两天，第三天又破功了。可是我发现，不是我意志力不够，是我太晚睡。早点睡，什么都容易一点。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ wǎnshang bù chī dōngxi, wǒ shuō nǐ hǎo zìlǜ. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shì zhe xué nǐ, yě shùnbiàn xué yí jiàn shì: shí'èr diǎn yǐhòu bú kàn shǒujī. Chēng le liǎng tiān, dì sān tiān yòu pò gōng le. Kěshì wǒ fāxiàn, bú shì wǒ yìzhìlì bú gòu, shì wǒ tài wǎn shuì. Zǎo diǎn shuì, shénme dōu róngyì yìdiǎn.","m":"You said you don't eat at night — so disciplined. These days I tried copying you, and added one more rule: no phone after midnight. I lasted two days, then caved on day three. But I've realised it's not that I lack willpower — I just stay up too late. Go to bed earlier and everything's a bit easier.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有想改，可是很难改的习惯？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu xiǎng gǎi, kěshì hěn nán gǎi de xíguàn?","m":"Is there a habit you want to change but find hard?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，晚睡。","p":"Yǒu, wǎn shuì.","m":"Yes — staying up late.","r":{"t":"我们一样！一起加油。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng! Yìqǐ jiāyóu.","m":"Same! Let's work on it together."}},{"t":"有，看手机太久。","p":"Yǒu, kàn shǒujī tài jiǔ.","m":"Yes — too much phone.","r":{"t":"这个最难，我也在练。","p":"Zhège zuì nán, wǒ yě zài liàn.","m":"That's the hardest — I'm working on it too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天十二点以后，我把手机放到书桌另一边了。","p":"Jīntiān shí'èr diǎn yǐhòu, wǒ bǎ shǒujī fàng dào shūzhuō lìng yì biān le.","m":"After midnight today, I put my phone on the far side of the desk."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在是中午。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài shì zhōngwǔ.","m":"It's midday here."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边现在是中午","en":"You said it was noon where you were"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是中午，我这边已经要睡了。这两天我在手机上多加了几个城市的时钟，念书累了就看一下：有人在吃午饭，有人刚起床。好像不是只有我一个人在熬夜。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì zhōngwǔ, wǒ zhèbiān yǐjīng yào shuì le. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ zài shǒujī shang duō jiā le jǐ gè chéngshì de shízhōng, niàn shū lèi le jiù kàn yíxià: yǒu rén zài chī wǔfàn, yǒu rén gāng qǐchuáng. Hǎoxiàng bú shì zhǐ yǒu wǒ yí gè rén zài áoyè.","m":"You said it was noon where you were while I was heading to bed. These days I added a few cities' clocks to my phone, and when I'm tired of studying I check: someone's having lunch, someone's just getting up. It feels like I'm not the only one awake.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你一个人熬夜的时候，会觉得孤单吗？","p":"Nǐ yí gè rén áoyè de shíhou, huì juéde gūdān ma?","m":"When you're up late alone, do you feel lonely?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，有一点。","p":"Huì, yǒu yìdiǎn.","m":"Yes, a little.","r":{"t":"那你也加几个时钟，你不是一个人。","p":"Nà nǐ yě jiā jǐ gè shízhōng, nǐ bú shì yí gè rén.","m":"Add some clocks too — you're not alone."}},{"t":"不会，我喜欢安静。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ xǐhuan ānjìng.","m":"No — I like the quiet.","r":{"t":"嗯，安静也很好。","p":"Èn, ānjìng yě hěn hǎo.","m":"Mm, quiet's good too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天念书念到很晚，想到你那边可能还是白天。","p":"Jīntiān niàn shū niàn dào hěn wǎn, xiǎng dào nǐ nàbiān kěnéng hái shì báitiān.","m":"Studied late today — thought it might still be daytime where you are."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"便利商店一直开着吗？","p":"Biànlì shāngdiàn yìzhí kāi zhe ma?","m":"Is the convenience store open all the time?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过便利商店是不是一直开着（对，二十四小时，过年也开）","en":"You asked if the convenience store's always open (yes, 24 hours, even at New Year)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问便利商店是不是一直开着。对，二十四小时。这两天店员阿姨跟我说，她过年也要上班，除夕那天晚上在店里过。我问她会不会难过，她说：「赚钱给儿子念书，不难过。」我听了很想打电话给我妈。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn biànlì shāngdiàn shì bu shì yìzhí kāi zhe. Duì, èrshísì xiǎoshí. Zhè liǎng tiān diànyuán āyí gēn wǒ shuō, tā guònián yě yào shàngbān, chúxī nà tiān wǎnshang zài diàn lǐ guò. Wǒ wèn tā huì bu huì nánguò, tā shuō: “Zhuàn qián gěi érzi niàn shū, bù nánguò.” Wǒ tīng le hěn xiǎng dǎ diànhuà gěi wǒ mā.","m":"Last time you asked if the convenience store's always open. Yes, 24 hours. These days the auntie at the counter told me she works over New Year too — she'll spend New Year's Eve in the shop. I asked if that makes her sad. She said: 'Earning money for my son's studies — no, not sad.' Hearing that, I really wanted to call my mum.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你有没有为了家人，做过很辛苦的事？","p":"Nǐ yǒu méiyǒu wèile jiārén, zuò guo hěn xīnkǔ de shì?","m":"Have you ever done something hard for your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"有。","p":"Yǒu.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那你家人一定知道，就算他们没说。","p":"Nà nǐ jiārén yídìng zhīdào, jiùsuàn tāmen méi shuō.","m":"Your family knows, even if they don't say it."}},{"t":"还没有，都是他们为我做。","p":"Hái méiyǒu, dōu shì tāmen wèi wǒ zuò.","m":"Not yet — it's always them doing things for me.","r":{"t":"我也是。我们以后要还回去喔。","p":"Wǒ yě shì. Wǒmen yǐhòu yào huán huíqù o.","m":"Me too. We'll pay it back one day, OK?"}}],"next":{"t":"今天半夜十二点，对面的便利商店还是亮的。","p":"Jīntiān bànyè shí'èr diǎn, duìmiàn de biànlì shāngdiàn háishi liàng de.","m":"At midnight today the store across the street was still lit."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你周六晚上在家？","p":"Nǐ zhōuliù wǎnshang zài jiā?","m":"You're home on a Saturday night?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她周六晚上是不是在家（对，期末快到了，在家念书）","en":"You asked if she was home on Saturday night (yes — finals coming, studying)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我周六晚上是不是在家。对，在念书。这两天我把书桌搬到窗口，念累了就看一下对面。我也在算：下学期宿舍费要涨，大阪的钱也要存，我得多排几班，可是期末也要顾。我妈说钱不够就跟她说，可是我不想让她担心。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zhōuliù wǎnshang shì bu shì zài jiā. Duì, zài niàn shū. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ shūzhuō bān dào chuāngkǒu, niàn lèi le jiù kàn yíxià duìmiàn. Wǒ yě zài suàn: xià xuéqī sùshè fèi yào zhǎng, Dàbǎn de qián yě yào cún, wǒ děi duō pái jǐ bān, kěshì qīmò yě yào gù. Wǒ mā shuō qián bú gòu jiù gēn tā shuō, kěshì wǒ bù xiǎng ràng tā dānxīn.","m":"Last time you asked if I was home on Saturday night. Yes, studying. These days I moved my desk to the window and look across when I'm tired. I've also been doing sums: dorm fees go up next semester and I'm saving for Osaka too, so I need more shifts — but I can't let finals slip. Mum says tell her if money's short, but I don't want to worry her.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你钱不够的时候，会跟家里说吗？","p":"Nǐ qián bú gòu de shíhou, huì gēn jiā lǐ shuō ma?","m":"When money's short, do you tell your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，他们会帮我。","p":"Huì, tāmen huì bāng wǒ.","m":"Yes — they help.","r":{"t":"真好。我也要学着开口。","p":"Zhēn hǎo. Wǒ yě yào xué zhe kāikǒu.","m":"Lovely. I need to learn to ask too."}},{"t":"不会，自己想办法。","p":"Bú huì, zìjǐ xiǎng bànfǎ.","m":"No — I figure it out myself.","r":{"t":"我们一样。可是别撑太久喔。","p":"Wǒmen yíyàng. Kěshì bié chēng tài jiǔ o.","m":"Same as me. But don't hold out too long, OK?"}}],"next":{"t":"今天把书桌搬到窗口了。","p":"Jīntiān bǎ shūzhuō bān dào chuāngkǒu le.","m":"Moved my desk to the window today."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我妈从台南打电话来，问我过年哪天回去。我说除夕。","p":"Wǒ mā cóng Táinán dǎ diànhuà lái, wèn wǒ guònián nǎ tiān huíqù. Wǒ shuō chúxī.","m":"Mum called from Tainan to ask which day I'm coming home for New Year. I said New Year's Eve."},{"t":"她说：「那我除夕早上就开始煮。」然后小声问我，钱够不够用。","p":"Tā shuō: “Nà wǒ chúxī zǎoshang jiù kāishǐ zhǔ.” Ránhòu xiǎoshēng wèn wǒ, qián gòu bu gòu yòng.","m":"She said: “Then I'll start cooking that morning.” Then, quietly, she asked if I have enough money."},{"t":"我说够。挂了电话，我在宿舍哭了一下。还没回去，已经好想家。","p":"Wǒ shuō gòu. Guà le diànhuà, wǒ zài sùshè kū le yíxià. Hái méi huíqù, yǐjīng hǎo xiǎng jiā.","m":"I said yes. After I hung up I cried a little in the dorm. I'm not even home yet and I already miss it so much."}],"replies":[{"t":"你妈妈好温暖。","p":"Nǐ māma hǎo wēnnuǎn.","m":"Your mum is so warm.","r":{"t":"对啊，一通电话就让我想哭。","p":"Duì a, yì tōng diànhuà jiù ràng wǒ xiǎng kū.","m":"Yeah — one phone call and I want to cry."}},{"t":"快过年了，加油！","p":"Kuài guònián le, jiāyóu!","m":"New Year's nearly here — hang in there!","r":{"t":"嗯，先把期末考完，就可以回家了。","p":"Èn, xiān bǎ qīmò kǎo wán, jiù kěyǐ huí jiā le.","m":"Mm — finals first, then I can go home."}}],"from":"2026-12-29"}},"2026-12-26|en|elin":{"date":"2026-12-26","l":"en","id":"elin","nm":"Elin","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's grey here too.","p":"","m":"我这边也是灰灰的。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是灰天","en":"You said it was grey where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was grey where you were too. Grey but peaceful. These days I walked along the beach in it — no wind, the sea like glass, the bridge to Denmark just a pencil line in the mist. I used the time to think about next term. I want to be a calmer teacher.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边也是灰天。灰，但是很安静。这两天我在这样的天里沿着海滩走——没有风，海像玻璃，去丹麦的那座桥在雾里只是一条铅笔线。我趁这个时间想了想下学期。我想做一个更平静的老师。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Do you use the end of the year to think about the next one?","p":"","m":"年底的时候，你会想想明年吗？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, always.","p":"","m":"会，每年都想。","r":{"t":"Me too. A walk helps.","p":"","m":"我也是。走一走有帮助。"}},{"t":"No, I just take it as it comes.","p":"","m":"不会，走一步看一步。","r":{"t":"That's a kind of calm too.","p":"","m":"那也是一种平静。"}}],"next":{"t":"Grey and still again. The sea hasn't moved all day.","p":"","m":"又是灰灰的、没有风。海一整天都没动。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's sunny here.","p":"","m":"我这边有太阳。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边出太阳了","en":"You said it was sunny where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was sunny where you were. Lucky! These days the sun came out for us too — one cold, bright morning. The kids and I cycled to the beach. We didn't talk much, just rode side by side. Those are the moments I'll remember when they've grown up.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边出太阳了，真好！这两天我们这边也出了太阳——一个又冷又亮的早上。我和孩子们骑车去海边。我们没怎么说话，就并排骑着。等他们长大了，我会记得的就是这样的时刻。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a small moment with someone you'll always remember?","p":"","m":"有没有一个跟谁在一起的小时刻，你会一直记得？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a walk with my family.","p":"","m":"有，跟家人散步。","r":{"t":"Walks are where life happens.","p":"","m":"生活就在散步的时候发生。"}},{"t":"Too many to choose.","p":"","m":"太多了，选不出来。","r":{"t":"That's a lucky life.","p":"","m":"那是很幸运的人生。"}}],"next":{"t":"Grey again today. I'm still thinking about your sunshine.","p":"","m":"今天又灰了。我还在想你那边的太阳。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you live by the sea?","p":"","m":"你住在海边吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她是不是住在海边（走路十分钟，周末常去）","en":"You asked if she lives by the sea (ten minutes' walk, most weekends)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I live by the sea. Ten minutes' walk. These days I've gone every day of the holiday, just to look. My mum says I've done that since I was little: when something's on my mind, I go and stare at the sea. This week it's work — I've asked my head teacher if we can talk about me going part-time, to have more time with the kids.","p":"","m":"你上次问我是不是住在海边。走路十分钟。这两天放假，我每天都去，就是看看。我妈说我从小就这样：心里有事的时候，就去盯着海看。这周的心事是工作——我跟校长说了，想谈谈改成兼职，多陪陪孩子。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever had to choose between work and time?","p":"","m":"你有没有在工作和时间之间做过选择？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, it was hard.","p":"","m":"有，很难。","r":{"t":"It is. There's no perfect answer.","p":"","m":"是啊。没有完美的答案。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"You will one day. Take a walk first.","p":"","m":"总有一天会的。先去散个步。"}}],"next":{"t":"Went to look at the sea again today. Still there.","p":"","m":"今天又去看了海。它还在。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do people swim in winter?","p":"","m":"冬天有人游泳吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过冬天有没有人游泳（有，游完跑进桑拿；她自己不游）","en":"You asked if people swim in winter (yes, then the sauna — not her, though)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if people swim in winter. Yes — then they run into the sauna. These days I keep walking past the bathhouse on the pier. Most of the swimmers are over seventy. One woman told me she started at sixty-five after her husband died: 'The cold reminds me I'm alive.' On Sunday she held my hand and I finally went in. Twenty seconds. I understand her now.","p":"","m":"你上次问冬天有没有人游泳。有——游完就跑进桑拿。这两天我老是路过栈桥上的浴场。游泳的人大多七十多岁了。一位老太太告诉我，她六十五岁丈夫去世以后开始游：「冷水让我记得我还活着。」周日她拉着我的手，我终于下去了。二十秒。我现在懂她了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever started something new later than most people?","p":"","m":"你有没有比别人晚很多才开始做一件事？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes!","p":"","m":"有！","r":{"t":"Then you know it's never too late.","p":"","m":"那你知道，永远都不晚。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"There's still time. That woman started at sixty-five.","p":"","m":"还有时间。那位老太太六十五岁才开始。"}}],"next":{"t":"Going down to the bathhouse today. Wish me luck.","p":"","m":"今天要去浴场了。祝我好运。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"About that swim on Sunday — the best part came after.","p":"","m":"说说周日那次冬泳——最好的部分在后面。"},{"t":"In the sauna, still pink, the lady from the bathhouse asked what was on my mind. I told her about work and the kids.","p":"","m":"在桑拿里，脸还红着，浴场那位老太太问我在想什么。我跟她说了工作和孩子的事。"},{"t":"She said, 'Ask for what you need.' So that evening I emailed my head teacher: I'd like to talk about going part-time.","p":"","m":"她说：「需要什么，就去要。」所以那天晚上我给校长发了邮件：我想谈谈改成兼职的事。"}],"replies":[{"t":"She sounds wise.","p":"","m":"她好有智慧。","r":{"t":"She is. I'm going back next Sunday, partly to see her.","p":"","m":"是啊。下个周日我还要去，一半是为了见她。"}},{"t":"Good luck with the talk.","p":"","m":"谈话顺利。","r":{"t":"Thanks. The cold sea made it easier, somehow.","p":"","m":"谢谢。不知道为什么，冷水让这件事变容易了。"}}],"from":"2026-12-29"}},"2026-12-26|en|kwame":{"date":"2026-12-26","l":"en","id":"kwame","nm":"Kwame","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"I'm hiding in the shade too.","p":"","m":"我也在躲阴凉。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你也躲在阴凉里","en":"You said you were hiding in the shade too"},"later":{"t":"You said you were hiding in the shade too. Smart. These days I've moved my whole setup to the coolest corner of the house, under the stairs. My grandmother calls it 'the cave'. She brings me water every hour and says, 'Music is good, but drink.' She's right.","p":"","m":"你上次说你也躲在阴凉里。聪明。这两天我把整套设备搬到了家里最凉快的角落——楼梯下面。我奶奶叫它「山洞」。她每个小时给我送一次水，说：「音乐是好，可是要喝水。」她说得对。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Who looks after you when you forget to look after yourself?","p":"","m":"你忘了照顾自己的时候，谁会照顾你？"},"replies":[{"t":"My family.","p":"","m":"家里人。","r":{"t":"Lucky us.","p":"","m":"我们都很幸运。"}},{"t":"Nobody, really.","p":"","m":"没有人，真的。","r":{"t":"Then today I'm saying it: drink some water.","p":"","m":"那今天我来说：喝点水。"}}],"next":{"t":"Back in the cave today. Fan on full.","p":"","m":"今天又回到了山洞。风扇开到最大。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's cold here — no sun.","p":"","m":"我这边很冷，没有太阳。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边很冷，没有太阳","en":"You said it was cold with no sun where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was cold with no sun where you were. I said I'd swap with you for a day. These days I made a track called 'Swap' — half Accra drums, half a slow, cold piano. My friends say it sounds like two weathers talking. It's my way of saying: we're far apart, but not that far.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边很冷，没有太阳。我说想跟你换一天。这两天我做了一首曲子叫《Swap》——一半是阿克拉的鼓，一半是慢慢的、冷冷的钢琴。朋友们说听起来像两种天气在聊天。这是我想说的：我们离得很远，可是也没那么远。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever made something for someone far away?","p":"","m":"你有没有为远方的人做过什么？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, a gift or a letter.","p":"","m":"有，一个礼物或者一封信。","r":{"t":"Those mean the most.","p":"","m":"那些最有意义。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"Try it. Even a voice message counts.","p":"","m":"试试吧。一条语音也算。"}}],"next":{"t":"Still working on that cold piano part. Hard to play cold when it's thirty-two.","p":"","m":"还在弄那段冷冷的钢琴。三十二度的天，很难弹出冷的感觉。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Are you outside?","p":"","m":"你在外面吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他在不在外面（不在，在屋里开着风扇做音乐）","en":"You asked if he was outside (no, inside with the fan, making music)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I was outside. No — inside with the fan, making music. These days the fan finally died, mid-song. I had to decide: buy a new fan, or save for the album launch. I borrowed my cousin's old one. Money's tight, chale, but the album comes first.","p":"","m":"你上次问我在不在外面。不在——在屋里开着风扇做音乐。这两天风扇终于坏了，就在一首歌做到一半的时候。我得决定：买新风扇，还是把钱留着发专辑。我借了表哥的旧风扇。兄弟，钱很紧，可是专辑第一。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever had to choose what to spend your money on?","p":"","m":"你有没有在钱上做过很难的选择？"},"replies":[{"t":"All the time.","p":"","m":"一直都是。","r":{"t":"Same. Every cedi has a job.","p":"","m":"一样。每一塞地都有用处。"}},{"t":"Sometimes.","p":"","m":"有时候。","r":{"t":"It's hard. But it shows what matters to you.","p":"","m":"很难。可是它能看出什么对你重要。"}}],"next":{"t":"Fan's making a strange noise today. I'm worried.","p":"","m":"今天风扇发出奇怪的声音。我有点担心。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"How hot is it?","p":"","m":"有多热？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过有多热（大概三十二度，还有灰）","en":"You asked how hot it was (about thirty-two, and dusty)"},"later":{"t":"You asked how hot it was. About thirty-two, and dusty — harmattan season. These days the dust got so thick the sun looked like a pale orange coin. My grandmother says in her day the harmattan was stronger, and the year ended with everyone sitting outside telling stories. She told me three. I recorded them all.","p":"","m":"你上次问有多热。大概三十二度，还有灰——现在是哈马丹季节。这两天灰大到太阳看起来像一枚淡橙色的硬币。我奶奶说，她小时候的哈马丹更厉害，年底大家都坐在外面讲故事。她给我讲了三个。我全都录下来了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Have you ever recorded or written down an older person's stories?","p":"","m":"你有没有把老人讲的故事录下来或者写下来？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes.","p":"","m":"有。","r":{"t":"Keep them safe. They're gold.","p":"","m":"好好留着。那是金子。"}},{"t":"No, but I'd like to.","p":"","m":"没有，可是我想。","r":{"t":"Do it soon, chale. Just press record.","p":"","m":"快去吧，兄弟。按下录音就行。"}}],"next":{"t":"Thirty-three today. And the dust is back.","p":"","m":"今天三十三度。灰又来了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"Chale, December in Accra is wild — people come home from everywhere, and there's a party every night.","p":"","m":"兄弟，阿克拉的十二月很疯——人们从世界各地回家，每天晚上都有派对。"},{"t":"I went to one. Then I left early, because my grandmother was coughing and I didn't want her alone.","p":"","m":"我去了一个。然后我早早走了，因为我奶奶在咳嗽，我不想让她一个人。"},{"t":"We sat up and listened to the album together. She knew which song was hers before I told her.","p":"","m":"我们一起坐着，把专辑听了一遍。我还没说，她就知道哪一首是她的。"}],"replies":[{"t":"You're a good grandson.","p":"","m":"你是个好孙子。","r":{"t":"She helped raise me, chale. It's the least I can do.","p":"","m":"兄弟，她也帮着把我带大。这是我最起码能做的。"}},{"t":"How is she now?","p":"","m":"她现在怎么样？","r":{"t":"Better. Harmattan's easing off a bit.","p":"","m":"好一点了。哈马丹风小了一点。"}}],"from":"2026-12-29"}},"2026-12-27|zh|suqing":{"date":"2026-12-27","l":"zh","id":"suqing","nm":"Su Qing 苏晴","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是早上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì zǎoshang.","m":"It's morning here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边也是早上。这两天北京特别冷，早上零下七度。楼下有个大爷每天六点还是去公园打太极，我问他冷不冷，他说：「八十了，不动就真老了。」","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì zǎoshang. Zhè liǎng tiān Běijīng tèbié lěng, zǎoshang líng xià qī dù. Lóu xià yǒu gè dàye měi tiān liù diǎn háishi qù gōngyuán dǎ tàijí, wǒ wèn tā lěng bu lěng, tā shuō: “Bāshí le, bú dòng jiù zhēn lǎo le.”","m":"You said it was morning where you were too. Beijing's been bitter these days — minus seven in the mornings. An old man downstairs still goes to the park at six every day for tai chi. I asked if he's cold. He said: 'I'm eighty. If I stop moving, then I'm really old.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你每天会动一动吗？","p":"Nǐ měi tiān huì dòng yi dòng ma?","m":"Do you move your body every day?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，走路或者运动。","p":"Huì, zǒulù huòzhě yùndòng.","m":"Yes — walking or exercise.","r":{"t":"好！跟大爷一样。","p":"Hǎo! Gēn dàye yíyàng.","m":"Great! Like the old man."}},{"t":"不太会，太忙了。","p":"Bú tài huì, tài máng le.","m":"Not really — too busy.","r":{"t":"我也是。从每天走十分钟开始吧。","p":"Wǒ yě shì. Cóng měi tiān zǒu shí fēnzhōng kāishǐ ba.","m":"Me too. Let's start with ten minutes' walking a day."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上零下六度，大爷还是去打太极了。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang líng xià liù dù, dàye háishi qù dǎ tàijí le.","m":"Minus six this morning, and the old man still went to do his tai chi."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"对，我习惯早起。","p":"Duì, wǒ xíguàn zǎo qǐ.","m":"Yes, I'm used to getting up early."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你习惯早起","en":"You said you're used to getting up early"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你习惯早起。我也想学！这两天我试了：七点起，先写一个小时书法，再出门。一天真的变长了。以前我总说没时间，其实时间都在早上，被我睡掉了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ xíguàn zǎo qǐ. Wǒ yě xiǎng xué! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ shì le: qī diǎn qǐ, xiān xiě yí gè xiǎoshí shūfǎ, zài chūmén. Yì tiān zhēn de biàn cháng le. Yǐqián wǒ zǒng shuō méi shíjiān, qíshí shíjiān dōu zài zǎoshang, bèi wǒ shuì diào le.","m":"You said you're used to getting up early. I want to learn from you! These days I tried: up at seven, an hour of calligraphy, then out. The day really got longer. I always used to say I had no time — it was all there in the mornings, and I slept through it.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你早起以后，第一件事做什么？","p":"Nǐ zǎo qǐ yǐhòu, dì yī jiàn shì zuò shénme?","m":"What's the first thing you do after you get up?"},"replies":[{"t":"喝一杯水。","p":"Hē yì bēi shuǐ.","m":"A glass of water.","r":{"t":"好习惯，我也要学。","p":"Hǎo xíguàn, wǒ yě yào xué.","m":"Good habit — I'll copy that."}},{"t":"看手机。","p":"Kàn shǒujī.","m":"Check my phone.","r":{"t":"哈哈，大家都一样。","p":"Hāha, dàjiā dōu yíyàng.","m":"Haha, everyone does."}}],"next":{"t":"今天七点就起了，先写了半个小时字。","p":"Jīntiān qī diǎn jiù qǐ le, xiān xiě le bàn gè xiǎoshí zì.","m":"Up at seven today — half an hour of calligraphy first."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"是铃声把我叫醒的。","p":"Shì língshēng bǎ wǒ jiào xǐng de.","m":"The bell woke me up."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你是被铃声叫醒的","en":"You said the bell woke you up"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你是被铃声叫醒的，哈哈，我们都一样。这两天我把手机放到了客厅，早上让窗外的声音叫醒我：自行车铃、楼下大爷们聊天。睡前不看手机，我睡得好多了。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ shì bèi língshēng jiào xǐng de, hāha, wǒmen dōu yíyàng. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ bǎ shǒujī fàng dào le kètīng, zǎoshang ràng chuāng wài de shēngyīn jiào xǐng wǒ: zìxíngchē líng, lóu xià dàyemen liáotiān. Shuì qián bú kàn shǒujī, wǒ shuì de hǎo duō le.","m":"You said the bell woke you — haha, same here. These days I've left my phone in the living room and let the sounds outside wake me: bike bells, the old men chatting downstairs. No phone before bed, and I'm sleeping much better.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你早上是怎么醒的？","p":"Nǐ zǎoshang shì zěnme xǐng de?","m":"How do you wake up in the morning?"},"replies":[{"t":"闹钟。","p":"Nàozhōng.","m":"Alarm.","r":{"t":"闹钟最可靠，可是最吵。","p":"Nàozhōng zuì kěkào, kěshì zuì chǎo.","m":"Reliable but loud."}},{"t":"自然醒。","p":"Zìrán xǐng.","m":"Naturally.","r":{"t":"真幸福！","p":"Zhēn xìngfú!","m":"Lucky you!"}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上是楼下的自行车铃把我叫醒的。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang shì lóu xià de zìxíngchē líng bǎ wǒ jiào xǐng de.","m":"A bike bell downstairs woke me this morning."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边是半夜，刚要睡。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān shì bànyè, gāng yào shuì.","m":"It's midnight here — I was just going to bed."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是半夜，刚要睡","en":"You said it was midnight and you were about to sleep"},"later":{"t":"你上次说你那边是半夜，刚要睡。希望你睡得很香！这两天我给学生出了一个作文题：「同一刻」。一个学生写：「我在北京吃早饭，我妈妈在家睡觉。我很想她，可是我不想吵醒她。」我看了很久。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì shuō nǐ nàbiān shì bànyè, gāng yào shuì. Xīwàng nǐ shuì de hěn xiāng! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gěi xuésheng chū le yí gè zuòwén tí: “Tóng yí kè”. Yí gè xuésheng xiě: “Wǒ zài Běijīng chī zǎofàn, wǒ māma zài jiā shuìjiào. Wǒ hěn xiǎng tā, kěshì wǒ bù xiǎng chǎo xǐng tā.” Wǒ kàn le hěn jiǔ.","m":"You said it was midnight and you were about to sleep. Hope you slept soundly! These days I set my students a writing topic: 'The same moment'. One wrote: 'I'm eating breakfast in Beijing, my mum is asleep at home. I miss her, but I don't want to wake her.' I looked at it for a long time.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你跟家里人离得远吗？","p":"Nǐ gēn jiā lǐ rén lí de yuǎn ma?","m":"Do you live far from your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"很远，在别的国家。","p":"Hěn yuǎn, zài bié de guójiā.","m":"Far — another country.","r":{"t":"那你一定懂那个学生。","p":"Nà nǐ yídìng dǒng nà gè xuésheng.","m":"Then you'll understand that student."}},{"t":"不远。","p":"Bù yuǎn.","m":"Not far.","r":{"t":"真好，想见就能见。","p":"Zhēn hǎo, xiǎng jiàn jiù néng jiàn.","m":"Lovely — you can see them whenever."}}],"next":{"t":"今天早上楼下又是送孩子上学的家长，周一嘛。","p":"Jīntiān zǎoshang lóu xià yòu shì sòng háizi shàngxué de jiāzhǎng, zhōuyī ma.","m":"Parents doing the school run downstairs again this morning — it's Monday."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"孩子们去上什么课？","p":"Háizimen qù shàng shénme kè?","m":"What classes are the kids going to?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过孩子们去上什么课（画画、钢琴、英语，周末比上学还忙）","en":"You asked what classes the kids go to (art, piano, English — busier than school)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问孩子们去上什么课。什么都有。这两天我跟楼下一个小女孩聊了几句，她八岁，周末上四个班。我问她最喜欢哪个，她说：「周日晚上。」因为周日晚上什么课都没有，爸爸妈妈陪她玩。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn háizimen qù shàng shénme kè. Shénme dōu yǒu. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn lóu xià yí gè xiǎo nǚhái liáo le jǐ jù, tā bā suì, zhōumò shàng sì gè bān. Wǒ wèn tā zuì xǐhuan nǎ gè, tā shuō: “Zhōurì wǎnshang.” Yīnwèi zhōurì wǎnshang shénme kè dōu méiyǒu, bàba māma péi tā wán.","m":"Last time you asked what classes the kids go to. Everything. These days I chatted with a little girl downstairs — she's eight and has four classes at the weekend. I asked which she likes best. She said: 'Sunday evening.' Because Sunday evening there are no classes, and her mum and dad play with her.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你小时候，最喜欢跟家人一起做什么？","p":"Nǐ xiǎoshíhou, zuì xǐhuan gēn jiārén yìqǐ zuò shénme?","m":"As a kid, what did you most love doing with your family?"},"replies":[{"t":"一起出去玩。","p":"Yìqǐ chūqù wán.","m":"Going out together.","r":{"t":"那些日子，长大了还会记得。","p":"Nàxiē rìzi, zhǎng dà le hái huì jìde.","m":"You remember those days when you're grown."}},{"t":"一起吃饭。","p":"Yìqǐ chī fàn.","m":"Eating together.","r":{"t":"简单，可是最难忘。","p":"Jiǎndān, kěshì zuì nánwàng.","m":"Simple, but the most unforgettable."}}],"next":{"t":"今天楼下还是很多背着书包的孩子。","p":"Jīntiān lóu xià háishi hěn duō bēi zhe shūbāo de háizi.","m":"Lots of kids with school bags downstairs again today."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你周日有什么安排？","p":"Nǐ zhōurì yǒu shénme ānpái?","m":"What are your plans for Sunday?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她周日有什么安排（上午练书法，下午去妈妈家）","en":"You asked about her Sunday plans (calligraphy in the morning, Mum's in the afternoon)"},"later":{"t":"你上次问我周日有什么安排。上午练书法，下午去我妈家。那天我写了一个「冬」字带给我妈，她说写得像一个人在缩着脖子。然后她拿出我小时候写的字，一张一张都留着。我都不记得了，她都记得。","p":"Nǐ shàng cì wèn wǒ zhōurì yǒu shénme ānpái. Shàngwǔ liàn shūfǎ, xiàwǔ qù wǒ mā jiā. Nà tiān wǒ xiě le yí gè “dōng” zì dài gěi wǒ mā, tā shuō xiě de xiàng yí gè rén zài suō zhe bózi. Ránhòu tā ná chū wǒ xiǎoshíhou xiě de zì, yì zhāng yì zhāng dōu liú zhe. Wǒ dōu bú jìde le, tā dōu jìde.","m":"Last time you asked about my Sunday plans. Calligraphy in the morning, Mum's in the afternoon. That day I wrote the character 冬, 'winter', and took it to her. She said it looks like someone hunching against the cold. Then she brought out the characters I wrote as a child — she's kept every single sheet. I'd forgotten them all; she remembered every one.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里有人留着你小时候的东西吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu rén liú zhe nǐ xiǎoshíhou de dōngxi ma?","m":"Has anyone in your family kept things from your childhood?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，我妈留了很多。","p":"Yǒu, wǒ mā liú le hěn duō.","m":"Yes — my mum kept loads.","r":{"t":"妈妈们都是这样，什么都舍不得扔。","p":"Māmamen dōu shì zhèyàng, shénme dōu shěbude rēng.","m":"Mums are all like that — they can't throw anything away."}},{"t":"不知道，没问过。","p":"Bù zhīdào, méi wèn guo.","m":"Don't know — never asked.","r":{"t":"下次问问吧，说不定有惊喜。","p":"Xià cì wènwen ba, shuōbudìng yǒu jīngxǐ.","m":"Ask next time — there might be a surprise."}}],"next":{"t":"今天又写了几个字，手还是有点冷。","p":"Jīntiān yòu xiě le jǐ gè zì, shǒu háishi yǒudiǎn lěng.","m":"Wrote a few more characters today — hands still a bit cold."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"我妈说，今年家里的春联不买了，让我来写。","p":"Wǒ mā shuō, jīnnián jiā lǐ de chūnlián bù mǎi le, ràng wǒ lái xiě.","m":"Mum says this year we're not buying Spring Festival couplets — I'm writing them."},{"t":"我每个周日都在练，可是一写在红纸上，我的手也会抖。","p":"Wǒ měi gè zhōurì dōu zài liàn, kěshì yì xiě zài hóng zhǐ shang, wǒ de shǒu yě huì dǒu.","m":"I practise every Sunday, but the moment I write on red paper, my hand shakes too."},{"t":"离过年还有一个多月。我想写好，让我妈贴上去的时候，能跟邻居说：「我女儿写的。」","p":"Lí guònián hái yǒu yí gè duō yuè. Wǒ xiǎng xiě hǎo, ràng wǒ mā tiē shàngqù de shíhou, néng gēn línjū shuō: “Wǒ nǚ'ér xiě de.”","m":"There's still over a month till New Year. I want to do it well, so when Mum puts them up she can tell the neighbours: 'My daughter wrote those.'"}],"replies":[{"t":"你妈一定会很骄傲。","p":"Nǐ mā yídìng huì hěn jiāo'ào.","m":"Your mum will be so proud.","r":{"t":"希望吧。我就是怕写坏了红纸，哈哈。","p":"Xīwàng ba. Wǒ jiù shì pà xiě huài le hóng zhǐ, hāha.","m":"I hope so. I'm just scared of ruining the red paper, haha."}},{"t":"这是很有意义的事。","p":"Zhè shì hěn yǒu yìyì de shì.","m":"That really means something.","r":{"t":"是啊，练了这么多年，终于用上了。","p":"Shì a, liàn le zhème duō nián, zhōngyú yòng shang le.","m":"Yes — all those years of practice, finally put to use."}}],"from":"2026-12-30"}},"2026-12-27|zh|camila":{"date":"2026-12-27","l":"zh","id":"camila","nm":"Camila","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边也是晚上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān yě shì wǎnshang.","m":"It's evening here too."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边也是晚上","en":"You said it was evening where you were too"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边也是晚上。波哥大晚上很冷，八九度。我跟奶奶喝热的红糖水，聊天。她问我以后想做什么。我说：想去中国上大学。她想了很久，说：「去吧，我等你回来。」","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān yě shì wǎnshang. Bōgēdà wǎnshang hěn lěng, bā jiǔ dù. Wǒ gēn nǎinai hē rè de hóngtáng shuǐ, liáotiān. Tā wèn wǒ yǐhòu xiǎng zuò shénme. Wǒ shuō: xiǎng qù Zhōngguó shàng dàxué. Tā xiǎng le hěn jiǔ, shuō: “Qù ba, wǒ děng nǐ huílái.”","m":"You said it's evening there too. Bogotá evenings are cold — eight or nine degrees. My dad's mum and I drank hot brown-sugar water and talked. She asked what I want to do later. I said: university in China. She thought for a long time, then said: 'Go. I'll wait for you to come back.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你以后想去很远的地方吗？","p":"Nǐ yǐhòu xiǎng qù hěn yuǎn de dìfang ma?","m":"Do you want to go somewhere far away one day?"},"replies":[{"t":"想。","p":"Xiǎng.","m":"Yes.","r":{"t":"那我们都要勇敢一点。","p":"Nà wǒmen dōu yào yǒnggǎn yìdiǎn.","m":"Then we both need to be a bit brave."}},{"t":"不想，想留在家附近。","p":"Bù xiǎng, xiǎng liú zài jiā fùjìn.","m":"No — I'd rather stay near home.","r":{"t":"也很好，家人在身边最安心。","p":"Yě hěn hǎo, jiārén zài shēnbiān zuì ānxīn.","m":"That's good too — family nearby is a comfort."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又跟奶奶聊了很久。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu gēn nǎinai liáo le hěn jiǔ.","m":"Talked with Grandma for ages again tonight."}},"m0.f0":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"吃了。","p":"Chī le.","m":"Yes."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那天吃过晚饭了","en":"You said you'd already had dinner that day"},"later":{"t":"你说你吃过晚饭了，我也是，奶奶做的。这两天我跟她学做 sancocho，一种汤。她不用秤！我在本子上用中文写：「一把」「一点点」「差不多」。我想记下她会的菜。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ chī guo wǎnfàn le, wǒ yě shì, nǎinai zuò de. Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn tā xué zuò sancocho, yì zhǒng tāng. Tā bú yòng chèng! Wǒ zài běnzi shang yòng Zhōngwén xiě: “yì bǎ” “yìdiǎndiǎn” “chàbuduō”. Wǒ xiǎng jì xià tā huì de cài.","m":"You said you'd eaten — me too, my dad's mum cooked. These days I'm learning sancocho from her, a soup. She doesn't use scales! In my notebook I write in Chinese: 'a handful', 'a tiny bit', 'about right'. I want to write down all her dishes.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你家里有你想学下来的东西吗？","p":"Nǐ jiā lǐ yǒu nǐ xiǎng xué xiàlái de dōngxi ma?","m":"Is there something in your family you want to learn and keep?"},"replies":[{"t":"有，一道菜。","p":"Yǒu, yí dào cài.","m":"Yes — a dish.","r":{"t":"趁现在学，我也是这样想的。","p":"Chèn xiànzài xué, wǒ yě shì zhèyàng xiǎng de.","m":"Learn it now — that's what I'm doing."}},{"t":"有，家里的故事。","p":"Yǒu, jiā lǐ de gùshi.","m":"Yes — the family stories.","r":{"t":"故事最容易丢，记下来吧。","p":"Gùshi zuì róngyì diū, jì xiàlái ba.","m":"Stories are easiest to lose — write them down."}}],"next":{"t":"今天在奶奶的厨房待了一个下午。","p":"Jīntiān zài nǎinai de chúfáng dāi le yí gè xiàwǔ.","m":"Spent the whole afternoon in Grandma's kitchen today."}},"m0.f1":{"k":"back","you":{"t":"还没，等一下吃。","p":"Hái méi, děng yíxià chī.","m":"Not yet — in a bit."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那时候还没吃晚饭","en":"You said you hadn't had dinner yet at that point"},"later":{"t":"你说你还没吃晚饭。希望你后来吃了！奶奶说，她年轻的时候上夜班，常常不吃晚饭，后来身体不好。她说：「再忙也要吃饭。」我写在本子第一页了。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ hái méi chī wǎnfàn. Xīwàng nǐ hòulái chī le! Nǎinai shuō, tā niánqīng de shíhou shàng yèbān, chángcháng bù chī wǎnfàn, hòulái shēntǐ bù hǎo. Tā shuō: “Zài máng yě yào chī fàn.” Wǒ xiě zài běnzi dì yī yè le.","m":"You said you hadn't had dinner yet. Hope you ate later! My dad's mum says she worked nights when she was young, often skipped dinner, and later her health was bad. She said: 'However busy, eat.' I wrote it on the first page of my notebook.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你很忙的时候，会不吃饭吗？","p":"Nǐ hěn máng de shíhou, huì bù chī fàn ma?","m":"When you're very busy, do you skip meals?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，常常忘了。","p":"Huì, chángcháng wàng le.","m":"Yes, I often forget.","r":{"t":"那你也把奶奶这句话记下来吧。","p":"Nà nǐ yě bǎ nǎinai zhè jù huà jì xiàlái ba.","m":"Then write down Grandma's line too."}},{"t":"不会，我按时吃。","p":"Bú huì, wǒ ànshí chī.","m":"No — I eat on time.","r":{"t":"好！奶奶一定喜欢你。","p":"Hǎo! Nǎinai yídìng xǐhuan nǐ.","m":"Good! Grandma would love you."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚饭吃得早，七点就吃完了。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnfàn chī de zǎo, qī diǎn jiù chī wán le.","m":"Ate early today — done by seven."}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"我这边现在是早上。","p":"Wǒ zhèbiān xiànzài shì zǎoshang.","m":"It's morning here now."},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边现在是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"你说你那边是早上。我的一天要结束了，你的开始了。我想了一个办法：我睡觉前学的词，送给早上的你。这次送你三个：「勇敢」「想念」「回来」。","p":"Nǐ shuō nǐ nàbiān shì zǎoshang. Wǒ de yì tiān yào jiéshù le, nǐ de kāishǐ le. Wǒ xiǎng le yí gè bànfǎ: wǒ shuìjiào qián xué de cí, sòng gěi zǎoshang de nǐ. Zhè cì sòng nǐ sān gè: “yǒnggǎn” “xiǎngniàn” “huílái”.","m":"You said it's morning there. My day is ending, yours is starting. I had an idea: the words I learn before bed are for morning-you. This time, three: 勇敢 brave, 想念 miss, 回来 come back.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你最近最常想到的一个词是什么？","p":"Nǐ zuìjìn zuì cháng xiǎng dào de yí gè cí shì shénme?","m":"What word has been on your mind most lately?"},"replies":[{"t":"「累」。","p":"“Lèi”.","m":"'Tired'.","r":{"t":"那你要好好休息，这个词我也送你：「休息」。","p":"Nà nǐ yào hǎohǎo xiūxi, zhège cí wǒ yě sòng nǐ: “xiūxi”.","m":"Then rest well — here's another word for you: 休息, rest."}},{"t":"「希望」。","p":"“Xīwàng”.","m":"'Hope'.","r":{"t":"好词！我也收下了。","p":"Hǎo cí! Wǒ yě shōu xià le.","m":"Great word! I'll take it too."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上山上的灯还是一闪一闪的。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang shān shang de dēng háishi yì shǎn yì shǎn de.","m":"The lights on the mountain were twinkling again tonight."}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"山上的灯是什么？","p":"Shān shang de dēng shì shénme?","m":"What are the lights on the mountain?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过山上的灯是什么（房子，还有蒙塞拉特山上的教堂）","en":"You asked what the lights on the mountain are (houses, and the church on Monserrate)"},"later":{"t":"你问山上的灯是什么。是房子，还有教堂，在很高的山上。奶奶说，她年轻的时候，跟爷爷第一次约会，就是走路上山。走了一个上午！爷爷累得不能说话，她一直笑。她说：那天她就知道，要嫁给他。","p":"Nǐ wèn shān shang de dēng shì shénme. Shì fángzi, hái yǒu jiàotáng, zài hěn gāo de shān shang. Nǎinai shuō, tā niánqīng de shíhou, gēn yéye dì yī cì yuēhuì, jiù shì zǒulù shàng shān. Zǒu le yí gè shàngwǔ! Yéye lèi de bù néng shuōhuà, tā yìzhí xiào. Tā shuō: nà tiān tā jiù zhīdào, yào jià gěi tā.","m":"You asked what the lights on the mountain are. Houses, and a church, very high up. My dad's mum says her first date with Grandpa, when she was young, was walking up the mountain. A whole morning! Grandpa was too tired to talk and she kept laughing. She says that day she knew she'd marry him.","img":""},"ask":{"t":"你知道你家里的老人是怎么认识的吗？","p":"Nǐ zhīdào nǐ jiā lǐ de lǎorén shì zěnme rènshi de ma?","m":"Do you know how the older people in your family met?"},"replies":[{"t":"知道，很好玩。","p":"Zhīdào, hěn hǎowán.","m":"Yes — it's a fun story.","r":{"t":"老人的爱情故事最好听！","p":"Lǎorén de àiqíng gùshi zuì hǎotīng!","m":"Old love stories are the best!"}},{"t":"不知道。","p":"Bù zhīdào.","m":"No.","r":{"t":"下次问问吧，他们一定很想讲。","p":"Xià cì wènwen ba, tāmen yídìng hěn xiǎng jiǎng.","m":"Ask next time — they'll be dying to tell it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天晚上又数了数山上的灯，数不完。","p":"Jīntiān wǎnshang yòu shǔ le shǔ shān shang de dēng, shǔ bu wán.","m":"Tried counting the mountain lights again tonight — too many."}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"你去过山上吗？","p":"Nǐ qùguo shān shang ma?","m":"Have you been up there?"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过她去过山上没有（去过很多次，可以坐缆车）","en":"You asked if she's been up the mountain (many times — there's a cable car)"},"later":{"t":"你问我去过山上没有。去过很多次！这两天我跟表妹又去了，坐缆车。她跟好朋友吵架了，一直不说话。到了山上，看到整个波哥大的灯，她哭了。然后她说：「我去跟她说对不起。」","p":"Nǐ wèn wǒ qù guo shān shang méiyǒu. Qù guo hěn duō cì! Zhè liǎng tiān wǒ gēn biǎomèi yòu qù le, zuò lǎnchē. Tā gēn hǎo péngyou chǎo jià le, yìzhí bù shuōhuà. Dào le shān shang, kàn dào zhěng gè Bōgēdà de dēng, tā kū le. Ránhòu tā shuō: “Wǒ qù gēn tā shuō duìbuqǐ.”","m":"You asked if I've been up the mountain. Many times! These days I went again with my cousin, by cable car. She'd fought with her best friend and didn't talk at all. At the top, seeing all of Bogotá's lights, she cried. Then she said: 'I'm going to say sorry to her.'","img":""},"ask":{"t":"跟好朋友吵架以后，你会先道歉吗？","p":"Gēn hǎo péngyou chǎo jià yǐhòu, nǐ huì xiān dàoqiàn ma?","m":"After a fight with a close friend, are you the first to say sorry?"},"replies":[{"t":"会，不想失去朋友。","p":"Huì, bù xiǎng shīqù péngyou.","m":"Yes — I don't want to lose them.","r":{"t":"对，朋友比输赢重要。","p":"Duì, péngyou bǐ shūyíng zhòngyào.","m":"Right — a friend matters more than winning."}},{"t":"很难，要过几天。","p":"Hěn nán, yào guò jǐ tiān.","m":"It's hard — takes me a few days.","r":{"t":"我懂。几天也没关系，说了就好。","p":"Wǒ dǒng. Jǐ tiān yě méi guānxi, shuō le jiù hǎo.","m":"I get it. A few days is fine — as long as you say it."}}],"next":{"t":"今天我又看着山顶，想下次什么时候再上去。","p":"Jīntiān wǒ yòu kàn zhe shāndǐng, xiǎng xià cì shénme shíhou zài shàngqù.","m":"Looked up at the summit again today, wondering when to go back up."}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"哥伦比亚跨年有一个习惯：十二点的时候，提着空行李箱在街上跑一圈。","p":"Gēlúnbǐyà kuànián yǒu yí gè xíguàn: shí'èr diǎn de shíhou, tí zhe kōng xínglixiāng zài jiē shang pǎo yì quān.","m":"Colombian New Year has a custom: at midnight you run round the block with an empty suitcase."},{"t":"听说这样，新的一年就能去旅行。","p":"Tīngshuō zhèyàng, xīn de yì nián jiù néng qù lǚxíng.","m":"They say then you'll travel in the new year."},{"t":"今年我要跑两圈：一圈为了去中国，一圈为了外婆和奶奶的身体。","p":"Jīnnián wǒ yào pǎo liǎng quān: yì quān wèile qù Zhōngguó, yì quān wèile wàipó hé nǎinai de shēntǐ.","m":"This year I'm doing two laps: one for getting to China, one for my two grandmas' health."}],"replies":[{"t":"希望你的两个愿望都实现！","p":"Xīwàng nǐ de liǎng gè yuànwàng dōu shíxiàn!","m":"Hope both wishes come true!","r":{"t":"谢谢！第二个比第一个重要。","p":"Xièxie! Dì èr gè bǐ dì yī gè zhòngyào.","m":"Thanks! The second matters more than the first."}},{"t":"这个习惯太有意思了。","p":"Zhège xíguàn tài yǒu yìsi le.","m":"What a lovely custom.","r":{"t":"你也可以试试，什么行李箱都行！","p":"Nǐ yě kěyǐ shìshi, shénme xínglixiāng dōu xíng!","m":"You can try it too — any suitcase will do!"}}],"from":"2026-12-30"}},"2026-12-27|en|min_ny":{"date":"2026-12-27","l":"en","id":"min_ny","nm":"Min","opts":{"m0":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's dark here too.","p":"","m":"我这边天也黑了。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边天也黑了","en":"You said it was dark where you were too"},"later":{"t":"You said it was dark where you were too. These days New York finally had some snow. I went to Central Park with my sketchbook and drew for ten minutes before my fingers stopped working. Honestly, the worst drawing I've ever done. But I drew for me, not for a client. I'd forgotten how that feels.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边天也黑了。这两天纽约终于下了点雪。我带着速写本去中央公园，画了十分钟，手指就不听使唤了。说实话，这是我画得最差的一张。可是我是为自己画的，不是为客户。我都忘了那是什么感觉。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something you used to do just for fun?","p":"","m":"有没有什么事，你以前只是为了开心才做的？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, and I miss it.","p":"","m":"有，我很想念。","r":{"t":"Do it this week. Even badly.","p":"","m":"这周就去做吧。做得不好也行。"}},{"t":"Yes, and I still do it.","p":"","m":"有，现在还在做。","r":{"t":"I envy you. Keep it.","p":"","m":"我羡慕你。留着它。"}}],"next":{"t":"Dark at half four again. Steam still coming up from the street.","p":"","m":"又是四点半就黑了。街上还在冒蒸汽。"}},"m1":{"k":"me","you":{"t":"It's morning here.","p":"","m":"我这边是早上。"},"mem":{"zh":"你说你那边是早上","en":"You said it was morning where you were"},"later":{"t":"You said it was morning where you were, while I was thinking about dinner. These days I've started a small habit: when it gets dark, I cook one Korean dish. Sunday it was kimchi pancakes, the way my mum makes them. My kitchen smelled like home for a whole evening. Less homesick after.","p":"","m":"你上次说你那边是早上，我这边在想晚饭。这两天我养成了一个小习惯：天一黑，就做一道韩国菜。周日是泡菜饼，照我妈的做法。我的厨房一整晚都是家里的味道。之后没那么想家了。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What helps you when you miss home?","p":"","m":"你想家的时候，什么能让你好一点？"},"replies":[{"t":"Calling my family.","p":"","m":"给家里打电话。","r":{"t":"Same. Even five minutes.","p":"","m":"一样。五分钟也好。"}},{"t":"Food from home.","p":"","m":"家乡的菜。","r":{"t":"Honestly, the fastest way back.","p":"","m":"说实话，那是回家最快的路。"}}],"next":{"t":"Kimchi pancakes again tonight. Making it a habit.","p":"","m":"今晚又做了泡菜饼。要变成习惯了。"}},"m2":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Do you like winter in New York?","p":"","m":"你喜欢纽约的冬天吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过他喜不喜欢纽约的冬天（喜欢雪，不喜欢风）","en":"You asked if he likes winter in New York (the snow yes, the wind no)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if I like winter in New York. I like the snow, not the wind. These days I learned the English for that wind between tall buildings — a 'wind tunnel'. Jess says on 6th Avenue it can blow your hat to New Jersey. When I first came, I wouldn't have understood the joke. Now I laughed first.","p":"","m":"你上次问我喜不喜欢纽约的冬天。喜欢雪，不喜欢风。这两天我学了高楼之间那种风的英文——wind tunnel，风洞。Jess 说在第六大道，风能把你的帽子吹到新泽西。刚来的时候我听不懂这个笑话。现在我是第一个笑的。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"What's a moment you noticed your language had got better?","p":"","m":"你什么时候发现自己的语言进步了？"},"replies":[{"t":"When I understood a joke.","p":"","m":"听懂一个笑话的时候。","r":{"t":"Same! Jokes are the real test.","p":"","m":"一样！笑话才是真正的考试。"}},{"t":"Not yet.","p":"","m":"还没有。","r":{"t":"It's coming. One day you'll laugh first too.","p":"","m":"快了。有一天你也会第一个笑。"}}],"next":{"t":"Lost my hat on 6th Avenue. Not to New Jersey, just to a puddle.","p":"","m":"在第六大道丢了帽子。没吹到新泽西，只吹进了水坑。"}},"m3":{"k":"ask","you":{"t":"Is it cold?","p":"","m":"冷吗？"},"mem":{"zh":"你问过冷不冷（零度左右，到处冒蒸汽像电影）","en":"You asked if it was cold (around zero — steam everywhere, like a movie)"},"later":{"t":"You asked if it was cold. Around zero. And the steam — I finally found out where it comes from. Old pipes under the street carry steam to heat buildings, and some escapes. Honestly, I thought it was just for movies. The city still teaches me something every week.","p":"","m":"你上次问冷不冷。零度左右。还有那些蒸汽——我终于知道是哪儿来的了。街下面的老管道把蒸汽送去给大楼供暖，有一些漏了出来。说实话，我一直以为那只是电影里的。这座城市每周还在教我一点东西。","img":""},"ask":{"t":"Is there something in your city you only understood later?","p":"","m":"你住的城市里，有没有什么东西你后来才弄明白？"},"replies":[{"t":"Yes, lots of things.","p":"","m":"有，很多。","r":{"t":"Cities are full of secrets.","p":"","m":"城市里全是秘密。"}},{"t":"Not really.","p":"","m":"没有。","r":{"t":"Look around this week. There's always one.","p":"","m":"这周看看周围。总会有一个。"}}],"next":{"t":"Walked past the steam on the corner today. Now I know its secret.","p":"","m":"今天路过街角的蒸汽。现在我知道它的秘密了。"}}},"news":{"img":"","lines":[{"t":"I finally knocked. The kimchi-stew neighbour.","p":"","m":"我终于去敲门了。做泡菜汤的那个邻居。"},{"t":"He's from Busan, sixty-two, a retired cook. He's lived alone here since his wife passed. He said, 'I've seen you at your window. I was hoping you'd knock.'","p":"","m":"他是釜山人，六十二岁，退休厨师。他太太走了以后，他一个人住在这里。他说：「我在窗口看到过你。我一直希望你来敲门。」"},{"t":"We had stew. Honestly, it tasted like home. Next week I'm bringing the rice.","p":"","m":"我们一起吃了泡菜汤。说实话，是家的味道。下周我负责带米饭。"}],"replies":[{"t":"That's beautiful.","p":"","m":"太美好了。","r":{"t":"Honestly, I almost didn't knock.","p":"","m":"说实话，我差点没敲。"}},{"t":"Now you have a neighbour.","p":"","m":"现在你有邻居了。","r":{"t":"And he has someone to cook for.","p":"","m":"他也有人可以做饭给他吃了。"}}],"from":"2026-12-30"}}};

